srīr astu
śriyaḥ kāntāya namaḥ
śrīmate hayagrīvāya namaḥ
śrīpāñcarātre - 

īśvarasaṃhitā

namas sakalakalyāṇadāyine cakrapāṇaye |
viṣayārṇavamagnānāṃ samuddharaṇahetave || 1.1
nārāyaṇapadāmbhojasamārādhanalālasāḥ |
vedavedāṅganipuṇās <vedavedāṃganipuṇās> taponiṣṭhā maharṣayaḥ || 1.2
itihāsapurāṇajñā dharmaśāstraviśāradāḥ |
bhagavadbhaktiniratāś śamādiguṇasāgarāḥ || 1.3
nārāyaṇaṃ tapasyantaṃ naranārāyaṇāśrame |
saṃsevantas sadā bhaktyā mokṣopāyavivitsavaḥ || 1.4
saṃsthitā munayas sarve nārāyaṇaparāyaṇāḥ |
kālena kenacit svargāt nārāyaṇadidṛkṣayā || 1.5
tatrāvatīrya devarṣi nāradas sakutūhalaḥ |
dṛṣṭvā nārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ namaskṛtya kṛtāñjaliḥ <kṛtāṃjaliḥ> || 1.6
pulakāñcitasarvāṅgaḥ <pulakāṃcitasarvāṃgaḥ> prahṛṣṭavadano muniḥ |
stutvā nānāvidhaiḥ stotraiḥ praṇamya ca muhurmuhuḥ || 1.7
pūjayāmāsa taṃ devaṃ nārāyaṇamanāmayam |
atha nārāyaṇo devas tam āha munipuṅgavam <munipuṃgavam> || 1.8
munayo hy atra tiṣṭhanti prārthayānā hareḥ padam |
eteṣāṃ sātvataṃ śāstram upadeṣṭuṃ tvam arhasi || 1.9
ity uktvāntardadhe śrīmannārāyaṇamunis tadā |
tac chrutvā bhagavadvākyaṃ munir hṛṣṭatanūr uhaḥ || 1.10
tadājñāṃ kartukāmo 'tha nirjagāma munīśvaraḥ |
apaśyad āśramavaram ṛṣīṇām ūrdhvaretasām || 1.11
nānāpakṣigaṇākīrṇaṃ nānāmṛganiṣevitam |
tarupuṣpalatādyāḍhyaṃ vāpīkūpahradānvitam || 1.12
tatra gatvā munivaras tatratyair dvijasattamaiḥ |
pūjitaś cārdhyapādyādyaiḥ viṣṭare 'bhiniveśitaḥ || 1.13
munīnāṃ prītijanakaṃ vākyam evam uvāca saḥ |
nārāyaṇo 'tra satataṃ bhavadbhis sevyate yataḥ || 1.14
bhavatsu karuṇā tasya paripūrṇā hi vartate |
bhavadbhis saha sambandhāt <saṃbandhāt> kṛtārtho 'dya bhavāmy aham || 1.15
ādiṣṭo 'haṃ bhagavatā bhavadarthe munīśvarāḥ |
adhītya sāmprataṃ <sāṃprataṃ> sarve rahasyām nāyam uttaram || 1.16
adya prabhṛti deveśamārādhayata yoginaḥ |

munayaḥ
mune ciraprapannānām asmākaṃ tvaṃ parā gatiḥ || 1.17
nārāyaṇapadaprāpterupāyaṃ samprakāśaya <saṃprakāśaya> |

nāradaḥ
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayas sarve vedam ekāyanābhidham || 1.18
mokṣāyanāya vai panthā etadanyo na vidyate |
tasmād ekāyanaṃ nāma pravadanti manīṣiṇaḥ || 1.19
mūlabhūtas tu mahato vedavṛkṣasya yo mahān |
sadbrahmavāsudevākhyaparatattvaikasaṃśrayam || 1.20
divyair balādikair mantraiḥ sākṣāttatpratipādakaiḥ |
alaṅkṛtam <alaṃkṛtam> asandigdham <asaṃdigdham> avidyātimirāpaham || 1.21
ityuktvādhyāpya yogīndrān sañjagādāsya <saṃjagādāsya> vaibhavam |
eṣa prakṛtidharmākhyo vāsudevaikagocaraḥ || 1.22
pravartyate kṛtayuge tatas tretāyugādiṣu |
vikāravedās sarvatra devatāntaragocarāḥ || 1.23
mahato vedavṛkṣasya mūlabhūto mahānayam |
skandhabhūtā ṛgādyās te śākhābhūtāś ca yoginaḥ || 1.24
jaganmūlasya vedasya vāsudevasya mukhyataḥ |
pratipādakatā siddhā mūlavedākhyatā dvijāḥ || 1.25
ādyaṃ bhāgavataṃ dharmam ādibhūte kṛte yuge |
mānavā yogyabhūtās te anutiṣṭhanti nityaśaḥ || 1.26
tatas tretāyuge sarve nānākāmasamanvitāḥ |
vyāmiśrayājino bhūtvā tyajatyādyaṃ sanātanam || 1.27
antardadhāti sarvo 'yaṃ vāsudevasamāhṛtaḥ |
tato yogyāya bhagavān prādurbhāvayati svayam || 1.28
evaṃ mayā purādhītaśvetadvīpe munīśvarāḥ |
sanassanatsujātaś ca sanakaś ca sanandanaḥ || 1.29
sanatkumāraḥ kapilas saptamaś ca sanātanaḥ |
ete ekāntidharmasya ācāryāś ca pravartakāḥ || 1.30
marīciratryaṅgirasau pulastyaḥ pulahaḥ kratuḥ |
vasiṣṭhaś ca mahātejā ete citraśikhaṇḍinaḥ || 1.31
manus svāyambhuvaś <svāyaṃbhuvaś> cāpi samārādhya jagatpatim |
mahatā tapasā caiva devaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ prabhum || 1.32
divyaṃ varṣasahasran tu tadante samadhītya ca |
mūlaśrutiṃ yathāvac ca ṛṣayo 'dhyāpitās tu te || 1.33
tatas te ṛṣayas tv aṣṭau lokānāṃ hitakāmyayā |
ślokānāṃ śatasāhasrair mūlavedaṃ nirīkṣya ca || 1.34
tathā divyāni śāstrāṇi sātvatādīni cādarāt |
nirīkṣyānyat tu tantrākhyaṃ śāstraṃ vidadhire dvijāḥ || 1.35
evaṃ mūlaśruter arthān jñātvā manvādayo 'pi ca |
dharmaśāstrāṇy anekāni kariṣyanti yathātatham || 1.36
anyeṣām api śāstrāṇāṃ yonir etad bhaviṣyati |
asmin dharmaś ca kāmaś ca arthaś coktas savistaram || 1.37
mokṣaś ca sūcitaḥ paścāt tasmāt sāratamo hy ayam |
purā todādriśikhare śāṇḍilyo 'pi mahāmuniḥ || 1.38
samāhitamanā bhūtvā tapas taptvā mahattaram |
anekāni sahasrāṇi varṣāṇāṃ tapaso 'ntataḥ || 1.39
dvāparasya yugasyānte ādau kaliyugasya ca |
sākṣāt saṅkarṣaṇāl <saṃkarṣaṇāl> labdhvā vedam ekāyanābhidham || 1.40
sumantuṃ jaiminiṃ caiva bhṛguṃ caivopagāyanam |
mauñjyāyanaṃ ca taṃ vedaṃ samyagadhyāpayat purā || 1.41
naranārāyaṇābhyāṃ ca jagato hitakāmyayā |
tathānuṣṭhīyate mūladharmo 'tra munipuṅgavāḥ || 1.42
eṣa ekāyano vedaḥ prakhyātas sarvato bhuvi |
durvijñeyo duṣkaraś ca pratibuddhair niṣevyate || 1.43

munayaḥ
bhagavan sarvaśātrajña śaraṇāgatavatsala |
tvatprasādena samprāpto <saṃprāpto> mūlavedo mahānayam || 1.44
tatprabhāvaś ca viditas sarvalokeṣu pūjitaḥ |
pratibuddhair niṣevyo 'yaṃ mūlavedas sanātanaḥ || 1.45
katham apratibuddhais tair magnair bhavamahāmbudhau |
prāpyate bhagavan dharma ekāntibhir anuṣṭhitaḥ || 1.46

nāradaḥ
śrūyatām abhidhāsyāmi sarvalokahitaiṣiṇaḥ |
puraivaṃ bhagavān eva samālocya haris svayam || 1.47
parityajya paraṃ dharmaṃ miśradharmam upeyuṣām |
bhūyas tatpadakāṅkṣāṇāṃ śraddhābhaktī upeyuṣām || 1.48
anugrahārthaṃ varṇānāṃ yogyatāpādanāya ca |
tathā janānāṃ sarveṣām abhīṣṭaphalasiddhaye || 1.49
mūlavedānusāreṇa chandasānuṣṭubhena ca |
sātvataṃ pauṣkaraṃ caiva jayākhyetyevamādikam || 1.50
divyaṃ sacchāstrajālaṃ tad uktvā saṅkarṣaṇādibhiḥ |
pravartayāmāsa bhuvi sarvalokahitaiṣibhiḥ || 1.51
evaṃ divyāni śāstrāṇi śāṇḍilyo 'pi mahāmuniḥ |
saṅkarṣaṇād <saṃkarṣaṇād> bhagavataḥ śrutvā adhyāpayan munīn || 1.52
malayācalaniṣṭhāś ca purā rāmasya cājñayā |
prathamaṃ sātvataṃ śāstraṃ samyagadhyāpitā mayā || 1.53
vāsudevena yatproktaṃ śāstraṃ bhagavatā svayam |
anuṣṭupchandobandhena samāsavyāsabhedataḥ || 1.54
tathaiva brahmarudrendrapramukhaiś ca pravartitam |
lokeṣv api ca divyeṣu taddivyaṃ munisattamāḥ || 1.55
brahmarudramukhair devaiḥ ṛṣibhiś ca tapodhanaiḥ |
svayaṃ praṇītaṃ yac chāstraṃ tat jñeyaṃ munibhāṣitam || 1.56
etat tu trividhaṃ viddhi sātvikādivibhedataḥ |
vijñāya puṇḍarīkākṣaḥ arthajālaṃ yathāsthitam || 1.57
tadbodhikaṃ praṇītaṃ yat śāstraṃ tat sātvikaṃ smṛtam |
tasmāt jñāte 'rthajāte tu kiñcit tadavalambya ca || 1.58
svabuddhyunmeṣitasyaiva hy arthajātasya bodhakam |
yatpraṇītaṃ dvijaśreṣṭha tathā vijñānatattvataḥ || 1.59
granthavistarasaṃyuktaṃ śāstraṃ sarveśvareśvarāt |
tatsaṃkṣepaprasādena <tatsaṅkṣepaprasādena>
svavikalpavijṛmbhaṇaiḥ <svavikalpavijṛṃbhaṇaiḥ> || 1.60
brahmādibhiḥ praṇītaṃ yat tathā tadṛṣibhir dvijāḥ |
brahmādibhiḥ pariśrutya tatsaṃkṣepātmanā <tatsaṅkṣepātmanā> punaḥ || 1.61
svavikalpāt praṇītaṃ yat tat sarvaṃ rājasaṃ smṛtam |
tat syād dvedhā pañcarātravaikhānasavibhedataḥ || 1.62
kevalasvavikalpoktaiḥ kṛtaṃ yat tāmasaṃ smṛtam |
kevalaṃ manujair yat tu kṛtaṃ tat pauruṣaṃ smṛtam || 1.63
ato divyāt parataraṃ nāsti śāstraṃ munīśvarāḥ |
sātvataṃ pauṣkaraṃ caiva jayākhyaṃ ca tathaiva ca || 1.64
evamādīni divyāni śāstrāṇi hariṇā svayam |
mūlavedānusāreṇa proktāni hitakāmyayā || 1.65
sātvatādyaṃ trikaṃ caitat vyāpakaṃ munisattamāḥ |
yathā cāṣṭākṣarādīnāṃ mantrāṇāṃ tritayaṃ budhāḥ || 1.66
etattantratrayoktena vidhinā yādavācale |
śrīraṅge hastiśaile ca kramāt sampūjyate <saṃpūjyate> hariḥ || 1.67
eteṣu divyaśāstreṣu sātvatantūttamottamam |
vaktā sākṣādīśvaro 'sya śrotā saṅkarṣaṇaḥ prabhuḥ || 1.68
kiṃ varṇyate 'sya māhātmyaṃ sātvatasya munīśvarāḥ |
atas sākṣādīśvaroktaśāstrāṇāṃ dvijapuṅgavāḥ || 1.69
sārabhūtaṃ viśeṣeṇa sātvatārthopapādakam |
īśvarākhyām idaṃ tantraṃ sākṣātsaṅkarṣaṇāc chrutam || 1.70
sampravakṣyāmi <saṃpravakṣyāmi> munayaḥ śṛṇudhvam avadhānataḥ |
ity uktvā nārado yogī natvā nārāyaṇaṃ prabhum || 1.71
saṅkarṣaṇaṃ <saṃkarṣaṇaṃ> namaskṛtya vaktuṃ samupacakrame |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
śāstrāvatāro nāma prathamo 'dhyāyaḥ




atha dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ

nāradaḥ
ārādhanavidhiṃ vakṣye śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
brāhme muhūrte samprāpte <saṃprāpte> mantrajñaḥ prayataś śuciḥ || 2.1
nāmnāṃ saṅkīrtanaṃ kuryāt utthāya śayane sthitaḥ |
paricyutamalas snātaś śuddhavāsā jitendriyaḥ || 2.2
dhṛtordhvapuṇḍraḥ kālyoktakarmāṇi vinivartya ca |
gandhaiḥ sragbhir alaṅkāraiḥ kaṭakādyair alaṅkṛtaḥ || 2.3
sapavitrakaro maunī āsādya bhagavadgṛham |
dvārād bāhye yathāśāstraṃ śuddhena salilena ca || 2.4
ājānu pādau prakṣālya hastau cāmaṇibandhanāt |
ācamya ca praviśyāntaḥ praṇamya manum uccaran || 2.5
dhāma pradakṣiṇīkṛtya bodhayet puruṣottamam |
śaṅkhadhvanisamopetaṃ dundubhīpaṭahasvanaiḥ || 2.6
vandibṛndotthitoccābhir nānāvāgbhir mahāmate |
mahājayajayārāvaiḥ punaḥpunarudīritaiḥ || 2.7
prabodhalakṣaṇaiḥ stotrair utthāpya śayanāt tataḥ |
dvāram āsādya tatrastho daśadigbandhapūrvakam || 2.8
avakuṇṭhyātha tarjanyā mantraṃ kavacam uccaran |
sthite vā kalpite tatra pūjayed balimaṇḍale || 2.9
sarvaṃ khageśapūrvan tu parivāraṃ hi sācyutam |
manasā praṇavādyena viṣṇum ādāya kīrtayet || 2.10
samastaparivārāya acyutāya namo namaḥ |
vāstupūruṣam anyāṃś ca samabhyarcya yathākramam || 1.11
mūlamantreṇa sāṅgena niraṅgenātha vā punaḥ |
nyāsaṃ kṛtvā trirācāryo hastatālaṃ hṛdā tataḥ || 2.12
mūlamantreṇa codghāṭya kavāṭaṃ netramantrataḥ |
nityadīpāṃs tato jvālya hastau prakṣālya vāriṇā || 2.13
prāsādāntaḥpraveśārthaṃ tato dvāran tu cetasā |
tribhāgīkṛtya tanmadhyabhāgam ekaṃ dvidhā punaḥ || 2.14
vibhajya vāmadeśena dakṣiṇenāṃghriṇā <dakṣiṇenāṅghriṇā> tataḥ |
śanaiś śanaiḥ praviśyāntas sāstramantreṇa tena vai || 2.15
dharaṇīhananaṃ kṛtvā bhagavantaṃ praṇamya ca |
manasā guruvaṃśaṃ ca tadājñāṃ mānasīm atha || 2.16
śirasā dhārayet sveṣṭaṃ phalaṃ saṅkalpya cetasā |
devāya taṃ nivedyātha yāgāgārasya madhyataḥ || 2.17
prāsādaṃ vigrahaṃ kṛtvā varmamantraṃ savigraham |
tajjīvaṃ bhagavantaṃ ca dhyātvā yāgagṛhaṃ tataḥ || 2.18
saśalākais tato darbhais saha devīvimiśritaiḥ |
sammārjya <saṃmārjya> bahutoyena prakṣālyālipya gomayaiḥ || 2.19
upaliptam athāstreṇa saṃvidhya śakalaṃ tyajet |
pañcagavyena sāstreṇa vāriṇā prokṣya candanaiḥ || 2.20
kuṅkumāgarukarpūrais samālipya samantataḥ |
kuśadūrvākṣatāṃś caiva vikiret sthānaśuddhaye || 2.21
prāsādaṃ śodhayed evaṃ svayam eva tu deśikaḥ |
prāsādoddeśam akhilaṃ mārjayet prokṣayet tataḥ || 2.22
paricārais tu kartavyaṃ balipīṭhāntam eva hi |
yāgopaskārasambhūtau <yāgopaskārasaṃbhūtau> bhagavantam anusmaran || 2.23
vinītān śiṣyaputrādīn  snātān ājñāpayet tataḥ |
pātraśuddhiṃ ca tair eva kārayet dvijasattamaḥ || 2.24
āmrakalkena toyena haimaṃ tāmraṃ ca śodhayet |
rājataṃ gṛhadhūmena śāntāṅgāreṇa vā punaḥ || 2.25
bhasmamiśreṇa toyena lohayuktaṃ viśodhayet |
śaṅkhaśuktimayānāṃ ca lavaṇena viśodhayet || 2.26
phalapatramayānāṃ ca mṛdbhir adbhiś ca śodhayet |
lepagandhāpanodena śuddhir bhavati kārayet || 2.27
dravyaśuddhir bhavaty evaṃ yathāvadvidhicoditā |
pātrāṇi śodhayitvaivaṃ tato maunaparo dvijaḥ || 2.28
deveśasyāgrato vāpi dakṣiṇaṃ bhāgam āśrayet |
īśvaraprāgvaśād eva hy uttarābhimukho dvijaḥ || 2.29
athopaviśya vai dārbhe kāṣṭhaje vā 'jināsane |
āgamārthaṃ ca devānāṃ gamanārthaṃ ca rakṣasām || 2.30
kuryād dhaṇṭāravaṃ tatra devatāsthānalāñchanam |
śaṅkhādighoṣasaṃyuktaṃ geyavādyasamanvitam || 2.31
karaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryād yathāvan munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
dve tale hastapṛṣṭhe dve sarvāś cāṅgulayas <cāṃgulayas> tathā || 2.32
astramantreṇa saṃśodhya dhyānamudrānvitena tu |
kṛtvaivaṃ karaśuddhiṃ ca sthānaśuddhiṃ samācaret || 2.33
dhyātvā devaṃ jvaladrūpaṃ sahasrārkasamaprabham |
jvālākoṭisamākīrṇaṃ vamantaṃ jvalanaṃ mukhāt || 2.34
tena sampūrayet <saṃpūrayet> sarvam ābrahmabhavanāntimam |
digoghaṃ prajvalantaṃ ca bhāvayen mantratejasā || 2.35
kṣmāmaṇḍalam idaṃ sarvaṃ smaret pakvaṃ ca vahninā |
mantrajena dvijaśreṣṭhāḥ mṛnmayaṃ bhājanaṃ yathā || 2.36
sthānaśuddhir bhavaty evaṃ sudhākallolasecanāt |
sambhāvyaivaṃ <saṃbhāvyaivaṃ> tataḥ kuryād digbandhaṃ hṛdayādikaiḥ || 2.37
astreṇaiva vidigbandhaṃ netreṇa tv ata ūrdhvataḥ |
ādityāyutadīptena jvalatkañcukarūpiṇā <jvalatkaṃcukarūpiṇā> || 2.38
kavacena tu tarjanyā rakṣārtham avakuṇṭhayet |
sāyāmāṃ bhūtasaṃśuddhiṃ dhāraṇābhyāṃ samācaret || 2.39
kevalena tu mantreṇa bhāvanāsahitena tu |
nābhideśasthitaṃ dhyātvā devaṃ saṅgṛhya <saṃgṛhya> kalmaṣam || 2.40
nissṛtaṃ vāyumārgeṇa dvādaśāntāvadhau kṣipet |
nirastapāpam ākṛṣya vātacakrasamanvitam || 2.41
nāsāgreṇa tu mantre 'muṃ dehasampūraṇāya <dehasaṃpūraṇāya> ca |
taṃ dhyāyed dhṛdayasthaṃ ca gatiruddhena vāyunā || 2.42
cittopaśamanārthaṃ tu nūnaṃ vāyujayāya ca |
śanaiś śanair atha bahiḥ kevalaṃ mārutaṃ kṣipet || 2.43
vināntyarecakenaivam anyeṣām uttarottaram |
kālābhyāsaṃ yathāśakti nityam evaṃ samācaret || 2.44
dvādaśānte 'tha mantreśaṃ taptahāṭakasannibham <taptahāṭakasaṃnibham> |
sahasaravisaṅkāśavṛttamaṇḍalamadhyagam
<sahasaravisaṃkāśavṛttamaṇḍalamadhyagam> || 2.45
smṛtvātha muktaṃ tanmantrair nirdahed vigrahaṃ svakam |
dakṣiṇāṅghrer athāṅguṣṭhaprānte deśe śikhākṣaram || 2.46
dhyātvā yugāntahutabhugrūpajvālāsamāvṛtam |
tena svavigrahaṃ dhyāyet prajvalantaṃ samantataḥ || 2.47
dehajāṃ bhāvayej jvālāṃ mantranāthe layaṃ gatām |
divyapraśāntāgāraṃ tu tam adhiṣṭhāya cetasā || 2.48
svamantrād amṛtaughena secayed vigrahaṃ svakam |
tatas svamantraṃ tadbimbam ākṛṣya hṛdi vinyaset || 2.49
evaṃ sa śuddhadeho 'tha mantranyāsaṃ samācaret |
yena vinyastamātreṇa devadevasamo bhavet || 2.50
pūjādisarvakāryāṇām adhikāraś ca jāyate |
hastadvaye 'pi vinyasyed dīptam aṣṭākṣaraṃ param || 2.51
maṇibandhān nakhāgrāntam ādityātapavat tataḥ |
sṛṣṭisaṃsthitisaṃhāranyāsaṃ kuryād yathāvidhi || 2.52
parvadakṣiṇatarjanyāḥ prārabhyāṅguliparvasu |
parvāntaṃ vāmatarjanyā nyāsas sṛṣṭir udāhṛtaḥ || 2.53
vyatyāsena tu saṃhāra sthitī <<sthitau>> tu karayor dvayoḥ |
prārabhya tarjanīparvakaniṣṭhāparvaviśramaḥ || 2.54
aṅguṣṭhābhyāmaṅgulīnāṃ madhyaparvasu vinyaset |
mantrākṣarāṇi tvādyantaparvasu prāṇavan nyaset || 2.55
aṅguṣṭhadvitayaṃ yāvatkaniṣṭhādvitayāvadhiḥ |
jñānādyaṃ vīryaparyantaṃ vinyased aṅgapañcakam <aṃgapaṃcakam> || 2.56
mūlavadvyāpakatvena netramūrdhvāṅgulīṣu ca |
kirīṭaṃ dakṣiṇe haste śrīvatsaṃ vāmamadhyataḥ || 2.57
kaustubhaṃ dakṣiṇatale vanamālāṃ tathāpare |
dakṣiṇe madhyataḥ padmaṃ prasphuratkiraṇojjvalam || 2.58
gadāṃ vāmatale nyasyej jvalatīṃ svena tejasā |
dakṣe ma(pra)hāprabhaṃ cakraṃ śaṅkhaṃ vāmatale nyaset || 2.59
śriyaṃ dakṣiṇahaste tu puṣṭiṃ vāmatale nyaset |
aṅguṣṭhād dakṣiṇād ādau vāmāntaṃ mūladeśataḥ || 2.60
gāruḍaṃ vinyasen mantraṃ daśasvaṅguliṣu kramāt |
anena vidhinā pūrvaṃ hastanyāsaṃ samācaret || 2.61
ābrahmarandhrāt pādāntaṃ mūlamantraṃ tu vigrahe |
vyāpakatvena vinyasya pādād bhūyaśśiro 'ntimam || 2.62
sṛṣṭisthitilayanyāseṣv ekaṃ dehe samācaret |
mūrdhādipādaparyantaṃ sṛṣṭinyāsaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 2.63
pādādimūrdhaparyantaṃ saṃhāranyāsa iṣyate |
nābhyādihṛdayāntas tu sthitinyāsa udāhṛtaḥ || 2.64
mūrdhni madhyamayāṅgulyā tarjanyā ca tadā dṛśoḥ |
sāṅguṣṭhayānāmikayā mukhamadhye tu vinyaset || 2.65
sāṅguṣṭhatarjanyagreṇa hṛdaye vinyaset tataḥ |
tathāṅguṣṭhakaniṣṭhābhyāṃ nābhau nyāsaṃ samācaret || 2.66
vyaṅguṣṭhābhiś catasṛbhir upasthe jānunor api |
sarvābhir aṅgulībhis tu pādayor nyāsam ācaret || 2.67
mantrākṣaraṃ tu sarvatra tārasampuṭitaṃ <tārasaṃpuṭitaṃ> nyaset |
evam aṣṭākṣaranyāsaṃ kṛtvā 'ṅganyāsam <'ṃganyāsam> ācaret || 2.68
tatas tu hṛdaye jñānaṃ yato vyajyeta tatra tat |
aiśvaryaṃ śiraso deśe yasmād upari tiṣṭhati || 2.69
prākṛtaṃ tāttvikaṃ vāpi sarvatra kamalekṣaṇam |
hārdāgner ūrdhvagāyān tu śikhāyāṃ śaktimantrarāṭ || 2.70
balaṃ cākhilagātrāṇāṃ tvaggataṃ vāyunā saha |
mūrcchitaṃ sarvagātrair yat tadvīryaṃ hastayor nyaset || 2.71
antarbodhasvarūpaṃ yat prākṛtadhvāntaśāntikṛt |
tejas tattaijase sthāne nyāsakāle samasyate || 2.72
kirīṭaṃ mūrdhni vinyasyet vanyarkāyutadīdhitim |
śrīvatsaṃ vakṣaso vāme pūrṇendusadṛśadyuti || 2.73
kaustubhaṃ hṛdaye nyasya caṇḍadīdhitilakṣaṇam |
nānābjavanapuṣpotthāṃ vanamālāṃ ca kaṇṭhataḥ || 2.74
tataḥ padmagadācakraśaṅkhān prāgvat tu vinyaset |
ā cāṃsād dakṣiṇe bhāge nyasyāc chrīr uttare tathā || 2.75
puṣṭi gulphāvasāne ca garuḍaṃ corumadhyataḥ |
mantranyāsaṃ tu kṛtvaivaṃ tataḥ pāṇidvayena tu || 2.76
mudrāṃ badhvā smared dhyānaṃ devo 'ham iti bhāvayet |
kṛtvaivaṃ tu tataḥ paścān mānasaṃ yāgam ārabhet || 2.77
padmāsanādikaṃ badhvā nābhau brahmāñjaliṃ <brahmāṃjaliṃ> dṛḍham |
manasy uparataṃ kuryād akṣagrāmaṃ bahiḥsthitam || 2.78
cittaṃ buddhau vinikṣipya tāṃ buddhiṃ jñānagocare |
jñānabhāvanayā karma kuryād vai pāramārthikam || 2.79
atha praṇavapūrveṇa svanāmnānatinā saha |
śeṣapūrvan tu vahnyantam āsanaṃ parikalpayet || 2.80
tathākramyāya tasyaiva kāryā svahṛdi kalpanā |
catuścakre navadvāre dehe devagṛhe purā || 2.81
kaṇṭhakūpadharārūḍhaṃ hṛtpadmaṃ yadadhomukham |
tatkarṇikāvaner madhye rūḍham ūrdhvamukhaṃ tu yat || 2.82
śabdavyaktis tadūrdhve tu sthitārkendvagnilakṣaṇā |
śrīdīptibhāsvarā nāḍī tv avyaktadhvanivigrahā || 2.83
vyaktacakradvayasyordhve vartate yā mahāmate |
nismṛtā brahmarandhreṇa gatā sūryapathāt param || 2.84
vāyudvāreṇa pātālaṃ bhitvā yātā svagocaram |
saṅkalpaviṣayas <saṃkalpaviṣayas> sarvas tadbandhaḥ pratitiṣṭhati || 2.85
sūtre maṇigaṇo yadvanmadhyanāḍī hy ataḥ smṛtā |
lakṣyasthāne tu pūrvokte tasyām abhyantare tu vai || 2.86
sampuṭe <saṃpuṭe> śaśisūryākhye nimeṣonmeṣalakṣaṇe |
tatrābjaṃ cārkam ālambya parāvākbhramarī sthitā || 2.87
yā sarvamantrajananī śaktis sarvātmano vibhoḥ |
nadantī varṇajaṃ nādaṃ śabdabrahmeti yat smṛtam || 2.88
akārapūrvo hāntaś ca dhārāsantānarūpadhṛk |
nādāvasānagagane devo 'nantasamanvitaḥ || 2.89
varadābhayadenaiva śaṅkhacakrāṅkitena tu |
trailokyoddhṛtidakṣeṇa yuktaḥ pāṇidvayena tu || 2.90
śāntas saṃvitsvarūpas tu bhaktānugrahakāmyayā |
anaupamyena vapuṣā hy amūrto mūrtitāṃ gataḥ || 2.91
viśvam āpyāyayatkāntyā pūrṇendvayutatulyayā |
raśmibhir bhāskaro yadvatsamudra iva vīcibhiḥ || 2.92
svamūrtibhir amūrtābhir acyutādibhir anvitaḥ |
dīptimadbhir amūrtais tu sudhākallolasaṅkulaḥ || 2.93
pūrṇa ābharaṇais sarvair nirvikārāṅghrivigrahaḥ |
tasmād devaṃ samāvāhya hṛdaye kalpitāsane || 2.94
mantranyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt hastanyāsaṃ vinā vibhoḥ |
tataḥ khābjakamadhyāt tu hy ardhvasthāt saṃsmaret cyutām || 2.95
gaṅgāṃ bhagavato mūrdhni tenāmṛtajalena tu |
ardhyādasvilabhogānāṃ kāryā vai śubhakalpanā || 2.96
yaṃ yaṃ saṅkalpayed bhogaṃ taṃ taṃ bhāvya sudhāmayam |
patantam ambarād vegād amṛtāṃśuparilputam || 2.97
sākṣād amṛtarūpais tu tais tair amṛtasamplavaiḥ <amṛtasaṃplavaiḥ> |
bṛṃhitaṃ muditaṃ magnaṃ sa punar mantrarāṭ smaret || 2.98
tatas tu devadevasya ardhyaṃ datvā yathāvidhi |
sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> sannirodhaṃ <saṃnirodhaṃ> ca
sāmmukhyaṃ <sāṃmukhyaṃ> ca samācaret || 2.99
hṛdayādīni sāṅgāni <<cāṅgāni>> kirīṭādyaṃ tu bhūṣaṇam |
gadādyaṃ lāñchanaṃ yat tu lakṣmyādyāś śaktayas tathā || 2.100
garuḍo mūrtayo vānyā dehe devasya yāḥ sthitāḥ |
vyāpakasya tathātvena sve sve sthāne prabhātmakāḥ || 2.101
taddehasaṃsthitās sarve pūjanīyāḥ krameṇa tu |
parivāraṃ vinā mantrais svaiḥ svair ardhyādibhir dvijāḥ  || 2.102
layayāgo hy ayaṃ viprāḥ hṛdādiṣv anukīrtitaḥ |
mantrarāṭ karṇikāmadhye hṛdādyāḥ prāgdalādiṣu || 2.103
sākārāḥ kevalās sarve pūjyā bhogābhidho hy ayam |
kevalena ca yāgena pṛthagbhūtena vai dvijāḥ || 2.104
teṣām abhyarcanavidhir adhikārābhidhaḥ smṛtaḥ |
evaṃ kṛtvā layākhyaṃ tu yāgaṃ bhogābhidhaṃ tathā || 2.105
dhyātvātha bhāvanājātair bhogaiḥ paramapāvanaiḥ |
abhyarcayet svahṛdaye devaṃ vijñāpayed idam || 2.106
svāgataṃ devadeveśa sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> bhaja me 'cyuta |
gṛhāṇa mānasīṃ pūjāṃ yathārthaparibhāvitām || 2.107
jñātvā tu suprasannaṃ taṃ prasādābhimukhaṃ prabhum |
vistareṇa dvijaśreṣṭho <<dvijaśreṣṭhāḥ>> mānasaṃ yāgam ārabhet || 2.108
saṅkalpajanitair <saṃkalpajanitair> divyaiḥ pavitrair akṣayaiś śubhaiḥ |
sarvakāmapradaṃ devaṃ mantramūrtidharaṃ yajet || 2.109
abhyaṅgodvartane pūrvaṃ snānaṃ cātha vilepanam |
vastrapūrvāṇi mālyāni sugandhāni nivedya ca || 2.110
hārakeyūrakaṭakair makuṭair bhūṣitaṃ smaret |
citreṇa kaṭisūtreṇa hemaratnamayena ca || 2.111
māṇikyaracitaiś śuddhair muktāhāraiś ca bhūṣayet |
sampūrṇendusamānaṃ <saṃpūrṇendusamānaṃ> ca hemadaṇḍasamanvitam || 2.112
chatraṃ nivedayed viṣṇor māyūravyajanaṃ śubham |
karpūracūrṇasammiśraṃ <karpūracūrṇasaṃmiśraṃ> sugandhi madhuraṃ bahu || 
2.113
dhūpaṃ bhagavato datvā dīpamālāṃ ghṛtena ca |
madhusarpiḥplutaṃ cātha madhuparkaṃ nivedayet || 2.114
paśuṃ ca vividhaṃ mūrtaṃ pāvanaṃ śakuniṃ tathā |
oṣadhīś śālidūrvāś ca satphalāḍhyaṃ vanaspatim || 2.115
mūrtaṃ nivedayet pūrvam idam annaṃ caturvidham |
nivedya vividhaṃ śuddhaṃ bhakṣyabhojyāny anekaśaḥ || 2.116
hṛdyāni phalamūlāni ṣaḍrasaprabhavāni ca |
ṣaḍrasāni vicitrāṇi pānāny atha nivedya ca || 2.117
sarvāṇy ātmopabhogyāni bhaktiśraddhāvaśāt dvijāḥ |
pradikṣv apy aviruddhāni devāya vinivedayet || 2.118
tantrīvādyāny anekāni nṛttageyānvitāni ca |
bherīpaṭahaghoṣādistutipāṭhānvitāni ca || 2.119
cintayed devadevasya lokatrayagatāni ca |
kiṅkiṇījālayuktena cāmareṇopavījya ca || 2.120
vitānakaṃ patākāṃś ca dhvajāni vividhāni ca |
vinivedya vibhor bhaktyā prasannenāntarātmanā || 2.121
gajāśvadhenuyānāni suvastrālaṅkṛtāni <suvastrālaṃkṛtāni> ca |
nivedya cāntarā tāni grāhayantaṃ smaret tataḥ || 2.122
ātmānaṃ sasutaṃ dārān sarvasvena samāyutān |
nivedya praṇato mūrdhnā ānandāśrusamanvitaḥ || 2.123
kāmadhenumayīṃ mudrāṃ mantrasaṃyutām |
baddhāṃ sañcintayed <saṃcintayed> viṣṇos sarvakāmaprapūriṇīm || 2.124
tato viśeṣayajanaṃ kalayed acyutasya tu |
sauvarṇapuṣpasampūrṇamañjaliṃ <sauvarṇapuṣpasaṃpūrṇamaṃjaliṃ>
samprasārya <saṃprasārya> tu || 2.125
mūlamantraṃ samuccārya prayatnaiḥ pūrakādibhiḥ |
dīrghaghaṇṭāravaprakhyaṃ yāvat tat sambhavāvadhi <saṃbhavāvadhi> || 2.126
sphuradraśmidvayākīrṇaṃ vahnyarkendusamaprabham |
dhyātvā nārāyaṇaṃ devam ajñatāṃ sannirodhayet <saṃnirodhayet> || 2.127
tam añjaliṃ kṣipen mūrdhni tasmin vai mantravigrahe |
ardhyaṃ nivedayed bhūyaḥ punaḥ puṣpāñjaliṃ śubham || 2.128
mudrāṃ sandarśya mūlākhyāṃ mānasaṃ japam ārabhet |
saṅkhyāhīnaṃ yathāśakti ghaṇṭākhyākaraṇena ca || 2.129
bhogasthānagatānāṃ ca hṛdādīnāṃ krameṇa tu |
manasā darśayen mudrāṃ japaṃ kuryāt sakṛtsakṛt || 2.130
stotramantraiḥ pavitraiś ca stutvā samyak prasādayet |
japāntaṃ caivam abhyarcyāpy avatārya bahiryajet || 2.131

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
mānasayāgavidhir nāma
dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ


śrīḥ
atha tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ

purānena vidhānena kṛtvā yāgaṃ tu mānasam |
karmaṇā bhaktiyuktena bahirbimbe yajet tataḥ || 3.1
bāhyayāgavidhiṃ samyak śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
devaṃ hṛtkamalākāśe tejorūpatayā sthitam || 3.2
tasmāt sthānāt samānīya taṃ kuryān netramadhyagam |
vāsudevābhidhānaṃ tu prāguktaṃ ca samāśrayet || 3.3
tato locanayugmena stabdhena munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
japan locanamantraṃ tu paśyed yāgopayoginam || 3.4
sambhāram <saṃbhāram> akhilaṃ tena dravyasaṅgho viśudhyati |
upārjitaṃ purā yad vai yāgopakaraṇaṃ mahat || 3.5
tatsarvaṃ tatkṣaṇe kṛtvā vāme tu karakaṃ nyaset |
gālitenāmbhasā pūrṇaṃ madhye bhadrāsanaṃ nyaset || 3.6
yat kiñcitpatrapuṣpādyaṃ paridṛśyeta piṅgalam |
pāṇinā tat samāhṛtya śucisthāne nidhāya vai || 3.7
gavyair vā cāmarair vālaiś śikhipakṣaiḥ kuśair atha |
sammārjya <saṃmārjya> bhadrapīṭhaṃ tu vāsasā susitena vā || 3.8
bahunā vastrapūtena vāriṇā tadanantaram |
prakṣālya dvādaśārṇena praṇavādyantakena tu || 3.9
evam ārādhanādhāraṃ kṣālayitvā ca vāriṇā |
tat tāvadastrapuṣpeṇa kuryād vighnagaṇojjhitam || 3.10
ārāthyāṃyāmathāropya tatra mantramayīṃ śubhām |
sarvopakaraṇopetāṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutām || 3.11
pratimāṃ dhātupāṣāṇanirmitām ātmasiddhaye |
divyārghyapādyācamanairdevam abhyarcya vai tataḥ || 3.12
bhuktam arghyādikaṃ tasmād apanīyābhivādya ca |
samarpya viṣvaksenasya saṃśodhya mṛdunā dvijāḥ || 3.13
uśīravaṃśakūrcena kṣālayed ambhasā tataḥ |
uccaran mūlamantraṃ vā kuryān mārgatrayaṃ vibhoḥ || 3.14
sudhaute devadevasya vāsasī paridhāpayet |
citrasthād bhagavadbimbād bhuktapuṣpādikaṃ hi yat || 3.15
apanīya tu tatkuryād vāsasā reṇumārjanam |
yad vā prāgyāgabhavanapraveśānantaraṃ dvijāḥ || 3.16
nyasya bhadrāsanādyantam anyad anyat samācaret |
yad vā tadātane kāle nyasya bhadrāsanādikam || 3.17
ādyaṃ mārgatrayaṃ kṛtvā yathoktavidhinā tataḥ |
yogapīṭhārcanārambhe bimboktaṃ sarvam ārabhet || 3.18
athārghyādīni pātrāṇi prakṣālyāstreṇa vāriṇā |
gālitenāmbhasāpūrya pātrāṇi munisattamāḥ || 3.19
mukhyāmukhyārghyapātrādikramād dravyāṇi nikṣipet |
ekasmin candanādīni dūrvāsiddhārthakāni ca || 3.20
sākṣatāni kuśāgrāṇi taṇḍulāni tilāṃs tu vai |
saratnānuttamān dhātūn saphalān viniveśayet || 3.21
dvitīye dadhimadhvājyakṣīrabinducatuṣṭayam |
kuśāgreṇa sabāhlīkaṃ sapuṣpatilataṇḍulam || 3.22
dūrvāṃ ca viṣṇukrāntāṃ ca śyāmākaṃ śaṅkhapuṣpakam |
padmakaṃ kundareṇuṃ ca pādyapātre vinikṣipet || 3.23
tvagelādyacayaṃ sarvaṃ sakarpūraṃ ca candanam |
nyased ācamanīyākhyapātre tu munisattamāḥ || 3.24
koṣṭhaṃ māṃsīṃ haridre dve murāśaileyacampakān |
vacākaccoramustāś ca snānīye tu vinikṣipet || 3.25
hṛnmantreṇaiva sarvatra kuryād vai dravyayojanam |
ādhāropari pātrāṇi svapūrvaniyamena tu || 3.26
vāyavyādiṣu vinyasya tattatkalpanamantrataḥ |
om arghyaṃ kalpayāmīti uktvā vāyupade nyaset || 3.27
kalaśaṃ tadvadaiśānyāṃ nyased ācamanārthataḥ |
snānārtham agnikoṇe tu pādyārthaṃ naiṛte tathā || 3.28
agrato vāpi tanmadhye nyased arghyaṃ dvitīyakam |
yad vā prāg eva pātrāṇi nyasyādhāropari dvijāḥ || 3.29
tattatkalpanamantrais tu tāni hastena saṃspṛśet |
dakṣiṇottarahastābhyāṃ hṛdbījena vicintya ca || 3.30
sūryasomau tataḥ kuryād dravyadāhasamudbhavau |
badhvā kāmadughāṃ mudrāṃ sravantīṃ mantrasaṃyutām || 3.31
gorūpāṃ himaśailābhāṃ nirādhārapade sthitāṃ |
tayā tadamṛtīkuryāt dravyajālaṃ yathāsthitam || 3.32
varge 'ṣṭame tṛtīyārṇaṃ vakāropari saṃsthitam |
īkārānusvārayuktaṃ namaḥpraṇavamadhyagam || 3.33
saurabhīyo hy ayaṃ mantraḥ svavāṇīsaṃyuto dvijāḥ |
evaṃ vāṇīdvayenaiva agnīṣomātmakena tu || 3.34
yogyatāṃ padavīṃ nītvā preṣayed yadyadāhṛtam |
toyam ādāya pātre 'tha tatra hṛnmantritaṃ kṣipet || 3.35
puṣpagandhasamopetaṃ susitaṃ śālitaṇḍulam |
mantrayet praṇavādyena bahuśo hṛdayena tu || 3.36
taduddhṛtenāmbhasā vai astramantraṃ samuccaran |
prokṣayet svāsanaṃ sthānaṃ yāgopakaraṇaṃ tathā || 3.37
sāstreṇa mūlamantreṇa arghyādīn abhimantrya tu |
saṣaḍaṅgena tenaiva kuryāt puṣpādinārcanam || 3.38
dhūpapātraṃ ca ghaṇṭāṃ ca samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
ghaṇṭācālanapūrvaṃ tu dhūpenārghyādikān yajet || 3.39
dhūpapātrasya ghaṇṭāyāḥ pūjanaṃ cocyate 'dhunā |
padmacakrāṅkitaṃ divyam ādhārakajarūpiṇam || 3.40
ekanālaṃ ca kartavyaṃ śeṣaṃ saptaphaṇaṃ vibhum |
baddhāñjalipuṭaṃ <baddhāṃjalipuṭaṃ> nityaṃ dhyāyantaṃ kāraṇaṃ param || 
3.41
cakralāṅgalahastaṃ ca padmāsanagataṃ vibhum |
kartavyaṃ dhūpadhartāraṃ kiṅkiṇījālaśobhitam || 3.42
cakraṃ taccakrahṛdayaṃ padmaṃ hṛtkoṭaraṃ viduḥ |
cakre yā yā arākhyāstā nāḍyo vai dvādaśa smṛtāḥ || 3.43
kiṅkiṇyo yāḥ sthitā viprāḥ jñeyās tās sūkṣmanāḍayaḥ |
yāsāṃ vai madhyamā śaktir bhujaṅgakuṭilopamā || 3.44
dhūmadhūsaravarṇābhā aṇḍaṃ bhitvā vinirgatā |
kālāgnihṛdayotthā sā satyānte tu layaṃ gatā || 3.45
tayā sañcodito <saṃcodito> hy ātmā mantramūrtīśvaraḥ prabhuḥ |
sannidhau <saṃnidhau> bhavati kṣipram apy ucchinnaṃ dahet tathā || 3.46
mantreṇānena viprarṣe tanmantram avadhāraya |
oṅkāraṃ pūrvam uddhṛtya paramātmā tataḥ punaḥ || 3.47
vyomānandena saṃyuktam anantāya padaṃ tataḥ |
kālāgnirūpāya padaṃ jagaddhūmapadaṃ tathā || 3.48
sugāndhine padaṃ kuryāt sarvagandhavahāya ca |
namas svāhā samāyuktam ekatriṃśākṣaraṃ padam || 3.49
mantraṃ dvijasamākhyātaṃ dhūpapātrasya nārada |
mudrādhyānasamāyuktaṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ param || 3.50
mantreṇānena sampūjya <saṃpūjya> dhūpapātram anantaram |
ghaṇṭāsampūjanaṃ <ghaṇṭāsaṃpūjanaṃ> kuryāt tadvidhān abhihocyate || 3.51
ādāya praṇavaṃ pūrvam ananteśamataḥ param |
taṃ cānalena sambhinnam <saṃbhinnam> ūrdhvādho munisattama || 3.52
trailokyaiśvaryadenātha lāñchayet pañcabindunā |
dadyād asyāvasāne tu ṛgadhvani padaṃ tataḥ || 3.53
mantramātre padaṃ cānyatsvāhākṣarasamanvitam |
tadante paramātmānaṃ prajñādhāropari sthitam || 3.54
bhūdhareṇa yutaṃ mūrdhnā bhūdharopari vinyaset |
viśvāpyāyakarāntassthatrailokyaiśvaryadaṃ mune || 3.55
trayodaśākṣaro mantro ghaṇṭākhyas sarvasiddhikṛt |
vinyāsakāle yasyā vai plutam uccārayet tataḥ || 3.56
dhyānayuktaṃ dvijaśreṣṭha taddhyānam avadhāraya |
adhomukhaṃ tu brahmāṇḍaṃ dhyāyej janaravākulam || 3.57
sanālaṃ ca tadūrdhve tu padmam aṣṭadalaṃ smaret |
prakīrṇapatraṃ susitaṃ kesarālisukarṇikam || 3.58
tanmadhye cintayed devīṃ vargāṣṭakabhujānvitām |
mukhye hastacatuṣke tu lāñchanaṃ <lāṃchanaṃ> kamalādikam || 3.59
sphāṭikaṃ cākṣasūtraṃ ca tathā vijñānapustakam |
abhayaṃ varadaṃ caiva hastadvidvitaye pare || 3.60
padmāsanenopaviṣṭāṃ padmapatrāyatekṣaṇām |
padmagarbhapratīkāśāṃ padmalāñchanabhūṣitām <padmalāṃchanabhūṣitām> 
|| 3.61
sitābharaṇasañchannāṃ <sitābharaṇasaṃchannāṃ> pītavastravimaṇḍitām |
mantraughamudgirantīṃ ca mantrajvālāprabhānvitām || 3.62
devais sustūyamānāṃ ca brahmādyaiḥ brahmavādibhiḥ |
ṛṣibhir munibhis siddhair lokānugrahakāribhiḥ || 3.63
namyamānāṃ smaret samyakpūjākāle sadaiva hi |
yo 'nayā pūjayen mantrī tasya siddhir na dūrataḥ || 3.64
evaṃ dhyātvārcayet samyagarghyādyais tu tataḥ smaret |
śabdabrahmamaho yadyaddhṛdabjākāśamadhyagam || 3.65
nityoditamanaupamyamanabhyāsādagocaram |
upadeṣṭumato 'nyeṣām abhaktānāṃ na yujyate || 3.66
parasvarūpaṃ mantrāṇām etallakṣaṇam abjaja |
daśaprakāre yacchabde visargānte 'kṣarādike |
nānāmantrasvarūpeṇa vartate varṇavigrahe || 3.67
bhogamokṣaprado mantro ya āptas sadguror mukhāt |
pañcasthānagato <paṃcasthānagato> jñeyo bhaktair divyakriyāparaiḥ || 3.68
bahissthapratimādau tu jihvāgre hṛtkuśeśaye |
dhūpadhūmaśikhāyāṃ ca ghaṇṭāśabde sulakṣaṇe || 3.69
svarūpajyotir evāntarbhāvayan saṃsthitaṃ hṛdi |
madhyamena svarūpeṇa apy ucchinnaṃ mahāmate || 3.70
dhūpadhūmāśritaṃ viddhi vaikharīvigrahaṃ punaḥ |
ghaṇṭāyāṃ cālyamānāyām acchinnam anubhūyate || 3.71
evaṃ smṛtvā tatas tāṃ tu svamantranyastavigrahām |
arcitāṃ dhyānasaṃyuktām arghyādyair dhūpasaṃyutaiḥ || 3.72
sañcālayet <saṃcālayet> tatas samyak suśabdāṃ mantrabodhinīm |
trailokyadrāviṇīṃ ghaṇṭāṃ sarvaduṣṭanibarhiṇīm || 3.73
eṣā drutir hi mantrāṇāṃ suptānāṃ ca prabodhinī |
vāriṇī sarvabighnānāṃ sarvamantraprasādinī || 3.74
praṇavānte dhvanir hy eṣā śabdaśaktau layaṃ gatā |
varṇadehāḥ smṛtā mantrāḥ mantradehāś ca devatāḥ || 3.75
ghaṇṭās tanitamūlās te prabuddhāḥ karmasiddhidāḥ |
paraśabdotthitā śaktir ghaṇṭās tanitarūpiṇī || 3.76
varṇatvaṃ samanuprāptā tair varṇair munisattama |
mantrāṇāṃ kalpitā dehāḥ nānākārās sahasraśaḥ || 3.77
svecchayā tvanayā śaktyā sāmarthyāt svātmanas svayam |
anugrahārtham iha hi bhaktānāṃ bhāvitātmanām || 3.78
mananān muniśārdūla trāṇaṃ kurvanti vai yataḥ |
dadate padam ātmīyaṃ tasmān mantrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 3.79
anabhivyaktaśabdās te nirākārās tathaiva ca |
ghaṇṭāyāṃ cālyamānāyāṃ niryānti ca sahasraśaḥ || 3.80
ata eva muniśreṣṭha mantramātā prakīrtitā |
eṣā ghaṇṭābhidhā śaktir vāgīśā ca sarasvatī || 3.81
vāci mantrān sthitān sarve vācyaṃ mantre pratiṣṭhitam |
mantrarūpātmakaṃ viśvaṃ sabāhyābhyantaraṃ tataḥ || 3.82
ghaṇṭāśabdagataṃ sarvaṃ tasmāt tāṃ cālayet purā |
āvāhanārdhye dhūpe ca dīpe naivedyajoṣaṇe || 3.83
japastutyavasānābhyāṃ pravṛtte cāgnitarpaṇe |
pūrṇāhutipradāne ca mantrāṇāṃ tu visarjane || 3.84
viṣvaksenārcane caiva tatpūjāpratipādane |
balipradānakāle tu devatānāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 3.85
nityam eva prayuñjīta <prayuṃjīta> samyaṅmantrārthasiddhaye |
pūjākālaṃ vinānyatra hitaṃ nāsyāḥ pracālanam || 3.86
nānayā tu vinā kāryaṃ pūjanaṃ siddhim icchatā |
dhūpaṃ datvātha pātrāṇāṃ dhaṇṭāśabdasamanvitam || 3.87
dhūpaṃ dadyād yathākāle yadvārghyādau sakṛtsakṛt |
anukalpe tu hṛnmantraṃ kuryād āvartanaṃ budhaḥ || 3.88
āvāhane sannidhāne <saṃnidhāne> sannirodhe <saṃnirodhe> tathārcane |
visarjane 'rghyadānaṃ tu prākpātrān nityam ārabhet || 3.89
tadambhasā cārhaṇaṃ tu tathaiva pariṣecanam |
kuryāt praṇayanādānaṃ prīṇanaṃ prītikarmaṇi || 3.90
prokṣaṇaṃ sarvavastūnām anyasmād udakena tu |
ārambhe sarvakāryāṇāṃ tatsamāptau sadaiva hi || 3.91
nyūnādhikānāṃ śāntyai tu jñānavyatyayaśāntaye |
kāryaṃ tadarghyadānaṃ ca nityaṃ mantrātmano vibhoḥ || 3.92
kumbhopakumbhakuṇḍānāṃ mantrāstrakalaśārcane |
sampūjane <saṃpūjane> ca bhūtānāṃ gurvādīnāṃ mahāmate || 3.93
dakṣaśiṣyātmapūjārthaṃ dvārsthānām arcanaṃ prati |
prāsādāsanadevānāṃ gurūṇāṃ santates tathā || 3.94
lāñchanāṅgaparīvāraśaktibhūṣaṇarūpiṇām < 
lāñchanāṅgaparīvāraśaktibhūṣaṇarūpiṇām> |
maṇḍalāvaraṇasthānāṃ devānāṃ cārcane tathā || 3.95
mudrābandhe karāsukṣiṃ tadarcākṣālanaṃ tathā |
pādyadānaṃ tṛtīyāt tu nityaṃ pātrāt samācaret || 3.96
caturthāt tu yathākālaṃ dadyād ācamanaṃ tataḥ |
hastaprakṣālanaṃ caiva gaṇḍūṣaṃ mukhadhāvanam || 3.97
snānīyāc cācaret snānaṃ prayojakavidhis tv ayam |
arghyapātrād dvitīyāt tu kiñcid uddhṛtya vai jalam || 3.98
tena svavigrahanyastān mantrān iṣṭvā yathākramam |
gandhapuṣpapradhūpaiś ca pṛthag eva prakalpitaiḥ || 3.99
athārghyādīn samādāya dvārsthān devān samarcayet |
nirgatya dvārabāhye tu sthito vāsīna eva vā || 3.100
vāstukṣetreśagaruḍadvārśrīcaṇḍapracaṇḍakān |
abhyarcyārghyādibhir devān prāsādasthāṃś ca pūjayet || 3.101
anekabhedabhinneṣu prāsādeṣu mahāmate |
vistareṇa samasteṣu vṛttāyatapurassaram || 3.102
vakṣye lo(kādhva)kordhvatattvānāṃ devatānāṃ ca saṃsthitim |
sannirudhya <saṃnirudhya> ca bhūrlokaṃ pādakṣititale 'khilam || 3.103
evaṃ prāsādapīṭheṣu bhuvarlokaṃ yathāsthitam |
smarej jaṅghāvadhir yāvat svarlokaṃ tattadūrdhvagam || 3.104
ārabhya prastaroddeśān mahacchikharabhūmigam |
janalokaṃ ca tadvedyāṃ tapassaṃjñaṃ tadāpagam || 3.105
satyasaṃjñaṃ ca yallokaṃ tacchikhāyāṃ tu saṃsmaret |
bhāvayec ca purā vyāptim evaṃ vai sāptalaukikīm || 3.106
tataś cordhvamayīṃ vyāptiṃ bhāvayet tu yathākramam |
kumbhādhāropalāntassthamadhvaṣaṭkaṃ smaran nyaset || 3.107
bījabhūtaṃ tadantassthamadhvavyāptim anusmaret |
bījataś cāṅkurībhūtā parastād vyaktim eti sā || 3.108
prāsādapīṭhaparyantaṃ kumbhādhāropalāt tu vai |
bhuvanād vā yathāvastho bhāvanīyas tu sarvataḥ || 3.109
garbhocchrāyāvadhir yāvatpadādhvānaṃ vilokayet |
mantrādhvā śukanāsāntaṃ tatvādhvā vedikāvadhi || 3.110
kalādhvā tu galāntaṃ ca varṇādhvā tu tadūrdhvataḥ |
evaṃ kṛtvādhvakīṃ vyāptiṃ tatas tattvāni vinyaset || 3.111
saṃyojya pārthivaṃ tatvaṃ ṣādakṣititale dvijāḥ |
toyatatvaṃ nyaset pīṭhe jaṅghāyāṃ taijasaṃ smaret || 3.112
grīvoddeśāvadhir yāvadvāyutatvaṃ tadūrdhvataḥ |
ākāśaṃ śikharasthaṃ syāt taduddeśāt krameṇa tu || 3.113
nyasec chabdādi tanmātrāṃ yāvatpadatalāntimam |
pārśvato nāsike śrotre tvaksudhā samudāhṛtā || 3.114
gavākṣe cakṣuṣī syātāṃ jihvā bhadrākhyavedikā |
ghrāṇan tu śukanāsā syād āsyaṃ dvāram udāhṛtam || 3.115
vijñeyāḥ pāṇayaḥstambhāḥ pādāḥ pādaśilāghaṭāḥ |
vāyubhyāṃ jalaniryāṇam upasthaṃ tu tadantaram || 3.116
mano 'ntarvyoma vijñeyaṃ garvo brahmaśilāgataḥ |
buddhis tu piṇḍikā jñeyā prakṛtis syāt tadantare || 3.117
pañcaviṃśatamo <paṃcaviṃśatamo> jñeyaḥ pratimāpuruṣaḥ paraḥ |
evaṃ nyasteṣu tatveṣu nyastavyā devatāḥ kramāt || 3.118
ghaṭādhāropalasyādhastvananto nāma nāgarāṭ |
sahasrasaṅkhyāt aphaṇāmaṇḍalena sumaṇḍitaḥ || 3.119
tadūrdhve saṃsthitaṃ cakraṃ sahasrāropaśobhitam |
yā śilā kalaśādhārasaṃjñāṃ tāṃ viddhi sarvagām || 3.120
sā madhyaśaktis sāmānyā niṣkalā pārameśvarī |
tardūrdhvasaṃsthitāḥ kumbhāḥ navasaṅkhyās tu ye dvijāḥ || 3.121
teṣāṃ madhyamakumbhe tu sāṅgaṃ <sāṃgaṃ> saparivārakam |
mantranāthaṃ samabhyarcya mūlamantreṇa deśikaḥ || 3.122
tataḥ prāgādidikstheṣu vāsudevādikān yajet |
vidikstheṣv aniruddhādīn yajed apyayayogataḥ || 3.123
teṣāṃ vidhānanavake tvāmadhyādīśagocaram |
smartavyās sarvato vyāptāḥ krameṇa dvijapuṅgavāḥ || 3.124
jñānabhāgā nivasati tathānandabalā prabhā |
sarvagā brahmavadanā dyotakī satyavikramā || 3.125
sampūrṇā <saṃpūrṇā> ceti kathitāś śaktayo viśvadhārikāḥ |
śilāṣṭake digvidikṣu tadbahis sthāpite nyaset || 3.126
dharmādyaṃ cāgnikoṇāt tu yāvadīśapadaṃ punaḥ |
prāgādāv uttarāntaṃ ca adharmādyaṃ catuṣṭayam || 3.127
śilānām antare bhūmau ṣaṭkaṃ ṣaṭkaṃ krameṇa tu |
nyastavyaṃ pūrvavarṇāc ca varṇānāṃ sāvasānakam || 3.128
tataḥ prāṅgaṇabhittyarthaṃ vinyaste ca śilāṣṭake |
digvidikṣu nyaset prāgvatprāguktāṃś ca digīśvarān || 3.129
cakraṃ tadantabhūmīnāṃ bhramadvahnisphuliṅgavat |
kṣārṇena cintayed vyāptiṃ bhūbhāgaṃ cāṅgaṇīyakam || 3.130
bahiḥ prāṅgaṇabhittīnāṃ sāsraṃ saparivārakam |
prāgādāvīśakoṇāntam indrādyaṃ cāṣṭakaṃ nyaset || 3.131
tathāvidheṣūpaleṣu antarbhūmigateṣu ca |
sarvādhāram ayaṃ cakraṃ śākhāmūlaṃ samāśritam || 3.132
jñānakriyātmake tattve śākhayor yugale sthite |
pārameśvara ādyas tu dvārasyordhva udumbare || 3.133
saṃsthitas sarvato vyāptas tatpṛṣṭhe madhyadeśataḥ |
catuṣpāt sakalo dharmaḥ sthitas satvavatāṃ varaḥ || 3.134
yadā kavāṭau dvārasya kalpitau dvijasattamāḥ |
kālavaiśvānaro devo hy apāṃ patirubhāv imau || 3.135
dakṣiṇottarayogena kavāṭopari saṃsthitau |
taddvārapārśvayor vā śrīmaṇṭapadvārapārśvayoḥ || 3.136
nidhīśau śaṅkhapadmākhyau pūjanīyau krameṇa tu |
tato jaṅghāsamūhe tu tathaivāntarabhūmiṣu || 3.137
bhavopakaraṇīyānāṃ devānām arcanaṃ kramāt |
kālo 'pi yanniyantā ca śāstraṃ nānāṅgalakṣaṇam || 3.138
vidyādhipatayaś caiva sarudras sagaṇaś śivaḥ |
prajāpatisamūhas tu indras saparivārakaḥ || 3.139
munayas sapta pūrve 'nye grahās tārādikair vṛtāḥ |
jīmūtaś cākhilā nāgāḥ apsaropagaṇa uttamaḥ || 3.140
oṣadhyaś caiva paśavo yajñās sāṅgākhilās tu ye |
vidhyācaivāparā vidyā pāvakaś caiva mārutaḥ || 3.141
candrārkau vārivasudhe ity ete devatāgaṇāḥ |
caturviṃśatisaṃkhyātāḥ <caturviṃśatisaṅkhyātāḥ> bhavopakaraṇāmarāḥ || 
3.142
mūrtayaḥ keśavādyās tu jaṅghāgropari saṃsthitāḥ |
tatas tu prastaroddeśe ete sthāpyāḥ krameṇa tu || 3.143
cakraśaṅkhau gadāpadme laṅgalaṃ <laṃgalaṃ> musalaṃ śarāḥ |
śārṅgaṃ <śārṃgaṃ> ca khaṅgakheṭau <khaḍgakheṭau> tu daṇḍaḥ paraśurītihā 
|| 3.144
pāśāṅkuśau <pāśāṃkuśau> mudgaraṃ ca vajraṃ śaktisamanvitam |
prāsāde caturaśre tu caturaśrāyate 'pi ca || 3.145
garuḍaṃ prastarasyordhve nyaset koṇacatuṣṭaye |
tadūrdhvaṃ vedikāyāṃ tu bhāvanīyā munīśvarāḥ || 3.146
ete pūrvādike yoge naikaśṛṅgatanus <naikaśṛṃgatanus> tataḥ |
devo vāmanadehas tu sarvavyāpī trivikramaḥ || 3.147
naro nārāyaṇaś caiva hariḥ kṛṣṇas tathaiva ca |
jvalatparaśudhṛgrāmo rāmaś cānyo dhanurdharaḥ || 3.148
vedavidbhagavān kalkī pātālaśayanaḥ prabhuḥ |
tatoḥ grīvātale dhyeyaḥ kūrmaḥ pātāladhārakaḥ || 3.149
varāho nārasiṃhaś cāpy amṛtāharaṇas tu vai |
śrīpatir divyadeho 'tha kāntātmāmṛtadhārakaḥ || 3.150
rāhujitkālanemighnaḥ pārijātaharo mahān |
lokanāthas tu śāntātmā dattātreyo mahāprabhuḥ || 3.151
nyagrodhaśāyī bhagavān ity ete dvijasattamāḥ |
tatas tu śikharoddeśaṃ tridhākṛtya yathāsamam || 1.152
yāvat tu kalaśādhāravedikāt dvijasattamāḥ |
adhobhāge kramāt dhyeyāḥ śiṣṭā devās tu vaibhavāḥ || 3.153
ananto bhagavān devaś śaktyātmā madhusūdanaḥ |
vidyādhidevaḥ kapilo viśvarūpo vihaṅgamaḥ || 3.154
kroḍātmā baḍako vakro dharmo vāgīśvaras tathā |
deva ekārṇavaśaya ity ete dvādaśa smṛtāḥ || 3.155
dhruvas tu sarvatovyāpī tadūrdhvapadasaṃsthitaḥ |
padmanābhastadūrdhve tu vyāpakaḥ paritiṣṭhati || 3.156
śukanāsāmukhe pūjyo vāsudevas sanātanaḥ |
yatra prāsādadeśe tu śukanāsā na kalpitā || 3.157
tatrāgrato nāsikāyāḥ vāsudevaṃ tu saṃsmaret |
śiṣṭanāsātraye pūjyāḥ kramāt saṅkarṣaṇādayaḥ || 3.158
atha vā puruṣas satyo hy acyuto 'nanta eva ca |
caturdikṣu krameṇaiva pūjyā yad vā krameṇa tu || 3.159
varāho nārasiṃhaś ca śrīdharaś ca hayānanaḥ |
yad vā narādyāś catvāro dharmamūrtyādayo 'pi vā || 3.160
yad vā paraśurāmādyāḥ smartavyāḥ kramayogataḥ |
ete tu śaktibhis sarve yuktā vā kevalās tu vā || 3.161
drumaiḥ patralatāyuktair bhūṣitair vedikātale |
vinyaset ṣaḍaraṃ cakraṃ tatas sāmalasārake || 3.162
bhagavān jagadādhāro vāsudevaḥ paraḥ pumān |
lokānadhvagaṇaṃ nityaṃ tatvādyam api devatāḥ || 3.163
prāsādopari vinyastās samākramya ca saṃsthitaḥ |
tadagradeśe hetīśaṃ yajed devaṃ sudarśanam || 3.164
prāsādāṅgeṣu viprendrāḥ kramān nigaditeṣu ca |
devatādhārabhūteṣu yadyadaṅgaṃ na kalpitam || 3.165
yatra vā tattadadhikaṃ tatrāpi ca samācaret |
tattatsthāne tu budhyā tu devatānyāsamūhataḥ || 3.166
yad vā hy anavakḷptāṅge devateṣṭiṃ tu varjayet |
lokās sapta tathādhvānas satvasaṅghaś ca devatāḥ || 3.167
dhyātavyās tu nirākārās sādhakair dvijasattamāḥ |
vimāne 'pi tathā saiddhe vibudhaiś ca pratiṣṭhite || 3.168
kiṃ tu tatra vimānāṅgamūrtīnāṃ lāñchanādikam <lāṃchanādikam> |
tāsāṃ sthānāni viprendrāḥ kalpitāni yathāvidhi || 3.169
vimānāvayavāṃś cāpi sannirīkṣyaiva <saṃnirīkṣyaiva> yatnataḥ |
pūjayet sāvadhānena cetasā dhyānapūrvakam || 3.170
lāñchanādyeṣu <lāṃchanādyeṣu> mūrtīnāṃ prāsādāvayaveṣv api |
anabhivyaktirūpeṇa lakṣaṇādyaparīkṣaṇāt || 3.171
svapnādeś cāpi viprendra deśikendropadeśataḥ |
yathāvat samparīkṣeta <saṃparīkṣeta> prayatnena dvijottamāḥ || 3.172
lakṣaṇādiṣu hīneṣu viparyasteṣv api dvijāḥ |
na lakṣaṇādikaṃ kuryād anyathā munipuṅgavāḥ || 3.173
lakṣaṇaṃ na parīkṣeta hy anyathākaraṇecchayā |
anyathākaraṇārthaṃ tu lakṣaṇādye parīkṣite || 3.174
kṣayatyāyuḥ kṛte tasmin lakṣaṇair narakaṃ vrajet |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena svayaṃvyaktādike 'pi ca || 3.175
vimāne saṃsthitānāṃ tu mūrtīnāṃ lakṣaṇādikam |
sthānāny api ca tāsāṃ vai vimānāvayavān api || 3.176
yathāsthitaṃ parīkṣyaiva kṛtvā mūrtivinirṇayam |
svena svena viśeṣeṇa lāñchanādyena <lāṃchanādyena> vai sphuṭam || 3.177
svena svena tu mantreṇa pūjanaṃ ca samācaret |
prāsādeṣu svayaṃvyaktaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ sarveṣu ca dvijāḥ || 3.178
tadrūpī bhagavān devaḥ svayam evāvatiṣṭhate |
tatra sannihitas <saṃnihitas> sākṣādbhagavān bhaktavatsalaḥ || 3.179
jāte jīrṇādidoṣe tu na tyajanti kadācana |
svaṃ svaṃ pradeśam etās tu mantrāṇāṃ śaktayaḥ parāḥ || 3.180
prāsādāntas sthitāś cāpi svayaṃvyaktapurassarāḥ |
ākārās tu vibhos samyak jñeyāḥ pūrvoktayogataḥ || 3.181
astrair mantrair dhvajair yeṣāṃ vyaktir vyaktā jagattraye |
te 'pi lāñchanabṛndaṃ <lāṃchanabṛndaṃ> tu dhārayanty
aṅghrigocare <aṃghrigocare> || 3.182
lalāṭe cāṃsapaṭṭe tu pṛṣṭhe pāṇitaladvaye |
tanūruhacaye mūrdhni karmiṇāṃ pratipattaye || 3.183
tattallāñchanabṛndaṃ <tattallāṃchanabṛndaṃ> tu parīkṣyaivaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
tattadākāraniyatair vācakais samprapūjayet <saṃprapūjayet> || 3.184
yeṣāṃ lāñchanabṛndaṃ <lāṃchanabṛndaṃ> tu na vyaktaṃ caraṇādiṣu |
tānarcayed viṣaṭkārṇapurogeṇa muniśvarāḥ <<purogāṇāṃ munīśvara>> || 3.185
vyāpakānāṃ tu mantrāṇām ekenābhimatena tu |
iti jñātvā yathāvac ca yaḥ pūjayati mantravit || 3.186
sa pūjāphalam āpnoti hy anyathā viparītabhāk |
etāni uktāni sarvāṇi lokādīni krameṇa tu || 3.187
samārādhanakāleṣu devasyāmitatejasaḥ |
dvārsthadevārcanaṃ kṛtvā pūjayet tadanantaram || 3.188
namaskārapadāntena svanāmnā praṇavādinā |
arghyālabhanamālyaiś ca dhūpena dvijasattamāḥ || 3.189
agrato devadevasya dvāradeśasya bāhyataḥ |
antarmaṇḍaladeśe tu gatvā vā pūjayet kramāt || 3.190
evaṃ prāsādabhede tu yasmin sādhakasattamaiḥ |
ekakālaṃ dvikālaṃ vā trikālaṃ vārcanaṃ dvijāḥ || 3.191
nityaśaḥ kriyate tatra sadā sannihito <saṃnihito> vibhuḥ |
ata eva dvijaśreṣṭhās <<dvijaśreṣṭha>> tadarcanapurassaram || 3.192
kuryād ārādhanaṃ viṣṇos sādhakas siddhilālasaḥ |
ya evaṃ kurute bhaktyā hy ananyaparayā sadā || 3.193
so 'cirāl labhate kāmān iha loke paratra ca |
mokṣārthī kurute yas tu sa yāti paramaṃ padam | 3.194

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
vimānadevatārcanavidhir nāma tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ


atha caturtho 'dhyāyaḥ

nāradaḥ
prāsāde saṃsthitān devān evam abhyarcya vai dvijāḥ |
dvārāvaraṇadevānāṃ pūjanaṃ ca yathākramam || 4.1
viṣvaksenāvasānaṃ ca kārayen munipuṅgavāḥ |
yadaṅgabhāvam abhyeti dvārsthādyaṃ devatāgaṇam || 4.2
viṣvaksenāvasānaṃ ca narāṇām alpamedhasām |
janter ekāntinas tad vai cittakhedakṛdarcanam || 4.3
vighnakṛt prakṛtasyāpi śiṣyāṇāṃ tadanarcanam |
atas tadanukampārthaṃ devabhṛtyadhiyārcanam || 4.4
bhaktiśraddhojjhitaṃ caivaṃ vihitaṃ tv evam eva hi |
te tatpāṇicyutaṃ prahvā dattam apy avahelayā || 4.5
gṛhṇanti manasā śreyaḥ paraṃ dhyātvā dhiyā hṛdi |
yatas sarve 'cyutamayās taccittārpitamānasāḥ || 4.6
etāvadarcanāt teṣāṃ guror ekāntinas tu vai |
syād virodhanirāsas tu yato bhṛtyās tu te hareḥ || 4.7
kṛtvaivaṃ dvārayāgaṃ tu tataḥ puṣpañ ca sammukham <saṃmukham> |
gṛhītvāṅguṣṭhapūrveṇa svāṅgulitritayena tu || 4.8
abhimantrya tadastreṇa cakraṃ tadupari smaret |
niśitāraṃ jvaladrūpaṃ varṣantam analāśanim || 4.9
kṣayakṛdvighnajālānāṃ kṣiped yāgagṛhāntare |
dakṣiṇāṃ tarjanīṃ vipraḥ kuryād ūrdhvamukhīṃ tataḥ || 4.10
śikhāmantreṇa saṃyuktāṃ vidyudvilasitaprabhām |
smṛtvā bhrāmayamāṇāṃ <<bhrāmayamāṇas>> tāṃ saṃviśed yāgamandiram || 
4.11
svāsanaṃ ca tataḥ prokṣya arghyapādyodakena ca |
upaviśyāsane yāgam ārabheta samāhitaḥ || 4.12
samayevātra kurvīta sarvabhoganirīkṣaṇam |
nyasya bhadrāsanaṃ mūlāt prokṣaṇārghyaplutena tu || 4.13
pāṇināpy atha kūrcena tajjalena tu mārjayet |
tattāvadastrapuṣpeṇa kuryād vighnagaṇojjhitam || 4.14
sarvalokam ayaṃ tatra sarvadevasamāśrayam |
sarvādhāram ayaṃ dhyāyed antarlīnaṃ tu cakrarāṭ || 4.15
praṇavena svanāmnātha namo 'ntenārcayec ca tam |
arghyālabhanadhūpais tu mālyair nānāsragudbhavaiḥ || 4.16
yogapīṭhārcanaṃ kuryād anusandhānapūrvakam |
svanāmnā praṇavādyena namo 'ntena yathākramam || 4.17
tatas tu sarvamantrāṇāṃ vinyāsaṃ tatra cetasā |
samācared yathāyogaṃ puṣpadānapurassaram || 4.18
bimbena sahitaṃ pīṭhaṃ yogapīṭham udāhṛtam |
anusandhānayoge tu yogapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet || 4.19
tanmantrāsanam ity uktaṃ mantranyāsaṃ tu sarvataḥ |
kuryāt tatsthasya devasya pīṭhasyādho munīśvarāḥ || 4.20
ādhāraśaktiṃ tasyordhve kūrmaṃ kālāgnisaṃjñakam |
ananteśaṃ smaren madhye sarvādhāram ayaṃ prabhum || 4.21
āgneyādau tu dharmādyam aiśānyantaṃ catuṣṭayam |
prāgādau tv apy adharmādyam uttarāntaṃ nyaset param || 4.22
tadūrdhve kamalaṃ dhyāyet svanāmnātha tathopari |
smaratpatrāśritaṃ sūryaṃ śaśāṅkaṃ kesarāvanau || 4.23
karṇikāsthaṃ hutabhujaṃ tato gandhādinā yajet |
susthire sannirodhaś <saṃnirodhaś> ca mantrāṇāṃ vihitas sadā || 4.24
yatra yatrānurūpaṃ tu tatra tannyāsam ācaret |
calabimbasya pīṭhe 'pi hy evam evārcayet kramāt || 4.25
kiṃ tu tātkālikaṃ tatra mantrāṇāṃ sannirodhanam <saṃnirodhanam> |
āhūtopaviśed yatra mantranātho hi sammukhaḥ <saṃmukhaḥ> || 4.26
tatprāgapekṣayā kuryād dharmādīnāṃ niveśanam |
sāmmukhyaṃ <sāṃmukhyaṃ> bhajate yasmāt sādhakaṃ parameśvaraḥ || 4.27
tadāsanaṃ hi cidrūpaṃ siddham etasya vāhanāt |
evaṃ cāsyācale pīṭhe śayānasya vibhos tv adhaḥ || 4.28
vahnyantaṃ kramaśobhyarcya tato 'nantaṃ samarcayet |
yānārūḍhe tv anantasya sthāne tārkṣyaṃ samarcayet || 4.29
lakṣmyādīnāṃ tu devīnāṃ pīṭhasyādhaḥ phaṇīśvaram |
tatkoṇeṣu ca dharmādīṃs tadūrdhve vyaktapaṅkajam || 4.30
yāmatrayaṃ tatas tasmin vinyaset pūrvavartmanā |
gaṇeśādyarcanaṃ kuryād atha pīṭhasamīpataḥ || 4.31
ātmanaḥ prāgvaśād vāyukoṇād ārabhya pūjayet |
vinyasya viṣṭarān darbhān kusumastabakān iva || 4.32
viṣvaksenaṃ gaṇādhīśaṃ gurūṃś ca tadanantaram |
gurūn paramasaṃjñāś ca yajet sarvagurūṃs tathā || 4.33
ādisiddhisamūhaṃ tu bhagavaddhyānatatparam |
nityādhikāriṇaś cāptān bhagavattattvavedinaḥ || 4.34
catvāro manavaś cānye ṛṣayas sapta pūrvakāḥ |
arghyādinā yajed etān tattannāmnā yathākramam || 4.35
sarveṣāṃ kramaśo dhyānaṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
anantaśaśisaṅkāśam <anantaśaśisaṃkāśam> anantam atha saṃsmaret || 4.36
sahasraphaṇamālāḍhyaṃ sahasrabhujabhūṣitam |
svapāṇisampuṭenaiva <svapāṇisaṃpuṭenaiva> śobhayan svāṅgabhūtalam || 4.37
sitāravindaśaṅkhākṣasūtracakrakarānvitam |
patanāśaṅkibuddher vai vitrastamanasas tu  ca || 4.38
mā bhair ity abhayaṃ yacchan ābrahmabhavanasya ca |
tuhinācchopalasvacchamuktāphalaśaśiprabhaḥ || 4.39
mṛgendraskandavadanāḥ dharmajānādayaś catuḥ |
padmarāgapravālāgnisudāḍimaphalojjvalāḥ || 4.40
antardayopayuktāś ca rājarājeśvaropamāḥ |
dviraṣṭavarṣavadviddhi catvāro dharmapūrvakāḥ || 4.41
sarve sadvastrasatpuṣpasadalaṅkaraṇānvitāḥ |
śaṅkhapadmadharās sarve varābhayakarās tu vai || 4.42
ādheyapadmavinyastas sādhakās svātmasiddhaye |
samarpitāntaḥkaraṇāḥ parasmin mantrakāraṇe || 4.43
cintyam avyaktapadmaṃ ca himahemāgnibhāsvaram |
śāntam aṣṭabhujaṃ saumyaṃ saṃsthitaṃ svastikena tu || 4.44
yāmatrayaṃ tadūrthve tu saṃsmaret kiraṇojjvalam |
saṃsmared guṇanāthaṃ tu vakṣyamāṇaprakārataḥ || 4.45
gaṇanāthaṃ vinā cānye susthitāś śāntavigrahāḥ |
gaṇitrābhayahastāś ca sarvānugrahakārakāḥ || 4.46
sarve padmāsanā vātha jaṭāmaṇḍalabhūṣitāḥ |
evaṃ dhyātvā samabhyarcya mudrās saṃspṛśya tatkramāt || 4.47
anujñāṃ prārthayet tebhyo yathānukramam eva ca |
gṛhītvā śirasā tāṃ ca tata āvāhayet prabhum || 4.48
tatas sarvagataṃ devaṃ mantramūrtitvam āgatam |
samāhūya sumantreṇa tvāgacchāntapadena <<ghumantreṇa kvāgacchā�>> tu || 4.49
yathā sarvagato vāyur vyajanena mahāmate |
vṛttim abhyeti bhagavān āhūtas tadvad eva hi || 4.50
bhāvadarpaṇasaṅkrāntaṃ kṛtvā hṛtkamalāt tu vai |
sannirudhya <saṃnirudhya> bahirvedyāṃ mantroccārāvasānataḥ || 4.51
mantram āgacchamānaṃ tu nirgataṃ tu svakāt padāt |
kālaṃ pādyārghyadānāntam utthitaṃ bhāvayet sadā || 4.52
athopacaryamāṇaṃ taṃ bhogaiḥ kālānukūlataḥ |
nānālabhanavastrasragdānālaṅkaraṇe tathā || 4.53
anyatra bhāgapūjāyāṃ smaret padmāsanādinā |
punas tam evopaviṣṭaṃ sānukampaṃ ca sammukham <saṃmukham> || 4.54
bimbaṃ vinānyatrādhāre bhavaty eva mahāmate |
bimbākṛtyātmanā bimbe samāgatyāvatiṣṭhate || 4.55
karoty amūrtām akhilāṃ bhogaśaktiṃ tu cātmasāt |
sthitam āyatane vātha sākāraṃ parameśvaram || 4.56
śaṅkhacakradharaṃ viṣṇuṃ surasiddhāvatāritam |
ṛṣibhir manujair vātha bhaktiyuktaiḥ pratiṣṭhitam || 4.57
tanmūrtau ca svamantreṇa yajed āvāhanaṃ vinā |
tathā prabodhayet taṃ tu kṛtvā hastau sugandhinau || 4.58
gandhārghyapuṣpais sampūrya <saṃpūrya> mūlamantraṃ samuccaran |
pīṭhopari harer agre mūrdhni puṣpāñjaliṃ <puṣpāṃjaliṃ> kṣipet || 4.59
svapratyabhimukhaṃ śāntaṃ suprabuddhaṃ smarec ca tam |
karanyāsaṃ vinā tatra sṛṣṭinyāsāditas trayam || 4.60
mūlamantrāditārkṣyāntamantrāṇāṃ nyāsam eva ca |
kṛtvātha tattanmudrāś ca tattanmantraiḥ pradarśayet || 4.61
dīpayed bimbato 'nyatra tasmin puṣpāñjaliṃ <puṣpāṃjaliṃ> harau |
āgaccha padamantreṇa mūlamantreṇa hṛtkajāt || 4.62
pratyahaṃ karmabimbānāṃ mūlabimbahṛdabjagāt |
kiñcidāvāhanaṃ kāryaṃ tatra tv evaṃ kramo dvijāḥ || 4.63
mūlabere tu yat tejaṣṣaḍbhāgaikaṃ tu cotsave |
ṣaṭtriṃśadekabhāgas tu balikarmārcanādiṣu || 4.64
evaṃ tejomayaṃ devaṃ nāḍīdakṣiṇamārgataḥ |
tannāsāgreṇa cāvāhya pīṭhakumbhādiṣu kṣipet || 4.65
tatkadambaprasūnābhe tasmin mantrātmagolake |
sthānabhedaṃ vināṅgāni nyasyābhyarcyeha dehataḥ || 4.66
sakalīkṛtya deveśaṃ dhyāyottadvyaktatāṃ gatam |
mūlamantrāditārkṣyāntamantrāṃs tatra ca vinyaset || 4.67
evam āhūya deveśaṃ datvārghyaṃ sannidhitsayā <saṃnidhitsayā> |
bhūyo 'py arghyaṃ pradāyāsmai hṛdā mudrāpurassaram || 4.68
sannidhāpyārghyadānena <saṃnidhāpyārghyadānena> mudrāpūrvañ ca varmaṇā 
|
sannirodhya <saṃnirodhya> tu mūlena tanmudrāsahitena tam || 4.69
sammukhīkṛtya <saṃmukhīkṛtya> mūlādimantrāṃs tatra samuccaran |
pradarśayaṃs tathā mudrās tv aṣṭāṅgenābhivādayet || 4.70
layayāgoktavidhinā pūjayet prathamaṃ tataḥ |
āmūlāt sarvamantrāṇāṃ vyaktisthānāṃ samarcanam || 4.71
arghyapuṣpādinā kuryāt svena svena svake pade |
tato bhagavato viṣṇor bhāsā bhāsvaravigrahān || 4.72
hṛdādīn nissṛtān dhyāyet sphuliṅganicayo yathā |
bhogasthāne yathāyogam ekaikaṃ vinyaset tataḥ || 4.73
sakalīkṛtya cārghyādyair arcayet tatra tu kramaḥ |
aṣṭapatrāmbuje pīṭhe hṛdayādyaṃ catuṣṭayam || 4.74
nyaset kamalapatrāṇām apūrvād uttarāntimam |
agnīśarakṣovāyavyadaleṣv astraṃ yathākramam || 4.75
netraṃ kesarajālasthaṃ vinyaset tatanantaram |
pīṭhopari dalādbāhye devasyeśānakoṇake || 4.76
kirīṭaṃ śrīvatsakaṃ ca vinyasyāgneyakoṇake |
kaustubhaṃ vanamālāṃ ca nyaset padmaṃ ca tatra vai || 4.77
īśakoṇe gadāṃ nyasya naiṛte cakram ujjvalam |
vāyavye pāñcajanyaṃ <pāṃcajanyaṃ> ca vinyasec ca yathākramam || 4.78
devasya karṇikāyāṃ tu śriyaṃ puṣṭiṃ tato 'pare |
agrataḥ pīṭhato bāhye nyasec cārāt patattripam || 4.79
evaṃ natvā tato dhyāyen mantravyūhaṃ yathāsthitam |
abhyantare vimānasya garbhabhūmau tu madhyataḥ || 4.80
sarasīruham āsthāya saṃsthitaṃ puruṣottamam |
prāvṛḍjaladasandohavilasaddivyavigraham || 4.81
sarvadevam ayaṃ devaṃ sarveṣāṃ tejasāṃ nidhim |
sarvalakṣaṇasampūrṇaṃ <sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇaṃ> sarvajñādiguṇair yutam || 4.82
vapuṣā sundareṇaiva divyenāviṣkṛtena ca |
muñcantam <muṃcantam> aniśaṃ dehād ālokaṃ jñānalakṣaṇam || 4.83
prayatnena vinājñānanāśakṛddhyāyināṃ mahat |
ghanakuñcitanīlālidalitāñjanasannibhaiḥ 
<ghanakuṃcitanīlālidalitāṃjanasaṃnibhaiḥ> || 4.84
karpūradhūsarair divyaiḥ puṣpasaṃvalitāntaraiḥ |
kirīṭamakuṭākrāntaiś śobhitaṃ svaśiror uhaiḥ || 4.85
bālacandrapratīkāśaphālodyattilakojjvalam |
subhruvaṃ sunasaṃ śāntaṃ savilāsasmitādharam || 4.86
kiñcidāraktagokṣīraśuddhanīlābjalocanam |
śītalair dṛṣṭipātais tu jagadāpy āyakāriṇam || 4.87
vilasadgaṇḍaphalakaṃ śravaṇojjvalakuṇḍalam |
mukhasaundaryaniṣyandacubukasthalaśobhitam || 4.88
vikalaṅkaśaraccandravilasanmukhamaṇḍalam |
kambugrīvaṃ pīvarāṃsaṃ dīrghabāhuṃ mahorasam || 4.89
caturbhujam udārāṅgaṃ vilasatpāṇipaṅkajam |
pītakauśeyavasanaṃ nimnanābhiṃ tanūdaram || 4.90
cārūruyugalaṃ cārujaṅghādvitayam ujjvalaiḥ |
maṇinūpurabhūṣādyair vilasatpādapaṅkajam || 4.91
divyagandhānuliptāṅgaṃ divyāmbaradharaṃ tathā |
divyasragveṣṭanopetaṃ divyālaṅkāramaṇḍitam || 4.92
anekaratnakhacitakirīṭamakuṭojjvalam |
kaustubhenorasisthena śrīvatsenāpy alaṅkṛtam || 4.93
ratnakāñcanasanmuktāyuktayā <ratnakāṃcanasanmuktāyuktayā> vanamālayā |
sabrahmasūtrayā caiva śobhitaṃ parameśvaram || 4.94
mukhyadakṣiṇahastena bhītānām abhayapradam |
śroṇītaṭaniviṣṭena vāmahastena līlayā || 4.95
dhriyamāṇaṃ gadāṃ gurvī niṣaṇṇāṃ dharaṇītale |
paścāddakṣiṇahastena cakraṃ kālānaladyuti || 4.96
praṇavadhvanigarbhaṃ tu himādriśataśobhitam |
śaṅkhaṃ vāmakareṇāpi dadhānamatulaprabham || 4.97
svadehatejassambhūtajvālāmaṇḍalamadhyagam
<svadehatejassaṃbhūtajvālāmaṇḍalamadhyagam > |
karuṇāpūrṇahṛdayaṃ jagaduddharaṇodyatam || 4.98
abhinnapūrṇaṣāḍguṇyavibhavenopabṛṃhitam |
yogidhyeyam ajaṃ nityaṃ jagajjanmādikāraṇam || 4.99
sākṣāl lakṣmīpatiṃ devaṃ dhyāyen nārāyaṇaṃ prabhum |
evaṃ śayānam āsīnaṃ yānārūḍham athāpi vā || 4.100
paraṃ vyūhaṃ vaibhavaṃ vā dvibhujaṃ vā caturbhujam |
aṣṭabāhvādikaṃ vāpi nānābhūṣaṇasaṃyutam || 4.101
nānāstragaṇasaṃyuktaṃ rūpaṃ bhagavatas tathā |
lakṣmyādiśaktijālaṃ ca dhyāyed bhaktisamanvitaḥ || 4.102
evam eva hi hṛnmantraṃ dhyāyet kumudapāṇḍaram |
padmarāgācalākāramāraktaṃ ca śiraḥ smaret || 4.103
añjanādripratīkāśaṃ <aṃjanādripratīkāśaṃ> śikhāmantraṃ tathākṛtim |
paritas sūryasantaptaṃ yathā kanakaparvatam || 4.104
tathā kavacamantraṃ ca dhyānakāle vicintya ca |
vṛtaṃ jvālāsahasrais tu ayaskāntasamadyuti || 4.105
sarvāstraśaktisampūrṇam <sarvāstraśaktisaṃpūrṇam> astramantraṃ prakīrtitam |
nirdhūmāṅgārasadṛśaṃ bhāvayen netramantrarāṭ || 4.106
dhyeyās svarucisaṃyuktā dvibhujāḥ puruṣottamāḥ |
vīkṣamāṇān vibhor vaktraṃ dhyāyed etān munīśvarāḥ || 4.107
sthitānām ādimūrtīnāṃ sthitān dhyāyet sadaiva hi |
āsīnānām athāsīnān vāhanasthe savāhanān || 4.108
śayitānām athāsīnān utthitān vā smared dhiyā |
atha dhyānaṃ bhūṣaṇāstraśaktīnām ucyate kramāt || 4.109
kirīṭas saumyavadanaḥ kāñcanābho <kāṃcanābho> mahātanuḥ |
bhābhir ākṛtiyuktābhir nānārūpābhir āvṛtaḥ || 4.110
sthito vaidyādharīyena sthānagenāntarikṣagaḥ |
sphaṭikādripratīkāśaṃ śrīvatsam atha bhāvayet || 4.111
baddhapadmāsanāsīnaṃ hastanyastaṃ svapārśvayoḥ |
vahantaṃ kūrmamudrāṃ ca mukhyahastadvayena ca || 4.112
padmarāgācalākāraṃ kaustubhaṃ ratnanāyakam |
diśo daśa dyotayantaṃ saṃlagnāṅghristhitaṃ smaret || 4.113
vahantaṃ vakṣaso madhye svahastakṛtasampuṭam <svahastakṛtasaṃpuṭam> |
sandhārayantam aparaṃ tathā vai śirasopari || 4.114
dhyeyā bhagavatī mālā citrarūpā manoharā |
sarvagandhānvitā saumyā īṣadvihasitā navā || 4.115
kundāvadātaṃ kamalaṃ saumyam īṣatsmitānanam |
ravaṃ ravantaṃ madhuraṃ śrotrendriyasukhāv aham || 4.116
gadāṃ hemādrisaṅkāśāṃ tanvīṃ kuvalayekṣaṇām |
dviraṣṭavarṣavatkāntāṃ kumārīṃ navayauvanām || 4.117
svotthena raśmijālena bhāsayantīṃ nabhassthalam |
svaraśmimaṇḍalāntassthaṃ valgantaṃ hetipaṃ smaret || 4.118
vibhorājñāṃ pratīkṣantaṃ hrasvāṅgaṃ raktalocanam |
tuhinācalasaṅkāśaṃ <tuhinācalasaṃkāśaṃ> śaṅkhaṃ <śaṃkhaṃ>
kamalalāñchanam <kamalalāṃchanam> <<kamalalocanam>> || 4.119
sadāgamādisāmāntam udgirantaṃ svakair mukhaiḥ |
dhyeyāḥ svarucisaṃyuktā dvibhujāḥ puruṣopamāḥ || 4.120
sāstrāḥ kirīṭapūrvā ye gadāmālāṅganākṛtīḥ <gadāmālāṃganākṛtīḥ> |
ete 'stranāyakās sarve vibhorājñāpratīkṣakāḥ || 4.121
protthitā vicalantaś ca susamaiḥ sthānakaiḥ sthitāḥ |
śroṇītaṭārpitakarāś cāmaravyajanodyatāḥ || 4.122
sapadmaṃ tu karīṭādyaṃ varjayitvā catuṣṭayam |
tarjayantaṃ ca duṣṭaugham anyeṣāṃ dakṣiṇaṃ karam || 4.123
smared vai dhyānakāle ca sarveṣām atha mastake |
dhyeyaṃ svakaṃ svakaṃ cihnaṃ suprabuddhaṃ nirākṛti || 4.124
nalinītālahastā ca lakṣmī raktāmbujaprabhā |
puṣṭā kanakagaurā cāmṛtakumbhadharā smṛtā || 4.125
bhoktṛśaktiḥ smṛtā lakṣmīḥ puṣṭir vai kartṛsaṃjñitā |
bhogārtham avatīrṇasya lokānugrahakāmyayā || 4.126
uditaṃ saha tenaiva śaktidvitayam avyayam |
raktatuṇḍaṃ mahāprāṇaṃ bhīmabhrukuṭilocanam || 4.127
dīvyaccāmīkarākāraṃ padmamaṇḍalamaṇḍitam |
saṃsmaret garuḍaṃ viprāḥ gṛdhravaktraṃ pṛthūdaram || 4.128
yathoktamūrtiyuktāś ca tathā dhyāyed yathākramam |
kirīṭo hutabhugvedyaḥ kaustubhas tu prabhākaraḥ || 4.129
svayaṃ śaśāṅkaḥ śrīvatso mālāṣṣaṇmādhavādayaḥ |
apāṃ patir vai kamalaṃ gadā devī sarasvatī || 4.130
kālaś cakrādhipo jñeyaḥ khaṃ śaṅkhaḥ kathito dvijāḥ |
prāṇaṃ patatrirāḍviddhi evaṃ tattveṣu saṃsthitān || 4.131
adhiṣṭhāt�n kramāc caitān arcayed arghyapuṣpakaiḥ |
yajet tadanu deveśaṃ bhogair arghyādibhiḥ kramāt || 4.132
vinivedyāsanavaraṃ samāhūtasya vai vibhoḥ |
pādapīṭhaṃ tu sāmānyaṃ mṛddhās taraṇabhūṣitam || 4.133
ghaṇṭāśabdasamopetaṃ datvārghyaṃ mantramūrdhani |
pādyapratigrahaṃ haimaṃ vibhor dadyāt suratnakam || 4.134
pādyaṃ pādodakākarṣaṃ śāṭakaṃ cānulepanam |
sapratigrahamācāmaṃ sānulepaṃ ca mālikām || 4.135
ghṛtādikair mahādīpair acchinnair arcayed dharim |
sugandhair madhurair dhūpaiḥ prabhūtair arcayed vibhum || 4.136
arhaṇaṃ madhuparkaṃ ca tarpaṇaṃ tadanantaram |
niṣpuṃsanaṃ sapātraṃ ca ācāmaṃ gandham eva ca || 4.137
atha cūrṇitakarpūraṃ ghṛṣṭaṃ śrīgandhabhāditam |
sapūgaphalam utkṛṣṭaṃ tāmbūlaṃ vinivedya ca || 4.138
saputradāramātmānam aṣṭāṅgapatanena ca |
cetasā bhaktiyuktena nivedya tadanantaram || 4.139
bhagavān artha vijñāpyaḥ kṛtvā tatpādagau karau |
sphuṭīkṛtaṃ mayā deva tv idaṃ snānavaraṃ tvayi || 4.140
sapādapīṭham aparaṃ śubhaṃ snānāsanaṃ mahat |
āsādayāśu snānārthaṃ madanugrahakāmyayā || 4.141
vijñāpyaivaṃ majjanārthaṃ kṛtvā mārgatrayaṃ tataḥ |
snānāsanaṃ nivedyātha devasya dvitayaṃ tu vai || 4.142
snānārtham avatīrṇasya pādapīṭham anantaram |
bhaktinamreṇa śirasā dadyād arghyaṃ tu mūrdhani || 4.143
vinivedya tato haimaṃ suratnaṃ ca pratigraham |
dadyād vai pādyakalaśāt pādyaṃ pādāmbujadvaye || 4.144
śubhe ca pāduke cātha tadante snānaśāṭakam |
sugandhaśālisampūrṇaṃ <sugandhaśālisaṃpūrṇaṃ> mātrārthaṃ pātram 
uttamam || 4.145
darpaṇaṃ pūrṇacandrābhaṃ gandhato 'yam anantaram |
pāṇīnāṃ kṣālanārthaṃ tu pādapīṭhaṃ tataś śubham || 4.146
dantakāṣṭhaṃ ca tadanu mukhaśuddhipratigraham |
jihvānirlekhanaṃ caiva mukhaprakṣālanaṃ tu val || 4.147
punarācamanaṃ caiva abhyaṅgārtham anantaram |
tailaṃ bahusugandhaṃ ca cūrṇaṃ godhūmaśālijam || 4.148
rajanīcūrṇasammiśramīṣatpadmakabhāvitam
<rajanīcūrṇasaṃmiśramīṣatpadmakabhāvitam> |
deyam udvartanārthaṃ tu camaṣīṃ tadanantaram || 4.149
snānārthaṃ svaṣasaṃyuktaṃ toyam uṣṇam anantaram |
candanaṃ mukhalepārthaṃ ghṛṣṭaṃ karpūrabhāvitam || 4.150
pañcaviṃśatibhiḥ <paṃcaviṃśatibhiḥ> kumbhais tatas saṃsnāpayed vibhum |
gavyaṃ prabhūtaṃ snānārthaṃ kṣīraṃ dadhi ghṛtaṃ madhu || 4.151
aikṣavaṃ tu rasaṃ hṛdyam abhāve śarkarodakam |
dhātrīphalodakaṃ caiva lodhratoya manantaram || 4.152
raktacandanatoyaṃ ca rajanīnīram uttamam |
granthipallavavāryeva tatas tu tagarodakam || 4.153
priyaṅguvāri tadanu māṃsījalamataḥparam |
siddhārthakodakaṃ cātha sarvauṣadhijalaṃ tataḥ || 4.154
patrapuṣpodake caiva phalabījodake tv atha |
gandhodakaṃ ca tadanu hemaratnajalaṃ tataḥ || 4.155
puṇyatīrthasarittoye kevalaṃ tadanantaram |
snānārthaṃ kalpitenaiva udakena vimaśritam || 4.156
yoktavyaṃ kramaśo hy etadarghyapuṣpasamanvitam |
antarāntarayogena snānānāṃ ca mahāmate || 4.157
kṣālanaṃ cārghyakalaśād arghyadānasamanvitam |
yad vā dviṣaṭkakalaśair navabhir vābhiṣecayet || 4.158 
tataḥ snānīyaśeṣeṇa hemādidravyanirmitam |
sampūrṇam <saṃpūrṇam> ambhasā kumbhaṃ haridrāśālitaṇḍulaiḥ || 4.159
supiṣṭair upariṣṭāc ca liptaṃ yuktaṃ sragādinā |
pāṇau kṛtvā tam ekasmin aparasmiṃs tu mallakam || 4.160
dhūmāyamānaṃ siddhārthair bhrāmya mūrghni bahiḥkṣipet |
sudhautamahataṃ cātha śāṭakaṃ vinivedya ca || 4.161
kacodakāpakarṣārtham aparaṃ dehavāridhṛt |
adharottaravastre dve gandhadhūpādivāsite || 4.162
skandhaplotaṃ nivedyātha susūkṣmam ahataṃ sitam |
śiraśśyānaṃ tataḥ kuryāc chaśidhūpasamanvitam || 4.163
karpūracūrṇasammiśraṃ <karpūracūrṇasaṃmiśraṃ> kuryād devasya mūrdhajam 
|
evaṃ hi citrapūrvāṇām anyeṣāṃ kamalāsana || 4.164
sadratnabrahmapāṣāṇavarjitānāṃ samācaret |
snānārthaṃ karmabimbe tu tatsamīpe 'tha darpaṇe || 4.165
snānavijñāpanaṃ kṛtvā karmārcāṃ tasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> |
snānāsane samāropya tasyāṃ sarvaṃ samācaret || 4.166
tadabhāve darpaṇe tu snānabhogān samarpayet |
citrastha evaṃ dadyāc ca bhogān anyān yathākramam || 4.167
tadabhāve ca tān sarvān pāṇinādāya cetasā |
nivedayen maṇḍalādiṣv evaṃ bhoganivedanam || 4.168
prokṣaṇaṃ yāvatā kuryād arghyādyair avaśiṣṭakaiḥ |
praṇālabhāgādaparaṃ snānaṃ bhadrāsanāt tu vai || 4.169
bhūrinīraghaṭaiś śuddhaṃ kṛtvā tatrāvatārya ca |
sapīṭhaṃ bhagavadbimbaṃ tadvinā vārcitaṃ yadi || 4.170
svaplutaṃ bhāvayed devaṃ niśśeṣaṃ kṣālayet tataḥ |
bhūyo gandhodakenaiva pūryaṃ kumbhacatuṣṭayam || 4.171
snānakumbhaṃ vinānyeṣāṃ prāgvatkāryā hi kalpanā |
hṛnmantreṇa caturṇā tu kuryād vai divyayojanam || 4.172
sāstreṇa mūlamantreṇa sarvaṃ tac cābhimantrya tu |
mārgatrayaṃ kramāt kṛtvā vinivedyāsanaṃ tataḥ || 4.173
tṛtīyaṃ ratnakhacitaṃ tatrasthaṃ parameśvaram |
vibhāvyālaṅkṛtaṃ bhaktyā bhogais srakcandanādibhiḥ || 4.174
samabhyarcyārghyapādyena pādukābhyām anantaram |
deyam ācamanaṃ bhūyaḥ pādapīṭhaṃ tathaiva ca || 4.175
samālabhya sugandhena bhaktitaś candanādinā |
saṃvījya candanenaiva māyūreṇa tatena ca || 4.176
keśaprasādakṛtkūrcaṃ puṣpatāmbūlakartanīm |
nivedya devadevāya dukūlavasane site || 4.177
upavītaṃ sottarīyaṃ makuṭādyam anantaram |
pādanūpuraparyantam alaṅkaraṇam uttamam || 4.178
vicitraṃ hi śiromālyaṃ veṣṭanena samanvitam |
sragdāmasūtrasamddhamākarṇāc <sragdāmasūtrasaṃddhamākarṇāc> 
caraṇāvadhi || 4.179
ruciraṃ kaṅkaṇaṃ cātha dadyāt pratisaraṃ tataḥ |
dhātubhiḥ kuṅkumādyair vā vicitraṃ sitasūtrajam || 4.180
pūritaṃ mṛdutūlena grathitaṃ cāntarāntarā |
añjanaṃ <aṃjanaṃ> saśalākaṃ ca tāmbūlaṃ gandhabhāvitam || 4.181
lalāṭatilakaṃ haimaṃ mukhavāsaṃ sarocanam |
karṇāvataṃsake puṣpe maṇḍanaṃ darpaṇaṃ mahat || 4.182
prakāraṃ citrakusumair dīptaratnaprabhojjvalaiḥ |
prabhūtais tu mahājvālais tilatailājyapūritaiḥ || 4.183
abhuktāhatasuśvetaracitair vartiveṣṭitaiḥ |
granthīkṛtatvagelādyaiḥ pūjayet tadanantaram || 4.184
karpūracūrṇasammiśraṃ <karpūracūrṇasaṃmiśraṃ> sugandhi madhuraṃ bahu |
ghṛṣṭadhūpasamāyuktaṃ guggulaṃ dhūpayec chubham || 4.185
sahaghaṇṭāravairamyaiś cālyamānena bāhunā |
upānahau sitaṃ chatraṃ śibikāṃ ca rathādi yat || 4.186
vāhanaṃ gajaparyantaṃ sapatākaṃ svagadhvajam |
sitāsitau cāmarau tu mātrāvittam anantaram || 4.187
jānunī bhūgatau kṛtvā śirasāvanatena tu |
ādāyottānapāṇibhyāṃ vinivedya jagatprabhoḥ || 4.188
aupacārikabhogānām eteṣāṃ pūraṇāya ca |
bherīmṛdaṅgaśaṅkhādyair jayaśabdasamanvitaiḥ || 4.189
gītakair vividhair nṛttais tantrīvādyasamanvitaiḥ |
vaṃśaiś śṛṅgais tathā hāsyair anyaiś śrāvyaiś ca pūjayet || 4.190
stotramantrair namaskāraiḥ praṇāmaiś ca pradakṣiṇaiḥ |
saṅkaṭe sati bhūbhāge bhagavaty agrataḥsthite || 4.191
dhiyā namaskṛtiṃ kuryād badhvā tu karasampuṭam <karasaṃpuṭam> |
hṛddeśe mūrdhakampais tu smaran sarveśvaraṃ harim || 4.192
antargarbhagṛhe viṣṇor garbhadvārārdhamaṇḍape |
praṇipātagaṇaṃ kuryāt pradakṣiṇagaṇaṃ vinā || 4.193
saṅgaṭe sati taddeśe bāhye tu mukhamaṇṭape |
sthāpayec calabimbāni tatrāpi sati saṅkaṭe || 4.194
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇe 'pi vā |
sthānaṃ suvistṛtaṃ kṛtvā prāsādāgraṃ ca varjyadik || 4.195
diktraye 'bhimate kuryād vidikṣvabhimateṣu ca |
khalūrikāpradeśe vā sudeśe suparīkṣite || 4.196
sthāpayed vidhinā yātrābimbaṃ devīsamanvitam |
anyāni sarvabimbāni na bahis sthāpayet kvacit || 4.197
mūlabimbaṃ samabhyarcya purā nīrājanāntimam |
paścādbahisthitān bimbān pūjayet tu yathāvidhi || 4.198
evaṃ pradakṣiṇāntaṃ ca devam arbhyarcya vai tataḥ |
nīrājayed devadevaṃ tadvidhānam ihocyate || 4.199
nīrājanaṃ tu trividhaṃ sāttvikādivibhedataḥ |
snānānte bhogayajñānte dvitayaṃ sāttvikaṃ bhavet || 4.200
sāyaṅkāle pratidinaṃ kuryād rājasasaṃjñitam |
pūjāyāṃ dīpadānāgre naivedyānte 'pi tāmasam || 4.201
kuryāt prāsāda ekasmin teṣām ekaṃ na tu trayam |
svayaṃvyakte tathānyaiś ca vibudhaiś ca pratiṣṭhite || 4.202
prāsāde munimukhyaiś ca sāttvikākhyaṃ samācaret |
brāhmaṇaiḥ kṣatriyair vaiśyaiḥ sthāpite rājasaṃ bhavet || 4.203
śūdrais tu sthāpite strībhis tāmasākhyaṃ samācaret |
sāttvikasya vidhānaṃ tu śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 4.204
kartavyaṃ snānabhogānte yat tad uktaṃ puraiva tu |
alaṅkārāsanānte yatkartavyaṃ tad ihocyate || 4.205
kṛtaṃ svarṇādibhir dravyaiḥ kumbham āpūrya vāribhiḥ |
arghyapātroddhṛtair yad vā kevalair gālitaiḥ punaḥ || 4.206
antassiddhārthakān kṣiptvā kaṇṭhe kuryād alaṅkṛtim |
aśvatthapallavais sragbhiś candanenākṣatair api || 4.207
anyatra rajanīpiṣṭair lepayet sarvato dvijāḥ |
tadāsye mallakaṃ puṣpaṃ sampūrṇaṃ <saṃpūrṇaṃ> tu niyojayet || 4.208
saṃskṛtāgnisamudbhūtān purā dīpān pradīpya tu |
vibhavecchānurūpeṇa caturviṃśatikān dvijāḥ || 4.209
pākasthānāt tu vai dīpād ucchritāc caturaṅgulaiḥ |
pradīpaṃ mallake kṛtvā sakumbhaṃ viniveśayet || 4.210
agrato devadevasya sadādhāropari sthitam |
tamarghyagandhasragdhūpair hṛnmantreṇa tu pūjayet || 4.211
kevalaṃ sārghyapuṣpeṇa sādhakas tadanantaram |
dadyād ācamanānte 'rghyaṃ mantreśasyātha vā dvijāḥ || 4.212
arghyālabhanamālyāni dhūpaṃ cāpy arghyam eva ca |
dīpakumbhaṃ tu pāṇibhyām uddhṛtaṃ paricāriṇā || 4.213
devasya dakṣiṇaṃ pādam ārabhyetarapaścitam |
bhrāmayet sarvato 'ṅgāni <'ṃgāni> ekadhā vā dvidhā tridhā || 4.214
japan vai netramantraṃ tu hṛnmantraṃ vā yathāruci |
evaṃ kumbhaṃ paribhrāmya dvijena paricāriṇā || 4.215
śuddhayā yoṣitā vāpi dvārād bāhye visarjayet |
tatas tu devadevasya dadyād arghyaṃ tu mūrdhani || 4.216
pākasthānāt tadardhaṃ tu dīpa ānīyate yadā |
tadānīṃ tadvidhānaṃ tu śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 4.217
dīkṣitās suvinītāś ca susnātāḥ paricārikāḥ |
vadanaṃ nāsikārandhre sthagayitvāmbareṇa tu || 4.218
sitoṣṇīṣadharās sarve sitacandanabhūṣitāḥ |
sauvarṇāni ca pātrāṇi vitatāni yathāruci || 4.219
rājatāny atha tāmrāṇi ārakūṭamayāni ca |
kāṃsyāni vāpi sampādya <saṃpādya> yathāvittānusārataḥ || 4.220
ekatripañcasaptāpi <ekatripaṃcasaptāpi> na caikādaśa vā tathā |
dviṣaṭṣoḍaśa vā yad vā caturviṃśatisaṅkhyayā <caturviṃśatisaṃkhyayā> || 
4.221
pākālayaṃ samāsādya tatrāgnes saṃskṛtāt purā |
teṣāṃ madhyevartidīpān pātrāṇāṃ tu mahāmate || 4.222
caturaṅgulikotsedhān saghṛtān dīpayet punaḥ |
uddhṛtya tāni pātrāṇi karais tu paricārakāḥ || 4.223
vaheyuḥ paṅktibandhena tadagre gaṇikājanāḥ |
gaccheyur bhagavadbhaktāḥ kurvantyo nṛttagītake || 4.224
tadagre śaṅkhabheryādisamudghoṣaṇatatparāḥ |
tadagre vetriṇe 'spṛśyajanotsāraṇatatparāḥ || 4.225
gaccheyuḥ paritas teṣāṃ dīpikādhāriṇo janāḥ |
evaṃ kramāt samāsādya tiṣṭheyur devasannidhau <devasaṃnidhau> || 4.226
athānyo dīkṣito vipraḥ kumbham āpādya pūrvavat |
samallakaṃ tadūrdhve tu teṣv ekasmāt pradīpya tu || 4.227
pākas sthānād āhṛteṣu pradīpaṃ viniveśya ca |
sadādhārasthitaṃ kuryāt tatas sādhakasattamaḥ || 4.228
kumbhaṃ prāgvatsamabhyarcya deveśaṃ ca tataḥ param |
bhrāmayet pūrvavat kumbhaṃ tasmin kāle dvijottamāḥ || 4.229
ṛgādyadhyayanaṃ kuryur dvijāḥ prāgādidiksthitāḥ |
sannidhau <saṃnidhau> devadevasya nṛtyaṃ tu gaṇikās tadā || 4.230
maṅgalāni ca gītāni sarve gāyantu gāyakāḥ |
svareṇoccatareṇaiva stuvantu stotrapāṭhakāḥ || 4.231
bherīmṛdaṅgaśaṅkhādīn ghoṣayeyus samantataḥ |
evaṃ sarvatra vai kuryād ṛgādyadhyayanādikam || 4.232
kumbham evaṃ paribhrāmya datvā tatparicāriṇaḥ |
haste 'tha dīpapātrāṇi darśayed itarāṇi ca || 4.233
dṛṣṭvā samyaktato dadyād arghyaṃ devasya mūrdhani |
kumbhapūrvāṇi pātrāṇi vahantaḥ paricārakāḥ || 4.234
pradakṣiṇakramāt sārdhaṃ pūrvavadgaṇikādibhiḥ |
kṣipeyur dvārabāhye vā bāhyadvārasya bāhyataḥ || 4.235
atha vā viniyuktāni tāni saṅgṛhya yoṣitaḥ |
susnātā dhautavasanā dvijātībhāvitātmanaḥ || 4.236
lalāṭatilakaṃ datvā sarvālaṅkārabhūṣitāḥ |
kṣipeyur uditenaiva vartmanā dvijasattamāḥ || 4.237
atha vā viniyogāt tu pūrvaṃ pākālayād api |
yoṣito dīpapātrāṇi gṛhītvā proktavartmanā || 4.238
ānayeyur vibhor agre kartur icchānurūpataḥ |
evaṃ nīrājanaṃ kuryād alaṅkārāsanaṃ tataḥ || 4.239
atha vā bhrāmayet kumbhaṃ dīpāṣṭakasamanvitam |
yad vā tatrāpi vai kumbhaṃ sāgnimallakasaṃyutam || 4.240
dhūmāyamānaṃ siddhārthair bhrāmayed dīpavārjitam |
evaṃ nīrājanaṃ proktam ekamūrter dvijottamāḥ || 4.241
anekamūrtipūjāyāṃ mukhyamūrtyāditaḥ kramāt |
sarvāsām api mūrtīnāṃ datvārghyādyaṃ pṛthak pṛthak || 4.242
ekaikena tu kumbhena pratyekam atha vā dvijāḥ |
sarvāsām api kumbhena prāgvannīrājanaṃ caret || 4.243
evaṃ nīrājanaṃ proktaṃ kṛtaṃ bhagavato vibhoḥ |
anutiṣṭhanti sāhāyyaṃ tasmin karmaṇi ye janāḥ || 4.244
rajastamovinirmuktā bhaveyus te na saṃśayaḥ |
evaṃ nīrājanaṃ proktaṃ sāttvikaṃ nāma nāmataḥ || 4.425

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ nīrājanāntavidhir nāma
caturtho 'dhyāyaḥ


śrīḥ
atha pañcamo 'dhyāyaḥ

nāradaḥ
tato bhojyāsane devo bhaugair ābhyavahārikaiḥ |
pūjyassapādapīṭhaṃ vai dadyād bhojyāsanaṃ vibhoḥ || 5.1
channaṃ dukūlatūlotthamasūrakavareṇa tu |
āropayitvā prāgāsyaṃ tatrasthe bhojanāsane || 5.2
arghyaṃ pādyācame dadyāt pratigrahasamanvite |
tarpaṇaṃ sampratiṣṭhāpya <saṃpratiṣṭhāpya>
vāsitañcārghyavāriṇā <vāsitaṃcārghyavāriṇā> || 5.3
atharvaṇajalaṃ svacchaṃ sugandhaṃ pātrataḥ kṛtam |
madhuparkaṃ dadhimadhughṛtayuktam anantaram || 5.4
samastam evam ekāṅgaṃ dadhi vāpi nivedayet |
śītalaṃ tarpaṇajalam atha cūrṇaṃ puroditam || 5.5
deyaṃ niṣpuṃsanārthaṃ tu punarācamanaṃ vibhoḥ |
svalaṅkṛtāṃ surūpāṃ ca sragyuktāṃ vinivedya gām || 5.6
oṣadhīś śālipūrṇāś ca srakphalāḍhyaṃ vanaspatim |
mūrtaṃ nivedayet pūrvaṃ tatas saṃsthāpya tarpaṇam || 5.7
pracchādanāmbaraṃ caiva pradadyād arhaṇodakam |
ṣaḍsaprabhavair divyair naivedyaiḥ pāvanaiḥ phalaiḥ || 5.8
gula(ḍa)khaṇḍāñcitair <gula(ḍa)khaṇḍāṃcitair> bhakṣyair bahubhir ghṛtapācitaiḥ |
gula(ḍa)mudgapayomiśrair niśājyatilamiśritaiḥ || 5.9
dadhimiśrais sarpimiśrair madhusvāduyutaiḥ phalaiḥ |
kramād annair aṣṭavidhair apūpān vinivedayet || 5.10
sarasābhī rasālābhiḥ payasā suśritena ca |
pavitraiś śītalais svādurasagandhaiś ca pānakaiḥ || 5.11
bhakṣyair bhojyais tathā lehyaiḥ peyair anyair anekaśaḥ |
śraddhāpūtena manasā yajet tamajam avyayam || 5.12
ekaikasmiṃs tu bhoge 'pi prokṣayed arghyavāriṇā |
dhoṭikāṃ mantrasaṃyuktāṃ kṛtvā pāṇidvayena tu || 5.13
atha pāṇidvayenaiva agnīṣomātmakena tu |
yogyatāpadavīṃ nītvā mudrāṃ kāmadughāṃ tataḥ || 5.14
badhvā tadamṛtīkuryād bhogajālaṃ yathāsthitam |
datvārghyaṃ puṣpam upari saṃspṛśed viṣṇupāṇinā || 5.15
savyena pāṇināspṛśya prakoṣṭhaṃ dakṣiṇasya tu |
tena dakṣiṇahastena agrasaṅkuñcitena <agrasaṃkuṃcitena> tu || 5.16
nivedayet tato viprāś śirasāvanatena tat |
asannidheś <asaṃnidheś> ca yo bhogo hy aṅgabhāvam anuvrajet || 5.17
tattat dhyātvā tu manasā bhaktyā viṣṇor nivedayet |
pāvanaiḥ pānakais svacchaiś śītalair madhurādikaiḥ || 5.18
tvagelādyanvitair mṛṣṭadhūpakarpūravāsitaiḥ |
nālikerodakopetais tarpaṇīyam anantaram || 5.19
masūramāṣacūrṇena rajanīśālijena ca |
samudvarti ca saṃkṣālya <saṅkṣālya> śītalair bahuvāribhiḥ || 5.20
naivedyācamanārthaṃ tu gandhodakam anuttamam |
vāsasā nirmalaṃ kṛtvā candanena sitena ca || 5.21
samālabhya sughṛṣṭena karpūrasahitena ca |
tilāny atha suratnāni sauvarṇe vātha rājate || 5.22
pātre kṛtvātha mātrārthaṃ devāya vinivedayet |
lavaṅgatakkolailātvakkarpūraparibhāvitam || 5.23
jātīpūgaphalopetaṃ sasugandhacchadaṃ bahu |
karpūracūrṇasammiśraṃ <karpūracūrṇasaṃmiśraṃ> muktācūrṇavimiśritam || 
5.24
mātalaṅgaphalopetaṃ nālikeraphalānvitam |
pradadyāt praṇataś cānte tāmbūlaṃ jagataḥ pateḥ || 5.25
prakṣālya gandhatoyena arghyapātroddhṛtena vai |
pāṇiyugmaṃ yathā vai syāt svaccham atyantanirmalam || 5.26
naivedyadhūpapātrādyaiḥ pātraiś cānirmalīkṛtam |
kṛtvā sadgundhadigdhau tāvarghyeṇārcya parasparam || 5.27
mudrāṃ mūlādimantrāṇāṃ darśayitvā yathākramam |
bhūyo 'rghyagandhapuṣpeṇa dhūpāntena samarcya ca || 5.28
japayajñavidhānena devaṃ santarpayet tataḥ |
sphāṭikenākṣasūtreṇa svakair vā karaparvabhiḥ || 5.29
pātraṃ saṃsthāpayet paścādarghyapātrāc ca vāriṇā |
vilipya candanādyais tu sthāpayed bhājane śubhe || 5.30
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> puṣpadhūpādyair mantraṃ tatra ca vinyaset |
sādhāramāsanaṃ caiva śaktipūrvais samāvṛtam || 5.31
caturbhujaṃ tu virajo nārāyaṇam ivāparam |
varadābhayahastaṃ ca baddhāñ jalidharaṃ smaret || 5.32
brahmasthānasthitaṃ taṃ ca sūtraṃ dhyāyec chikhopamam |
sannidhau <saṃnidhau> bhava deveśa sanniruddho <saṃniruddho> bhavācyuta || 5.33
sūtrākhyamaṇijāle 'smin yāvaccandrārkatārakāḥ |
evaṃ mune pratiṣṭhāpya sūtramantre 'kṣasaṃjñike || 5.34
pratiṣṭhitasya vai paścānmudrāṃ svāṃ ca pradarśayet |
yathāśakti japaṃ kuryāc chatam aṣṭādhikaṃ tu vā || 5.35
tan nivedya vibhoḥ paścādvākkarma manasānvitam |
puṇḍarīkākṣa viśvātman mantramūrte janārdana || 5.36
gṛhāṇāsmin japaṃ nātha mama dīnasya śāśvatam |
ity uktvā sodakaṃ paścātpuṣpaṃ dakṣiṇapāṇigam || 5.37
agrato nikṣipedviṣṇor mūlamantreṇa nārada |
bhāvayec ca tatas samyak sphurantīṃ tārakāvalim || 5.38
praviṣṭāṃ bhagavadvaktre vaktrāt taddhṛdgatāṃ punaḥ |
hṛdayāt dvijaśārdūlaṃ saṃhārākhyakrameṇa tu || 5.39
pūrvavadbrahmarandhreṇa pareṇa saha yojayet |
ekaikaṃ hṛdayādīnāṃ sarveṣāṃ vihitaṃ tv atha || 5.40
kriyāṅgatvān na doṣo 'sti anyathā tajjapaṃ vinā |
dhūpaṃ datvā praṇamyātha stutvā mantreśvaraṃ tataḥ || 5.41
ajñānāt jñānato vāpi jātamūnādhikaṃ ca yat |
dāsasya mama dīnasya kṣantavyaṃ lokalocana || 5.42
iti vijñāpya deveśaṃ bhaktitas sādhakottamaḥ |
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> gandhadhūpaiś ca tatas tu bhagavanmayāt || 5.43
yathākramaṃ samabhyarcya naivedyaṃ pratipādya ca |
teṣāṃ mantrāvasānaṃ ca arhaṇādyaṃ nivedayet || 5.44
yadvaibhyo devayajñānte tanmātrāntaṃ pradāya tu |
asmin kāle 'rhaṇādyaṃ tu tāmbūlāntaṃ samarpayet || 5.45
śayyāsanaṃ tato dadyād agnau santarpayet tataḥ |
nyastvāstramāsane yāyādanalālayam arghyabhṛt || 5.46
pūrvavat dvārayāgaṃ tu kṛtvā sapraviśet tataḥ |
tatra pūrvoktavidhinā upaspṛśya samāhitaḥ || 5.47
pramāṇapariśuddhaṃ ca vibhavānuguṇaṃ śubham |
caturāvaraṇaṃ kuṇḍaṃ kṛtvā hy oṣṭhavibhūṣitam || 5.48
tryaṃśenārdhena vāṃśena khātād vyāso vidhīyate |
cakraśaṅkhāmbujākāraṃ vṛttaṃ vā caturaśrakam || 5.49
gadādyaiś cakraparyantair lāṃchanair lāṃchitaṃ tu vā |
agnikāryopayogyāni yāni yāni mahāmate || 5.50
sruksruvādīni bhāṇḍāni tvaṅkitavyāni tair api |
yad vā kirīṭaśrīvatsamālākaustubhalakṣaṇam || 5.51
śaṅkhacakragadāpadmasamastavyastalāṃchitam
<śaṃkhacakragadāpadmasamastavyastalāñchitam>|
bhṛṅgārakarakākāraṃ <bhṛṃgārakarakākāraṃ> kuṇḍaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ || 
5.52
kuṇḍaṃ caturmekhalaṃ vā trimekhalam athāpi vā |
dvimekhalaṃ tathā caikamekhalaṃ vā prakalpayet || 5.53
sthiraṃ samekhalaṃ kuryāj jaṅgamaṃ tu vimekhalam |
deśakālavaśāc caiva kuṇḍaṃ na ghaṭate yadi || 5.54
taṃ vinā havanacchedo na kāryas siddhim icchatā |
śodhite hy upalipte ca sthale 'calamṛdānvite || 5.55
homas tu vihitas samyak mantrasyāmantritasya ca |
piṇḍikā caturāśrā tu bahis sarvatra śasyate || 5.56
madhye padmaṃ prakurvīta śrīpadaṃ pradmamadhyagam |
evaṃ kṛte śucau kuṇḍe agnikāryaṃ samācaret || 5.57
cullyāṃ vā mallake vāpi homaṃ kuryād yathāvidhi |
eteṣv ekatamaṃ kuṇḍaṃ sambhavānuguṇaṃ <saṃbhavānuguṇaṃ> śubham || 5.58
sudhādyair varṇakaiś śuddhair bhūṣayitvopalipya ca |
sugandhaiś candanādyaiś ca pañcagavyapurassaraiḥ <paṃcagavyapurassaraiḥ> || 5.59
kuṇḍasyārambhakāle tu saṃskārā na kṛtā yadi |
niṣpannasya ca te sarve vidheyāś ca krameṇa tu || 5.60
tāḍayed astramantreṇa puṣpair dakṣiṇapāṇinā |
khananaṃ tīkṣṇaśastreṇa deśikaś cāstravidyayā || 5.61
gṛhītvā caikadeśāt tu kuṇḍamadhyāt tu mṛtkaṇam |
aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ tu hṛdayena samuddharet || 5.62
astreṇaiva samīkṛtya na syān nimnonnataṃ yathā |
secayet kavacenaiva kuṭṭayet tadanantaram || 5.63
lepayed gandhatoyena astreṇa pariśodhayet |
astrajaptaiḥ kuśākāṇḍais tīkṣṇalāṅgūlavarjitaiḥ <tīkṣṇalāṃgūlavarjitaiḥ> || 
5.64
astrābhimantritenaiva darbhakāṇḍadvayena tu |
tanmadhye ca kuśāgreṇa prāgbhāgam avalambya ca || 5.65
ārabhya dakṣiṇāśāyāṃ likhel lekhāmudaggatām |
tasyām upari saṃlikhya lekhānāṃ tritayaṃ sphuṭam || 5.66
prāgagraṃ dakṣiṇāśādi hy duīcyantaṃ ca sāntaram |
tatra prāgagrarekhāsu madhyaikā piṅgalābhidhā || 5.67
dakṣiṇottarayor dve tu suṣumneḍādidaivate |
caturthā praṇavenātha prokṣayed arghyavāriṇā || 5.68
tadabhyarcyārghyapuṣpādyair dhyāyet tatbhadrapīṭhavat |
praṇavais tu pratiṣṭhānaṃ prāgvadasya samācaret || 5.69
caturaśrasthale kuṇḍe digvidiga(gva)ṣṭake bahiḥ |
sampūrṇapātraṃ <saṃpūrṇapātraṃ> kumbhānām aṣṭakaṃ viniveśya ca || 5.70
ūrdhvādhomekhalānāṃ ca caturṇā dikcatuṣṭaye |
kauśeyaviṣṭarasthāṃś ca vāsudevādikān yajet || 5.71
vidikṣv apy atha yogena hy ūrdhvāntamadharāt tu vai |
tadvad evārghyapuṣpādyaiḥ pūjanīyāḥ krameṇa tu || 5.72
mṛdudarbhasamūhaṃ ca nīrasaṃ cāśmakuṭṭimam |
śuṣkagomayacūrṇena yuktaṃ gandhātmanā saha || 5.73
kuṇḍe droṇāṃśamātraṃ tu samāropya prasārya ca |
acchinnāgrais tato darbhair astramantrābhimantritaiḥ || 5.74
kuṇḍabhittigaṇaṃ sarvaṃ protthitaiḥ paribhūṣayet |
varmaṇā cākṣavāṭaṃ tu saṅkalpya tadanantaram || 5.75
samabhyarcya ca puṣpādhyair madhyataḥ praṇavena tu |
tenaiva vidhinā nābhiṃ pūjayec candrasannibhām <candrasaṃnibhām> || 5.76
tataḥ pavitrakaṃ dārbhaṃ śikhāmantrābhimantritam |
prāksamālepanopetaṃ catuṣpathapade nyaset || 5.77
hṛnmantreṇa tatas tatra yogapīthaṃ prakalpayet |
tatra nārāyaṇākhyāṃ vai śaktiṃ vidyotalakṣaṇām || 5.78
lakṣmyākṛtipadaṃ prāptām amṛtāmṛtarūpiṇīm |
sarvātiśayarūpāṃ ca sarvaśaktisamanvitāṃ || 5.79
saukumāryeṇa rūpeṇa sarvavastvantarasthitām |
śāśvatīṃ sṛṣṭimārgeṇa avatārya hṛdambuje || 5.80
purā dhyānakrameṇaiva hṛnmantreṇa hṛdambujāt |
svanāmapadayuktena sanamaḥpraṇavādinā || 5.81
recakena vinikṣipya kuṇḍahṛtpadmamadhyataḥ |
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> gandhapuṣpādyaiḥ padmamudrāṃ pradarśya ca || 5.82
tāmrapātre 'tha vānyasmin samādāya hutāśanam |
āraṇyaṃ laukikaṃ vātha maṇijaṃ darpaṇodbhavam || 5.83
nidhāya kuṇḍasyaiśānye saṃskārārthaṃ ca sāmpratam <sāṃpratam> |
santāḍya cāstramantreṇa prokṣayec chikhayā ca tam || 5.84
hṛdābhyarcyāmṛtaṃ dhyānaṃ datvācchādyātha varmaṇā |
mūlaṃ smṛtvā samānīya pūrakeṇa hṛdantare || 5.85
mantrānilakarākṛṣṭaṃ kṛtvā tasmād vinirgatam |
vyāsto guṇagaṇāt ṣaṣṭhas tejo nāma guṇo hi yaḥ | 5.86
parasya brahmaṇas so 'yaṃ sāmānyaṃ sarvatejasām |
virecya vinyaset tasmin vahnipātre purārcite || 5.87
tato 'gnipātram ādāya nirdhūmamatidīptimat |
dakṣiṇena kareṇaiva pāṇibhyām atha vā dvijāḥ || 5.88
bhrāmayitvā caturdhā vai tataḥ kuṇḍāntare kṣipet |
dhyāyed ekatvam āpannaṃ tato mantrārciṣā saha || 5.89
yājñiyair indhanaiś śuṣkaiḥ prajvālyāstrābhimantritaiḥ |
hṛdā dakṣiṇahastena kuryāt parisamūhanam || 5.90
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva hy ārdraṃ pāṇitalena tu |
tiryakhādhomukhasthena nakhapṛṣṭham adarśayan || 5.91
astrābhimantritenaiva prokṣayed arghyavāriṇā |
tatas tv abhagnamūlāgrais samair dadyāt kuśais staram || 5.92
diśi diśyuttarāśāntaṃ yāmyāśādau tu sāntaram |
caturguṇaiś caturdhā tv apy agracchannaiḥ parasparam || 5.93
prākprāntaiḥ pūrvabhāgāc ca yāvaduttaragocaram |
homopakaraṇaṃ sarvaṃ homabhāṇḍapurassaram || 5.94
avatārya tadūrdhve tu dakṣiṇasyāṃ tathātmanaḥ |
dvandvadvandvaprayogeṇa dravyasthāpanam ācaret || 5.95
paridhīṃś cedhmanicayaṃ muktadarbhaiḥ karaṇḍikām |
sruksruvau ca catuṣkaṃ yad ekatra viniveśya ca || 5.96
sragdhūpamadhuparkaṃ ca bījāny ekatra vai tataḥ |
kauśeyaṃ dhūtakeśaṃ tu viṣṭaraṃ ca ghṛtaṃ carum || 5.97
ājyasthālīcatuṣkaṃ ca nidhāya tadanantaram |
praṇītāpātrayugalaṃ karakaṃ cārghyabhājanam || 5.98
catuṣkam etad aparam agrato viniveśya ca |
prādeśamātrāssamidhaḥ prabhūtaṃ śuṣkam indhanam || 5.99
pakṣmakakhedahṛdvastraṃ vāmabhāge nidhāya vai |
arghyodakena sāstreṇa kṛtsnaṃ pāvanatāṃ nayet || 5.100
tatas tu mūladeśasthāḥ brahmavṛkṣādikotthitāḥ |
saparṇās satvacasspaṣṭā adho nemes tu cādhikāḥ || 5.101
prākpratyaguttarāgrau ca prāgagrau dakṣiṇottarau |
catasro vai paridhayaś śikhāmantreṇa pūjayet || 5.102
viṣṭarāṇi tato dadyāt hṛdā kumbhāṣṭake tataḥ |
teṣu kramāt pūjayec ca lokapālān svadiksthitān || 5.103
ādāya sodakaṃ cātha praṇītākhyaṃ ca bhājanam |
pavitrakaṃ tu tanmadhye caturdarbhakṛtaṃ nyaset || 5.104
uddhṛtyoddhṛtya hastena jalaṃ tatraiva nikṣipet |
tatas tv aṣṭākṣaraṃ mantraṃ japamāno hi sādhakaḥ || 5.105
bhūyas tadambhasā sarvaṃ prokṣayed viṣṭareṇa tu |
śeṣasya srāvaṇaṃ kuryāt sarvadikṣus taropari || 5.106
punar evāmbhasāpūrya tanmadhye parameśvaram |
dhyātvārcayitvā saṃsthāpya tv agratas tadanantaram || 5.107
praṇīte cāparasmin vai pātre cāgre kṛte sati |
sapavitraṃ tu tatrārghyaṃ datvā cakraṃ tu vinyaset || 5.108
mantranāthaṃ tadūrdhve tu dhyātvābhyarcya yathākramam |
tatpātram uttarasyāṃ ca kṛtvā sampūjya <saṃpūjya> vai punaḥ || 5.109
athājyaṃ daśasaṃskārais saṃskuryāt sādhakottamaḥ |
adhiśrayaṇamatrādāv upādhiśrayaṇaṃ tathā || 5.110
prasādīkaraṇaṃ caiva hṛnmantreṇa samācaret |
samplavotplavane <saṃplavotplavane> kuryāt praṇavena tu sādhakaḥ || 5.111
hṛdā pavitrīkaraṇaṃ dṛśā nīrājanaṃ tathā |
tataḥ kavacamantreṇa kuryāt tadavakuṇṭhanam || 5.112
avalokāmṛtīkārau kramān netreṇa varmaṇā |
bhāṇḍasthasya yadājyasya darbhaiḥ prajvalitaiḥ purā || 5.113
sparśanaṃ viddhi saṃskāram adhiśrayaṇasaṃjñakam |
upādhiśrayaṇaṃ nāma yat tad drāvaṇam ucyate || 5.114
ājyasthālīm athādāya tvājyaṃ yat prāgdravīkṛtam |
tat tatra nikṣiped ājyabhāṇḍād doṣāpanuttaye || 5.115
pravādīkaraṇaṃ hy etaduccasthena kareṇa tu |
punar ādāya kṛtvāgre ādhāropari yat tataḥ || 5.116
darbhakāṇḍacatuṣkaṃ tu dvādaśāṅgulasammitam <dvādaśāṅgulasaṃmitam>|
tiryaguttānapāṇibhyām avaṣṭabhya ca sāntaram || 5.117
anāmāṅguṣṭhayugmena yathā madhyaṃ nataṃ bhavet |
tairājyaṃ caturo vārānānayec caturo nayet || 5.118
antarāntarayogena hy ātmano 'gnes tu sammukham <saṃmukham>|
praṇavenoktasaṅkhyena kuṇḍamadhye 'tha nikṣipet || 5.119
samplavotplavane <saṃplavotplavane> tv evaṃ kṛtvā dārbhaṃ pavitrakam |
vinikṣipec ca tanmadhye pavitrīkaraṇaṃ ca tat || 5.120
kuṇḍādulmukham ādāya jvalantaṃ dhūmavarjitam |
tenāvartaṃ sakṛdvipra tad vai nīrājanaṃ smṛtam || 5.121
nīrājīkṛtya tat paścāt kavacodaragaṃ smaret |
avakuṇṭhanam etad dhi tarjanyā yatpradakṣiṇam || 5.122
tejasā hṛdayasthena dṛggatenāvalokanam |
nirīkṣaṇam idaṃ vipra tatas tatropari smaret || 5.123
candramaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃ dhenumudrāsamanvitam |
mantraṃ vai saurabheyaṃ ca sphuradinduśataprabham || 5.124
tadantarasthaṃ mantreśaṃ himācalanibhaṃ smaret |
tatsrutair amṛtaughaiś ca śaśijair dhenujair api || 5.125
sarvasaṃskārasaṃyuktaṃ smared ājyaṃ ca bhāvitam |
amṛtīkaraṇaṃ nāma idaṃ te samprakāśitam <saṃprakāśitam> || 5.126
sruksruvāvatha cādāya darbhapuñjalikena <darbhapuṃjalikena> tu |
rajopanayanaṃ kuryāt prakṣālyoṣṇena vāriṇā || 5.127
nirmalīkṛtya kūrcena jvālābhissanpratapya ca |
prokṣayitvā 'rghyatoyena tāḍayed gandhapuṣpakaiḥ || 5.128
tadāprameyaṃ sruco jñātavyaṃ karmasiddhaye |
śatapatrātmanānanto muṣṭisto 'nantavaktradhṛk || 5.129
antarbījātmabhāvena sthitvā cordhvamukhaḥ punaḥ |
saptaskandhaṃ yad adhyātmaṃ bhūtaprāṇamarunmahat || 5.130
preritaṃ brahmarandhreṇa tat tadicchāvaśāt punaḥ |
saptapātālanāgaṃ ca agamat kṣmāmbujātmanā || 5.131
yadāśrayatyadhvavāhe tv amṛtātmā jalaṃ sthitaḥ |
sacakraracanājāle sthitas tejastrimūrtidhṛk || 5.132
śaṅkhavigrahadhṛgvāyurājyakośaṃ ca khaṃ tataḥ |
nirbījam ajam akṣobhyam ādyaṃ yasyādhidaivatam || 5.133
aparasmin sruve jñeyaṃ yathā jāyeta tacchṛṇu |
sākṣādmṛtamūrtir vai varuṇaḥ kalaśātmanā || 5.134
nālātmanā tadastraṃ ca saṃsthitaṃ vighnabhītihṛt |
jagadāpyāyakṛccandraḥ padmatvenāgradeśataḥ || 5.135
ānandākhyaṃ hi sāmarthyaṃ jñeyaṃ tatpārameśvaram |
satyabhūtam ameyaṃ ca prameyam idam ucyate || 5.136
saṃskārakāle tv āropya nityaṃ sanmantratarpaṇe |
svasaṃjñāpraṇavopetā namaskārapadānvitāḥ || 5.137
sarveṣām arcane viprāḥ ārādhya hṛdayena vā |
pūjayitvārghyagandhādyair nyastamantragaṇaṃ tataḥ || 5.138
bahuśākhair abhagnāgrais samūlais susamaiḥ kuśaiḥ |
caturbhir vāmahastena tvādāyātha pavitrakam || 5.139
dakṣiṇānāmikāyāṃ tu catuṣkāṇḍavinirmitam |
aṅgulīyakarūpaṃ ca kṛtvā vai tadanantaram || 5.140
saṃskṛtājyasya vipruḍbhis saṃspṛśed indhanādikam |
niśśeṣadoṣaśāntyartham athāgner āhṛtasya ca || 5.141
śataṃ śatārdhaṃ pādaṃ vā tv āhutīnāṃ svaśaktitaḥ |
tilānāṃ ghṛtasiktānāṃ śuddhena haviṣā saha || 5.142
hotavyaṃ karmasiddhyarthaṃ yathāvad avadhāraya |
āhutyām uddhṛtāyāṃ ca mūlamantrāvasānataḥ || 5.143
praṇavāntaṃ padaṃ brūyād agniṃ śodhaya śodhaya |
yathāvasthitarūpeṇa tatas tenaiva buddhimān || 5.144
dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ paścādghṛtena ca catuṣphalīm |
agner homo 'tha kartavyas sarvasaṃskārasiddhaye || 5.145
hṛdānalaṃ puṭīkṛtya karmanāma samuccaret |
sampādayāmi <saṃpādayāmi> svāhāntaṃ sarvakarmasvayaṃ kramaḥ || 5.146
ājyena siktaiḥ kusumais sarpiṣā vā dhiyā dvija |
garbhādhānādisaṃskārān kuryād dārāvasānakān || 5.147
śrīkukṣikuhare yad vai bahiṣṭhasya praveśanam |
garbhādhānaṃ tu tadviddhi saṃskāraṃ prathamaṃ mune || 5.148
prāṇayogāc ca yā śaktir vahniśrījaṭhare sthitā |
jaḍarūpā ca yā sūkṣmā tasyāścit prasaro hi yaḥ || 5.149
bhagavacchakticaitanyāsāmarthyāc ca śanaiś śanaiḥ |
smṛtvaivaṃ juhuyād ājyaṃ tanmantreṇoditena ca || 5.150
bhavet puṃsavanaṃ cāgneś cicchaktinayanāt tu vai |
sīmantākhyaṃ tu saṃskāram agnau kuryād anantaram || 5.151
avyaktāś ca tadantassthāś śiraḥpāṇyādayo 'khilāḥ |
svāṃ svāṃ vai karmasīmānaṃ prabuddhās saṃśrayanti ye || 5.152
vibhāgakalanāt teṣāṃ sīmantaṃ tadudāhṛtam |
agner vai jātakarmārthaṃ pūrvavad dhomayet sakṛt || 5.153
nissṛtasya ca vai garbhāj jātakaṃ tadudāhṛtam |
hiraṇyamadhusarpirbhyāṃ stanasamprāśanaṃ <stanasaṃprāśanaṃ> dvija || 5.154
kuryāt tadanu vai nāma jātasyāgneḥ prayatnataḥ |
vāsudevādināmnā vai prasiddhenāṅkayet tu tam || 5.155
evaṃ saṃskāraśuddhasya vaiṣṇavāgnaiḥ prayatnataḥ |
mantrānnadānaṃ pūrvaṃ yat tad annaprāśanaṃ bhavet || 5.156
śikhābandhaṃ yad agnes tu tac caulam iti cocyate |
yad agner homayed ājyaṃ tac copanayanaṃ smṛtam || 5.157
vedavrataṃ ca godānaṃ samāvartavivāhakau |
kṛtvānalasya jihvānāṃ bhāvayet saptakaṃ punaḥ || 5.158
navakhaṇḍe samindhāne kuṇḍe 'gnāv arciṣoddhṛte |
tathā dīptiprakāśā ca marīcis tāpinī tathā || 5.159
karālā lelihā caiva kuṇḍaṃ vyāpya vyavasthitāḥ |
īśapūrvāgnidigbhāge prabhādyaṃ tritayaṃ smṛtam || 5.160
rakṣovāruṇavāyavye marīcyādyaṃ trayaṃ tu tat |
udagdiṅmadhyato yāmye sthitaikā lelihābhidhā || 5.161
raktaṃ śvetaṃ tathā nīlaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ pītaṃ tathāruṇam |
saudāminīnibhaṃ dhyāyej jihvānāṃ saptakaṃ kramāt || 5.162
svasvabījais svasaṃjñair vā svabījair vā svanāmabhiḥ |
etair mantrair dvijaśreṣṭha bhāvayec ca yathākramam || 5.163
aṅgārāṇyarciṣaś caiva śaktir yā dahanātmikā |
trilakṣaṇo 'yam ādhāraḥ ādheyo hutabhugvibhuḥ || 5.164
ātmano 'gnes tu viśveśo vāsudevas sanātanaḥ |
evaṃ jñātvā purā samyak saktāṃ vaiśvānarīṃ parām || 5.165
ādheyolliṅgitākāraṃ dhvātvā kuṇḍagatānalam |
tajjanitrīṃ tataḥ kuṇḍāj jvālāmārgeṇa cāgatām || 5.166
parānandaprakāśābhāṃ nāsikyāṃ dvādaśāvadhi |
tato 'vatārayogena praviṣṭāṃ bhāvayed dhṛdi || 5.167
tasya saṃśuddhadehasya punar evaṃ samācaret |
sambodhajanakaṃ <saṃbodhajanakaṃ> homaṃ jaḍabhāvapraśāntidam || 5.168
uccārya mūlamantraṃ tu praṇavadvitayānvitam |
juhuyād āhutīnāṃ ca sahasraṃ śatam eva vā || 5.169
tadvadājyena santapya dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ tathā |
saṃskṛtasyātha vai vahneḥ pūjāṃ kuryāt tu bhaktitaḥ || 5.170
puṣpair dhūpena dadhnā ca tilair akṣatamiśritaiḥ |
annair bhakṣyaphalopetair ājyena kramaśo dvija || 5.171
sampūjyaivaṃ <saṃpūjyaivaṃ> vidhānena svamantreṇānalaṃ tataḥ |
tarpayeta yathāśakti tilājyādyair anukramāt || 5.172
ājyena vā kevalena sahasraśatasaṅkhyayā |
agneḥ pūrṇāhutiṃ datvā vauṣaḍantāṃ ghṛtena tu || 5.173
tataḥ pūjā prakartavyā devasyāgnes tu madhyataḥ |
pūrvavac ca smared vahniṃ sākāraṃ niṣkalaprabham || 5.174
svayogabalavīryeṇa vyāpakaṃ sarvadiggatam |
kadambakusumākāraṃ svaprabhābhir virājitam || 5.175
kuṇḍam āpūrayan sarvaṃ sarvākṛtyā tu sarvataḥ |
evaṃ hi vitato vyāpī nirākāras sudīptimān || 5.176
atha jvālājaṭādhāre vahner vai kuṇḍamadhyataḥ |
anusandhīyate buddhyā viṣṭaraṃ tu yathoditam || 5.177
tadarcanamadhaḥ kuryāt puṣpair dhūpais sacandanaiḥ |
mudrābandhaṃ tataḥ kuryāt pīṭhāmaragaṇasya ca || 5.178
tato 'vatārya tanmadhye hṛdayāptarameśvaram |
niraudakāt svamantreṇa dadyāt puṣpāñjaliṃ <puṣpāṃjaliṃ> vibhoḥ || 5.179
sāṅgaṃ <sāṃgaṃ> salāñchanaṃ <salāṃchanaṃ> dhyāyet sakalaṃ 
parameśvaram |
sāmmukhyaṃ <sāṃmukhyaṃ> sannidhānaṃ <saṃnidhānaṃ> ca
sannirodhanam <saṃnirodhanam> ācaret || 5.180
arghyapradānapūrvaṃ tu sarvaṃ kuryāt tu pūrvavat |
mūlabimbe yathā dhyānam agnimadhye tathā bhavet || 5.181
yānage yānagaṃ dhyāyed agnau sthāne yathāsthitam |
āsīne tv atha cāsīnaṃ śayāne ca tathāvidham || 5.182
padmarāgāruṇaśuciṃ smartavyamanalāspade |
mūlādisarvamantrāṇāṃ tattanmudrāḥ pradarśya ca || 5.183
arghyagandhādinābhyarcya pūjayet sakalaṃ prabhum |
layabhogātmanā samyak pūrvoktavidhinā tathā || 5.184
samidgaṇaṃ tu pātrasthaṃ kṛtvābhyarcya hṛdā tataḥ |
śirasāvanatenaiva vinivedya tataḥ prabhoḥ || 5.185
ājyenobhayatas siktaṃ brahmakṣīradrumodbhavam |
idhmāṣṭakaṃ samādāya dvidhā kṛtvā dvijottamaḥ || 5.186
nidhāya dakṣiṇasyāṃ ca madhya āgneyadiggatam |
viśrāntaṃ naiṛtapade uttarasyāṃ tathāparam || 5.187
vāyvīśapadasaṃruddhamāghārābhyantataḥ kṣipet |
idhmamūlād athākrāntam idhmedhmopari saṃsthitam || 5.188
sruvamājyena sampūrya <saṃpūrya> sūryabījena cintayet |
sahasrāṃśuṃ ca tanmadhye dadyāt kuṇḍasya dakṣiṇe || 5.189
aparasmin sruci dhyātvā somākhyenākṣareṇa tu |
pūrṇaṃ śaśāṅkabimbaṃ ca pradadyāt tata uttare || 5.190
saṅkhyānuguṇam <saṃkhyānuguṇam> idhmānāṃ ghṛtaṃ ca juhuyāt tu vai |
sūryasomātmakaṃ cāgner viddhi tallocanadvayam || 5.191
etayor antaraṃ yad vai tadagner vadanaṃ smṛtam |
tatra vai juhuyāt pūrvaṃ samidhāṃ saptakaṃ kramāt || 5.192
ghṛtasiktāṃ catussaṅkhyām ekaikāṃ hi supuṣkalām |
prākkuṅkumādinā liptāṃ kāṣṭhasaṃjñāṃ tu homayet || 5.193
sragdhūpamadhuparkaṃ ca bījānyājyaṃ yathākramam |
tatrānnasamidho dāne viśeṣo 'yaṃ vidhīyate || 5.194
sāditaṃ saṃskṛtāgnau prāk taṃ nidhāyāgrataś carum |
samudghāṭyāvalokyādau samprokṣyārghyāmbhasā < saṃprokṣyārghyāmbhasā> 
tataḥ || 5.195
darbhakāṇḍacatuṣkeṇa sāgninā tadanu spṛśet |
tanmadhye srukcatuṣkaṃ tu mantreṇājyasya nikṣipet || 5.196
athādāya srucaṃ tatra tadvad dadyāc catuṣṭayam |
caturaṅgulamānenāpy annagrāsamathācaret || 5.197
taṃ nidhāya sruvāgarbhe tadūrdhve pūrvavadghṛtam |
dadyād agnau catuṣkaṃ tu kṣiped annāhutiṃ tataḥ || 5.198
bhūyo 'gnau srukcatuṣkaṃ tv apy ājyasyāpādya yatnataḥ |
tato 'nnam ājyasaṃsiktaṃ prāgvatkṛtvāhutiṃ punaḥ || 5.199
dadyāt pūrvaprayogeṇa evam eva catuṣṭayam |
hutvāpy annāhutīnāṃ ca ājyākhyāṃ juhuyāt tataḥ || 5.200
tilair ghṛtasamāyuktair aṣṭottarasahasrakam |
śataṃ śatārdhaṃ pādaṃ vā yathāśakti samācaret || 5.201
ājyāktair akṣatais tadvattilaiś ca juhuyāt tataḥ |
ardham ardhāṃśasaṃyuktam adhikaṃ cāgravartinām || 5.202
japakāle tathā home kartavyaṃ siddhim icchatā |
sviṣṭakṛdbhavanaṃ kuryād annagrāsena vai sakṛt || 5.203
kāmyair avaśyaphaladair deśakālasamudbhavaiḥ |
tilair ghṛtena payasā dadhnā vā pāyasena tu || 5.204
siddhān naissādhitair bhakṣyair bījair lājaiś ca taṇḍulaiḥ |
mūlaiḥ phalaiḥ pallavaiś ca supraśastaiś ca komalaiḥ || 5.205
sugandhais sthalapadmādyaiḥ puṣpaiś caiva sitādikaiḥ |
guggulenājyamiśreṇa samyakchrīveṣṭakena vā || 5.206
dhātrīphalaiś ca sarasair utpalaiś ca śubhais tathā |
susitāsitaraktaiś ca padmair bilvais suśobhanaiḥ || 5.207
dūrvākāṇḍair abhagnāgrair dantisaddantanirmalaiḥ |
edhobhir brahmavṛkṣotthaiḥ kṣīradrumamayais tathā || 5.208
amṛtākṣīrasaṃyuktāṃ audumbaryo madhuplutāḥ |
acchinnāgrā hy abhagnāś ca kaṇṭakaiḥ parivarjitāḥ || 5.209
sarvāstrimadhuyuktāś ca ghṛtayuktās tu vā punaḥ |
yoktavyāny agnimadhye tu samidbhis saha sarvadā || 5.210
sarvāṇy annaviśeṣāṇi candanādīni yāny api |
sadantakāṣṭhaṃ tāmbūlam utkaṭakṣāravarjitam || 5.211
dāpyāni lakṣahome tu āsanādīni yāni ca |
madhulavaṇapānāṃsukaṭutailojjhitāni ca || 5.212
ājyayuktais tilaiś cāntissiddhayas sakalās tathā |
ghṛtena payasā dadhnā homas tṛptiṃ prayacchati || 5.213
pāyasena tu siddhānnair bhakṣyaiḥ puṣṭis sadā bhavet |
bījair dhānyais taṇḍulaiś ca tarpito mantrarāṭ dvija || 5.214
prayacchati sadā śreyaḥ prasannaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
pallavaiḥ phalamūlaiś ca homas tuṣṭiṃ prayacchati || 5.215
jahāti cāpamṛtyuṃ ca rogāṃś copaśamaṃ nayet |
tarpitas sthalapadmādyaiḥ puṣpaiś cānyais sitādikaiḥ || 5.216
saubhāgyamatulaṃ viprāḥ acirāt samprayacchati <saṃprayacchati> |
guggulājyair dvijārogyaṃ śubhair dhātrīphalais tathā || 5.217
śarkaraiḥ bilvaphalakaiḥ pañcagavyasamukṣitaiḥ <paṃcagavyasamukṣitaiḥ> |
ājyānnaiḥ padmabījaiś ca lakṣmīṃ śīghraṃ prayacchati || 5.218
utpalair vaśyakāmas tu bhogakāmas tu homayet |
dūrvāṅkuraiś ca homena āyuṣo vṛddhim āpnuyāt || 5.219
edhobhiś ca śubhair homo māṣaiś śāntipradaḥ prabhuḥ |
tilānāṃ śasyate homo hariṇānanamudrayā || 5.220
ghṛtasya kārṣiko homaḥ kṣīrasya ca viśeṣataḥ |
śuktimātrāhutir dadhnaḥ prasṛtiḥ pāyasasya vā || 5.221
grāsārdhamānam annānāṃ bhakṣyāṇāṃ svapramāṇataḥ |
sarveṣām eva bījānāṃ muṣṭinā homam ācaret || 5.222
agrāṅgulis tu lājānāṃ śālīnāṃ pañcakaṃ <paṃcakaṃ> hunet |
phalānāṃ svapramāṇaṃ ca pallavānāṃ tathaiva ca || 5.223
karkandhumātrā gulikā hotavyā guggulos sadā |
dhātrīphalapramāṇaṃ vā sambhave <saṃbhave> sati homayet || 5.224
dūrvākāṇḍāni viprendra caturaṣṭāṅgulāni vā |
samitprādeśamānena samacchedās tvaganvitāḥ || 5.225
agner varṇāś ca gandhāś ca śabdāś cākṛtayas tathā |
vikārā viśikhā caiva saṃvedyāḥ karmasiddhaye || 5.226
padmarāgadyutiḥ śreṣṭho lākṣālaktakasannibhaḥ saṃnibhaḥ> |
bālārkavarṇo hutabhuk jayārthaṃ śasyate dvija || 5.227
indrakopakasaṅkāśaś śoṇābho vātha pāvakaḥ|
cakracāpanibhaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ kuṅkumābhas tathaiva ca || 5.228
raktānāṃ puṣpajātīnāṃ varṇenāgnir ihocyate |
sugandho dravyagandho 'gnir ghṛtagandhaś ca śobhanaḥ || 5.229
āyurdaḥ padmagandhas syād bilvagandhaś ca suvrataḥ |
agragandho 'bhicāre tu vihitas sarvadānalaḥ || 5.230
jīmūtavallakīśaṅkhamṛdaṅgadhvanitulyakaḥ |
śabdo 'gnes siddhaye hetur ato 'nyas syād asiddhidaḥ || 5.231
raktābhas tu yadā vahniḥ kṣīṇārciḥ paridṛśyate |
padmarāgopalābhaś ca sphaṭikābhas tathā śubhaḥ || 5.232
yadrūpaṃ kathitaṃ pūrvaṃ yadi tasya pradakṣiṇam |
anyonyatvaṃ prapadyeta tadā siddhikaronalaḥ || 5.233
garvitena tu varṇena yadi kāpotakādinā |
parivartaṃ karoty agnis tathā vipra viparyayaḥ || 5.234
homānte tannimittaṃ vai homaṃ kuryāc chatādhikam |
viṣamā ca śikhā vahner udayāś ca śubhāvahāḥ || 5.235
hrasvāhrasvonnatā dīrghā jvālā siddhipradā smṛtā |
snigdhapradakṣiṇāvartaḥ śrutipracchāditadhvaniḥ || 5.236
sa nityam eva śubhakṛdyadanyair virjito guṇaiḥ |
pradīpte lelihāno 'gnau nirdhūme saguṇe tathā || 5.237
hṛdye tuṣṭoprade caiva hotavyaṃ śriyam icchatā |
alpatejo'lparūpaś ca viṣphuliṅgasamanvitaḥ || 5.238
jvālābhramavihīnaś ca kṛśānur naiva siddhidaḥ |
aprabuddhe sadhūme ca juhuyād yo hutāśane || 5.239
karmahānir bhavet tasya tvābhicārārdham aśnute |
durgandhaḥ pītavarṇaś ca avalīḍhaś ca yo 'śubhaḥ || 5.240
prabhāmūrtigato mantras tarpito yadi sattama |
vidyāṃ prayacchaty acirād dīptistho bhūpradaḥ prabhuḥ || 5.241
tāpayaty āśu śatrūṇāṃ prakāśoparyavasthayā |
śatrukṣayaṃ dadātyāśu marīcyāmūrdhvago vibhuḥ || 5.242
tāpinyāmūrdhvago mantras sarvaśāpopaśāntidaḥ |
vipakṣoccāṭanaṃ kuryāt karālāsaṃsthito hutaḥ || 5.243
lelihāvasthito mantro yadi santarpyate mune |
dadyād abhīpsite caiva dehānte paramaṃ padam || 5.244
svāhākāraṃ sadā home pūrṇāyāṃ vauṣaḍena ca |
tam eva śāntike kuryād vaṣaḍāpyāyane tathā || 5.245
svadhā pitṛkriyāyāṃ ca phaṭakāraṃ kṣayakarmaṇi |
vidveṣe huṃ vaśe strīṇāṃ namo mokṣaprasiddhaye || 5.246
karmahomāvasāne ca ghṛtenāpūrya sasrucam |
abhāvāc ca prabhūtena homadravyeṇa pūrayet || 5.247
tatropari ghṛtaṃ dadyāt tato 'rghyakusumādibhiḥ |
mūladeśāt samārabhya srucaṃ pūjya sruvānvitām || 5.248
ghṛtayuktaṃ tu tat dravyaṃ srucaḥ puṣkarakukṣigam |
dravaccandropamaṃ dhyāyet tataḥ pūrṇaṃ samuddharet || 5.249
srugdaṇḍe dehanābhau tu mūle saṃrudhya saṃsmaret |
niṣkalaṃ mantranāthaṃ tu pūrṇaśītāṃśuvigraham || 5.250
āmūlāc ca marucchaktyā proddharec ca svavigrahāt |
vidhāya ceśvarādhāre tasmād dhārāmṛtaṃ mahat || 5.251
nāsikāsandhimārgeṇa srukpadme patitaṃ smaret |
sāmṛtām ājyadhārāṃ ca vasudhārām iva kṣipet || 5.252
mukhamadhye tu mantrasya tadbrahmavivare 'tha vā |
hṛtpadmāntargatāṃ samyak praviṣṭām anubhāvayet || 5.253
tathā vai bṛṃhitaṃ mantraṃ dārayed brahmadhārayā |
tṛptaṃ puṣṭaṃ ca hṛṣṭaṃ ca tuṣṭaṃ vai sādhakopari || 5.254
mantroccārasametā vai śarīrakaraṇānvitā |
dhyānopetā dvijaśreṣṭha pūrṇeyaṃ parikīrtitā || 5.255
sarvasiddhikarī śaśvanmokṣalakṣmīvivardhanī |
bahuśuṣkendhane 'gnau ca hotavyaṃ karmasiddhaye || 5.256
ekānekaprayogāṇāṃ na tu karmaṇi karmaṇi |
tato 'rghyagandhapuṣpādyair mantranāthaṃ samarcayet || 5.257
mudrāḥ pradarśayet sarvā mūlamantrāditaḥ kramāt |
caturthāṃśena cāṅgānāṃ kuryān mūlasya tarpaṇāt || 5.258
lāñchanābharaṇānāṃ <lāṃchanābharaṇānāṃ> ca lakṣmyādīnāṃ 
tadardhataḥ |
atha vā hṛdayādīnāṃ tato 'rdhenākhilāsu ca || 5.259
parameśvarakāntāsu tadardhena dvijottama |
lāñchanābharaṇādīni <lāṃchanābharaṇādīni> sarvāṇi juhuyāt kramāt || 5.260
hṛdādisarvamantrāṇām ekaikaṃ juhuyāt tu vā |
visarjanaṃ tataḥ kuryād datvārghyaṃ dhūpasaṃyutam || 5.261
bhogasthānagatā mantrāḥ pūjitā ye yathākramam |
mukhyamantraśarīraṃ ca sampraviṣṭāṃś <saṃpraviṣṭāṃś> ca saṃsmaret || 5.262
jvālā jvālāntare yadvatsamudrasyaiva nimnagāḥ |
taṃ mantravigrahaṃ sthūlaṃ sarvamantrās padaṃ dvija || 5.263
praviṣṭaṃ bhāvayet sūkṣme adhyakṣe hṛdayātmake |
pare prāguktarūpaṃ tu taṃ sūkṣmam ubhayātmakam || 5.264
taṃ paraṃ prasphurad rūpaṃ nirādhārapadāśritam |
sandhimārgeṇa hṛtpadme sampraviṣṭaṃ <saṃpraviṣṭaṃ> tu bhāvayet || 5.265
mantramudrāsametena pūrakeṇa tu saptamam |
bhāsitaṃ bhāvayed dehaṃ tenāpādāc chiro 'vadhi || 5.266
praviṣṭena tu mantreṇa prayatnena vinā dvija |
vigrahaḥ kampate yasya mantras tasya prasīdati || 5.267
evaṃ visṛjya mantreśaṃ mudrābandhena vai saha |
sādhārāsanamantrāṇāṃ gaṇeśasya dvijottamāḥ || 5.268
gurvādīnāṃ tu vihitam ardhaṃ lācchanadarpaṇāt |
eteṣāṃ ca layaṃ vipra kuryāt sṛṣṭokrameṇa tu || 5.269
dvārsthāstrilokapālānāṃ vaprasthaharisevinām |
gurupūrvakramādittham ardham ardhaṃ yathākramam || 5.270
sakṛtsakṛtsvaśaktyā vā pūrṇā sarveṣv atha kṣipet |
viṣvaksenas tato bhaktyā tarpaṇīyas tilākṣataiḥ || 5.271
vauṣaḍantena mantreṇa dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ dvija |
pūjayitvā yathānyāyaṃ kuryāt tasya visarjanam || 5.272
