acchidrakaraṇīṃ pūrṇāṃ pūrṇāṃ mantreṇa pātayet || 5.273
sandarśayet tato vahner mudrāṃ mantrasamanvitām |
kuṇḍe puṣpāñjaliṃ <puṣpāṃjaliṃ> kṣiptvā vahnimantram anusmaran || 5.274
kṣāntvā caiva namaskṛtya yathāvidhi visṛjya tat |
samāghrāya nyaset koṣṭhe hy avatārakrameṇa tu || 5.275
sammārjya <saṃmārjya> sruksruvāv agnau srucaṃ nikṣipya cāmbhasā |
arghyapātrāt tu cāpūrya kuṇḍabāhye pradakṣiṇam || 5.276
kuryād īśānakoṇād vai acchidrodakadhārayā |
pavitrakeṇādha ūrdhve vinikṣipya kareṇa vā || 5.277
dadyāc chirasi vai śeṣaṃ sragadho vadanān nyaset |
ātmano vāmabhāge tu viṣṭarasravasaṃyutam || 5.278
apavāsya jalaṃ pātradvitayasthaṃ tadarcitam |
upasaṃhṛtya tu tathā bhasmanā tadanantaram || 5.279
jalanirmathitenaiva hy ūrdhvapuṇḍracatuṣṭayam |
hṛdyaṃsayor lalāṭe ca kuryād dīpaśikhākṛtim || 5.280
athārghyapātram ādāya gatvā bhagavato gṛham |
namaskuryāj jagannātham aṣṭāṅgapatanena tu || 5.281
āpūrya pāṇiyugalaṃ puṣpais tatropari sthitam |
saṃsmaronniṣkalaṃ mantram amṛtenopabṛṃhitam || 5.282
prabhūtadīpticchuritaṃ nikṣipen mantramūrdhani |
tarpito 'si vibho bhaktyā homenānalamadhyaga || 5.283
homadravyeṣu yadvīryaṃ tad idaṃ cātmasātkuru |
vinivedyaṃ vibhor homaṃ pūjāṃ kṛtvā yathāvidhi || 5.284
gṛhītaṃ bhāvayet tena prasannenāntarātmanā |
evaṃ samāpya homāntamarghyagandhādibhir vibhum || 5.285
