evamaṣṭāṅgayajanam anuyāgāntam ītritam |
antaḥkaraṇayāgādi yāvadātmanivedanam || 6.70
tadādyam aṅgayāgasya nāmnābhigamanaṃ mahat |
pūjanaṃ cārghyapuṣpādyair bhogair yadakhilaṃ mune || 6.71
bāhyopacārais tadviddhi bhogasaṃjñaṃ tu nārada |
madhvājyāt tena dadhnā ca pūjā ca paśunārcayā || 6.72
tattṛtīyaṃ hi yāgāṅgaṃ turyam annena pūjanam |
niveditasya yaddānaṃ pūrvoktavidhinā mune || 6.73
sampradānaṃ <saṃpradānaṃ> tu tannāma yāgāṅgaṃ pañcamaṃ <paṃcamaṃ> 
smṛtam |
vahnisantarpaṇaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ pitṛyāgas tu saptamam || 6.74
prāṇāgnihavanaṃ nāmnā tv anuyāgas tadaṣṭamam |
evamaṣṭāṅgasahitāṃ pūjāṃ kuryād yathāvidhi || 6.75
yatra dvādaśakālejyā kartavyābhūtivistarāt |
tatra prābhātikīṃ kuryāt pūjām aṣṭāṅgasaṃyutām || 6.76
aṅgadvayaṃ tu pāścāt yaṃ vinā ghātāṃ samāpya ca |
pit�ṇāṃ saṃvibhāgaṃ ca anuyāgaṃ yathoditam || 6.77
deśikas svejyayā kuryān nityaṃ mādhyandinārcane |
trikāleṣv ekam aṣṭāṅgaṃ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ cāvared dvayam || 6.78
yogārthināṃ ca svādhyāyaṃ bhogam aghyātmasaṃjñitam |
tattatkāleṣu kurvīta svādhyāyamadhunocyate || 6.79
aṣṭāṅgena namaskṛtya hy upaviśyāgrato vibhoḥ |
āgamādhyayanaṃ kuryāt tadvākyārthavicāraṇam || 6.80
prāpte 'tha sandhyāsamaye snātvā vā jaghanāvadhi |
kṣālayitvā tataḥ kuryād vāsasāṃ parivartanam || 6.81
sāyantanārcanaṃ kuryāt ṣaḍaṅgaṃ balipaścimam |
tattatkāleṣu kurvīta yathāśāstroditena ca || 6.82
japaṃ kṛtvā yathāśakti svāsādya śayanaṃ tataḥ |
samādhāya bahirdevaṃ nirālambapade sthitam || 6.83
aprayatnena vai tāvadanuruddhena cetasā |
saha tenaiva vai nidrā yāvadabhyeti sāmpratam <sāṃpratam> || 6.84
samutthāyārdharātre 'tha jitanidro jitaśramaḥ |
kamaṇḍalusthitenaiva samācamya tu vāriṇā || 6.85
guruṃ devaṃ namaskṛtya upaviśyājināsane |
yogābhyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryād yathāvidhi munīśvarāḥ || 6.86
samādhāyātmanātmānaṃ evaṃ tyaktvā japakriyām |
dhyātṛjñeyavibhāgena yāvattanmayatāṃ vrajet || 6.87
sadā saṃvedyanirmukte samādhau labhate sthitim |
abhyāsād bhagavadyogī brahma sampadyate <saṃpadyate> tadā || 6.88
tatra śramajayaṃ kuryāt tyaktvā dhyānāsane kramāt |
śayyāsanaṃ nivedyātha mūlamūrter anantaram || 6.89
lakṣmyādiśaktiyuktasya yāgamūrtigatasya ca |
tasmin nāropayed devaṃ sarvāṅgapariśobhite || 6.90
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathācāmaṃ parigrahasamanvitam |
datvā samālabhet paścāccandanādyanulepanaiḥ || 6.91
sugandhapuṣpamālyādiṃ dīpadhūpe nivedya ca |
bhakṣyāṇy apūpapūrvāṇi sakṣīrāṇi phalāni ca || 6.92
tarpaṇāmbhaś ca tāmbūlaṃ sāṅgaṃ sadgandhabhāvitam |
nivedya devadevāya vibhavānuguṇaṃ tataḥ || 6.93
sarvaṃ ca vinyaset paścāt tasmin karma kṛtaṃ ca yat |
tuṣṭaṃ gṛhītaṃ tatpūrṇaṃ bhāvayed dakṣiṇaṃ karam || 6.94
tanmadhye niṣkalaṃ mantraṃ sarvaṃ yatkiraṇākulam |
yogotthāṃ phalasampattiṃ <phalasaṃpattiṃ> lakṣmīrūpāṃ vicintayet || 6.95
mūlamantraṃ samuccārya pāṇimadhye tathā smaret |
bhūyaś ca niṣkalaṃ mantraṃ tasmād upari bhāvayet || 6.96
saśīrṣe jānunī bhūmau kṛtvā viṣṇor nivedayet |
prasādābhimukhenātha tena tac cātmasātkṛtam || 6.97
bhāvanīyaṃ dvijaśreṣṭhāḥ parituṣṭena cādarāt |
sannyāsaṃ <saṃnyāsaṃ> sañcayaṃ <saṃcayaṃ> vātha kṛtvā samyak tu tasya ca || 
6.98
mantrarūpānukāriṇyā mudraṇīyaṃ ca mudrayā |
phalārthaṃ prasavaṃ yena naiti sannyāsakāriṇām <saṃnyāsakāriṇām> || 6.99
phalaparyavasāne ca kāmam āgamacoditam |
bhartur no yujyate yena siddhādyais tu phalārthinām || 6.100
nityaṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ bimbaṃ vinā sthalajalādikān |
visarjanaṃ tataḥ kuryād datvārghyaṃ dhūpasaṃyutam || 6.101
bhogasthānagatā mantrāḥ pūjitā ye yathākramam |
mukhyamantraśarīraṃ tu sampraviṣṭāṃś <saṃpraviṣṭāṃś> ca saṃsmaret || 6.102
jvālā jvālāntare yadvatsamudrasyeva nimnagāḥ |
tanmantraṃ vigrahaṃ sthūlaṃ sarvamantrās padaṃ dvijāḥ || 6.103
praviṣṭaṃ bhāvayet sūkṣme hy adhyakṣe hy ubhayātmake |
pare prāguktarūpe tu taṃ sūkṣmam ubhayātmakam || 6.104
tasmāt paraṃ sphuradrūpaṃ nirādhārapadāśritam |
darpaṇaṃ darśayitvā tu nirmalaṃ tasya cāgrataḥ || 6.105
sandhimārgeṇa hṛtpadmaṃ sanpraviṣṭaṃ tu bhāvayet |
smṛtvā parātmanā taṃ ca svasaṃvidgagane hṛdi || 6.106
viśvāntaṃ bhāvayed devaṃ svabhāvena samanvitam |
karmārcādiṣu bimbeṣu ṣaṭsu nityādisiddhaye || 6.107
pratiṣṭhiteṣu vidhivannityaṃ prāgādike 'rcane |
tacchaktyā yojitāṃ śaktiṃ mūlabimbād yathāvidhi || 6.108
samabhyarcyārghyapuṣpādyaiḥ tāmbūlādyaiḥ puroditaiḥ |
punarāropayen mūle tatra tatra niyojitām || 6.109
pūjārthaṃ karmabimbādau nityanaimittikādiṣu |
prāpte tu tattatkarmādau mūlād āvāhya mantravit || 6.110
samāpya teṣu tatkarmāṇy ārabdhāni yathārthataḥ |
samāpya mūlabimbe tu tebhyas tatra visarjayet || 6.111
mantrānarghyādipātrasthān visṛjya prāgprayogataḥ |
śeṣam arghyādikaṃ sarvaṃ bhuktapūrveṇa vai saha || 6.112
pāṇinā toyapūtena viṣvaksenāya cārcya ca |
nyāsadvayaṃ ca saṃgṛhya <saṃgṛhya> manasā ca svavigrahāt || 6.113
niśśeṣasyopasaṃhāraṃ kuryād arghyādikasya ca |
yāgoddeśāt tathā kuṇḍāt starād yasyākhilasya ca || 6.114
sahopalepanenaiva sarvam ambhasi nikṣipet |
kavāṭabandhanaṃ kuryān mantraṃ kavacam uccaran || 6.115
niyojya tatra rakṣārthaṃ cakraṃ ca vihageśvaram |
svechayā tvāgato mantrī prātarutthāya pūrvavat || 6.116
yathoktaṃ sakalaṃ kuryāt prabodhayajanādikam |
sakṛttryahaṃ ca saptāhaṃ pakṣaṃ māsam athāpi vā || 6.117
yo yajed vidhinānena bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ |
so 'pi yāyāt paraṃ sthānaṃ kiṃ punar yo 'tra saṃsthitaḥ || 6.118
yāvajjīvāvadhiṃ kālaṃ baddhakakṣyo mahāmatiḥ ||

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
pitṛsaṃvibhāgādiśayanotsavāntavidhir nāma
ṣaṣṭho 'dhyāyaḥ


atha saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
bhagavanmuniśārdūla sarvaśāstraviśārada |
purā pradhānamūrter vai pūjanāt samanantaram || 7.1
prāṅkaṇeṣu ca sarveṣu prāsādeṣv āśrayeṣu ca |
pratiṣṭhitānāṃ bimbānāṃ pūjanaṃ samudīritam || 7.2
tatra śrībhvādidevīnāṃ pūjanaṃ tu viśeṣataḥ |
devarṣe śrotum icchāmo vistareṇa prakāśaya || 7.3

nāradaḥ
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayas sarve śrībhūdevyarcanaṃ param |
yena vijñātamātreṇa vāñchitān <vāṃchitān> labhate naraḥ || 7.4
bhoktṛśaktiḥ smṛtā lakṣmīḥ puṣṭir vai kartṛsaṃjñitā |
bhogārtham avatīrṇasya tasya lokānukampayā || 7.5
uditaṃ saha tenaiva śaktidvitayam avyayam |
nānātvena hi vai yasya pariṇāmaḥ prakāśitaḥ || 7.6
tatra śriyādidevīnāṃ rūpatrayam udāhṛtam |
śrīvatsagā yogalakṣmīr bhogalakṣmīs tu pārśvagā || 7.7
vīralakṣmīḥ pṛthaksthāne svātantryeṇa pratiṣṭhitā |
evam anyāsu devīṣu rūpatrayam udāhṛtam || 7.8
yogalakṣmībhogalakṣmyor devena saha pūjanam |
vīralakṣmīṃ pṛthaggehe pūjayeta yathāvidhi || 7.9
yatra sā pūjyate devī tatra śrīr niścalā bhavet |
tadvidhānaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 7.10
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇe 'pi vā |
tṛtīyāvaraṇādau vā śriyaḥ sthānaṃ prakalpayet || 7.11
tuṣṭiṃ puṣṭiṃ ca sāvitrīṃ vāgdevīṃ ca munīśvarāḥ |
tadvimānacaturdikṣu diṅmūrtīḥ parikalpayet || 7.12
koṇeṣu vainateyaṃ vā siṃhaṃ vāpi yathāruci |
tadantarbrahmabhāge tu divye vā sthāpayet śriyam || 7.13
caturbhujām udārāṅgīṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutām |
padmāsanenopaviṣṭāṃ padmapatrāyatekṣaṇām || 7.14
mukhyābhyāñ caiva hastābhyāṃ abhītivaradāyinīm |
jaghanyābhyāṃ tu hastābhyāṃ divyapaṅkajadhāriṇīm || 7.15
trikālam arcayed devīṃ tanmantreṇa dvijottamāḥ |
praṇavaṃ pūrvam uddhṛtya śrībījaṃ tadanantaram || 7.16
śriyai namaṣṣaḍarṇo 'yaṃ mantras sarvārthasiddhidaḥ |
śrāṃ śrīṃ śrūṃ śraiṃ śrauṃ śra iti yojayed dhṛdayādibhiḥ || 7.17
mantreṇānena vai pūrvaṃ snātvā deśikasattamaḥ |
prakṣālya pāṇipādau ca tvācamya ca yathāvidhi || 7.18
prāsādaṃ sampraviśyātha <saṃpraviśyātha> kuryāt sarvaṃ yathocitam |
svāsane sukham āsīnaḥ prāṅmukho vāpy udaṅmukhaḥ || 7.19
karaśuddhiṃ ca digbandhaṃ prāṇāyāmaṃ samāpya ca |
dhāraṇādvitayenātha śodhayitvā nijaṃ vapuḥ || 7.20
śrīmantraṃ tu tatas sāṅgaṃ haste dehe ca vinyaset |
kirīṭaṃ vanamālāṃ ca kamaladvayam eva ca || 7.21
hastādau pūrvavan nyasya badhvā vai padmamudrikām |
tādātmyam avalambyātha hṛdayāmbhoruhodare || 7.22
svānandadhāmaniṣṭhasya devasya paramātmanaḥ |
śrīvatsāt tu śriyaṃ devīṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutām || 7.23
avatāryāmṛtair bhogair japāntaṃ prāgvad arcayet |
tato bahiryajed devīṃ prāguktair bhogasañcayaiḥ <bhogasaṃcayaiḥ> || 7.24
tadarthaṃ kalpayet prāgvadarghyādyaṃ pātrapañcakam <pātrapaṃcakam> |
prāgvatsvadehavinyastān mantrānabhyarcya mantravit || 7.25
arghyādyair dhūpaparyantair dvārayāgam athācaret |
vāstvīśaṃ kṣetranāthaṃ ca dvāralakṣmīṃ tathaiva ca || 7.26
caṇḍīṃ caiva pracaṇḍīṃ ca garbhadvārasya pārśvayoḥ |
samabhyarcya vimānasya pūjanaṃ ca samācaret || 7.27
lokādhvatatvavinyāsaṃ prāgvad eva samācaret |
devattānyasane tv eṣa viśeṣaḥ śrūyatām iha || 7.28
yajen masūrakādhāre dharmādyaṃ yaccatuṣṭayam |
mūrtayo vāsudevādyāḥ keśavādyāś ca mūrtayaḥ || 7.29
padmanābhādayaś cāpi yatra pūjyā munīśvarāḥ |
tattacchaktīs tatra tatra yajet tān eva vā kramāt || 7.30
yad vā tacchaktibhis sārdhaṃ pūjayet tān yathākramam |
lakṣmīḥ kīrtir jayā māyā vyūhaśaktaya īritāḥ || 7.31
śrīś ca vāgīśvarī kāntikriyāśaktibibhūtayaḥ |
icchā prītī ratiś caiva māyā dhīr mahimeti ca || 7.32
śaktayaḥ keśavādīnāṃ krameṇa parikīrtitāḥ |
dhīs tārā vāruṇī śaktiḥ padmā vidyā tathaiva ca || 7.33
sāṅkhyā viśvā khagā bhūr gaur lakṣmīr vāgīśvarī tathā |
amṛtā hariṇī chāyā nārasiṃhī tathā sudhā || 7.34
śrīkāntivīrāḥ kāmā ca satyā śāntissaroruhā |
mayā padmāsanā kharvā vikrāntir narasambhavā <narasaṃbhavā> || 7.35
nārāyaṇī hariprītir gāndhārī kāśyapī tathā |
vaidehī vedavidyā ca padminī nāgaśāyinī || 7.36
triṃśac cāṣṭāvimā devyaḥ padmanābhādiśaktayaḥ |
yatrānyā bhagavanmūrtiḥ puṇyā tatra śriyaṃ yajet || 7.37
anyān vimānadevāṃs tu pūrvoktān eva pūjayet |
vimānasya caturdikṣu kalpitāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ || 7.38
tuṣṭiṃ puṣṭiṃ ca sāvitrīṃ vāgdevīṃ ca samarcayet |
athāgramaṇḍapadvāre dakṣiṇe tu balākinī || 7.39
vanamālinyudagbhāge pūjanīye krameṇa tu |
kṛtvaivaṃ dvārayāgaṃ tu kalpayed āsanaṃ tataḥ || 7.40
sarvādhāram ayaṃ devaṃ pīṭhasyādhaḥ phaṇīśvaram |
tatkoṇeṣu ca dharmādīṃs tadūrdhve vyaktapaṅkajam || 7.41
yāmatrayaṃ tatas tasmin yajed arghyādibhiḥ kramāt |
gaṇanāthādikāṃś cātha samabhyarcya yathāvidhi || 7.42
tataḥ śriyaṃ samāvāhya mantrany āsādikaṃ caret |
sannidhānādikaṃ <saṃnidhānādikaṃ> kṛtvā padmamudrāṃ pradarśayet || 7.43
mantrān vigrahavinyastān layoktavidhinārcayet |
bhogayāgaś ca kartavyaḥ padmapīṭhatalopari || 7.44
prāgādipadmapatreṣu hṛdayādīni pūrvavat |
vidigdaleṣu caivāstraṃ netraṃ kesarajālakam || 7.45
pīṭhopari dalād bāhye tvāgneyeśānakoṇayoḥ |
kirīṭaṃ vanamālāṃ ca yātuvāyavyakoṇayoḥ || 7.46
kamaladvitayaṃ cāpi vinyaset tadanantaram |
tato dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ dvijasattamāḥ || 7.47
abhyantare vimānasya divye sarasijāsane |
padmāsanenopaviṣṭāṃ phullapadmodaraprabhām || 7.48
sarvalakṣaṇasampannāṃ <sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannāṃ>
sarvālaṅkārabhūṣitām < sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitām > |
caladdvirephapaṭalasamākrāntālakāvalim || 7.49
vilasadratnasvacitakirīṭapariśobhitām |
ardhacandralalāṭastharājamānalalāṭikām || 7.50
prabuddhotpalavistīrṇalocanāṃ susmitānanām |
kaṭākṣaiḥ karuṇāpūrṇair jagadāpyāyakāriṇīm || 7.51
darpaṇodarasaṅkāśavilasadgaṇḍamaṇḍalām |
prasphurannāsikāvaṃśamauktikāṃ bhrūlatojvalām || 7.52
muktāphalābharadanāṃ vilasadvidrumādharām |
ratnatāṭaṅkavilasatkarṇadvayamanoharām || 7.53
pūrṇacandrapratīkāśavadanāṃ kambukandharām |
ratnagraivaiyakopetāṃ māṅgalyamaṇibhūṣitām || 7.54
caturbhujāṃ pīvarāṃsāṃ muktāhāraiś ca bhūṣitām |
sukarkaśadṛḍhottuṅgapīnavṛttadhanastanīm || 7.55
vicitrakañcukenāḍhyāṃ <vicitrakaṃcukenāḍhyāṃ> nānābhūṣāvibhūṣitām |
mukhyadakṣiṇahastena bhītānām abhayapradām || 7.56
savyena pāṇipadmena śritānāṃ varadāyinīm |
paścāddakṣiṇahastena padmakuṭmaladhāriṇīm || 7.57
tathāvidhena vāmena dadhānāṃ phullapaṅkajam |
maṇikaṅkaṇakeyūranānāratnāṅgulīyakaiḥ || 7.58
maṇḍitāṃ divyavasanāṃ mekhalādyair alaṅkṛtām |
gambhīranābhiṃ trivalīvibhūṣitatanūdarām || 7.59
vicitramaṇimañjīravilasatpādapallavām <vicitramaṇimaṃjīravilasatpādapallavām> |
divyagandhānuliptāṅgīṃ <divyagandhānuliptāṃgīṃ> divyamālyavibhūṣitām || 
7.60
pūrṇendvayutatulyābhāṃ saundaryāmṛtavāridhim |
vīralakṣmīm imāṃ dhyāyet sarvābhīṣṭapradāyinīm || 7.61
evaṃ dhyātvā śriyaṃ devīṃ hṛdayādīṃś ca pūrvavat |
kirīṭaṃ vanamālāṃ ca tathaiva kamaladvayam || 7.62
dhyātvātha pūjanaṃ kuryād āsanādyair yathoditaiḥ |
catuṣṣaṣṭyupapacārair vā dvātriṃśadbhis tu vā dvijāḥ || 7.63
havir nivedayed devyai pṛthak devārpitaṃ tu vā ||
japāntaṃ pūjayed devīṃ homāntaṃ vā yathāvidhi || 7.64
pāratantryād baliṃ tatra kadāpi na samācaret |
mūlālayārcayā sārdhaṃ tasyā deśikasattamaiḥ || 7.65
pavitrārohaṇaṃ kāryam aṅgatvenādhivāsitaiḥ |
tajjanmarkṣādike kuryāt snapanañ cotsavādikam || 7.66
pāratantrye 'pi vai lakṣmyā navarātriṣu cotsavam |
aṅkurārpaṇapūrvaṃ tu rakṣābandhapurassaram || 7.67
catuḥsthānārcanayutaṃ kuryād rāṣṭrābhivṛddhaye |
balidānaṃ dhvajārohaṃ tīrthaṃ tatra vivarjayet || 7.68
pāratantrye vidhirayaṃ svātantrye tūcyate adhunā |
grāme vā nagare vāpi parvate vā nadīpaṭe || 7.69
saprākāraṃ śriyaḥ sthānaṃ savimānaṃ prakalpayet |
tatra śriyaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya tanmantreṇa yathāvidhi || 7.70
śrīvatsād devadevasya śriyaṃ bimbahṛdambuje |
samāvāhya tu mantreṇa sāṅgena sakalīkriyām || 7.71
kṛtvā sampūjayed <saṃpūjayed> devīṃ bhogais tu havirantimaiḥ |
atha śriyaṃ tv agnimadhye prīṇayet samidādibhiḥ || 7.72
saṃskṛtya vidhivatkuṇḍaṃ vahnim utpāditaṃ tathā |
saṃskṛtājyasya vipruḍbhis saṃspṛśed indhanādikam || 7.73
santarpaṇaṃ tathāgneś ca tasmin mantrāsanādikam |
tanmadhye hṛdayād devīṃ samāvāhya yathāvidhi || 7.74
samidbhiś cāpi nityābhiḥ kāmyaiś ca juhuyāt tathā |
sviṣṭakṛddhavanaṃ cātha prāyaścittāhutiṃ tv api || 7.75
pūrṇāhutyādikaṃ kṛtvā tato lakṣmīṃ hṛdambuje |
visṛjya parivārāṇāṃ homaṃ kṛtvā yathāvidhi || 7.76
praviśya tu tato devyā mandiraṃ yajanāspadam |
samarpaṇaṃ ca homasya pit�ṇāṃ tarpaṇaṃ tv api || 7.77
balidānaṃ ca bhūtānām iṣṭaśiṣṭajanasya ca |
pradānaṃ yajñaśīlānāṃ kārūṇāṃ bhāvitātmanām || 7.78
anuyāgaṃ ca vidhivan naivedyaprāśanādikam |
pūrvavatsakalaṃ kuryād bhogamokṣaprasiddhaye || 7.79
atraivaṃ balidānādau parivārārcanakramaḥ |
prathamāvaraṇe pūjyāḥ prāgādau kumudādikāḥ || 7.80
vibhīṣikāṃ śāṅkarīṃ ca yajet taddvārapārśvayoḥ |
dvitīyāvaraṇe paścādupendrādīn prapūjayet || 7.81
taddvārapārśvayoś caiva śaṅkhapadmanidhī yajet |
tṛtīyāvaraṇe paścādindrādīn paripūjayet || 7.82
taddvārapārśvayoḥ pūjyau nalakūbarajṛmbhalau |
caturthāvaraṇe caiva vajrādīn paripūjayet || 7.83
taddvāradakṣiṇe pārśve śibikuṇḍalam arcayet |
uttare maṇibhadraṃ ca pañcamāvaraṇe <paṃcamāvaraṇe> tataḥ || 7.84
lohitākṣādikān iṣṭvā tatas taddvārapārśvayoḥ |
jayāṃ a vijayāṃ caiva pūjayet tu yathākramam || 7.85
mahāpīṭhe tu vidhivat kumudādīn samarcayet |
sumukhīṃ pūjayed viṣvaksenasthāne caturbhujām || 7.86
vetrahastāṃ dakṣiṇena tarjanīṃ cāpi bibhratīm |
paścāddakṣiṇahastābhyāṃ dadhānāṃ paṅkajadvayam || 7.87
evaṃ sarvaparīvārān balidānādibhir yajet |
pavitrārohaṇādīni pṛthakkuryād yathāvidhi || 7.88
guruḍadhvajam āropya kuryāc caiva mahotsavam |
catussthānārcanādīni śrīmantreṇa samācaret || 7.89
evamukto muniśreṣṭhāḥ śryādidevyarcanakramaḥ |
evaṃ puṣṭyādidevīś ca pūjayet svasvamantrataḥ || 7.90

munayaḥ
bhagavan sarvaśāstrajña śaraṇāgatavatsala |
śrutaṃ śriyādyarcanaṃ tu tvatto 'smābhir munīśvara || 7.91
sudarśanārcanaṃ tv adya vaktum arhasi naḥ prabho |

nāradaḥ
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayas sarve sāvadhānena cetasā || 7.92
saudarśanārcanavidhimaihikāmuṣmikapradam |
saudarśanīyā mantrāś ca mūrtayaś cāpy anekāghā || 7.93
tatrābhimatamantreṇa mūrti cābhimatāṃ yajet |
divyādyāyatane citre prāṅgaṇādau <prāṃgaṇādau> tu kutracit || 7.94
grāmādau tu nadītīre vipine parvate 'pi vā |
prāsādaṃ maṇḍapaṃ vātha sacitraṃ sarvatomukham || 7.95
prāṅmukhaṃ vāpi kurvīta sagavākṣakavāṭakam |
ekāditalasaṃyuktaṃ cakralāñchanalāñchitam <cakralāṃchanalāṃchitam> || 7.96
mukhabhadrasamopetam ārohaṇasamanvitam |
saprākāraṃ samāsādya prāsādābhyantare tathā || 7.97
bimbaṃ saudarśanaṃ tatra pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi |
yajetrikālaṃ prayato deśikas tasya mantrataḥ || 7.98
tatrādhivyādhidurbhikṣabhūtavetāladurgrahāḥ |
na bādhante janān sarvān śubhaṃ bhavati nityaśaḥ || 7.99
tatrārcanavidhānaṃ tu śṛṇudhvaṃ mantrapūrvakam |
sugupte bhūtale śuddhe varṇacakraṃ paristaret || 7.100
akārādi kṣakārāntaṃ sarvārṇamayarūpiṇam |
svakṣanābhyaranemībhiḥ prathībhiś cāpy alaṅkṛtam || 7.101
kāraṇaṃ sarvamantrāṇāṃ kṣetre praṇavam ālikhet |
akārādyā visargāntāḥ svarā nābhyaṅgam <nābhyaṃgam> āśritāḥ || 7.102
kakārādīni bhāntāni tadarāṇāṃ triraṣṭake |
mādihāntāni nemau tu kṣārṇaṃ pradhigaṇe sthitam || 7.103
śabdabrahmam ayaṃ cakraṃ purā varṇagaṇaṃ tataḥ |
praṇavādyair namo'ntaiś ca saṃjñābhiḥ kramaśastataḥ || 7.104
vinyastamātṛyantraṃ svaṃ deśiko vidhivad guruḥ |
samabhyarcyārghyapuṣpādyair mātṛkāmantravigraham || 7.105
tatas samuddharen mantrān sarvābhimatasidhidān |
jetuṃ śaktyātmanā yā tu sṛṣṭisthitilayonmukhī || 7.106
kriyāśaktis samuddiṣṭā sukalpajananī purā |
kālarūpam adhiṣṭhāya tayaitadbṛṃhitaṃ jagat || 7.107
kālacakraṃ jagaccakraṃ tatmātsaudarśanaṃ vapuḥ |
tamadhiṣṭhāya sā śaktir jīvabhūtā vyavasthitā || 7.108
vinākṛtaṃ tayā sarvam asatkalpam idaṃ bhavet |
tasmāt samuddharec śaktim agniṣṭomasamaprabhām || 7.109
akṣādhārāṃ tu vai nityām anādyantāṃ ca vaiṣṇavīm |
pūrvaṃ nemyantimadvandvaṃ tadādyaṃ sānaladvayam || 7.110
nābhituryāntimadvābhyāṃ piṇḍam etadalaṅkṛtam |
saudarśanamahāśaktiḥ sarvasiddhipradāyinī || 7.111
jīvabhūtā ṣaḍarṇasya prakāśānandarūpiṇī |
hṛdayādyaṅgasiddhyarthaṃ piṇḍam etat svarojjhitaiḥ || 7.112
dīrghair ādyais tribhiś cāntyair bhedayen netrapaścimam |
praṇavādīni caitāni turyāntair hṛdayādibhiḥ || 7.113
namassvāhāvaṣaḍḍhuṃphaḍvauṣadbhir jātibhis saha |
kramān niyojanīyāni vijñānādiguṇais saha || 7.114
śakteḥ prakṛtirūpasya ṣaḍarṇasyoddhṛtis tv atha |
pūrvavatsamupāhṛtya cāntimadvayam antimam || 7.115
tatrāṣṭamaṃsatṛtīyam asyāṃ yāntyantato 'ntimam |
sapañcamasvarāntaṃ <sapaṃcamasvarāntaṃ> ca kuryān nemyādyabhūṣitam || 
7.116
paścādekādaśārārṇayuktaṃ taddviguṇāragam |
anyārṇam avimuktaṃ tu kuryāt tatpañcaṣaṣṭhayoḥ <tatpaṃcaṣaṣṭhayoḥ> || 7.117
ayaṃ saudarśano mantraḥ ṣaḍarṇaḥ amudīritaḥ |
tṛtīyaḥ pañcamaḥ <paṃcamaḥ> ṣaṣṭhaḥ pratyekaṃ tryakṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ || 7.118
anye varṇasamopetā varṇāḥ syur dvyakṣarāstrayaḥ |
eṣa kālātmano viṣṇor viśvarūpasya vācakaḥ || 7.119
satārayā ca śaktyā ca hy aṣṭārṇaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
kṣetrakṣetrajñayuktyā tu yathā prakṛtigaḥ pumān || 7.120
sthūlasūkṣmātmako dhyeyas tathā saudarśano hariḥ |
darśanaṃ paratattvasya stāttadākhyānadarśanam || 7.121
tanniṣṭhānām idaṃ nityam ajñānatimirāpaham |
chinatti saṃśayaṃ teṣāṃ sadupāyapravṛttaye || 7.122
rūpāntaram idaṃ tasya saṃśayacchedakāraṇam |
nūnaṃ varṇāśramācāraniṣṭhānāmānaneṣu tu || 7.123
chinatti dūṣakān jantūn svakavidyāprabhāvataḥ |
lāñchitānāmanenāśu <lāṃchitānāmanenāśu> bhaktānāṃ bhāvitātmanām || 
7.124
karastho vijayas tu syād iha loke paratra ca |
kiṃ punar viṣaye yatra sthāpite pūjite sati || 7.125
lakṣaṇaṃ hṛdayādīnāṃ mantrāṇāṃ tūcyate 'dhunā |
prāg eva hṛdayādīnāṃ mantrārṇāni yathākramam || 7.126
vinyased bījabhūtāni tārānte vindunā tataḥ |
avisūnāṃ kramādante yathā sūryākṣaradvayāt || 7.127
mahāsudarśanajvālāpadayor antime 'pi ca |
cakrāyeti padaṃ ṣoḍhā śiro'nte yojayet kramāt || 7.128
vijñānādiguṇopetais turyāntair hṛdayādibhiḥ |
namassvāhādinetrāntaiḥ prāguktavidhinā likhet || 7.129
dhyeyāny ākārapattīni bhogasthāneṣu mūlavat |
varṇabhūṣaṇavastrāstrabhujasaṃsthānaceṣṭitaiḥ || 7.130
jñātvaivaṃ mantramāhātmyaṃ yo 'rcayed vidhipūrvakam |
digbandhavahniprākāragāyatryāvāhanādikaiḥ || 7.131
yāgopakaraṇair mantrair bhogadānavivarjitaiḥ |
kramāt sarvaphalāvāptir mantrasiddhiś ca jāyate || 7.132
daśadigbandhamantrāṇāṃ vakṣyate lakṣaṇaṃ purā |
oṃpūrvaṃ puruṣāyeti svāhāntaṃ tadanantaram || 7.133
astreṇa bandhayāmīti svāhāntaṃ ca ṣaḍakṣaram |
iti digbandhamantro 'yam īrito duṣṭadoṣahṛt || 7.134
praṇavaṃ prāk samuddhṛtya manuvā *gnijāyayoḥ |
āyāntaṃ vinyasec cakram agniprākārasaṃjñakam || 7.135
kīrtitaṃ cakragāyatrīṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munisattamāḥ |
jātipūrvaṃ puraskṛtya cakrāyeti samuddharet || 7.136
dvitīyaṃ viṣṇugāyatryā nṛsūktādyakṣaratrayam |
netrābhyāṃ padam ādāya nemipūrvāntaṃyojitam || 7.137
dhīmahīti tadante no viniveśyo nivāritaḥ |
gāyatryantaṃ samuddhāryaṃ tadante caturakṣaram || 7.138
saudarśanī samudiṣṭā gāyatrī tārakākṣarā |
satārakā purā ceyaṃ bhaved ekākṣarādhikā || 7.139
atha mantratrayaṃ vakṣye sāmānyaṃ sarvapūjane |
tāradvayaṃ puroddhṛtya paramaṃ padam uddharet || 7.140
yāmyety avasthitaṃ cātha nemyādyaṃ dvinavārakam |
dvidaśāraṃ gataṃ varṇaṃ nābhipañcamamūrdhani <nābhipaṃcamamūrdhani> || 
7.141
tatas tu gṛhakāmyāyo iti pañcārṇam <paṃcārṇam> uddharet |
yutaṃ nemidvitīyena dvinavāraṃ gataṃ tataḥ || 7.142
ṣoḍaśāraṃ gataṃ varṇaṃ dvitīyasvarasaṃyutam |
nemipañcamavarṇaṃ <nemipaṃcamavarṇaṃ> ca ṣoḍaśāraṃ gataṃ punaḥ || 7.143
tṛtīyadvārasaṃyuktaṃ tṛtīyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt |
nemyantamāsvaropetamarāntaś ca svarāntaram || 7.144
nemyādyaṃ ṣoḍaśārasthaṃ nemyaṣṭam amikāragam |
nyūnaviṃśāragordhvaṃ tu dvinavākṣaramūrdhani || 7.145
svaraṃ tṛtīyaṃ saṃyojya tataś ca dvinavāragam |
punarmantraśarīreti praṇavāntaṃ tato namaḥ || 7.146
punaś ca namasā yukto mantra ābāhanocitaḥ |
pradāne sarvabhogānāṃ mantroyaṃ samprakāśyate <saṃprakāśyate> || 7.147
praṇavaṃ pūrvam uccārya sarvabhogaikakāraṇam |
nemyantaṃ bindusaṃyuktaṃ tridhedaṃ padam apy atha || 7.148
gṛhāṇeti śiro'nto 'yaṃ bhogadānasya vācakaḥ |
āvāhane tathārcāyāṃ visarjanavidhau tathā || 7.149
praṇavaṃ pūrvam uddhṛtya sambodhya <saṃbodhya> bhagavann iti |
mantramūrte padaṃ dadyāt svapadaṃ ca dvitīyayā || 7.150
āsādaya kṣamasveti praṇavāntaṃ samuddharet |
sudarśanārcanārthaṃ tu mantrās tv evaṃ mayoditāḥ || 7.151
ihārcanavidhānaṃ tu pravakṣyāmi munīśvarāḥ |
prāgvatsnānādikaṃ kṛtvā praviśya yajanālayam || 7.152
prakṣālya pādāvācamya sottarīyaḥ svalaṅkṛtaḥ |
dhṛtordhvapuṇḍraḥ kusumair dvārsthānarbhyarcya pūrvavat || 7.153
kavāṭoddhātanaṃ kṛtvā praviśyābhyantare vibhum |
praṇipatya ca gāyatryā pāṇiprakṣālanādikam || 7.154
arcāyāṃ viṣṭare yantre kṛtvā mārgatrayaṃ tataḥ |
prāsādaṃ śodhayitvāsya purataḥ phalakādike || 7.155
prokṣite cāstramantreṇa sammukhaṃ <saṃmukhaṃ> rucirāsane |
samāsīnassvapārśvasthayājñīyaṃ cādhivāsanam || 7.156
karaśuddhiṃ sthānaśuddhiṃ kṛtvāstreṇa yathāpuram |
pāṇibhyām uktamantreṇa saṃyuktenāstramudrayā || 7.157
pūjāsthānagatān vighnān bāhyato dṛśyavigrahān |
virecya bandhanaṃ kuryād dikṣu caiva vidikṣu ca || 7.158
kavacenāvakuṇṭhyātha prāṇānāyamya pūrvavat |
bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā mantranyāsam athācaret || 7.159
akārādikṣakārāntaṃ mātṛkāṃ mantramātaram |
vinyaset karayoḥ pūrvaṃ vigrahe cakram āplavan || 7.160
kṛtvaiva vyāpakanyāsam ādityātapasaprabham |
dakṣetarakrameṇaiva śākhāsu talayor api || 7.161
aṅguṣṭhādikaniṣṭāntam ekaikasyāś catuś catuḥ |
evaṃ dvāviṃśakaṃ nyasya talayor daśakaṃ tataḥ || 7.162
madhye ca vicatuṣke ca pañcakaṃ pañcakaṃ <paṃcakaṃ paṃcakaṃ> tathā |
praṇavadvayamadhyasthān evaṃ nyasya karadvaye || 7.163
vyāpakanyāsapūrvaṃ tu svaśarīre 'pi vinyaset |
mūrdhnaḥ pādatalaṃ yāvatpāṇibhyāṃ tapanāṃśuvat || 7.164
vyāpayitvā tato nyāsaṃ pṛthag eva samācaret |
keśānte vaktravṛtte ca netrayoḥ śravaṇadvaye || 7.165
ghrāṇarandhradvaye gaṇḍadvaye dakṣetarakramāt |
uttarādharayogena dantayos tacchadadvaye || 7.166
mūrdhnaṃ nyaset svarān anyān savisargān anantaram |
kavargaṃ dakṣiṇe bāhau sandhipañcagataṃ <saṃdhipaṃcagataṃ> kramāt || 7.167
vāme tathā cavargaṃ ca pādayor dakṣiṇāditaḥ |
sandhigau ṭatavargau ca pūrvavattūbhapārśvayoḥ || 7.168
pṛṣṭhe nābhau ca hṛdaye pavargaṃ dhātusaptake |
yādisāntāni varṇāni hakāraṃ hṛdayāntare || 7.169
kṣakāraṃ hṛdayākāśe nyasyaivaṃ mātṛkāṃ purā |
tataḥ śaktyā ṣaḍarṇaṃ tu nyaset karaśarīragam || 7.170
karanyāsaṃ purā kuryāt tacchṛṇudhvaṃ munīśvarāḥ |
puṭīkṛtena tārābhyāṃ mantreṇaiva saśaktinā || 7.171
nakhāntaṃ maṇibandhādi prāgvatpāṇidvayaṃ mṛjet |
ādyante tāraśaktyādyaiḥ śaktivarṇais sabindukaiḥ || 7.172
aṅguṣṭhādikaniṣṭhāntaṃ tyaktvā madhyamaparvasu |
vinyaset karajāgreṣu caramaṃ varṇam eva ca || 7.173
evamarṇāni vinyasya hṛdayādīni vinyaset |
mūlāgraparvasv aṅgāni varṇanyāsakrameṇa tu || 7.174
pāṇibhyām ālabhed deham āmūrdhnaś caraṇāvadhi |
kṛtvaivaṃ vyāpakanyāsam aṅganyāsaṃ samācaret || 7.175
mūrdhni vaktre ca hṛdaye nābhau guhye ca pādayoḥ |
pādādiś ca śiro'ntas tu saṃhṛtinyāsa ucyate || 7.176
hṛdi mūdhni śikhāyāṃ tu skandhayoḥ karamadhyataḥ |
netrayor nyasanīyāni nissvair mantrair utaiḥ kramāt || 7.177
hṛdayādīni vinyasya paścāt pāṇitaladvaye |
kirīṭaṃ kaustubhaṃ mālāṃ śrīvatsaṃ ca yathāpuram || 7.178
vinyased āyudhāny aṣṭau padmādīni yathākramam |
dakṣiṇottarayor aṃse icchāśaktiṃ svapārśvayoḥ || 7.179
ūrumūle manastattvaṃ nyasya mantram ayaṃ svakam |
bhāvayed aham ity antassudarśanavapurhariḥ || 7.180
gāyatryāvartayed bāhye svātmānaṃ cakramudrayā |
cakrajvālāvaliṃ viprāḥ parito mantravittamaḥ || 7.181
bhāvanājanitaṃ yāgam ācared ādicoditam |
niyamya karaṇagrāmaṃ prāgvad vai jñānagocare || 7.182
āsanaṃ hṛdi saṅkalpya tv anantādyaṃ tu pūrvavat |
parasmād bhagavattattvāc citsvarūpaṃ parātmakam || 7.183
manasā mantram uccārya viṣṭarordhvevatārya ca |
mantranyāsādikaṃ kṛtvā layabhogārcanaṃ tathā || 7.184
śirordhve devadevasya bhāvayed indumaṇḍalam |
tatsrutair amṛtaughaiś ca kuryād arghyādikalpanam || 7.185
ṣoḍaśair upacārair vā dvātriṃśadbhis tu vā yajet |
kṛtvaivaṃ mānasaṃ yāgaṃ japāntaṃ tu yathāvidhi || 7.186
tato bahiryajed devaṃ hetīśaṃ deśikottamaḥ |
mūrtair arghyādibhir bhogair vidhivatsamupāhṛtaiḥ || 7.187
prāgvadarghyādipātrāṇāṃ sthāpanaṃ pūjanaṃ tataḥ |
dehavinyastamantrāṇāṃ garbhadvārasthapūjanam || 7.188
caṇḍaṃ caiva pracaṇḍaṃ ca garbhadvāre prapūjayet |
tathāgramaṇṭapadvāre yajed dhātṛvidhātṛkau || 7.189
kṛtvaivaṃ dvārayāgaṃ tu praviśyābhyantaraṃ tataḥ |
phaṇīśvaraṃ samārabhya yogapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet || 7.190
gaṇanāthādikāṃś caiva samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
tataḥ sudarśanaṃ devaṃ samāvāhya tu pūrvavat || 7.191
mantranyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sṛṣṭinyāsāditastrayam |
sthāneṣu hṛdayādīni bhūṣaṇāni tathaiva ca || 7.192
tataś cāstravarāṇāṃ tu hy aṣṭakaṃ cāpi vinyaset |
icchāśaktiṃ manastatvaṃ vinyasec ca svadehavat || 7.193
layabhogau ca kṛtvātha dhyāyed devaṃ sudarśanam |
sahasrāraṃ mahācakramayutāgnicayotkaṭam || 7.194
ṣaḍaghvamayam udbhrāntaṃ bhagavacchaktijṛmbhitam |
akṣasthaṃ paramātmānaṃ nārāyaṇamanāmayam || 7.195
cakrarūpiṇam īśānaṃ divyakuṅkumasannibham <divyakuṅkumasaṃnibham> |
piṅgākṣaṃ piṅgakeśāḍhyaṃ raktāmbaradharaṃ vibhum || 7.196
mahaujasaṃ mahākāyaṃ bhujair aṣṭabhir anvitam |
daṃṣṭrāniṣṭhyūtaghorāgnijvālākolāhalākulam || 7.197
kuṭilabhrukuṭībhaṅgabhaṅgurālakaṣaṭpadam |
lalāṭanayanodgīrṇajvālājvalitadiṅmukham || 7.198
ūrdhvajvālāgaṇālīḍhakirīṭataṭaśobhitam |
śrīvatsakaustubhoraskaṃ divyamālāvibhūṣitam || 7.199
udyajjānumanekāstraṃ sthitaṃ paramaśobhanam |
gadāṅkuśau <gadāṃkuśau> ca musalaṃ cakram atyugratejasam || 7.200
śaṅkhaṃ ca saśaraṃ cāpaṃ pāśaṃ kaumodakīṃ kramāt |
mukhyadakṣiṇahastādi mukhyavāmakarāvadhi || 7.201
dadhānamatulaṃ vīraṃ divyābharaṇabhūṣitam |
nijāṭṭahāsasantrasyaddaityadānavasañcayam
<nijāṭṭahāsasaṃtrasyaddaityadānavasaṃcayam> || 7.202
ayutāyutavahnīnāmāspade dīptatejasām |
adhvaṣaṭkamaye cakre cakriṇaṃ cakram uttamam || 7.203
dhyāyed evaṃvidhaṃ devaṃ cintitārthaphalapradam |
dhyāyec ca hṛdayādīni kirīṭādīni pūrvavat || 7.204
āyudhānām atha dhyānaṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ dvijasattamāḥ|
cakraśaṅkhagadāḥ <cakraśaṃkhagadāḥ> padmaṃ prāgvaddhyāyed gurūttamaḥ || 
7.205
kṛśāṅgaṃ <kṛśāṃgaṃ> dīrghabāhuṃ ca piṅgalākṣaṃ <piṃgalākṣaṃ>
tu cāṅkuśam <cāṃkuśam> |
vikarālamukhaṃ raudraṃ bhinnāñjanagiriprabham <bhinnāṃjanagiriprabham> || 7.206
kṛśodaraṃ ca musalam agnijvālāvalīvṛtam |
aṅgārarāśisadṛśaṃ <aṃgārarāśisadṛśaṃ> pralambamatiniṣṭhuram || 7.207
nīlotpaladalaśyāmam iṣvastraṃ bāṇavigraham |
nānārūpaṃ ca niśitaṃ dīrghadigbandhavikramam || 7.208
kārmukaṃ hemagauraṃ ca kiṅkiṇījālamaṇḍitam |
āsphoṭayat tu svakarau mahājaladaniḥsvanam || 7.209
pāśaṃ phaṇigaṇākīrṇaṃ vidyujjihvaṃ bhayānakam |
hemālipāṇḍarābhaṃ ca ghorāsyaṃ raktalocanam || 7.210
dhyeyāḥ svarucisaṃyuktā dvibhujāḥ puruṣottamāḥ |
etestranāyakāḥ sarve vibhor ājñāpratīkṣakāḥ || 7.211
protthitā vicalantaś ca susamaiḥ sthānakaiḥ sthitāḥ |
śroṇītaṭārpitakarāś cāmaravyajanodyatāḥ || 7.212
sapadmaṃ tu karīṭādyaṃ varjayitvā catuṣṭayam |
tarjayantaś ca duṣṭaugham anyeṣāṃ dakṣiṇaṃ karam || 7.213
smartavyaṃ dhyānakāle tu sarveṣām atha mastake |
dhyeyaṃ svakaṃ svakaṃ cihnaṃ suprasiddhaṃ nirākṛti || 7.214
adhiṣṭhātṛkramas teṣāṃ kathyate munisattamāḥ |
jñātavyaś cāṅkuśaḥ kāmo musalaṃ nāganāyakaḥ || 7.215
śabdādayaḥ sāyakāstraṃ dhanurviddhi samīraṇam |
pāśo māyeti vijñeya evaṃ dhyātvā samarcayet || 7.216
āsanādyaiś ca sāṃsparśair hṛdayaṅgam apaścimaiḥ |
prīṇayet tu vidhānena homāntaṃ vā japāntimam || 7.217
evam eva svayaṃvyaktaṃ divyaṃ saiddham athāpi vā |
sthāpitaṃ manujair vāpi śailamṛllohasambhavam <śailamṛllohasaṃbhavam> || 7.218
aṣṭabāhuṃ caturbāhuṃ tathā ṣoḍaśabāhukam |
calasthiravibhāgena sthāpitaṃ ca yathāruci || 7.219
trikālam arcayed devaṃ sarvāniṣṭanivārakam |
naimittikāni kāmyāni nityāni yajanāni ca || 7.220
viśeṣeṇaiva kāryāṇi vinā svāpaṃ mahotsavam |
śāntike poṣṭike caiva tathaivāpyayanādiṣu || 7.221
dhyānena pūjitenaiva hutena japitena ca |
samīhitāni pūryante bhaktānāṃ bhāvitātmanām || 7.222
iti samyak samākhyātaṃ paraṃ saudarśanārcanam |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ 
lakṣmīsudarśanārcanavidhir nāma
saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ


athāṣṭamo 'dhyāyaḥ


munayaḥ
bhagavan muniśārdūla bhagavacchāstrakovida |
garuḍapramukhānāṃ ca pūjanaṃ prāgudīritam || 8.1
tadvidhānaṃ viśeṣeṇa prakāśaya kṛpānidhe |

nāradaḥ
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayaḥ sarve garuḍasyārcanaṃ purā || 8.2
yena vijñātamātreṇa vāñchitaṃ <vāṃchitaṃ> sādhako 'śnute |
viṣṇoḥ saṅkarṣaṇākhyasya vijñānabalaśālinaḥ || 8.3
mūrtiḥ jñānabalākhyā yā sarvādhārasvarūpiṇī |
mahimeti jagaddhātuḥ vijñeyo vihageśvaraḥ || 8.4
sarvarogabhayaghnaś ca kṣepakaḥ sarvavidviṣām |
tataḥ samarcayen nityaṃ prāsāde sthāpya mantravit || 8.5
prāṅkaṇe prathame vātha dvitīye mūlamandirāt |
agradeśe prakurvīta prāsādaṃ maṇṭapākṛtim || 8.6
caturdvārasamopetaṃ vargatrayasamanvitam |
vargaṣaṭkānvitaṃ vātha sarvālaṅkāraśobhitam || 8.7
mūlagehāt tribhāgoccamardhoccaṃ vā savistaram |
tasmin brāhmetha divye vā divyayuktetha mānuṣe || 8.8
saṃsthāpya lohajāṃ vātha śailīmarcāṃ yathoditām |
trikālam arcayen nityaṃ mukhyamūrtyarcanāntime || 8.9
tadvidhānaṃ viśeṣeṇa mantrapūrvam ihocyate |
praṇavaṃ pūrvam uddhṛtya pakṣiśabdam anantaram || 8.10
pañcākṣaro <paṃcākṣaro> mahāmantraḥ svāhāntaḥ samprakīrtitaḥ 
<saṃprakīrtitaḥ> |
mantrārṇāni sabindūni prāgoṅkārānvitāni ca || 8.11
samuccāryāthaturyāntaiḥ jñānādyaiś ca hṛdādibhiḥ |
anetrair astraparyantair aṅgāny etāni vai dvijāḥ || 8.12
prāṅmūlamantramadhyādyavyatyayādviṣahā bhavet |
so 'yaṃ mantraḥ samākhyātastridaśair api durlabhaḥ || 8.13
pañcākṣara <paṃcākṣara> iti khyāto gāruḍo munisattamāḥ |
pañcāṅgāni <paṃcāṃgāni> yathāpūrvam akṣaraiḥ syuḥ sabindukaiḥ || 8.14
sāṅgenānena mantreṇa sthāpanīyo vidhānataḥ |
mūlālayagate bimbe susthite vātha yānage || 8.15
sthitaiva gāruḍī mūrtir yāne vā gamanonmukhī |
śayane cāsane caiva tv āsīnā vātha susthitā || 8.16
dvārāvaraṇadevānāṃ dhyānādhyāye viśeṣataḥ |
dhvajārohe 'pi suvyaktaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ cāsya vakṣyate || 8.17
evaṃ jñātvā yathā kālaṃ tanmantranirato dvijāḥ |
snātvā tadīyamantreṇa kṛtapādāvanejanaḥ || 8.18
upaspṛśya yathānyāyaṃ prāsādaṃ sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> ca |
svāsane sukhamāsīnaḥ prāṅmukho vāpy udaṅmukhaḥ || 8.19
karaśuddhiṃ ca digbandhaṃ prāṇāyāmaṃ samāpya ca |
bhūtaśuddhiṃ ca vidhivanmantravinyastavigrahaḥ || 8.20
pakṣīśamudrāṃ badhvātha hṛdayāmbhoruhodare |
svānandadhāmaniṣṭhasya devasya caturātmanaḥ|| 8.21
saṅkarṣaṇāṃśāt sampūrṇavijñānabalasaṅkulāt 
<saṃpūrṇavijñānabalasaṃkulāt> |
avatāryāmṛtair bhogaiḥ japāntaṃ prāgvadarcya ca || 8.22
tato mūrtair yajed bāhye prāguktair bhāgasañcayaiḥ <bhāgasaṃcayaiḥ> |
pātraśiṣṭaiś ca devānnaiḥ sādhitaiḥ pṛthag eva vā || 8.23
tadarthaṃ kalpayet prāgvadarghyādyaṃ pātrapañcakam <pātrapaṃcakam> |
dvitayaṃ cātha vaikasmin pādyaṃ snānīyavāri ca || 8.24
arghyācāme tadanyasmin ekasmin sakalaṃ tu vā |
prāgvatsvadehavinyastān mantrān abhyarcya mantravit || 8.25
arghyādyair dhūpaparyantais tato dvāracatuṣṭaye |
vāstvīśaṃ kṣetranāthaṃ ca dvāralakṣmīṃ svamantrataḥ || 8.26
caṇḍādyaṃ ca gaṇaṃ prāgvadāsanaṃ kalpayet tataḥ |
śeṣapūrvaṃ ca dharmādyam aṣṭakaṃ vinyaset kramām || 8.27
tadūrdhve vyaktapadmaṃ ca yāmatrayasamanvitam |
samabhyarcya ca gandhādhyair gaṇanāthādikān api || 8.28
hṛtpadmakarṇikāmadhye mānasair arcitaṃ purā |
svavidyayā samāvāhya svasthānād bimbahṛtkaje || 8.29
sakalīkṛtya vidhivadaṅgabhūṣaṇalāñchanaiḥ 
<vidhivadaṃgabhūṣaṇalāṃchanaiḥ> |
kirīṭaṃ vanamālāṃ ca vinyasya tadanantaram || 8.30
anantādīṃś ca nāgeśān nyased vāmakarādiṣu |
satyākhyayā dakṣiṇato balaśaktyā svarūpayā || 8.31
gaṇitrakaṃ ca mandārakusumastabakaṃ tathā |
kalaśaṃ cāmṛtādhāraṃ phaṇīndraṃ dakṣiṇāditaḥ || 8.32
śaktiḥ prāguditā tasya baladharmasvarūpiṇī |
pakṣīśamudrāṃ sandarśya layayāgaṃ samācaret || 8.33
bhogayāgaś ca kartavyaḥ padmapīṭhatalopari |
prāgādipadmapatreṣu hṛdayādīni pūrvavat || 8.34
vidikpatreṣu caivāstram eṣāṃ varṇāni pūrvavat |
rūpalāvaṇyabhūṣādyair mūlamantraśarīravat || 8.35
kirīṭaṃ vanamālāṃ ca nyased deśikasattamaḥ |
purastāttiṣṭhataś cāsya dakṣiṇottarayoḥ kramāt || 8.36
catuṣṭayakrameṇaiva śeṣādyāḥ pannageśvarāḥ |
agnīśarakṣovāyavyakoṇeṣu vihageśituḥ || 8.37
catuṣṭayaṃ gaṇitrādyaṃ vinyaset tu yathākramam |
dakṣiṇe vihageśasya satyākhyā karṇikopari || 8.38
prāṇāpānasamānodānavyānaprāṇarūpiṇaḥ |
madhyasthasya khageśasya bahiḥ prāgāditaḥ kramāt || 8.39
satyaḥ suparṇo guruḍastārkṣyaś ca vihageśvaraḥ |
pañcātmakasya <paṃcātmakasya> prāṇasya vikāras tv eṣa pañcadhā <paṃcadhā> 
|| 8.40
satyādyā dikṣu catvāraḥ koṇeṣu vihageśvaraḥ |
dhyānam eṣāṃ viśeṣeṇa samāsāt kathyate 'dhunā || 8.41
ācāṅghrigocarāḥ sarve yasya dehās tu pauruṣaḥ |
dvibhujastuhinābhas tu sa satyaḥ prāṇadaivatam || 8.42
suparṇaḥ padmarāgābho nirmalasvarṇalocanaḥ |
garuḍaḥ kāñcanābhas <kāṃcanābhas> tu kuṭilabhraruṇekṣaṇaḥ || 8.43
kekarākṣas tu tārkṣyo vai prāvṛḍjaladasannibhaḥ <prāvṛḍjaladasaṃnibhaḥ> |
dravatkanakanetras tu śabalābhaś ca pañcamaḥ || 8.44
caturbhujāḥ suparṇādyāḥ saumyarūpā hy anākulāḥ |
patatricaraṇās sarve pakṣamaṇḍalamaṇḍitāḥ || 8.45
lambodarās supīnāṅgāḥ kuṇḍalādyair vibhūṣitāḥ |
kuṭilabhrūsuvṛttākṣā vajratuṇḍā sitānanāḥ || 8.46
apānādisamīrāṇām ādhipatyena saṃsthitāḥ |
mahābalā mahākāyā raktatuṇḍo 'tra pañcamaḥ <paṃcamaḥ> || 8.47
svasvāṅguṣṭhadvayaprotagaṇitrobhayapāṇinā
<svasvāṃguṣṭhadvayaprotagaṇitrobhayapāṇinā> |
puṣpāñjalidharāḥ <puṣpāṃjalidharāḥ> sarve mukhyena vihagottamāḥ || 8.48
suparṇaḥ paścimābhyāṃ tu pāṇibhyāṃ dakṣiṇāditaḥ |
mandārapuṣpastabakaṃ dadhadvismayamudrikām || 8.49
tathāvidhābhyāṃ garuḍas te dhatte vyatyayena tu |
tārkṣyaḥ paścimayor nityaṃ dhatte dakṣiṇavāmayoḥ || 8.50
kadrūṃ tathāmṛtaṃ kumbhaṃ pañcamo <paṃcamo> vihageśvaraḥ |
dakṣiṇena sudhākumbhaṃ vāmena tu phaṇīśvaram || 8.51
nityoditasya vyūhasya tathā śāntoditasya ca |
prāṇāpānādivāyūnāṃ pañcānām <paṃcānām> api nāmabhāk || 8.52
garuḍaḥ parivāratve dhvajatve 'pi viśeṣataḥ |
yojanīyas tathānyeṣu suṣuptyādipadeṣu ca || 8.53
vāsudevādimūrtīnāṃ caturṇāṃ kramaśastvamī |
satyādyāstārkṣyaparyantāḥ tattanmūrtyantareṣu ca || 8.54
triṣu triṣu samādeyāḥ satyādyāḥ keśavādiṣu |
padmanābhādimūrtīnāṃ pañcamo <paṃcamo> vihageśvaraḥ || 8.55
parātparaparavyūhavyūhāntaratanor vibhoḥ |
prādurbhāvatanoś cāpi jagadrakṣaṇakāṃkṣiṇaḥ <jagadrakṣaṇakāṅkṣiṇaḥ> || 
8.56
khagānāṃ kāraṇatvāc ca prāgukto vā khageśvaraḥ |
iti te garuḍavyūhaprabhāvaḥ samprakāśitaḥ <saṃprakāśitaḥ> || 8.57
kumudādyās tato bāhye śakrādyāstadbahiḥ kramāt |
tadbahiḥ kumudādīnāṃ bhūteśāś cotkaṭādayaḥ || 8.58
gaṇeśaḥ pūjanīyo vā tadagre balimaṇḍape |
mahāpīṭhe 'tha vā pūjyāḥ garuḍasyānuyāyinaḥ || 8.59
pālayantaś ca tadbhaktān divyānyāyatanāny api |
dhyātvaivam arcanaṃ kuryād āsanādyaiḥ yathoditaiḥ || 8.60
catuṣṣaṣṭyupacārair vā dvātriṃśadbhis tu vetaraiḥ |
ṣoḍaśair upacārair vā mukhyamadhyādhamakramāt || 8.61
tanniveditam annādyaṃ narāṇāṃ rogiṇāṃ sadā |
vandhyānāṃ vanitānāṃ ca jayecchūnāṃ ca bhūbhujām || 8.62
viṣopahataveṣāṇāṃ pradadyāt saṃvibhajya ca |
ārdrāyāṃ pratimāsaṃ tu viśeṣeṇaivam arcayet || 8.63
utsaveṣu viśeṣeṇa bhrāmayed utsavārcayā |
iti samyak samākhyātaṃ garuḍasyārcanaṃ param || 8.64
viṣvaksenārcanaṃ tvadya pauṣkaroktaṃ tu kathyate |
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayas sarve sāvadhānena cetasā || 8.65

pauṣkara uvāca
kimartham āha bhagavān vighnocchedakaraṃ prabhum |
samastavighnanāthānāṃ paramaṃ kāraṇaṃ ca yaḥ || 8.66
viṣvaksenas tu yaṣṭavyo bhogabhūmigate 'cyute |
kair dravyaiḥ kena vidhinā kiṃ karoty abhipūjitaḥ || 8.67

śrībhagavān
bhavināṃ bhāvino vighnāḥ saddharmavinivārakāḥ |
na yāgayajñadharmādyaiḥ manye saṃsāriṇāṃ śubham || 8.68
tatpravṛttau tu ye vighnāḥ protsāhavinivārakāḥ |
vyapārayanti ca te sarve cakrajvālābhayārditāḥ || 8.69
prāgārjitena kenāpi karmaṇā caiva sāmpratam <sāṃpratam> |
anubhuṅkte phalaṃ yāgādvividhaṃ cāgrataḥ sthitam || 8.70
tasya saṃrakṣaṇārthaṃ tu viṣvaksenas tadaiva hi |
kāle yāgāvasānākhye dvitīye vāsaretha vā || 8.71
kṛtvā nirvyākulaṃ cittaṃ yaṣṭavyaḥ phalasiddhaye |
yāganirvartanoccheṣair amlānair arghyapūrvakaiḥ || 8.72
upacāramayair bhogaiḥ sarvair ābharaṇādikaiḥ |
naivedyair madhuparkādyaiḥ mukhyamūrter niveditaiḥ || 8.73
dijapradānaśiṣṭais tu svayamprāśanavarjitaiḥ <svayaṃprāśanavarjitaiḥ> |
tathā carvantarasthaiś ca hy aparebhyo niveditaiḥ || 8.74
saṃskṛtair ūṣmalopetair madhurājyapariplutaiḥ |

pauṣkaraḥ
ka eṣo 'tulavīryo hi yasya dūrāddravanti ca || 8.75
vighnā nimeṣamātreṇa trailokyonmūlanakṣamāḥ |

bhagavān
kālavaiśvānarākhyā yā mūrtis turyātmano vibhoḥ || 8.76
sa eva dvijadevo hi viṣvaksenaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
sthita āhavanīyādibhedena makhayājinām || 8.77
ṛkpūtaṃ hutam ādāya tarpayaty akhilaṃ jagat |
evaṃ mantramayādyāgāt sāttvikād brahmabhāvitāt || 8.78
samprāpya <saṃprāpya> gurumūrter vai prāpaṇaṃ mantrasaṃskṛtam |
anāhūtāmarāṇāṃ ca sarvalokanivāsinām || 8.79
svayaṃ saṃvibhajatyāśu sadanugrahakāmyayā |
jñātvaivaṃ tasya māhātmyaṃ vṛttisthaṃ phalasiddhaye || 8.80
trisandhyaṃ nityapūjāyāṃ balyante taṃ samarcayet |
vatsarotsavapūrveṣu tathā vaiśeṣikeṣv api || 8.81
vṛttyādyādhārabhūteṣu kramāt kṛtvā purārcanam |
kevalaṃ vātha homāntaṃ svaśaktyā vibhavena vā || 8.82
vistareṇātha vā śaśvat tataḥ kamalasambhava <kamalasaṃbhava> |
kṛtvā parṇapuṭe toyaṃ pātre vā kalaśe 'vraṇe || 8.83
tam ātmanottare bhāge hy arcayitvā nivedya ca |
athāparasmin bhāṇḍe tu tadastraparimantrite || 8.84
naivedyād bhāgam ādāya tathā carvantarasthitāt |
odanād aṃśam uddhṛtya dadhyājyavyañjanaiḥ <dadhyājyavyaṃjanaiḥ> saha || 8.85
samālabhanapuṣpārghyakuśāmbuparibhāvitam |
taddṛṅmantreṇa bahuśo hy abhimantryābjasambhava <abhimantryābjasaṃbhava> || 
8.86
tatmūlamantram uccārya dhyānabhāvanayānvitam |
prāksanniveśite <prāksaṃniveśite> bhāṇḍe samutkīrya pidhāya tat || 8.87
praṇavāṣṭakajaptaṃ vā tannāmnā saha pauṣkara |
ekaṃ vai sodakaṃ pātraṃ sanaivedyaṃ jalāplutam || 8.88
sarvatra sarvadā yāge kuryāt prāgvidhinā vinā |
tac cāpi kṣmātale kūpe taṭākādau tu cotkiret || 8.89
jñātvaivaṃ yatnato mantrī tanmantreṇa samarcayet |
sāṅgaṃ mantramatho vakṣye yathāvadavadhāraya || 8.90
ākrāntamanalenaiva prāṇākhyaṃ bījanāyakam |
trailokyaiśvaryadopetamūrjoparigataṃ tu tat || 8.91
tato varāham ādāya bhūdharavyomabhūṣitam |
viṣvaksenāya tadanu sanamaskaṃ padaṃ nyaset || 8.92
praṇavādyo hy ayaṃ mantro viṣvaksenasya kīrtitaḥ |
pūrvabījaṃ hi yac cāsya ūkārasvaravarjitaḥ || 8.93
ākārādyaiś ca ṣaḍdīrghair bhinnam aṅgagaṇaṃ <aṃgagaṇaṃ> nayet |
praṇavena svanāmnātha jātibhiḥ ṣaḍbhir anvitam || 8.94
namaḥ svāhādirbhiścāyaṃ viṣvaksenasya vācakaḥ |
sāṅgenānena mantreṇa pratiṣṭhāpya vidhānataḥ || 8.95
prathamāvaraṇe vātha dvitīyāvaraṇe 'tha vā |
īśānasomadiṅmadhye prāsāde dakṣiṇāmukhe || 8.96
mūlālayoccānnīce ca kalpite garbhamāndire |
brahmasthāne 'tha vā divyaṃ mūlaberāṃśamānataḥ || 8.97
kalpitasya śilādārulohapūrvais tu vastubhiḥ |
pūjanaṃ mukhyakalpaṃ syād anukalpogramaṇḍape || 8.98
prāguktakoṇabhūbhāge mekhalātrayanirmite |
pīṭhe 'vatārya gaganādamūrtaṃ mūrtam eva vā || 8.99
kevalaṃ balidānena tarpayed udakena ca |
catuḥ sthānāvatīrṇasya maṇḍalādiṣu vṛttiṣu || 8.100
paravyūhādirūpasya devasya yajanāvadhau |
prāsādāntargatasyāpi svasthānasthasya maṇḍape || 8.101
pūjanaṃ vidhivat kāryam ārambhadivasāditaḥ |
sarvakarmāvasāne tu maṇḍalādigate vibhau || 8.102
sve sve dhāmni visṛṣṭe tu dhyātvā maṇḍalamadhyataḥ |
pūjayed vidhivanmantrī dvitīye vāsare 'pi ca || 8.103
bhagavadyajanārthaṃ tu prāsādasthaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
yathāvidhi samabhyarcya naivedyais tanniveditaiḥ || 8.104
arghyādyair akhilair anyais tāmbūlādyaiś ca nityaśaḥ |
jalasthalādinilayāṃs tadbhūtāṃś cātha tarpayet || 8.105
prāsādasthasya tasyātha dehamānānusārataḥ |
kṛtvā hemādibhir divyair viśeṣārcāṃ vidhānataḥ || 8.106
ugrāṃ vā śāntarūpāṃ vā vighnavidhvaṃsanakṣamām |
caturbhujāṃ vā dvibhujām āsīnāṃ vātha susthitām || 8.107
dvibhujasya caturhastām anyadhā (anyathā?) vā prakalpitām |
vaiśeṣikeṣu prāpteṣu pūjayed utsavārcayā || 8.108
mṛgayādyutsave prāpte yatra yatra vrajet prabhuḥ |
tatra tatra nayed enāṃ nirvighnaphalasiddhaye || 8.109
dhyānam asya pravakṣyāmi yathāvacchṛṇu sattama |
navadūrvāṅkurābhaṃ ca tvīṣatpītalakāntibhāk || 8.110
caturdaṣṭraṃ caturbāhuṃ catuṣkiṣkuṃ caturgatim |
pūrṇāṅgaṃ <pūrṇāṃgaṃ> kesariskandhaṃpṛthūraḥsthalarājitam || 8.111
dakṣiṇāvartanimnena nābhīrandhreṇa śobhitam |
ājānubāhuṃ śrīmantaṃ piṅgalārcir jaṭādharam || 8.112
dravatkanakapiṅgākṣaṃ cipiṭaṃ pṛthunāsikam |
sitadīrghanakhaśreṇīśobhitaṃ kuṭilabhruvam || 8.113
vistīrṇagaṇḍavadanaṃ bālendukuṭilopamaiḥ |
navakiṃvaruṇākārair lomabhiḥ pūrṇavigraham || 8.114
śobhanena pralambena pṛthunā pronnatena ca |
māṇikyakuṇḍalāḍhyena yuktaṃ śrotradvayena tu || 8.115
makuṭenonnatenaiva hārādyair upaśobhitam |
citrakauśeyavasanaṃ vicitrasragvimaṇḍitam || 8.116
pralayadvādaśādityasahasraguṇadīdhitim |
īṣadūrdhvaṃ tathā tiryagvinipātitalocanam || 8.117
kundendukāntidaśanaṃ kiñcidvihasitānanam |
svabhāvasaumyam amalaṃ māyākrodhoparañjitam <māyākrodhoparaṃjitam> || 
8.118
savilāsacalatpādanyāsasthānakasaṃsthitam |
svenāntaḥ karaṇenaivaṃ bhāvayantaṃ paraṃ padam || 8.119
aṅguṣṭhādikaniṣṭhāntaṃ vāmapāṇau latātrayam |
namayitvonnatā caikāghrāṇāgre viniyojitā || 8.120
sadvighnabhītipradayā tvanayā mudrayānvitam |
rathāṅgaśaṅkhahastaṃ ca lambamānagadādharam || 8.121
śroṇītaṭaniviṣṭena sāvahelanapāṇinā |
itthaṃ rūpadharaṃ devam anekādbhutavigraham || 8.122
ugrarūpam imaṃ dhyāyed āgneyam analaprabham |
daṃṣṭrātarjananirmuktaṃ sābhayaṃ śāntalakṣaṇam || 8.123
mukhyadakṣiṇahastena bhaktānām abhayapradam |
tathāvidhena vāmenaṃ lambamānagadādharam || 8.124
pṛṣṭhadakṣiṇavāmābhyāṃ cakraśaṅkhadharaṃ kramāt |
evaṃ caturbhujasyoktaṃ dvibhujasyāvadhāraya || 8.125
uktābhyām ugraśāntābhyāṃ cakraśaṅkhadharaṃ vinā |
prāguktadvitayaṃ vātha dvitīyaṃ cittatantu vā || 8.126
gadāvirahitaṃ vātha vāmakaṭyavalambitam |
sthānakenāsanevāmamūrudeśe niveśitam || 8.127
gopanīmudrayā vātha kaṭakākāramudrayā |
ubhābhyām api pāṇibhyāṃ viśrāntaṃ pīṭhapṛṣṭhataḥ || 8.128
avaṣṭabhya gadāmūrdhve mātaṅgamusalākṛtim |
prakpadmadalam ākramya pādābhyāṃ karṇikāsanam || 8.129
susthitaṃ karṇikāyāṃ vā prāgvadanyair alaṅkṛtam |
evaṃ dhyānaviśeṣeṣu tv ekaṃ sthāpya vidhānataḥ || 8.130
samarcayīta kāleṣu prāgukteṣu svamantrataḥ |
catuḥsthānārcanārthaṃ tu maṇḍalānāṃ tu madhyataḥ || 8.131
pūjiteṣv atha mantreṣu niyukteṣu svadhāmani |
īśānasomadiṅmadhye caturaśre purethavā || 8.132
dvāraśobhāgranirmukte rekhātritayabhūṣite |
tadantare 'rdhacandrasthe kamale 'ṣṭadalānvite || 8.133
sāmrājyena niyukte 'smin vighnānām acyutena tu |
pūjite vidhinā śaśvadabhīṣṭaṃ sādhako 'śnute || 8.134
tasmān mantrais tadīyais tu snātvā pūrvaṃ vidhānataḥ |
prakṣālya pāṇipādau vā tvācamya nyāsam ācaret || 8.135
tadadhiṣṭhātṛkatvena dhāraṇābhiḥ svavigraham |
śodhayitvā punarnyasya ṣaḍaṅgādiṃ karāditaḥ || 8.136
prāgvadānandadhāmāc ca hy avatārya tathā prabhum |
iṣṭvā hṛtpuṇḍarīke tu svāpekṣāṃ niṣkalātmakam || 8.137
tam eva sakalatvena yātaṃ dhyātvā bahiryajet |
prāgvadarghyādipātrāṇi pratiṣṭhāpya svavigrahe || 8.138
vinyastamantrān abhyarcya dvāradakṣiṇasaumyayoḥ |
caṇḍapracaṇḍasadṛśau balaprabalasaṃjñitau || 8.139
vāyuvegaṃ mahāghrāṇaṃ dvārāgre garuḍopamam |
samabhyarcya yathāpūrvaṃ prāgdatvā kamalāsanam || 8.140
dharmādyanantaparyantaṃ pañcakaṃ <paṃcakaṃ> navakantu vā |
satvenācchāditaṃ paścātkevalenāmbujaṃ svaret || 8.141
tasminn āvāhya taṃ devaṃ hṛdaye dhyānacoditam |
sannidhānādikaṃ <saṃnidhānādikaṃ> kṛtvā mudrābandhapurassaram || 8.142
samabhyarcyārghyapuṣpādyaiḥ layayāgavidhānataḥ |
karṇikāmadhyagaṃ tasya hṛdādyaṃ mukhyamantravit || 8.143
padmacchadāntarasthāś ca tadākāradyutiṃ vinā |
kiṃ tv aṅgānāṃ ca sarvatra dhyānamuktaṃ sitādikam || 8.144
kriyākhyāṃ tejasīṃ śaktiṃ svāhāparyāyarūpiṇīm |
lakṣmīrūpadharāṃ prītāṃ sarvālaṅkāramaṇḍitāṃ || 8.145
priyānurūpāṃ satataṃ svāsīnāṃ vātha susthitām |
dakṣiṇottarayogena cāmarobhayadhāriṇīm || 8.146
oṃ hrīṃ kriyāyai svāhānto mantro 'yaṃ samprakīrtitaḥ <saṃprakīrtitaḥ> |
anena svāmino dehāt taijasād vighnasūdanāt || 8.147
vāmapārśvevatāryāsya bhogayāgāvasānataḥ |
gajānano jayatseno harivaktro mahābalaḥ || 8.148
kālaprakṛtisaṃjñaś ca caturthaḥ kamalodbhava |
gaṇarājeśvarāś caite catvāraś caṇḍavigrahāḥ || 8.149
ājñāpratīkṣakāś cāsya suśvetacamarodyatāḥ |
vināyakādayaś caiva vighneśapravarās tu ye || 8.150
amīṣāṃ gaṇanāthānāṃ nityam ājñānupālinān |
īśānādiṣu koṇeṣu padmabāhye sthitānyaset || 8.151
vīkṣamāṇā vibhor vaktraṃ tattulyasthānake sthitāḥ |
tadvatkarāṅkitāḥ <tadvatkarāṃkitāḥ> sarve kiṃ tu mudrāvivarjitāḥ || 8.152
dhyānam eṣāṃ pṛthagbhūtaṃ śārīram avadhāraya |
bhīmadvipendravadanaṃ caturdaṃṣṭraṃ trilocanam || 8.153
kambugrīvaṃ caturbāhuṃ pūrṇacandrāyutadyutim |
hāranūpurakeyūramekhalādāmamaṇḍitam || 8.154
nānāsraggandhavastrāḍhyamanaupamyaparākramam |
dhyāyed gajānanamato jayatsenaṃ ca saṃsmaret || 8.155
mahatturaṅgavadanaṃ padmarāgācalaprabham |
dravaccāmīkarākṣaṃ ca tv anekād bhūtavigraham || 8.156
harivaktramato dhyāyet saṭācchuritamastakam |
niṣṭaptakanakaprakhyaṃ ghoraghargharanisvanam || 8.157
mṛgarāḍvadanaṃ viprāḥ kalpāntānalaveginam |
kālaprakṛtināmānaṃ bhāvayed añjanādrivat <aṃjanādrivat> || 8.158
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ piṅgalaśmaśrulocanam |
jhaṣakuṇḍalabhṛdraudraṃ mīnavannimnanāsikam || 8.159
gaṇarājeśvarāhyete mahāpuruṣalakṣaṇaiḥ |
saṃyuktāś cākhilair viprāḥ āpādāt kandharāvadhi || 8.160
yaktiñcin <yat kiñcin> maṇḍanaṃ vastu tadādyoktaṃ smaret triṣu |
eteṣām arcanaṃ kuryāt svanāmnā praṇavādinā || 8.161
namānteno 'bjasambhūta <'bjasaṃbhūta> nānāsiddhiphalāptaye |
aṣṭāṣṭakais tadardhair vā tasyārdhair vā yathāruci || 8.162
kṣiprakarmaprasidhyartham aṣṭābhir vā samarcayet |
tanniveditam annādyamarghyasrakcandanādikam || 8.163
na deyaṃ kasyacitprājñair aihikām uṣmikāptaye |
svāśritānām anujñātaṃ bhūtānāñ caiva tena tat || 8.164
nityaṃ tadūrdhvatas teṣām āśāsthagitacāriṇī |
ata eva hi bhokt�ṇām arthahāniṃ dadāti tat || 8.165
nūnam āśāgaṇaṃ sarvaṃ dhvaṃsayanti sadaivahi |
tasmād dadāti yo 'nyeṣāṃ svayam aśnāti vādhamaḥ || 8.166
mohād upekṣate vāpi sa yāti narake 'dhamaḥ |
ataḥ śreyo 'rthinā kāryaḥ parihāraḥ sadaiva hi || 8.167
tac cāpi kṣmātale kūpe taṭākādau tu citkṣipet |
nopabhogaṃ yathā yāti kākādiṣv abjasambhava <abjasaṃbhava> || 8.168
yasmāt sanmantrapūtaṃ tatprādhānyenāpi vardhate |
ato niṣiddhaḥ pāpānām apāpānāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 8.169
iti samyak samākhyātaṃ viṣvaksenārcanaṃ param |
pūjanaṃ kumudādīnāṃ śṛṇudhvam atha yoginaḥ || 8.170
dvārāvaraṇadevānāṃ susthitānāṃ svasadmasu |
calānāṃ vātha hemādyair nirmitānāṃ yathāvidhi || 8.171
trikālaṃ vā dvikālaṃ vā saṅkaṭe tv ekakālakam |
tattanmantreṇa kurvīta pūjām aṣṭopacārataḥ || 8.172
ity evaṃ vainateyādiparivāragaṇasya ca |
pūjanaṃ sarvam ākhyātaṃ sarvasiddhiphalapradam || 8.173
ito 'nyacchrotum icchā cet kathyatāṃ munisattamāḥ |

munayaḥ
bhagavan mandire viṣṇoḥ sthāpitā lokapūjitāḥ || 8.174
viṣṇubhaktāḥ kathaṃ pūjyās tadvidhānaṃ vadasva naḥ |

nāradaḥ
ekāntino mahābhāgāḥ śaṭhakopapurassarāḥ || 8.175
kṣoṇyāṃ kṛtāvatārā ye lokojjīvanahetunā |
śāṇḍilyādyāś ca ye cānye pāñcarātrapravartakāḥ <pāṃcarātrapravartakāḥ> || 
8.176
prahlādaś caiva sugrīvo vāyusūnur vibhīṣaṇaḥ |
ye cānye sanakādyāś ca pañcakālaparāyaṇāḥ <paṃcakālaparāyaṇāḥ> || 8.177
bhaktottamās te vijñeyās tān divyāyatanādiṣu |
carasthiravibhāgena lohair vā śilayāpi vā || 8.178
svasvavarṇāśramācārasadṛśākṛticeṣṭitān |
lāñchitān <lāṃchitān> cakraśaṅkhābhyāṃ <cakraśaṃkhābhyāṃ>
bhujayor dakṣiṇāditaḥ || 8.179
padmaviṣṭaramadhye tu svāsīnān vātha susthitān |
ṛju sthitān yathāśobhaṃ paiśācasthānake 'thavā || 8.180
nirmāya ca vidhānena prāṅkaṇe maṣṭape 'tha vā |
prāsādeṣv anurūpeṣu kalpiteṣv agrato vibhoḥ || 8.181
yathāvakāśaṃ vāme vā dakṣiṇe vātha paścime |
svasvamantraiḥ pratiṣṭhāpya vidhivacchraddhayārcayet || 8.182
śṛṇudhvam atha tanmantrān sthāpanādiṣu karmasu |
pradhānapuruṣeśādyatārakabrahmaṇātha vā || 8.183
ahaṃsatārakeṇaiva savisargeṇa cāntike |
ādyena vā dvitīyena yuktayā tritayena vā || 8.184
saṃjñayā yojanīyās te sāṅgayāgas <sāṃgayāgas> tv athocyate |
tārādyayor dvayor ekaṃ ṣoḍhya kṛtvā tadantime || 8.185
jñānādihṛdayādīni caturthyantāny udīrayet |
praṇavādhārayuktāni prāg evāṅgānyamūni vai || 8.186
mantreṇānena vai bhaktān pūjayet tu yathāvidhi |
prāgvatsnānādikaṃ kṛtvā sordhvapuṇḍraḥ svalaṅkṛtaḥ || 8.187
pādau prakṣālya cācamya praviśya yajanālayam |
kavāṭodghāṭanaṃ kuryād dvārsthābhyarcanapūrvakam || 8.188
tanmantreṇa praṇamyātha bimbaśudhyādikaṃ tathā |
prāsādaśodhanādīni kṛtvā vai tasya dakṣiṇe || 8.189
pārśve samupaviśyātha karaśuddhiṃ samācaret |
digbandhaṃ caiva sāyāmāṃ bhūtaśuddhiṃ samāpya ca || 8.190
puṭīkṛtena tārābhyāṃ bhaktamantreṇa mantravit |
nakhāntaṃ maṇibandhādyaṃ prāgvatpāṇidvayaṃ mṛjet || 8.191
aṅgāni caiva vinyasya pūrvoktavidhinā tataḥ |
tulasīnalinākṣāṇāṃ mālikādvitayaṃ tathā || 8.192
cakraśaṅkhau pāṇitaladvaye nyasya yathākramam |
kṛtvaivaṃ karavinyāsaṃ tatas tanmantram uccaran || 8.193
pāṇibhyām ālabhed deham āmūdhnaś caraṇāvadhi |
kṛtvaivaṃ vyāpakanyāsaṃ hṛdayādīni vinyaset || 8.194
tato mālādvayaṃ kaṇṭhe cakraśaṅkhau bhujadvaye |
vinyasya hārdadhīmudrāṃ badhvā tādātmyam āśrayet || 8.195
tataḥ svahṛdayām bhoje devasya paramātmanaḥ |
pādādhas tāc cetanan tu vicintya tadanantaram || 8.196
tasmāc caitanyam āvāhya yajed bhogais tu mānasaiḥ |
tato bahiryajed bhaktaṃ prāguktair bhogasañcayaiḥ <bhogasaṃcayaiḥ> || 8.197
tadarthaṃ pañcapātrāṇi <paṃcapātrāṇi> catustridvyekam eva vā |
kalpayitvā tato dehanyastān mantrān samarcayet || 8.198
dvārayāgaṃ tataḥ kuryād arghyādyair deśikottamaḥ |
sāvitraṃ savitāraṃ ca garbhadvārasya pārśvayoḥ || 8.199
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> tadvimāne tu caturdikṣu yathākramam |
bhaktamūrtīs samabhyarcya arghyādyair munisattamāḥ || 8.200
tato 'gramaṇṭapadvāre durgāṃ gaṇapatiṃ yajet |
indrādilokapālāṃs tu prathamāvaraṇādiṣu || 8.201
sampūjyāvaraṇadvāre <saṃpūjyāvaraṇadvāre> tv indraṃ cendrajayaṃ yajet |
yad vā dvāreṣu sarveṣu tathaivāvaraṇeṣu ca || 8.202
tattacchiṣyagaṇān eva parivārān prakalpayet |
mahāpīṭhe yajet sarvabhūtebhyo nama ity atha || 8.203
garbhagehe sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> kalpayed āsanaṃ guruḥ |
dharmādīn caturaḥ pīṭhakoṇeṣv abhyarcya pūrvavat || 8.204
satvenācchāditaṃ paścātkevalenāmbujaṃ yajet |
tatrāvatārya taṃ bhaktaṃ mantranyāsaṃ samācaret || 8.205
yathā dehe tathā bimbe layoktavidhinā tataḥ |
samabhyarcya tato bhogayāgaṃ kuryād yathāvidhi || 8.206
prāgādipadmapatreṣu hṛdayādīni pūrvavat |
vidigdaleṣu caivāstraṃ netraṃ kesarajālagam || 8.207
pīthopari dalād bāhye tvāgneyeśānakoṇayoḥ |
mālādvayaṃ tu pūrvoktaṃ cakraśaṅkhau ca pūjayet || 8.208
tato dhyāyed viṣṇubhaktaṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam |
svasvavarṇāśramācārasadṛśākṛticeṣṭitam || 8.209
baddhāñjalipuṭaṃ <baddhāṃjalipuṭaṃ> vātha vyākhyāmudrāsamanvitam |
padmaviṣṭaramadhye tu svāsīnaṃ vātha suthitam || 8.210
lalāṭādiṣu cāṅgeṣu <cāṃgeṣu> hy ūrdhvapuṇḍrair alaṅkṛtam <alaṃkṛtam> |
lāñchitaṃ <lāṃchitaṃ> cakraśaṅkhābhyāṃ <cakraśaṃkhābhyāṃ>
bhujayor dakṣiṇāditaḥ || 8.211
tulasīnalinākṣāṇāṃ mālādvitayabhūṣitam |
evaṃ dhyātvā viṣṇubhaktaṃ hṛdayādīṃś ca pūrvavat || 8.212
dhyātvātha pūjanaṃ kuryād āsanādyair yathoditaiḥ |
dvātriṃśadupacārair vā hy aṣṭabhir vā dviraṣṭabhiḥ || 8.213
japāntaṃ vāpi homāntaṃ tattanmantreṇa pūrvavat |
asvātantryād baliṃ tatra na kadāpi samācaret || 8.214
tattajjanmadine kuryāt teṣāṃ vaiśeṣikārcanam |
sahaiva devadevena saṅkrāntyāmayanādiṣu || 8.215
kāleṣv eteṣu kartavyam utsavabhramaṇādikam |
pṛthagvāpy utsavaḥ kāryo dhvajārohaṇavarjitaḥ || 8.216
na homā na balis tīrthaṃ pāratantrye vidhis tv ayam |
svātantrye cāgrahārādau vipine vā nadītaṭe || 8.217
saprakāraṃ samānaṃ tu yatheṣṭatalaśobhitam |
kalpayitvā prayatnena rathyābhiś ca pariṣkṛtam || 8.218
deśāntaragatānāṃ vā bhagavallokavāsinām |
dṛśyarūpam adṛśyaṃ vā devasārūpyatāṃ gatam || 8.219
sthāpayitvā vidhānena prāsāde mānuṣe pade |
divyamānuṣayor vātha divye vā mānuṣāśrite || 8.220
viṣṇor mantrāsanāvyaktapadmamadhyasthacetanāt |
bhaktabimbahṛdamboje caitanyam avatārya ca || 8.221
sakalīkṛtya mantreṇa sāṅgenābhyarcayet sadā |
āvāhane viśeṣo 'yaṃ jīvatāṃ vāpyajīvatām || 8.222
sarvatrāvyaktapadmādyair aṣṭabhir vā dviraṣṭabhiḥ |
bhogaiḥ prāguditaiḥ sphītaiḥ tāmbūlāntaiḥ samarcayet || 8.223
kṛtvā padmadhvajārohaṃ haṃsadhvajam athāpi vā |
samāropya yathāśāstraṃ kuryāt tatra mahotsavam || 8.224
balidānādikaṃ tīrthaṃ sarvaṃ tatra samācaret |
bhaktapraṇītā gādhāś ca śrutyantārthopabṛṃhitāḥ || 8.225
śrāvayed vidhivaddevaṃ bhaktyā gītipurassaram |
