dakṣiṇena kareṇaiva sarvāmarasamāśrayaḥ || 9.5
puṇḍarīkasamānābhavastrasraganulepanaḥ |
gadodyatakaro viprāḥ dhyātavyo vāstupūruṣaḥ || 9.6
kṣetreśaṃ dvibhujaṃ dhyāyed dhemābhavasanasrajam |
nīlajīmūtasaṅkāśaṃ daṇḍahastaṃ mahātanum || 9.7
muṣṭikṛdvāmahastena yāgakṣetrasya pālakam |
kuṇḍalādyair alaṅkārair etau śobhitavigrahau || 9.8
vīkṣamāṇau vibhor vaktraṃ tejasātīva nirbharau |
taptakāṃcanavarṇābhāṃ pravālasadṛśāmbarām || 9.9
hāranūpurakeyūrakaraṇḍamakuṭādikaiḥ |
alaṅkṛtām alaṅkāraiḥ puṇḍarīkanibhekṣaṇām || 9.10
akalaṅkasusampūrṇaśaraccandranibhānanām
<akalaṃkasusaṃpūrṇaśaraccandranibhānanām> |
padmakumbhakarāṃ lakṣmīṃ padmopari gatāṃ smaret || 9.11
padmāsanenopaviṣṭāṃ dvārasyordhva udumbare |
taruṇādityasaṅkāśo mahoraskaś caturbhujaḥ || 9.12
