madhupiṅgalanetraś ca kuṭilabhrūlatāyutaḥ || 9.14
pralambalolaśravaṇaḥ pṛthughrāṇaḥ smitānanaḥ |
kuṇḍalālaṅkṛtaś caiva hārakeyūrabhūṣitaḥ || 9.15
baddhoṣṇīṣalalāṭaś ca tilakenāpy alaṅkṛtaḥ |
