śaṅkukarṇābhidhāno yaḥ sarvanetrābhisaṃjñitaḥ || 9.40
dvāv etau campakābhau tu māyūravyajanodyatau |
mahāvibhūter devasya pratyagvāyudigāsthitau || 9.41
