noktaśeṣakarāṇāṃ tu tadviddhi kumudoditam |
ete bhagavato viprāstvantaraṅgā mayoditāḥ || 9.43
karmaṇā manasā vācā tadbhāgagatamānasāḥ |
jñānādiṣaḍgaṇopetair <jñānādiṣaḍguṇopetair> ākīrṇāḥ koṭiśaḥ paraiḥ || 9.44
bhūtaiḥ siddhair anantaiś ca prārthayānaiḥ paraṃ padam |
vastrabhūṣāṅgarāgādyaiḥ <vastrabhūṣāṃgarāgādyaiḥ> sarve te kumudopamāḥ 
|| 9.45
śvetamṛtkalpitenaiva hy ūrdhvapuṇḍreṇa bhūṣitāḥ |
