nānāgandhaviliptāṅgaṃ <nānāgandhaviliptāṃgaṃ> nāgaikādaśabhūṣitam || 
9.55
puṣpastabakasampūrṇamañjaliṃ <puṣpastabakasaṃpūrṇamaṃjaliṃ> dadhataṃ 
dvijāḥ |
