ete caturbhujāḥ sarve akṣasūtravibhūṣitāḥ |
cintayantaḥ paraṃ tattvaṃ varābhayakarodyatāḥ || 9.100
divyābharaṇadigdhāṅgā divyamālyāmbarānvitāḥ |
divyarūpadharāś caiva divyagandhavahā dvijāḥ || 9.101
raktaśuklaniśāpītanīlacampakasaprabhaiḥ |
vyomasphaṭikamārtāṇḍarājopalanibhais tathā || 9.102
mālyāṅgarāgavasanaiḥ mahārghaiḥ samalaṃkṛtāḥ <samalaṅkṛtāḥ> |
