nṛtyantaṃ madamattaṃ ca sahasrārāntarasthitam |
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ kuṭilabhrūlatāyutam || 9.107
kalpāntapāvakākāraṃ svaraśmipariveṣṭitam |
