pṛthūdaraṃ dīrghapucchaṃ pakṣamaṇḍalamaṇḍitam |
raktāmbaradharaṃ caiva raktasraganulepanam || 9.113
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ bhrakuṭīkuṭilekṣaṇam |
vicitrakañcukadharaṃ <vicitrakaṃcukadharaṃ>
bhujagendrair alaṅkṛtam <alaṃkṛtam> || 9.114
makuṭādyair alaṅkārair <alaṃkārair> vividhais tu vibhūṣitam |
bhujadvaye yaccakrasya vāme samparikīrtitam <saṃparikīrtitam> || 9.115
dakṣiṇe tadbhaved asya dakṣoktaṃ vāmakaṃ bhavet |
vajraṃ śaktis tathā daṇḍaḥ khaḍgaḥ pāśo dhvajas tathā || 9.116
śiśirākhyaṃ triśūlaṃ tu lāṅgalaṃ musalaṃ tathā |
pūrvādikramayogena caturthāvaraṇe sthitāḥ || 9.117
eteṣāṃ kramaśo dhyānaṃ sāmprataṃ <sāṃprataṃ> kathyate dvijāḥ |
vajraṃ vajropalābhaṃ tu sitadīrghanakhāṅkitam <sitadīrghanakhāṃkitam> || 9.118
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ jvalatkanakalocanam |
saudāminīprabhāṃ śaktiṃ śāntāgnivadanekṣaṇām || 9.119
ghanaghargharanirghoṣam udgirantīṃ muhurmuhuḥ |
baddham uṣṭiṃ smared daṇḍaṃ raktāṅgaṃ raktalocanam || 9.120
krodhamūrtiṃ svadaśanair daśantamadharaṃ svakam |
svaraśmikhacitaṃ dhyāyen nṛtyamānaṃ tu nandakam || 9.121
śaradākāśasaṅkāśaṃ daśantaṃ daśanāvalīm |
pāśaṃ guṇagaṇākīrṇaṃ vidyujjihvaṃ bhayānakam || 9.122
hemālipāṇḍurābhaṃ tu ghorāsyaṃ raktalocanam |
śarajjaladasaṅkāśaṃ dhvajaṃ kuṭilalocanam || 9.123
svatejasā jagatsarvaṃ dyotayantaṃ balotkaṭam |
śiśiraṃ śītadhāmābhaṃ pīnāṅgaṃ pṛthuvigraham || 9.124
jaṭākalāpadhṛtsaumyaṃ puṇḍarīkanibhekṣaṇam |
udayārkasahasrābhaṃ triśūlaṃ bhīṣaṇākṛtim || 9.125
kalpāntapāvakākāraṃ svaraśmipariveṣṭitam |
sandhyājaladasaṅkāśaṃ lāṅgalaṃ bhīmalocanam || 9.126
kṣāmāṅgam unnatāṃsaṃ tu vajrakāyaṃ balotkaṭam |
kundāvadātaṃ musalaṃ saumyamīṣatsmitānanam || 9.127
ravaṃ ravantaṃ madhuraṃ śrotrendriyasukhāv aham |
nīlaraktasitāpītapāvakāñjanasannibhaiḥ 
<nīlaraktasitāpītapāvakāṃjanasaṃnibhaiḥ> || 9.128
hemacandrahimākāśasamānābhaiḥ krameṇa tu |
mālyāṅgarāgavasanair <mālyāṃgarāgavasanair> ucitaiḥ
samalaṅkṛtāḥ <samalaṃkṛtāḥ> || 9.129
divyair ābharaṇair yuktāḥ svacihnāṅkitamastakāḥ <svacihnāṃkitamastakāḥ> |
tarjayantaś ca duṣṭaughaṃ dakṣiṇena kareṇa tu || 9.130
vāmena kaṭim ālambya susame sthānake sthitāḥ |
caturthāvaraṇadvāradakṣiṇottaraśākhayoḥ || 9.131
gaṅgāṃ <gaṃgāṃ> ca yamunāṃ caiva dhyātvā sampūjayet <saṃpūjayet> 
kramāt |
bhagavatpādasambhūtāṃ <bhagavatpādasaṃbhūtāṃ>
gaṅgāṃ <gaṃgāṃ> kumudasannibhām <kumudasaṃnibhām> || 9.132
navayauvanalāvaṇyasaukumāryagaṇair vṛtām |
nīlāṅgarāgavasanāṃ <nīlāṃgarāgavasanāṃ> nīlamālyair alaṅkṛtām 
<alaṃkṛtām> || 9.133
dvibhujāṃ saumyavadanāṃ puṇḍarīkanibhekṣaṇām |
hāranūpurakeyūrakuṇḍalādyupaśobhitām || 9.134
saṃsāratāpasantaptānārurukṣūn paraṃ padam |
vāsanākarmapaṅkāni kṣālayantīṃ svatejasā || 9.135
vahantīṃ dakṣiṇenaiva kalaśaṃ vāripūritam |
vāmena tarjayantīṃ tu kareṇa prākṛtān janān || 9.136
yamunāṃ nīlaratnābhāṃ nīlakuñcitamūrdhajām <nīlakuṃcitamūrdhajām> |
sitāṅgarāgavasanāṃ <sitāṃgarāgavasanāṃ> sitamālyopaśobhitāṃ || 9.137
dakṣiṇe tarjanīmudrā vāme tu kalaśaḥ smṛtaḥ |
anyatsarvaṃ tu gaṅgoktamatrāpi syān munīśvarāḥ || 9.138
lohitākṣo mahāvīryas tv aprameyaḥ suśobhanaḥ |
vīrahā vikramo bhīmaḥ śatāvartas tu cāṣṭamaḥ || 9.139
aiśvarīdikkrameṇaiva pañcamāvaraṇe <paṃcamāvaraṇe> sthitāḥ |
dhyāyec candrapratīkāśaṃ lohitākṣaṃ balotkaṭam || 9.140
nīlāmbaradharaṃ nīlamālyaṃ nīlānulepanam |
mahāvīryaṃ mahākāyaṃ pītavarṇaṃ mahābhujam || 9.141
pravālābhāmbaradharaṃ raktasraganulepanam |
saṃsmared aprameyākhyam aprameyabalotkaṭam || 9.142
haritākṛtimāpītavasanasragvilepanam |
suśobhanaṃ śobhanāṅgaṃ muktāphalanibhaṃ smaret || 9.143
atasīpuṣpasaṅkāśavāsomālyānulepanam |
vīraghnaṃ vīrahākhyaṃ ca dhyāyec caṃpakasannibham <caṃpakasaṃnibham> || 
9.144
vāhlīkārañjitāraktavasanasragvimaṇḍitam 
<vāhlīkāraṃjitāraktavasanasragvimaṇḍitam> |
vikramaṃ vikramāvāsaṃ cāṣodaranibhaṃ smaret || 9.145
kundendukāntivasanaṃ sitamālyānulepanam |
bhīmaṃ bhīmākṛtiṃ dhyāyet taptakāñcanasannibham <taptakāṃcanasaṃnibham> || 
9.146
pāṇḍarāruṇakauśeyaṃ tadvadgandhasraganvitam |
atasīkusumaśyāmaṃ śatāvartaṃ tu bhāvayet || 9.147
pītāmbaradharaṃ pītamālyagandhavibhūṣitam |
bhujadvayānvitā hy ete cāntarmuditamānasāḥ || 9.148
dakṣiṇaiḥ pāṇibhiḥ sarve jvalantaṃ paraśuṃ tathā |
vāmaiḥ śaṅkhavaraṃ dīptaṃ dadhānāś cārukuṇḍalāḥ || 9.149
samāḥ samavibhaktāṅgāḥ <samavibhaktāṃgāḥ> praśāntākṛtayas tathā |
sthānakaiḥ saṃsthitāḥ sarve saprabhābhir virājitāḥ || 9.150
prasannavadanāḥ saumyāḥ trailokyoddharaṇakṣamāḥ |
hāranūpurakeyūrapūrvabhūṣāvibhūṣitāḥ || 9.151
tadājñāprekṣakāś caiva duṣṭadoṣopaśāntidāḥ |
balena mahatā kṣiptadevāsuramahoragāḥ || 9.152
ekavīrāsahāyāś ca tv aprayatnena līlayā |
ābrahmabhavanaṃ śaśvatparivartayituṃkṣamāḥ <śaśvatparivartayituṅkṣamāḥ>|| 
9.153
etadāvaraṇadvāracatuṣke dvāradevatāḥ |
nyasyed yugmaprayogeṇa pūrvadvārāditaḥ kramāt || 9.154
vajranābhaṃ karīśaṃ ca pūrvasyāṃ dakṣiṇottare |
dhyāyet tu vajranābhākhyaṃ śatadhāmasamaprabham || 9.155
mukhyadakṣiṇahastena niṣedhābhinayānvitam |
vetralatāṃ dvitīyena cakrarājaṃ tṛtīyataḥ || 9.156
mukhyavāmakareṇaiva śroṇītaṭakṛtārpaṇam |
śaṅkharājaṃ <śaṃkharājaṃ> dvitīyena tathā vajraṃ tṛtīyataḥ || 9.157
dhārayantaṃ tathā rukmabhūṣaṇair vividhair api |
raktamālyāmbaradharaṃ raktasraganulepanam || 9.158
evaṃ vāme harīśaṃ ca niṣedhābhinayojjhitam |
praveśābhinayākhyena pāṇinā kiṃ tu cihnitam || 9.159
eko hy atra niṣedhaṃ ca tv abhaktānāṃ karoti vai ||
bhaktānām aparaś caiva praveśaṃ samprayacchati <saṃprayacchati> || 9.160
dvāre dvāre pratīhāradvayasyaivaṃ prayojanam |
dakṣoktaṃ vajranābhasya taddharīśasya vāmagam || 9.161
ādyavāmagataṃ sarvam anyadakṣiṇapāṇigam |
dharmādhyakṣaninyatrīśau dakṣiṇe dakṣiṇottare || 9.162
kuryād antakasādṛśyau pūrvavadbhujabhūṣitau |
pītakauśeyavasanau pītamālyavilepanau || 9.163
kiṃ tu daṇḍagadāhastau vajracakravivarjitau |
śuddhākṣamamṛtānandaṃ pratīcyāṃ dakṣiṇāditaḥ || 9.164
bāṇakārmukam ekasmin pāṇau pāśam athāpare |
ādyaṃ karacatuṣkaṃ yattadvyagraṃ pūrvavadbhavet || 9.165
ākṛtau jalanāthasya sadṛśau sarvadaiva hi |
nīlakauśeyavasanau nīlasraganulepanau || 9.166
vasunāthaṃ sudhānandamudagdigdakṣiṇottare |
khaḍgamudgarahastau ca prāgvaccheṣaṃ catuṣṭayam || 9.167
karāṇāmanayoḥ kāryaṃ rūpeṇoḍupateḥ samau |
atasīkusumaśyāmakauśeyasragvilepanau || 9.168
bhūṣaṇair bhūṣitā hy ete vividhair vajranābhavat |
ṣaṣṭāvaraṇadevānāṃ tadvārsthānāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 9.169
śṛṇudhvaṃ dhyānamadhunā tattvato munipuṅgavāḥ |
pūrvādīśānaparyantaṃ ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇasaṃsthitāḥ || 9.170
etāś ca devatā viprās tejorūpasamanvitāḥ |
kālo 'pi yanniyantā ca śāstraṃ nānāṅgalakṣaṇam || 9.171
vidyādhipatayaś caiva sarudraḥ sagaṇaḥ viśvaḥ |
prajāpatisamūhas tu indraḥ saparivārakaḥ || 9.172
mukhye dvāracatuṣke tu pūrvavatsaṃsthitāḥ kramāt |
cakraśaṅkhau padmagade lāṃgalaṃ <lāṅgalaṃ> musalaṃ śarāḥ || 9.173
śārṅgaṃ caite kramād dhyeyā vidyuttuhinakundabhāḥ |
pītanīlasitāraktasitagokṣīrasannibhaiḥ <saṃnibhaiḥ> || 9.174
haritālāruṇābhais tu vastramālyānulepanaiḥ |
sarvaratnamayair yuktair bhūṣaṇair apy alaṅkṛtāḥ || 9.175
mahābalā mahāvīryās tv ekavaktrā dvibāhavaḥ |
ete tu nāyakāḥ sarve svacihnāṅkitamastakāḥ <svacihnāṃkitamastakāḥ> || 9.176
duṣṭaughaṃ tarjayantaś ca dakṣiṇena kareṇa tu |
kaṭimālambya vāmena sthānakaiḥ susamaiḥ sthitāḥ || 9.177
dṛḍhavrato bahuśirā mahākāyo mahābalaḥ |
jitakrodho durādharṣo mahotsāhastrivikramaḥ || 9.178
atulo duṣṭahārciṣmān sarvadṛgduratikramaḥ |
viṣamo gahano 'moghaṣṣoḍaśopapraveśadāḥ || 9.179
śakrāgnimadhyam ārabhya śakreśānāntarāvadhi |
śuklaśoṇasuvarṇālipiṅgaraktasitāsitāḥ || 9.180
raktapītātasīhemaśoṇaśubhrasitāsitāḥ |
varṇānurūpasadvastramālyālepanabhūṣaṇāḥ || 9.181
nāmānurūpacāritrāḥ śaṃkhamudgaradhāriṇaḥ <śaṅkhamudgaradhāriṇaḥ> |
savyetarakrameṇaiva praveśakaniṣedhakāḥ || 9.182
kṣaṇād bhuvanasaṃhārasṛṣṭisthitikṛtikṣamāḥ |
uktān etān krameṇaiva pūrvavatsaṃprapūjayet || 9.183
munayaḥ sapta pūrvenye gṛhāstārādikair vṛtāḥ |
jīmūtāś cākhilā nāgās tv apsarogaṇa uttamaḥ || 9.184
oṣadhyaś caiva paśavo yajñāḥ sāṅgākhilās tu ye |
sūkṣmarūpeṇa tiṣṭhanti pūrvavatsaptamāvṛtau || 9.185
sambhavaḥ <saṃbhavaḥ> prabhavaś caiva pūrṇaḥ puṣkara eva ca |
ānando nandanaś caiva vīrasenaḥ suṣeṇakaḥ || 9.186
tanmukhyadvāraśākhāsthau dvau dvau dakṣiṇavāmayoḥ |
sambhavaḥ <saṃbhavaḥ> śvetavarṇas tu prabhavaḥ
kundasannibhaḥ <kundasaṃnibhaḥ> || 9.187
pūrṇas tu raktavarṇābhas tv atiraktas tu puṣkaraḥ |
ānandaḥ pītavarṇas tu hemābho nanda ucyate || 9.188
kṛṣṇābho vīrasenas tu suṣeṇo 'ñjanasannibhaḥ <'ṃjanasaṃnibhaḥ> |
makuṭāṅgadacitrāṅgā <makuṭāṃgadacitrāṃgā> gadāhastā dvibāhavaḥ || 9.189
caturbhujā vā viprendrāḥ śaṃkhacakragadāgharāḥ (śaṅkhacakragadādharāḥ) |
pūrvavatpāṇinānyena praveśakaniṣedhakāḥ || 9.190
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanā nigrahānugrahakṣamāḥ |
kṣemakṛcchivakṛtprājño homakṛdbhūtabhāvanaḥ || 9.191
yugāntāgnyaśanaś caiva saṃvarto bhīṣaṇas tathā |
saṅkrandanaś cānimiṣaḥ śataparvā śatānanaḥ || 9.192
audumbaraḥ prakṛtiko virāmaś cāṃśumāly api |
aupadauvārikaṃ tv etadgaṇaṣoḍaśakaṃ kramāt || 9.193
dṛḍavratādisadṛśaṃ varṇataḥ ṣaḍbhujānvitam |
vāmadakṣiṇayogena pṛṣṭhataḥ pūrvapaścimam || 9.194
śaṃkhamudgarapadmākṣavarābhayasamanvitam
<śaṅkhamudgarapadmākṣavarābhayasamanvitam> |
nānāvarṇasraguṣṇīṣavastrālepanabhūṣaṇam || 9.195
prāguktaguṇaśauryāḍhyaṃ sarvakarmakṛtikṣamam |
tacchobhāṣṭakarakṣārthaṃ śataganyurvirocanaḥ || 9.196
apratarkyas tv anullaṅghyas tv aprameyābhidhānakaḥ |
amarṣī ca mahābhūtaś cakorākṣas tathāṣṭamaḥ || 9.197
indrāgnimadhyopadvārapārśvaśobhāsvanukramāt |
ekaikaśaḥ sthitāḥ śūrāḥ praveśakaniṣedhakāḥ || 9.198
nīlapītajapāśyāmasitahiṅgulakendubhāḥ |
mahābalā mahāvīryāḥ sudurlaṅghyaparākramāḥ || 9.199
nānāvidhāmbarasragbhir bhūṣaṇair anulepanaiḥ |
anyair anupadiṣṭaiś ca yathāśobham alaṅkṛtāḥ <alaṃkṛtāḥ> || 9.200
ṣāḍguṇyamahimāyuktāś caturhastāḥ krameṇa tu |
pṛṣṭhadakṣiṇavāmābhyāṃ cakraśaṅkhasamanvitāḥ || 9.201
gadāgropariviśrāntamukhyahastadvayānvitāḥ |
dvāropadvāraśobheśān etān sampūjayet <saṃpūjayet> kramāt || 9.202
vidyā caivāparāvidyā pāvakaś caiva mārutaḥ |
candrārkau vārivasudhe hy etāḥ saṃsāradevatāḥ || 9.203
sūkṣmarūpeṇa tiṣṭhanti bāhyāvaraṇabhūtale |
amareśo virūpākṣaḥ sudharmiṣṭho niyāmakaḥ || 9.204
sarvasatvāśrayaś ceti gahanas tadanantaram |
mahārājeśvaraś cāpi dhanādhyakṣeśvaras tathā || 9.205
ete gaṇeśvarās tv aṣṭau tanmukhyadvārapālakāḥ |
dhyeyāś caturbhujāḥ sarve mukhyapāṇidvayena tu || 9.206
amareśavirūpākṣau vajravetralatākarau |
pṛṣṭhagābhyāṃ tu pāṇibhyāṃ cakraśaṅkhasamujvalau <cakraśaṃkhasamujvalau> 
|| 9.207
kuṅkumāñjanasaṅkāśau <kuṃkumāṃjanasaṃkāśau> daṃṣṭrayā vikṛtānanau |
dakṣiṇottarayogena lāñchanavyatyayānvitau <lāṃchanavyatyayānvitau> || 9.208
dvāradakṣiṇavāmasthau praveśakaniṣedhakau |
sudharmiṣṭho niyantā ca susitaśyāmalaprabhau || 9.209
subhīmadaṇḍahastau ca vajrāyudhavivarjitau |
yathākramoditānanyān dhārayantau yathāvidhi || 9.210
sarvasatvāśrayaś cātigahanaḥ śyāmalaḥ sitaḥ |
kiṃ tu pāśakarāv etau pūrvavadbhujabhūṣitau || 9.211
mahārājeśvaro rakto dhanādhyakṣeśvaro 'sitaḥ |
śiśirāyudhasaṃyuktau trikam anyad yathā purā || 9.212
mahābalā mahāvīryā duṣṭadoṣakṣayaṅkarāḥ |
durnirīkṣāś ca durdharṣā daityadānavahiṃsakāḥ || 9.213
nānāmahārghavāsobhiḥ bhūṣālepair alaṅkṛtāḥ |
maharṣabhaṃ prabhūtaṃ ca gambhīraṃ prāṇagocaram || 9.214
yogāṅgaṃ yoganilayaṃ sanātanam aśṛṃkhalam <aśṛṅkhalam> |
tārakāntaritaṃ tāraṃ virāmaṃ viṣamaṃ tathā || 9.215
duratikramaṃ <<durākramaṃ>> durgahaṃ ca sudhūmramanilāśanam |
tatsālakopadvāreṣu vinyaset pūrvavartmanā || 9.216
uktopadvārapālānāṃ varṇataḥ samam ujvalam |
gaṇaṣoḍaśakaṃ tv etaccatuṣpāṇisamanvitam || 9.217
gauṇavāmakarādyaṃ tu mukhyavāmakarāvadhi |
śaṃkhapaṭṭasahastaṃ <śaṅkhapaṭṭasahastaṃ> ca niṣedhābhinayāṅkitam || 9.218
praveśābhinayāṅkaṃ ca nānāvarṇāmbarasrajam |
nānāsthānakasaṃyuktaṃ nānābhūṣaṇabhūṣitam || 9.219
akṣasūtradharaṃ vātha prapannānāṃ praveśakṛt |
niṣedhakṛt tathānyeṣāṃ vyastavyaṃ munisattamāḥ || 9.220
devavrataṃ nirātaṅkaṃ bhīṣmaṃ ca puruṣaṃ tathā |
ugraṃ vīreśvaraṃ ramyam ariṣṭaṃ munisattamāḥ || 9.221
nirviṣaṇṇaṃ yugāntāṃśaṃ śatānandaṃ śatānanam |
tejodharaṃ viśālākṣaṃ yugāṃśaṃ devanandanam || 9.222
etaṃ dviraṣṭaśobhāsu gaṇam ekaikaśo nyaset |
upadvāreśasadṛśaṃ varṇato lāñchanair <lāṃchanair> vinā || 9.223
caturbhiḥ pāṇibhiś caiva pṛṣṭhadakṣiṇapūrvakam |
mukhyadakṣiṇahastāntaṃ śaṃkhacakragadādharam <śaṅkhacakragadādharam> || 
9.224
niṣedhakṛc ca pāpānām apāpānāṃ praveśakṛt |
nānāsragambaroṣṇīṣabhūṣālepādyalaṅkṛtāḥ || 9.225
anantācintyavibhavāḥ sarvabhūtasamāśrayāḥ |
nānāśastrāstrakuśalāḥ nānājñānasamanvitāḥ || 9.226
nirastānekadaityeśāḥ sādhūnāṃ pālanodyatāḥ |
dvāradvayānvite sāle mukhyadvāragatāv ubhau || 9.227
tiṣṭhataḥ sūkṣmarūpeṇa tadanyadvārapārśvayoḥ |
prākārasarvakoṇeṣu vahnikoṇādito nyaset || 9.228
prabhavāpyayarūpāṇāṃ mūrtīnāṃ caturātmanām |
tathā mūrtyantarāṇāṃ ca tatkāntānām anukramāt || 9.229
mantrāṇām astrasaṃghādi <astrasaṅghādi> teṣāṃ rūpam anusmaran |
caturṇām api koṇānām avyaktaṃ bhavanād bahiḥ || 9.230
saṃyajed bhavanāmnā vai yasmān nānyo bhavaḥ smṛtaḥ |
teṣāṃ bahiḥ svamantreṇa dikkrameṇa tu hetirāṭ <<hetipam>> || 9.231
svamarīcigaṇenaiva bhāsayantaṃ niveśya ca |
nyasyaivam arcanaṃ kuryān mantramudrānvitena tu || 9.232
nirīkṣaṇādiśuddhena arghyasrakcandanādinā |
vāsudevābhidhānas tu devaḥ ṣāḍguṇyavigrahaḥ || 9.233
karmiṇām upakārārthaṃ prāsādaṃ sthūlavigraham |
sarvajñānakriyāḍhyaṃ ca sarvatatvasamāśrayam || 9.234
samāsādyānugṛhṇāti sadārcāntargataḥ prabhuḥ |
tasmāt tadaṅgabhūteṣu prākāreṣv aṣṭasu kramāt || 9.235
pṛthvyādibuddhiniṣṭhan tu bāhyatatvāṣṭakaṃ nyaset |
prāsādaś cāṅgasaṃyuktaḥ prakṛtistriguṇātmikā || 9.236
tadgatā pratimā jīvas tadgataḥ paramaḥ pumān |
ato 'dhidaivatāny atra tatvāny etāny anukramāt || 9.237
sarvatra vyāpakatvena dhyātvā sampūjayet <saṃpūjayet> tataḥ |
sarvādhāramayenaiva sarvasatvāśrayeṇa ca || 9.238
sarvadoṣaviṣaghnena kālacakrāmbujena tu |
sampuṭīkṛtya <saṃpuṭīkṛtya> bhavanaṃ saprākāramathordhvataḥ || 9.239
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> hārdayīṃ mudrāṃ cakramudrāsamanvitām |
pradarśya sarvato dikṣu kavacenāvakuṇṭhayet || 9.240
ekamūrtividhāne ca tathaikadvārabhūṣite |
bhavane 'yaṃ vidhānasyād digvyūhapariniṣṭhite || 9.241
caturdvārānvite gehe digdvārāgrasthamaṇṭape |
sarvatobhadrasāle ca aghanirmocane 'pi ca || 9.242
sadadhvadeśadharmākhye dvāradvidvitayānvite |
dvārapālagaṇanyāse viśeṣo 'yaṃ prakāśyate || 9.243
caṇḍādyāś ca subhadrāntāḥ prāsādadvāś catuṣṭaye |
nyasanīyāḥ krameṇaiva pūrvavaddvaṃdvayogataḥ || 9.244
dvārordhvodumbaradvandvadvitayasthā yathākramam |
lakṣmīḥ kīrtir jayā māyā devyaḥ prāguktalakṣaṇāḥ || 9.245
satyaḥ suparṇo garuḍas tārkṣyas tv agreṣu saṃsthitāḥ |
anivartī mahāvṛttir darpahā sarvajit sthiraḥ || 9.246
jayanto bhayakṛnmānī tv aṣṭamo dvijasattamāḥ |
digagramaṇṭapadvāraśākhāpārśvaṃ samāsthitāḥ || 9.247
anivartīṃ mahāvṛttiḥ kṛṣṇābhaḥ śukasannibhaḥ <śukasaṃnibhaḥ> |
darpahā sarvajic caiva pāṇḍuraktasuvarṇabhau || 9.248
sthiro jayantaḥ satataṃ śyāmāñjanasamadyutī <śyāmāṃjanasamadyutī> |
bhayakṛc caiva mānī ca piṅgalaḥ <piṃgalaḥ> pāṇḍurojvalaḥ || 9.249
dvibhujāḥ sarva evaite dakṣiṇena kareṇa tu |
nandakaṃ śaṃkham <śaṅkham> anyena dadhānāḥ krūravikramāḥ || 9.250
yadā caturbhujā dhyeyās tadā caite gaṇeśvarāḥ |
mukhyadakṣiṇahastena khaḍgavetralatānvitāḥ || 9.251
tathā vāmakare śaṃkhaṃ <śaṅkhaṃ> pṛṣṭhage dakṣiṇāditaḥ |
pāṇidvaye cakrapadme bibhrato jvalanaprabhāḥ || 9.252
nānāvastrasraguṣṇīṣabhūṣaṇālepanānvitāḥ |
vyatyastahastacaraṇā lāñchanavyatyayānvitāḥ <lāṃchanavyatyayānvitāḥ> || 9.253
ūrjitaś cāmṛtāṅgas <cāmṛtāṃgas> tu sarvāṅgaḥ <sarvāṃgaḥ> sarvatomukhaḥ |
śubhrāṅgo <śubhrāṃgo> varadaś caiva vāgīśaḥ śabdavikramaḥ || 9.254
pāñcajanyaviśeṣā <pāṃcajanyaviśeṣā> hi dvau dvau caiva kramāt sthitau |
sarvatobhadrasālasthacaturdvāreṣu pūrvavat || 9.255
dvibāhavas tu saṃsmaryāḥ dakṣiṇena kareṇa tu |
gṛhītamusalāḥ sarve śaṃkham <śaṅkham> anyena pāṇinā || 9.256
dadhānāś caiva catvāraḥ pūrve bandhūkasannibhāḥ <bandhūkasaṃnibhāḥ> |
anye parabhṛtābhās tu sarvabhūṣaṇabhūṣitāḥ || 9.257
balena mahatā kṣiptadevāsuramahoragāḥ |
ekavīrāsahāyāś ca aprayatnena līlayā || 9.258
ābrahmabhavanaṃ śaśvatparivartayituṃ kṣamāḥ |
viśveśo viśvakṛdviśvo viśvātmā viśvalocanaḥ || 9.259
viśvapādo viśvabhujas tathā vai viśvakarmakṛt |
ete dvitīyasālasya digdvāreṣu niyāmakāḥ || 9.260
dvibāhavaḥ parijñeyāḥ vāmadakṣiṇayogataḥ |
gadākhaḍgāstrasaṃyuktāḥ karaṇḍamakuṭānvitāḥ || 9.261
śoṇapiṅgasitaśyāmā raktapītasitāsitāḥ |
sarvavarṇāmbarālepasragbhūṣābhir virājitāḥ || 9.262
ekavīrāsahāyāś ca sarvadoṣanivārakāḥ |
taddvārāntarabhāgeṣu vāmadakṣiṇayogataḥ || 9.263
prāsādābhimukhān nyasyen nidhinātheśvarān kramāt |
śaṃkhapadmau <śaṅkhapadmau> mahāpadmaśatadhāmābhidhau tataḥ || 9.264
akhaṇḍitaḥ santataś cānantadhāra iti śrutaḥ |
sarvadvāra iti khyātaḥ prathamau pūrvam īritau || 9.265
anyeṣāṃ vakṣyate ṣaṇṇāṃ varṇarūpādikaṃ kramāt |
raktaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ suvarṇābhaḥ sitāruṇatamālabhāḥ || 9.266
śaṃkhapadmanidhīśoktasarvalakṣaṇalakṣitāḥ
<śaṅkhapadmanidhīśoktasarvalakṣaṇalakṣitāḥ> |
vasuratnasuvarṇāṣṭalohadhānyadhanādhipāḥ || 9.267
sarvoṣadhīnidhīśānās teṣām ūrdhve sukhāsanāḥ |
sarvālaṅkārasaṃyuktāḥ svāśritābhimatapradāḥ || 9.268
tataḥ tṛtīyāvaraṇadvāreṣu dvandvayogataḥ |
taddakṣiṇottarābhyāṃ tu śākhābhyāṃ vinyaset kramāt || 9.269
purataś cakragaruḍau halatālau tu dakṣiṇe |
paścime śārṅgamakarau saumye nandakaṛśyakau || 9.270
cakrapakṣīśasīrāṇāṃ śaṅkhanandakayor api |
sveṣu sthāneṣu pūrvoktaṃ varṇarūpādikaṃ dvijāḥ || 9.271
anyeṣāṃ tālapūrvāṇāṃ trayāṇām atha vakṣyate |
tālo dhvajaḥ syād bhūtādibālarūpābhimānakaḥ || 9.272
jhaṣaḥ sarvāṅganibhṛto jagadbīja udāhṛtaḥ |
sasarvopadravo ṛśyaḥ saṃsāraś capalātmakaḥ || 9.273
etān sūkṣmasvarūpeṇa dhyātvā sampūjayet <saṃpūjayet> kramāt |
gaṅgā ca yamunā godā nadī ca mahatī tathā || 9.274
vitastā narmadā caiva jambvākhyā ca sarasvatī |
nadyaś caturthasālasya digdvāreṣu kramāt sthitāḥ || 9.275
gaṅgāyamunayor uktaṃ varṇarūpādikaṃ purā |
tābhyām anyāḥ samānās tu varṇaśobhāṃ vinaiva tu || 9.276
sitāruṇāḥ sitasvarṇasitakundasamaprabhāḥ |
pramattaprauḍhaveṣāś ca nānābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ || 9.277
sarvadhātuvicitrāṅgāḥ sarvaratnavirājitāḥ |
sudhākumbhadharā dvābhyāṃ karābhyāṃ pūrvavac ca tāḥ || 9.278
evaṃ digdvārabhavanadvārsthasthitir udāhṛtā |
ekamūrteṣu diṅramūrteḥ prākāreṣūrdhvageṣu ca || 9.279
dvārādayas tadīyāś ca sāmānyāḥ samudāhṛtāḥ |
sarvasālapratīhāraśākhāpārśvagatāv ubhau || 9.280
dhyeyau vā sthāpanīyau vā bāhyāhāragatau yadi |
yathoktalakṣaṇopetau sthāpanīyau yathākramam || 9.281
evamāvaraṇeśānān dhyātvā saṃsthāpya vārcayet |
dhyānotthāḥ pīṭhadeśeṣu svākārātmasu sadmasu || 9.282
tadarthamaṅkaṇakṣetraṃ tridhā vā pañcadhā <paṃcadhā> bhajet |
tribhāgam ekabhāgaṃ vā tyaktvā tanmadhyato bahiḥ || 9.283
pīṭhaṃ vāyatanaṃ kuryāt sarvadikṣvantare 'tha vā |
adharottaraniṣṭhābhyāṃ prāgukte pūrvavat sthite || 9.284
śileṣṭakādibhiḥ kḷptāḥ pīṭhikā hastavistṛtāḥ |
tadardhenocchritāḥ sarvāḥ sarvālaṅkāraśobhitāḥ || 9.285
caturaśrāḥ suvṛttā vā sampūjyā <saṃpūjyā> vātha kevalāḥ |
grāmādivāstudevānāṃ khadigbhāgagateṣu ca || 9.286
gomayādivilipteṣu maṇḍaleṣu baliṃ haret |
vistārocchrāyamānādvau pīṭhāḥ prāguktalakṣaṇāḥ || 9.287
ardhamānena vā kāryā rathayātrāvirodhataḥ |
evamāvaraṇeśānāḥ pīṭheṣu svāsu dikṣu ca || 9.288
duṣṭadoṣanirāsārthaṃ prāsādābhimukhaṃ sthitāḥ |
catuḥsthānāvatīrṇasya dvāre ca yajanālaye || 9.289
sthāpanaṃ gaṇanāthānāṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
vāstukṣetreśasaṃjñau dvau prāgdvāre pūrvavat sthitau || 9.290
lakṣmīḥ kīrtir jayā māyā dvāreṣūrdhvasthitāḥ kramāt |
vajranābhādayo devā dvau dvau digdvāraśākhayoḥ || 9.291
prāgādidvārakumbheṣu sambhavaprabhavādayaḥ <saṃbhavaprabhavādayaḥ> |
kumudādyantaraṅgaṃ ca bhūtānām aṣṭakaṃ param || 9.292
dvārāntaryugmayuktyā tu bhramaṇīdeśam āśritam |
suparṇaś cakrasaṃjñaś ca satyaḥ kaumodakī dvijāḥ || 9.293
yojanīyāḥ krameṇaiva dvārāṇām agrabhūtale |
hemadaṇḍagataḥ satyaḥ kiṃ tu paścimadiggataḥ || 9.294
caṇḍādyāś ca subhadrāntāḥ dvau dvau prāgādiṣu dvijāḥ |
dakṣiṇottarayogena toraṇastaṃbhamūlagāḥ || 9.295
cakradvitayamadhyasthaḥ pakṣīśastoraṇopari |
tatpārśvayoḥ sthitaṃ cakraṃ nānāvarṇapatākayoḥ || 9.296
satyādikaṃ catuṣkaṃ tu madhyavedyā dhvajāṣṭake |
prabhavāpyayayogena pūjyaṃ prāgādiyogataḥ || 9.297

           << ... pakṣīśastoraṇopari |
susitāsu patākāsu satyākhyo vihagādhipaḥ ||
suparṇaḥ śoṇavarṇāsu garuḍaḥ piṅgalāsu ca |
rājapāṣāṇavarṇāsu tārkṣyasaṃjñaḥ pratiṣṭhitaḥ ||
nānāvarṇapatākāyāṃ sampūjyo <saṃpūjyo> vihageśvaraḥ |
indrādilokapālās te ... >>

indrādilokapālās te siddhasaṃghapuraḥsarāḥ <siddhasaṅghapuraḥsarāḥ> |
vajrādayas tadastrāś ca svāsu dikṣuṃ bahiḥ sthitāḥ || 9.298
mukhyakalpe 'tha vānyeṣu nimitteṣv evam āvaret |
anukalpe 'tha caṇḍādīn vāstunāthādipūrvakam || 9.299
dvāreṣu kevalān nyasya garuḍāntaṃ prapūjayet |
sarvadvāreṣu vā pūjyaḥ sahetīśaḥ patatripaḥ || 9.300
vividhāsu pratiṣṭhāsu jīrṇoddhāravidhāv api |
mahotsaveṣu sarveṣu dhvajārohaṇakarmaṇi || 9.301
maṅgalāṅkurarope ca pavitrārohaṇādiṣu |
tathā cānantakalaśādyabhiṣekavidhāv api || 9.302
prāyaścitteṣv anityeṣu kāmyeṣv api ca nityaśaḥ |
mukhyakalpoktavidhinā kuryād anyatra cānyathā || 9.303
siddhasaṃghās <siddhasaṅghās> tathendrādyāstadastrāś ca yathākramam |
lokadikpālakās tv ete svasenābhiḥ samāvṛtāḥ || 9.304
prasiddhaprāgvaśenaiva nityaṃ svaṃ sthānam āśritāḥ |
dikpālakatvād āsṛṣṭer yatas teṣāṃ sthitiḥ sthirā || 9.305
bhagavanmantramūrtīnām anantānāṃ munīśvarāḥ |
svasthānasthā namasyanti pūjayanti japanti ca || 9.306
dhvajādyair upacāraiś ca samyak paricaranti ca |
kaivalyasiddhaye śaśvadbahubhiḥ svānugaiḥ saha || 9.307
pālayanti ca bhaktānāṃ balabhojo dadanti ca |
dhvaṃsayanti ca vighnaughamaniśaṃ mantrayājinām || 9.308
saṃrakṣanti phalaṃ māntraṃ vardhamānaṃ dvilakṣaṇam |
adhikāram anādīyaṃ śaktibījaṃ jagatprabhoḥ || 9.309
diksiddhaye daśatvaṃ tadvyaktaye 'ṣṭadiśātmatā |
bāhyatrisālabhūmiṣṭhāḥ kālādyā bhavadevatāḥ || 9.310
tatsādhakatvāt pūrvoktadigbhāge niyatāḥ sadā |
vajranābhādayo devāḥ lokadigdvārapālakāḥ || 9.311
tathāmareśapūrvāś ca sambhavaprabhavādayaḥ <saṃbhavaprabhavādayaḥ> |
prasiddhaprākkrameṇaiva digdvāreṣu sthitāḥ kramāt || 9.312
kālādyam aṣṭakaṃ nityam indrādyaṃ rudrapaścimam |
niyantā kālatatvānte tadante susthitaṃ viyat || 9.313
kramāt pūrvottare koṇe nyased dakṣiṇapaścime |
vidyāvidyādvayaṃ yad vai svapadasthe 'gnimārute || 9.314
candrādityāv udagyāmyasthānayor viniveśya ca |
pratyagbhāgagataṃ toyaṃ prāgbhāge vinyased dharām || 9.315
kumudādyāvṛtīśānā lohitākṣādayas tathā |
vajranābhādikaṃ muktvā dvārapālaṃ triraṣṭakam || 9.316
dvārapālagaṇās tv ete sālakoṇagatās tathā |
proktakrameṇa tiṣṭhanti bhagavatprāgapekṣayā || 9.317
kumudādigaṇeśānāḥ puragrāmādivāstuni |
pālikāvasadhe caiva dikpāloktavaśāt sthitāḥ || 9.318
trisandhyam eva devānāṃ balidānaṃ samācaret |
saṅkalpiteṣu sāleṣu dvārāvaraṇavāsinām || 9.319
asaṅkalpitasāloktadevānāṃ nācared balim |
tattannirmāṇakāle tān pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi || 9.320
devayātrāsametan tu balidānaṃ samācaret |
evaṃ sarvaṃ samāpādya mahāpīṭhordhvabhūtalam || 9.321
prakṣālitaṃ samāruhya prāgmukho vāṣyudaṅmukhaḥ |
tadūrdhvām bujadikpatre kumudādīn athāntare || 9.322
sarvabhūtān pāriṣadānāhūya grahasaṃjñitān |
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> sodakaṃ tatra baliśeṣaṃ samutkiret || 9.323
paścād ācamya vidhivat snātvā vā saṃviśed gṛham |
sarvadvārāvṛtīśānāṃ koṇasthānāṃ samarcane || 9.324
natipraṇavasaṃyuktaḥ svanāmā mantra īritaḥ |
mahāpīṭhasthabhūtānāṃ pārṣadānāṃ grahātmanām || 9.325
tārānte viṣṇuśabdaṃ ca niyuñjyād <niyuṃjyād> uditakramāt |
sarvakoṇagatā mantrāḥ phaḍantāḥ samudīritāḥ || 9.326
sarve samuditā mantrāḥ svāhāntā homakarmaṇi |
dhyātvaivam arcya tanmantrair arghyādyair upacārakaiḥ || 9.327
darśayed āvṛtīśānāṃ mudrāṃ tarjanisaṃjñitām |
dvārapālagaṇānāṃ tu caṇḍādyuktam anantaram || 9.328
dharmādyāvaraṇād ūrdhvaṃ hetunā yena kena cit |
balidānam aśakyaṃ cet tatratyānāṃ yathākramam || 9.329
sarvatobhadrapūrveṣu dviguṇīkṛtya cācaret |
mukhyakalpe tathānyatra yathāśaktyāvṛtikṣitau || 9.330
tadbāhyāvṛtidevānām āvṛtyāvṛtya tarpayet |
dvāropadvārapālānāṃ tasmin dvāre samarpayet || 9.331
mahāpīṭhoditānāṃ ca tadvārāgrakamaṇḍale |
dhyānotthānāṃ tv asañcāre <asaṃcāre> na doṣaḥ kena hetunā || 9.332
tattadāvaraṇadvāradeśeṣūktakrameṇa tu |
dravyamūrtigatānāṃ ca sañcāraḥ <saṃcāraḥ> syād aniṣṭakaḥ || 9.333
evamāvṛtidevānāṃ trisandhyaṃ balim ācaret |
nityotsavārthaṃ bimbasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> tatsamācaret || 9.334
nṛttageyādisaṃyuktaṃ vedaghoṣasamanvitam |
dvārāvaraṇadevānāṃ dhyānādītthaṃ prakāśitam || 9.335
evaṃ hi balidānāntaṃ yatra pūjāṃ samācaret |
tatra devasya sānnidhyaṃ <sāṃnidhyaṃ> nairantaryeṇa siddhyati || 9.336
evaṃ kālatraye kuryāt pūjanaṃ deśikottamaḥ |
na ca kālatrayān nyūnaṃ pūjanaṃ vihitaṃ sadā || 9.337
prāsādeṣu svayaṃvyaktapūrveṣu dvijasattamāḥ |
kālatrayaṃ pradhānaṃ syāt tadūrdhvaṃ kartur icchayā || 9.338
vibhavāpekṣayā caiva vardhayeta yathākramam |
yāvat dvādaśamaḥ kālastāvadvai munipuṅgavāḥ || 9.339
śreṣṭhaḥ prabhātakālaḥ syāt triṣu kāleṣu vai punaḥ |
yathāvanmantravinyāsamātmanaḥ karadehayoḥ || 9.340
hṛdyāgaṃ sthānasaṃśuddhiṃ sāyāmāṃ bhautikīṃ tataḥ |
nityaṃ prabhātike kuryād anyatrecchānurūpataḥ || 9.341
snapanaṃ balidānaṃ ca kuryāt kālatraye sadā |
mūrter āsanapūjā tu kāryā kālacatuṣṭaye || 9.342
pañcakāle <paṃcakāle> bhaven nyāsaḥ ṣaṭkāle havanakriyā |
ata ūrdhveṣu kāleṣu japāntaṃ pūjanaṃ bhavet || 9.343
alaṅkārāsanādyaṃ ca pūrvavatkramayogataḥ |
vinoktena prakāreṇa hy anyadhā na samācaret || 9.344
mukhyakalpe tu homāntaṃ nityanaimittikātmikām |
pūjāṃ krameṇa vai kuryāt tattaddhomāvasānikām || 9.345
anukalpe tu japyāntaṃ yāgānantariteṣu ca |
yāgeṣu havanānteṣu nityanaimittikādiṣu || 9.346
tattadyāgaṃ japāntaṃ ca kramāt kṛtvā tataḥ param |
tattaddhomaṃ muniśreṣṭhaḥ kramāt kuryād yathāvidhi || 9.347
anukalpeṣu yāgeṣu hy upakāloditeṣu vai |
āsanārdhye tataḥ pādyam ācāmaṃ sapratigraham || 9.348
gandhaṃ mālyaṃ tathā dīpaṃ dhūpaṃ mātrāṃ krameṇa tu |
datvā bhojyāvasānaṃ tu kramād dadyād vidhānataḥ || 9.349
ity evamarcanavidhiḥ sāṅgopāṅgaḥ pradarśitaḥ |
ito 'nyac chrotum icchā cet kathyatāṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 9.350

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
dvārāvaraṇadevatālakṣaṇādividhir nāma
navamo 'dhyāyaḥ

atha daśamo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
bhagavanmuniśārdūla sarvajña vadatāṃ vara |
nityārcanādikaṃ sarvaṃ śrutaṃ tvattaḥ savistaram || 10.1
mahotsavādyutsavāṃs tu sāṃprataṃ vaktum arhasi |

nāradaḥ
athātaḥ saṃprakṣyāmi mahotsavavidhikramam || 10.2
sava ity ucyate duḥkhaṃ vidvadbhir munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
uddhṛtaḥ sa savo yasmāt tasmād utsava ucyate || 10.3
nityo naimittikaḥ kāmyastrividhaḥ sa mahotsavaḥ |
vatsare vatsare yas tu kriyate sa tu nityakaḥ || 10.4
bhūmikampe diśāṃ dāhe mahotpāteṣu satsu ca |
durbhikṣe vyādhite rāṣṭre tathā vai śatrusaṅkaṭe <śatrusaṃkaṭe> || 10.5
anāvṛṣṭau ca sarvatra nakṣatrapatane ca khāt |
hasane bhagavanmūrter aṅgānāṃ calane sati || 10.6
rodane cāsanād bimbe paribhramati sattamāḥ |
vyatyāse śaśisūryasya tathānyeṣv evamādiṣu || 10.7
śāntyarthaṃ yat prakurvīta sa naimittika ucyate |
caturṇāṃ puruṣārthānām uddiśyānyatamaṃ phalam || 10.8
utsavo 'nuṣṭhitaḥ kāmyaḥ saṅkalpitaphalapradaḥ <saṃkalpitaphalapradaḥ> |
jyotiśśāstreṣu kuśalair brāhmaṇaiḥ saha deśikaḥ || 10.9
pūrvaṃ kṛtvā yathāśāstraṃ tīrthaṛkṣavinirṇayam |
tīrthayātrānusāreṇa dhvajārohaṃ prakalpayet || 10.10
mantramūrtipratiṣṭhānakāla eva munīśvarāḥ |
prāsādasya śikhāgre tu sthāpitaḥ khagarāḍdhvajaḥ || 10.11
hetirājasamāyukto yatra yatra sadā dvijāḥ |
vinā tv anyadhvajāroham utsavaṃ parikalpayet || 10.12
tatrāpy anyadhvajārohaṃ kuryād vā vibhave sati |
kuryād utsavam anyatra dhvajārohaṇapūrvakam || 10.13
navāhaṃ daivikaṃ proktaṃ saptāhaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet |
pañcāham adhamaṃ vidyāt trividhaṃ cotsavaṃ smṛtam || 10.14
tatra tāvat pravakṣyāmi navāhasya vidhikramam |
dhvajādhivāsapūrvedyuḥ deśiko mantravittamaḥ || 10.15
snāyād vapanapūrvaṃ tu bhagavadyāgasiddhaye |
niśāmukhe pravṛtte tu ācāryo mūrtipaiḥ saha || 10.16
snānādinityaniyamān kṛtvā caiva yathāvidhi |
bhūṣaṇair vividhair vastrair nūtanaiś ca vibhūṣitaḥ || 10.17
sitoṣṇīṣottarīyaś ca citramālyair alaṅkṛtaḥ <alaṃkṛtaḥ> |
praviśya devasadanaṃ yajamānasamanvitaḥ || 10.18
nityārcanāvasāne tu vaiṣṇavān dvijasattamān |
ṣaṭkarmaniratāṃś caiva pañcakālaparāyaṇān || 10.19
samabhyarcya tatas tebhyo hy anujñāṃ pratigṛhya ca |
viṣvaksenaṃ samabhyarcya yāgavighnapraśāntaye || 10.20
paścāt svadehaśuddhyarthaṃ puṇyāhaṃ vācayed guruḥ |
prakalpya bhūtale śuddhe dhānyapīṭhaṃ yathāvidhi || 10.21
vinyasya maṅgalaṃ kumbhaṃ sampūrṇaṃ <saṃpūrṇaṃ> gandhavāriṇā |
ratnahāṭakakūrcasragvastrapallavasaṃyutam || 10.22
candanādyupaliptaṃ ca paritaś cārghyacarcitam |
tatkumbhasya caturdikṣu caturo mūrtipān nyaset || 10.23
adbhir gandhais tathā puṣpair akṣatair dakṣiṇādibhiḥ |
toṣayitvā tu tān sarvān tataḥ kumbhe sudarśanam || 10.24
samāvāhya samabhyarcya dhyāyamāno 'cyutaṃ hṛdi |
darbhaiḥ spṛśaṃs tu kalaśaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥ saha deśikaḥ || 10.25
oṃkārādyaṃ pavintrāntaṃ mantrāṇāṃ prākcatuṣṭayam |
pāṭhayec ca sapuṇyāhaṃ gāyatrītritayānvitam || 10.26
tataś cātmānuvādaṃ ca ātmavyūhaṃ tathaiva ca |
tataś ca śuddhimantrāṃs tu paṭhed evaṃ samāhitaḥ || 10.27
śuddhayes tu paro devo vāsudevo 'stu śuddhaye |
saṅkarṣaṇaḥ <saṃkarṣaṇaḥ> śuddhayes tu pradyumnaś cāstu śuddhaye || 10.28
śuddhayes tv aniruddho 'pi keśavaś cāstu śuddhaye |
nārāyaṇo 'stu viśveśaḥ śuddhaye sarvakarmasu || 10.29
śuddhaye mādhavaś cāstu sarvalokahite rataḥ |
govindaḥ śuddhaye cāstu paramātmā sanātanaḥ || 10.30
śuddhaye viṣṇur astv ādyaḥ śuddhaye madhusūdanaḥ |
sarvalokahito devaḥ śuddhaye 'stu trivikramaḥ || 10.31
vāmanaḥ śuddhaye cāstu śrīdharo 'dyāstu śuddhaye |
śuddhaye 'stu hṛṣīkeśaḥ padmanābho 'stu śuddhaye || 10.32
sadā dāmodaro devaḥ śuddhaye 'stu jagatpatiḥ |
śuddhaye padmanābho 'stu śuddhaye 'stu sadā dhruvaḥ || 10.33
anantaḥ śuddhaye cāstu śaktyātmā cāstu śuddhaye |
sarvakarmasu caivāstu śuddhaye madhusūdanaḥ || 10.34
sadā vidyādhidevo 'stu śuddhaye kapilas tathā |
śuddhaye viśvarūpo 'stu śuddhaye 'stu vihaṅgamaḥ <vihaṃgamaḥ> || 10.35
kroḍātmā śuddhaye cāstu śuddhaye baḍabānanaḥ |
śuddhaye 'stu sadā dharmaś cāstu vāgīśvaras tathā || 10.36
deva ekārṇavaśayaḥ śuddhaye 'stu nirantaram |
śuddhaye 'stu sadā devaḥ kūrmaḥ pātāladhārakaḥ || 10.37
varāhaḥ śuddhaye cāstu nārasiṃho 'stu śuddhaye |
amṛtāharaṇaś cāstu śuddhaye sarvakarmaṇām || 10.38
śrīpatiḥ śuddhaye cāstu śāntātmā cāstu śuddhaye |
śuddhaye rāhujic cāstu kālanemighna eva ca || 10.39
pārijātaharaś cāstu lokanātho 'stu śuddhaye |
sarvatra śuddhaye cāstu dattātreyo mahāprabhuḥ || 10.40
nyagrodhaśāyī bhagavān śuddhaye cāstu sarvadā |
ekaśṛṅgatanuś cāstu vāmanaś cāpi śuddhaye || 10.41
trivikramaḥ śuddhaye 'stu śuddhaye 'stu naraḥ sadā |
nārāyaṇaḥ śuddhaye 'stu hariḥ kṛṣṇaś ca śuddhaye || 10.42
jvalatparaśudhṛgrāmaḥ śuddhaye 'stu dhanurdharaḥ |
rāmaś ca śuddhaye cāstu vedavidbhagavāṃs tataḥ || 10.43
śuddhaye 'stu sadā kalkī sarvadoṣakṣayaṃkaraḥ |
śuddhaye 'stu sadā devaḥ pātālaśayanaḥ prabhuḥ || 10.44
śuddhaye santu sarveṣāṃ sarve sarvatra sarvadā |
ete sarve sadā devāḥ śāntaye santu pūjitāḥ || 10.45
ṛddhaye puṣṭaye santu siddhaye bhaktaye 'pi ca |
śivāya muktaye santu vṛddhaye sarvakarmaṇām || 10.46
mantrāṇāṃ deśikānāṃ ca sthānānām api sarvadā |
putramitrakalatrāṇāṃ dāsīdāsagavām api || 10.47
vedaśāstrāgamādīnāṃ vratānām iṣṭasaṃpadām |
manorathānāṃ sarveṣāṃ hitānāṃ santu sarvadā || 10.48
āyuṣyārogyamedhānāṃ dhanadhānyādisampadām <dhanadhānyādisaṃpadām> |
puṇyānām aṇimādīnāṃ guṇānāṃ śreyasām api || 10.49
rājño janapadasyāpi yajamānasya mantriṇām |
vaiṣṇavānāṃ viśeṣeṇa paratra hitam icchatām || 10.50
pañcakālaviśuddhānāṃ satvasthānāṃ śubhātmanām |
svasty astu ca śivaṃ cāstu śubhaṃ cāstu punaḥ punaḥ || 10.51
avighnam aniśaṃ cāstu dīrgham āyuṣyam astu vai |
samāhitaṃ manaś cāstu sampadaś <saṃpadaś> cottarottaram || 10.52
puṇyāhaṃ śuddhaye cāstu vāsudevādimūrtayaḥ |
śaṅkhacakragadāpadmayuktaḥ <śaṃkhacakragadāpadmayuktaḥ> sarveśvareśvaraḥ 
|| 10.53
prīyatāṃ bhagavān devo lāṅgalī priyatāṃ sadā |
pradyumnaḥ prīyatāṃ nityam aniruddhaḥ sureśvaraḥ || 10.54
nārāyaṇaḥ sureśo 'pi karmaṇāṃ pūraṇāya ca |
nyūnādhikānāṃ śāntyarthaṃ prīyatāṃ prīyatāṃ vibhuḥ || 10.55
puṇyāhaṃ svasti ṛddhiṃ ca saṃvācya saha mūrtipaiḥ |
tadadbhiḥ śatadhāreṇa sthānānītyādikena ca || 10.56
ātmānaṃ prokṣayet paścāddeśikaḥ svātmaśuddhaye |
evaṃ sarveṣu yogeṣu kuryāt puṇyāhavācanam || 10.57
gohiraṇyādidānaiś ca śuddhiṃ prāpyātha deśikaḥ |
devasya sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> gatvā hy upaviṣṭas tathāsane || 10.58
sāyāmāṃ bhūtasaṃśuddhiṃ dhāraṇābhyāṃ samācaret |
dehavinyastamantro 'tha mānasaṃ yāgam ācaret || 10.59
mantrāsane tato devaṃ samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
snānāsanaṃ tato nītvā snāpayen navabhir ghaṭaiḥ || 10.60
devasya purato bhūmiṃ snapanārthaṃ yathāvidhi |
tredhā vibhajya koṣṭhānāṃ navake dvijasattamāḥ || 10.61
dhānyapīṭhādikaṃ kṛtvā kalaśān adhivāsya ca |
pādhyam arghyaṃ tathācāmaṃ sarvauṣadhijalaṃ tathā || 10.62
prāgādyuttaraparyantaṃ nyaset koṣṭhacatuṣṭaye |
dadhi kṣīraṃ madhu ghṛtam āgneyādiṣu vinyaset || 10.63
śuddhāmbhaḥkalaśaṃ madhye vinyasya tadanantaram |
haridrācūrṇakumbhaṃ tu teṣāṃ ca purato nyaset || 10.64
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu prokṣayet tajjalais tu tān |
prāgādidikṣu vinyastakumbheṣu prabhavakramāt || 10.65
caturo vāsudevādīn vidiksthakalaśeṣu tu |
īśādivahniparyantaṃ tān evāpyayayogataḥ || 10.66
madhye śuddhodakalaśe yajen nārāyaṇaṃ vibhum |
arghyālabhanapuṣpaiś ca dhūpena munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 10.67
haridrācūrṇakumbhe tu śriyaṃ devīṃ samarcayet |
snānāsanoditair bhogair mukhalepāntimaiḥ kramāt || 10.68
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> devadeveśaṃ kumbhaiḥ saṃsnāpayet tataḥ |
prathamaṃ viṣṇugāyatryā tathedaṃ viṣṇur itryṛcā || 10.69
tatas trīṇipadādyena viṣṇoḥ karmāṇi mantrataḥ |
prāgādidikṣu vinyastaiḥ pādyādyaiḥ snāpayet kramāt || 10.70
dadhikrāviṇṇamantreṇa āpyāyasveti mantraḥ |
madhuvātetimantreṇa tataḥ śukram asītyṛcā || 10.71
vidikṣu nyastakalaśair dadhyādyaiḥ snāpayed vibhum |
śrīsūktena tato devaṃ hāridreṇa vilepayet || 10.72
tataḥ puruṣasūktaṃ tu paṭhadbhir brāhmaṇaiḥ saha |
sahasradhārayā devaṃ śuddhodenābhiṣecayet || 10.73
pratidravyaṃ tu vastreṇa hy arghyālabhanamālyakaiḥ |
dhūpena ca samabhyarcya tatas tenābhiṣecayet || 10.74
yad vārghyapādyam ācāmaṃ gandhasragdhūpadīpakam |
naivedyaṃ cārpayet sarvaṃ kevalaṃ cārghyam eva ca || 10.75
tato nīrājanādīṃś ca kṛtvā devasya pūrvavat |
alaṅkārāsanaṃ <alaṃkārāsanaṃ> nītvā āsanādikramād yajet || 10.76
bhogaiḥ sāṃsparśikaiḥ prāgvadvividhair aupacārikaiḥ |
hṛdayaṅgamasaṃjñaiś <hṛdayaṃgamasaṃjñaiś> ca samabhyarcya yathāvidhi || 
10.77
stutvā stotrair jitaṃtādyaiḥ praṇamed deśiko vibhum |
athāṅkurārpaṇaṃ kuryād deśiko mantravittamaḥ || 10.78
tadvidhānaṃ vistareṇa śṛṇudhvaṃ munisattamāḥ |
trividhāni ca pātrāṇi maṅgalāṅkuraropaṇe || 10.79
pālikā ghaṭikāś ceti śarāvāś ceti bhedataḥ |
pālikānām athocchrāyaḥ pañcaviṃśāṅgulo bhavet || 10.80
tadānanasya vistāro bhaved vai ṣoḍaśāṅgulaḥ |
aṣṭāṅgulas taducchrāyo hy aṅgulaṃ valayaṃ tataḥ || 10.81
bhavet kaṇṭhabilaṃ viprāstatoṣṭāṅgulavistṛtam |
ārabhya vaktravalayād yāvatkaṇṭhabilaṃ dvijāḥ || 10.82
hrāsayed anupātena tannālaṃ dvādaśāṅgulam |
ucchrāyād atha vistārān madhyatas tu ṣaḍaṅgulam || 10.83
adhastād aṅgulānān tu catuṣkaṃ vistṛtaṃ bhavet |
tataḥ kaṇṭhabilāc caiva hrāsayed anupātataḥ || 10.84
pādapīṭhamadhotsedhādvijñeyaṃ caturaṅgulam |
daśāṅgulas tadvistāras tatsandhiś <tatsaṃdhiś> cāṅgulo bhavet || 10.85
tatsandheś <tatsaṃdheś> ca bhaven nāhaṃ sārdham ekāṃgulaṃ <ekāṅgulam> 
dvijāḥ |
unmattakusumākāraṃ vaktraṃ padmākṛtir bhavet || 10.86
pālikotsedhatulyās tu ghaṭikāḥ samudāhṛtāḥ |
aṅgulatrayahīnā vā tadūrdhvaṃ kalaśākṛtiḥ || 10.87
ghaṭikāḥ pañcavaktrāḥ syur etāsāṃ madhyamaṃ mukham |
ṣaḍaṅgulaṃ ca vistīrṇaṃ caturdikṣu catuṣṭayam || 10.88
caturaṅgulavistāraṃ kalaśodaravistṛtiḥ |
ṣoḍaśāṃgulamānoktaśeṣaṃ <ṣoḍaśāṅgulamānoktaśeṣaṃ> prāgvat 
samācaret || 10.89
yadāṃgulatrayanyūnās <yadāṅgulatrayanyūnās> tadā
saptāṃgulocchritam <saptāṅgulocchritam> |
tadānanaṃ tu tannālam ardhottaradaśāṃgulam || 10.90
sārdhatrayāṅgulaṃ pīṭhaṃ prāgvat sarvatra vistaraḥ |
śarāvāḥ pālikotsedhatulyāḥ pañcabhir aṅgulaiḥ || 10.91
hīnā vā vaktravistārāt samārabhya munīśvarāḥ |
pādapīṭhasya vistāraṃ yāvat tāvatkrameṇa tu || 10.92
pūrvoktāt pādahīnā tu bhavet sarvatra vistṛtiḥ |
bhavet tripādahīnā tu pādapīṭhasya vistṛtiḥ || 10.93
yadā śarāvā hīnāḥ syur aṅgulaiḥ pañcabhis tadā |
mukhaṃ ṣaḍaṅgulocchrāyaṃ tannālaṃ tu daśāṅgulam || 10.94
tryaṅgulaṃ pādapīṭhaṃ syāt prāgvat sarvatra vistṛtiḥ |
etad uttamamānaṃ tu pātrāṇāṃ kathitaṃ dvijāḥ || 10.95
etad eva muniśreṣṭhāḥ pādahīnaṃ tu madhyamam |
ardhahīnaṃ tu tanmānamadhaṃ parikīrtitam || 10.96
ato nyūnaṃ na kartavyaṃ kadācit siddhikāṅkṣibhiḥ |
hemādilohajāḥ sarve mṛṇmayā vā yathāvasu || 10.97
pratyekaṃ pālikādīnāṃ dviṣaṭkaṃ cottamaṃ bhavet |
dviraṣṭhakaṃ vā ṣaṭtriṃśadvibhave sati kalpayet || 10.98
pratyaṣṭakaṃ madhyamaṃ syāñ catuṣkam adhamaṃ bhavet |
sarvārthe pālikāḥ prāgvat ṣoḍaśāṣṭau yathābalam || 10.99
catasro vā tatas tāsu maṅgalāṅkurakalpanam |
ayugmā mānuṣe kārye daive yugmās tu pālikāḥ || 10.100
mahotsave pratiṣṭhāyāṃ pavitrāropaṇe tathā |
jīrṇoddhāravidhau vāpi sahasrakalaśe tathā || 10.101
trivargapālikā yad vā bhaved uttamasaṅkhyayā <uttamasaṃkhyayā> |
bhaven madhyamayā vāpi nānyathā dvijasattamāḥ || 10.102
karmasv anyeṣu sarveṣu yathāvittaṃ yathāruci |
aṅkurāvāpanasthānamaṇṭapaṃ parikalpayet || 10.103
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇe 'pi vā |
tṛtīyāvaraṇe vāpi caturthāvaraṇe 'pi vā || 10.104
śubhe vivikte 'bhimate deśe vai deśikottamaḥ |
caturdikṣu caturdvāraṃ caturvandanamālikam || 10.105
darbhamālāparikṣiptaṃ muktādāmavirājitam |
vitatakṣaumasañchannaṃ <vitatakṣaumasaṃchannaṃ> gomayāliptabhūtalam || 10.106
pradīpamālāvitatam akṣataiś cāpi sarvataḥ |
sudhācūrṇaiś ca dhavalaiś citritābhyantarasthalam || 10.107
maṇṭapaṃ kalpayitvaivaṃ yad vā snapanamaṇṭape |
yāgākhyamaṇṭape vāpi kuryād aṅkuraropaṇam || 10.108
aṅkurān arpayed rātrau ya icched rāṣṭravardhanam |
bījānām adhipaḥ soma oṣadhīśo 'mṛtātmakaḥ || 10.109
na prīṇāti sadā tatra aṅkurārpaṇam ahni cet |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena rātryām evāṅkurārpaṇam || 10.110
kuryāt samyagvidhānena bhagavadbhaktisaṃyutaḥ |
tasmin jagatpriye prīte śītāṃśau prāṇijīvane || 10.111
taddeśe sarvasasyānāṃ saṃpattir mahatī bhavet |
gavāṃ ca lokamāt�ṇāṃ nṛṇām api ca sarvaśaḥ || 10.112
ajñānād ahni kuryāc ced aṅkurāṇām arthāpaṇam |
aśobhanaṃ bhaved rāṣṭram asamṛddhajanānvitam || 10.113
sadyaḥkālīnake viprāḥ karmaṇi syād divāpi vā |
yad yat tatropayogyaṃ syāt tat sarvaṃ ca samārjayet || 10.114
sambhṛtya <saṃbhṛtya> sarvasambhārān <sarvasaṃbhārān> ācāryo mūrtipaiḥ saha 
|
tadartham arpayitvā tu yajamānasamanvitaḥ || 10.115
bhavantaṃ jagadyoniṃ pūjayitvā vidhānataḥ |
tatas tv abhinave pātre sauvarṇe rājate 'tha vā || 10.116
tilasarṣapanīvāraśālimāṣapriyaṅgavaḥ |
kulutthamudganiṣpāvayavagodhūmavaiṇavāḥ || 10.117
bījāni dvādaśaitāni pṛthak pātreṣu vā dvijāḥ |
sambhṛtya <saṃbhṛtya> tu muniśreṣṭhāḥ sthāpayitvā tu mūrdhani || 10.118
dīkṣitasya tu viprasya puṣpākṣatakarāñjaliḥ |
ācāryaḥ praviśet sārdhaṃ sādhakair bhagavanmayaiḥ || 10.119
prāsādābhyantaraṃ viprās tatrādhāropari nyaset |
bījapātraṃ tato 'rghyeṇa gandhaiḥ puṣpaiś ca dhūpakaiḥ || 10.120
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> mūlabimbasthaṃ tathā cotsavabimbagam |
bījapātraṃ tato 'bhyarcya devāya vinivedayet || 10.121
saha śaṅkhaninādaiś <śaṃkhaninādaiś> ca maṅgalair gītanisvanaiḥ |
tūryanādaiś ca vividhaiḥ śrutighoṣaiḥ samantataḥ || 10.122
sthāpayitvā tu tatpātraṃ dīkṣitasyaiva mūrdhani |
sādhakaiḥ sahito viprā bahirnirgatya deśikaḥ || 10.123
dhāma pradakṣiṇīkṛtya nyased aṅkuramaṇṭape |
viṣvaksenan tu vā tārkṣyaṃ hanumatpramukhan tu vā || 10.124
hetīśaṃ vāpi vastrādyair alaṅkṛtya viśeṣataḥ |
yānādikaṃ samāropya prakṣālyādbhiḥ khanitrakam || 10.125
navena vāsasācchādya bhūṣayitvā tu mālyakaiḥ |
deśiko vāhayed vipraiḥ śūdrair vā dīkṣitair dvijāḥ || 10.126
citradhvajapatākābhiḥ sārdham aṅkurapātrakaiḥ |
trividhaiḥ pālikādyaiś ca śaṅkhatūryādibhiḥ <śaṃkhatūryādibhiḥ> saha || 10.127
āmnāyoddhoṣaṇaparair bhaktair bhāgavatair vibhoḥ |
gāyakair gaṇikābhiś ca tathānyair maṅgalaiḥ saha || 10.128
kramāt pradakṣiṇīkṛtya sarveṣv āvaraṇeṣu ca |
diśaṃ prācīm udīcīṃ vā adhavā prāgudagdiśam || 10.129
adūraṃ samanuprāpya tatrodyāne manohare |
kevale vā śucau deśe mṛdaṃ śuddhāṃ samāharet || 10.130
astramantreṇa dharaṇīṃ samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> prathamaṃ guruḥ |
mahīsūktena saṃspṛśya dhyāyann ekāgracetasā || 10.131
mūrtiṃ devasya vārāhīm abhyarcya kusumair bhuvam |
astrāmbunā prokṣitena puṣpair abhyarcitena ca || 10.132
khanitreṇa khaned bhūmiṃ prāṅmukhaḥ kroḍamantrataḥ |
lohaje bhājane mṛtsnāṃ vetraje vā yathāruci || 10.133
gṛhītvā mūlamantreṇa veṣṭayitvā ca vāsasā |
pratyagreṇa tathā nadyā vālukāṃ gomayaṃ tathā || 10.134
gokulāt pūrvavatpātre gṛhītvācchādya vāsasā |
yānādike samāropya yad vā dīkṣitamūrdhani || 10.135
gatvā pradakṣiṇaṃ grāmaṃ praviśen maṇṭapaṃ tataḥ |
maṇṭapaṃ śodhayitvā tu yathoktavidhinā dvijāḥ || 10.136
tato maṇṭapamadhye tu sūtrāṇy āsphālayet kramāt |
prāgāyatāni prathamaṃ kramāt saptadaśa kṣipet || 10.137
udagāyatasūtrāṇi caturdaśa nipātayet |
sūtrāt sūtrād antarālaṃ ṣoḍaśāṅgulasaṃmitam || 10.138
trayādhikadaśaiva syuḥ pūrvapaścimapaṅktayaḥ |
evaṃ ṣoḍaśasaṅkhyātā <ṣoḍaśasaṃkhyātā> dakṣiṇottarapaṅktayaḥ || 10.139
bījapātrapratiṣṭhārthaṃ pūrvapaścimapaṅktiṣu |
madhye paṅktitrayaṃ sthāpyaṃ vīdhyarthaṃ dvitaye mṛjet || 10.140
bhūyaś ca paṅktitritayaṃ sthāpayet pārśvayor dvayoḥ |
dakṣiṇottaramadhye tu sthāpyaṃ paṅkticatuṣṭayam || 10.141
dvitayaṃ dvitayaṃ pārśve vīdhyarthaṃ vimṛjet punaḥ |
catuś catuś ca paṅktīnāṃ sthāpayet kramayogataḥ || 10.142
āśāsv aṣṭāsu madhye ca śarāvaghaṭapālikāḥ |
dvādaśa dvādaśa sthāpyāḥ śatam aṣṭottaraṃ bhavet || 10.143
āgneye dakṣiṇe bhāge nairṛte 'pi ca pālikāḥ |
ghaṭikā vāruṇe brāhme tathā paurandare 'pi || 10.144
śarāvā mārute saumye īśāne ca yathāvidhi |
pratyekaṃ pālikādīnāṃ ṣoḍaśatvena kalpate || 10.145
dakṣiṇottaragaṃ sūtrapañcakaṃ viniveśayet |
prāgāyatāni sūtrāṇi pūrvavad viniveśayet || 10.146
ācaret pūrvavad viprāḥ prākpratyakpaṅktikalpanam |
tatra dakṣiṇataḥ paṅkticatuṣke sthāpayet kramāt || 10.147
pālikāḥ ṣoḍaśa puro madhye paṅkticatuṣṭaye |
ghaṭikāḥ ṣoḍaśa nyastvā uttare viniveśayet || 10.148
śarāvān api tatsaṅkhyān <tatsaṃkhyān> atha dvādaśakalpane |
dakṣiṇottarasūtrāṇi catvāry atra vinikṣipet || 10.149
pūrvāparāṇi sūtrāṇi pūrvavad vinipātayet |
aṣṭādhikāni koṣṭhāni catvāriṃśad bhavanti hi || 10.150
yāmye dvādaśakoṣṭhāni sthāpayitvā tato mṛjet |
vīdhyarthaṃ bhāgaṣaṭkaṃ tu madhyataḥ sthāpayet tataḥ || 10.151
bhāgadvādaśakaṃ paścādbhāgaṣaṭkaṃ vilopayet |
bhūyaś cottaradiksthāpyaṃ koṣṭhadvādaśakaṃ kramāt || 10.152
nyaset tu pālikādīni bhāgadvādaśakatraye |
āgneyādīśaparyantaṃ dakṣiṇāśāditaḥ kramāt || 10.153
pratyekaṃ pālikādīnām aṣṭasaṃkhyāprakalpane |
dakṣiṇottarasūtrāṇi trīṇy eva tu niyojayet || 10.154
anyat sarvaṃ bhavet prāg vadatha praticatuṣṭaye |
dakṣiṇottaragaṃ sūtratritayaṃ vinipātayet || 10.155
pūrvapaścimasūtrāṇi ekādaśa vinikṣipet |
sarvārthe pālikānāṃ tu ṣoḍaśānāṃ parigrahe || 10.156
pañca dakṣiṇasūtrāṇi prāksūtrāṇi tathā kṣipet |
prāksūtrāt pañca cāṣṭānāṃ dakṣasūtratrayaṃ kṣipet || 10.157
caturviṃśatisaṅkhyānāṃ <caturviṃśatisaṃkhyānāṃ> pālikānāṃ parigrahe |
pūrvadakṣiṇasūtrāṇāṃ saptakaṃ pañcakaṃ kṣipet || 10.158
catuḥ parigrahe sūtraṃ tritayaṃ tritayaṃ kṣipet |
pūrvavat sūtrapātaḥ syād ādyasaṅkhyāsu <ādyasaṃkhyāsu> pañcasu || 10.159
evam āsphālya sūtrāṇi vibhavec chānusārataḥ |
padeṣu pālikādīnāṃ śālibhir vrīhibhis tathā || 10.160
āḍhakādimitaiḥ prāgvad uttamādivyapekṣayā |
vṛttāṃ vā caturaśrāṃ vā kalpayet pīṭhikāṃ kramāt || 10.161
pālikādīni pātrāṇi kṣālayen mūlamantrataḥ |
sahadevīṃ ca dūrvāṃ ca sārdham aśvatthapallavaiḥ || 10.162
śarīṣapallavaiś cāpi niśāpatrais tathaiva ca |
kaṇṭheṣu pālikādīnāṃ bandhayet tadanantaram || 10.163
kuśakāśatṛṇais teṣāṃ bilamūlāni pūrayet |
bilāni prathamaṃ mṛdbhir vālukābhir anantaram || 10.164
karīṣacūrṇair upari samṛddhaṃ pūrayed bilam |
yad vā mṛdādikaṃ viprāḥ sarvaṃ saṃmiśrya pūrayet || 10.165
koṣṭheṣu vinyaset tāni pālikādīny anukramāt |
āgneyādīśaparyantaṃ pratiskandhaṃ dvijottamāḥ || 10.166
dvādaśānāṃ tu navakam aṣṭottaraśate nyaset |
brahmādīśānaparyantamuditakramayogataḥ || 10.167
teṣāṃ tu paścime sthāne dhānyarāśau salakṣaṇam |
vinyaset somakumbhaṃ tu veṣṭitaṃ navavāsasā || 10.168
gandhasarvauṣadhīratnakūrcapallavasaṃyutam |
evaṃ sarvaṃ samāpādya dīkṣitaiḥ paricārakaiḥ || 10.169
tat tat sarvaṃ samāpādya yad yat prāganupārjitam |
samārabhet tataḥ karma deśikaḥ prāṅmukhaḥ pade || 10.170
paścime ghaṭikāsthānād upaviśyāsane śubhe |
nyāsam uddīpya vidhinā prokṣaṇārghyaṃ prakaplayet || 10.171
dehavinyastamantrāṇāṃ kuryād arghyādinārcanam |
dvārapālārcanaṃ kṛtvā vibhavec chānurūpataḥ || 10.172
toraṇāni dhvajāṃś caiva dvārakumbhāṃś ca pūjayet |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu pūrvoktavidhinā guruḥ || 10.173
yajed arghyādibhiḥ paścāt pālikādyadhidevatāḥ |
añjanābhaṃ paraṃ caiva padmanābhaṃ dhruvaṃ tathā || 10.174
pātraskandhatrike viprāḥ krameṇa paripūjayet |
pālikānāṃ dvādaśake vahnyādīśānapaścimam || 10.175
anantādi dvādaśakaṃ ghaṭikādvādaśe tataḥ |
kūrmādikaṃ dvādaśakaṃ śarāvāṇāṃ tu dvādaśe || 10.176
dviṣaṭkam ekaśṛṅgādyaṃ krameṇa paripūjayet |
pratyekaṃ pālikādīnāṃ kṛte ṣoḍaśakalpane || 10.177
anantādyaṃ ca ṣaṭtriṃśatpātālaśayanāntimam |
lakṣmyādimatiparyantaṃ śaktidvādaśakaṃ yajet || 10.178
pratyekaṃ pālikādīnāṃ ṣaṭtriṃśatparikalpane |
catuṣṭayaṃ tu mūrtīnāṃ svapnākhyapadasaṃsthitam || 10.179
prabhavāpyayayogena jāgradrūpaṃ tathāṣṭakam |
mūrtyantaradvādaśakaṃ tacchaktīnāṃ catustrayam || 10.180
anantādyaṃ ca ṣaṭtriṃśatpātālaśayanāntimam |
svadhādīnāṃ ca śaktīnāṃ catustriṃśac ca tatparam || 10.181
cakraśaṅkhau <cakraśaṃkhau> kramād bhogair arghyagandhādibhir yajet |
aṣṭake keśavādyāṃś ca tadīyāḥ śaktayo yajet || 10.182
catuṣke keśavādyāṃs tu kevalān dvādaśārcayet |
sarvārthaṃ pālikānāṃ tu kramāt ṣoḍaśake yajet || 10.183
vāsudevādi caturaḥ keśavādīṃś ca dvādaśa |
aṣṭake vāsudevādīn prabhavāpyayayogataḥ || 10.184
catuṣke vāsudevādīn prabhavānukrameṇa tu |
evam iṣṭvā tataḥ somakumbhapūjāṃ samācret || 10.185
kumbhe somātmakaṃ devaṃ karake ca sudarśanam |
aṣṭadikṣu ca vinyastakumbheṣv indrādikān yajet || 10.186
evaṃ kumbhārcanaṃ kṛtvā bījakṣālanam ācaret |
gavyena payasā samyaṅmūlamantreṇa vai dvijāḥ || 10.187
bījānāṃ nāmadheyais tu caturthyantaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak |
arghyādyaiḥ pūjayitvā tu vāsasā pariveṣṭya ca || 10.188
kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile vāgniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi |
kṛtvā santarpaṇaṃ <saṃtarpaṇaṃ> cāgnes tasmin mantrāsanādikam || 10.189
parikalpya ca tanmadhye devam āvāhya pūrvavat |
sannidhānādikaṃ <saṃnidhānādikaṃ> sarvaṃ prāgvad eva samācaret || 10.190
samidbhiś caiva nityābhiḥ kāmyaiś ca juhuyāt tataḥ |
pālikādyadhidevānāṃ mantraiś cāpi yathākramam || 10.191
aṣṭau catuḥ sakṛd vāpi huned ājyena vai dvijāḥ |
hutvā somādimantraiś ca sampātājyaṃ <saṃpātājyaṃ> samāharet || 10.192
hutāvaśiṣṭam ājyaṃ tu tadanyaṃ vāpi saṃskṛtam |
ādāya lohaje pātre mṛṇmaye vā yathāruci || 10.193
ubhābhyāṃ caiva hastābhyāṃ dūrvām ādāya mūlataḥ |
ghṛte nimajya cāgrāṇi pālikādiṣu secayet || 10.194
hastavyatyāsamārgeṇa vahnyādīśānapaścimam |
pratiskandhaṃ ghṛtārope dūrvābhedaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 10.195
evaṃ kṛtvā ghṛtāropaṃ bhūyaḥ skandhādhidevatāḥ |
prapūjya sarvabījāni mantrayen mūlamantrataḥ || 10.196
ācāryādīn anujñāpya deśikendra udaṅmukhaḥ |
prāṅmukho vā muhūrte tu śobhane pālikādiṣu || 10.197
aṣṭākṣareṇa mantreṇa sarvabījāni vāpayet |
yad vā jitantāmantreṇa hy ubhayenātha vā dvijāḥ || 10.198
āgneyādīśaparyantaṃ pratiskandhaṃ krameṇa tu |
śaṅkhadundubhinirghoṣajayanād asamanvitam
<śaṃkhadundubhinirghoṣajayanādasamanvitam> || 10.199
bījāni dvādaśoktāni vaped dvādaśasu kramāt |
yad vā sarvāṇi saṃmiśrya vaped icchānusārataḥ || 10.200
bījānām apy alābhe tu mudgam ekaṃ tu vā vapet |
ācāryānugatāś cānye deśikāḥ sādhakā api || 10.201
vapeyur dhyānasaṃyuktāḥ kevalaṃ gurur eva vā |
haridrācūrṇasaṃmiśrair jalaiḥ kusumavāsitaiḥ || 10.202
bahubhiḥ secayed viprā deśikendraḥ krameṇa tu |
pratiskandhopariṣṭāt tu candramaṇḍalamadhyagam || 10.203
tatkāntisannibhaṃ <tatkāntisaṃnibhaṃ> devaṃ svadehotthair nirantaraiḥ |
siñcantam amṛtoghais tu bījāny uptāni sarvataḥ || 10.204
dhyātvārcayitvā pātrāṇi navais tu sadaśaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
ācchādayitvā vasanaiḥ pratiskandhaṃ krameṇa tu || 10.205
vāsudevaṃ jagadyoniṃ sarveṣām ūrdhvato yajet |
bhūtakrūrabaliṃ dadyād aṣṭadikṣu dvijottamāḥ || 10.206
bhūtānāṃ kumudādīnāṃ pūrvādikramayogataḥ |
tadā prabhṛti te sarve rakṣanti kumudādayaḥ || 10.207
ācāryān gurupūrvāṃś ca sādhakān vaiṣṇavān api |
prabhūtais tu tathoddiṣṭais tāṃbūlaiḥ sumanaḥphalaiḥ || 10.208
guruṃ ca toṣayed vittair yajamānaḥ prayatnavān |
kramād uddhṛtya tān sarvān sugupte sthāpayet tataḥ || 10.209
maṇḍapeśānakoṇe vā deśe 'nyatra yathāruci |
tatrāpi pālikādīnāṃ parito 'ṣṭāsu dikṣu ca || 10.210
bhūtānāṃ kumudādīnām aindrādikramayogataḥ |
baliṃ tu maṇṭape dadyād bhūtakrūravidhānataḥ || 10.211
dīpān bahūn anirvāṇān paritaḥ paridīpayet |
ūnādhikyopaśāntyarthaṃ śatam aṣṭottaraṃ hunet || 10.212
pūrṇāhutyādikaṃ kṛtvā deśikendro yathāvidhi |
tataḥ kuṇḍagataṃ devaṃ visṛjya hṛdayāntare || 10.213
caturdvārādhidevānāṃ mantraiś cāpi yathākramam |
hutvājyena tato vahniṃ visṛjet tu yathāvidhi || 10.214
paritaḥ pālikādīnāṃ pratirātraṃ pṛthak pṛthak |
dadyād divā rajanyāṃ vā baliṃ kāladvaye 'pi vā || 10.215
prātaḥ karmadine dadyād baliṃ deśikasattamaḥ |
yadā coptāni bījāni tadā prabhṛti nityaśaḥ || 10.216
na kaścit praviśet tatra na spṛśed vā kathaṃ cana |
ācārya eva praviśet tacchiṣyo vā samāhitaḥ || 10.217
ucchiṣṭādīni sarvāṇi dūrataḥ parivarjayet |
adatvā tu baliṃ kāñcin na kuryāt pālikākriyām || 10.218
haridrāvāribhiḥ siñced aṅkurāṇy abhivṛddhaye |
aṅkurān śyāmalān raktān kṛṣṇāṃs tiryaggatāṃs tathā || 10.219
aprarūḍān muniśreṣṭhā varjayet tu prayatnataḥ |
śyāmeṣu dravyanāśaḥ syād rakteṣu kalaho bhavet || 10.220
kṛṣṇeṣu mānasī pīḍā rogī tiryaggateṣu ca |
aprarūḍeṣu maraṇaṃ bhavet tatra na saṃśayaḥ || 10.221
śubhaṃ pīteṣu śukleṣu ṛjuṣūrdhvagateṣv api |
sarvasampat <sarvasaṃpat> samṛddhiś ca kartuḥ kārayitur bhavet || 10.222
karmārtham aṅkurāṇyādau yaḥ samāropayed guruḥ |
sa eva karma kārtsnyena kuryāt prājñe 'pi netaraḥ || 10.223
anujñayā vā tatputraḥ śiṣyo vā tatsamācaret |
evaṃ sarveṣu yāgeṣu aṅkurāropaṇaṃ bhavet || 10.224
deśaṃ kālaṃ tathā vittaṃ jñātvā svādhīnatāṃ tathā |
uktaṃ sarvaṃ samabhyūhya kuryāt karma pradhānakam || 10.225
evaṃ kṛtvāṅkurāropaṃ gatvā devasya sannidham <saṃnidham> |
devam arghyādinābhyarcya naivedyāntaṃ yathāvidhi || 10.226
anirvāṇaṃ yathādīpaṃ rātriśeṣaṃ samāpayet |
tadanyedyuḥ prabhātāyāṃ dhvajārthaṃ paṭam āharet || 10.227
yathāvittānusāreṇa krītaṃ vābhinavaṃ śubhaṃ |
dukūlapaṭṭaṃ devāṅgaṃ citrakṣaumam athāpi vā || 10.228
atha kārpāsakaṃ vāpi nīlaromādivarjitam |
sulakṣaṇaṃ dṛḍhaṃ snigdhaṃ paṭamānam ihocyate || 10.229
āyataṃ navabhir hastaiḥ saptabhiḥ pañcabhis tu vā |
mūlaberasamāyāmaṃ dvārāyāmam athāpi vā || 10.230
āyāmārdhena vistīrṇaṃ pādena kṛtaśekharam |
śekhareṇa samaṃ pucchaṃ tadardhaṃ karṇapucchakam || 10.231
bālākhyadhvajavastraṃ tu paṭākhyaparisaṃmitam |
vistāraṃ paṭatulyaṃ tu pūrvavac chikharaṃ bhavet || 10.232
nirṇejitaṃ khalīyuktaṃ śoṣitaṃ lakṣaṇānvitam |
paṭaṃ vicitrayed vidvān śilpinā kuśalena vai || 10.233
chatraṃ tu śikhare kuryāt pārśvayoḥ śvetacāmare |
adho 'nekadalaṃ padmaṃ tadadhaḥ pūrṇakumbhakam || 10.234
kumbhasya pārśve vilikhet sāṅkuraṃ pālikāgaṇam |
dīpau suśobhanau kuryāt pālikānāṃ tu pārśvayoḥ || 10.235
dhvajaṃ tu garuḍākāram ekamūrtes tu sattamāḥ |
satyaḥ suparṇo garuḍas tārkṣyaś ca caturātmanaḥ || 10.236
pañcamūrtes tu catvāro vihageśvarasaṃyutāḥ |
suparṇatālamakaraṛśyā vā caturātmanaḥ || 10.237
tata ūrdhvaṃ tu sarveṣāṃ vyūhānāṃ garuḍau dhvajaḥ |
paṭamadhye tu garuḍaṃ dvibhujaṃ vidhṛtāñjalim || 10.238
puṣpāñjalipuṭaṃ vātha suvarṇācalasannibham <suvarṇācalasaṃnibham> |
gaganegam anārambhapakṣavikṣepaṇānvitam || 10.239
kuñcito vāmapādas tu dakṣiṇaḥ pṛṣṭhataḥ sthitaḥ |
kiñcid āyatavṛttākṣaṃ nīladīrghāgranāsikam || 10.240
atīva śāntaveṣaṃ tu tathā prahasitānanam |
bālacandrasamākāraṃ daṃṣṭrādvayavirājitam || 10.241
kuṭilabhrukuṭībhaṅgaṃ bhaṅgurālakaśobhitam |
kambugrīvaṃ bṛhadbāhuṃ pīvāṃsaṃ dṛḍhavakṣasam || 10.242
pṛthūdaraṃ nimnanābhiṃ romarājivirājitam |
suvṛttakanakastambhapīvarorudvayānvitam || 10.243
hemarambhāsamākārajaṅghākāntapadadvayam |
karaṇḍamakuṭākrāntapuṣpāpīḍadhirājitam || 10.244
vṛtte vaipulyamānena locane padmapatravat |
bhrūyugmaṃ tārasihmotthaṃ ghrāṇāgraṃ śukatuṇḍavat || 10.245
sihmavanmadhyadeśas tu taddvaṃśaṃ gajapṛṣṭhavat |
tad evaṃ daivadīrgheṇa vistṛtaṃ haṃsapakṣavat || 10.246
svapakṣamānādiguṇaṃ tatpucchaṃ śataśākhinam |
sarveṣām eva sāmānyaṃ viśeṣākhyam athocyate || 10.247
makuṭādisapādāntaṃ nānāratnena śobhitam |
hārakeyūrakaṭakabrahmasūtravibhūṣitam || 10.248
pralambakarṇapāśāntaviśrāntaśubhakuṇḍalam |
lalāṭatilakopetaṃ puṣpakarṇāvataṃsakam || 10.249
ratnāṅgulīyakopetaṃ śiñjinīrañjitāṅghrikam |
anyair ābharaṇair divyair bhūṣitaṃ sarpabhūṣitam || 10.250
nīlāmbaradharaṃ nīlavāravāṇavirājitam |
phullaraktotpaladalasragbhir maṇḍitakandharam || 10.251
tathā vicitrakusumasragbhir anyābhir ujvalam |
ananto vāmakaṭako yajñasūtraṃ tu vāsukiḥ || 10.252
takṣakaḥ kaṭisūtraṃ tu hāraḥ kārkoṭakas tathā |
padmo dakṣiṇakarṇe tu mahāpadmas tu vāmataḥ || 10.253
śaṅkhaḥ <śaṃkhaḥ> śiraḥpradeśe tu gulikaś ca bhujāntare |
etair aṣṭoragair ādyair bhūṣitam bhujagottamaiḥ|| 10.254
anantaḥ śuklavarṇābho raktavarṇas tu vāsukiḥ |
takṣakaḥ pītavarṇābho dhūmraḥ kārkoṭakas tathā || 10.255
śaṅkhas <śaṃkhas> tuhinavarṇābho gulikas tv alisannibhaḥ <alisaṃnibhaḥ> |
padmaḥ padmasamānābho mahāpadmas tu piṅgalaḥ || 10.256
pañcavarṇair likhed evaṃ devaṃ pañcāyudhaṃ tathā |
cakraṃ svaṅgaṃ śaraṃ caiva śaṅkhaṃ <śaṃkhaṃ> śārṅgaṃ gadāṃ tathā || 
10.257
paṭordhve hy ubhaye pārśve vilikhec ca yathāvidhi |
tadadho dakṣiṇe pārśve vahnimaṇḍalam ālikhet || 10.258
tadval likhed vāmabhāge svastvikaṃ lakṣaṇānvitam |
lepayet paṭaśeṣaṃ tu śyāmalenāsitena vā || 10.259
vicitrapuṣpasaṃyuktapatravallīsamanvitam |
evaṃ śilpivareṇaiva kārayed diśikottamaḥ || 10.260
śūdreṇa vā dvijaśreṣṭhā dīkṣitena yathāvidhi |
kulālenātha vā mantrī kārayet kuśalena ca || 10.261
evaṃ sarvaṃ samāpādya deśikaḥ susamāhitaḥ |
sāyaṃkāle tu saṃprāpte sahito mūrtidhārakaiḥ || 10.262
kāruśālāṃ praviśyātha toṣayitvā tu śilpinam |
tatpaṭaṃ tu samādāya vinyasec chiṣyamūrdhani || 10.263
śaṃkhadundubhinirghoṣaiḥ kāhaladhvanibhis tathā |
gītaiś ca vividhair anyaiḥ śrutighoṣaiḥ pṛthagvidhaiḥ || 10.264
saha dhvajapaṭaṃ tasmād ānayen mukhamaṇṭape |
praviśyābhyantaraṃ mūlabimbasthaṃ parameśvaram || 10.265
abhivādyārghyagandhādyaiḥ pūjayet puṣpadhūpakaiḥ |
visṛjya śilpinaṃ paścāt samprokṣyārghyāmbhasā <saṃprokṣyārghyāṃbhasā> 
paṭam || 10.266
siddhārthakānvitaiḥ puṣpais tāḍayed astramantrataḥ |
darśayed devadevasya saṃmukhaṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 10.267
dahanāpyāyane kuryād vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
bhūyo 'rghyagandhapuṣpādyaiḥ prapūjya parameśvaram || 10.268
giroccayā tv imaṃ mantraṃ baddhāñjalikaraḥ paṭhet |
bhagavan puṇḍarīkākṣa sarveśvara jaganmaya || 10.269
tvayā yathā tu kathitaṃ tathā kartuṃ na śakyate |
asvātantryād asāmarthyāc chruddhādīnām abhāvataḥ || 10.270
tasmān mānādisarveṣām ūnādhikyopaśāntaye |
samālokaya netrābhyāṃ śītalābhyāṃ paṭasthitam || 10.271
sarvadoṣāpahāribhyāṃ vainateyaṃ prasīda oṃ |
dīkṣitānāṃ tato viprā haste datvā tu taṃ paṭam || 10.272
catuḥ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya tena sārthaṃ tu deśikaḥ |
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇe 'pi vā || 10.273
praviśed yajamānena prāsādāgrasthamaṇṭapam |
tatra nyastvā bhadrapīṭhaṃ tadūrdhve śālitaṇḍulaiḥ || 10.274
vediṃ kṛtvā tu tatpṛṣṭhe bhadrākhyaṃ maṇḍalaṃ likhet |
vibhave sati vastraṃ tu samāstīrya tadūrdhvataḥ || 10.275
tilarāśiṃ samutkīrya tanmadhye svastikaṃ likhet |
tasyopariṣṭāt saṃsthāpya prāsādābhimukhaṃ paṭam || 10.276
upaviśyāsane paścādācāryaḥ susamāhitaḥ |
karaśuddhyādi pūrvoktaṃ svadehārcanapaścimam || 10.277
sarvaṃ khageśamantreṇa sāṅgena tu samācaret |
dvārsthatoraṇakumbhādiyajanaṃ prāgvad ācaret || 10.278
tataḥ puṇyāhaghoṣaṃ tu kārayet pūrvavad dvijāḥ |
garuḍasyāgrataḥ prāgvat kumbhe karakasaṃyutam || 10.279
bhāramātropakḷpte tu dhānyapīṭhe tu vinyaset |
jaladroṇyādikaṃ pātraṃ gandhatoyaiḥ supūritam || 10.280
dakṣiṇe karakasyātha viniveśya ca tatra tu |
sadyaś chāyādhivasanam ācared garuḍasya tu || 10.281
adhamādhamamārgeṇa snapanaṃ tu samācaret |
agrato vainateyasya vedikopari saṃsthite || 10.282
darpaṇe tu tataḥ paścānmuhūrte śobhane guruḥ |
nayanonmīlanaṃ kuryād vakṣyamāṇavidhānataḥ || 10.283
sarveṣām api sarpāṇāṃ netronmīlanam ācaret |
prāgvatsaṃśuddhadehas tu śilpī prakaṭatāṃ nayet || 10.284
sarvaṃ tu vidhivat kuryān netrayoḥ pūraṇādikam |
kumbhe ca karake caiva āsanaṃ parikalpya ca || 10.285
kumbhe garuḍam āvāhya karake mantram astrapam |
pūjayitvārghyagandhādyais tato dikkalaśāṣṭake || 10.286
indrādilokapālāṃs tu prādakṣiṇyena pūjya ca |
bhittisaṃsecanaṃ kṛtvā bhūyaḥ saṃsthāpya tatra tu || 10.287
tato dhvajapaṭe prāgvadāsanaṃ parikalpya ca |
tato garuḍamantraṃ tu sahasrādityabhāsvaram || 10.288
sarvarogapraśamanaṃ sarvopadravanāśanam |
sarvasiddhipradaṃ n�ṇāṃ sarvadāridryanāśanam || 10.289
hṛdayād recya viprendrāḥ paṭasthagaruḍe nyaset |
sakalīkaraṇaṃ kṛtvā sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> ca samācaret || 10.290
sannirodhaṃ <saṃnirodhaṃ> ca sāṃmukhyaṃ mudrābandhaṃ tathaiva ca |
layayāgaṃ bhogayāgaṃ yathāvad dvijasattamāḥ || 10.291
sarvaṃ garuḍamantreṇa sāṅgena tu samācaret |
kumbhe ca karake caiva paṭe ca kramayogataḥ || 10.292
mahatā vibhavenaiva pūjanaṃ samācaret |
alaṅkārāsanāntaṃ <alaṃkārāsanāntaṃ> ca yathoktena krameṇa tu || 10.293
kṛtvā sampūjanaṃ <saṃpūjanaṃ> viprā garuḍasya tataḥ param |
prāsādābhyantare viprā deśikānumatena tu || 10.294
anyena guruṇā yad vā sādhakena viśeṣavat |
pūjanaṃ kārayet samyaṅmūlamūrtigatasya ca || 10.295
yātrāmūrtigatasyāpi vibhor dānāntam eva ca |
tatparaṃ vainateyasya bhojyāsanapuraḥsaraiḥ || 10.296
vividhair madhuparkāntair hṛdyaiḥ saphalamūlakaiḥ |
anyair atiprabhūtaiś ca tathānyair vividhair api || 10.297
bhogair iṣṭvā japāntaṃ ca pūrvavatkramayogataḥ |
saṃpradānaṃ pṛthak kuryāt kāribhyas tu yathāvidhi || 10.298
mantrāstrakumbhayor dattam ācāryebhyo dadet tataḥ |
paṭasthasyāpi naivedyaṃ kiñcid ādāya pātragam || 10.299
deśikaḥ svayam ādadyād gurvādibhyo 'pi vai dadet |
mūlabimbasthitasyāpi yātrābimbasthitasya ca || 10.300
devasya madhuparkādyair naivedyaṃ pratipāditam |
dāpayed deśikādibhyas tato homaṃ samācaret || 10.301
kuṇḍaṃ salakṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā prāgbhāge garuḍasya tu |
tatrānalaṃ tu saṃskṛtya āvāhya vihageśvaram || 10.302
samidhāṃ saptakaṃ hutvā śāntyarthaṃ tu tilair ghṛtaiḥ |
āhutyaṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā pūrṇāṃ nivedayet || 10.303
yad vā naimittike kuṇḍe homaṃ kuryāt tu deśikaḥ |
evaṃ dhvajādhivāsaṃ tu kṛtvā garbhagṛhaṃ vrajet || 10.304
rakṣābandhaṃ tataḥ kuryād yathāvidhi munīśvarāḥ |
mūlamūrtigataṃ devam arghyādyaiḥ samprapūjya <saṃprapūjya> ca || 10.305
tatpādagau karau kṛtvā devaṃ vijñāpayed idam |
bhagavan puṇḍarīkākṣa kariṣye kautukakriyām || 10.306
mahotsavārthaṃ deveśa tadarthaṃ tvaṃ prasīda me |
iti vijñāpya deveśam āvāhyotsavakautuke || 10.307
arghyagandhādinābhyarcya vāsobhir vividhaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
bhūṣaṇair divyagandhaiś cāpy alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ || 10.308
sauvarṇaṃ yānam āropya śaṅkhabheryādisaṃyutam <śaṃkhabheryādisaṃyutam> |
chatrādyaiś ca samāyuktaṃ prādakṣiṇyakrameṇa tu || 10.309
āsthānamaṇṭapaṃ nītvā sauvarṇe bhadraviṣṭare |
tatra muktāvitānādyair upariṣṭād vibhūṣite || 10.310
sarvasādhanasaṃyukte samāropya vidhānataḥ |
pūjayitvā jagannāthaṃ prabhūtānnaṃ nivedya ca || 10.311
kṛtvā santarpaṇāntaṃ <saṃtarpaṇāntaṃ> ca prāsādaṃ sampraveśayet 
<saṃpraveśayet> |
tatas tu hemajaṃ pātraṃ rājataṃ vā samāharet || 10.312
śālibhis taṇḍulair viprā bhāramātraiḥ supūritam |
tadardhair vāpi tatpādaiḥ ṣaḍaṃśair vāṣṭamāṃśakaiḥ || 10.313
tadūrdhve hemajaṃ sūtraṃ kṣaumaṃ kārpāsam eva vā |
paṭṭajaṃ pañcabhiḥ sūtraiś caturbhiḥ saptabhis tu vā || 10.314
kṛtaṃ nyasya satāmbūlaṃ tatpātraṃ vinyaset tataḥ |
garbhāgramaṇṭape pīṭhe śālibhiḥ parikalpite || 10.315
bhāramānais tadardhair vā evaṃ śālivinirmite |
pīṭhe pātrāntare nyasyed apūpikasamanvitam || 10.316
arghyādinā samabhyarcya samyagācchādya vāsasā |
pātradvayaṃ dīkṣitayor nyastvā śirasi deśikaḥ || 10.317
yānādike vā saṃsthāpya vibhavānuguṇaṃ dvijāḥ |
saha tābhyāṃ tu pātrābhyāṃ nṛttagītādisaṃyutam || 10.318
pradakṣiṇaṃ paribhrāmya sarveṣv āvaraṇeṣv api |
ekasmin vā catuḥ kṛtvā grāmādau vā pradakṣiṇam || 10.319
nītvaikadhā tato viprāḥ praviśen mūlamandiram |
yad vā sudarśanopetaṃ viṣvaksenena vā dvijāḥ || 10.320
khageśaṃ vā hanūmantaṃ vibhīṣaṇasamanvitam |
yānādikaṃ samāropya bhrāmayet tu yathāruci || 10.321
garbhagehaṃ praviśyātha devadevasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> |
pātradvayaṃ tu vinyasya ādhāropari pūjayet || 10.322
aṣṭākṣareṇa mantreṇa arghyagandhādikais tathā |
kṛtvā puṇyāhaghoṣaṃ tu devam arghyādibhir yajet || 10.323
tataḥ pratisaraṃ ceṣṭvā gandhadhūpādhivāsitam |
prathamaṃ devadevasya mūlamūrtigatasya ca || 10.324
bandhayet kautukaṃ sūtrair hemajaiḥ paṭṭajais tu vā |
hemajaṃ sūtram ādāya gandhenālipya bandhayet || 10.325
devasya dakṣiṇe haste yātrāmūrtigatasya ca |
jitantākhyenamantreṇa śaṅkhagītādisaṃyutam <śaṃkhagītādisaṃyutam> || 10.326
spṛṣṭvā dakṣiṇahastena sūtram astraśataṃ japet |
śriyo vāmakare kuryāt paṭṭasūtreṇa kautukam || 10.327
śrīsūktam uccaran vāpi tanmantreṇa dvijottamāḥ |
puṣṭyās tu vāmahaste tu kṣaumasūtreṇa bandhayet || 10.328
kuryāt snapanabimbasya paṭṭasūtreṇa kautukam |
balibimbādikānāṃ ca kṛtvaivaṃ kautukaṃ tataḥ || 10.329
kautukaṃ deśikendras tu kārpāsena svadakṣiṇe |
kare tu mūlamantreṇa bandhayet tu tataḥ param || 10.330
tathaiva karmakart�ṇāṃ kautukaṃ bandhayet kramāt |
vibhave sati sarveṣāṃ sūtraṃ hemamayaṃ bhavet || 10.331
devam arghyādinābhyarcya apūpādīn nivedayet |
tāmbūlādīn samarpyātha tāmbūlais toṣayed dvijān || 10.332
dīkṣitān vaiṣṇavāṃś cāpi deśikendrapurassarān |
ācāryaḥ svayam ādadyāt tadarthaṃ taṇḍulādikam || 10.333
evaṃ sarveṣu yāgeṣu kāryaṃ kautukabandhanam |
rakṣābandhaṃ tu kṛtvaivaṃ rātriśeṣaṃ samāpayet || 10.334
tataḥ prabhāte susnātaḥ svācānto deśikottamaḥ |
nityārcanaṃ vibhoḥ kṛtvā viśeṣayajanaṃ tathā || 10.335
vainateyaṃ tato 'bhyarcya kumbhapūrvaṃ yathāvidhi |
mahāhavirnivedyātha homaṃ kṛtvā tu pūrvavat || 10.336
tataḥ kuryāt dhvajastambhasthāpanaṃ deśikottamaḥ |
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇādike || 10.337
sthāpayed gopurāsyāntar bahir vā stambham uttamam |
atha vā balipīṭhasya purobhāge munīśvarāḥ || 10.338
paścādbhāge 'pi vā kuryāt dhvajapīṭhaprakalpanam |
tayos tadantaraṃ kuryād dhastaṃ vā tālam eva vā || 10.339
uttare dhvajapīṭhasya pūrvasyāṃ diśi vā dvijāḥ |
śāyayec ca dhvajastambhaṃ dhvajayaṣṭisamanvitam || 10.340
pūrvāgram uttarāgraṃ vā lakṣaṇāḍhyaṃ suśobhanam |
antassāro bahissāro nissāras trividhas taruḥ || 10.341
antassāraś candanādiḥ praśastaḥ stambhakalpane |
kramukādir bahissāraḥ so 'pi śasto munīśvarāḥ || 10.342
kiṃśukādyaṃ tu nissāraṃ varjayet stambhakarmaṇi |
ārdraṃ navamṛjuṃ snigdhaṃ vaktrasphoṭanavarjitam ||| 10.343
ayugmaparvakaṃ snigdhaṃ satvacaṃ susthiraṃ tathā |
grāhayet tu dhvajastambhaṃ śāstradṛṣṭyā parīkṣya tu || 10.344
śatatālaṃ tu mukhyaṃ syād viṃśanyūna mathāpi vā |
ṣaṣṭitālamitaṃ vāpi mānāṅgulavaśena tu || 10.345
mātrāṅgulavaśenāpi pramāṇaṃ parikalpayet |
prāsādaśikharāgroccaṃ prāsādoccam athāpi vā || 10.346
karṇoccaṃ gopuroccaṃ vā yathāśakti prakalpayet |
caturdhā vibhajet stambham ekāṃśenaiva mastakam || 10.347
tasya cādhārabhūtānāṃ chidritānāṃ trimūlataḥ |
trayāṇām api pīṭhānāṃ stambhāgre viniveśanam || 10.348
agre pīṭhadvayacchidre dhvajayaṣṭiṃ tu yojayet |
darbhamuṣṭiṃ tadūrdhve tu bandhayet ghaṇṭayā saha || 10.349
veṣṭayed darbhamālābhir dhvajadaṇḍaṃ pradakṣiṇam |
evaṃ kṛtvā dhvajastambhaṃ prokṣayed astravāriṇā || 10.350
dhvajapīṭhasthite garte ratnadhānyāni nikṣipet |
deśikas tārkṣyamantreṇa tato brāhmaṇasattamaiḥ || 10.351
śūdrair vā dīkṣitair viprāḥ devadāsair athāpi vā |
śaṅkhabheryādinirghoṣagītavāditrasaṃyutam
<śaṃkhabheryādinirghoṣagītavāditrasaṃyutam> || 10.352
sthāpayet tu dhvajastambhaṃ tasmin garte ṛjusthitam |
prāsādābhimukhaṃ sthāpya vālukābhiś ca pūrayet || 10.353
hastapādādibhiḥ kṛtvā sudṛḍhaṃ tu yathā bhavet |
stambhamūlasthale vediṃ pañcahastasamucchritām || 10.354
trihastair ucchritāṃ vāpi ekahastasamucchritām |
tāvadbhir eva vistīrṇāṃ caturaśrāṃ prakalpayet || 10.355
tadūrdhve madhyadeśe tu padmam aṣṭadalair yutam |
karṇikāstho yathā stambhas tathā kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ || 10.356
prāsādāntaḥ praviśyātha mūlamūrtigataṃ vibhum |
arghyagandhādinābhyarcya tasmād utsavakautuke || 10.357
kiñcid āvāhya taṃ cāpi devībhyāṃ sahitaṃ tataḥ |
pūjayitvā jagannāthaṃ pāduke vinivedya ca || 10.358
yāne praropya tadanu sauvarṇaprabhayānvite |
evam eva hi balyarcām iṣṭvā yāne niveśayet || 10.359
ācāryo mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ gatvā garuḍasannidhim <garuḍasaṃnidhim> |
rathe vā kuñjare yāne dhvajam āropya yatnataḥ || 10.360
prabhayā citrakusumaiḥ kṛtayā bhūṣayet dhvajam |
vāsobhir bhūṣaṇaiḥ sragbhir vicitrābhiś ca bhūṣayet || 10.361
chatracāmarapūrvaiś ca mayūravyajanais tataḥ |
vicitrais tālavṛntaiś ca ātapatrair manoharaiḥ || 10.362
ketudaṇḍair vicitraiś ca dukūlapaṭaśobhitaiḥ |
caturvedamayoddhoṣaiḥ stotraghoṣasamanvitaiḥ || 10.363
gītakair vividhair vādyaiḥ śaṅkhakāhalanisvanaiḥ <śaṃkhakāhalanisvanaiḥ> |
bherīmṛdaṅgapūrvāṇāṃ ghoṣair anyaiś ca maṅgalaiḥ || 10.364
brāhmaṇair dhiyamāṇaiś ca sāṅkuraiḥ pālikāgaṇaiḥ |
suveṣagaṇikāsaṅghaiḥ <suveṣagaṇikāsaṃghaiḥ> sadā bhaktajanaiḥ saha || 10.365
kṣvelitāsphoṭitair yuktaṃ jayaśabdasamanvitam |
balibimbaṃ puraskṛtya madhye dhvajapaṭaṃ tataḥ || 10.366
yātrāmūrtiṃ ca tadanu krameṇa bhrāmayet tataḥ |
prathamāvṛtim ārabhya rathyāvaraṇapaścimam || 10.367
balidānapuraskaṃ tu kṛtvā grāmapradakṣiṇam |
yātrābimbaṃ ca tadanu nayed āsthānamaṇṭape || 10.368
niveśya viṣṭare haime dhvajapīṭhasya sammukham <saṃmukham> |
ācāryo mūrtipaiḥ sārdham ādāya garuḍadhvajam || 10.369
saha śaṅkhaninādādyaiḥ <śaṃkhaninādādyaiḥ> prādakṣiṇyena yogataḥ |
dhvajapīṭhaṃ samānīya stambhaṃ prakṣālya sajjalaiḥ || 10.370
vibhave sati vastreṇa saṃveṣṭhya dhvajadaṇḍakam |
trivṛtkṛtais tu kārpāsasūtrair atidṛḍhaiḥ kṛtām || 10.371
rajjum ādāya tadanu sudṛḍhāṃ deśikottamaḥ |
yaṣṭyagrasaṃsthite yantre yojayitvā tayā tataḥ || 10.372
dhvajasya śikharaṃ viprā bandhayet sudṛḍhaṃ tataḥ |
sarvaiḥ parijanaiḥ sārdhaṃ kumbhapārśvaṃ samāśrayet || 10.373
tatkumbhaṃ tu samuddhṛtya vinyasec chiṣyamūrdhani |
upalumbhāṣṭakaṃ caiva vāhayed brāhmaṇaiḥ saha || 10.374
vardhanīṃ ca samādāya ācāryaḥ svakareṇa tu |
acchinnadhārayā yuktaṃ vādyaghoṣapurassaram || 10.375
devāgāraṃ paribhrāmya stambhamūlaṃ samāśrayet |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu samprokṣyāstreṇa <saṃprokṣyāstreṇa> vai dhvajam || 
10.376
gāruḍenaiva mantreṇa paṭasthaṃ garuḍaṃ yajet |
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathācāmaṃ gandhaṃ mālyaṃ ca dhūpakam || 10.377
apūpān pṛthukāṃś cāpi pānakaṃ tarpaṇaṃ tataḥ |
nālikerajalair yuktam ācāmaṃ tadanantaram || 10.378
karpūrādisamāyuktaṃ datvā tāmbūlam uttamam |
tanmudrāṃ darśayitvā tu tataḥ puruṣasūktataḥ || 10.379
mahākumbhasthatoyena samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> garuḍaṃ tataḥ |
mahākumbhasthagaruḍaṃ paṭasthe tu niveśayet || 10.380
upakumbhāṣṭakenaiva aṣṭa nāgān yathākramam |
āyudhānāṃ tathaivoktaṃ karakāstrajalena tu || 10.381
evaṃ krameṇa samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> tato deśikasattamaḥ |
mantranyāsādikaṃ kṛtvā puṣpāñjalipuraḥsaram || 10.382
sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> sannirodhaṃ <saṃnirodhaṃ> ca sāṃmukhyaṃ ca samācaret 
||
tatas tv arghyādibhiḥ pūjya upahārān bahūn api || 10.383
mudgān nādīn nivedyātha tāmbūlādīn samarpayet |
stotraiḥ stuvīta garuḍaṃ baddhāñjalipuṭo guruḥ || 10.384
vāhanāya mahāviṣṇoḥ tārkṣyāyāmitatejase |
garuḍāya namas tubhyaṃ sarvasarpendramṛtyave || 10.385
namo namas te pakṣīndra svādhyāyavapuṣe namaḥ |
vihagendra namas te 'stu samutpāṭitakalpaka || 10.386
āhṛtāmṛtakumbhāya jananīdāsyamocine |
surāsurendrajayine nāgendrābharaṇāya te || 10.387
yadādhāram idaṃ sarvaṃ tadādhārāya te namaḥ |
pakṣau yasya bṛhatsāma rathantaram api dvayam || 10.388
akṣiṇī cāpi gāyatrī trivṛtsāma śiraḥ smṛtam |
stoma ātmā namas tasmai vāmadevyāṅgasampade <vāmadevyāṅgasaṃpade> || 
10.389
namaḥ prāṇādivāyūnām īśānāya garutmate |
doṣān apanayākhaṇḍān guṇān āvaha sarvataḥ || 10.390
vighnāni jahi sarvāṇi ātmasātkuru mām api |
stutvaivaṃ śrāvayet tasya bṛhatsāma rathantaram || 10.391
tatkāle deśikendras tu dhyāyamānaḥ khageśvaram |
naivedyaṃ kabalīkṛtya mantrayitvā tu mantravit || 10.392
pauruṣair gāruḍair mantraiḥ vandhyānām api yoṣitām |
kṣiped añjaliṣu dhyātvā garuḍaṃ cācyutaṃ harim || 10.393
bhakṣayitvā striyaḥ piṇḍān janayeyuḥ sutān bahūn |
tatas tu garuḍāgre tu tāmbūlair gandhamālyakaiḥ || 10.394
daivajñaṃ pūjayitvā tu labdhvā lagnaṃ śubhapradam |
sumūhūrte sulagne ca āśīrvādapurassaram || 10.395
ghaṇṭāśabdamṛdaṅgaiś ca sarvavādyaravaiḥ saha |
rajjūnārohayed dhīraṃ suparṇosītimantrataḥ || 10.396
rañjuṃ ca bandhayet stambhe prādakṣiṇyakrameṇa tu |
prāsādābhimukhaṃ stambhe sthāpayed garuḍadhvajam || 10.397
pūrvāhne vātha madhyāhne dhvajasyārohaṇaṃ mahat |
yātrāmūrtiṃ ca tadanu yānam āropya deśikaḥ || 10.398
dhvajastambhasamīpaṃ tu nītvā cādarśayet dhvajam |
āhvānārtham aśeṣāṇāṃ bhaktānāṃ patageśvaram || 10.399
niyujya devas tadanu prāpnuyān maṇṭapāvanim |
prārthayet sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> cātha garuḍasya dhvajodare || 10.400
asmād dināt samārabhya yāvattīrthadināntimam |
sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> kuru pakṣīndra rājño janapadasya ca || 10.401
grāmasya yajamānasya vaiṣṇavānāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
tuṣṭaye puṣṭaye caiva sarvaśatrujayāya ca || 10.402
apamṛtyujayārthāya vainateya prasīda om |
iti vijñāpya pakṣīndraṃ vikiret kusumāñjalim || 10.403
sannidhau <saṃnidhau> devadevasya gatvā puṣpāñjaliṃ kṣipet |
jñānato 'jñānato vāpi yathoktaṃ na kṛtaṃ mayā || 10.404
tat sarvaṃ pūrṇam evāstu sutṛpto bhava sarvadā |
om acyuta jagannātha mantramūrte janārdana || 10.405
rakṣa māṃ puṇḍarīkākṣa kṣamasvādya prasīda om |
iti vijñāpya deveśaṃ yātrāmūrtigataṃ vibhum || 10.406
anyatra maṇṭape nītvā viśeṣārcanapūrvakam |
prabhūtānnaṃ nivedyātha sarvaṃ havanapaścimam || 10.407
kṛtvā yathākrameṇaiva prāsādaṃ tu praveśayet |
kalpayet dhvajapīthordhve catuḥstambhānvitāṃ prapām || 10.408
yad vā stambhāṣṭakāpetāṃ ṣoḍaśastambhasaṃyutām |
catustoraṇasaṃyuktāṃ darbhamālāpariṣkṛtām || 10.409
bhūṣitāṃ tu patākādyair bāhye yavanikānvitām |
dīpān pradīpayet tatra anirvāṇān samantataḥ || 10.410
tadvāsarāt samārabhya puṣpayāgadināntimam |
trisandhyam <trisaṃdhyam> arcanaṃ kuryāt saviśeṣaṃ japānvitam || 10.411
balikāle baliṃ dadyād asyāpi prativāsaram |
evaṃ dhvajādhirohāntaṃ divākṛtyam udīritam || 10.412

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
mahotsavadhvajārohaṇāntavidhir nāma
daśamo 'dhyāyaḥ


atha ekādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ

nāradaḥ
niśāmukhe pravṛtte tu deśiko mūrtipaiḥ saha |
snānādinityaniyamān kṛtvā caiva yathāvidhi || 11.1
devasya sanniddhiṃ <saṃniddhiṃ> gatvā nityapūjāṃ samācaret |
yātrāmūrtigataṃ devaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam || 11.2
āsthānamaṇṭapaṃ nītvā sthāpayet snānaviṣṭare |
tatas tu vakṣyamāṇaṃ yat snapanaṃ tv adhamottamam || 11.3
tena saṃsnāpayed devaṃ yathāvibhavavistaram |
alaṅkārāsane <alaṃkārāsane> 'bhyarcya bhogaiḥ paramapāvanaiḥ || 11.4
prabhūtam atha naivedyaṃ vinivedya yathākramam |
kṛtvā japāvasānaṃ tu bherītāḍanam ācaret || 11.5
devasya dakṣiṇe pārśve upaviśyāsane guruḥ |
bherīsaṃsthāpanārthaṃ tu deveśasyāgratas tataḥ || 11.6
caraṇaṃpavitram uccārya mahīṃ prakṣālya vāriṇā |
viṣṇor arāṭamantreṇa darbhais sammārjya <saṃmārjya> deśikaḥ || 11.7
gandhadvāretimantreṇa gomayenānulepayet |
āpa undantumantreṇa sudhācūrṇair alaṅkṛtiḥ <alaṃkṛtiḥ> || 11.8
devasya tvetimantreṇa vikired akṣatān kṣitau |
grīṣmo hemantamantreṇa dhānyapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet || 11.9

<<viṣṇor arāṭamantreṇa dhanyapīthaṃ prakalpayet || 11.7
śanno devītimantreṇa gomayenānulepayet |
āpa undantumantreṇa sughācūrṇair alaṅkṛtiḥ <alaṃkṛtiḥ> || 11.8
devasya tvetimantreṇa ūrdhvaṃ darbhaiḥ paristaret |>> 

śanno devītimantreṇa śatapatraṃ caturdiśi |
trātāram itimantreṇa madhye padmaṃ ca saṃlikhet || 11.10
dhananāgetimantreṇa ūrdhvaṃ darbhaiḥ paristaret |
mūrdhānam itimantreṇa namaskuryād bhuvaṃ tataḥ || 11.11
tatra koṇacatuṣke tu nyased dīpacatuṣṭayam |
vācayet svasti puṇyāhaṃ tato deśikasattamaḥ || 11.12
tajjalaiḥ prokṣayed bherīṃ āpa undantumantrataḥ |
agnir āyuṣmamantreṇa prokṣayet sarvavādyakān || 11.13
aryamāyeti tadbherīṃ vinyased dhānyaviṣṭare |
tatpūrve śaṅkhanikaraṃ <śaṃkhanikaraṃ> vahnau
kāhalasañcayam <kāhalasaṃcayam> || 11.14
yāmye tu mardalaṃ tantrīṃ vaṃśayuktāṃ tu yātudik |
vāruṇyāṃ tu mṛdaṅgaṃ ca ḍuḍḍukān hrasvamardalān || 11.15
vāyavye jhallarīṃ kāṃsyatālasamanvitam |
paṭahaṃ hrasvapaṭahaṃ some ḍuḍḍukasaṃyutam || 11.16
aiśānyāṃ ḍuḍḍukāṃ jhallīṃ hastaghaṇṭāsamanvitām |
teṣāṃ bāhye tu viprendrā dakṣiṇe gaṇikājanān || 11.17
nyasen maṅgalagānārthaṃ tatpārśve mantragāyakān |
nartakān agrataḥ sthāpya uttare vandivṛndakān || 11.18
svasvasthāneṣu saṃsthāpya anyān vai vādyakovidān |
evaṃ krameṇa saṃsthāpya sambhavānuguṇaṃ <saṃbhavānuguṇaṃ> dvijāḥ || 11.19
garuḍasthānam āsādya arghyādhyair havirantimaiḥ |
ārādhya garuḍaṃ pūrvaṃ bherīpārśvaṃ samāśrayet || 11.20
vāsasā veṣṭhayed bherīṃ yathāvittānusārataḥ |
śabdavigraham ākāśaṃ bheryāṃ saṃskṛtya pūjayet || 11.21
bherīmadhye tato viṣṇuṃ pūjayed viṣṇumantrataḥ |
brahmāṇaṃ dakṣiṇe 'bhyarcya rudram abhyarcya vāmake || 11.22
koṇaṃ taddakṣiṇe sthāpya vāyuṃ tatra supūjayet |
śaṃkheṣu viṣṇum abhyarcya kāhaleṣu sarasvatīm || 11.23
mardaleṣv indum abhyarcya tantryāṃ gandharvam arcayet |
mṛdaṅge rudram abhyarcya ṣaṇmukhaṃ ḍuḍḍukeṣu ca || 11.24
hrasvamardalavādyeṣu medinīṃ ca samarcayet |
jhallaryāṃ viṣṇum abhyarcya brahmāṇaṃ kāṃsyatālake || 11.25
paṭaheṣu śriyaṃ devīṃ ghaṇṭāyāṃ tu sarasvatīm |
anyeṣu sarvavādyeṣu viṣṇum eva samarcayet || 11.26
bheryādisarvavādyāni yajed evaṃ guruḥ svayam |
tatkāle vāravanitāḥ puṣpāñjalisamanvitāḥ || 11.27
bheryūrdhve tāni puṣpāṇi vikireyur mudānvitāḥ |
tataḥ pāraśavaṃ snātaṃ darbhapāṇim alaṅkṛtam <alaṃkṛtam> || 11.28
upavītādisaṃyuktaṃ pañcasaṃskāraśālinam |
bhagavadbhaktisaṃyuktam agrataḥ sthāpya vīkṣayet || 11.29
astreṇa prokṣayet paścādarghyatoyena tatparam |
muhūrte śobhane prāpte bherīm evaṃ prapūjitām || 11.30
koṇena tāḍayen mūrtitrayaṃ dhyāyan guruḥ svayam |
tad viṣṇor itimantreṇa prathamaṃ tāḍanaṃ bhavet || 11.31
brahmajajñānamantreṇa dvitīyaṃ tāḍanaṃ bhavet |
kadrudrāyetimantreṇa tṛtīyaṃ tāḍanaṃ bhavet || 11.32
tristhānādiṣu devānāṃ tridhā vai tena tāḍayet |
tataḥ pārāśavas tāṃ tu vahan bherīm alaṅkṛtām <alaṃkṛtām> || 11.33
prathamaṃ vāmahastena tridhā santāḍanaṃ <saṃtāḍanaṃ> caret |
dakṣiṇena tataḥ samyak tathā santāḍayet <saṃtāḍayet> tridhā || 11.34
prathamaṃ śaṅkhanādaṃ <śaṃkhanādaṃ> tu dvitīyaṃ kāhalasvanam |
tṛtīyaṃ tāḍanaṃ proktaṃ krameṇaivaṃ hi kārayet || 11.35
devatāhvānavelāyāṃ sarvavādyāni ghoṣayet |
devatāvāhinīṃ gādhāṃ saṃskṛtāṃ prākṛtāṃ tu vā || 11.36
drāmiḍīṃ vā yathecchātas tadā saṃśrāvayed vibhum |
tatkāle devatānṛttaṃ tattadgītādisaṃyutam || 11.37
darśayed devadevasya devatānāṃ sutṛptaye |
tatas tu cotsavaṃ bimbaṃ devībhyāṃ saha deśikaḥ || 11.38
yānam āropya sudṛḍham alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ |
balibimbapuraskaṃ tu yātrāmūrtim anantaram || 11.39
bhrāmayet kramayogena vādyaghoṣapurassaram |
sarvaiḥ parijanaiḥ sārdhaṃ balidānapurassaram || 11.40
pāyasaṃ droṇamānaṃ tu samādāyātha pātrataḥ |
tathārghyagandhamālyāni dhūpaṃ tāmbūlam eva ca || 11.41
prāsādadvāram ārabhya bahirdvārāvasānakam |
āvṛtiṣv api sarvāsu vīthyāvaraṇapaścimam || 11.42
baliṃ pradāya vidhinā gītanṛttādisaṃyutam |
tataḥ praviśya grāmaṃ tu pūrvasyāṃ diśi saṃsthitaḥ || 11.43
devatāvāhanaṃ kuryāt prāṅmukho deśikaḥ svayam |
tatputras tasya śiṣyo vā svareṇoccatareṇa tu || 11.44
āgacchatām aragaṇāḥ prāgāśāṃ ye 'dhiśerate |
virūpāś ca surūpāś ca saparyām udyatām imām || 11.45
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ kumudasyānuyāyinaḥ |
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ || 11.46
anena mantreṇāvāhya kumudaṃ sagaṇaṃ tataḥ |
arghyalepanamālyāni dhūpaṃ toyaṃ yathākramam || 11.47
pāyasānnaṃ punastoyaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca pradāpayet |
paścāt santoṣayed <saṃtoṣayed> ramyair mahadbhiḥ śaṅkhajai ravaiḥ || 11.48
tadīyatālasaṅgītanṛtteś <tadīyatālasaṃgītanṛtteś> cāpi tataḥ param |
āgacchatām arahaṇāḥ yogyāśāmadhiśerate || 11.49
bhīmā bhīmamukhā raudrāḥ saparyām udyatām imām |
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ kumudākṣānuyāyinaḥ || 11.50
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ |
anena kumudākṣaṃ tu samāvāhya gaṇādhipam || 11.51
prāgvat santoṣayitvā <saṃtoṣayitvā> tu tataḥ samprāpya <saṃprāpya> yāmyadik |
āgacchata pitṛgaṇāḥ yāmyāśāṃ yedhiśerate || 11.52
dāruṇā dāruṇācārāḥ saparyām udyatām imām |
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ puṇḍarīkānuyāyinaḥ || 11.53
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ |
anena puṇḍarīkākhyaṃ samāvāhya gaṇeśvaram || 11.54
krameṇa pūjayitvā tu gatvā vai yātudhānadik |
āgacchata yātugaṇāḥ yātvāśāṃ yedhiśerate || 11.55
kravyāśinaḥ krūradhiyaḥ saparyām udyatām imām |
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ vāmanasyānuyāyinaḥ || 11.56
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ |
ity āvāhya gaṇeśaṃ tu vāmanaṃ pūjayet kramāt || 11.57
vāruṇāśāṃ tato gatvā śaṅkukarṇaṃ gaṇeśvaram |
āgacchatāhiprathamāḥ pratīcīṃ yedhiśerate || 11.58
mahāviṣā dandaśūkāḥ saparyām udyatām imām |
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ śaṅkukarṇānuyāyinaḥ || 11.59
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ |
ity āvāhya yajet prāgvat paścāt samprāpya <saṃprāpya> vāyudik || 11.60
āyāntu gandharvagaṇāḥ vāyvāśāṃ yedhiśerate |
sudarśanā bhīmavegāḥ saparyām udyatām imām || 11.61
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ sarvanetrānuyāyinaḥ ||
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ || 11.62
anenāvāhya sagaṇaṃ sarvanetraṃ tu toṣayet |
tataḥ somadiśaṃ gatvā sumukhaṃ tu gaṇādhipam || 11.63
āgacchata yakṣagaṇā udīcīṃ yedhiśerate |
virūpā daṇḍahastāś ca saparyām udyatām imām || 11.64
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ sumukhasyānuyāyinaḥ |
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ || 11.65
iti mantreṇa cāvāhya toṣayet pūrvavartmanā |
tatas tv īśadiśaṃ gatvā gaṇeśaṃ supratiṣṭhitam || 11.66
āyāntu piśācagaṇāḥ īśāśāṃ yedhiśerate |
saśūlāyughahastāś ca saparyām udyatām imām || 11.67
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ supratiṣṭhānuyāyinaḥ |
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ || 11.68
mantreṇāvāhya sampūjya <saṃpūjya> gatvā vai grāmam adhyataḥ |
tatra cāvāhayed ūrdhve praśnigarbhaṃ gaṇeśvaram || 11.69
āgacchata siddhagaṇāḥ gaganaṃ yedhiśerate |
śucimatayaḥ śucayaḥ saparyām udyatām imām || 11.70
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ praśnigarbhānuyāyinaḥ |
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ || 11.71
āvāhya toṣayitvā tu adhastān mānavaṃ tataḥ |
āgacchatādharagaṇāḥ pṛthivīṃ yedhiśerate || 11.72
bahurūpā bahujñānāḥ saparyām udyatām imām |
gṛhītvā pāntu nas tṛptāḥ mānavasyānuyāyinaḥ || 11.73
mahantv imam upāyāntu prītās tebhyo namo 'stu vaḥ |
āvāhya toṣayet prāgvatkramāt kṛtvāvasānakam || 11.74
tṛptaye sarvabhūtānāṃ baliśeṣaṃ tataḥ kṣipet |
balidāne tu pūrvādi vaivasvatadigantimam || 11.75
ācāryaḥ prāṅmukhaḥ sthitvā kuryād āvāhanādikam |
yāttvāditritaye kuryāt pūrvoditam udaṅmukhaḥ || 11.76
someśadigdvaye grāmamadhye 'pi prāṅmukho bhavet |
samatālas tathā baddhatālo vai śṛṅgiṇī tathā || 11.77
mallatālo maṅgalaś ca jayatālaś ca bhadrakaḥ |
ḍhakkarīsaṃjñitas tālo brahmatālas tathaiva ca || 11.78
anantatāla ity ete daśa tālāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
kumudādigaṇeśānāṃ daśānāṃ kramaśo dvijāḥ || 11.79
ṣaḍjarṣabhau ca gāndhāro madhyamaḥ pañcamas tathā |
dhaivataś caiva niṣādo dhaivato madhyamas tathā || 11.80
pañcamaś ca krameṇaiva kathitāḥ syur daśa svarāḥ |
gāndhārarāgaḥ kaulākhyaḥ kauśiko naṭabhāṣikaḥ || 11.81
śrīḥ kāmadaś ca tatkeśī dakṣarāgas tathaiva ca |
cālāpāṇyabhidho rāgo megharāgaś ca pañcamaḥ || 11.82
ity ete kumudādīnāṃ daśarāgāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
vilāsaṃ sarvatobhadraṃ kheṭakaṃ cakramaṇḍalam || 11.83
kāntārakuṭṭimaṃ pṛṣṭhakuṭṭimaṃ kaṭibandhanam |
vāmajānūrdhvanṛttaṃ tu ādimaṃ ca dvayaṃ punaḥ || 11.84
ete nṛttaviśeṣāś ca kumudādeḥ kramāt smṛtāḥ |
ete hy āvṛtidevānāṃ kramāt tālādayaḥ smṛtāḥ || 11.85
anyeṣāṃ sarvadevānāṃ tālo bhadra praśasyate |
bhaved garuḍatālas tu pakṣīśasya tu madhyamaḥ || 11.86
svaro rāgas tu gauḍaḥ syān nṛttaṃ vai viṣṇukāntakam |
vighnārer jayatālaṃ syān nṛttaṃ svastikam ucyate || 11.87
ṛṣabhas tu svaraḥ prokto varāṭīrāga eva ca |
bherītāḍanapūrvaṃ tu devatāvāhanaṃ caret || 11.88
ghoṣayed gāruḍaṃ tālam antarāle tu vai diśām |
tatkāle deśikendreṇa svayaṃ saṃskṛtagādhayā || 11.89
anye caturmukhamukhā āhūtavyā marudgaṇāḥ |
devasyotsavasevārthaṃ tathānye bhagavadgaṇāḥ || 11.90
tathānye bhagavadbhaktāḥ janās tatpādasevinaḥ |
yad vā guror anumatair bhagavadbhaktibṛṃhitaiḥ || 11.91
āhvātavyās tu tair viprair divyayā gāthayā dvijāḥ |
evaṃ grāmaṃ paribhrāmya prāsādaṃ sapraviśya tu || 11.92
garuḍasthānam āsādya toṣayitvā khagadhvajam |
tālādikais tatas tv enaṃ viṣvaksenaṃ tu toṣayet || 11.93
tatas tu cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ yāgaśālāṃ praveśayet |
vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutām || 11.94
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇe 'pi vā |
tṛtīyāvaraṇādau vā yathābhimatādiggatām || 11.95
tathā prāgānanāṃ yad vā yathābhimatadiṅmukhām |
ekadvārāṃ caturdvārāṃ yad vā dvāradvayānvitām || 11.96
bhittiyuktām ayuktāṃ vā koṇabhittisamanvitām |
kṣiprakarmaprasiddhyarthaṃ kevalaṃ vā prapākṛtim || 11.97
dhūmanirgamanopetāṃ madhye vedisamanvitām |
tadūrdhve homakuṇḍaṃ tu sacaturmekhalaṃ bhavet || 11.98
mekhalātrayayuktaṃ vā dvimekhalam athāpi vā |
tathaikamekhalaṃ vāpi caturaśraṃ salakṣaṇam || 11.99
tatpūrve maṇḍalopetāṃ vahnau dīpaghaṭānvitām |
paścime dīpa(bimba)saṃyuktām uttare cāṅkurair yutām || 11.100
īśānye kumbhasaṃyuktāṃ sarvopakaraṇair yutām |
alaṅkṛtāṃ <alaṃkṛtāṃ> vitānādyais toraṇadhvajaśobhitām || 11.101
evaṃvidhāṃ yāgaśālāṃ praviśya gurusattamaḥ |
prāgdik pratyaṅmukhā yojyā ṛṅmayāḥ svāsaneṣu ca || 11.102
dakṣiṇe ca udagvaktrān yajurvedāṃś ca yojayet |
prāṅmukhān paścime bhāge sāmagān viniveśayet || 11.103
saha caikāyanair viprair mūrtisaṃjñopalakṣitaiḥ |
diśyuttarasyāṃ ca tato nityakarmaparāyaṇān || 11.104
niveśyātharvavedajñān sarvān dvidvikasaṃkhyayā |
pravartite vedaghoṣe vādyaghoṣe ca bāhyataḥ || 11.105
praviśya kalaśasthānaṃ samīpe tu varāsane |
prāṅkhaḥ saṃsmaren mantraṃ pūrvavadvyāptibhāvite || 11.106
upaviśya yathānyāyam antaryāgāntam ācaret |
karādiśuddhipūrvaṃ tu paścādarghyādikalpanam || 11.107
prāgvat kṛtvā tato 'bhyarcya mantrasaṅghaṃ <mantrasaṃghaṃ> tu dehagam |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu prokṣayet sarvasādhanam || 11.108
dvau dvau tu pūrvaṃ kalaśau sauvarṇau rājatau tu vā |
tāmrajau mṛṇmayau vātha sāpidhānau sapallavau || 11.109
phalaratnādikair yuktau sūtreṇa pariveṣṭitau |
śālipīṭhopari sthāpya pratidvāre tu pārśvayoḥ || 11.110
dvārayāgaṃ tataḥ kuryāt pūrvādyuttarapaścimam |
arghyālepanamālyaiś ca dhūpair guggulumiśritaiḥ || 11.111
athādāya dṛḍhaṃ śubhram ekarūpaṃ ca nirvraṇam |
kubhaṃ <kumbhaṃ> ca mṛṇmayaṃ ramyaṃ sauvarṇaṃ vātha rājatam || 11.112
ratnahāṭakasraggandhaphalasarvauṣadhīyutam |
śubhapādapaśākhāḍhyaṃ paṭṭasraggandhabhūṣitam || 11.113
gālitodakasampūrṇaṃ <gālitodakasaṃpūrṇaṃ> vāridhārānvitaṃ navam |
candanādyanuliptaṃ ca paritaś cākṣatārcitam || 11.114
veṣṭitaṃ paritaḥ sūtrair vikīryopari taṃ nyaset |
taddevatāśarīraṃ tu paśyed amalavarcasam || 11.115
sāstreṇa cakramantreṇa mantrayed atha vardhanīm |
pūrvoktadravyasaṃyuktāṃ paritaḥ sūtraveṣṭitām || 11.116
āvāhya mantranāthasya dakṣiṇe kalaśottare |
vinyasya paritas tatra sthāpayet kalaśāṣṭakam || 11.117
sapallavaṃ sāpidhānaṃ sūtreṇa pariveṣṭitam |
kumbhamadhye vibhoḥ paścādāsanaṃ parikalpya ca || 11.118
tanmadhye puṇḍarīkākṣaṃ samāvāhya vidhānataḥ |
sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> sannirodhādi <saṃnirodhādi> bhogayāgāvasānakam || 
11.119
pūrvavat sakalaṃ kṛtvā tasya dakṣiṇadiggatam |
astravigraharūpaṃ ca dhyātvābhyarcya yathāvidhi || 11.120
dhvaṃsayantaṃ ca vighnānāṃ jālaṃ karmāvasānakam |
aṣṭāsu tatra kumbheṣu paritaḥ sthāpiteṣu ca || 11.121
vāsudevādayaḥ pūjyāḥ prabhavāpyayayogataḥ |
idam abhyarthayed devaṃ sāstraṃ baddhāṃjaliḥ sthitaḥ || 11.122
yāgālayaṃ hi viśveśa gṛhāṇa racitaṃ mayā |
āsāmaptiṃ bhaja vibho kriyāṅgānāṃ ca sannidhim <saṃnidhim> || 11.123
tato 'strodakadhārāṃ cāpy acchinnāṃ bhittikāṃ nayet |
pradakṣiṇena prāgbhāvāt tatpādāntaṃ ca tat smaret || 11.124
athaveśānadigbhāgāt tatpādāntaṃ dvijottamāḥ |
pṛṣṭhataḥ kalaśaṃ bhrāmya tulyakālaṃ tu vā pṛthak || 11.125
kalaśaṃ vardhanīyuktaṃ vinyasya vikirordhvagam |
arghyadānaṃ tayoḥ kṛtvā puṣpādyaiḥ pūrayet punaḥ || 11.126
astreṇa vastrayugmaṃ tu ahataṃ cābhimantrya vai |
dhūpādhivāsitaṃ kṛtvā tāv ubhau pariveṣṭya ca || 11.127
atha vā bhadrapīṭhaṃ tu vinyased vikirordhvagam |
sāstraṃ hi mantrakalaśaṃ tatrādhāragataṃ nyaset || 11.128
catustridvyaikabhārair vā śālibhir viṣṭare kṛte |
tāvanmānāṃs tadardhān vā tadūrdhve taṇḍulān nyaset || 11.129
tatpādāṃs tatsamānvāpi tadūrdhve vinyaset tilān |
tadūrdhve cāhataṃ vastrayugmam āstīrya vai śubham || 11.130
kalaśaṃ vardhanīyuktaṃ tadūrdhve vāpi vinyaset |
prāgvat sāstraṃ tu deveśam āsanādikramād yajet || 11.131
vyāpāram ācared divyaṃ kumbhake ca smaranvibhum |
nāniśaṃ yujyate yāsmāt tasmād eṣā pratikriyā || 11.132
vibhāvya mantriṇā kaumbhī astraṃ rakṣārtham evaṃ hi |
tato maṇḍalavediṃ tu samāsādya ca deśikaḥ || 11.133
upalipyātha bhūbhagaṃ sāmbhasā gomayena tu |
tatra maṇḍalam ālekhyaṃ sūtrayitvā yathāvidhi || 11.134
tadvidhānaṃ viśeṣeṇa śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
saṃsādhya yaṣṭiyogena sūtrāt pūrvāpare purā || 11.135
taddigdvayāntare dadyāt pārśve sūtracatuṣṭayam |
samāṃśena dvidhā kṛtvā sphuṭaṃ madhyāt tadantya ca || 11.136
sādhitenārdhamānena prākpratyaksthena tantunā |
dakṣiṇottarabhāgābhyāṃ samutpādya catuṣpathau || 11.137
sūtraṃ pūrvāparasamaṃ kṛtvā tadupari kṣipet |
punarardhasamaṃ dikṣu datvā koṇacatuṣṭayam || 11.138
catuṣpathacatuṣkeṇa nayed vyaktiṃ prasārya vai |
samaṃ sūtracatuṣkaṃ ca caturaśrāśrasiddhaye || 11.139
tadvibhajyāṣṭadaśabhiś caturdikṣu padaiḥ samaiḥ |
kṣipet sūtragaṇaṃ tatra ghaṭikāreṇur añjitam || 11.140
madhye padmāvanīṃ kuryād bhāgapaṅktitraye kramāt |
tadbahiḥ padapaṅktyā tu pīṭham aṣṭadiganvitam || 11.141
tasya bhāgacatuṣkāḍhyaṃ dikcatuṣkaṃ prakalpya ca |
vidikcatuṣkaṃ tripadaṃ paṅktyā pīṭhapradakṣiṇam || 11.142
pradakṣiṇakṣiter bāhyāc catuṣkaṃ dikcatuṣṭayāt |
caturṇāṃ tu caturṇāṃ tu bāhyād bāhyaṃ dvayaṃ dvayam || 11.143
śodhayitvā tu tadbāhyāc catuṣkaṃ dvārasiddhaye |
catuṣṭayaṃ krameṇaiva bhūyo dikṣu padaṃ padam || 11.144
sabāhyābhyantaragataṃ śodhanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
punaḥ sarvapadābhyāṃ tu ṣatkaṃ ṣaṭkaṃ tu cāntarāt || 11.145
sammārjya <saṃmārjya> pūrṇaśobhārthaṃ tatra raktotpalāṣṭakam |
yathā dikṣu sthitaṃ kuryāt pūjanāya divaukasām || 11.146
bāhyasthapadapadmāt tu trīṇi trīṇi tu lopayet |
trayāṇām antarasthaṃ yatpadam ekātmatāṃ nayet || 11.147
upaśobhaṃ tu taṃ viddhi kuryān nīlābjabhūṣitam |
pañcakaṃ pañcakaṃ koṇādvīdhau nītvā layaṃ purā || 11.148
śeṣaiḥ koṇaṃ tu nirvartya sāntaraṃ ca tato bahiḥ |
dadyāt sūtratrayaṃ caiva madhye 'tha kamalaṃ likhet || 11.149
sacakram aṣṭapatraṃ tu tasya lakṣaṇam ucyate |
ṣaṭtriṃśatkoṣṭhamadhye tu śaṅkuṃ saṃsthāpya yatnataḥ || 11.150
sūtrabhramais tu susamaṃ kuryān maṇḍalapañcakam |
teṣv ādyaṃ maṇḍalaṃ madhye bhaved vai karṇikāspadam || 11.151
dvitīyaṃ maṇḍalaṃ tredhā bhaṅktvā sūtrabhramaiḥ punaḥ |
teṣv ādyaṃ kesarasthānaṃ dvitīyaṃ dalamaṃḍalam <dalamaṇḍalam> || 11.152
tṛtīyaṃ tat punas tredhā bhaktaṃ nābhitrayaṃ caret |
nābher bahirmaṇḍalayoḥ dvādaśārāṇi kalpayet || 11.153
tadbahirmaṇḍalaṃ tv ekaṃ nebhisthānaṃ prakalpayet |
kṛtvaivaṃ varṇakaiḥ pūtaiḥ pūraṇīyaṃ mahojvalaiḥ || 11.154
uccāgravitatāṃ pītāṃ sabījāṃ viddhi karṇikām |
rekhānvitāni patrāṇi sarvāṇi susitāni ca || 11.155
kesaratritayaṃ kuryāt patre patre 'ruṇaprabham |
dalāntarālam asitaṃ śvetaṃ pītaṃ ca pāṭalam || 11.156
nābhitrayaṃ krameṇa syād raktavarṇāny arāṇi tu |
nemes tu pūrvabhāgaḥ syāt kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ sito 'ntimaḥ || 11.157
sitāni pīṭhakoṇāni raktaṃ taddikcatuṣṭayam |
rājopalaprabhā vīdhī patramālyādyalaṃkṛtā <patramālyādyalaṅkṛtā> || 11.158
paścimāṃśaṃ vinā sarvadvārāṇy ambujapatravat |
kṛṣṇāni sarvaśobhāni dvāroddeśasthitāni ca || 11.159
tadardhākṛtitulyāni upaśobhāni garbhavat |
koṇāni kesarābhāni sitaśaṅkhānvitāni ca || 11.160
śoṇahemādivarṇaṃ ca kramād rekhāgaṇaṃ bahiḥ |
kṛtvaivam anusandhāya <anusaṃdhāya> sarvātmatvena dehavat || 11.161
rajāṃsi viddhi bhūtāni sitapītādikāni ca |
tanmātrāny upaśobhāni śobhāni karaṇāni ca || 11.162
evaṃ sarvāṇi koṇāni sadvārāṇīṃdriyāṇi <sadvārāṇīndriyāṇi> ca |
bahirāvaraṇaṃ yad vai satvādyaṃ tritayaṃ hi yat || 11.163
manaḥ suvitatā vīdhī garvaḥ pīṭham udāhṛtam |
dhīḥ padmaṃ tadadhiṣṭhātā bījātmā cinmayaḥ pumān || 11.164
amūrta īśvaraś cātra tiṣṭhaty ānandalakṣaṇaḥ |
yasya saṃdarśanād eva śaśvadbhāvaḥ prasīdati || 11.165
sasaṅgānām <sasaṃgānām> asaṅgānāṃ <asaṃgānāṃ> vapuṣpāte kṛte sati |
prāyaśo muktibhājāṃ ca iha janmaikaśeṣiṇām || 11.166
deva āste 'jñatāṃ hitvā bahir antaś ca karmiṇām |
anyathā dṛṣṭamātrād vai katham āhlādam eti vai || 11.167
antaḥ saṃvedanasamam astitvapratipādakam |
yad yat svalakṣaṇaṃ tatvaṃ tat tat sarvatra siddhigam || 11.168
vastutvena gṛhītvaivaṃ maṇḍalaṃ pūrvanirmitam |
nāmnābjanābhabhuvanaṃ sarvaduḥkhakṣayaṃkaram || 11.169
tatas tasmin vibhoḥ prāgvadāsanaṃ parikalpya ca |
tanmadhye devadeveśaṃ samāvāhya yathāvidhi || 11.170
sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> sannirodhādi <saṃnirodhādi> bhogayāgāvasānakam |
sarvaṃ ca pūrvavat kṛtvā āsanādyaiḥ puroditaiḥ || 11.171
pūjayej japayajñāntaṃ deveśaṃ maṇḍale guruḥ |
maṇḍale kumbhayāge ca prokṣaṇe snānam ācaret || 11.172
tatas tu mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ gatvā vai bimbasannidhim <bimbasaṃnidhim> |
tatra sampūjayed <saṃpūjayed> devaṃ mahatā vibhavena tu || 11.173
tataḥ kuṇḍasamīpaṃ tu gatvā deśikasattamaḥ |
kuṇḍaṃ tatrānalaṃ cāpi saṃskṛtya vidhivat tataḥ || 11.174
agnau santarpaṇaṃ <saṃtarpaṇaṃ> kuryād yathoktavidhinā vibhoḥ |
samidbhiś caiva nityābhiḥ kāmyābhiś ca yathākramam || 11.175
pūrṇāhutyādikaṃ sarvaṃ prāgvad eva samācaret |
notsṛjet paridhīn darbhān devān nodvāsayet tataḥ || 11.176
pratyahaṃ dhārayed agniṃ yāvattīrthadināntimam |
ahorātraṃ pratidinaṃ juhuyād uktavartmanā || 11.177
tato bimbāntikaṃ gatvā kṛtvā homanivedanam |
sarvaṃ tu sampradānāntaṃ <saṃpradānāntaṃ> kramāt kṛtvā tataḥ param || 11.178
vibhave sati vai kuryād bhūyaḥ sampūjanaṃ <saṃpūjanaṃ> vibhoḥ |
tato dvārabaliṃ dadyāc caturdikṣu yathāvidhi || 11.179
tataś ca yāgagehāt tu devam antaḥ praveśayet |
tatra sampūjya <saṃpūjya> deveśaṃ rātriśeṣaṃ samāpayet || 11.180
aṅkurāropaṇadināt puṣpayāgadināntimam |
vrataṃ kuryād deśikendro dinadvādaśake kramāt || 11.181
snānārcanādikaṃ kṛtvā pītvā taccaraṇodakam |
kuśodakasamāyuktaṃ japed aṣṭākṣaraṃ manum || 11.182
naivedyaprāśanaṃ pūrvaṃ kuryān naktāśanaṃ dvijāḥ |
japet dvādaśānāmāni kramād vācyam anusmaran || 11.183
dvitīye divase prāpte deśiko mantravittamaḥ |
snānādinityaniyamān nirvartya saha mūrtipaiḥ || 11.184
nityārcanaṃ vibhoḥ kṛtvā viśeṣeṇa yajet tataḥ |
praviśya yāgasadanaṃ pūrvoktavidhinā guruḥ || 11.185
kṛtvā dvārārcanāntaṃ tu gatvā kumbhasya sannidhim <saṃnidhim> |
kumbhe ca maṇḍale caiva yajed devaṃ yathāvidhi || 11.186
kumbhe ca maṇḍale caiva pūrvaṃ yatrārcanaṃ kṛtam |
anyedyur api tatraiva pūjanaṃ tu samācaret || 11.187
na paryuṣitadoṣo 'sti tayor yasmān munīśvarāḥ |
sthale bhasmanibhe pūrve pūjanaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 11.188
yojayitvā tu kumbhasthe vartayen maṇḍalaṃ tataḥ |
sitādyaiḥ pāvanai rāgais tataḥ kumbhe samarcayet || 11.189
yathāvad devadeveśaṃ pūjayen maṇḍale tataḥ |
evaṃ kumbhe 'pi doṣāṇāṃ sambhave <saṃbhave>
munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 11.190
kumbhaṃ saṃśodhya bhūyo 'pi sampūjya <saṃpūjya> vimalodakaiḥ |
tatra sthitaṃ devadevaṃ maṇḍale yojayed guruḥ || 11.191
pūrvavat samalaṃkṛtya <samalaṅkṛtya> tatra sampūjayed <saṃpūjayed> vibhum |
atha devagṛhaṃ gatvā puṇḍarīkākṣam acyutam || 11.192
aṣṭāṅgena namaskṛtya pūjayet puruṣottamam |
arghyālabhanamālyaiś ca dhūpair aṅgādisaṃyutam || 11.193
tat sarvaṃ yogyam āhartuṃ pūjāntaraniveditam |
puṣpapūrvaṃ samādāya śirasā cābhinaṃdya <cābhinandya> tat || 11.194
samarpya viṣvaksenasya hy astramantrābhimantritaiḥ |
sapīṭhaṃ bhagavadbimbaṃ nirmilīkṛtya vāribhiḥ || 11.195
prāsādaṃ śodhayitvā tu devadevaṃ samarcayet |
snānais tu kṣīrapūrvair vā dhātrīphalapurassaraiḥ || 11.196
yathākramopadiṣṭais tu cānyabhogair akṛtrimaiḥ |
pradakṣiṇapraṇāmāntaṃ viśeṣotsavam ācaret || 11.197
tato yāgagṛhaṃ gatvā vahnau santarpayed <saṃtarpayed> vibhum |
pūrvoktavidhinā paścātsaṃskṛtenātha vahninā || 11.198
caruṃ saṃśrāpayec culyāṃ hṛdā kṣīrājyataṇḍulaiḥ |
samuddhṛtyājyapūtaṃ tu vinivedya yathākramam || 11.199
kalaśasthalabimbānām ekāṃśaṃ juhuyāt tataḥ |
yad vā yāgasamāraṃbhāt pūrvaṃ saṃsādhya vai carum || 11.200
kalaśasthalabimbānāṃ kramāt kṛtvā tu pūjanam |
sarvaṃ dvijapradānāntaṃ vahnau santarpayet <saṃtarpayet> tataḥ || 11.201
datvā pūrṇāhutiṃ paścāt kuryād dvārabaliṃ tathā |
gatvā bimbasamīpaṃ tu kṛtvā homanivedanam || 11.202
balibimbam athādāya yānam āropya vai tataḥ |
alaṃkuryād viśeṣeṇa vastrābharaṇamālyakaiḥ || 11.203
vaheyur brāhmaṇā yānaṃ dhyāyanto vihageśvaram |
prathamāvṛtim ārabhya rathyāvaraṇapaścimam || 11.204
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva balidānapurassaram |
bhrāmayitvā tu deveśaṃ tato grāme 'pi pūrvavat || 11.205
grāmasyaindrādiyogena diśāsu vidiśāsu ca |
madhye ca kumudādīnāṃ sagaṇānāṃ krameṇa tu || 11.206
pīṭhikāsu baliṃ dadyān nirmitāsu puraiva tu |
bhūtale gomayādyena lepite vā yathāruci || 11.207
daśānāṃ kumudādīnāṃ gaṇeśānāṃ dvijottamāḥ |
praṇavādyair namo 'ntais tu svaiḥ svair nāmabhir eva ca || 11.208
arghyaṃ gandhaṃ tathā mālyaṃ dhūpaṃ gandhāmbupūrvakam |
baliṃ bhūyo jalaṃ capi <cāpi?> tāmbūlaṃ kramaśo dadet || 11.209
nṛttagītādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat parikalpayet |
evaṃ grāmabaliṃ kṛtvā balibimbāgrato guruḥ || 11.210
anuktānāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ gramamadhye munīśvarāḥ |
namaḥ pāriṣadebhyaś cety uktvā śiṣṭabaliṃ kṣipet || 11.211
tatas tu balibimbaṃ tu praveśyāntar munīśvarāḥ |
abhyarcya śramaśāntyarthaṃ svasthāne sanniveśayet <saṃniveśayet> || 11.212
evaṃ kāladvaye kuryād baliṃ tīrthadināntimam |
ārambhadivase rātrau samāptidivase 'hani || 11.213
balim ekaṃ kṣipen madhyadivaseṣu balidvayam |
evaṃ divā rajanyāṃ ca nityapūjāpurassaram || 11.214
viśeṣayajanaṃ kuryād balyantaṃ deśikottamaḥ |
vāhanārohaṇaṃ rātrau divase vā yathāruci || 11.215
baliyante deśikaḥ kuryāt tadvidhānam ihocyate |
yātrābimbagataṃ devaṃ devībhyāṃ saha vā vinā || 11.216
alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa vicitravasanais tathā |
vividhair bhūṣaṇaiś cāpi mālyair nānāvidhais tathā || 11.217
alaṅkṛtaṃ <alaṃkṛtaṃ> viśeṣeṇa yānaṃ hemādinirmitam |
samānīya tu saṃprokṣya dhyātvā garuḍarūpiṇam || 11.218
tanmantreṇa samabhyarcya yānam arghyādibhis tataḥ |
kṛtvā puṇyāhaghoṣaṃ ca śrutighoṣasamanvitam || 11.219
śaṅkhatūryādisaṃyuktaṃ <śaṃkhatūryādisaṃyuktaṃ> prādakṣiṇyakrameṇa tu |
yāne tatra samāropya yātrāmūrtigataṃ vibhum || 11.220
dṛḍhīkṛtya viśeṣeṇa hy alaṅkuryāj <alaṃkuryāj> jagatprabhum |
arghyādyair arcayitvā tu tāmbūlādīn nivedayet || 11.221
vaheyur brāhmaṇā yānaṃ dhyāyanto vihageśvaram |
atha vā vaiṣṇavāḥ śūdrā vaheyur bhaktisaṃyutāḥ || 11.222
grāme vā nagare vāpi paṭṭaṇe vā munīśvarāḥ |
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva paribhramaṇam ācaret || 11.223
brāhmaṇair dhriyamāṇaiś ca kañcukoṣṇīṣadhāribhiḥ |
mauktikair ātapatraiś ca māyūraiś ca suśobhanaiḥ || 11.224
hemadaṇḍasamāyuktais tālavṛntais tathāvidhaiḥ |
paṭṭajair vividhaiś cāpi cāmaraiś ca sitāsitaiḥ || 11.225
ketudaṇḍaiś ca vividhair vaijayantīvibhūṣitaiḥ |
kevalai ratnadaṇḍaiś ca tathānyair māṅgalīyakaiḥ || 11.226
vandivṛndaiś ca vividhair vīṇāveṇusvanais tathā |
suvarṇaśṛṅgaghoṣaiś ca tathānyair maṅgalasvanaiḥ || 11.227
gaṇikādevadāsībhis tathā nāgarakair janaiḥ |
viprair vetralatāhastaiḥ kañcukoṣṇīṣabhūṣitaiḥ || 11.228
sumṛṣṭadhūpapātrāṇi vahadbhiḥ pārśvatas tathā |
anekaśatasaṅkhyātair <anekaśatasaṃkhyātair> dīpair atisamujjvalaiḥ || 11.229
pāduke ratnakhacite pātre hemādinirmite |
vinyasya devapurato vahadbhiḥ paricārakaiḥ || 11.230
ṛgyajussāmavedāṃs tu paṭhadbhiḥ pṛṣṭhataḥ sthitaiḥ |
brāhmaṇair dakṣiṇe bhāge tathā caikāyanīṃ śrutim || 11.231
saṃhitāḥ sātvatādyāś ca paṭhadbhir bhaktisaṃyutaiḥ |
vāsudevasya māhātmyaṃ kathayadbhiś ca santatam <saṃtatam> || 11.232
vāsudevārcanaparaiḥ sātvikaiḥ pāñcarātrikaiḥ |
vāme tu setihāsāni purāṇāni stutīr api || 11.233
nānābhāṣāviracitāḥ viṣṇupāramyasūcakāḥ |
paṭhadbhir brāhmaṇer bhaktais trayyantārthavicāribhiḥ || 11.234
śābdikais tārkikaiś caiva tathā mauhūrtikādibhiḥ |
tattacchāstraprameyaṃ tu bruvāṇair vinayānvitaiḥ || 11.235
gāyadbhir agre devasya drāmiḍīṃ śrutim uttamām |
tathā bhāṣāprabandhāṃś ca gadyapadyātmakāni ca || 11.236
tathā ca vaiṣṇavībhaktyā bruvāṇair vaiṣṇavottamaiḥ |
brāhmaṇaiḥ kṣatriyair vaiśyaiḥ śūdraiś ca bhagavatparaiḥ || 11.237
bhagavaddarśanāsaktacittaiḥ praṇatiśālibhiḥ |
senayā sarvato dikṣu caturaṅgabalāḍhyayā || 11.238
rājocitaiḥ parikarair anyaiś ca vividhaiḥ saha |
devaṃ grāmādivīdhīṣu bhrāmayet tu pradakṣiṇam || 11.239
yātrāyāṃ vartamānayāṃ devadevāya bhaktitaḥ |
mukhavāsaṃ satāmbūlaṃ bahuśo vinivedayet || 11.240
candanaṃ śramaśāntyarthaṃ karpūrādyaiḥ subhāvitam |
pradadyād devadevāya mālyāni vividhāny api || 11.241
śītalaṃ tarpaṇajalaṃ nālikerajalānvitam |
śramaśāntinimittāni anyāny api nivedayet || 11.242
digaṣṭake ca grāmādes tanmadhye ca viśeṣataḥ |
gītakair vividhair nṛttais tantrīvādyasamanvitaiḥ || 11.243
śaṅkhabherīmṛdaṅgādyair <śaṃkhabherīmṛdaṅgādyair> deveśaṃ paritoṣayet |
evaṃ devaṃ paribhrāmya nayed bāhye tu maṇṭape || 11.244
samāropya ca sauvarṇe viṣṭare jagatāṃpatim |
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathācāmaṃ gandhamālye ca dīpakam || 11.245
dhūpaṃ nīrājanaṃ caiva samarpya ca yathāvidhi |
athārhaṇajalaṃ svaccham apūpān pṛthukān api || 11.246
tarpaṇaṃ nālikerottharasamācamanaṃ tathā |
mukhavāsasamopetaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca krameṇa tu || 11.247
nivedya devadevāya upahārāṃs tu darśayet |
pūjākāle tu sarvatra bhūṣāmālyāmbarārpaṇam || 11.248
visarjanaṃ ca teṣāṃ vai tathā cābhyavahārikaiḥ |
bhogair abhyarcanaṃ caiva itarālakṣyam ācaret || 11.249
tatsiddhyai devam abhitaḥ stared yavanikāpaṭam |
tatas tu maṇṭapāt tasmān mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 11.250
mahāpīṭhasya purato devam arghyādibhir yajet |
apūpānupahārāṃś ca tāmbūlādīn nivedayet || 11.251
devāgre caturo vedān pāṭhayet tadanantaram |
pāṭhayed drādiḍīṃ cāpi stutiṃ vaiṣṇavasattamaiḥ || 11.252
śaṅkhamardalanādaiś <śaṃkhamardalanādaiś> ca nṛttagītādibhiḥ saha |
bhrāmayed devadeveśaṃ prādakṣiṇyena mandiram || 11.253
tataḥ praveśayen mandaṃ mandaṃ sopānamārgataḥ |
tadānīṃ devadevāya tāmbūlādīn samarpayet || 11.254
cāmarais tālavṛntādyair vījayec chramaśāntaye |
stotraiḥ stuvīta deveśaṃ saṃskṛtair drāmiḍais tu vā || 11.255
vīṇāveṇumṛdaṅgaiś ca maṅgalais tālanisvanaiḥ |
drāmiḍastutigītāni kurvadbhir vaiṣṇavottamaiḥ || 11.256
tathā maṅgalagānābhir gaṇikābhiḥ pade pade |
uccair udghuṣyamāṇaiś ca vandistotraravaiḥ saha || 11.257
nānāvidhopacāraiś ca devam antaḥ praveśayet |
prāsādadvāradeśe tu devadevasya bhaktitaḥ || 11.258
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathācāmaṃ gandhaṃ mālyaṃ ca dhūpakam |
nivedya devadeveśaṃ svasthāne sanniveśayet <saṃniveśayet> || 11.259
vāhanārohaṇaṃ tv evaṃ kuryād devasya nityaśaḥ |
prathame śibikāyānaṃ dvitīye śeṣapīṭhikā || 11.260
tṛtīye candrabimbaṃ ca divā cet sūryamaṇḍalam |
caturthe divase prāpte puṣpamaṇṭapavāhanam || 11.261
pañcame divase prāpte garuḍārohaṇaṃ bhavet |
ṣaṣṭhe dine tu samprāpte <saṃprāpte> tanniśāyāṃ divāpi vā || 11.262
balyantam arcanaṃ kṛtvā devam āsthānamaṇṭape |
bhadrāsane samāropya puratas tasya śodhite || 11.263
bhūtale dhānyapīṭhe tu cūrṇakumbhaṃ ca vinyaset |
prokṣya puṇyāhatoyena śriyaṃ tatra samarcayet || 11.264
sadarbhavastreṇācchādya cakraṃ tatra niyojayet |
rakṣārthaṃ ca tato devam arghyādyair havirantimaiḥ || 11.265
samabhyarcya ca hāridraṃ cūrṇam ādāya deśikaḥ |
śrīsūktam uccaran devaṃ cūrṇaiḥ samabhiṣecayet || 11.266
maṇṭapasyaikadeśe tu śālitaṇḍulanirmite |
viṣṭare tu jaladroṇīṃ sauvarṇīṃ vātha rājatīm || 11.267
tāmrajāṃ vā yathālābhaṃ catustrirdvikarāyatām |
tadardhavistṛtām ūrdhve mūle tatpādavistṛtām || 11.268
vṛttāyatām adhobhāge praṇālena samanvitām |
unmattakusumākārasadṛśīm atha vā dvijāḥ || 11.269
bimbamānānurūpāṃ tāṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutām |
niveśya tāṃ samāpūrya gālitena jalena tu || 11.270
kuṅkumakṣodayuktena candanenānvitena ca |
karpūracūrṇayuktena kusumair vāsitena ca || 11.271
tatpārśve devam ānīya cārghyādyaiḥ paripūjya ca |
bherīpaṭahavāditraśaṅkhaghoṣasamanvitam
<bherīpaṭahavāditraśaṃkhaghoṣasamanvitam> || 11.272
stutimaṅgalaghoṣais tu śrutighoṣasamanvitam |
sūktena pauruṣeṇaiva vibhoḥ kṛtvāvagāhanam || 11.273
yāne devaṃ samāropya saha snānārdravāsasā |
kuṅkumena samālipya āpādān mastakāvidhiḥ || 11.274
bhrāmayet prāṅkaṇaṃ vīdhīṃ prītaye varuṇasya ca |
janānām api sarveṣāṃ pavitrīkaraṇāya ca || 11.275
tatkāle devadeveśaṃ bhaktyā paśyanti ye dvijāḥ |
te sarve dhūtapāpmāno bhavanti nirupadravāḥ || 11.276
tatas tu maṇṭape devaṃ viṣṭare viniveśya ca |
snānavastrādisakalam ācāryaḥ svayam āharet ||| 11.277
tato devam alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> kuryāt samyaggajotsavam |
saptame divase prāpte kṛtvā balyantam arcanam || 11.278
pratiṣṭhitaṃ rathaṃ pūrvaṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam |
muktāprapāvitānaiś ca sauvarṇair mañjarīgaṇaiḥ || 11.279
muktādāmasamopetair vicitraiḥ puṣpadāmabhiḥ |
haimena ca vitānena prabhayā ca viśeṣataḥ || 11.280
madhyato bhadrapīṭhena sauvarṇena tathaiva ca |
dhvajaiś ca vividhai ramyaiḥ patākābhiś ca sarvataḥ || 11.281
bhūṣayed rathayānaṃ tu tathā garuḍaketunā |
sauvarṇakumbhaśikharaiḥ ratham evam alaṃkṛtam <alaṅkṛtam> || 11.282
samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> pañcagavyena tathā puṇyāhavāribhiḥ |
rathasya pādād ūrdhvāntaṃ sthitān devān samarcayet || 11.283
prathamaṃ pādacakreṣu vahnyādīśānapaścimam |
satyaṃ suparṇaṃ garuḍaṃ tārkṣyaṃ caiva yathākramam || 11.284
tattanmantraiḥ samabhyarcya anyatra vihageśvaram |
cakradaṇḍadvaye māyāṃ cakre ca śaśibhāskarau || 11.285
anantaṃ ca tadādhāre bhārākhye daṇḍakadvaye |
viśvarūpadharo viṣṇuḥ śaktīśaś cāpy ubhāv imau || 11.286
paritaḥ paṅktikājāle keśavādīn anukramāt |
gātreṣu gātrapādeṣu dharmādyaṃ tv aṣṭakaṃ yajet || 11.287
gātrād gātrāntare nyasyec cakrādyāyudhasañcayam <cakrādyāyudhasaṃcayam> |
rathaprāsādamūrdhānte sthūpikāyāṃ sadāharim || 11.288
kūṭaśālāsu pūrvoktavāsudevādikān yajet |
ekaśṛṅgādikān nyastvā parito vedikātale || 11.289
kūrmādīn dvādaśa tathā grīvāyāṃ parito yajet |
śikhare tu yajet paścādanantādīn anukramāt || 11.290
sarveṣām ūrdhvato viprāḥ padmanābhaṃ dhruvaṃ yajet |
arghyasraggandhadhūpaiś ca krameṇaitān prapūjya ca || 11.291
caṇḍādyaṃ ca subhadrāntaṃ dvau dvau dikṣu samarcayet |
kumudādigaṇeśānān lokapālān yathākramam || 11.292
tattatsthāneṣu sampūjya <saṃpūjya> rathaṃ garuḍarūpiṇam |
dhyātvābhyarcya tato 'rghyādyair havirantaṃ tato guruḥ || 11.293
caṇḍādīnāṃ baliṃ datvā rathasya paritas tataḥ |
devagehaṃ samāsādya mūrtipaiḥ saha deśikaḥ || 11.294
yānam āropya deveśaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam |
āsthānamaṇṭapaṃ nītvā samāropya ca viṣṭare || 11.295
arghyādyair devam abhyarcya vividhair upacārakaiḥ |
yātrānirvighnasiddhyarthaṃ bījāni vividhāni ca || 11.296
phalāni ca hiraṇyāni tathā dadhyodanaṃ dvijāḥ |
devasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> datvā viprebhyo deśikottamaḥ || 11.297
sumuhūrte sulagne ca daivajñaparicodite |
rathasyārohaṇārthaṃ tu devam abhyarcya yatnataḥ || 11.298
pāduke vinivedyātha yānam āropya pūrvavat |
vedaghoṣais tathā ghaṇṭāghoṣair maṅgalanisvanaiḥ || 11.299
tathā jayajayārāvaiḥ kāhalaiḥ śaṅkhanisvanaiḥ <śaṃkhanisvanaiḥ> |
bherīpaṭahavāditranṛtagītādabhiḥ saha || 11.300
chatracāmarapūrvaiś ca yātropakaraṇaiḥ saha |
prathamāvṛtim ārabhya rathyāvaraṇapaścimam || 11.301
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva paribhrāmya ca pūrvavat |
rathaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛya <pradakṣiṇīkṛtya> sumuhūrte sulagnake || 11.302
ratham āropayed devaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥ suprayatnataḥ |
rathasyordhvatale devaṃ viṣṭare viniveśya ca || 11.303
yatrārthaṃ devadevāya arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathaiva ca |
ācāmaṃ gandhamālye ca dīpaṃ dhūpaṃ tathaiva ca || 11.304
arhaṇaṃ madhuparkaṃ ca naivedyaṃ vividhaṃ tathā |
pṛthukādyaṃ pānakaṃ ca tarpaṇācamane tathā || 11.305
tāmbūlaṃ vinivedyātha mukhavāsasam anvitam |
tatkāle putrakāmānāṃ strīṇāṃ cārogyam icchatām || 11.306
naivedyaṃ kabalīkṛtya dadyād devasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> |
ācāryaḥ sādhakāś cāpi rathasyordhvatale sthitāḥ || 11.307
tasyādhastāt sthale sthāpyāḥ paścime chatradhārakāḥ |
tatra tatpārśvataḥ sthāpyau māyūracchatradhāriṇau || 11.308
dakṣiṇottarapārśvasthāv agre cāmaradhāriṇau |
sārathis tatsthale sthāpyas tv agrato madhyadeśataḥ || 11.309
tatas tadrathayānaṃ tu bhrāmayet sarvavīdhiṣu |
prādakṣiṇyena vai grāme nagare pattane 'pi vā || 11.310
tato rathāt tu deveśam avaropya suyatnataḥ |
yānāntare samāropya svasthāne sanniveśayet <saṃniveśayet> || 11.311
aṣṭame 'hni tu tadrātrau ḍolārohaṇam ūrvakam |
aśvārohaṃ tataḥ kuryāt mṛgayāṃ cāpi kārayet || 11.312
bhaktasantrāṇalīlāṃ <bhaktasaṃtrāṇalīlāṃ> ca brāhme nagaraśodhanam |
praṇayaḥ kalahaś ca syād devyor devena vai miśraḥ (?/mithaḥ?) || 11.313
sandhānam <saṃdhānam> ubhayoḥ kuryāt kṣamyatām iti coccaret |
navame 'vabhṛdhaṃ kuryāt tadrātrau śibikotsavam || 11.314
vāhanārohaṇasyaivaṃ kramaḥ samyaṅnirūpitaḥ |
apūrvābharaṇair mālyair apūrvaiś cāmbarais tathā || 11.315
apūrvodyānayānādyair yathā kautūhalaṃ bhavet |
tathā viśeṣaḥ kartavyo yāvattīrthadināvadhi || 11.316
athāvabhṛdhakāryasya vidhānaṃ tūcyate dvijāḥ |
ācāryo mūrtipais sārdhaṃ praviśya bhagavadgṛham || 11.317
devaṃ prapūjya vidhivadbalyantaṃ sarvam ācaret |
ācāryo yajamānena sādhakaiś ca samanvitaḥ || 11.318
prāsādaṃ sampraviśyātha <saṃpraviśyātha> mūlabimbasya pādayoḥ |
praṇamya daṇḍavat tatra tīrthabimbaṃ samānayet || 11.319
tadabhāve muniśreṣṭhā nityasnapanakautukam |
abhāve 'py asya bimbasya balibimbaṃ tu vā dvijāḥ || 11.320
mūlabimbasya purataḥ saṃsthāpyāvāhya pūjya ca |
tīrthabimbaṃ samuddhṛtya vādyair ghaṇṭāravaiḥ saha || 11.321
dhvajapīṭhasamīpaṃ tu samānīya yathāvidhi |
śodhite 'laṃkṛte <'laṅkṛte> tatra maṇṭape snānaviṣṭare || 11.322
niveśya snānabimbaṃ tu sūlabimbasya sammukham <saṃmukham> |
tadagratas tu saṃsthāpya snapanaṃ tv adhamādhamam || 11.323
purataḥ sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvolūkhalaṃ tatra vinyaset |
musalāni caturdikṣu vinyasyolūkhalopari || 11.324
musalolūkhale gṛhya dūrvākāṇḍāni bandhayet |
navavastreṇa saṃveṣṭya tatra cūrṇaṃ vinikṣipet || 11.325
sauvarṇaṃ rajanīcūrṇasaṃmiśraṃ gandhasaṃyutam |
caturbhir vaiṣṇavair viprair vaiṣṇavībhis tu vā dvijāḥ || 11.326
kārayed avaghātaṃ tu gīyamāne tu maṅgale |
sthāpitasnapanād viprāḥ prāgbhāge vā taduttare || 11.327
taṇḍulaiḥ pīṭhikāṃ kṛtvā tatra kumbhaṃ niveśya ca |
sasūtraṃ tatra nikṣipya cūrṇaṃ vastreṇa veṣṭya ca || 11.328
atha vā pañca nava vā kalaśān cūrṇapūritān |
arcayitvā tu mūlena tataḥ saṃsnāpayed vibhum || 11.329
tailenābhyajya deveśaṃ samudvartya ca pūrvavat |
tataḥ saṃsnāpya vidhinā pādyādyaiḥ kalaśaiḥ kramāt || 11.330
abhyarcya devam arghyādyair hemacūrṇādipūritam |
ādāya kumbhaṃ taiś cūrṇaiḥ śrīsūktenābhiṣecayet || 11.331
sahasradhārayā snānaṃ kṛtvā saṃśudhya vāriṇā |
adharottaravastrābhyāṃ navābhyāṃ paridhāpya ca || 11.332
alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
mudgānnapāyasānnādīn vinivedya tataḥ param || 11.333
śibikādau samāropya tīrthabimbam alaṃkṛtam <alaṅkṛtam> |
tathaiva cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam || 11.334
śibikādau samāropya hy alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ |
tīrthabimbaṃ puraskṛtya yātrāmūrtigataṃ vibhum || 11.335
chatracāmaraśaṅkhādisarvasādhanasaṃyutam 
<chatracāmaraśaṃkhādisarvasādhanasaṃyutam> |
pradakṣiṇaṃ paribhrāmya sarveṣv āvaraṇeṣv api || 11.336
tīrthapārśvaṃ samāsādya tattīre maṇṭape 'tha vā |
prapāyāṃ <<prāpayan>> devadeveśaṃ viniveśya ca viṣṭare || 11.337
yātrābimbasya purataḥ snānapīṭhaṃ nidhāya vai |
niveśya tatra tīrthārcāṃ pañcaviṃśatibhir ghaṭaiḥ || 11.338
yad vā dvādaśabhiḥ kumbhair navabhir vābhiṣecayet |
cūrṇasnānaṃ tu vidhivat kṛtvā devasya deśikaḥ || 11.339
arghyādyaiḥ pūjayitvātha bimbaṃ tu parimārjya ca |
bhuktāvaśiṣṭaṃ yaccūraṇaṃ bhaktānāṃ mūrdhni dāpayet || 11.340
gaṅgāsnānaphalaṃ cūrṇaṃ sarvapāpapraṇāśanam |
krīḍayā vāpi taccūrṇaṃ śirasā dhārayet tu yaḥ || 11.341
tasya dehagataṃ pāpaṃ tatkṣaṇād eva naśyati |
kṛtvā puṇyāhaghoṣaṃ tu tīrthaṃ samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> deśikaḥ || 11.342
tattīrthe sarvatīrthāni samāvāhya samarcayet |
tataś ca deśikendras tu yātrāmūrtigataṃ vibhum || 11.343
samāsādya tu tatpāde praṇamya tadanujñayā |
muhūrte śobhane prāpte ravau madhyandinaṃ gate || 11.344
tīrthabimbaṃ samādāya ghaṇṭāśaṅkharavaiḥ saha |
vāmahastatale kuryāt kṣmāmaṇḍalagataḥ svayam <<kṣmāmaṇḍalagataḥ svayam : 
śīrṣasyordhvatale 'tha vā>> || 11.345
vidhṛyān madhyabhāge tu pāṇinā dakṣiṇena tu |
tīrthatīraṃ samāsādya deśikendraḥ samāhitaḥ || 11.346
āśīrvādaṃ purā kṛtvā rājarāṣṭrādikasya ca |
jalamadhyaṃ samāsādya nābhidaghne jale sthitaḥ || 11.347
japan vai mūlamantraṃ tu bimbena saha deśikaḥ |
nimajjed bhaktisaṃyukto dhyāyamānocyutaṃ hṛdi || 11.348
nimajjeyus tadā sarve bhaktā bhāgavatā api |
devena saha tatkāle nimajjanti ca ye janāḥ || 11.349
vimuktakalmaṣās te vai prāpnuyuḥ paramāṃ gatim |
svayaṃ vyaktādike sthāne madhyāhne vāparāhṇake || 11.350
rajanyāṃ pūrvabhāge vā kuryād avabhṛdhaṃ vibhoḥ |
muhūrtātikramaprāptadoṣas tatra na vidyate || 11.351
tatas tīre samāropya tīrthabimbaṃ tu viṣṭare |
śāṭakadvitayaṃ datvā snānavastre visṛjya ca || 11.352
deśikaḥ svayam ādāya te vastre mūrdhni dhārayet |
arghyādhyaiś ca samabhyarcya alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ || 11.353
mahāhavirnivedyātha brāhmaṇān bhojayet tataḥ |
pratyahaṃ bhojayed viprān sahasraṃ śatam eva vā || 11.354
yāne devaṃ samāropya tato gehaṃ praveśayet |
tīrthabimbagatāṃ śaktiṃ mūlabere visarjayet || 11.355
sāyaṅkāle tu samprāpte <saṃprāpte> devadevaṃ jagatpatim |
vastrābharaṇamālyādyair alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ || 11.356
śibikādau samāropya devībhyāṃ saha deśikaḥ |
śaṅkhādimaṅgalaravaiḥ <śaṃkhādimaṅgalaravaiḥ> chatracāmaraketubhiḥ || 
11.357
rājacihnaiḥ parikarair gaṇikādevadāsibhiḥ |
sarvaiḥ parijanaiḥ sārdhaṃ kṛtvā grāṃaṃ pradakṣiṇam || 11.358
mandirāntaḥ praveśyātha balipīṭhasamīpataḥ |
madhuparkaṃ nivedyātha apūpādīn nivedayet || 11.359
śītalaṃ tarpaṇajalaṃ tāmbūlādīn nivedayet |
devāgāraṃ paribhrāmya mahāmaṇṭapam āśrayet || 11.360
nivedya viṣṭare tatra devam arghyādibhir yajet |
kṛtvā nīrājanāntaṃ tu deśikendraḥ samāhitaḥ || 11.361
sthānasya rājño rāṣṭrasya yajamānasya mantriṇām |
prajānāṃ parivārāṇāṃ vaiṣṇavānāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 11.362
āśīrvādaṃ tataḥ kuryād vīkṣamāṇo vibhor mukham |
om ity evaṃ pratibrūyuḥ sarve devasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> || 11.363
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ yāgaśālāṃ praveśayet |
tatra paścimavedyāṃ tu devam āropya pūrvavat || 11.364
kumbhapūrvaṃ krameṇaiva catuḥsthānasthitaṃ vibhum |
yathāvidhi samabhyarcya prabhūtānn asamanvitam || 11.365
tato dvārādhidevānāṃ pradāpya vidhinā balim |
kuṇḍasthaṃ maṇḍalasthaṃ ca devaṃ hṛdi visṛjya ca || 11.366
visarjayed yathāvac ca tathā dvārādhidevatāḥ |
vāhayann autsavaṃ bimbaṃ mahākumbhapurassaram || 11.367
karakāstraṃ samādāya ācāryaḥ svakareṇa tu |
acchinnadhārayā yuktaṃ kṛtvā gehaṃ pradakṣiṇam || 11.368
prāsādaṃ tu samāsādya mūlabimbasya sammukham <saṃmukham> |
niveśya cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ sampūjyārghyādibhiḥ <saṃpūjyārghyādibhiḥ> 
kramāt || 11.369
prokṣayet kumbhatoyena mūlamūrtigataṃ vibhum |
puṃsūktam uccaran paścādyātrābimbaṃ ca secayet || 11.370
mahākumbhagatāṃ śaktiṃ mūlabere samarpayet |
karakāstragatāṃ śaktim āyudheṣu samarpayet || 11.371
tathaiva vāsudevādīn pīṭhordhve yojayet kramāt |
tatkāle tu viśeṣeṇa guroḥ sammānam <saṃmānam> ācaret || 11.372
vasanaiś ca dukūlādyair devasya prāṅniveditaiḥ |
vividhaiḥ sragvaraiś cāpi sugandhaiś candanādikaiḥ || 11.373
ācāryo 'pi samādāya dukūlādyam anuttamam |
badhvā svoṣṇīṣavat svasmin śirasi dvijasattamāḥ || 11.374
mālyādīṃś ca yathāyogaṃ dhārayan praṇipatya ca |
puṣpāñjaliṃ tataḥ kṛtvā praṇamya ca muhirmuhuḥ || 11.375
sarvaṃ nyūnātiriktaṃ ca mayā pūrvaṃ hi yat kṛtam |
tat sarvaṃ devadeveśa kṣantum arhasi naḥ prabho || 11.376
iti vijñāpya deveśaṃ karastham atha kautukam |
visṛjya hṛdayenaiva yātrāmūrtigataṃ vibhum || 11.377
svasthāne sanniveśyātha <saṃniveśyātha> ārghyādyaiḥ paripūjya ca |
apūpānupahārāṃś ca samarpya ca vibhos tadā || 11.378
śayyāsanaṃ samarpyātha rātriśeṣaṃ samāpayet |
tadanyedyuḥ prabhātāyāṃ kṛtasnānaḥ kṛtāhnikaḥ || 11.379
ācāryo mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ prāsādaṃ sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> tu |
kṛtvā nityārcanāntaṃ tu devadevasya deśikaḥ || 11.380
tatas tu vakṣyamāṇaṃ yatsnapanaṃ cādhamottamam |
tena saṃsnāpya deveśaṃ havirantaṃ samarcayet || 11.381
sāyaṅkāle ca samprāpte <saṃprāpte> nityapūjāvasānataḥ |
deveśasyāgrataḥ sthitvā vijñāpanam athācaret || 11.382
bhagavan puṇḍarīkākṣa śaraṇāgatavatsala |
aṅkurārpaṇam ārabhya utsavāvabhṛdhāntimam || 11.383
yan mayānuṣṭhitaṃ karma tava samprītaye <saṃprītaye> vibho |
tathānyair madanujñātair deśikaiś cāpi yat kṛtam || 11.384
sādhakaiś ca tathānyaiś ca vividhaiḥ paricārakaiḥ |
tattatsampūraṇārthaṃ <tattatsaṃpūraṇārthaṃ> ca nyūnādhikyopaśāntaye || 
11.385
tvām adya vāsare yaṣṭuṃ puṣpayāgavidhānataḥ |
pravṛttam anujānīhi madanugrahakāmyayā || 11.386
iti vijñāpya devasya tadanujñām avāpya ca |
devam utsavabimbasthaṃ devībhyāṃ saha deśikaḥ || 11.387
āsthānamaṇṭapaṃ nītvā sauvarṇe bhadraviṣṭare |
tatra devaṃ samāropya alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ || 11.388
tatas tasya purobhāge puṣpamaṇḍalam ālikhet |
śvetaiḥ pītais tathā raktaiḥ pāṭalaiś ca sitāsitaiḥ || 11.389
pañcavarṇais tu puṣpādyaiḥ śyāmalais tulasīdalaiḥ |
maṇḍale pūrayitvā tu yathālocanasupriyam || 11.390
maṇṭaleśānabhāge tu mahākumbhaṃ ca vinyaset |
maṇṭapasya caturdikṣu dvārakumbhāṣṭakaṃ nyaset || 11.391
maṇḍapaṃ samalaṅkṛtya <samalaṃkṛtya> vitānadhvajatoraṇaiḥ |
puṣpāṅkuraṃ tataḥ kuryād yathoktavidhinā guruḥ || 11.392
maṇḍalasyottare bhāge sūtrāṇy āsphālya pūrvavat |
pālikādīni pātrāṇi śālipīṭhopari nyaset || 11.393
vibhavecchānusāreṇa kevalaṃ pālikās tu vā |
prakṣālya pālikādīni alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> yathāvidhi || 11.394
kuśakāśatṛṇais teṣāṃ bilamūlāni pūrayet |
bilāni taṇḍulair eva pūrayet tu yathāvidhi || 11.395
prokṣya puṇyāhatoyena yajet pātrādhidevatāḥ |
pūrvoktakramayogena teṣu puṣpāṇi vāpayet || 11.396
somakumbhārcanaṃ homaṃ varjayed atra deśikaḥ |
rakṣābandhaṃ tataḥ kuryān mūlabimbādiṣu kramāt || 11.397
autsavaṃ bimbam ādāya mṛdvāstaraṇaśobhite |
puṣpamaṇḍalamadhye tu prāṅmukhaṃ viniveśya ca || 11.398
tasya pārśvadvaye viprāḥ śriyaṃ puṣṭiṃ ca vinyaset |
kumbhapārśvaṃ samāsādya prāgvaddeśikasattamaḥ || 11.399
kṛtvā mānasayāgāntaṃ dvārayāgaṃ samācaret |
mahākumbhe mūlabimbāt kiñcid āvāhya pūjayet || 11.400
karakāstrādyarcanaṃ tu sarvaṃ prāgvat samācaret |
bimbe 'tha pūjanaṃ kuryāt prāgvannīrājanāntimam || 11.401
upahārān nivedyātha punaḥ pūjāṃ samācaret |
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathācāmaṃ gandhaṃ mālyaṃ ca dīpakam || 11.402
dhūpaṃ tato 'rhaṇajalam apūpān pṛthukān api |
tarpaṇaṃ nālikerottharasamācamanaṃ tathā || 11.403
mukhavāsasamopetaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca samarpayet |
evaṃ dvādaśavāraṃ tu kṛtvā pūjāṃ jagatprabhoḥ || 11.404
mahāhavirnivedyātha kuryāt puṣpādhivāsanam |
sauvarṇe rājate vāpi pātre puṣpāṇi pūrayet || 11.405
tatpātraṃ devapurataḥ śālipīṭhe nidhāya vai |
prokṣya puṇyāhatoyena pūjayen mūlamantrataḥ || 11.406
vastreṇācchādya tatpātraṃ gatvā yāganiketanam |
kuṇḍam agniṃ ca saṃskṛtya tanmadhye devam arcayet || 11.407
samidbhiś caiva nityābhiḥ kāmyābhiś ca yathāvidhi |
pūrṇāhutyādikaṃ kṛtvā devādīṃs tu visarjayet || 11.408
sampātājyam <saṃpātājyam> athādāya gatvā devasya sannidhim <saṃnidhim> |
homaṃ samarpya devāya deśiko mantravittamaḥ || 11.409
sampātājyena <saṃpātājyena> puṣpāṇi saṃsicya tadanantaram |
devasya pādayoḥ puṣpaṃ puṃsūktena samarpayet || 11.410
athāṣṭākṣarabījāni hṛdayādīni ca kramāt |
bhūṣaṇāni ca divyāni kirīṭādīny anukramāt || 11.411
āyudhāni ca divyāni śriyaṃ puṣṭiṃ khageśvaram |
tathaiva parivārāṃś ca samuddiśya yathākramam || 11.412
devasya pādayoḥ puṣpaṃ dadyād deśikasattamaḥ |
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ yānam āropya yatnataḥ || 11.413
alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa vastrābharaṇamālyakaiḥ |
sarvamaṅgalasaṃyuktaṃ prathamāvaraṇādiṣu || 11.414
paribhrāmya ca deveśaṃ tathā vai grāmavīdhiṣu |
praveśya devasadanaṃ dhvajapīṭhasamīpake || 11.415
devam arghyādinābhyarcya nivedya ca havis tataḥ |
dhvajasthānaṃ samāsādya patatrīśaṃ samarcayet || 11.416
mahāhavir nivedyātha dhvajasthaṃ vihageśvaram |
visarjayitvā svahṛdi dhvajaṃ samavaropayet || 11.417
dhvajadaṇḍaṃ dhvajapaṭaṃ tadyaṣṭiṃ tatprapāṃ tathā |
ācāryaḥ svayam ādadyād yāgopakaraṇāny api || 11.418
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ prathamāvaraṇe 'pi vā |
dvitīyāvaraṇe vāpi maṇṭape bhadraviṣṭare || 11.419
niveśya prāgmukhaṃ vāpi hy uttarābhimukhaṃ tu vā |
devasyotsavasevārthaṃ ye devāḥ pūrvam āgatāḥ || 11.420
vaikuṇṭhavāsinaś caiva kumudādigaṇeśvarāḥ |
brahmarudrādayañ caiva tathā devarṣisattamāḥ || 11.421
tathā vai bhagavadbhaktāḥ deśāntaranivāsinaḥ |
devadevasya kalyāṇam anusandhātum <anusaṃdhātum> āgatāḥ || 11.422
teṣāṃ svadeśayānārthaṃ devānujñāpurassaram |
kṛtvā visarjanaṃ paścāddevam antaḥ praveśayet || 11.423
tatas tu devaṃ devībhyāṃ mūlabimbasya sammukham <saṃmukham> |
niveśya cobhayor madhye mahākumbhaṃ tu vinyaset || 11.424
kumbhaprokṣaṇapūrvaṃ tu kautukotsarjanāntimam |
prāgvat kṛtvā yathāśāstraṃ devam antaḥ praveśayet || 11.425
arghyagandhādinābhyarcyaṃ mūlabimbe visarjayet |
śayyāsanaṃ samarpyātha jāgareṇa nayen niśām || 11.426
brāhme muhūrte samprāpte <saṃprāpte> deśiko mantravittamaḥ |
udvāsanabaliṃ dadyān mūkaiḥ parijanaiḥ saha || 11.427
grāme cāvāhitān pūrvaṃ kumudādīn gaṇānvitān |
santoṣya <saṃtoṣya> balidānena saviśeṣaṃ visarjayet || 11.428
mahātaṭāke nadyādau deśiko mantravittamaḥ |
ṛtvigbhiḥ paricāraiś ca sarvaiḥ parijanaiḥ saha || 11.429
snānaṃ kṛtvā tu vidhivad gatvā devagṛhaṃ tataḥ |
nityapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ yathāvidhi samācaret || 11.430
yajamāno guruṃ haimair bhūṣaṇaiḥ kaṭakādibhiḥ |
vasanair gandhapuṣpādyair alaṅkṛtyābhipūjya <alaṃkṛtyābhipūjya> ca || 11.431
uttamāṃ dakṣiṇāṃ dadyāt svarṇaniṣkaśatānvitām |
tato 'dhikāṃ tu vā dadyād vibhavasyānuguṇyataḥ || 11.432
tadardhaṃ madhyamāṃ vāpi tadartham adhamāṃ tu vā |
yathāvittānurūpaṃ tu yathāśraddhaṃ tu vā dadet || 11.433
tadardham ṛtvijāṃ dadyāt tadardhaṃ paricāriṇām |
vedapāṭhakapūrvāṃś ca tathā gāyakasattamān || 11.434
anyāṃś caiva yathāśakti dakṣiṇābhiḥ pratoṣayet |
yāgas tu dakṣiṇāhīno niṣphalaḥ syān na saṃśayaḥ || 11.435
tasmād vittānuguṇyena deyā spalpāpi dakṣiṇā |
tatkāle yajamānas tu alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> tu deśikam || 11.436
vastrasrakcandanādyaiś ca samāropya ca yānake |
śaṅkhakāhalavāditrabherīpaṭahasaṃyutam || 11.437
chatradīpasamāyuktaṃ gāyakādisamanvitam |
deśikaṃ devavat smṛtvā svagṛhe sampraveśayet <saṃpraveśayet> || 11.438
evaṃ hi devadevasya utsavaṃ kārayet tu yaḥ |
iha loke sukhaṃ prāpya paraloke mahīyate || 11.439
evaṃ nigaditaḥ samyaṅmahotsavavidhir dvijāḥ |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
mahotsavavidhir nāma
ekādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ



