nāradaḥ
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi pakṣamāsotsavādikān |
tathā vasantotsavādīn śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 12.1
pakṣe pakṣe ca dvādaśyāṃ māse māse tathaiva ca |
amāvāsyāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ śravaṇe cottare dine || 12.2
avatāradineṣv evaṃ devadevasya vai dvijāḥ |
yajamānādijanmarkṣe caitrādiviṣuvadvaye || 12.3
ayanadvitaye cāpi tathā saṅkrāntiṣu <saṃkrāntiṣu> dvijāḥ |
ācared devadevasya viśeṣayajanaṃ guruḥ || 12.4
nakṣatrabhede samprāpte <saṃprāpte> pūrvam eva phalapradam |
paredyur daśanāḍī cet param eva śubhaṃ bhavet || 12.5
tithibhede tathā prāpte param eva phalapradam |
ekādaśyām amāvāsyāṃ dvādaśyādiṣu vā dvijāḥ || 12.6
paredyuś cet kalāmātraṃ tad eva śubhadaṃ bhavet |
uttarāyaṇapūrveṣu ṣaṭsu saṅkrāntiṣu <saṃkrāntiṣu> dvijāḥ || 12.7
paścāt ṣoḍaśanāḍīnām antare devam arcayet |
dakṣiṇāyanapūrveṣu ṣaṭsu saṅkramaṇeṣu <saṃkramaṇeṣu> ca || 12.8
prāg evābhyarcayed devaṃ nāḍīṣoḍaśakāntare |
anukalpe tu tat kuryāt paścāt ṣoḍaśakāntare || 12.9
evam ṛkṣādikaṃ jñātvā kuryāt tattaddine 'rcanam |
dvādaśyādiṣu kartavyaṃ utsavaṃ tv adhunocyate || 12.10
purā nityārcanaṃ kṛtvā devadevasya sattamāḥ |
saṃsnāpya vidhivad devaṃ mūlamūrtigataṃ vibhum || 12.11
yātrāmūrtigataṃ vāpi yad vā snapanakautukam |
alaṅkārāsanaṃ <alaṃkārāsanaṃ> nītvā samabhyarcya vidhānataḥ || 12.12
mahāhavir nivedyātha homāntaṃ vā japāntimam |
sarvaṃ kuryād viśeṣeṇa mūlād utsavakautuke || 12.13
kiñcid āvāhya tadanu yātrāmūrtigataṃ vibhum |
yānam āropya sauvarṇaṃ sapuṣpaprabhayānvitam || 12.14
alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa pūrvoktavibhavaiḥ saha |
utsavabhramaṇaṃ kṛtvā samyaggrāmapradakṣiṇam || 12.15
bhagavanmandirāgre vā balipīṭhāgrato 'pi vā |
devasya śramaśāntyarthaṃ kuryād abhyarcanaṃ guruḥ || 12.16
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathācāmaṃ gandhaṃ mālyaṃ ca dīpakam |
dhūpaṃ tathārhaṇajalaṃ apūpān pṛthukān api || 12.17
tarpaṇaṃ nālikerottharasam ācamanaṃ tathā |
mukhavāsasamopetaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca nivedayet || 12.18
vividhair nṛttagītādyais tadā santoṣayet <saṃtoṣayet> prabhum |
gaṇikā devadāsyaś ca tathā vai vādyakovidāḥ || 12.19
vandinaś ca tathānye 'pi sarve bhaktisamanvitāḥ |
devaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya balipīṭhena vai saha || 12.20
dvivāraṃ vā caturvāraṃ praṇameyuś ca bhaktitaḥ |
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 12.21
yānāt samavaropyātha pāduke vinivedya ca |
agramaṇṭapabhūbhāge bhadrapīṭhe niveśya ca || 12.22
arghyādyaiḥ prāgvad abhyarcya svasthāne sanniveśayet <saṃniveśayet> |
ādau niyojitāṃ śaktiṃ mūlabimbe niyojayet || 12.23
dvādaśyādiṣu kartavyam utsavaṃ tv evam īritam |
madhumādhavamāse tu śuklapakṣe viśeṣataḥ || 12.24
kalayāpi caturdaśyā hy apṛṣṭe parvāṇi dvijāḥ |
jalakrīḍāṃ tu devasya kuryād deśikasattamaḥ || 12.25
jalakrīḍānusāreṇa saptāhaṃ vā navāhakam |
pañcāhaṃ vā tryahaṃ vāpi ekāhaṃ votsavaṃ caret || 12.26
utsavārambhadivasāt pūrvedyur niśi deśikaḥ |
aṅkurāropaṇaṃ kṛtvā rakṣāvandhaṃ <rakṣābandhaṃ> yathāvidhi || 12.27
utsavārambhadivasād ārabhya prativāsaram |
catuḥsthānārcanaṃ kuryāt sāyamprātar yathāvidhi || 12.28
baliṃ nityoktavidhinā kuryāt kāladvaye 'pi ca |
madhyāhne balidānānte yātrāmūrtigataṃ vibhum || 12.29
śibikāyāṃ samāropya śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ saha dvijāḥ |
nītvā mahāmaṇṭapaṃ tu tatra vai bhadraviṣṭare || 12.30
samāropya ca devasya purato dhānyaviṣṭare |
cūrṇadhivāsanaṃ prāgvatkṛtvā deśikasattamaḥ || 12.31
arghyādyair devam abhyarcya havirantaṃ yathāvidhi |
śrīsūktena tato devaṃ śriyaṃ puṣṭiṃ ca deśikaḥ || 12.32
abhiṣicya ca cūrṇena hāridreṇa yathāvidhi |
devībhyāṃ saha deveśaṃ bhrāmayed grāmavīdhiṣu || 12.33
prādakṣiṇyena pūrvoktayātropakaraṇaiḥ saha |
tadā devasya devyoś ca yuddhakrīḍāṃ ca kārayet || 12.34
prathame gandhayuddhaṃ tu dvitīye puṣpayuddhakam |
tṛtīye cūrṇayuddhaṃ ca caturthe tailayuddhakam || 12.35
pañcame kṣīrayuddhaṃ syāt ṣaṣṭhe karpūrakuṅkumaiḥ |
nārikelajalair yuddhaṃ saptame tu samācaret || 12.36
gandhāmbhasāṣṭame yuddhaṃ navame jalayuddhakam |
gehādigrāmamadhyāntaṃ bhaktair bhāgavataiḥ saha || 12.37
gaṇikādevadāsībhiḥ kāryaṃ yuddhaṃ vinodataḥ |
yuddhakrīḍāṃ tu kṛtvaivaṃ devam antaḥ praveśayet || 12.38
saptāham utsave kuryāt cūrṇayuddhādisaptakam |
pañcāham utsave kuryāt kṣīrayuddhādipañcakam || 12.39
tryahotsave nālikerarasayuddhādikaṃ bhavet |
kevalaṃ jalayuddhaṃ tu kuryād ekāha utsave || 12.40
jalakrīḍāvidhānaṃ tu śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
tṛtīyāvaraṇādau vā yad vā gopurabāhyataḥ || 12.41
khātvā puruṣamātraṃ tu kṣitau vai munisattamāḥ |
śilābhir iṣṭakābhir vā dṛḍhīkṛtya samantataḥ || 12.42
sopānapaṅktibhir yuktāṃ jaladroṇīṃ prakalpayet |
catuḥstambhasamāyuktaṃ maṇṭapaṃ vā prapāṃ tu vā || 12.43
kṛtvopariṣṭāt tadroṇīṃ pūrayec chuddhavāribhiḥ |
prāgvatkaṭāhaṃ vāpūrya kastūrīkuṅkumādibhiḥ || 12.44
surabhīkṛtya tadanu prasūnair vikirec chubhaiḥ |
pṛthakcūrṇādhivāsaṃ tu kṛtvā yāgagṛhe guruḥ || 12.45
kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile vāgnau śriyam āvāhya mantravit |
tatra santarpya <saṃtarpya> vidhivatsampātājyena <vidhivatsaṃpātājyena> secayet || 
12.46
taccūrṇapātram ādāya vādyaghoṣapurassaram |
jaladroṇīṃ samāsādya puṇyāhoktipurassaram || 12.47
tatra cūrṇaṃ vinikṣipya vasantaṃ tatra pūjayet |
parito lokapālāṃś ca samabhyarcya viśeṣataḥ || 12.48
baliṃ dadyād aṣṭadikṣu geyavādyapurassaram |
jaladroṇyāṃ tu saṃskāras tv evam ukto munīśvarāḥ || 12.49
devībhyāṃ saha deveśaṃ maṇṭape prāgvad arcayet |
kṛtvā cūrṇābhiṣekāntaṃ jaladroṇīsamīpataḥ || 12.50
devam ānīya devībhyām arghyādyaiḥ paripūjya ca |
bherīpaṭahavāditraśaṅkhaghoṣasamanvitam || 12.51
stutimaṅgalaghoṣaiś ca vedaghoṣasamanvitam |
pauruṣeṇaiva sūktena kuryāt tatrāvagāhanam || 12.52
yad vā kūrce pādukāyāṃ devam āvāhya mantravit |
tatrāvagāhayed viprāḥ tadānīṃ deśikottamaḥ || 12.53
yajamāno mūrtipāś ca bhūsurā vaiṣṇavottamāḥ |
yatayo brahmaniṣṭhāś ca siñceyur maṅgalāmbhasā || 12.54
cāturvarṇyabhavāḥ sarve puruṣāṃś ca striyo 'pi ca |
gaṇikā devadāsyaś ca tathānye vādyavādakāḥ || 12.55
parasparaṃ ca siñceyuḥ sarve maṅgalavāribhiḥ |
gaṅgāsnānaphalaṃ prāpya viṣṇusāyujyam āpnuyuḥ || 12.56
yāne devaṃ samāropya saha snānārdravāsasā |
jalakrīḍāpuraskaṃ tu yātropakaraṇaiḥ saha || 12.57
bhrāmayed grāmavīdhīṣu prītaye varuṇasya ca |
prajānām api sarveṣāṃ pavitrīkaraṇāya ca || 12.58
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ mandirāntaḥ praveśayet |
tatra devaṃ yathāśāstraṃ pañcaviṃśatibhir ghaṭaiḥ || 12.59
abhiṣicya viśeṣeṇa havirantaṃ samarcayet |
pratyahaṃ cāpi yuddhānte snapanaṃ tv evam ācaret || 12.60
tadrātrau pūrvavat kuryāt kumbhasamprokṣaṇāntimam 
<kumbhasaṃprokṣaṇāntimam> |
ācāryaṃ pūjayet paścādvastrahemāṅgulīyakaiḥ || 12.61
mūrtipādīn yathānyāyaṃ toṣayed draviṇais tathā |
iti saṅkṣepataḥ <saṃkṣepataḥ> prokto vasantotsava uttamaḥ || 12.62
caitre tu śukladvādaśyāṃ kuryād damanikotsavam |
pavitrārohavat kuryāc catuḥsthānārcanādikam || 12.63
bhūṣaṇāny uttamādīni kuryād damanikais tathā |
tat tu saṅkhyāviracitaṃ <saṃkhyāviracitaṃ> yathā śobhānurūpataḥ || 12.64
pañcaviṃśatikumbhāṃs tu sthāpayitvābhiṣecayet |
eka eva nārāyaṇa iti prākkalaśena tu || 12.65
tasya dhyānāntaḥsthasyeti dvitīyakalaśena tu |
atha punar eva <<punar eva : puruṣo>> nārāyaṇa iti tu tṛtīyataḥ || 12.66
atha punar eva nārāyaṇa iti caturthataḥ |
sahasraśīrṣā puruṣa iti pañcamakumbhataḥ || 12.67
patiṃ viśvasyātmeśvaram iti vai ṣaṣṭhakumbhataḥ |
nārāyaṇaparaṃ brahma iti vai saptamena tu || 12.68
yac ca kiñcij jagaty asminn iti hy aṣṭamakumbhataḥ |
anantam avyayaṃ kavim iti navamenābhicayet || 12.69
atho niṣṭhyā vitastyāṃ tu iti syād daśamena vai |
santataṃ <saṃtataṃ> sirābhis tu ity ekādaśamena tu || 12.70
tasya madhye mahān agnir iti dvādaśamena vai |
santāpayati <saṃtāpayati> svaṃ deham iti trayodaśamena vai || 12.71
nīlatoyadamadhyasthā iti caturdaśamena vai |
tasyāḥ śikhāyā madhya iti pañcadaśena vai || 12.72
sarvasya viśinam iti ṣoḍaśamena tu |
bahirāvaraṇasthais tu kalaśair abhiṣecayet || 12.73
bahirāvaraṇe nāsti iti prāksaṃsthitena tu |
yannābhipadmād abhavad iti vahnigatena tu || 12.74
dhṛtordhvapuṇḍraḥ parameti yāmyadiksaṃsthitena tu |
dakṣiṇe tu bhuje vipra iti yātugatena tu || 12.75
viṣṇunāttam aśnantīti vāruṇīsaṃsthitena tu |
pumpradhāneśvaro viṣṇur iti vāyugatena tu || 12.76
imāṃ mahopaniṣadam iti somagatena tu |
om iti prathamaṃ nāma itīśānagatena tu || 12.77
puruṣo ha vai vāsudeva iti madhyagatena tu |
yad vā puruṣasūktīyair mantraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhiḥ kramāt || 12.78
bahirāvaraṇasthais tu kalaśair abhiṣicya ca |
pūrvoktair brahmasūktasthair mantrair dvidvikasaṃkhyayā || 12.79
antarāvaraṇasthais tu saṃsnāpya kalaśaiḥ kramāt |
avaśiṣṭaiś tribhiś cānte madhyakumbhena secayet || 12.80
rajanīcūrṇasaṃmiśrān saṃsthāpya navakumbhakān |
arghyādyair cayitvā tu cakraraśmisamaprabhān || 12.81
rajanīcūrṇanicayān dhyātvā tair abhiṣecayet |
sarvavighnanirāsārthaṃ sarvasampūraṇāya <sarvasaṃpūraṇāya> ca || 12.82
dakṣiṇe tu bhuje vipra iti prāksaṃsthitena tu |
nicikṣepa suṣaṇam iti vahnigatena tu || 12.83
prate viṣṇo abjacakre iti yāmyagatena tu |
ebhir vayam urukramasyeti yātugatena tu || 12.84
dhṛtordhvapuṇḍraḥ kṛtacakreti paścimagena tu |
pavitram ity agnir iti vāyukoṇagatena tu || 12.85
caraṇaṃ pavitraṃ vitatam iti somagatena tu |
lokasya dvāram arcimad iti rudragatena tu || 12.86
mantrair etais tu cāṣṭābhir anyaiḥ saudarśanais tathā |
saṃsnāpya madhyakumbhena śuddhodair abhiṣicya ca || 12.87
mahopaniṣadantasthair brahmasūktaiḥ puroditaiḥ |
mantraiś caturbhiḥ puṃsūktamantraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhis tathā || 12.88
vāsudevadviṣaṭkārṇabrāhmaṇadvitayena tu |
oṅkārādipavitrāntaiś <oṃkārādipavitrāntaiś> caturbhir vyāpakais tathā || 12.89
sahastradhārayā devaṃ snāpayed vidhipūrvakam |
yad vāṣṭākṣaramantreṇa sarvaṃ snapanam ācaret || 12.90
tato 'nyaiḥ sakalair bhogaiḥ prāgvadiṣṭvā krameṇa tu |
sarvaiḥ puroditair mantrair mūlamantreṇa vā dvijāḥ || 12.91
homaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣeṇa samidbhis trimadhuplutaiḥ |
tato damanikāropam ācaret tu yathāvidhi || 12.92
atrānuktaṃ tu sakalaṃ pavitrārohavad bhavet |
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi viśākhotsavam uttamam || 12.93
vṛṣabhasthe dinakare paurṇamāsī tu yā bhavet |
viśākhāṛkṣayuktā vā hy ayuktā vā dvijottamāḥ || 12.94
caturdaśyā hy aviddhāyāṃ tasyām utsavam ācaret |
sahakāraphalādīni nālikeraphalāny api || 12.95
drākṣākharjūrakādīni mātulaṅgaphalāny api |
anyāni caiva yogyāni yathālabdhāni vā dvijāḥ || 12.96
āhṛtya sarvāṇy ekatra nyasya pātreṣu ca dvijāḥ |
tāni pātrāṇi vinyasya paricārakamūrdhasu || 12.97
viṣvaksenaṃ puraskṛtya vādyaghoṣasamanvitam |
grāmaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 12.98
mahānasādau nikṣipya phalapātrāṇy ataḥ param |
vaiṣṇavair brāhmaṇaiḥ śuddhair mahāharṣasamanvitaiḥ || 12.99
vastreṇa pihitāsyaiś ca jihvācāpalyavarjitaiḥ |
nistvakkaraṇayogyāni tathā nistvañci kārayet || 12.100
yathāvasthitarūpeṇa śodhanārhāṇi śodhayet |
tathaiva kṣālanārhāṇi kṣālayec chuddhavāribhiḥ || 12.101
phalāni sahakārāṇāṃ kṣīreṇa guḍamiśritam |
pācayen nālikerāṇāṃ khaṇḍaiś caiva marīcibhiḥ || 12.102
elākarpūracūrṇaiś ca miśrayed evam eva hi |
mahāhaviḥ pāyasādīn apūpāṃś ca prakalpayet || 12.103
divāpi vā rajanyāṃ vā nityapūjāvasānataḥ |
mantrāsanapuraskaṃ tu devaṃ snānāsanaṃ nayet || 12.104
pañcaviṃśatibhiḥ kumbhaiḥ saṃsnāpya puruṣottamam |
alaṅkārāsane <alaṃkārāsane> 'bhyarcya tato bhojyāsanam nayet || 12.105
mahāhaviḥ pāyasādyaṃ sahakāraphalādikam |
nivedya devadevāya tāmbūlādīn nivedayet || 12.106
kāribhyo vaiṣṇavebhyaś ca tatprasādaṃ pradāpayet |
tatas tu cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam || 12.107
yānam āropya vastrādyair alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ |
sarvamaṅgalasaṃyuktaṃ nītvā grāmaṃ pradakṣiṇam || 12.108
mandirāntaḥ praveśyātha svasthāne sanniveśayet <saṃniveśayet> |
yajamāno 'tha gurvādīn toṣayed dakṣiṇādibhiḥ || 12.109
evaṃ viśākhotsavasya vidhānaṃ saprakīrtitam |
atha plavotsavavidhiṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 12.110
śiśirādyeṣu ṛtuṣu triṣv ekasmin samācaret |
śuklapakṣe 'tha vā kṛṣṇe deveśasya plavotsavam || 12.111
yajamānasya janmarkṣe devajanmarkṣake 'pi vā |
plavādhirohaṇaṃ kuryād rājarāṣṭrābhivṛddhidam || 12.112
tannakṣatrānusāreṇa saptāhaṃ vā navāhakam |
pañcāhaṃ vā tryahaṃ vāpi ekāhaṃ votsavaṃ bhavet || 12.113
utsavārambhapūrvedyur aṅkurārpaṇam ācaret |
rakṣābandhaṃ ca vidhivat kṛtvā deśikasattamaḥ || 12.114
ārambhadinam ārabhya pratyahaṃ kālayor dvayoḥ |
catussthānārcanaṃ kuryād balidānasamanvitam || 12.115
ādāvante ca deveśam adhamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpayet pratidinaṃ vāhanārohaṇaṃ bhavet || 12.116
antime tu dine kāryam uḍupasyādhirohaṇam |
pratyahaṃ cāpi madhyāhne devaṃ devīsamanvitam || 12.117
yānam āropya vastrādyair alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ |
grāmaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya sarastīraṃ samānayet || 12.118
tatra prakalpite divye maṇṭape sumanohare |
bhadrāsane devadevaṃ samāropya viśeṣataḥ || 12.119
arghyādhyais tu samabhyarcya mahatā haviṣā tathā |
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 12.120
uḍupārohaṇadine 'py evaṃ devaṃ sarastaṭe |
samārādhya viśeṣeṇa havirantaṃ jagatprabhum || 12.121
svastike caturaśre vā vṛtte vāpi sarovare |
paritaḥ kṛtasopāne caturdvāropaśobhite || 12.122
caturdikṣu mahottuṅgagopuraiś copaśobhite |
samadhyamaṇṭape divye vimalodakapūrite || 12.123
prakalpitaṃ plavaṃ divyaṃ phalakābhir dṛḍhīkṛtam |
anekastambhasaṃyuktaṃ lohakīlair dṛḍhīkṛtam || 12.124
vimānasadṛśākāraṃ maṇṭapākṛtim eva vā |
dvitalaṃ tritalaṃ vāpi catuḥpañcatalānvitam || 12.125
alaṅkṛtaṃ <alaṃkṛtaṃ> ca vividhair vitānaiḥ puṣpamālyakaiḥ |
darpaṇaiś cāmaraiś caiva dhvajaiś ca vividhair api || 12.126
nālikeraiḥ pūgaphalastabakaiḥ kadalīphalaiḥ |
hrīberaiś caiva ghaṇṭābhiḥ paritaḥ samalaṃkṛtam <samalaṅkṛtam> || 12.127
prokṣya puṇyāhatoyena sarastoyaṃ ca deśikaḥ |
dahanāpyāyanābhyāṃ ca saṃśodhya vimalodake || 12.128
kṣīrārṇavaṃ samāvāhya sampūjyārghyādibhir <saṃpūjyārghyādibhir> dvijāḥ |
plave phaṇīndram āvāhya paritaḥ kumudādikān || 12.129
samabhyarcyārghyagandhādyaiḥ kumbhe cāvāhya pūjayet |
agnāv anantamantreṇa hutvā caiva yathāvidhi || 12.130
plavaṃ tatkumbhatoyena prokṣayed deśikottamaḥ |
evaṃ plavaṃ tu saṃskṛtya muhūrte tu suśobhane || 12.131
devībhyāṃ saha deveśaṃ plavam āropayed guruḥ |
ācāryaḥ sādhakaś caiva dīkṣitāḥ paricārakāḥ || 12.132
sevāparās tathānye ca vaiṣṇavā vedapāṭhakāḥ |
tiṣṭheyuḥ parito devam anyeṣāṃ tu pṛthakplavaḥ || 12.133
anye tu na spṛśeyus taṃ yas tu śeṣātmakaḥ plavaḥ |
vandino vāravanitāḥ ye cānye vādyavādakāḥ || 12.134
te te pṛthakplavārūḍhāḥ kuryunṛttādikaṃ tathā |
śaṅkhabheryādininadair vedaghoṣaiḥ samantataḥ || 12.135
puṣpavarṣair vinodaiś ca devaṃ santoṣayet <saṃtoṣayet> tadā |
pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kuryāt pañcakaṃ saptakaṃ tu vā || 12.136
tataḥ saromadhyabhāgamaṇṭape devam ānayet |
tatra devaṃ samabhyarcya arghyādyair dośikottamaḥ || 12.137
arhaṇaṃ pṛthukāpūpanālikerarasaṃ tathā |
tarpaṇaṃ caiva tāmbūlaṃ mukhavāsasam anvitam || 12.138
nivedya devadevāya tāmbūlādyais tataḥ param |
sevājanāṃś ca santoṣya <saṃtoṣya> yāvadastamayaṃ raveḥ || 12.139
nānāvinodaiḥ santoṣya <saṃtoṣya> devaṃ nītvā punaḥ plavam |
tīram āsādya deveśam avaropya plavāt tataḥ || 12.140
grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ devaṃ mandirāntaḥ praveśayet |
nityārcanaṃ purā kṛtvā viśeṣayajanaṃ tathā || 12.141
prāgvatkumbhaprokṣaṇāntaṃ sarvaṃ kuryād yathāvidhi |
yajamāno guruṃ caiva toṣayed dakṣiṇādibhiḥ || 12.142
evaṃ plavotsavavidhiḥ proktaḥ saṅkṣepato <saṃkṣepato> dvijāḥ |
atha cāgrayaṇākhyasya vidhānaṃ kiñcid ucyate || 12.143
āṣāḍhe pūrvaphalgunyāṃ puṣye caiva viśeṣataḥ |
mādhamāse tu pañcamyāṃ saptamyām atha vā dvijāḥ || 12.144
muhūrte śobhane prāpte kuryād dhānyasya saṅgraham <saṃgraham> |
senādhipaṃ tadarthaṃ (?) tu tārkṣyaṃ vā mārutiṃ tu vā || 12.145
āropya śibikāyānaṃ sarvaiḥ parijanaiḥ saha |
ācāryo yajamānaś ca vādyaghoṣapurassaram || 12.146
kṣetradeśaṃ samāsādya puṇyāhaṃ vācayed guruḥ |
kṣetram arghyādinābhyarcya bhūmantreṇaiva mantravit || 12.147
lavitraṃ cāpi samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> mūlamantreṇa pūjayet |
tatas tu kṣetrapālebhyo baliṃ dadyāt samantataḥ || 12.148
dadhyodanaṃ pāyasaṃ vā deśikaḥ kṣetravṛddhaye |
sumuhūrte maunayukto deśiko mūlamantrataḥ || 12.149
dhānyānāṃ lavanaṃ kuryāt tataś caivaṃ kṛṣībalaiḥ |
kārayitvā dhānyabhārān vividhāni phalāni ca || 12.150
saṅgṛhya <saṃgṛhya> bahāyan paścāddevādyaravaiḥ saha |
viṣvaksenapuraskaṃ tu kṛtvā grāmapradakṣiṇam || 12.151
devagehaṃ samāsādya prāsādāntaḥ praviśya ca |
devasya dakṣiṇe haste dhānyaṃ kiñcit pradarśayet || 12.152
ātape śoṣayet paścādavaghātaṃ samācaret |
tatsthāne gomayāmbhobhiḥ samālipya samantataḥ || 12.153
sudhācūrṇair alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> musalaṃ tadulūkhalam |
kṣālayitvā śuddhajalair arghyagandhādinārcayet || 12.154
dhānyāny ulūkhale nyasya sumuhūrte 'vaghātayet |
sārdhaṃ maṅgalagānaiś ca sarvavādyaravaiḥ saha || 12.155
sadhavabrāhmaṇastrībhir devadāsīgaṇais tu vā |
tuṣān apohya śūrpeṇa kṣālayec chuddavāriṇā || 12.156
śodhayitvā punaḥ sarvān guḍapākena miśritān |
marīcijīrakair yuktān nālikeraphalānvitān || 12.157
vidhāya mūlabimbādīn abhyarcya ca viśeṣataḥ |
nivedya tāni tadanu vahnau santarpayed <saṃtarpayed> vibhum || 12.158
homānte sapta samidhāṃ taṇḍulair juhuyāt tataḥ |
paścān niveditaṃ sarvaṃ gurvādibhyaḥ pradāpayet || 12.159
evam āgrayaṇākhyaṃ hi aśvamedhasahasrataḥ |
uttamaṃ devadevasya kārayet prativatsaram || 12.160
atha ḍolotsavavidhiṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
uttarāyaṇakāle vā dakṣiṇāyana eva ca || 12.161
śuklapakṣe viśeṣeṇa pañcamīṃ saptamīṃ tu vā |
ekādaśīṃ vā daśamīṃ dvādaśīṃ pūrṇimāṃ tu vā || 12.162
samārabhyotsavaṃ kuryāt saptāhaṃ vā navāhakam |
pañcāhaṃ vā tryahaṃ vāpi vibhavec chānusārataḥ || 12.163
utsavārambhapūrvedyur niśāyām aṅkurārpaṇam |
rakṣābandhaṃ ca vidhivat kuryād deśikasattamaḥ || 12.164
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇādike |
bahir vā gopuradvārāt kutracit sumanohare || 12.165
deśe ḍolotsavārthaṃ tu maṇṭapaṃ parikalpayet |
dvātriṃśatstambhasaṃyuktaṃ caturviṃśatibhis tu vā || 12.166
ṣoḍaśastambhayuktaṃ vā caturdvārasamanvitam |
maṇṭapaṃ samalaṅkuryān <samalaṃkuryān> nānāvarṇavitānakaiḥ || 12.167
vicitrakṣaumavastraiś ca muktādāmabhir eva ca |
nānākusumamālyaiś ca darpaṇaiś cāmarādibhiḥ || 12.168
dhvajaiś ca vividhai ramyaiḥ prasūnastabakais tathā |
ghaṇṭābhiḥ phalabhāraiś ca pradīpāvalibhis tathā || 12.169
maṇṭapābhyantarabhuvaṃ kastūrīkuṅkumādibhiḥ |
karpūraiś ca samālipya sudhācūrṇādibhir bhuvam || 12.170
alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa kusumair akṣataiḥ śubhaiḥ |
vikīrya divyadhūpaiś ca dhūpayitvā samantataḥ || 12.171
sauvarṇīṃ rājatīṃ tāmrīṃ dārujāṃ vā yathā ruci |
yathoktalakṣaṇāṃ ḍolāṃ vṛttāṃ vā caturaśrakām || 12.172
vimānasadṛśīṃ vāpi yatheṣṭatalaśobhitām |
catuḥstambhasamāyuktāṃ yad vā stambhadvayānvitām || 12.173
vitānair vividhair mālyair darpaṇaiḥ ketubhis tathā |
alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa lambayen maṇṭapāntare || 12.174
rajjubhir lohakḷptābhiḥ kṣaumakārpāsatantubhiḥ |
kṛtābhir vā yathāyogaṃ tato deśikasattamaḥ || 12.175
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu ḍolāṃ samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> mantravit |
ḍolāyāḥ phalakāmadhye anantaṃ paripūjayet || 12.176
pādeṣu caiva dharmādyam aṣṭakaṃ vā catuṣṭayam |
stambheṣu garuḍavyūham abhyarcya kramayogataḥ || 12.177
tathaiva caturo vedān rajjuṣu kramaśo 'rcayet |
itihāsapurāṇāni vedāṅgāni tathaiva ca || 12.178
phalakāyām aṣṭadikṣu pūjayen munisattamāḥ |
vyāpakāṃs tu caturmantrān pādeṣu paripūjayet || 12.179
iṣṭvā dhvajeṣu sāvitrīṃ chatreṣu vyāhṛtīs tathā |
praṇavaṃ tu patākāsu toraṇeṣu svarāṃs tathā || 12.180
vyañjanāni ca sampūjya <saṃpūjya> ḍolāṃ kṛtvā tu vāṅmayīm |
ḍolāyāḥ parito dikṣu indrādīn paripūjayet || 12.181
ḍolāyās tu purobhāge yad vānyatra yathāvidhi |
dhānyapīṭhe mahākumbham upakumbhaṣṭakānvitam || 12.182
vinyasya tatra ḍoloktān devān āvāhya pūjayet |
upakumbhāṣṭake caiva indādīn paripūjayet || 12.183
kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile vāpi vahniṃ saṃskṛtya pūrvavat |
tān devāṃs tatra cāvāhya tattanmantrair anukramāt || 12.184
pṛthagaṣṭāhutīr hutvā ghṛtādyair deśikottamaḥ |
pūrṇāhutyādikaṃ kṛtvā visṛjyāgniṃ tato guruḥ || 12.185
sampātājyane <saṃpātājyane> tāṃ ḍolāṃ saṃsicya sumuhūrtake |
kumbhatoyena samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> pūjayec ca viśeṣataḥ || 12.186
ḍolāyāḥ parito dikṣu indrādibhyo baliṃ dadet |
evaṃ ḍolāṃ tu saṃskṛtya kuryāḍ ḍolotsavaṃ vibhoḥ || 12.187
catuḥsthānārcanayutaṃ balidānasamanvitam |
ārambhe cāvasāne ca pūrvoktasnapanānvitam || 12.188
sāyaṃ nityārcanaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣayajanaṃ tathā |
devaṃ yāne samāropya śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam || 12.189
dhāma pradakṣiṇīkṛtya ḍolāpārśvaṃ samānayet |
śaṅkhabherīninādaiś ca tūryamaṅgalanisvanaiḥ || 12.190
sumuhūrte sulagne ca ḍolām āropayed vibhum |
tatrārcayej jagannātham alaṅkārāsanoditaiḥ <alaṃkārāsanoditaiḥ> || 12.191
bhogair nīrājanāntaṃ ca tato bhojyāsane vibhum |
nītvā mahāhavirdivyam apūpān upahārakān || 12.192
nivedya tarpaṇādīni tāmbūlāntaṃ nivedayet |
ḍolārajjūn caturdikṣu gṛhītvā dvijasattamāḥ || 12.193
mandaṃ mandaṃ cālayeyus tadānīṃ deśikottamaḥ |
puṃsūktādyair devadevaṃ stuvann uccaravais tadā || 12.194
kastūrīkuṅkumādyaiś ca karpūraiḥ paribhāvitam |
divyagandhaṃ tu devāya samarpya ca viśeṣataḥ || 12.195
vījayeyus taulavṛntaiś cāmaraiś ca viśeṣataḥ |
vicitrakusumasragbhir hemaratnasarādibhiḥ || 12.196
alaṅkuryād <alaṃkuryād> devadevaṃ tatkāle dvijasattamāḥ |
vividhānupahārāṃś ca punarācamanaṃ tathā || 12.197
mukhavāsasamopetaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca nivedayet |
vividhāni ca nṛttāni kuryur vārāṅganās tadā || 12.198
vīṇāveṇuninādaiś ca gītaiś ca vividhais tadā |
toṣayed devadeveśaṃ stotraiś ca vividhais tathā || 12.199
stuvantu vandinaḥ sarve bhagavadbhaktibṛṃhitāḥ |
evam anyaiś ca vividhair upacāraiś ca toṣayet || 12.200
ḍolācālanavelāyāṃ ye paśyanti śriyaḥ patim |
iha te prāpya cābhīṣṭān prāpnuvanti parāṃ gatim || 12.201
tatas tu devaṃ devībhyāṃ yānam āropya deśikaḥ |
dhāma pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā prāsādāntaḥ praveśayet || 12.202
sakṛt tryahaṃ vā pañcāhaṃ saptāhaṃ vā navāhakam |
kṛtvaivam utsavaṃ nityaṃ sāyaṅkāle <sāyaṃkāle> yathāvidhi || 12.203
prāgvat kuryād utsavānte kumbhasamprokṣaṇāntimam 
<kumbhasaṃprokṣaṇāntimam> |
ācāryaṃ pūjayet prāgvad yajamānas tu pūrvavat || 12.204
iti ḍolotsavavidhiḥ saṅkṣepeṇa <saṃkṣepeṇa> pradarśitaḥ |
āṣāḍhaśukladvādaśyāṃ svāpotsavam athācaret || 12.205
tadādi kaumudākhyasya yāvanmāsasya taddinam |
tapasā yoganidrāyāḥ santuṣṭo <saṃtuṣṭo> jagadīśvaraḥ || 12.206
yoganidrāṃ prabhajati lokarakṣaṇahetunā |
naimittikān māsimāsi tathā saṃvatsarotsavān || 12.207
viśeṣayāgasaṃyuktān sarvasampūraṇādṛte <sarvasaṃpūraṇādṛte> |
nānyaṃ naimittikaṃ kāmyaṃ kuryān māsacatuṣṭaye || 12.208
abhīṣṭavratam āśritya netavyaṃ taccatuṣṭayam |
bhagavadbhaktiniṣṇātaiḥ kāryaṃ tatredam ucyate || 12.209
prāsādasya purobhāge yad vānyatra munīśvarāḥ |
kalpayec chayanāgāraṃ sarvālaṅkārasaṃyutam <sarvālaṃkārasaṃyutam> || 12.210
sarvopakaraṇair yuktaṃ paryaṅkādyupaśobhitam |
yad vā garbhagṛhe viṣṇor mūlamūrtes tu dakṣiṇe || 12.211
śayanaṃ kalpayed viprāḥ sarvopakaraṇaiḥ saha |
saṃgṛhya sarvasambhārān <sarvasaṃbhārān> daśamyāṃ dvijasattamāḥ || 12.212
ekādaśyāṃ niśi vibhuṃ catussthāneṣu pūjayet |
yāgamaṇṭapam āsādya jāgareṇa nayen niśām || 12.213
brāhme muhūrte samprāpte <saṃprāpte> kṛtasnānaḥ kṛtāhnikaḥ |
nityārcanaṃ purā kṛtvā catussthānārcanaṃ tathā || 12.214
tato visṛjya deveśaṃ kumbhamaṇḍalakuṇḍamam |
arghyeṇa gandhapuṣpābhyāṃ dhūpena suśubhena ca || 12.215
mūlamūrtiṃ samabhyarcya tasmāc chayanakautuke |
kūrce vā devam āvāhya śrībhūmibhyāṃ samanvitam || 12.216
saṃsnāpya samalaṃkṛtya <samalaṅkṛtya> abhyarcya havirantimam |
niśāmukhe pravṛtte tu kṛtvā nityārcanaṃ vibhoḥ || 12.217
tatas tu śayanāgāraṃ nītvā śayanakautukam |
tataḥ śayanadeśe tu paścime hemaviṣṭare || 12.218
niveśya prāṅmukhaṃ devaṃ havirantaṃ samarcayet |
homaṃ vidhāya vidhivat kṛtvā homasamarpaṇam || 12.219
paryaṅkenantam <paryaṅke 'nantam> āvāhya tasmin devaṃ yathāvidhi |
śāyayitvātha tasyāgre niyamān śāstracoditān || 12.220
saṅkalpya <saṃkalpya> caturo māsān devasyotthāpanāvadhi |
vratānuṣṭhānanirataḥ pratyahaṃ devam arcayet || 12.221
sarve 'pi vaiṣṇavāḥ kuryus tadādi vratam uttamam |
śayanāṅgopacāraiś ca pratyahaṃ toṣayed vibhum || 12.222
evaṃ māsadvaye yāte māsi bhādrapade dvijāḥ |
dvādaśyāṃ śuklapakṣasya deśikendro niśāmukhe || 12.223
viśeṣayāgapūrvaṃ tu parivartanam ācaret |
prabodhanaṃ tataḥ kuryāt śayanasthasya vai vibhoḥ || 12.224
dvādaśyāṃ śuklapakṣasya kārtike māsi tu dvijāḥ |
daśamyāṃ pūrvavat sarvasambhārān <sarvasaṃbhārān> samupārjya ca || 12.225
ekādaśyāṃ niśāyāṃ tu catuḥsthānasthitaṃ vibhum |
samabhyarcya viśeṣeṇa jāgareṇa nayen niśām || 12.226
brāhme muhūrte dvādaśyāṃ mantramūrtiṃ prabodhayet |
nityārcanaṃ purā kṛtvā catuḥsthānārcanaṃ tathā || 12.227
tataḥ śayanamūrtiṃ ca samabhyarcya viśeṣataḥ |
snānādihavirantaṃ tu garbhagehe praveśayet || 12.228
visarjayen mūlamūrtau mantraṃ śayanamūrtigam |
tatas tu cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ devībhyāṃ samalaṃkṛtam <samalaṅkṛtam> || 12.229
rathādike samāropya yātropakaraṇaiḥ saha |
grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā svasthāne sanniveśayet <saṃniveśayet> || 12.230
tato visarjayed devaṃ kumbhamaṇḍalakuṇḍagam |
tadā cāśramiṇaḥ sarve kuryur vratavisarjanam || 12.231
yajamāno 'tha gurvādīn sādhakān brāhmaṇān api |
hiraṇyais toṣayet sarvān yathāśakti dvijottamāḥ || 12.232
ity evamuktaṃ devasya śayanaṃ ca prabodhanam |
śayanasthe jagannāthe cāturmāsasya madhyataḥ || 12.233
pavitrārohaṇaṃ kuryād anantasyātituṣṭidam |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
pakṣotsavavidhir nāma
dvādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ




atha trayodaśo 'dhyāyaḥ

nāradaḥ
janmotsavaṃ ca kṛṣṇasya śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
kṛṣṇajanmadinaṃ tv etad dvividhaṃ parikīrtitam || 13.1
janmāṣṭamī jayantīti tayor bhedas tu kathyate |
candrodaye 'ṣṭamīyuktā saptamīkalayā vinā || 13.2
rohiṇīrahitā vāpi sā hi janmāṣṭamī smṛtā |
sihmaṃ <siṃhaṃ> gaterke <gate 'rke> sā mukhyā yad vā śrāvaṇamātragā || 13.3
tasyām abhyarcanaṃ viṣṇor dharmakāmārthasiddhidam |
niṣkāmo yadi kaivalyaphaladaṃ bhavati dhruvam || 13.4
sūryodaye 'pi saptamyā tathā kṛttikayāpi ca |
kalayāpi hy aviddhā yā rohiṇī dvijapuṅgavāḥ <dvijapuṃgavāḥ> || 13.5
aṣṭamīsahitā vāpi aṣṭamīrahitāpi vā |
tathaiva budhavāreṇa sahitā rahitāpi vā || 13.6
jayantī nāma sā proktā jayaty aśubham ity asau |
aṣṭamyāṃ vā navamyāṃ vā daśamyāṃ vāpi rohiṇī || 13.7
aviddhā yadi labhyeta kalāmātrāpi vaiṣṇavaiḥ |
grāhyā kadāpi viddhā tu na grāhyā vaiṣṇavottamaiḥ || 13.8
mṛgaśīrṣaṃ tu vā grāhyaṃ śuddharkṣasya hy abhāvataḥ |
sihmabhādrapade <siṃhabhādrapade> mukhyā jayantī siṃhagāpi vā || 13.9
tasmin māse muniśreṣṭhā yadā ṛkṣadvayaṃ bhavet |
paratraivotsavaṃ kuryān mahāpātakanāśanam || 13.10
paścāc ced rohiṇī viddhā pūrvatraiva samācaret |
evam eva hi saṅkrāntivedhatyāgo <saṃkrāntivedhatyāgo> 'pi śasyate || 13.11
divā saṅkrāntiyogaś <saṃkrāntiyogaś> cej jayantīṃ pūrvatas tyajet |
parato niśi yoge tu tyajed yogānvitām api || 13.12
ubhayoḥ krāntivedhaś cej jayantyor munisattamāḥ |
utsavaṃ mṛgaśīrṣe vā pūrvam eva samācaret || 13.13
evaṃ jayantyāṃ rāmasya narasiṃhavarāhayoḥ |
vāmanādijayantyām apy evam eva vinirṇayaḥ || 13.14
jayantyāṃ tatra kṛṣṇasya divopoṣya viśeṣataḥ |
rātrāvabhyarcanaṃ kuryāt tadvidhānam ihocyate || 13.15
nityakarmāṇi nirvartya sāyaṃ deśikasattamaḥ |
bhagavadgṛham āsādya kṛtvā nityārcanaṃ purā || 13.16
prāsādasya purobhāge maṇṭapaṃ parikalpayet |
kḷptaṃ vā paṇṭapaṃ pūrvam alaṅkuryād <alaṃkuryād> viśeṣataḥ || 13.17
caturdvārasamāyuktaṃ dhvajatoraṇabhūṣitam |
vitānair vividhaiś citraiḥ sarvataḥ pariśobhitam || 13.18
paritaś citrakauśeyamahāyavanikānvitam |
muktāsaraiś ca vividhapuṣpamālyair virājitam || 13.19
kadalījambujambīranālikeraphalādibhiḥ |
rambhāstambhaiḥ pūgaphalastabakaiḥ samalaṅkṛtam <samalaṃkṛtam> || 13.20
darpaṇair dīpamālābhiḥ śobhitaṃ dhūpadhūpitam |
kuṅkumāgarukastūrīsamāliptamahītalam || 13.21
sudhācūrṇādibhiś citraiḥ paritaḥ samalaṃkṛtam <samalaṅkṛtam> |
madhye pravilasaddivyaratnaviṣṭaraśobhitam || 13.22
evaṃ pūrvam alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> maṇṭapaṃ tu tataḥ param |
kṛṣṇabimbaṃ smānīya vinyased bhadraviṣṭare || 13.23
arghyādibhiḥ samabhyarcya tatas tu tadanujñayā |
puṣpāṅkuraṃ nidhāyātha rakṣābandhaṃ samācaret || 13.24
devasyaiśānabhāge tu mahākumbhaṃ tu vinyaset |
maṇḍalaṃ tu purobhāge samālikhya yathāvidhi || 13.25
maṇṭapasya purobhāge kuṇḍaṃ tu parikalpayet |
evaṃ sarvaṃ samāpādya yāvaccandrodayaṃ guruḥ || 13.26
devasya dakṣiṇe pārśve japannaṣṭākṣaraṃ manum |
gāpayan kṛṣṇamāhātmyaṃ tathānyā vaiṣṇavīḥ kathāḥ || 13.27
gānair nṛttair vinodaiś ca toṣayej jagatāṃ patim |
udite tu niśānāthe janmakāle jagatpateḥ || 13.28
kumbhe ca maṇḍale kṛṣṇaṃ yathoktavidhinā yajet |
tato bimbe samabhyarcya devaṃ mantrāsanāntimam || 13.29
ekāśītighaṭair devaṃ snāpayed dhomapūrvakam |
pañcaviṃśatikumbhair vā snāpayet tu yathāvidhi || 13.30
alaṅkārāsanaṃ nītvā samabhyarcya viśeṣataḥ|
kṛtvā nīrājanāntaṃ ca tato bhojyāsanaṃ nayet || 13.31
arghādibhiḥ samabhyarcya arhaṇaṃ ca samarpayet |
madhuparkaṃ nivedyātha navanītaṃ ca śarkarām || 13.32
gokṣīraṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ phalāni vividhāni ca |
pṛthukādīṃś copahārān guḍakhaṇḍānvitān api || 13.33
māṣair mudgais tilayavair dadhimadhvājyadugdhakaiḥ |
haridrājīrakailādyair yojitāni viśeṣataḥ || 13.34
vividhāni ca bhakṣyāṇi goghṛtaiḥ pācitāni ca |
kramād aṣṭavidhānnāni suśṛtaṃ kṣīram uttamam || 13.35
śītalaṃ tarpaṇajalaṃ pānakaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |
bhakṣyaṃ bhojyaṃ tathā lehyaṃ peyaṃ cāpi hy anekaśaḥ || 13.36
nivedya devadevāya mātrāntaṃ deśikottamaḥ |
mukhavāsasamopetaṃ tāmbūlaṃ vinivedya ca || 13.37
kṛtvātha japayajñāntaṃ gatvā kuṇḍasamīpakam |
tatra pratiṣṭhitāgnau tu yogapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet || 13.38
tanmadhye kṛṣṇam āvāhya sakalīkṛtya mantravit |
kṛtvā saptasamiddhomaṃ tataḥ pūrṇāṃ nivedayet || 13.39
tato devaṃ visṛjyāgner agniṃ ca visṛjed guruḥ |
tatas tu devadevāya kṛtvā homasamarpaṇam || 13.40
arghyadānaṃ viśeṣeṇa kuryāt sarvaphalapradam |
tadvidhānaṃ pravakṣyāmi devasya purato bhuvi || 13.41
gomayenopalipyātha vṛttākāraṃ suśobhanam |
sudhācūrṇair alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> gandhapuṣpākṣataiḥ phalaiḥ || 13.42
tanmaṇḍale tu rohiṇyā saha candraṃ samarcayet |
tatas tasmai namaskuryān mantreṇānena vai dvijāḥ || 13.43
jyotsnāṃpate namas tubhyaṃ namas te jyotiṣāṃ pate |
namas te rohiṇīkānta sudhākumbha namo 'stu te || 13.44
iti candraṃ namaskṛtya dadyād arghyaṃ tataḥ param |
śaṅkhe toyaṃ samāpūrya gokṣīreṇa vimiśritam || 13.45
śaṅkhāgre candram abhyarcya tanmūle kṛṣṇam arcayet |
hastābhyāṃ śaṅkham ādāya sapuṣpaphalacandanam || 13.46
jānubhyām avaniṃ spṛṣṭvā candrāyārghyaṃ nivedayet |
kṣīrodārṇavasambhūta <kṣīrodārṇavasaṃbhūta> atrinetrasamudbhava || 13.47
gṛhāṇārghyaṃ śaśāṅkedaṃ rohiṇyā sahito mama |
iti candrāyārghyadānaṃ kṛṣṇasantoṣakāraṇam <kṛṣṇasaṃtoṣakāraṇam> || 13.48
prīṇanaṃ sarvadevānāṃ sarvasasyavivṛddhidam |
kṛṣṇāyārghyaṃ tato dadyān mantreṇānena vai dvijāḥ || 13.49
jātaḥ kaṃsavadhārthāya bhūbhārottāraṇāya ca |
pāṇḍavānāṃ hitārthāya dharmasaṃsthāpanāya ca || 13.50
kauravāṇāṃ vināśāya daityānāṃ nidhanāya ca |
gṛhāṇārghyaṃ mayā dattaṃ devakyā sahito hare || 13.51
iti kṛṣṇāyārghyadānaṃ rājarāṣṭrābhivṛddhidam |
sarvasampatkaraṃ <sarvasaṃpatkaraṃ> caiva sarvalokahitārthakṛt || 13.52
yajamāno 'pi vā dadyād arghyam evaṃ jagatprabhoḥ |
iha sarvābhīṣṭasiddhyai paratra ca sukhāptaye || 13.53
tatkāle deśikādibhyo gobhūsvarṇāny anekaśaḥ |
dadyād devasya santuṣṭyai <saṃtuṣṭyai> yajamāno viśeṣataḥ || 13.54
athopahārair vividhais tāmbūlādyaiś ca deśikaḥ |
japastotrādibhiś caiva toṣayet tu śriyaḥ patim || 13.55
niveditānnabhakṣyādīn caturdhā vibhajet tataḥ |
ācāryaḥ svayam ādadyād ekāṃśaṃ tu tatas tribhiḥ || 13.56
mūrtipān vaiṣṇavān anyān bhaktān bhāgavatottamān |
toṣayitvā tataḥ sarvāṃs tāmbūlādyaiś ca toṣayet || 13.57
kumbhasthaṃ maṇḍalasthaṃ ca prāgvad devaṃ visarjayet |
tatas tu devadevasya śayanaṃ kārayed guruḥ || 13.58
ramye tu maṇṭape ḍolāṃ kṛtvā maṇimayīṃ śubhām |
mṛdūpadhānatūlāḍhyāṃ svarṇarajjuvilambitām || 13.59
sauvarṇakiṅkaṇīyuktāṃ muktādāmavilambitām |
kastūrīkuṅkumādyaiś ca vāsitāṃ dhūpadhūpitām || 13.60
tatrānantaṃ samabhyarcya devam āropayed guruḥ |
śayanāsanabhogais tu devaṃ tatra samarcayet || 13.61
evaṃ hi śayanāntaṃ tu kṛtvā caikadinotsavam |
anuyāgaṃ tataḥ kuryād ācāryo vaiṣṇavaiḥ saha || 13.62
vaiṣṇavānām utsavānte pāraṇaṃ vihitaṃ dvijāḥ |
yad vā phalecchayā kāryaṃ pāraṇaṃ tu parehani || 13.63
tato 'vaśiṣṭayāminyām ācāryo devasannidhau <devasaṃnidhau> |
bhaktair bhāgavataiḥ sārdhaṃ gāpayan vaiṣṇavīḥ kathāḥ || 13.64
gānair nṛttais tathā hāsyair jāgareṇa nayen niśām |
tataḥ prabhāte tv ācāryaḥ kṛtasnānaḥ kṛtāhnikaḥ || 13.65
devam utthāpya vidhivan nityapūjāṃ samācaret |
viśeṣeṇārcayed devaṃ snānādyair havirantimaiḥ || 13.66
tataḥ kṛṣṇam alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> vividhair vastrabhūṣaṇaiḥ |
divye tu kuñjare vāśve śibikāyāṃ rathe 'pi vā || 13.67
samāropya dṛḍhīkṛtya hy alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ |
utsavaṃ devadevasya kuryād grāmapradakṣiṇam || 13.68
vicitrair dāruravitaiś catusstambhair manoharaiḥ |
citravastravitānāḍhyaiḥ phalapallavasaṃyutaiḥ || 13.69
madhyālambikṣīraghaṭair navanītaghatānvitaiḥ |
dadhibhāṇḍānvitaiś caiva toraṇair vividhais tadā || 13.70
citradhvajapatākābhiḥ puṣpamālāśatānvitaiḥ |
vitānaiḥ phalabhāraiś ca rambhāstambhādibhis tathā || 13.71
alaṅkṛtāsu <alaṃkṛtāsu> siktāsu divyakuṅkumavāribhiḥ |
sudhācūrṇālaṃkṛtāsu <sudhācūrṇālaṅkṛtāsu> kīrṇāsu kusumākṣataiḥ || 
13.72
divyadhūpair dhūpitāsu vīdhīṣu dvijasattamāḥ |
śanaiḥ śanair devadevaṃ savilāsaṃ nayet tadā || 13.73
chatradhvajapatākābhir vandibhir gaṇikādibhiḥ |
vādyaghoṣair vedaghoṣair bhaktair bhāgavatottamaiḥ || 13.74
tailaṃ ca rajanīcūrṇaṃ vikiradbhiḥ parasparam |
navanītaṃ ca dadhi ca kṣīraṃ ca kusumādikam || 13.75
kṣipadbhiś ca hasadbhiś ca bhakṣayadbhiś ca kaiścana |
arthīn santoṣayadbhiś <saṃtoṣayadbhiś> ca navanītaghṛtādikaiḥ || 13.76
tāmbūlaṃ rajanīcūrṇaṃ dadadbhiḥ paurayoṣitām |
vikiradbhiḥ puṣpagandhaiḥ kuṅkumaiḥ kṛṣṇam avyayam || 13.77
hastam uddhṛtya kūjadbhis tathā gopālabālakaiḥ |
dadhyādibhāṇḍān bhindadbhiḥ kṛṣṇasya purato bhuvi || 13.78
pibadbhiḥ kṣīradadhyādīn kiradbhiś ca parasparam |
āsvādya navanītaṃ ca kṣipadbhir bahudhā midhaḥ || 13.79
rohadbhis toraṇastambhān nṛtyadbhir garjitair muhuḥ |
ābhīrakulajair yuktaiḥ kṛṣṇānucarabhāvataḥ || 13.80
yantrasthabhāṇḍān daṇḍena tāḍayadbhir muhurmuhuḥ |
tatra bhāṇḍasrutāṃ dhārāṃ pibadbhiś ca pade pade || 13.81
evaṃ krīḍāratair bhaktair vinodair evamādibhiḥ |
grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 13.82
āsthānamaṇṭapaṃ nītvā devaṃ vai hemaviṣṭare |
samāropya samabhyarcya vividhair upahārakaiḥ || 13.83
tāmbūlādyupacāraiś ca devam antaḥ praveśayet |
sakṛt tryahaṃ vā pañcāhaṃ saptāhaṃ vā navāhakam || 13.84
pakṣaṃ māsaṃ tu vā caivam utsavais toṣayed vibhum |
svatantraṃ paratantraṃ vā kṛṣṇam evaṃ samarcayet || 13.85
abhāve kṛṣṇabimbasya tat tat prāsādasaṃsthitam |
devam evārcayed bhaktyā jayantyāṃ tu viśeṣataḥ || 13.86
evaṃ nṛsiṃhaṃ rāmaṃ ca varāhaṃ vāmanādikān |
tattajjanmadine samyagviśeṣasnapanena tu || 13.87
mahatā haviṣā caiva catuḥsthāneṣu pūjayet |
kumbhe ca maṇḍale bimbe vahnau ca yajanaṃ vibhoḥ || 13.88
mukhye kalpe prakurvīta hy anukalpe tu maṇḍalam |
vinā kumbhādiṣu yajed bimbavahnyos tu vā yajet || 13.89
itthaṃ yaḥ kārayed bhaktyā jayanty utsavam uttamam |
ihepsitārthān sampādya <saṃpādya> sāyujyaṃ padam āpnuyāt || 13.90
atha cāśvayuje māsi kartavyaṃ sarvasiddhidam |
vīralakṣmyutsavavidhiṃ vakṣyāmi munisattamāḥ || 13.91
tasmin māsi site pakṣe hy aṣṭamīkalayāpi vā |
aviddhāyāṃ navamyāṃ tu śrīdevyutsavam ācaret || 13.92
tadvāsarānusāreṇa navāhotsavam ācaret |
tithilope hy amāvāsyāṃ ārabhyotsavam ācaret || 13.93
vṛddhau dvitīyām ārabhya navāhotsavam ācaret |
saptāhaṃ vāpi pañcāhaṃ tryaham ekāham eva vā || 13.94
ācared utsavaṃ lakṣmyāḥ phalakāmanayā dvijāḥ |
navāhaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ proktaṃ saptāhaṃ tv ārṣakaṃ bhavet || 13.95
pañcāhaṃ tv aindrakaṃ proktaṃ tryahaṃ śaivam ucyate |
ekāham utsavaṃ brāhmaṃ pañcadhaivaṃ prakīrtitam || 13.96
brāhmaṃ vai brahmasiddhyarthaṃ śaivaṃ rogavināśanam |
aindraṃ durbhikṣanāśārthamārṣaṃ rāṣṭrābhivṛddhidam || 13.97
vaiṣṇavaṃ tūtsavaṃ proktaṃ bhaktimuktiphalapradam <<bhakti� : bhukti�>> |
utsavārambhapūrvedyur niśāyām aṅkurārpaṇam || 13.98
rakṣābandhaṃ ca vidhivat kuryād deśikasattamaḥ |
ārambhe cāvasāne ca adhamottamamārgataḥ || 13.99
saṃsnāpayec chriyaṃ devīṃ śrīmantreṇaiva deśikaḥ |
pratyahaṃ nityapūjānte viśeṣārcanam ācaret || 13.100
kumbhe ca maṇḍale bimbe vahnau cāpi yathāvidhi |
tatra tara viśeṣo yaḥ kathyate samprati <saṃprati> dvijāḥ || 13.101
kumbhārcane śriyaṃ devīṃ madhyakumbhe samarcayet |
sudarśanaṃ tu vardhanyāṃ prāgvad eva samarcayet || 13.102
lakṣmīḥ kīrtir jayā māyā upakumbhāṣṭake dvijāḥ |
prabhavāpyayayogena pūjyāḥ prāgādiṣu kramāt || 13.103
tatra dvārārcanavidhiṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
vāstvīśakṣetrapālau dvau sarvadvāreṣu pūjayet || 13.104
lakṣmīḥ kīrtir jayā māyā dvāreṣūrdhvasthitāḥ kramāt |
sṛṣṭir lajjā jayā māyā sāvitrī ca kṣamā tathā || 13.105
śuddhāśuddhā tathā dve dve prāgādidvāraśākhayoḥ |
tathādidvārakumbheṣu <<�didvāra� : digdvāra�>> jyeṣṭhāvidhyos tathaiva ca || 13.106
śraddhākāntyoḥ kriyāsṛṣṭyoḥ kṣamāmūrtijayākhyayoḥ |
kramād dvandvaprayogeṇa pūjanaṃ tu samācaret || 13.107
caṇḍīṃ caiva pracaṇḍīṃ ca pūrvadvāre prapūjayet |
dakṣiṇottarayogena toraṇastambhamūlayoḥ || 13.108
balākinīṃ dakṣiṇe tu yajec ca vanamālinīm |
vibhīṣikāṃ śāṅkarīṃ <śāṃkarīṃ> ca paścime samprapūjayet 
<saṃprapūjayet> || 13.109
tathaiva cottaradvāre śaṅkhapadmanidhī yajet |
satyādīṃś ca patākāsu indrādīṃś ca yathākramam || 13.110
prāgvad evārcayed viprā ayaṃ dvārārcanakramaḥ |
prātarviśeṣayāgānte utsavaṃ ca samācaret || 13.111
sauvarṇaśibikāyāne atha vā puṣpamaṇṭape |
śriyaṃ devīṃ samāropya hy alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ || 13.112
sarvair yātropakaraṇair nayed grāmapradakṣiṇam |
evaṃ kṛtvotsavaṃ paścāddevīm āsthānamaṇṭape || 13.113
hemapīṭhe samāropya hy alaṅkārāsanoditaiḥ <alaṃkārāsanoditaiḥ> |
bhogaiḥ krameṇa sampūjya <saṃpūjya> nayed bhojyāsanaṃ tataḥ || 13.114
arghyādīn arhaṇaṃ cāpi madhuparkaṃ samarpayet |
mudgānnapāyasādīni bhakṣyāṇi vividhāni ca || 13.115
pṛthukādīṃś copahārān śriyai devyai nivedayet |
śītalaṃ tarpaṇaṃ caiva nālikerarasaṃ tathā || 13.116
samarpya dadyāt tāmbūlaṃ mukhavāsasamanvitam |
japayajñaṃ tataḥ kuryāl lakṣmīmantreṇa mantravit || 13.117
niveditaṃ tu yaddravyaṃ caturdhā vibhajet tataḥ |
teṣv ekāṃśaṃ samādāya ācāryāya pradāpayet || 13.118
śiṣṭānaṃśāṃs tathā sarvān bhaktebhyaś ca pradāpayet |
stotraiś ca vividhair nṛttaiḥ gītair vādyaravaiḥ saha || 13.119
tadā santoṣayel <saṃtoṣayel> lakṣmīṃ sarvābhīṣṭaphalapradām |
evaṃ kṛtvā tato lakṣmīṃ prāsādāntaḥ praveśayet || 13.120
evaṃ pratidinaṃ kuryān navamyantaṃ mahotsavam |
sāyaṃ prātaś catuḥsthānapūjanena samanvitam || 13.121
navamīdivase prāpte prāgvatkṛtvotsavādikam |
rātrau viśeṣayāgānte kuṇḍamaṇḍalamadhyagām || 13.122
śriyaṃ visṛjya hṛdaye kumbhaṃ devyās tu sannidhim <saṃnidhim> |
samānīya samabhyarcya śriyaṃ śrīsūktam uccaran || 13.123
kumbhatoyena samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> kautukaṃ ca visṛjya ca |
havirantaṃ samabhyarcya praṇipatya kṣamāpayet || 13.124
yajamāno dakṣiṇābhir ācāryādīn pratoṣayet |
evaṃ yaḥ kārayed bhaktyā mahānavamikotsavam || 13.125
āyuṣyārogyam aiśvaryaṃ tejaḥ kīrtiṃ ca santatim <saṃtatim> |
sarvābhīṣṭāṃś ca samprāpya <saṃprāpya> brahmasāyujyam āpnuyāt || 13.126
tadanyedyur daśamyāṃ tu devasya mṛgayotsavam |
vakṣyamāṇena vidhinā kuryād rāṣṭrābhivṛddhidam || 13.127
navamyām eva devasya turagaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |
alaṅkṛtaṃ tathāstraughaṃ devasya dhanurādikam || 13.128
vāhayaṃs tu nadītīraṃ sarastīram athāpi vā |
samānīyātha saṃsnāpya turagaṃ cāyudhādikam || 13.129
alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa mālyair vastrādikais tathā |
chatradhvajapatākādyair nṛttavādyaravaiḥ saha || 13.130
grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ nītvā ālayaṃ sampraveśayet <saṃpraveśayet> |
tatra devasya turagaṃ tārkṣyamantreṇa mantravit || 13.131
samabhyarcyārghyagandhādyair havirantaṃ samarcayet |
āyudhāny arcayet tadvat tattanmantreṇa deśikaḥ || 13.132
daśamyāṃ devadevasya kṛtvā nityārcanaṃ purā |
yātrāmūrtigataṃ devaṃ nayed āsthānamaṇṭapam || 13.133
taṃ devaṃ tatra saṃsnāpya pañcaviṃśatibhir ghaṭaiḥ |
alaṅkārāsane <alaṃkārāsane> 'bhyarcya nivedya ca mahāhaviḥ || 13.134
devam aśve samāropya tatas tu mṛgayocitaiḥ |
alaṅkārair <alaṃkārair> alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> yātropakaraṇaiḥ saha || 13.135
bhaktair bhāgavataiḥ sārdhaṃ sannaddhaiḥ <saṃnaddhaiḥ> sāyudhair bhaṭaiḥ |
mahāvanaṃ samānīya tatra tatra viśeṣataḥ || 13.136
vānaprasthais tāpasādyair arpitāni ca bhaktitaḥ |
kandamūlaphalādīni vividhāḥ kusumasrajaḥ || 13.137
samarpya devadevāya vahnivṛkṣasamīpataḥ |
nītvā pradakṣiṇīkṛtya devaṃ tatra prapādike || 13.138
bhadrāsane samāveśya vahnivṛkṣasya mūlataḥ |
āyudhāni samabhyarcya puṇyāhoktipurassaram || 13.139
śamīpatraṃ tu saṅgṛhya <saṃgṛhya> mūlamantreṇa deśikaḥ |
datvā devasya śirasi arghyādyaiḥ samprapūjya <saṃprapūjya> ca || 13.140
tāmbūlaṃ vinivedyātha deśikas tadanujñayā |
dhanurbāṇān samādāya sarvadigvijayāya ca || 13.141
sarvaśatruvināśāya rājarāṣṭrābhivṛddhaye |
caturdikṣu caturbāṇān ūrdhve 'dhaś ca śaradvayam || 13.142
prayuñjed astramantreṇa dhanvanāgeti vā ṛcā |
tato 'rcayed devadevaṃ vividhair upahārakaiḥ || 13.143
sāyaṅkāle <sāyaṃkāle> tu samprāpte <saṃprāpte> āropyāśve jagatprabhum |
pradīpaśatasaṃyuktaṃ nānāvādyasamanvitam || 13.144
grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ devaṃ mandirāntaḥ praveśayet |
deveśaṃ navabhiḥ kumbhaiḥ snāpyālaṃkṛtya <snāpyālaṅkṛtya> deśikaḥ || 13.145
śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ saha vibhuṃ havirantaṃ samarcayet |
evaṃ daśamyāṃ kartavyam utsavaṃ ca prakīrtitam || 13.146
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi dīpotsavam anuttamam |
vṛścikasthe dinakare paurṇamāsī tu yā dvijāḥ || 13.147
caturdaśyā bharaṇyāś ca kalayāpy aruṇodaye |
aviddhā kṛttikāyuktā hy ayuktā vā munīśvarāḥ || 13.148
tasyāṃ vṛṣabhakāle tu dīpāropaṇam ācaret |
dvayor ahnoḥ saṅgatiś <saṃgatiś> cet parvaṇas tv antime dine || 13.149
grāhyaṃ parva kālāmātram api dīpotsavādike |
dīpaṃ kuryāt pratipadi tv alabdhau śuddhaparvaṇaḥ || 13.150
parvadvaye tu samprāpte <saṃprāpte> tasmin māse dvijottamāḥ |
dīpotsavaṃ tu māsāntaparvaṇy eva samācaret || 13.151
tasmin saṅkrāntiduṣṭe <saṃkrāntiduṣṭe> tu pūrvam eva samācaret |
ubhayatrāpi saṅkrāntau <saṃkrāntau> kṛttikābhiḥ samanvite || 13.152
parvaṇy eva muniśreṣṭhā dīpāropaṇam ācaret |
parvadvayaṃ kṛttikābhir ayuktaṃ cet tadā dvijāḥ || 13.153
rohiṇyā vāpi saṃyukte parvaṇyutsavam ācaret |
rohiṇyā apy ayoge tu tadā māsāntaparvaṇi || 13.154
saṅkrāntiyogaduṣṭe <saṃkrāntiyogaduṣṭe> 'pi dīpāropaṇam ācaret |
atha candroparāgeṇa duṣṭaṃ parva yadi dvijāḥ || 13.155
prākpaścāduparāgasya santyaktvā <saṃtyaktvā> sapta nāḍikāḥ |
dīpaṃ rātryantare kuryād rājarāṣṭrasukhāvaham || 13.156
evaṃ samyagvicāryātha kuryād dīpotsavaṃ budhaḥ |
tadvidhānaṃ vistareṇa vakṣyāmi munisattamāḥ || 13.157
taddine devadevasya mandiraṃ sarvato dvijāḥ |
prāsādabhāgam ārabhya bahirāvaṇāntimam || 13.158
saṃkṣālayec chuddhatoyair brāhmaṇaiḥ paricārakaiḥ |
śalākāsahitair darbhaiḥ sahadevīvimiśritaiḥ || 13.159
mārjayet sarvatas tatrālepayed gomayāmbubhiḥ |
astreṇa prikṣayet paścātpañcagavyakuśāmbubhiḥ || 13.160
sudhācūrṇair alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> vikired akṣatair bhuvam |
vitānaiḥ puṣpamālābhir alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> ca sarvataḥ || 13.161
candanāgarukarpūradhūpaiḥ sarvatra dhūpayet |
tato 'parāhṇe samprāpte <saṃprāpte> deśiko mūrtipaiḥ saha || 13.162
prāsādaṃ sampraviśyātha <saṃpraviśyātha> mūlabimbagataṃ vibhum |
samabhyarcyārghyagandhādyais tasmād utsavakautuke || 13.163
samāvāhya samabhyarcya śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam |
yātrābimbaṃ bhadrapīṭhe niveśyāsthānamaṇṭape || 13.164
puṣpāṅkuraṃ tataḥ kṛtvā mūlabimbādiṣu dvijāḥ |
rakṣābandhaṃ ca vidhivat kṛtvā deśikasattamaḥ || 13.165
catussthānārcanaṃ kuryād yathoktavidhinā tataḥ |
saṃsnāpayet tadā devaṃ pañcaviṃśatibhir ghaṭaiḥ || 13.166
mahatā haviṣā caiva apūpair upahārakaiḥ |
abhyarcya devadeveśaṃ kuryād dīpādhivāsanam || 13.167
mūlabimbasya purato dhānyapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet |
sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ vāpi tāmraṃ mṛṇmayam eva vā || 13.168
dīpapātraṃ samādāya tasminn āḍhakasammitam <āḍhakasaṃmitam> |
gavyam ājyaṃ samāpūrya vartiṃ tanmadhyato nyaset || 13.169
nūtanair vastrakhaṇḍair vā kṛtāṃ kārpāsatantubhiḥ |
tatpātraṃ dhānyapīṭhorthve vinyasya munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 13.170
tatpātraparitaś cāṣṭau śarāvān ghṛtapūritān |
savartikān nyaset tatra prāgādiṣu yathākramam || 13.171
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu prokṣayed astravāriṇā |
pradoṣe dīpapātrāṇi vāhayan dīkṣitair dvijaiḥ || 13.172
gatvā kuṇḍasamīpaṃ tu tatra kuṇḍasthavahninā |
dīpān prajvālya netreṇa vāhayan brāhmaṇais tadā || 13.173
vedaghoṣair vādyaghoṣaiḥ sākaṃ dhāmapradakṣiṇam |
kṛtvā devasya purataḥ prāgvatpīṭhe tu vinyaset || 13.174
netreṇa vāgnimantreṇa dīpam arghyādibhir yajet |
tataḥ śubhe muhūrte tu vṛṣalagne gurūttamaḥ || 13.175
devam arghyādinābhyarcya dīpapātraṃ samujvalam |
ādāya netramantreṇa uddīpyasveti vā ṛcā || 13.176
pradarśya devadevāya sarvamaṅgalasaṃyutam |
paricārakahaste taddīpaṃ datvā tato guruḥ || 13.177
tena dvāreṣu sarveṣu maṇṭapāvaraṇeṣu ca |
vinyastā dīpikāḥ sarvā dīpayed dvijapuṅgavāḥ <dvijapuṃgavāḥ> || 13.178
tadānīm autsavaṃ bimbaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam |
yānam āropya vastrādyair alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ || 13.179
yātropakaraṇaiḥ sārdhaṃ pradīpānāṃ sahasrakaiḥ |
adhīyānair dvijaśreṣṭhair mantrānanaladevatān || 13.180
prathamāvaraṇādyeṣu sarveṣv āvaraṇeṣv api |
bhrāmayed devadeveśaṃ prādakṣiṇyena vai dvijāḥ || 13.181
devasyotsavavelāyāṃ sarvatrāvaraṇādiṣu |
dīpā nānāvidhākārāḥ kalpanīyāḥ samantataḥ || 13.182
tathā prāsādadigbhāge maṇṭape gopureṣu ca |
śriyādīnāṃ mandireṣu parivārālayeṣu ca || 13.183
dhanadhānyādigeheṣu tathā puṣpālayādike |
dīpāropaṃ tadā kuryād yātrābimbasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> || 13.184
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ gopuradvāram ānayet |
tatra dvijā vakṣyamāṇaṃ viṣṇudīpaṃ prakalpayet || 13.185
śailajaṃ lohajaṃ vāpi dārujaṃ vā yathāruci |
prāsādocchrāyamānaṃ vā śatatālam athāpi vā || 13.186
tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā dīpastambhaṃ samācaret |
caturdhā vibhajet stambhaṃ ekāṃśaṃ caturaśrakam || 13.187
tryaṃśaṃ tūrdhve ṣoḍaśāśram aṣṭāśraṃ vṛttam eva vā |
ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā trihastaṃ vā ghanaṃ tathā || 13.188
stambhāgre caturaśraṃ ca pīṭhaṃ kuryāt sapadmakam |
tathā stambham alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> patrapuṣpalatācayaiḥ || 13.189
āhṛtyaivaṃvidhaṃ stambhaṃ bahirdvārasya bāhyataḥ |
saṃsthāpayed antarālaṃ stambhagopurayor bhavet || 13.190
dvātriṃśaddhastamānaṃ vā caturviṃśatkaraṃ tu vā |
rathayātrāvirodhena tato 'py adhikam eva vā || 13.191
yad vā stambhaṃ gopurāntaḥ sthāpayen munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
pīṭhagopurayor madhye yad vā stambhaṃ prakalpayet || 13.192
stambhamūle caturhastaṃ trihastaṃ vāyataṃ dvijāḥ |
tāvanmānena vistīrṇaṃ dvitrihastocchritaṃ dvijāḥ || 13.193
sārdhahastocchritaṃ vāpi caturaśraṃ tu pīṭhakam |
śilābhir iṣṭakābhir vā kalpayen munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 13.194
stambhādhastāt pūrvabhāge siṃhaṃ dakṣe tu mārutim |
paścime vainateyaṃ cāpyuttare haṃsam ālikhet || 13.195
evaṃ kṛte dīpadaṇḍe yathāśāstraṃ suśobhane |
muhūrte tārkṣyamantreṇa pūrvam eva pratiṣṭhate || 13.196
tadā pūrvoditaṃ dīpapātram āropayed dvijaiḥ |
ity eva viṣṇudīpasya vidhānaṃ samprakīrtitam <saṃprakīrtitam> || 13.197
evaṃ kṛtvā tato devaṃ nayed grāmapradakṣiṇam |
tatra tatra grāmavīthyāṃ dīpāropaṇam ācaret || 13.198
tīrthatīreṣu codyāne kūpatīrādiṣu dvijāḥ |
catvareṣu ca sarvatra dīpāropaṇam ācaret || 13.199
gṛhe gṛhe tathā kuryād gamayan sarvavīdhikāḥ |
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 13.200
āsthānamaṇṭape bhadraviṣṭare sanniveśya <saṃniveśya> tu |
arghyādibhiḥ samabhyarcya apūpānupahārakān || 13.201
pāyasādīn tathā lājān tāmbūlādīn nivedayet |
agnau santarpayed <saṃtarpayed> devaṃ prāyaścittāhutīs tathā || 13.202
ghṛtenāṣṭottaraśataṃ juhuyād deśikottamaḥ |
tato visarjayed devaṃ kuṇḍamaṇḍalamadhyagam || 13.203
kumbhasamprokṣaṇādīṃs <kumbhasaṃprokṣaṇādīṃs> tu prāgvad eva samācaret |
tatas tu cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ prāsādāntaḥ praveśayet || 13.204
tatra cāvāhitāṃ śaktiṃ punarmūle niyojayet |
yajamāno dakṣiṇābhir ācāryādīn pratoṣayet || 13.205
evaṃ yaḥ kārayed bhaktyā dīpotsavam anuttamam |
iha loke sukhaṃ prāpya paraloke mahīyate || 13.206
kārtikyāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ hi kartavyam idam utsavam |
toṣakṛd devadevasya vistareṇa prakīrtitam || 13.207
kātrike māsi viprendrāḥ śuklaikādaśikā tu yā |
tasyām upoṣya rātryāṃ tu jāgareṇa jagatpatim || 13.208
tatkālocitarāgotthais toṣayitvā tu gītakaiḥ |
brāhme muhūrte samprāpte <saṃprāpte> viśeṣeṇa yajed vibhum || 13.209
saṃśrāvayed gītakāni stotrāṇi vividhāḥ kathāḥ |
homāvasānaṃ sarvaṃ tu saviśeṣaṃ samācaret || 13.210
tatkāle ye ca gāyanti tac ca śṛṇvanti ye janāḥ |
teṣāṃ puṇyaphalāvāptiṃ kaḥ śaknoty abhivarṇitum || 13.211
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi mārgaśīrṣotsavaṃ param |
kodaṇḍasthe dinakare tatkāle saṅkrame <saṃkrame> dvijāḥ || 13.212
saṃsnāpya devadeveśam adhamottamamārgataḥ |
alaṅkārāsanaṃ <alaṃkārāsanaṃ> nītvā hy arghyādyaiḥ paripūjya ca || 13.213
vāsobhir bhūṣaṇair mālyair gandhaiḥ kastūrikādibhiḥ |
alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> ca deveśaṃ viṣvaksenādikāṃs tathā || 13.214
tathaiva bhaktabimbāṃś ca saṃsnāpya navabhir ghaṭaiḥ |
alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣaṇa yajed arghyādibhiḥ kramāt || 13.215
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ nītvā bhojyāsanaṃ śubham |
mudgānnaṃ pāyasānnaṃ ca śarkarāghṛtasaṃyutam || 13.216
nānāvidhāni bhakṣyāṇi vividhāni phalāni ca |
tāmbūlaṃ mukhavāsaṃ ca vinivedya yathāvidhi || 13.217
niveditānnabhakṣyādīn viṣvaksenādikasya ca |
bhaktānāṃ ca nivedyātha devadevaṃ śriyaḥ patim || 13.218
pradakṣiṇīkṛtya tadā praṇamya ca yathāvidhi |
toṣayed vaiṣṇavair devaṃ stotrair nānāvidhais tadā || 13.219
saṃskṛtair drāmiḍair vāpi devapāramyasūcakaiḥ |
mānasaṃ dhyānam ity uktaṃ kāyikaṃ karma cocyate || 13.220
vācikaṃ stotram ity uktaṃ trividhais toṣayet prabhum |
tatas tu vaiṣṇavāgryāṇāṃ vaiṣṇavastutigāyinām || 13.221
tīrthaṃ niveditānnādīn dadyād devasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> |
vaiṣṇavā bhagavadbhaktā gṛhītvā vinayānvitāḥ || 13.222
pītvā tīrthaṃ prasādaṃ ca bhakṣeyur devasannidhau <devasaṃnidhau> |
ārabhya saṅkramād <saṃkramād> evaṃ māsāntaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ 
<munipuṃgavāḥ> || 13.223
aruṇasyodayāt pūrvaṃ samārādhya yathāvidhi |
mudgānnapāyasānnādīn bhakṣyāṇi vividhāni ca || 13.224
nivedayec ca devāya bhaktebhyaś ca dine dine |
bhaktapraṇītagādhābhiḥ stuvīta puruṣottamam || 13.225
tasmin māse viśeṣeṇa devadevasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> |
sarpiṣā tilatailair vā dīpāropaṇam ācaret || 13.226
triṃśaddine viśeṣeṇa dīpam āropayet tu yaḥ |
iha bhuktvākhilān bhogān viṣṇulokaṃ sa gacchati || 13.227
evaṃ triṃśaddinaṃ kuryād arcanaṃ tv aruṇodaye |
tasminn antye daśadine viśeṣotsavam ācaret || 13.228
utsavārambhapūrvedyur niśāyām aṅkurārpaṇam |
rakṣābandhaṃ ca vidhivat kṛtvā deśikasattamaḥ || 13.229
utsavārambhadivasādārabhyāntyadināvidhi |
catussthānārcanaṃ kuryāt sāyamprātaryathāvidhi || 13.230
ārambhe cāvasāne ca snapanaṃ prāgvad ācaret |
dvitīyāvaraṇādau vā gopurād bahir eva vā || 13.231
kalpayed devadevasya mahāmaṇṭapam uttamam |
vitānaiḥ phalapuṣpaiś ca darpaṇaiś cāmarādibhiḥ || 13.232
alaṅkuryād <alaṃkuryād> viśeṣeṇa yathālocanasupriyam |
madhyāhne devadeveśaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam || 13.233
śibikāyāṃ samāropya hy alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ |
viṣvaksenādibhiś caiva bhaktabimbādibhiḥ saha || 13.234
yātropakaraṇaiḥ sārthaṃ kṛtvā grāmapradakṣiṇam |
mahāmaṇṭapam ānīya tatra vai siṃhaviṣṭare || 13.235
devam āropya devībhyāṃ viṣvaksenādikān api |
devasyābhimukhaṃ sthāpya hy alaṅkārāsanoditaiḥ <alaṃkārāsanoditaiḥ> || 13.236
bhogair devaṃ samabhyarcya bhaktabimbāṃś ca deśikaḥ |
sadāgamādikān vedāṃs tathā divyāś ca siṃhitāḥ || 13.237
itihāsapurāṇāni stotraṃ daivaṃ ca mānuṣam |
vedopabṛṃhaṇaṃ cānyatsaṃskṛtaṃ prākṛtaṃ tu vā || 13.238
bhāṣāntaragataṃ vāpi tadā saṃśrāvayed vibhum |
tatas tv aṣṭavidhānnāni bhakṣyāṇi vividhāni ca || 13.239
pṛthukān nālikerekṣukadalīcaṇakādikān |
nālīkerodakādīni tāmbūlam upahārakān || 13.240
nivedya devadevāya bhaktebhyaś ca yathākramam |
niveditānnabhakṣyādīn vaiṣṇavebhyaḥ pradāpayet || 13.241
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam |
śibikāyāṃ samāropya bhaktabimbādibhiḥ saha || 13.242
savilāsaṃ nayet tatra maṇṭape dvijasattamāḥ |
tatkāle bhaktabimbānāṃ sanmānaṃ ca samācaret || 13.243
vedaghoṣaiḥ stotraghoṣair gadyapadyātmakaiḥ stavaiḥ |
vīṇāveṇuravaiś caiva nṛttagītādibhiḥ saha || 13.244
maṇṭapaṃ dviḥ paribhrāmya punaḥ siṃhāsane vibhum |
samāropya samabhyarcya sāyaṅkāle <sāyaṃkāle> viśeṣataḥ || 13.245
catuḥsahasrikām ādyāṃ drāmiḍīṃ stutim uttamām |
gāpayed vaiṣṇavais tatra naivedyānte dine dine || 13.246
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ pūrvoktavidhinā dvijāḥ |
dhāmapradakṣiṇaṃ nītvā mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 13.247
āsthānamaṇṭapaṃ nītvā kṛtvā nityārcanaṃ vibhoḥ |
catuḥsthānārcanaṃ cāpi kṛtvā svasthānam ānayet || 13.248
evaṃ daśadinaṃ kuryād utsavaṃ munisattamāḥ |
utsavānte tu kumbhādigataṃ devaṃ yathāvidhi || 13.249
visarjayet tato devaṃ praṇipatya kṣamāpayet |
yajamāno akṣiṇābhir ācāryādīn pratoṣayet || 13.250
mārgaśīrṣotsavavidhir ity evaṃ samprakīrtitaḥ <saṃprakīrtitaḥ> |
makarasthe dinakare tatkāle saṅkrame <saṃkrame> dvijāḥ || 13.251
saṃsnāpya devadeveśaṃ pañcaviṃśatibhir ghaṭaiḥ |
alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> viśeṣeṇa havirādīn nivedayet || 13.252
tatkāle yajamānaś ca gobhūsvarṇādikāṃs tathā |
kūśmāṇḍavrīhidānaṃ ca kuryād devasya tuṣṭaye || 13.253
tadanyedyur devadevaṃ samabhyarcya viśeṣataḥ |
aśvaratne samāropya devam utsavabimbagam || 13.254
pūrvoktavidhinā kuryān mṛgayotsavam uttamam |
vane vane samānīya savilāsaṃ jagatpatim || 13.255
tatra tatra viśeṣaṇa samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
mṛgayāṃ kārayet paścāt savinodaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 13.256
varāhavāraṇavyāghrakṛṣṇasāraśaśādikān |
madhye kṛtvā tu paritaḥ senāṃ vinyasya sāyudhām || 13.257
atiśūrabhaṭās tatra madhye saṃviśya yatnataḥ |
jīvagrāhaṃ mṛgān badhvā nayeyur devasannidhim <devasaṃnidhim> || 13.258
tato vimocayet sarvān mṛgān ekaikaśaḥ kramāt |
hatānāṃ vā mṛgāṇāṃ ca bhavet puṇyagatir dhruvam || 13.259
tatas tu devadeveśaṃ maṇṭape vā prapādike |
bhadrāsane samāropya samabhyarcya viśeṣataḥ || 13.260
sāyaṅkāle <sāyaṃkāle> tu samprāpte <saṃprāpte> pūrvoktavibhavaiḥ saha |
grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ nītvā mandirāntaḥ praveśayet || 13.261
saṃsnāpya devadeveśam alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> yathāvidhi |
śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ saha vibhuṃ havirantaṃ samarcayet || 13.262
evaṃ hi devadevasya mṛgayotsava īritaḥ |
pratisaṃvatsaraṃ tv evaṃ devasya sakalotsavān || 13.263
yaḥ kārayati viprendrāḥ sa tu sāmrājyasaṃyutaḥ |
iha loke sukhaṃ bhuktvā ciraṃ bhogān yathepsitān || 13.264
dehasanyāsakāle tu prāpnoti bhagavatpadam |
iti saṅkīrtitāḥ <saṃkīrtitāḥ> samyagdevasya sakalotsavāḥ || 13.265
ito 'nyac chrotum icchā cet kathyatāṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
pakṣotsavādividhir nāma 
trayodaśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha caturdaśo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
śayanasthe jagannāthe cāturmāsyasya madhyataḥ |
pavitrāropaṇaṃ kāryam ity uktaṃ bhavatā purā || 14.1
tadvidhānaṃ vistareṇa vadasva vadatāṃ vara |

nāradaḥ
vakṣye lokahitārthāya pavitrāropaṇakramam || 14.2
śṛṇudhvaṃ sāvadhānena cetasā munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
lopabuddhiṃ vinā yasya bhogānām apy asambhavaḥ <asaṃbhavaḥ> || 14.3
sāmarthyena vinā yasya kṛcchrādīnāṃ paricyutiḥ |
jvarādivyādhidoṣeṇa jāto yasyāhnikakṣayaḥ || 14.4
cāturmāsyasya vāprāptir yasya svātantryato vinā |
tasya tasya mahābuddhe śṛṇu yad vihitaṃ hitam || 14.5
sāṃsparśikānāṃ bhogānāṃ mātrāvittaṃ hi pūraṇam |
hṛdayaṅgam <hṛdayaṃgam> asaṃjñānām annaṃ ca haviṣāplutam || 14.6
aupacārikabhogānāṃ bījāni vihitāni vai |
kṛcchracāndrāyaṇādīnāṃ vratānāṃ paripūrakaḥ || 14.7
viśeṣārcanasaṃyuktaś cāturmāsyasya saṃyamaḥ |
sautraṃ pratisaraṃ citraṃ muktāhāropamaṃ śubham || 14.8
śamaṃ nayati bhaktānāṃ sarvadā lopam āhnikam |
tac ca māsacatuṣkasya madhye kuryāc chubhe dine || 14.9
āṣāḍhapañcadaśyās tu yāvad vai kārtikasya ca |
sampūrṇaṃ <saṃpūrṇaṃ> candradivasaṃ taṃ kālaṃ cāndram antimam || 14.10
ākarkaṭakasaṅkrāntes <ākarkaṭakasaṃkrāntes> tulābhāgakṣayāvadhi |
kālaṃ tam aṣṭapakṣaṃ ca sauraṃ madhyam asaṃjñitam || 14.11
ekādaśyāṃ dinānto yaś cāturmāsyopalakṣitaḥ |
kālaṃ taṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ viddhi tūttamaṃ sarvasiddhidam || 14.12
aprāpter asya kālasya tv antarāyeṇa kenacit |
nirvāhaṇīyo 'py aparaḥ kālaś cāndrāyaṇādinā || 14.13
sampādyaś <saṃpādyaś> caiva tanmadhye vidhivadyāgapūrvakam |
prāsādasyāgrataḥ kuryāt tadarthaṃ maṇṭapaṃ dvijāḥ || 14.14
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇe 'pi vā |
tṛtīyāvaraṇe vātha caturthe pañcame 'pi vā || 14.15
agryālābhe tad anyatra yathā vāñchitadiggatam |
caturaśraṃ samaṃ vāpi prākpaścimadigāyatam || 14.16
saumyayāmyāyataṃ vāpi kartur icchānurūpataḥ |
tathā prāgānanaṃ yad vā yathābhimatadiṅmukham || 14.17
dvāviṃśatidhanurmānaṃ maṇṭapaṃ cottamaṃ bhavet |
aṣṭādaśadhanurmānaṃ maṇṭapaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet || 14.18
adhamaṃ dvādaśadhanurmānaṃ syād atha vā dvijāḥ |
pañcahastāt samārabhya dvidvihastam avardhanāt || 14.19
trisaptakaraparyantaṃ mānair navavidhaṃ bhavet |
yadvottamaṃ daśakaraṃ madhyamaṃ cāṣṭahastakam || 14.20
ṣaḍḍhastaṃ tv adhamaṃ vidyāt kṣudraṃ hastatrayāyatam |
triṃśatkarāvasānaṃ vā ṣaṭkarāt pañcaviṃśatiḥ || 14.21
ekaṃ saṅgṛhya <saṃgṛhya> māneṣu hy eṣu vittānurūpataḥ |
sopapīṭham adhiṣṭhānaṃ kevalaṃ vā masūrakam || 14.22
adhiṣṭhānopari stambhaṃ prastaraṃ ca trivargakam |
kapotapratisaṃyuktaṃ yadvoktākṛtivarjitam || 14.23
ekatripañcasaptādibhittibhedaiḥ samāvṛtam |
pratyaṅgoktair alaṅkārair <alaṃkārair> yuktaṃ vā tadvivarjitam || 14.24
śilayeṣṭakayā vāpi pakvayā vāpy apakvayā |
ekadvāraṃ caturdvāraṃ yad vā dvāradvayānvitam || 14.25
bhittiyuktam ayuktaṃ vā koṇabhittiyutaṃ tu vā |
kevalaṃ vā prapāmātram uktalakṣaṇavarjitam || 14.26
kṣiprakarmaprasiddhyarthaṃ śarakāṣṭhamayaṃ śubham |
gavākṣakānvitaṃ caiva dvārais tu paribhūṣitam || 14.27
channaṃ vitānakenordhve prāsādaṃ parikalpayet |
kṣetrasaṅkocavistārau <kṣetrasaṃkocavistārau> kartur icchānusārataḥ || 14.28
śilpaśāstrānusāreṇa kṛtvaivaṃ maṇṭapaṃ dvijāḥ |
yāgārthaṃ suśubhaṃ viprās tanmadhye 'tha prakalpayet || 14.29
masūrakam adhiṣṭhānaṃ vāstvādhāraṃ dharātalam |
dṛḍhāṃ samāṃ tadākārām īṣatprāguttaraplavām || 14.30
procchritāṃ ca viśeṣeṇa sthalīṃ darpaṇasannibhām <darpaṇasaṃnibhām> |
sāmānyā na bhaved yena medinī maṇṭapasya tu || 14.31
dvidvikenāṅgulānāṃ tu pronnater yāvadaṣṭakam |
ekavṛdhyālpamānānāṃ yāgānāṃ tu sthalāṅgaṇam || 14.32
navāṅgulonnates tāvad yāvat pañcadaśāṅgulam |
pronnatatvaṃ sthalānāṃ ca madhyamānaṃ mitātmanām || 14.33
caturviṃśatyaṅgulāntam ucchrāyaṃ ṣoḍaśāṅgulāt |
prāguktavṛdhyā kartavyaṃ jyeṣṭhamānaṃ mitātmanām || 14.34
evam ucchrāyamānaṃ ca kathitaṃ ca sthalīṣu hi |
pādam ardhaṃ tu hastaṃ vā vistārāt sarvadikṣu vai || 14.35
sthalīnām iṣṭakādyaiś ca cinvīyāt prathamaṃ tataḥ |
mṛdā sampūrya <saṃpūrya> tanmadhyam īṣadvālukayānvitam || 14.36
parīkṣya keśakīṭādīn ākoṭya tadanantaram |
yāvad bhavati pūrvoktalakṣaṇaṃ vā viśeṣataḥ || 14.37
sthalīṃ madhyonnatāṃ ramyāṃ saptāhaṃ samparīkṣya <saṃparīkṣya> sā |
na dadāti yadā bhedaṃ yāgayogyā bhavet tadā || 14.38
tadūrdhve vedikāṃ kuryād anekacaraṇānvitām |
toraṇaiś ca samāyuktāṃ vibhavec chānusārataḥ || 14.39
pāvanair yajñakāṣṭhaiś ca sudṛḍhaiḥ saralaiḥ samaiḥ |
yathālakṣaṇayuktāni toraṇāni caturdiśi || 14.40
dvārāṇāṃ bāhyato viprās tadantar vā niyojayet |
trīṇi trīṇy atha vā samyagekaikasyāṃ nyased diśi || 14.41
budhvā maṇṭapavistāraṃ pañcakaṃ saptakaṃ tu vā |
etāni hemaratnādyaiś citrayed vibhave sati || 14.42
śrīvṛkṣodumbaravaṭaplakṣotthair atha vā dvijāḥ |
pūrvādyuttaraparyantaṃ toraṇānāṃ catuṣṭayam || 14.43
catuṣṭayaṃ caturdikṣu hy eṣām ekaikam eva vā |
toraṇānāṃ samuchrāyaḥ stambhāyāmasamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 14.44
stambhadvayāntarasthena mānena syāt tu vistṛtiḥ |
stambhamastakamānena sādhikena sadaiva hi || 14.45
taddaṇḍān vinyased bhūmau stambhābhyantaragā sthitiḥ |
sadaiva dṛksvarūpāṇāṃ kāryā vedavidāṃ varāḥ || 14.46
dvārāṇāṃ bāhyato viprāstoraṇānāṃ yadā sthitiḥ |
talāc chikharaparyantaṃ mānam ucchrāyatas tadā || 14.47
sārdhaṃ samaṃ vā dviguṇaṃ taddaṇḍeṣu ca bhūgatam |
cakradvitayamadhyasthaṃ pakṣamaṇḍalamaṇḍitam || 14.48
toraṇe toraṇe kuryād garuḍaṃ cordhvasaṃsthitam |
tatpārśvayoś cakracihnau nānāvarṇadhvajau nyaset || 14.49
sitaraktādibhedena prāgādau tu dhvajāṣṭakam |
niveśya madhyavedyāṃ tu prabhavāpyayayogataḥ || 14.50
matsyādīn avatārāṃś ca prādurbhāvān anekaśaḥ |
citroditena vidhinā caturdikṣu samālikhet || 14.51
munisiddhāmaravrātair anekād bhūtadarśibhiḥ |
dvīpācalavanodyānair bahubhir mṛgayūdhapaiḥ || 14.52
sarassārasakahlārajalakrīḍāparānvitaiḥ |
khecarair aṅganāyuktair nṛpair vidyādharādhipaiḥ || 14.53
praśāntamānasair viprair ātmadhyānaparāyaṇaiḥ |
evamādyair anantaiś ca vyāpāraiś citrasambhavaiḥ <citrasaṃbhavaiḥ> || 14.54
tadyāgaveśma sakalaṃ rañjanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
kuryāt sudhāvaliptaṃ vā bhūṣayet tadanantaram || 14.55
darpaṇaiś cāmarair vastrair dukūlair vividhojvalaiḥ |
ghaṇṭābhir ardhacandrādyair ātapatrair manoharaiḥ || 14.56
procchritaiḥ kadalīpūgaiḥ drumāṅgaiḥ pāvanair dṛḍhaiḥ |
madhvājyadadhisatkṣīrasampūrṇaiḥ <madhvājyadadhisatkṣīrasaṃpūrṇaiḥ>
kāṃsyabhājanaiḥ || 14.57
śālitaṇḍulapātraiś ca sahiraṇyaiḥ phalaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
lājasiddhārthakair bījabhājanaiḥ ṣaḍrasānvitaiḥ || 14.58
satsugandhais tvagelādyaiḥ parṇaiḥ pūgaphalais tathā |
madhūkabadaradrākṣā ikṣubhis triphalaiḥ phalaiḥ || 14.59
yathartuprabhavaiḥ puṣpaiḥ bahubhiḥ prakarīyakaiḥ |
ity evamādyair vividhair bhogapūgais tu pāvanaiḥ || 14.60
pavitreṇa vitānena susitenojvalena vā |
cakrāmburuhacihnena bhūṣayec ca tadūrdhvataḥ || 14.61
stambhān saṃveṣṭayet paścāddukūlair vividhaiḥ pṛthak |
prāguttarādidigbhāgād yāvatkoṇaṃ ca mārutam || 14.62
sitādivarṇabhedotthāḥ patākās tatra yojayet |
evaṃ rāgavibhāgena pratyagbhāgāc ca vai punaḥ || 14.63
dakṣiṇāśāvadhir yāvaddvitīyaṃ ca catuṣṭayam |
ekaiva svarṇa(sarva)varṇā ca nābhau kāryā vitānake || 14.64
bāhyato vedikāyās tu maṇṭapasya digaṣṭake |
vihnikoṇāt samārabhya yāvatkoṇaṃ tu śāṅkaram || 14.65
sitāruṇaṃ ca pītaṃ ca kṛṣṇaṃ kuryāc catuṣṭayam |
bhūyaś cottaradigbhāgād yāvatpaścimadik dvijāḥ || 14.66
tathāvidhaṃ catuṣkaṃ tu dhvajānāṃ parikīrtitam |
rājapāṣāṇavarṇābhaṃ cakrapakṣīśvaropagam || 14.67
vaijayantītrayaṃ kuryāt toraṇe pūrvadiksthite |
dakṣiṇe sphaṭikābhaṃ tu āpye sindūravarcasam || 14.68
hemābhaṃ cottare kuryāt toraṇe dhvajakatrayam |
catuṣkeṇapatākānāṃ yuktaṃ śvetādikena ca || 14.69
ekaikaṃ toraṇaṃ vātra tṛtayaṃ pañcakaṃ tu vā |
ardhena toraṇāyāmāt patākānāṃ ca dīrghatā || 14.70
evaṃ tv abhinavaṃ kṛtvā yāgārthaṃ maṇṭapaṃ dvijāḥ |
snapanādyutsavāntasya vaiśeṣikagaṇasya ca || 14.71
purā prakalpitaṃ vātha maṇṭapaṃ bhūṣayet tadā |
evaṃ kṛte tataḥ paścādvedikāṃ toraṇaiḥ saha || 14.72
vilipya candanādyais tu gandhavarṇojvalaiḥ kramāt |
candanena samālabhya vedikāṃ kevalena ca || 14.73
bāhlīkabhāvitenaiva tenaivādyaṃ ca toraṇam |
liptaṃ mṛgamadenaiva kuryād dakṣiṇadiggatam || 14.74
tuṣāradhūlīdhavalaṃ paścimaṃ kārayet tataḥ |
kuṅkumena samālabhyaṃ kevalenottare sthitam || 14.75
kṣīreṇa candanenaiva kuṅkumena kṛtāṃ sthalīm |
rajanīcūrṇayuktena hrībereṇāmbunā saha || 14.76
puṇyagandhauṣadhībhis tu dvārāṇāṃ maṇṭapāvanim |
tatas tu vividhair dhūpair bahubhir dhūpayed dvijāḥ || 14.77
tatas tiraskariṇyā tad veṣṭayet savato bahiḥ |
maṇṭapasyottare bhāge kuryāt kuṇḍaṃ puraiva tu || 14.78
yad vā dvijās tato 'nyatra yāgāgrasthā cā varjyadik |
diktraye 'bhimatā yā dikkuryād analamaṇṭapaṃ || 14.79
dhūmanirgamanopetaṃ nānākuṇḍavibhūṣitam |
sāṃdraiś ca supalāśaiś ca saṃyuktaṃ toraṇādikaiḥ || 14.80
yad vā pacanagehe tu kuṇḍaṃ kuryāt salakṣaṇam |
anyan naimittikārthaṃ tu purā kḷptaṃ tu vā bhavet || 14.81
yāgamaṇṭapavinyāsaṃ sarvatraivaṃ samācaret |
evaṃ kṛte tataḥ kuryāt sambhāragrahaṇaṃ <saṃbhāragrahaṇaṃ> dvijāḥ || 14.82
tatra tāvatpavitrāṇāṃ nirmāṇam adhunocyate |
teṣāṃ tu dvividhaṃ rūpaṃ sūkṣmasthūlavibhedataḥ || 14.83
sarvabhāvena bhaktānāṃ yat pālayati sarvadā |
manovākcittajaṃ kṛtsnaṃ vyāpāraṃ śubhalakṣaṇam || 14.84
parijñeyam atas tasmāt svarūpaṃ tasya yādṛśam |
phalam eti ca vai yena bhaktānāṃ tatsamāpanāt || 14.85
yad acchinnaṃ jagadyoner anantaprasaraṃ sitaṃ |
vicchedam akṛtajñānām eti nānātmanā svayam || 14.86
jagatsūtraṃ tu tadviddhi hemasūtrādinā tu vai |
ṣāḍguṇyamahimānaṃ yaddhatte pratisarātmanā || 14.87
jñānarāgoparaktaṃ tu yuktaṃ kāryais tu vīryajaiḥ |
taijasair āvṛtaṃ mantrair balenāvāsitaṃ pari || 14.88
aiśvaryam upacāre tu sampattau <saṃpattau> śaktito 'vyayam |
evaṃ pavitrakaṃ tāvatparijñeyaṃ jagatprabhoḥ || 14.89
brahmaṇyādhipatau viṣṇau tadākāre pratiṣṭhite |
bhaktyā ca vidhivaddattaṃ dadāti bhagavatpadam || 14.90
sthūlasya vyatiriktasya vyavahārapade sthitaiḥ |
padārthaiḥ kalpanīyaṃ ca tadvidhānam ihocyate || 14.91
sūkṣmaṃ dṛḍhaṃ sitaṃ ślakṣṇaṃ sūtraṃ brahmaprasūtayā |
vinirmitaṃ kumāryā vā vṛddhayā vā vinītayā || 14.92
śuddhayā vā vidhavayā sampāditam <saṃpāditam> athāpi vā |
kṣaumaṃ vā paṭṭajaṃ vāpi keśaromādivarjitam || 14.93
yathālabdhaṃ samādāya samyakprakṣālya vāriṇā |
tasya śuddhiṃ purā kṛtvā dahanāpyāyanena ca || 14.94
avalokya smaranmūlaṃ viniṣpādya caturguṇam |
cāturātmyavyapekṣāyām atha vāṣṭaguṇaṃ dvijāḥ || 14.95
prabhavāpyayabudhyā tu bhedabhinnopalakṣitam |
keśavādiṣv adhiṣṭhātṛbhāvena tricaturguṇam || 14.96
tantubhir viṣamair viṣṇoḥ samasya parivarjayet |
pāvitrikī kriyā yasmād viṣamā sā na kasyacit || 14.97
pavitrakāṇi kāryāṇi tantubhis taiḥ sitāsitaiḥ |
mūlamantrādisarveṣāṃ mantrāṇāṃ munisattamāḥ || 14.98
kumbhasthamantramūrteḥ prākkakalpayed bhūṣaṇaṃ dvijāḥ |
adhyardhaśatajair vyāsād dhārākāraiś ca tantubhiḥ || 14.99
śatenāṣṭottareṇādyaṃ dviguṇena dvitīyakam |
triguṇena tṛtīyaṃ tu vyāsam evaṃ tu tan nayet || 14.100
ṣaṭtriṃśadgrandhikaṃ cādyaṃ dvitīyaṃ dviguṇaṃ smṛtam |
tṛtīyaṃ triguṇaṃ kuryād evam eva mahāmatiḥ || 14.101
maṇḍalasthasya ca vibhos tathā vahnigatasya ca |
bimbasthasya pavitrāṇāṃ viśeṣo 'py avadhāryatām || 14.102
mālākṛtiṃ tu śirasi yathecchagrandhipūrvakam |
dvitīyamaṃsayor yāvallambitaṃ jānumaṇḍale || 14.103
mūrdhnaḥ pādāvadhir yāvattṛtīyam iti viśrutam |
āmūrdhnaḥ pīṭhaparyantaṃ vanamālāpavitrakam || 14.104
pṛthakpīṭhasya vai kuryāt svapramāṇena śobhanam |
bimbapratisarāṇāṃ ca vyāsaś cāniyataḥ smṛtaḥ || 14.105
sūtramānaṃ ca pūrvoktaṃ dviguṇaṃ sati sambhave <saṃbhave> |
triguṇaṃ vā muniśreṣṭhā vanamālākhyabhūṣaṇam || 14.106
aṣṭottareṇa sūtrāṇāṃ sahasreṇa samanvitam |
yad vā tadardhaṃ pādaṃ vā kuryād vittānurūpataḥ || 14.107
lepabhittipaṭasthe tu mūlabimbe yadā dvijāḥ |
kuryād utsavabimbasya bhūṣaṇānāṃ tu pañcakam || 14.108
tadāpi mūlabimbasya bhūṣaṇāny api pūrvavat |
kalpayed ādyapūrvāṇi bimbapratisareṣu tu || 14.109
vibhave devadeveśe hārapañcakasaṃyutam |
nānākārāṇi tantūni muktāhārasamanvitam || 14.110
tryaṅgulāntaritā deyāḥ sarveṣāṃ grandhayaḥ samāḥ |
saṅkhyānena <saṃkhyānena> vinā samyaṅmātuluṅgopamāḥ śubhāḥ || 14.111
aṣṭottaraśatagrandhisaṃyuktā vanamālikā |
catuḥsthānāvatīrṇasya vibhor āmantraṇāya ca || 14.112
pavitram ādyasadṛśam ekaikaṃ vā dvayaṃ dvayam |
sarveṣāṃ karmabimbānāṃ tathā vai gopurādiṣu || 14.113
sthitānāṃ mantrabimbānāṃ bhajatāṃ sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> sadā |
uttamādīni karmāṇi kuryād vai mukhyakalpane || 14.114
prakalpayet tatsadṛśaṃ madhyamenottamena vā |
dvitayaṃ dvitayaṃ vāpi hy ekaikaṃ vānukalpane || 14.115
aṅgānāṃ bhūṣaṇānāṃ ca lāñchanānāṃ tathaiva ca |
śaktīnāṃ vihageśasya pavitraṃ kalpayet tathā || 14.116
prāgvattrīṇy atha vā dve dve ekaikaṃ vātha vā dvijāḥ |
yathecchāmānasaṃkhyotthaiḥ sūtrais tu parikalpayet || 14.117
sūtrabhramasamopetair garbhair bhūṣaṇasañcayam <bhūṣaṇasaṃcayam> |
anyeṣāṃ maṇḍalāṅgānāṃ devānāṃ vibhave sati || 14.118
pavitrakagaṇaṃ kuryād yathecchāgrandhitantubhiḥ |
tathaiva viṣvaksenādeḥ parivāragaṇasya ca || 14.119
mantrāstrakumbhayor dve vai hy ekaṃ vai maṇḍalasya ca |
dvayaṃ ca kuṇḍānalayoḥ śāstṛpīṭhasya ca dvayam || 14.120
liper vāktatvabhūtasya śabdatattvasya ca prabhoḥ |
ghaṇṭākṣasūtrapūrvāṇāṃ kriyāṅgānāṃ mahātmanām || 14.121
balipīṭhādhidevānāṃ deśāntaranivāsinām |
gurvādīnāṃ caturṇāṃ tu harilipsāpralāpinām || 14.122
dvijottamādivarṇānāṃ nityam acyutabhāvinām |
gṛhasthabrahmacāriṇāṃ yatīnāṃ banavāsinām || 14.123
vṛddhānāṃ janakādīnāṃ bhagavattatvavedinām |
bandhūnāṃ bhrātṛputrāṇāṃ nārāyaṇaratātmanām || 14.124
jāyāyā bhaktinamrāyā ratāyā arcane hareḥ |
sambandhināṃ <saṃbandhināṃ> ca mitrāṇāṃ bhagavaddhāmavāsinām
<<�vāsinām : �sevinām>> || 14.125
taduttarasahāyānāṃ cāturātmyābhilāṣiṇām |
bhṛtyānāṃ svānukūlānāṃ puruṣottamayājinām || 14.126
vṛddhaye yogyatāyai ca pavitrīkaraṇāya ca |
yathābhimatamānais tu tantubhir granthibhis tathā || 14.127
kuryāt pavitranicayam atha vā munisattamāḥ |
gurvādīnāṃ caturṇāṃ tu yatīnāṃ ca kuṭumbinām || 14.128
kramāc caturviṃśatibhiḥ sūtraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhis tathā |
tato dvādaśibhiś caiva aṣṭabhiḥ ṣaṭtribhis tathā || 14.129
pavitrakāṇi kāryāṇi granthayaḥ sūtrasaṃkhyayā |
ārādhakasya ca guroḥ kuryād vai bhūṣaṇadvayam || 14.130
sthūlakalpam idaṃ proktaṃ sūkṣmakalpam ihocyate |
śiraḥpramāṇenārcāyā bhūṣaṇaṃ prathamaṃ smṛtam || 14.131
catuḥśatena sūtrāṇāṃ dvātriṃśadbhis tathādhikaiḥ |
sūtrāvartaiś ca susamaiḥ parikalpya ca śobhanam || 14.132
saptaviṃśatpramāṇena datvāsmin granthisañcayam <granthisaṃcayam> |
karṇād ūrdhvagataṃ nābhipramāṇena pāvitrakam || 14.133
parikalpya dvitīyaṃ ca sūtrāṇāṃ munisattamāḥ |
śatatrayeṇa ca tathā caturviṃśadbhir eva ca || 14.134
dviguṇair granthinicayair anugarbhaṃ tu tatsmṛtam |
skandhadeśāt samārabhya yāvatpādadvayāvadhi || 14.135
netrasūtrais tribhāgonaiḥ sūtragrāmaiś ca kalpayet |
triguṇair granthinicayais tato 'nyad dvijasattamāḥ || 14.136
aṣṭottareṇa sūtrāṇāṃ śatena granthibhis tathā |
śiraḥpūrvāvatārādau yāvatpīṭhaṃ tu vaiṣṇavam || 14.137
sūtrair granthigaṇaiś caiva garbhais tu vividhais tataḥ |
maṇḍalasya pramāṇena kuryāc cānyac catuṣṭayam || 14.138
prathamaṃ padmamānena nābhimānaṃ dvitīyakam |
aratulyaṃ tṛtīyaṃ syāt caturthaṃ nemibhiḥ samam || 14.139
ekāśītibhir āvartaiḥ sūtrāṇāṃ dvijasattamāḥ |
agneḥ kuṇḍapramāṇena granthibhis tāvad eva hi || 14.140
bhūṣaṇatritayaṃ kuryād yathāyogaṃ mahāmatiḥ |
aṣṭottaraśatādardhais sūtrais tadgranthibhis tathā || 14.141
bhūṣaṇaṃ susamaṃ caiva suśubhaṃ parikalpayet |
dvijendrā dvijamukhyānāṃ brāhmaṇānāṃ tadardhataḥ || 14.142
mukhyam etat smṛtaṃ kalpam anukalpodhunocyate |
aṣṭādhikena sūtreṇa śatena prathamaṃ tv idam || 14.143
caturbhāgonam aparaṃ tadardhena tṛtīyakam |
ādyāc caturthabhāgena caturthaṃ kalpayet tataḥ || 14.144
tribhāgonaṃ caturthāt tu agneḥ kuryāt tu bhūṣaṇam |
dvijendrāṇāṃ prakurvīta saptaviṃśatitantujam || 14.145
brāhmaṇānāṃ prakurvīta tantubhir navabhir dvijāḥ |
stanād ūrdhvam adho nābher na kartavyaṃ kadācana || 14.146
sūtratrayeṇa cānyeṣāṃ bhaktānāṃ tu jagadguroḥ |
sūkṣmakalpam idaṃ proktaṃ parakalpam ihocyate || 14.147
catuḥsthānāvatīrṇasya mukhyamantrasya vai vibhoḥ |
śatenāṣṭottareṇaiva hy ardhenāṃśena vā dvijāḥ || 14.148
tantūnāṃ bhūṣaṇaṃ kuryād ekaikaṃ vā trayaṃ trayam |
japahomādikā saṃkhyā pūrṇā riktā mahātmanām || 14.149
samīkaroti bhaktānāṃ mantriṇām ata eva hi |
kuryāt tadgranthinicayaṃ sūtrasaṃkhyopalakṣitam || 14.150
yadṛcchayā tato 'nyeṣāṃ yājyānāṃ parikalpya ca |
sūtrabhramasamopetair garbhair bhūṣaṇasañcayam <bhūṣaṇasaṃcayam> || 14.151
tatas tu devadevasya catuḥsthānasthitasya yat |
pavitrakagaṇaṃ viprāḥ proktamādyapurassaram || 14.152
kuryāt tu garbharacanāṃ tasya sarvasya sattamāḥ |
hemasadratnakarpūramalayakṣodakuṅkumaiḥ || 14.153
sarvauṣadhisamopetais tvagelādivimiśritaiḥ |
pāvanair vividhair dranyair nīvyā sapicunā saha || 14.154
bījapūrasamākāram āmrāmalakaśaṅkhavat |
tadantarālāni punas tv acchinnena tu tantunā || 14.155
vibhāgapratipattyarthaṃ grathanīyānyadūrataḥ |
anyeṣāṃ sarvabimbānāṃ yathāvittānurūpataḥ || 14.156
kalpayed garbharacanāṃ pūrvoktair dravyasañcayaiḥ <dravyasaṃcayaiḥ> |
ārādhakasya ca guroḥ sagarbhaṃ bhūṣaṇadvayam || 14.157
vihitaṃ bhagavanmantranyāsāt tādātmyabhāvanāt |
ato 'nyeṣām agarbhaṃ ca racanīyaṃ yathākramam || 14.158
antarālagaṇaṃ gārbhaṃ kuryād bāhlīkarañjitam |
alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> ca sauvarṇair upariṣṭāc ca rūpyakaiḥ || 14.159
pavitracchedasaṃmūlaṃ jātarūpamayais tu vā |
śaṅkhapadmagadācakramālāśrīvatsapūrvakaiḥ || 14.160
ekasyaiva bahūnāṃ vā yathāvittānusārataḥ |
evaṃ kṛtvā pavitrāni krameṇa dvijasattamāḥ || 14.161
dhātuje vitate bhāṇḍe vastracchanne vidhāya ca |
atha vā vaidale bhāṇḍe mṛṇmaye vā suśobhane || 14.162
pālāśe vāpi caikasmin māntraṃ bhūṣaṇasañcayam <bhūṣaṇasaṃcayam> |
anyasmin laukikaṃ sthāpya samastaṃ dvijasattamāḥ || 14.163
ācchādya vāsasā paścātsusitenāhatena ca |
bandhayitvā tu sūtreṇa dṛḍhena susitena ca || 14.164
madhye tu yāgadravyāṇāṃ te bhaṇḍe viniveśayet |
evaṃ hi sarvasambhārān <sarvasaṃbhārān> sampādya <saṃpādya> dvijasattamāḥ 
|| 14.165
cāturmāsye tv anyatame māse vai śuklapakṣake |
dvādaśyāṃ devadevasya pavitrāropam ācaret || 14.166
pūrvaṃ daśamyekādaśyoḥ kuryāt karmādhivāsanam |
ekādaśyāṃ vānukalpe adhivāsanam ācaret || 14.167
sadyo 'dhivāsaṃ dvādaśyāṃ kuryād vā śaktyabhāvataḥ |
adhivāsadināt pūrvadine kṛtvāṅkurārpaṇam || 14.168
adhivāsadine kuryād rakṣābandhaṃ ca deśikaḥ |
adhivāsādikaṃ sarvaṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 14.169
ācāryo mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ daśamyāṃ tu niśāmukhe |
mantreśasannidhiṃ <mantreśasaṃnidhiṃ> gatvā prapūjyārghyādibhiḥ kramāt || 
14.170
tasmād anujñām ādāya prāsādāgrasthitaṃ śubham |
yāgamaṇṭapam āsādya dvārārcanapurassaram || 14.171
pūrvavat pūjanaṃ kuryāt kalaśe maṇḍalakṣitau |
sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> tataḥ prāgvanmūlamūrtau tu pūjanam || 14.172
pradakṣiṇapraṇāmāntaṃ saviśeṣaṃ samācaret |
lepabhittipaṭasthaṃ tu mūlabimbaṃ yadā dvijāḥ || 14.173
tadā naimittike bimbe sarvaṃ kuryād viśeṣataḥ |
ekasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> viprāḥ kṛtvā snapanamātrakam || 14.174
snapanādhikṛte bimbe nityanaimittike 'pi vā |
sarvam anyatpavitrāntam mūlabimbe samācaret || 14.175
nityotsavārthaṃ bimbe tu tadā kuryāt tadutsavam |
teṣām asannidhau <asaṃnidhau> viprā darpaṇe tatsamīpage || 14.176
kuryāt snapanamātraṃ tu tadā kuryāt tadutsavam |
durbhamañjarije kūrce cakre vā kumbhake 'pi vā || 14.177
prāgvadanyatsamastaṃ tu mūlabimbe samācaret |
tato homagṛhaṃ gatvā kuṇḍaṃ saṃskṛtya pūrvavat || 14.178
tatrānalaṃ ca saṃskṛtya kuryād vai mantratarpaṇam |
prāsādaṃ sampraviśyātha <saṃpraviśyātha> kṛtvā homasamarpaṇam || 14.179
praṇamya devadeveśaṃ tatas tv ekaṃ pavitrakam |
dahanāpyāyasaṃśuddhaṃ prokṣitaṃ cārghyavāriṇā || 14.180
vāsitaṃ gandhadhūpābhyāṃ catussthānasthitasya ca |
nivedya ca krameṇaiva dhūpaṃ datvārghyapūrvakam || 14.181
nijānandamayair bhogair nityatṛptas tvam avyayaḥ |
tathāpi bhaktyā tṛpto 'haṃ tvāṃ yajāmy ātmasiddhaye || 14.182
iti vijñāpya devasya tato 'streṇārghyavāriṇā |
sarvaṃ bhūṣaṇapūrvaṃ tu samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya>
dravyasañcayam <dravyasaṃcayam> || 14.183
atha pāṇidvayenaiva agnīṣomātmakena tu |
yogyatāpadavīṃ nītvā sarvaṃ bhūṣaṇasañcayam <bhūṣaṇasaṃcayam> || 14.184
mūlamantreṇa samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> saṃspṛśyātha virīkṣya ca |
kumbhayogyani <kumbhayogyāni> caikasmin maṇḍalīyāni cāpare || 14.185
bimbayogyāni caikasminn agniyogyāni cāpare |
anyāni mantrayogyāni ekasmin dvijasattamāḥ || 14.186
pātre pātre pṛthak sthāpya pātralābhānurūpataḥ |
ācchādya vāsasā paścātsusitenāhatena tu || 14.187
tāni bhūṣaṇapātrāṇi krameṇa ca pṛthak pṛthak |
bandhanīyāni sūtreṇa dṛḍhena susitena ca || 14.188
śālibhis taṇḍulair vāpi tilair vā tritayena vā |
catustridvyekabhārair vā kṛte pīthe 'tha vā sthale || 14.189
tāni bhūṣaṇapātrāṇi saṃsthāpya purato vibhoḥ |
praṇavenārcayitvā tu varmaṇā sthagayet punaḥ || 14.190
devāgāraṃ bahiś cāntaḥ mandiraṃ yāgasaṃjñitam |
saṃveṣṭya sitasūtreṇa caturdhā tadguṇena tu || 14.191
tato 'bhyarthya samūhaṃ tu pañcakālaparāyaṇam |
ṣaṭkarmanirataṃ cāpi yativṛndaṃ tu vaiṣṇavam || 14.192
samakṣaṃ bhavatāṃ bhaktyā śvaḥ prabhuṃ pūjayāmy aham |
sannidhānam <saṃnidhānam> ataḥ kāryaṃ madanugrahakāmyayā || 14.193
evam abhyarthya tebhyas tu hy anujñāṃ pratigṛhya ca |
sannidhau <saṃnidhau> devadevasya jāgareṇa nayen niśām || 14.194
ekādaśyāṃ prabhāte 'tha kṛtasnānaḥ kṛtāhnikaḥ |
ācāryo brāhmaṇaiḥ sārdhaṃ yatibhir vaiṣṇavottamaiḥ || 14.195
svadharmanirataiś caiva viṣṇubhaktair dṛḍhavrataiḥ |
praviśya bhagavadgehaṃ kṛtvā nityārcanaṃ vibhoḥ || 14.196
catuḥsthānārcanaṃ cāpi saviśeṣaṃ samācaret |
tathaiva rātrāv api ca saviśeṣaṃ samācaret || 14.197
havanāntaṃ kriyākāṇḍaṃ japastutiparastataḥ |
ārādhyasyāgrataḥ sthitvā jāgareṇa nayen niśām || 14.198
snātvā brāhme muhūrte 'tha deśiko vaiṣṇavaiḥ saha |
praviśya devasadanaṃ kṛtvā nityārcanaṃ vibhoḥ || 14.199
catuḥsthānasthitaṃ devaṃ samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
tatas tu cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ śrīpuṣṭibhyāṃ samanvitam || 14.200
yānam āropya vastrādyair alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> viśeṣataḥ |
maṇṭapaṃ tu samīnāya viniveśya ca viṣṭare || 14.201
pāṭhayec caturo vedān caturdikṣu yathāvidhi |
atha bhūṣaṇapātrasya gatvā vai sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> dvijāḥ || 14.202
pūjayitvā samudghāṭya pātraṃ pratisarīyakam |
avalokya samādāya dhyāyed ādyekhilaṃ <ādye 'khilaṃ> dvijāḥ || 14.203
sāṃvatsaraṃ tu yatkarma āprabhātān niśāntimam |
dhyānotthaṃ niṣkalaṃ samyagapavargapradaṃ tu yat || 14.204
saṃsmṛtya niṣkalaṃ mantraṃ śuddhoccārakrameṇa tu |
mantre sandhāya <saṃdhāya> tatsūtraṃ sūtre mantraṃ tathaiva ca || 14.205
ekīkṛtyātmanā sārdhaṃ dadyād vai mantramūrdhani |
samādāyāparaṃ sūtraṃ tasmin sakalaniṣkalam || 14.206
dhyānakarmasvarūpaṃ tu karma dhyāyec ca vātsaram |
smṛtvā cobhayarūpaṃ tu mantraṃ kalaśapūjitam || 14.207
pūrvavac cānusandhānaṃ <cānusaṃdhānaṃ> kṛtvā dadyāt pavitrakam |
tataḥ pratisaraṃ viprāḥ tṛtīyaṃ ca samācaret || 14.208
bāhyaṃ sāṃvatsaraṃ karma sakalaṃ cākhilaṃ smaret |
pūjayantaṃ svam ātmānaṃ ādhārāc ca parāvadhim || 14.209
layabhogādhikārākhyakrameṇa sakalātmanā |
sakalaṃ mantranāthaṃ tu layabhogādi vigraham || 14.210
smṛtvā kṛtvā ca sandhānaṃ <saṃdhānaṃ> dadyāt pratisaraṃ tataḥ |
arghyapuṣpais tathā gandhair mālyair dhūpais tathā dvijāḥ || 14.211
pūjayā sampuṭīkuryād <saṃpuṭīkuryād> bhūṣaṇāni pṛthak pṛthak |
antarāntarayogena ghaṇṭāśabdasamanvitā || 14.212
samastaratnasaddhātupuṣpākṣataphalānvitā |
satsugandhārghyadarbhāḍhyā lājasiddhārthakair yutā || 14.213
prakṣeptavyā tu bahuśo vṛṣṭiḥ karagatair mudā |
kevalāpuṣpavṛṣṭir vā śaṅkhādīn api nādayet || 14.214
datvaivaṃ kalaśasthasya purā viprāḥ pavitrakam |
anena vidhinā dadyān maṇḍalasthasya vai purā || 14.215
pavitrakatrayaṃ śubhraṃ bhogasthāne ca nārada |
dadyāt samastamantrāṇāṃ trīṇy ekaṃ vā yathecchayā || 14.216
bimbasthaṃ tu samabhyarcya pradadyād bhūṣaṇāni tu |
kalaśoktakrameṇaiva vanamālākhyabhūṣaṇe || 14.217
pūrvavac cānusandhānaṃ <cānusaṃdhānaṃ> sarvaṃ kṛtvā nivedayet |
pṛthaṅnyāso yadā proktaḥ kirīṭādyaṃ catuṣṭayam || 14.218
krameṇāvāhayed viprā bhūṣaṇānāṃ catuṣṭaye |
kirīṭākhya sureśasya bhānutulyaprabhānvita || 14.219
parivārayutas tiṣṭha tvam asmin śīrṣabhūṣaṇe |
śrīvatsāgacchapūrṇendu samāne bhagavatpriya || 14.220
vakṣaḥsthale jagadyoner bhūṣaṇaṃ kalpitaṃ mayā |
kaustubhāgaccha ratnānām īśa tvaṃ bhagavatpriya || 14.221
vakṣaḥsthale jagadyāner bhūṣaṇaṃ kalpitaṃ mayā |
dhātupuṣpasamākīrṇe pravālamaṇibhūṣite || 14.222
vanamāle samāgaccha devadevapriye śubhe |
caturbhir etair mantrais tu krameṇāhāhayed dvijāḥ || 14.223
astrānāṃ bhūṣaṇānāṃ ca lāñchanānāṃ tathaiva ca |
śaktīnāṃ vihageśasya tathaiva munisattamāḥ || 14.224
pīṭhasya ca pavitrāṇi pradadyāt kramaśastataḥ |
evam eva vibhor dadyān mūlabimbagatasya ca || 14.225
sarveṣāṃ mūlabimbānāṃ lakṣmyādīnāṃ tathaiva |
anyeṣām aṅgabimbānāṃ parivāragaṇasya ca || 14.226
śāstṛpīṭhasya ca lipeḥ śabdatatvasya ca prabhoḥ |
ghaṇṭākṣasūtrapūrvāṇāṃ arghyapātrādikasya ca || 14.227
chatracāmarapūrvāṇāṃ sarvopakaraṇasya ca |
dvārāvaraṇadevānāṃ sarveṣāṃ ca dvijottamāḥ || 14.228
krameṇa bhūṣaṇaṃ datvā yāyād agniniketanam |
agnisthasya vibhor dadyād bhūṣaṇāni tu pūrvavat || 14.229
agnau nivedayed viprā bhūṣaṇaṃ na tu homayet |
yasmāt sanyāsam ūrdhve tu vihitaṃ bhūṣaṇasya ca || 14.230
nāhartuṃ yujyate dagdhaṃ doṣam ābharaṇaṃ vinā |
tathaiva sruksruvādīnāṃ dadyāt pratisaraṃ tadā || 14.231
deśikasya hṛdāropya pūjitasya ca devavat |
svaṃ svaṃ cāropya cānyeṣāṃ deśikānāṃ tathaiva ca || 14.232
sādhakānāṃ tato dadyād yāgāṅgānām api kramāt |
mūlabimbe yadā kuryāt pavitrāropaṇaṃ dvijāḥ || 14.233
tadā tu mūlaberasya datvā pratisaraṃ purā |
naivedyāntaṃ samabhyarcya paścādutsavakautuke || 14.234
yāgamaṇṭapam ānīya atha vāsthānamaṇṭape |
bhadrāsane samāropya pūrvoktavidhinā tataḥ || 14.235
catuḥsthānasthitasyāpi dadyāt pratisaraṃ dvijāḥ |
evaṃ hi devadevasya catuḥsthānasthitasya ca || 14.236
alaṅkārāsane <alaṃkārāsane> mūlamantreṇa praṇavena vā |
āmūrdhnaḥ kramaśo datvā bhūṣaṇāni yathāvidhi || 14.237
bhojyāsanaṃ tato nītvā vividhābhyavahārikaiḥ |
bhogair abhyarcya deveśaṃ brūyād dhadbāñjalis <baddhāñjalis> tv idam || 14.238
nāvalepān na mohāc ca karmatyāgo mayā kṛtaḥ |
tvam eva sarvaṃ jānāsi sarveśa hṛdaye sthitaḥ || 14.239
yathāśaktyā tv anicchātas tatrāpi parameśvara |
tannimittam idaṃ karma kṛtaṃ tvatprītaye mayā || 14.240
evam uktvā samabhyarcya caturaḥ pāñcarātrikān |
bhagavatpratipattyā tu śaktyā prāvaraṇair dhanaiḥ || 14.241
tathā pratisarāntais tu brahmacārīn yatīn gurūn |
tarpayitvātha cānnena pūtena vividhena tu || 14.242
paścādustavabimbaṃ tu yānam āropya deśikaḥ |
mahotsavavidhiproktasarvamaṅgalasaṃyutam || 14.243
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva prāsādaṃ tu praveśayet |
deśikas tv atha naivedyapūrvaṃ kuryāc ca bhojanam || 14.244
bandhubhrātṛsamopetaḥ saviśeṣaṃ dvijottamāḥ |
sāyamprātaḥ pratidinaṃ bhūṣaṇotsarjanāvadhi || 14.245
catuḥsthānasthitaṃ devaṃ samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
maṇṭape cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ saviśeṣaṃ samarcayet || 14.246
utsavaṃ devadevasya kuryāt kāladvaye 'pi ca |
vāhanārohaṇaṃ rātrau divase vācared dvijāḥ || 14.247
samāptidivase prātarviśeṣayajanaṃ tataḥ |
catuḥsthānasthitasyāpi madhye madhye 'rcanaiḥ saha || 14.248
avaropya pavitrāṇi rātrau maṇḍalavahnigam |
visṛjya vidhivat kuryāt kumbhasamprokṣaṇādikam <kumbhasaṃprokṣaṇādikam> || 
14.249
ekarātraṃ trirātraṃ vā pañca vā saptarātrakam |
pavitrakaṃ sthāpayitvā tataḥ sanyāsam ācaret || 14.250
atha vārcāgataṃ viprāḥ tāvat saṃsthāpya bhūṣaṇam |
yāvad ekādaśī śuklā saṃvṛttā kārtikasya tu || 14.251
apanīya ca mālyādīn pradadyād vā dine dine |
no yāti mlānatāṃ yāvatsamprāpte <yāvatsaṃprāpte> kālavāsare || 14.252
apanīya guror bhaktyā nivedya brāhmaṇasya vā |
pañcakālaprasaktasya tadabhāvāt tu nārada || 14.253
ṣaṭkarmasampravṛttasya <ṣaṭkarmasaṃpravṛttasya> viṣṇubhaktasya tattvataḥ |
viśeṣayāgahomānte kṛtvācāryaprapūjanam || 14.254
vaiṣṇavāḥ pūrvavatpūjyāḥ dadyād ācchādanaṃ tataḥ |
teṣāṃ caiva yathāśakti abhāvād atha nārada || 14.255
yugmam ekaṃ tu vā vastram ekasyāvaśyam eva hi |
upavītāni cānyeṣāṃ sottarīyāṇi yojayet || 14.256
prārthanā ca tataḥ kāryā yatīnāṃ saṃyatātmanām |
yuṣmatprasādasāmarthyān mamāstu paripūrṇatā || 14.257
kriyāṅgānāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ mā me 'stu samayacyutiḥ |
evam astv iti vaktavyaṃ sarvais tālasamanvitam || 14.258
saṃvatsarakṛtākṛtyadoṣaḥ samayapūrvakaḥ |
nāśam āyāti vai kṣipraṃ pavitrāropaṇān na tu || 14.259
pāti yasmāt sadoṣaṃ hi patanāt parirakṣati |
viśeṣeṇa dvijāstrāti pūrṇaṃ karma karoti ca || 14.260
sādhake ca kriyāhīne tasmād ukto mayā mahān |
yāga eṣa pavitrākhya uktalakṣaṇalakṣitaḥ || 14.261
vakṣyate sūkṣmarūpo 'nyaḥ prakāro munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
kevale bimbake vāpi yāgamandirasaṃsthite || 14.262
prāsādasaṃsthite vāpi daśamyām adhivāsite |
kalpayed bhūṣaṇāropaṃ vinā kalaśamaṇḍale || 14.263
agnisthe 'pi tadā kuryāt tatprāgvadadhivāsite |
ekaṃ dve trīṇi vā dadyāt pavitrāṇi tadā vibhoḥ || 14.264
samānīyottamādyena bhedena tu kṛtāni vā |
dravyābhāve dvijaśreṣṭhā aśaktir yadi vā bhavet || 14.265
sadyo'dhivāsaṃ dvādaśyāṃ kṛtvā śaktyā tu kārayet |
sopavāsaṃ dvijaśreṣṭhā arcāyāṃ bhūṣaṇaṃ vibhoḥ || 14.266
yathecchākalpitaiḥ sūtrair grandhibhis tu yathecchayā |
niśārocanayā vāpi pavitrāṇāṃ ca dhātunā || 14.267
kenacid grandhayo viprā vidhivat parirañjayet |
puṣpapūrṇāni garbhāṇi kṛtvā vā kevalānyataḥ || 14.268
prapūjya pūrvavad viprā bimbasannihitaṃ <bimbasaṃnihitaṃ> vibhum |
nivedya bhūṣaṇaṃ dadyād vāṇīm uccārayed imām || 14.269
yan mayā brahmasūtraṃ ca kalpitaṃ grāhayasva ca |
karmaṇāṃ pūraṇārthāya yathā doṣo na me bhavet || 14.270
ity uktvā ca tato dadyāt pūjyopari pavitrakam |
stutvā ca devadeveśaṃ dvitīye'hni prayatnataḥ || 14.271
pūjayitvātha deveśaṃ kuryāt tadupasaṃhṛtam |
gṛhe pavitrayāge tu viśeṣo 'yam adhocyate || 14.272
bimbasthe maṇḍalasthe vā catuḥsthānasthite 'pi vā |
pavitrāṇāṃ trayaṃ dadyād ekaikaṃ vā yathecchayā || 14.273
ity uktaṃ yogināṃ śreṣṭhāḥ pavitrārohaṇaṃ param |
evaṃ kṛte sati tadā siddhir bhavati śāśvatī || 14.274
sarvārthāḥ sādhakānāṃ ca cetasābhīpsitaṃ tadā |
tapodānavratānāṃ ca vihitasyāhnikasya ca || 14.275
niśśeṣayāgabhogānāṃ kṛtvā sampūraṇakriyām <saṃpūraṇakriyām> |
apare'hani vai kuryāc caturthe saptame 'pi vā || 14.276
snapanaṃ pūjyamantrasya tīrthoddeśe 'tha saṅgame <saṃgame> |
nadyāṃ samudragāminyāṃ devakhāte hrade tu vā || 14.277
prītaye parameśasya tv ātmano duḥkhahānaye |
ahlādāyāmarāṇāṃ ca pit�ṇāṃ tṛptaye tu vai || 14.278
āpyāyanārthaṃ bhūtānāṃ bhuvanānāṃ ca bhūtaye |
deśadoṣapraśāntyarthaṃ gobrāhmaṇahitāya vai || 14.279
yathāvat snapanaṃ kuryāt tīrthabimbe viśeṣataḥ |
nityasnapanabimbe tu kuryāt tattadasannidhau <tattadasaṃnidhau> || 14.280
nityotsavapare bimbe hy ācaret tadasannidhau <tadasaṃnidhau> |
tadabhāve pavitre tu darbhamañjarije śubhe || 14.281
vidhānamatra me samyak śṛṇudhvaṃ susamāhitāḥ |
bahuśākham abhagnāgraṃ samūlaṃ yadapuṣpitam || 14.282
prāṅmukho darbham ādāya praṇavena purā kṣiteḥ |
tatas tenaiva tanmūlaṃ prāgvat kuryād adhiṣṭhitam || 14.283
tasya madhyamanālaṃ yannyagbhūtam avatiṣṭhate |
ārādhya mantranādhena smared vyāptaṃ mahātmanā || 14.284
vivartaṃ paramātmīyamadhyakṣākhyaṃ ca viddhi tam |
anekadarbham uccaṃ yat kāṇḍaṃ kāṇḍeṣu cottamam || 14.285
aṇimādiguṇair yuktaṃ puṃstatvaṃ tena kalpyate |
vācakaṃ tasya yoktavyaṃ haṃsayuktaṃ dvilakṣaṇam || 14.286
bahiḥ kāṇḍacatuṣkeṇa cittapūrvaṃ catuṣṭayam |
grathanīyam atho 'vaktram avyaktāntaṃ svakaiḥ padaiḥ || 14.287
praṇavādinamo'ntais tu vyāpakaṃ sūkṣmalakṣaṇam |
evaṃ śrotrādikān pañca svanāmnā gradhayet tadā || 14.288
karmendriyāṇi tadanu tatas tanmātrapañcakam |
pañcakaṃ tv atha bhūtānāṃ badhvā vai kṣmāvasānikam || 14.289
aviśiṣṭais tu tatkāṇḍair badhnīyāt tu karaṇḍavat |
vinā śikhāsamūhena samutthānāvadher atha || 14.290
kiñcit tadūrdhvadeśāc ca yathā no yāti vai punaḥ |
bahudhā kāṇḍasaṅghas <kāṇḍasaṃghas> tu kalpitas
tatvasaṅkhyayā <tatvasaṃkhyayā> || 14.291
vibhinnānāṃ ca kāṇḍānāṃ bhaṅgād ekaratasya ca |
utpadyate 'nyadhātvaṃ ca tasmāt tadgradhayet dṛḍham || 14.292
darbhamañjarijaṃ tv evaṃ sampādyādau <saṃpādyādau> pavitrakam |
anusandhīyate <anusaṃdhīyate> tatra mātrādhyānaṃ yathāsthitam || 14.293
pūjayitvārghyapuṣpādyair alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> paṭhed idam |
tvam eva tīrthaṃ bhagavan tvam evāyatanaṃ param || 14.294
tvayaivādhiṣṭhitaṃ sarvam idaṃ jānāmi tatvataḥ |
tatrāpi ca tvayādiṣṭaṃ kriyākāṇḍaṃ śubhapradam || 14.295
yat tan nirvāhayāmy adya tvadanugrahakāmyayā |
evaṃ vijñāpya bhagavanmantramūrtiṃ parātparam || 14.296
tatpātrapātragaṃ kṛtvā brahmayānagataṃ tu vā |
vedageyadhvanīśaṅkhaśabdamaṅgalapūrvakam || 14.297
nītvā tīrthāntikaṃ tatra nīradeśe nidhāya ca |
pūrvāmukhaṃ ca tadyānam ādāya ca pavitrakam || 14.298
vāmahastatale kuryāt kṣmāmaṇḍalagataṃ tv iva |
vidhṛyān madhyabhāge ca pāṇinā dakṣiṇena tu || 14.299
avatīryāmbhaso madhyaṃ nimajjet saha tena vai |
sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> tatra tatkālaṃ prakurvaty avirāt tu vai || 14.300
aśeṣāṇi ca tīrthāni lokatrayagatāni ca |
mantrātmā yatra rakṣārthaṃ kṣaṇam āste jalāśaye || 14.301
tatrāyatanatīrthānāṃ sarveṣāṃ syāt samāgamaḥ |
kiṃ punar yatra bhagavān mantramūrtir adho'kṣajaḥ || 14.302
sādhakābhyarthitaḥ snāyāt sarvānugrahayā ghiyā |
vidvān yo 'nena vidhinā tīrtham āsādya tatvavit || 14.303
snāpayed bāndhavādīnāṃ prāpnuvanty acirāc ca te |
tairthaṃ phalam anāyāsān mantramūrtaiḥ prasādataḥ || 14.304
kiṃ tu tadyānavāditravarjitas tu bhaved vidhiḥ |
imaṃ vidyān mahābuddhir viśeṣaṃ cātra karmaṇi || 14.305
sāmānyam avināśaṃ yac cinmayaṃ rūpavarjitam |
viśeṣajñānasambandhaṃ <viśeṣajñānasaṃbandhaṃ> jīvahaṃsaṃ vibhāvya tam 
|| 14.306
pavitrakaṃ tadākāraṃ smṛtvā plāvyaṃ tato 'mbhasā |
evaṃ tenaiva cānyeṣāṃ bahūnāṃ bahubhis tu vā || 14.307
sampādya <saṃpādya> viṣṭare snānaṃ dūrasthānāṃ sadaiva hi |
sampanne <saṃpanne> snapane tv evaṃ dvitīye'hni mahāmatiḥ || 14.308
rathe kṛtvārcite taṃ vai prapūjya ca yathāvidhi |
yātrākhyam utsavaṃ kuryād annadānapurassaram || 14.309
sanṛttageyavāditraṃ jāgareṇa samanvitam |
ekarātraṃ dvirātraṃ vā trirātraṃ bhaktipūrvakam || 14.310
sakṛtsaṃvatsarasyānte tūtsavaṃ snapanādikam |
kuryād vai mantranādhasya sa siddhiṃ labhate parām || 14.311
atha vā mandire devam uttamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya samalaṃkṛtya <samalaṅkṛtya> rathādau jagatāṃ patim || 14.312
samāropya viśeṣeṇa yātrotsavam athācaret |
iti pāvitrakaṃ samyagvidhānaṃ parikīrtitam || 14.313
itaḥ paraṃ ca śrotavyam asti cet kathyatāṃ dvijāḥ |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
pavitrotsavādividhir nāma
caturdaśo 'dhyāyaḥ




atha pañcadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ


munayaḥ
snapanānāṃ vidhiṃ samyaksamākhyāhi munīśvara |
yadjñānāt sakalāḥ pūrṇā nityanaimittikāḥ kriyāḥ || 15.1

nāradaḥ
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayaḥ sarve sāvadhānena cetasā |
vidhānaṃ snapanānāṃ tu bahubhedavinirmitam || 15.2
prāsādasyāgrataḥ kuryān maṇṭapaṃ tu tadarthataḥ |
prathamāvaraṇe vāpi dvitīyāvaraṇe 'pi vā || 15.3
tṛtīyāvaraṇe vāpi caturthe pañcame 'pi vā |
āgneyyāṃ dakṣiṇasyāṃ vā nairṛtyāṃ paścime tu vā || 15.4
vāyavyām uttarasyāṃ vā aiśānyāṃ vā yathāruci |
kuryān mānādikaṃ sarvaṃ yāgamaṇṭapavad dvijāḥ || 15.5
vinā yāgasthalaṃ madhye vedīṃ cāpi tadūrdhvataḥ |
adhivāsaś ca kumbhānāṃ sthāpanaṃ snapanaṃ tathā || 15.6
yujyate vai yathaikasmin tathābhyūhya samācaret |
ācāryāś caturo viprāḥ ṣaḍaṣṭau dvādaśāpi vā || 15.7
yajamānas tu varayec chāstrajñān guruṇā saha |
pravīṇāṃś ca bahutve tu tatsaṃkhyāniyatiḥ kṛtā || 15.8
teṣāṃ yathoktasaṃkhyānām abhijñānām asannidhau <asaṃnidhau> |
tādṛśān varayed viprāṃś catustridvyekam eva vā || 15.9
sādhakāṃś caturaḥ ṣaḍ vā hy aṣṭau dvādaśa ṣoḍaśa |
varayec chāstrakuśalān pravīṇān uktakarmasu || 15.10
evaṃ sarveṣu yāgeṣu nityanaimittikātmasu |
ācāryāṇāṃ sādhakānāṃ saṅkhyāniyama <saṃkhyāniyama> īritaḥ || 15.11
saṅkhyāhīnaṃ <saṃkhyāhīnaṃ> na gṛhṇīyād āpady api kadācana |
mohena yadi gṛhṇīyād bhayaṃ syād rājarāṣṭryoḥ || 15.12
prāṅmukhe maṇṭape bhāge tṛtīye paścime sthite |
madhyasūtraṃ samāśritya snānapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet || 15.13
prāggataṃ pratyagāsye tu saumyāsye dakṣiṇāgatam |
tadāsye cottarāsaṃsthaṃ yathālakṣaṇalakṣitam || 15.14
yadā snapanabimbādau bimbe snapanam ācaret |
evaṃ tadā prakurvīta maṇṭapaṃ dvijasattamāḥ || 15.15
mūlabimbe yadā kuryāt tadagre maṇṭapaṃ tadā |
tadānīṃ na tu kurvīta snānapīṭhaṃ dvijottamāḥ || 15.16
saptame pañcame vāpi pūrve snapanavāsarāt |
tṛtīye vā muniśreṣṭhās tasminn ahani vā dvijāḥ || 15.17
aṅkurān arpayitvā tu tataḥ snapanam ārabhet |
yadā pūrvadine kuryāt kumbhānām adhivāsanam || 15.18
tadānīṃ pūrvarātrau tu kuryāt kautukabandhanam |
pūrvedyur vighnite paścāt tasminn ahani vācaret || 15.19
yadā karmadine viprāḥ kuryāt kumbhādhivāsanam |
tadānīṃ tu dine tasmin kuryāt kautukabandhanam || 15.20
tataḥ prabhāta ācāryaḥ kṛtasnānaḥ prasannadhīḥ |
praviśya paṇṭapaṃ sārthaṃ paricaryāparair janaiḥ || 15.21
śalākāsahitair darbhaiḥ sahadevīvimiśritaiḥ |
mārjayet sarvato viprāḥ prāṅmukho vāpy udaṅmukhaḥ || 15.22
ālepayeṅ gomayena pūrvādīśānapaścimam |
nūtanenāmbareṇaiva gālitena jalena tu || 15.23
prokṣayet sarvadigviprāḥ pañcagavyakuśāmbubhiḥ |
eko dvo bahavo vāpi deśikāḥ snapane smṛtāḥ || 15.24
navavastradharāḥ sarve sarvālaṅkārasaṃyutāḥ <sarvālaṃkārasaṃyutāḥ> |
navavastrottarīyāś ca soṣṇīṣā gurusammatāḥ <gurusaṃmatāḥ> || 15.25
niyamasthās tu bahavas tathaiva paricārakāḥ |
yad yad yogyaṃ bhaved viprāḥ snapane yatra yatra tu || 15.26
tatsamastaṃ samāhṛtya maṇṭape sampraveśya <saṃpraveśya> ca |
snapanaṃ prārabhet paścāddeśikaḥ śāstrapāragaḥ || 15.27
snapanaṃ dvividhaṃ viddhi parāparavibhedataḥ|
paraṃ tu daśadhā proktaṃ pradhānādivibhedataḥ || 15.28
pradhānaṃ prathamaṃ viddhi dvitīyaṃ tu paraṃ smṛtam |
tṛtīyaṃ parasūkṣmaṃ syāt parasthūlaṃ caturthakam || 15.29
pañcamaṃ syāt sūkṣmaparaṃ sūkṣmasūkṣmaṃ tu ṣaṣṭhakam |
sūkṣmasthūlaṃ saptamaṃ syāt sthūlaṃ syāt param aṣṭamam || 15.30
sthūlasūkṣmaṃ tu navamaṃ sthūlasthūlaṃ taduttaram |
uttamādivibhedena tv aparaṃ navadhā sthitam || 15.31
parāparavibhedānām eṣāṃ sādhāraṇaṃ smṛtam |
anantakalaśaṃ nāmnā snapanaṃ sarvapūrakam || 15.32
eṣāṃ pradhānapūrvāṇāṃ sūtrapātapurassaram |
sarvam uddhāraparyantaṃ krameṇa śṛṇuta dvijāḥ || 15.33
lohajaṃ dārujaṃ vāpi mṛṇmayaṃ vā suśobhanam |
maṇṭapeśānadigbhāge saṃsthāpya jalabhājanam || 15.34
vediṃ prakṣālya toyena vastraiḥ saṃveṣṭya nūtanaiḥ |
sūtrapātaṃ tataḥ kuryāt kumbhasaṃkhyānurūpataḥ || 15.35
yathoktamānavistīrṇaṃ kṣetramaṇṭapamadhyataḥ |
maṇṭapasya tu viprendrāḥ prāgbhāgam avalambya vā || 15.36
svīkṛtya paścāt prāk pratyag dadyāt sūtracatuṣṭayam |
dakṣiṇottaragaṃ sūtrapañcakaṃ viniveśayet || 15.37
evaṃ kṛte bhavanty atra padāni dvādaśa dvijāḥ |
ekaikasya tu vistāraṃ tālaṃ prādeśam eva vā || 15.38
hastaṃ vāratnimātraṃ vā maṇṭapasyānurūpataḥ |
mahattvasya ca kumbhānām evaṃ sarvatra cordhvataḥ || 15.39
piṣṭacūrṇair alaṅkṛtya <alaṃkṛtya> caturdikṣu samantataḥ |
koṣṭheṣu pīṭhikāṃ kuryāt tapḍulair vrīhibhis tu vā || 15.40
tāsāṃ hi pratikoṣṭhaṃ tu kuryād āḍhakasammitaiḥ <āḍhakasaṃmitaiḥ> |
ardhādhikais tribhiḥ prasthair athavā kevalais tribhiḥ || 15.41
ardhottareṇa vā viprāḥ kuryāt prasthadvayena vā |
yad vā prasthadvayenaiva prasthenārdhottareṇa vā || 15.42
prasthena vā tadardhena tatpādenādha vā <tatpādenāthavā?> dvijāḥ |
turyāśramatha vā vṛttāṃ kṛtvaivaṃ pīṭhikāṃ tataḥ || 15.43
sauvarṇā rājatā grāhyāstāmrā vā bhedavarjitāḥ |
ślakṣṇā asuṣirāḥ kumbhāś caturviṃśāṅgulonnatāḥ || 15.44
vistṛter madhyatas tadvattadgalaṃ tryaṅgulonnatam |
tatam aṅguloṣaṭkena tatrāsyaṃ tryaṅgulaṃ smṛtam || 15.45
mekhalā parito jñeyā tryaṅgulā dvijasattamāḥ |
yad vā tadardhamānaṃ tu sarvam ucchrāyapūrvakam || 15.46
yad vottamottamā viprā droṇamānodapūrakāḥ |
tadaṣṭamāṃśato nyūnāḥ kramāt prasthadvayāvadhi || 15.47
adhamādhamakumbhās tu prasthamātrodapūrakāḥ |
evaṃ lakṣaṇayuktās tu kāryā vittānusārataḥ || 15.48
cakrādhāroparisthās tu vitatāḥ kamaṭhodarāḥ |
pāñcajanyavaligrīvāḥ śatapatramukhānanāḥ || 15.49
ūrdhvādhaḥ kaumudīmālāmaṇḍalālaṅkṛtā <kaumudīmālāmaṇḍalālaṃkṛtā> 
dvijāḥ |
makarānanaśeṣābhiramṛtāmbupravāhakāḥ || 15.50
nadīsamudraśrīvṛkṣanānāmālyaiḥ pariṣkṛtāḥ |
cakrādhārādibhir yad vā rahitāḥ satyasambhave <satyasaṃbhave> || 15.51
mṛṇmayā vānukalpe tu bhedacchidravivarjitāḥ |
na dvitaptāḥ sutaptāś ca hy ekavarṇās tu susvarāḥ || 15.52
saṅgṛhya <saṃgṛhya> kṣālayet samyak śuddhatoyaiś ca sarvataḥ |
sūtreṇa veṣṭayed yatnād aṅkulāṅgulam antaram || 15.53
paścime kalaśasthānāt kalaśān adhivāsayet |
śālibhiḥ sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā kevale sthaṇḍile tu vā || 15.54
pūrvāgrānuttarāgrāṃś ca kuśāṃs tatra paristaret |
tāreṇa tatra kalaśān nyasya puṣpeṇa pūjayet || 15.55
athomukhāṃs tu tān eva nyasya paṅktikrameṇa tu |
kuśānupari saṃstīrya prāṅmukhaṃ parameṣṭhinā || 15.56
darbhamudrāṃ pradarśyātha gandhatoyena sarvataḥ |
samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> puṃsā viśvena vikired akṣatāni ca || 15.57
nivṛtyā conmukhīkṛtya sarveṇa munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
pṛthaguddhṛtya kalaśān svasthāneṣu kramān nyaset || 15.58
kumbhanyāsādikaṃ sarvaṃ mūlamantreṇa vācaret |
nirīkṣaṇādisaṃśuddhān kṛtvā sahṛdayena tu || 15.59
aṣṭākṣareṇa mantreṇa mantrayet tān sakṛt sakṛt |
tenaiva pūjayet paścādarghyasrakcandanādinā || 15.60
tadāharaṇahomaṃ tu yathāśakti samācaret |
pūrṇāntam atha sampūrya <saṃpūrya> kramād dravyair niyojayet || 15.61
paṅktitraye paścimādi pūrvāntaṃ ca catuś catuḥ |
tatra dakṣiṇadikpaṅktau kalaśe paścimasthite || 15.62
dhātrīphalodakaṃ caiva lodhratoyam anantaram |
raktacandanatoyaṃ ca rajanīnīram uttamam || 15.63
tatas tu madhyapaṅktau tu tathaiva viniveśayet |
grandhipallavavāry eva tatas tu tagarodakam || 15.64
priyaṅguvāri tadanu māṃsījalamataḥ param |
tathaivottarapaṅktau tu bhaved etac catuṣṭayam || 15.65
siddhārthakodakaṃ caiva sarvauṣadhijalaṃ tataḥ |
sarvaratnodakaṃ caiva śuddhodakamataḥ param || 15.66
nyaset kūrcaṃ kuśaṃ dārbham udagraṃ ṣoḍaśāṅgulam |
aṅgulaṃ grandhimānaṃ tu mūlaṃ vai dvādaśāṅgulam || 15.67
śeṣam agraṃ vijānīyād ity etat kūrcalakṣaṇam |
atha vāṛdhāṅgulā granthir agraṃ vai dvyaṅgulaṃ bhavet || 15.68
mūlaṃ kuryāt tu viprendrā dvādaśāṅgulasammitam <dvādaśāṅgulasaṃmitam> |
brāhmaṇasya caturdarbhaṃ tridarbhaṃ kṣatriyasya tu || 15.69
dvidarbhaṃ tu viśāṃ kūrcaṃ strīśūdrāṇāṃ tathā bhavet |
sarveṣām atha vā kūrcaṃ catuḥsaptakṛtaṃ tu vā || 15.70
mūlamantreṇa tadanu pūjayet kalaśān kramāt |
arghyālabhanapuṣpaiś ca dhūpena munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 15.71
apidhāya krameṇaiva pidhānaiḥ sūtraveṣṭitaiḥ |
pratikumbhaṃ tu vasanair veṣṭayed vibhave sati || 15.72
ācchādya navavastreṇa sarvataḥ prāgudaṅmukhaḥ |
pūrvavat pūjayitvā tu tato homaṃ samārabhet || 15.73
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā samidādīn pṛthak pṛthak |
pūrṇāhutiṃ tato hutvā kalaśān abhimantrayet || 15.74
mūlamantreṇa sarveṣāṃ snapanaṃ vihitaṃ dvijāḥ |
antarāntarayogena kumbhaiḥ śuddhodapūritaiḥ || 15.75
snapanaṃ cārghyadānaṃ ca dravyāṇāṃ tu samācaret |
dravyanyāsakrameṇaiva taduddhāraḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 15.76
pradhānam etat kathitaṃ dviṣaṭkakalaśātmakam |
sarveṣāṃ kāraṇam idaṃ kāryāṇy anyāni sattamāḥ || 15.77
ambunā pañcagavyena kṣīreṇa tadanantaram |
dadhnā ghṛtena madhunā sarvauṣadhijalena tu || 15.78
bījāmbuphalatoyena gandhapuṣpāmbunā tataḥ |
hemaratnodakenātha pūritaṃ tu yathākramam || 15.79
kalaśānāṃ dviṣaṭkaṃ yat param etad udāhṛtam |
pañcagavyadadhikṣīraghṛtamadhvikṣuvāriṇā || 15.80
sarvauṣadhīgandharatnaphalapuṣpajalais tathā |
kevalenodakenāpi krameṇa paripūritam || 15.81
dviṣaṭkam etat kumbhānāṃ parasūkṣmam udāhṛtam |
sūtrapātādikaṃ cāmin <cāsmin?> dvitaye 'pi pradhānavat || 15.82
pādyam arghyaṃ tathācāmaṃ sarvauṣadhijalaṃ tathā |
dadhi kṣīraṃ madhu ghṛtaṃ tathā śuddhodakaṃ dvijāḥ || 15.83
kumbhānāṃ navakaṃ tv etat parasthūlam udāhṛtam |
sūtrapātādikaṃ cāsya prāg eva parikīrtitam || 15.84
pañcadhā bhājite kṣetre bhāgāḥ syuḥ pañcaviṃśatiḥ |
bahiḥ prāgādiyogena kalaśānāṃ dviraṣṭake || 15.85
kṣīraṃ dadhi ghṛtaṃ caiva madhu vai rasamaikṣavam |
dhātrīphalādidaśakaṃ sarvauṣadhyantam eva hi || 15.86
patrodakaṃ tataḥ paścāt tadantaḥ kalaśāṣṭake |
prāgādi puṣpatoyaṃ ca phalabījodake tv atha || 15.87
gandhodakaṃ ca tadanu hemaratnajale tathā |
puṇyatīrthasarittoye madhye śuddhodakaṃ nyaset || 15.88
dravyanyāsakrameṇaiva taduddhāra udāhṛtaḥ |
evaṃ kramād dravyayuktakalaśair dvijasattamaḥ || 15.89
snapanaṃ pañcaviṃśadbhir etat sūkṣmaparaṃ smṛtam |
pañcaviṃśat tu koṣṭhāni kalpayitvā tu pūrvavat || 15.90
madhye śuddhodakaṃ nyasya bahirindrādiyogataḥ |
pūrvaṃ kṣīrāmbhasā pūrṇaṃ paraṃ śuddhena vāriṇā || 15.91
tṛtīyaṃ ratnatoyena hematoyena cāparam |
gandhāṃbumiśritaṃ cānye phalapuṣpodakānvite || 15.92
śālibījāmbhasā pūrṇam aṣṭamaṃ parikīrtitam |
kumbhāṣṭakaṃ tu tadbāhyadigaṣṭakasamāśritam || 15.93
dhātrīphalodakaṃ pūrve pathyātoyaṃ tato 'pare |
gulūcīkṣodam anyasmin vibhītakajalaṃ pare || 15.94
kumārīkvathitaṃ toyaṃ vyāghrīsalilam eva ca |
nāgarodakam anyasmin tathānyasmin madhūdakam || 15.95
vihito 'tra samuddhāro dravyanyāsakrameṇa tu |
nṛsiṃhamantrair japtena kevalenodakena tu || 15.96
satyādyaiḥ pañcabhir mantrais tribhiḥsiṃhādibhiḥ kramāt |
antarāvaraṇasthānāṃ kalaśānāṃ munīśvarāḥ || 15.97
ekaikaṃ saptadhāmantrya prāgādau tadbahiḥsthitān |
kalaśāṃś cakramantreṇa hṛdādyenābhimantrayet || 15.98
gāyatryāntargatair viprāḥ kalaśaiḥ snāpayet kramāt |
dvitīyāvaraṇasthais tu upacārā hṛdā matāḥ || 15.99
kevalenodakenātha astrajaptena secayet |
yad vā prāguditenaiva vartmanā sarvam ācaret || 15.100
daśabhiḥ saptabhiḥ kumbhaiḥ sūkṣmasūkṣmam idaṃ smṛtam |
caturhastaṃ trihastaṃ vā kṣetraṃ sārdhadvihastakam || 15.101
dvihastaṃ vā samāpādya tadardhaṃ tu dvidhā bhavet |
ekena karṇikāṃ kuryād dvitīyena dviraṣṭakam || 15.102
dalānāṃ tu tato viprāḥ karṇikopari vinyaset |
kalaśānāṃ catuṣkaṃ tu dikcatuṣkasamāśritam || 15.103
pūrvaṃ tu pañcagavyena tataś caiva mṛdambunā |
sarvauṣadhyudakenaiva kevalenāmbhasātha ca || 15.104
pūrvapatrāt samārabhya yāvadīśānagocaram |
ṣoḍaśānyān pratiṣṭhāpya tatraiva kalaśān kramāt || 15.105
prathamaṃ pañcagavyena kevalena tu pūrayet |
gomūtreṇa dvitīyaṃ tu tṛtīyaṃ gomayāmbunā || 15.106
tretāgnibhūtinā viprāḥ caturthaṃ sodakena tu |
gajagovṛṣabhaśṛṅgavalmīkākhyamṛdā param || 15.107
śālikṣetrān nadīmadhyāt padmaṣaṇḍāc ca parvatāt |
mṛdbhiḥ ṣaṣṭhaṃ tu kalaśaṃ pūraṇīyaṃ tato dvijāḥ || 15.108
saptamaṃ sarṣapāmbhobhiḥ sarvauṣadhibhir aṣṭamam |
kṣīreṇa navamaṃ viddhi dadhnā daśamam ucyate || 15.109
ghṛtena caikādaśamaṃ madhunā dvādaśaṃ dvijāḥ |
sarvais trayodaśaṃ bījaiḥ phalaiḥ sarvaiś caturdaśam || 15.110
samastadhānyair aparaṃ sarvagandhais tu ṣoḍaśaṃ |
vihito 'tra samuddhāro dravyanyāsakrameṇa tu || 15.111
hṛdābhimantritaṃ kṛtvā ekaikaṃ kalaśaṃ purā |
snāpayen mūlamantreṇa ekaikena tataḥ kramāt || 15.112
iti viṃśatibhiḥ kumbhair anvitaṃ dvijasattamāḥ |
sūkṣmasthūlam idaṃ proktaṃ tato 'nyat kathyate dvijāḥ || 15.113
prākpratyagāyataṃ sūtrapañcakaṃ viniveśya ca |
dakṣiṇottarasūtrāṇām ekādaśa vinikṣipet || 15.114
evaṃ kṛte tu koṣṭhāni catvāriṃśad bhavanti hi |
tatra paścimadikpaṅkter ārabhya kramayogataḥ || 15.115
dakṣiṇād uttarāntaṃ ca kalaśānāṃ ścatuścatuḥ |
vinyasya pūrayet tāṃs tu kramād dravyair nibodhata || 15.116
pādyārghyācamanīyārthadravyaiḥ pūrvoditais trayam |
nagād ādyantamadhyebhyo nadīmṛttīrasambhavā <nadīmṛttīrasaṃbhavā> || 15.117
hradād valmīkaśikharād gajadantakṣatīkṛtāt |
halotthā govṛṣaśṛṅgaśālīnāṃ tu samudbhavā || 15.118
tathā ca padmaṣaṇḍotthā tv ekasmin gomayaṃ pare |
vanadāhasamudbhūtaṃ tathaiva ca mahānasāt || 15.119
tretāgnibhasma tv apare viniveśya ghaṭāntare |
anyasmin pañcagavyaṃ tu kuśodakasamanvitam || 15.120
saghṛtaṃ tailakumbhaṃ tu camasīvāripūritam |
palāśakhādirāśvatthaśamīlohitacandanam || 15.121
kaṣāyodakam anyasmin pare tu triphalodakam |
vacā śatāvarī kanyā vyāghrī siṃhī kṛtāñjaliḥ || 15.122
golomī siṃhalomī ca kuṣṭhaṃ bhūmyañjanaṃ tathā |
mahāgaruḍavegā ca kalaśe 'nyatra sattamāḥ || 15.123
mahānīlā gulūcī ca sahadevī śatāvarī |
viṣṇukrāntā ca kārkoṭā sāhvā vihniśikhā pare || 15.124
yaṣṭī varāhakarṇī cāpy anyasmin gajapippalī |
śrīphalādyāni cānyasmin pāvanāni phalāni ca || 15.125
dadhikṣīrājyakumbhāṃś ca dvau madhvikṣurasānvitau |
mūlānyambhoruhāṇāṃ ca tāny anyasmin dvaye nyaset || 15.126
drumāṇāṃ pāvanānāṃ tu sakṣīrāṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
patrapuṣpaphalopetam ekasmin mañjarīgaṇam || 15.127
jātyādikam athaikasmin kausumīyaṃ latācayam |
rocanārajanīyugmaṃ balā moṭatha padmakam || 15.128
iti pañcakam anyasmin darbhadūrvāṅkurāṇi ca |
sāsyaṃ śālyaṃkuracayaṃ kalaśe hy apare tu vai || 15.129
siddhārthakān sitādyāṃs tu priyaṅguṃ gandhasaṃjñitam |
aparasmin nyaset kumbhe saha vai nāgakesaraiḥ || 15.130
grāmyāś cauṣadhayaḥ sapta saptāraṇyā ghaṭadvaye |
bāhlīkaṃ candanaṃ caiva rasaṃ karpūram eva ca || 15.131
catuṣkam etad apare tv anyasmin dhātavaḥ śubhāḥ |
tāmrajāmbūnadādyās tu pare ratnacayaṃ mahat || 15.132
nyased vidrumajālaṃ ca rdvayor <dvayor> muktāphalāni ca |
arghyodakam athaikasmin nadītīrthodakaṃ dvaye || 15.133
sarvauṣadhighaṭaṃ caiva suśītāmbhoghaṭaṃ tataḥ |
sugandhapuṣpakalaśaṃ catvāriṃśat tv amī smṛtāḥ || 15.134
dravyanyāsakramoddhāra idaṃ sthūlaparaṃ smṛtam |
śītāmbupūritānāṃ ca ghaṭānāṃ kevalaṃ dvijāḥ || 15.135
catvāriṃśat samāyuktaṃ sthūlasūkṣmaṃ prakāśitam |
gandhodakena pūrṇānāṃ catvāriṃśadbhir eva ca || 15.136
samanvitaṃ ghaṭānāṃ tu sthūlasthūlaṃ prakīrtitam |
sūtrapātavidhānaṃ ca kumbhanyāsakramaṃ tathā || 15.137
uddhāraṃ cānayoḥ kuryāt sthūlādyasadṛśaṃ dvijāḥ |
bhaktiśraddhāvaśāc cāpi vibhavānuguṇaṃ tu vā || 15.138
trividhaṃ sthūlabhedaṃ tu dviguṇaṃ tu samācaret |
anukalpe tadardhaṃ vā pādam aṣṭāṃśam eva vā || 15.139
catuṣṭayaṃ vā kumbhānāṃ pratyekaṃ vā dvayaṃ dvayam |
ekaikaṃ vāpi viprendrāḥ sarvadravyamayaṃ ghaṭaṃ || 15.140
navānāṃ paripūrṇānām uktād anyad apekṣitam |
kuryād abhyūhya tatsarvaṃ pradhānoditavartmanā || 15.141
evaṃ tu daśadhā viprāḥ parabhedāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
aparasya vibhedāṃs tu krameṇa śṛṇuta dvijāḥ || 15.142
caturaśrīkṛte kṣetre hy ekatriṃśadvibhājite |
koṣṭhakānāṇ navaśatam ekaṣaṣṭis tathaiva ca || 15.143
madhye paṅktitrayaṃ sthāpya mārjayet tadbahirdvayam |
vīdhyarthaṃ tadbahirbhūyaḥ sthāpya paṅktitrayaṃ punaḥ || 15.144
dvayaṃ vimṛjya vīdhyarthaṃ sthāpayet saptakam punaḥ |
vibhajya vā trinavadhā hy ekaikaṃ vimṛjed dvijāḥ || 15.145
vīdhyarthaṃ saṅkaṭe <saṃkaṭe> deśe kalaśānāṃ tu pūrvavat |
krameṇa teṣu koṣṭheṣu kalaśān pūrvavan nyaset || 15.146
ghṛtam uṣṇodakaṃ caiva ratnavāri phalodakam |
lohāmbho mārjanāmbhaś ca gandhāmbhokṣatavāri ca || 15.147
yavodakam atheśāntaṃ madhyād ārabhya madhyame |
pādyam arghyaṃ tathācāmaṃ pañcagavyaṃ krameṇa tu || 15.148
dvicatuṣkoṇasaṃvītanavakānāṃ tu madhyame |
aindrādyuttaraparyantaṃ vidiksthānāṃ tu madhyame || 15.149
dadhi kṣīraṃ madhu tathā kaṣāyaṃ vahnidikkramāt |
evaṃ saptadaśa proktāḥ pradhānadravyasaṃyutāḥ || 15.150
śeṣāś cānye catuṣṣaṣṭiḥ śuddhodakasamanvitāḥ |
ity ekāśītikalaśā madhyataḥ saṃsthitā dvijāḥ || 15.151
tatas tv ekonapañcāśatkalaśās taddigaṣṭake |
tatra madhyamakumbheṣu diksthitānāṃ tu secayet || 15.152
guḍodakaṃ cekṣurasaṃ nālikerarasaṃ tathā |
śāntivāri muniśreṣṭhāḥ pūrvādikramayogataḥ || 15.153
vidiksthabrahmakumbheṣu secayen maṅgalodakam |
āgneyādīśaparyantaṃ śiṣṭam anyacchatatrayam || 15.154
aśītiyuktaṃ kumbhānāṃ tathaiva caturuttaram |
sugandhaiḥ śītalais toyaiḥ sampūrṇaṃ <saṃpūrṇaṃ> dvijasattamāḥ || 15.155
paścānmadhyasthanavake madhyādīśānapaścimam |
vāsudevādvarāhāntaṃ mūrtīnāṃ navakaṃ yajet || 15.156
arghyālabhanamālyaiś ca dhūpena ca yathākramam |
tadbahirnavakānāṃ tu brahmakumbheṣu pūjayet || 15.157
keśavād vāmanāntaṃ ca dvicatuḥ pūrvadikkramāt |
tata ekonapañcāśatkalaśānāṃ munīśvarāḥ || 15.158
pūjayed brahmakumbheṣu śrīdharādyaṃ catuṣṭayam |
pūrvādyuttaraparyantaṃ vahnyādīśānapaścimam || 15.159
narādyaṃ kṛṣṇaparyantaṃ catuṣkaṃ pūjayed dvijāḥ |
prāgvatkūrcāni vinyasya cakrikābhiḥ pidhāya ca || 15.160
tataḥ pracchādayed vastraiḥ nūtanais tu pṛthak pṛthak |
tata ūrdhvaṃ yajed devaṃ vāsudevaṃ jagatpatim || 15.161
pādyāndyair maṅgalāntais tu kumbhaiḥ saṃsnāpayed vibhum |
aṣṭākṣareṇa mantreṇa dviṣaṭkākṣarato 'pi vā || 15.162
viṣṇugāyatriyā vāpi tanmūrtimanunāpi vā |
snapanaṃ sarvakalaśair vihitaṃ tv atha vā dvijāḥ || 15.163
devaṃ vaiṣṇavagāyatryā snāpayet pādyavāriṇā |
tadviṣṇor itimantreṇa snāpayed arghyavāriṇā || 15.164
prateviṣṇo itiṛcā snānam ācamanena tu |
viṣṇoḥ karmetimantreṇa snānaṃ syāt pañcagavyakaiḥ || 15.165
dadhikrāviṇṇamantreṇa dadhnā saṃsnāpayed vibhum |
āpyāyasvetimantreṇa gokṣīreṇābhiṣecayet || 15.166
madhuvātetimantreṇa madhunā snapanaṃ vibhoḥ |
oṣadhya itimantreṇa kaṣāyaiḥ snapanaṃ bhavet || 15.167
tvaṃ viṣṇur itimantreṇa snapanaṃ tūṣṇavāriṇā |
phalinītyādimantreṇa snāpayet phalavāriṇā || 15.168
śanno devītimantreṇa snapanaṃ mārjanāmbubhiḥ |
sāvitryākṣatatoyena agna āyāhi mantrataḥ || 15.169
ratnodakair iṣetveti lohatoyena secayat |
gandhadvāretimantreṇa snapanaṃ yavavāriṇā || 15.170
śatadhāretimantreṇa snapanaṃ gandhavāriṇā |
ghṛtena snāpayed devaṃ tataḥ śukram asītyṛcā || 15.171
atha vā pādyapūrvaṃ tu yāvattoyāvasānakam |
ṛgbhiḥ puruṣasūktasya tataḥ śukram asītyṛcā || 15.172
ājyaṃ ca guḍatoyādyaṃ catuṣkaṃ śāntipaścimam |
tvaṃ viṣṇur itimantreṇa viṣṇor nukam iti dvijāḥ || 15.173
snāpayen maṅgalākhyena toyena munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
yenābhiṣiñced deveśaṃ pradhānakalaśena tu || 15.174
tacchuddhavārikalaśais tanmatreṇābhiṣecayet |
pratidravyaṃ tu mantreṇa hy arghyālabhanamālyakaiḥ || 15.175
dhūpena ca samabhyarcya tatas tenābhiṣecayet |
yad vārghyaṃ pādyam ācāmaṃ gandhasragdhūpadīpakam || 15.176
dadyād yathākramaṃ sarvaṃ kevalaṃ cārghyam eva vā |
yuktaṃ śatacatuṣkeṇa saptatyā ca trayeṇa ca || 15.177
kumbhānāṃ snapanaṃ hy etad uttamottamam ucyate |
hīnam aṣṭāṣṭasaṅkhyātair <aṣṭāṣṭasaṃkhyātair> antaḥ śuddhodavāribhiḥ || 
15.178
kalaśaiḥ snapanaṃ yat tu tat syād uttamamadhyamam |
tathā paṅkticatuṣkaṃ tu hīnaṃ syāt pūrvaniścitāt || 15.179
yad etat snapanaṃ yuktam ekāśītyā ca madhyataḥ |
dikṣu caikonapañcāśaccatuṣkeṇa vidikṣu ca || 15.180
brāhmadaivikabhāgasthaiḥ kalaśair anvitaṃ dvijāḥ |
śeṣaiḥ ṣaṣṭyuttaraśatasaṅkhyātaiḥ <ṣaṣṭyuttaraśatasaṃkhyātaiḥ> 
śuddhavāribhiḥ || 15.181
vihīnaṃ kalaśair viprās tad bhaved uttamādhamam |
śatadvayena kumbhānāṃ caturdiksaṃsthitena ca || 15.182
caturhīnena vai viprā hy ekāśītyā ca madhyataḥ |
saṃyuktaṃ snapanaṃ prāgvat tad bhaven madhyamottamam || 15.183
aṣṭāṣṭaparisaṃkhyātair antaḥ śuddhodavāribhiḥ |
kalaśair yad bhaved dhīnaṃ tat syān madhyamamadhyamam || 15.184
ekāśītyā ca kumbhānāṃ madhyatas tu samanvitam |
dikṣu caikonapañcāśanmadhyasthanavasaṃyutam || 15.185
śeṣaiḥ śuddhodakalaśair vihīnaṃ madhyamādhamam |
paṅktīnām aṣṭakenātra hīnakṣetraṃ tu kalpayet || 15.186
ekāśītyā ca kumbhānāṃ kevalaṃ pūrvavad dvijāḥ |
adhamottamam etat tu snapanaṃ parikīrtitam || 15.187
dvātriṃśadbhis tu kalaśaiḥ koṇasthaiḥ śuddhavāribhiḥ |
vihīnaṃ snapanaṃ yat tad bhaved adhamamadhyamam || 15.188
yac catuḥṣaṣṭikalaśair vihīnaṃ sarvadiksthitaiḥ |
śuddhodakair dvijaśreṣṭhās tad bhaved adhamādhamam || 15.189
navadhā saptadhā vātra kṣetraṃ kṛtvā tu pīḍayet |
dvayaṃ catuṣkaṃ vā śiṣṭaṃ kumbhānāṃ sthāpanārthataḥ || 15.190
ity evam aparaṃ proktaṃ navadhā munisattamāḥ |
kumbhādhivāsapūrvaṃ tu sarvaṃ pūrvavad ācaret || 15.191
ājyasya daivataṃ devo vāsudevaḥ paraḥ smṛtaḥ |
uṣṇāmbhasaḥ saṅkarṣaṇaḥ <saṃkarṣaṇaḥ> pradyumno ratnavāriṇaḥ || 15.192
phalāmbhaso 'niruddhas tu bhagavān daivataṃ dvijāḥ |
nārāyaṇas tu mantrātmā lohatoyasya daivatam || 15.193
mārjanasya hayagrīvo viṣṇuḥ syād gandhavāriṇaḥ |
nṛsiṃhokṣatatoyasya varāho yavavāriṇaḥ || 15.194
pādyasya keśavo devo 'rghyasya nārāyaṇah smṛtaḥ |
deva ācamanīyasya mādhavas tv adhidevatā || 15.195
govindaḥ pañcagavyasya viṣṇus tu dadhidaivatam |
madhusūdanasaṃjñas tu payaso devatā smṛtā || 15.196
trivikramākhyo madhunaḥ kaṣāyasya ca vāmanaḥ |
bhagavān śrīdharākhyas tu guḍatoyasya devatā || 15.197
devadevo hṛṣīkeśa ikṣusārasya daivatam |
dāmodaro 'dhidaivaṃ tu nālikerāmbhaso dvijāḥ || 15.198
padmanābhas tu bhagavān śāntitoyasya devatā |
naro nārāyaṇaś caiva hariḥ kṛṣṇas tathaiva ca || 15.199
āgneyādīśaparyantaṃ devatā maṅgalāmbhasaḥ |
ekāśītisthitānāṃ tu śuddhodānāṃ ca daivatam || 15.200
kāntyādyunnatiparyantam aṣṭakaṃ pratidikkramāt |
bahirekonapañcāśacchuddhatoyeṣu ca kramāt || 15.201
svadhādigāyatryantās tu śaktayo hy adhidevatāḥ |
aṣṭāvaṣṭau tu pūrvādidikṣvagnyādividikṣu ca || 15.202
kalaśānāṃ tu garuḍaḥ śeṣaḥ sūtrasya daivatam |
kūrcānāṃ tu paraṃ brahma cakrikāṇāṃ tu cakrarāṭ || 15.203
vāsasāṃ vāsudevas tu sarveṣāṃ ca sa eva vā |
mārjanaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ caiva śakṛdā cānulepanaṃ || 15.204
sūtrapātam alaṅkāraṃ <alaṃkāraṃ> piṣṭacūrṇaiḥ samantataḥ |
aṣṭākṣarādimantreṇa kārayet pañca mantravit || 15.205
pañcopaniṣadā mantrī kalaśān adhivāsayet |
viṣṇugāyatriyā tatra koṣṭheṣu kalaśān nyaset || 15.206
tatra dravyādhidevānāṃ vācakaiḥ pūrayet kramāt |
kūrcāṃs tu prakṣipet teṣu dviṣaṭkabrahmavidyayā || 15.207
tat tad dravyādhidevāṃs tu tattaddravyeṣu pūjayet |
cakrikāḥ sthāpayet paścāc cakramantreṇa sādhakaḥ || 15.208
vāsobhiś chādeyat paścāddviṣaṭkārṇeṇa mantravit |
vastrāpanayanaṃ kuryān mūlamantreṇa mantravit || 15.209
praṇavena tu sūtrāṇi chitvā tenābhivandya ca |
uddhṛtya viṣṇugāyatryā dadyād dhaste guros tathā || 15.210
yasmin yasmin na mantro 'tra vihitaḥ karmaṇi dvijāḥ |
aṣṭākṣareṇa mantreṇa tat tat kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ || 15.211
atha vā sarvakarmāṇi mūlenaiva samācaret |
pūrvoktaḥ parabhedānāṃ snapanānāṃ dvijottamāḥ || 15.212
arghyādidravyanicaya itareṣāṃ tu kathyate |
viṣṇuparṇī ca dūrvā ca padmaṃ śyāmākam eva ca || 15.213
etāni pādyasyāṅgāni catvāri dvijapuṅgavāḥ <dvijapuṃgavāḥ> |
gandhapuṣpākṣataphale yavasiddhārthakaṃ tilam || 15.214
kuśāgram arghyasyāṅgāni hy etāny aṣṭau bhavanti hi |
lavaṅgajātitakkolam aṅgam ācamanīyake || 15.215
śakṛdrasaṃ ca gomūtraṃ kṣīraṃ dadhi ghṛtaṃ tathā |
aṅgāni pañcagavyasya pañcaitāni ca sarvataḥ || 15.216
śamyudumbarabilvānāṃ palāśavaṭayos tathā |
khadirāśvatthayoś cāpi vikaṅkatataros tathā || 15.217
tvaksāraṃ tu kaṣāyaṃ syāt sarvapāpāpanodanam |
kadalībimbacūtāś ca panasaṃ mātuluṅgakam || 15.218
nālikeraṃ cāmalakaṃ bījapūraṃ phalāmbhasaḥ |
aṅgāny etāni caivāṣṭau phalāni kathitāni vai || 15.219
sahadevī śirīṣaṃ ca rajanī sūryavartinī |
sadābhadrā kuśāgrāṇi mārjanāṅgāni ṣaṭ dvijāḥ || 15.220
sūryakāntaṃ padmarāgam indukāntaṃ tathaiva ca |
vaiḍūryaṃ cāpyayas kāntam indranīlaprabālakau || 15.221
gāruḍaṃ puṣyarāgaṃ ca sphaṭikabrahmarāgakau |
vajraṃ mauktikam aṅgāni ratnodasyātha vā dvijāḥ || 15.222
maṇir muktāphalaṃ vajraṃ pravālaṃ puṣyakaṃ tathā |
ratnodakāṅgāny etāni pañcaivaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 15.223
bāhlīkaṃ candanaṃ caiva karpūram agaruṃ tathā |
gandhāṅgāni ca catvāri tv atha vā munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 15.224
candanaṃ kuṅkumaṃ māṃsī hariberaṃ muraṃ tathā |
uśīraṃ kuṣṭham agarur gandhāmbho 'ṅgaṃ tu cāṣṭakam || 15.225
rukmaṃ rūpyaṃ ca tāmraṃ cāpyayas trapukam eva ca |
aṅgāni kathitāny eva pañca vai lohavāriṇaḥ || 15.226
tilasiddhārthanīvārayavaveṇuyavāni ca |
tulasīpatrayuktāni śāntyambho 'ṅgāni caiva ṣaṭ || 15.227
indravallyaṅkuraṃ padmam aśvatthāṅkuram eva ca |
ekapadmaṃ ca catvāryaṅgāni maṅgalavāriṇaḥ || 15.228
śuddhodakalaśāḥ sarve candanaikāṅgasaṃyutāḥ |
ityuktoparabhedānāṃ snapanānāṃ yathākramam || 15.229
dravyāṇāṃ nicayaś cātha sarvauṣadhyādi cocyate |
kuṣṭhaṃ māṃsī haridre dve murāśaileyacampakāḥ || 15.230
vacākaccoramustāś ca sarvauṣadhyaḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
palāśabilvavakulakadambāmraśirīṣajāḥ || 15.231
nyagrodhāśvatthajāś cāpi pallavāḥ patravāriṇaḥ |
ketakīmallikājātinandyāvartotpalodbhavāḥ || 15.232
padmacampakakundotthāḥ kusumāḥ puṣpavāriṇaḥ |
yavagodhūmakavrīhiśālimudgapriyaṅgukāḥ || 15.233
māṣanīvārakrau cāṅgaṃ kathitaṃ bījavāriṇaḥ |
atha cānantakalaśaṃ nāmnā sakalapūrakam || 15.234
yad etasya vidhānaṃ tu śṛṇudhvaṃ munisattamāḥ |
pūrvavan maṇṭapaṃ kuryāc catvāriṃśatkarāyatam || 15.235
dvārtiṃśatkaravistāraṃ caturdvārādisaṃyutam |
dhvajādyair apy alaṅkāraiḥ <alaṃkāraiḥ> pūrvavat suvibhūṣitam || 15.236
āpādya vā prapāmātraṃ yathābhimatadeśagam |
yāgārthaṃ maṇṭapaṃ prāgvat kalpayet tatsamīpataḥ || 15.237
ukte dine 'ṅkurāropaṃ kṛtvā karmadināt purā |
tadarthān sarvasambhārān <sarvasaṃbhārān> saṃbhṛtya susamāhitaḥ || 15.238
deśikendras tu pūrvedyuḥ susnātaś ca kṛtāhnikaḥ |
bhūṣaṇair vividhair vastrair nūtanaiś ca vibhūṣitaḥ || 15.239
sitoṣṇīṣottarīyaś ca citrair mālyair alaṅkṛtaḥ <alaṃkṛtaḥ> |
caturbhir aṣṭabhir vāryais tādṛśair api sādhakaiḥ || 15.240
tatsaṅkhyaiḥ <tatsaṃkhyaiḥ> śāstrakuśalaiḥ kañcukādivibhūṣitaiḥ |
anyaiś ca susitair vastraiḥ sthagitānananāsikaiḥ || 15.241
tattatprayogakuśalair anekaiḥ paricārakaiḥ |
prāpte 'parāhṇasamaye kṛtvā dvārsthārcanaṃ viśet || 15.242
yāgārthaṃ maṇṭapaṃ tatra devaṃ kumbhādike yajet |
tatraiva vā yajed bimbaṃ vahnau santarpya <saṃtarpya> pūrvavat || 15.243
tato 'nujñāṃ samādāya krameṇa munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> |
anukalpavidhāne tu prāsādaṃ sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> ca || 15.244
mūlabimbaṃ tu sampūjya <saṃpūjya> arghyālabhanamālyakaiḥ |
dhupena ca tato 'nujñāṃ samādāyārabhet tataḥ || 15.245
dvārsthābhyarcanapūrvaṃ tu viśet snapanamaṇṭapam |
prokṣayet pañcagavyena mūlamantreṇa sarvataḥ || 15.246
nānāvidhāni puṣpāṇi vikiret sarvadikṣu ca |
siddhārthakāṃś ca bījāni tato maṇṭapamadhyataḥ || 15.247
sārdhadvāviṃśatikaraṃ bhajet kṣetraṃ tu pañcadhā |
ekaikaṃ navadhā bhūyaś catvāriṃśac ca pañca ca || 15.248
paṅktayaś cāpi koṣṭhānāṃ pañcaviṃśottaraṃ bhavet |
dvisahasraṃ tato madhye kalaśasthāpanārthataḥ || 15.249
ekāśītiṃ ca koṣṭhāni saṃsthāpya parimārjayet |
parito vīdhayaḥ paṅktidvitayaṃ tadbahiḥ punaḥ || 15.250
pūrvādidikcatuṣke tu ekāśītipadāni ca |
kalpayet pārśvato vīdhyai punaḥ paṅktidvayaṃ bhavet || 15.251
caturṣu koṇeṣv ekonapañcāśatkoṣṭhakāni ca |
kalpayet tatra cāpy ekāśītimadhyānusārataḥ || 15.252
madhyato navakaṃ sthāpya paṅktyekāṃ lopayet pari |
bahiḥ paṅktidvaye dikṣu ṣaṭkaṃ ṣaṭkaṃ vidikṣu ca || 15.253
catuś catuś ca saṃsthāpya śeṣāṇi parimārjayet |
tadbahiḥ parito vīdhyai lumpet paṅktidvayaṃ tataḥ || 15.254
koṇāni kalpayed yatnāt padaṣoḍaśakāni tu |
tatpārśve lopayet paṅktim ekaikāṃ dikcatuṣṭaye || 15.255
paṅktidvaye tu dvārāṇām antarbhāgāstrayo bahiḥ |
pañca pārśve tu śobhārthaṃ caturaṃ tadbahir dvayam || 15.256
tadantaḥ paṅktitritaye trayas triṃśat padāni tu |
vīdhyā sahaikatāṃ nītvā hy ekaikaṃ sthāpayed bahiḥ || 15.257
dvārāṇām api koṇānāṃ madhye ṣoḍaśasaṅkhyayā <ṣoḍaśasaṃkhyayā> |
pañcaviṃśatikoṣṭhāni sthāpayitvā tu pārśvataḥ || 15.258
anyonyaṃ lopayet paṅktim ekaikāṃ tu munīśvarāḥ |
evam āpādya kumbhānāṃ padāni sthāpanārthataḥ || 15.259
tataḥ sugandharajasā sitena susamā dvijāḥ |
aṅguṣṭhavistarotsedhā ṛjvī rekhās tu kalpayet || 15.260
vikīrya koṣṭheṣu rajaḥ paścāddvārāṇi pūrayet |
tenaiva śobhāṃ pītena vicitraiḥ kusumānvitaiḥ || 15.261
latāvṛndair muniśreṣṭhā vīdhīḥ sarvatra bhūṣayet |
tataḥ saṅgṛhya <saṃgṛhya> kalaśān sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitān || 15.262
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā mūlamantreṇa vai ghṛtam |
gāyatryā vā tato dvāracatuṣke pūrvadikkramāt || 15.263
dvau dvau saṃsthāpya kalaśau kumudādīn prapūjya ca |
puṣpair abhyarcya koṣṭhāni vicitrair mantramantritaiḥ || 15.264
sarvadhānyaiḥ prayatnena kalpayitvā tu vīdhikāḥ |
tāsu dvau dvau kuśāgrau ca nikṣipen mūlamantrataḥ || 15.265
sūtreṇa veṣṭitān kṛtvā kalaśān pūrvavad dvijāḥ |
gāyatryā kṣālayitvā tān koṣṭheṣu nyasya tānataḥ || 15.266
adhomukhān nyaset pṛṣṭhe parameṣṭhyātmanā kuśān |
tataḥ samprokṣayet <saṃprokṣayet> puṃsā pañcagavyena tān kuśaiḥ || 15.267
viśvena vikirotsiktān akṣatāṃś ca tadūrdhvataḥ |
uttānayen nivṛttyā tān kramād yatnena vai tataḥ || 15.268
gālitena tu toyena sugandhaiś candanādikaiḥ |
vāsitena tu tān viprāḥ sarveṇāpūrayet kramāt || 15.269
madhyaikāśītimadhyasthanavake madhyakumbhake |
sūryakāntaṃ padmarāgaṃ vaiḍūryaṃ candrakāntakam || 15.270
ayaskāntaṃ cendranīlaṃ pravālaṃ gāruḍaṃ tathā |
puṣyarāgaṃ sphāṭikaṃ ca brahmarāgaṃ ca mecakam || 15.271
vajraṃ ca rajataṃ caiva mauktikaṃ tāmram eva ca |
sarvāṇy etāni nikṣipya tadbahirnavakāṣṭake || 15.272
pūrvādīśānaparyantaṃ madhyakumbheṣu vai kramāt |
dravyāṇi ṣoḍaśaitāni dvandvayogena vinyaset || 15.273
dvisaptatikasaṃkhyeṣu nyasec cheṣeṣu mauktikam |
pūrvokāśītimadhyasthanavake madhyagocare || 15.274
kadalīpanasāmrāṇāṃ kṣīrikābadarākhyayoḥ |
mātuluṅgakesarayor bhavyajambīrayor api || 15.275
phalāni nikṣipet paścāt tadbahirnavakāṣṭake |
prāgādīśānaparyantaṃ mātuluṅgaṃ ca dāḍimam || 15.276
nāraṅgaṃ cāpi jambīraṃ takkolaṃ badarīṃ tathā |
kṣīrikāmalake caiva drākṣākharjūrake tathā || 15.277
āmraṃ ca sahakāraṃ ca panasasya phalaṃ tathā |
kṣudrapūrvaṃ ca panasaṃ kadalīmocake tathā || 15.278
kramād dvandvaprayogeṇa madhyakumbheṣu vinyaset |
navakāṣṭakakumbheṣu badarāṇi vinikṣipet || 15.279
uśīraṃ kuṅkumaṃ caiva māṃsīṃ malayajaṃ tathā |
muraṃ ca hariberaṃ ca kuṣṭhaṃ cāgarum eva ca || 15.280
ekāśītipade yāmye viśvāny etāni nikṣipet |
madhye madhyasthakalaśe pūrvādikramayogataḥ || 15.281
śeṣeṣu madhyakumbheṣu nyased ekaikajaṃ palam |
vinikṣipen malayajam eteṣām aṣṭakeṣu ca || 15.282
samudravāpīkūpānāṃ taṭākānāṃ hradasya ca |
vṛṣṭer nadīhimānāṃ ca toyāni pratipādayet || 15.283
vāruṇe madhyame kumbha ekaikaṃ śeṣamadhyame |
śeṣeṣu cāṣṭavargeṣu śuddhodāni vinikṣipet || 15.284
yavagodhūmakavrīhiśālimudgapriyaṅgukān |
māṣanīvārakau cāpi navame madhyame ghaṭe || 15.285
śeṣeṣu dhānyam ekaikaṃ madhyakumbheṣu ca kramāt |
aṣṭakeṣu ca śuddhāni toyāni pratipādayet || 15.286
āgneyaikonapañcāśannavake pūrayed ghṛtam |
ṣaṭkeṣv indrādiyogena gomūtraṃ gomayaṃ tathā || 15.287
kṣīraṃ dadhi vinikṣipya koṇeṣūṣṇodakaṃ nyaset |
nairṛte madhyanavake tailaṃ vinyasya tadbahiḥ || 15.288
śeṣeṣu catvāriṃśatsu kalaśeṣu guḍodakam |
vāyavyanavake madhye nyaset tailaṃ tu sārṣapam || 15.289
kalaśeṣu ca śeṣeṣu vinyased aikṣavaṃ rasam |
īśānaikonapañcāśannavake madhu vinyaset || 15.290
śeṣeṣu nālikerāmbhastatkṣīraṃ vāpi vinyaset |
aindrādipañcaviṃśatsu prathame madhyame ghaṭe || 15.291
kṣetratīrthābdhiśailebhyaḥ sūkarākhyabilād gajāt |
valmīkād vṛṣaśṛṅgāc ca mṛdam ādāya pūrayet || 5.292
śeṣeṣv aṣṭasu cekaikaṃ ṣoḍaśe gandhavāri ca |
sahadevī vacā caiva śatamūlī śatāvarī || 15.293
kumārī ca gulūcī ca siṃhī vyāghrī tathaiva ca |
dvitīye madhyame kumbhe vinyased bahiraṣṭake || 15.294
ekaikaṃ prākkrameṇaiva ṣoḍaśe pūrvavad bhavet |
nyagrodhodumbarāśvatthajambubilvapalāśajaiḥ || 15.295
śirīṣamadhukotthaiś ca tv agrasair madhyamaṃ ghaṭam |
tṛtīye pūrayitvāṣṭau vyastaiḥ ṣoḍaśa pūrvavat || 15.296
palaśabilvavakulakadambāmraśirīṣajān |
nyagrodhāśvatthajān kṣiptvā caturthe pallavān ghaṭe || 15.297
madhyame 'ṣṭāsu ca vyastān prāgvat ṣoḍaśa vinyaset |
mallikājātivakulanandyāvartapriyaṅgujaiḥ || 15.298
padmacampakakundaiś ca puṣpair āpūrya madhyamam |
kalaśaṃ pañcame vyastair aṣṭau śeṣāṃś ca pūrvavat || 15.299
siddhārthaṃ sarṣapaṃ māṣaṃ rocanāṃ gosamudbhavām |
indrayavaṃ veṇuyavaṃ śamīśyāmākabījake || 15.300
ṣaṣṭhe madhyasthite kumbhe nyased aṣṭāsu ca kramāt |
vyastāni tāni dravyāṇi prāgvaccheṣāṃś ca ṣoḍaśa || 15.301
tilaṃ vanatilaṃ caiva jīrakaṃ kṛṣṇajīrakam |
atasīṃ śatapuṣpāṃ ca kuṭhāracchinnam eva ca || 15.302
ṛṣibījaṃ ca vinyasya madhyakumbhe tu saptame |
ekaikaṃ bahiraṣṭāsu prāgvat ṣoḍaśasu dvijāḥ || 15.303
ṣaṣṭīśyāmākaśālīnāṃ nīvārasya ca taṇḍulam |
dūrvākuśendravallīnām aṅkurān pippalasya ca || 15.304
nyasen madhye 'ṣṭame 'ṣṭāsu vyastānanyeṣu pūrvavat |
kuśodīcyekṣukāśānām uśīraśarapuṅkhayoḥ || 15.305
agarvapāmārgayoś ca mūlāni navame nyaset |
kumbhe madhyasthite 'ṣṭāsu vyastānanyeṣu pūrvavat || 15.306
tulasyāḥ kṛṣṇatulasyā grandhiveṇor api cchadāḥ |
bhṛṅgarājasya bilvasya śamyāḥ ketakijātayoḥ || 15.307
daśame madhyame 'ṣṭāsu vyastān śeṣeṣu pūrvavat |
mustānāgaramustākhyakande kuvalayasya ca || 15.308
kumudotpalayoś cāpi śītalīyakakandakam |
kalhārasya kaśeroś ca kande ekādaśe kṣipet || 15.309
madhyakumbheṣu caitāni kramād anyeṣu pūrvavat |
mudgamāṣakaniṣpāvaśimbivrīhiyavāṅkurān || 15.310
āḍakānāṃ kulutthānām aṅkurān dvādaśe kṣipet |
madhyakumbhe 'ṣṭake vyastān prāgvat ṣoḍaśasu dvijāḥ || 15.311
śaṅkhapuṣpī sadābhadrā viṣṇukrāntaikapadmayoḥ |
balāyāḥ kharamañjaryāḥ sahāyāś ca tathaiva ca || 15.312
aṅkurān sahadevyāś ca madhye kumbhe trayodaśe |
vinyasyāṣṭāsu ca vyastānanyeṣu prāgvad ācaret || 15.313
śvetārkaṃ brahmadaṇḍīṃ ca tathā brahmasuvarcalām |
saraktāṃ ca viraktāṃ ca praśniparṇīṃ sthirāṃ tathā || 15.314
eraṇḍaṃ cāpi vinyasya madhye kumbhe caturdaśe |
aṣṭāsu tāni vyastāni prāgvadanyeṣu vinyaset || 15.315
surabhiṃ padmakiñjalkaṃ nāgakesaram eva ca |
patramelātvacaṃ caiva latāṃ kastūrikāṃ tathā || 15.316
jātīphalaṃ ca vai pañcadaśame madhyasaṃsthite |
kumbhe nyasyāṣṭake vyastaṃ śeṣaṃ pūrvavad ācaret || 15.317
suvarṇaṃ rajataṃ tāmramāyasaṃ trapu sīsakam |
āraṃ kāṃsyaṃ ca vinyasya ṣoḍaśe madhyasaṃsthite || 15.318
kalaśe 'ṣṭāsu ca vyastaṃ prāgvat ṣoḍaśasu dvijāḥ |
evaṃ dravyāṇi vinyasya krameṇa susamāhitaḥ || 15.319
tata āgneyakoṇe tu devasyārādhanārthataḥ |
arghyādidravyanicayaṃ madhuparkaṃ ca vinyaset || 15.320
tato nairṛtakoṇe tu haridrāśālipiṣṭake |
dūrvām aśvatthapatraṃ ca siddhārthaṃ ca tathākṣatam || 15.321
mālyāni pūrṇakumbhaṃ ca nyasen nīrājanārthataḥ |
tathā codvartanārthaṃ ca cūrṇaṃ godhūmaśalijam || 15.322
rajanīcūrṇasammiśramīṣatpadmakabhāvitam < 
rajanīcūrṇasaṃmiśramīṣatpadmakabhāvitam> |
camasīṃ ca khalīṃ caiva tathaiva munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 15.323
candanaṃ mukhalepārthaṃ ghṛṣṭakarpūrabhāvitam |
campakair muramāṃsībhyāṃ hariberaiḥ samanvitam || 15.324
piṣṭam āmalakaṃ caiva śiraḥsnānārthakaṃ nyaset |
pṛthak pṛthak ca pātreṣu tato vāyavyakoṇake || 15.325
dhautavastraṃ karaṇḍaṃ ca puṣpamālyādibhājanam |
tata īśānakoṇe tu śalākānyāyasāni tu || 15.326
āyasā gulikāś caiva tathā sandaṃśanaṃ <saṃdaṃśanaṃ> dvijāḥ |
anyad yad upayogi syāt sthāpayet tad yathāruci || 15.327
etad uktaṃ samastaṃ vā yathābhimatakoṇagam |
madhyaikāśītimadhyasthanavake madhyasaṃsthite || 15.328
kumbhe yajed vāsudevaṃ tataḥ prāgādiyogataḥ |
diksthānāṃ navakānāṃ tu madhyeṣu prabhavakramāt || 15.329
caturo vāsudevādīn vidiksthānāṃ tu madhyataḥ |
īśādivahniparyantaṃ tān evāpyayayogataḥ || 15.330
madhyaśuddhodakumbheṣu satyaṃ sarveṣu pūjayet |
bahirdiṅnavakānāṃ tu śuddhodeṣu ca dikkramāt || 15.331
suparṇaṃ garuḍaṃ caiva tārkṣyaṃ ca vihageśvaram |
vahnyādīśānaparyantaṃ navakānāṃ catuṣṭaye || 15.332
śuddhodeṣu ca tān eva krameṇa paripūjayet |
ekāśītiṣu dikstheṣu pūrvādikramayogataḥ || 15.333
madhyakumbheṣu ṣaṭtriṃśatsaṃkhyāteṣu yathākramam |
padmanābhādayo viprā devā vedavidantimāḥ || 15.334
pūjya navakayuktyā tu madhyādīśānapaścimam |
madhyaśuddhodakumbheṣu yajet kalkisvarūpiṇam || 15.335
bahirnavakaśuddhodakalaśeṣu yajed vibhum |
pātālaśayanākhyaṃ tu paścādagnidigāditaḥ || 15.336
caturṣu koṇeṣv ekonapañcāśannavakeṣu ca |
madhyeṣu keśavādīnāṃ kramāt trikacatuṣṭaye || 15.337
ādyān dikstheṣu kumbheṣu dvitīyāṃs tu caturṣv api |
vidikstheṣu tṛtīyāṃś ca ṣaṭkaṣoḍaśake kramāt || 15.338
akrādivajraparyantam astraṣoḍaśakaṃ yajet |
koṇastheṣu catuṣkeṣu nyasec chaktiṃ tataḥ param || 15.339
aindrīdakṣiṇataḥ pañcaviṃśatau prathame yajet |
sarvasampatpradāṃ <sarvasaṃpatpradāṃ> lakṣmīṃ madhyakumbheṣu tadbahiḥ || 
15.340
aṣṭāsu puṣṭiṃ tadbāhye kāntiṃ ṣoḍaśake dvijāḥ |
evamādyeṣu cānyeṣu pañcaviṃśatiṣu kramāt || 15.341
prabhādīnāṃ ca śaktīnāṃ tritayaṃ tritayaṃ yajet |
tatrāpi pañcadaśame bahiḥ ṣoḍaśake nyaset || 15.342
kirīṭam antime pañcaviṃśatau tritayaṃ yajet |
śrīvatsaṃ kaustubhaṃ cāpi vanamālāṃ tathaiva ca || 5.343
vāsudevādimantrais tu vanamālāntimaiḥ kramāt |
aṣṭāviṃśatisaṃkhyaṃ tu hutvājyaṃ vai yathāruci || 15.344
pūrṇāṃ datvā tataḥ kumbhān sampātavidhinā <saṃpātavidhinā> spṛśan |
pidhāya cakrikābhis tu sarvānuktakrameṇa tu || 15.345
vāsobhiḥ chādayet paścān nūtanais tu pṛthak pṛthak |
bhūyaḥ pūrṇāhutiṃ datvā dikṣu bhūtabaliṃ haret || 15.346
mṛdādi sarvaratnāntam uddhārakrama iṣyate |
pūrvaṃ viṣṇor nukam itimantreṇa ca munīśvarāḥ || 15.347
pūrvādīśānaparyantaṃ mṛtkumbhair abhiṣicya ca |
sarvamṛtkalaśenaiva madhyasthena tato bahiḥ || 15.348
kumbhaiḥ ṣoḍaśabhir viprāḥ prāgādikramayogataḥ |
evam eva kramaḥ sarvapañcaviṃśatiṣu dvijāḥ || 15.349
pratadviṣṇur ity anena mūlādbhir abhiṣecayet |
pratatte viṣṇuvāsa iti kaṣāyair anvitāmbubhiḥ || 15.350
yasya tripūrṇety etena kalaśaiḥ pallavānvitaiḥ |
tadasyeti ca mantreṇa puṣpair āpūritai ghaṭaiḥ || 15.351
tāvām iti ca mantreṇa siddhārthādisamanvitaiḥ |
pravaḥ pāntam ity anena tilādyanvitavāribhiḥ || 15.352
paromātretimantreṇa ṣaṣṭyādidravyavāribhiḥ |
nate viṣṇor ity anena kuśamūlānvitāmbubhiḥ || 15.353
irāvatītimantreṇa tulasyādijalais tataḥ |
ato devetimantreṇa mustākandādisaṃyutaiḥ || 15.354
idaṃ viṣṇur ity anena mudgādyaṅkurapūritaiḥ |
trīṇi padetimantreṇa śaṅkhapuṣyādivāribhiḥ || 15.355
viṣṇoḥ karmāṇīty anena śvetārkādyambubhis tataḥ |
tadviṣṇor itimantreṇa surabhyādijalais tataḥ || 15.356
tadviprāsa ity anena snāpayel lohavāribhiḥ |
prāgekāśītikalaśaiḥ snāpayet kramayogataḥ || 15.357
pūrvādimadhyaparyantanavakasnapane kramaḥ |
aindreṇa navakenādau purūyajñāya ityṛcā || 15.358
indrāviṣṇu dṛṃhiteti vahnidiksaṃsthitena ca |
yaṃ manīṣeti yāmyena navakenābhiṣecayet || 15.359
vaṣaṭte viṣṇuvāseti nairṛtena tataḥ param |
tisrovāca ity anena vāruṇena munīśvarāḥ || 15.360
yovarddha oṣadhimantreṇa vāyavyanavakena tu |
starīratuktaṃ bhavatīti saumyena navakena tu || 15.361
īśānadiksthatenaiva yasmin viśvena cetyṛcā |
idaṃ vacaḥ parjanyāyeti snāpayen madhyamena tu || 15.362
yāmyaikāśītikalaśais tataḥ saṃsnāpayed vibhum |
sahasraśīrṣaṃ devam itimantrapurassaraiḥ || 15.363
santataṃ <saṃtataṃ> sirābhir iti paryantaiś ca krameṇa tu |
aṣṭamantrair muniśreṣṭhāḥ prāgādinavakāṣṭakaiḥ || 15.364
etair eva samastais tu snāpayen madhyamena tu |
ekāśītyā tu vāruṇyā kalaśair abhiṣecayet || 15.365
samudrajyeṣṭhā ity anena pūrvādinavakena tu |
vāpīkūpataṭakotthaiḥ hradavṛṣṭisamudbhavaiḥ || 15.366
yā āpo divyā itimantreṇaivābhiṣecayet |
nadyambhasā snāpayitvā yāsāṃ rājetyṛcā tataḥ || 15.367
yāsu rājetimantreṇa himatoyena vai tataḥ |
samudrajyeṣṭhapūrvais tu catubhir <caturbhir> madhyamena tu || 15.368
tato 'bhiṣiñcet saumyaikāśītikumbhaiḥ krameṇa tu |
yad imā itimantreṇa śākreṇa navakena tu || 15.369
yasyauṣadhīr ity anena vahnidiksaṃsthitena tu |
sākaṃyakṣmeti yāmyena anyāvo iti nairṛte || 15.370
yāḥ phalinīr itimantreṇa vāruṇyāṃ navakena tu |
muñcantu mā śapathyād iti vāyudiṅnavakena tu || 15.371
avapatantīr ity anena somadiksaṃsthitena ca |
yā oṣadhīḥ somarājñīr itimantreṇaiśānakena tu || 15.372
yā oṣadhīḥ somarājñīr viṣṭhitā iti madhyataḥ |
tato 'gnyekonapañcāśatkalaśair abhiṣecayet || 15.373
gāyatryā caindraṣaṭkeṇa gandhadvāreti yāmyataḥ |
payasvatīroṣadhaya itiṣaṭkeṇa paścime || 15.374
dadhikrāvṇṇa (?) ityṛcā saumyaṣaṭkeṇa tatparam |
samyaksravantisaritas sūktenaiva ghṛtena ca || 15.375
nairṛtaikonapañcāśatkalaśair abhiṣecayet |
tejosītyādiyajuṣā tailena snāpayet tataḥ || 15.376
dvādaśākṣaramantreṇa prākkrameṇa guḍodakaiḥ |
tejosītyādimantreṇa vāyau tailais tu sārṣapaiḥ || 15.377
dvādaśārṇākhyamantreṇa sarvair ikṣurasais tataḥ |
madhuvātādibhir mantraiḥ kalaśair madhupūritaiḥ || 15.378
pūrvoditena mantreṇa nālikerajalaiḥ kramāt |
tenainvoṣṇajalaiḥ paścādvahnyādīśānapaścimam || 15.379
sutaptāyogulakṣepāt sañjātoṣṇais <saṃjātoṣṇais> tadaiva tu |
udvarttayet tato devaṃ drupadād itimantrataḥ || 15.380
śirasyāmalakaṃ dadyān mānastoketimantrataḥ |
prakṣālya śuddhatoyaiś ca bahubhiś ca sugandhibhiḥ || 15.381
madhyaikāśītikalaśais tataḥ saṃsnāpayet kramāt |
sahasraśīrṣety anayā ṛcaindrīnavakair ghaṭaiḥ || 15.382
aṣṭābhir aṣṭadiksaṃsthair madhyamena dvitīyayā |
dvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ tathā ṛgbhyāṃ kramān navakasaptakaiḥ || 15.383
pauruṣeṇa tu sūktena samastena śanaiḥ śanaiḥ |
snāpayed devadeveśaṃ madhyasthanavakena tu || 15.384
yad vā sarvasya vaśinam ityādyair manubhiḥ kramāt |
mahopaniṣadantaḥsthair diksthitaiḥ kalaśāṣṭakaiḥ || 15.385
eka eva nārāyaṇa iti madhyagatena tu |
yad vāṣṭākṣaramantreṇa sarvakumbhaiḥ krameṇa tu || 15.386
mṛdādi sarvaratnāntaṃ snāpayed dvijasattamāḥ |
uddhāra evaṃ kathitaḥ karmakrama ihocyate || 15.387
prabhāte tu kṛtasnānaḥ kṛtakautukamaṅgalaḥ |
deśikendras tathā cānyair deśikaiś ca samanvitaḥ || 15.388
prāsādaṃ sampraviśyātha <saṃpraviśyātha> nityaṃ nirvartya pūrvavat |
yāgamaṇṭapam āsādya rajobhiḥ pūrya maṇḍalam || 15.389
kumbhamaṇḍalayor iṣṭvā prāsādaṃ sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> ca |
tatas tv arghyādibhir bhogair mūlabimbaṃ tu pūjayet || 15.390
tasmāt snapanabimbe tu samāvāhya tathaiva ca |
iṣṭvālaṅkṛtya <iṣṭvālaṃkṛtya> vividhair vastrair mālyaiś ca bhūṣaṇaiḥ || 15.391
śibikādau samāropya sarvālaṅkārasaṃyutam <sarvālaṃkārasaṃyutam> |
pūrvoktavidhinā viprāḥ ninayet snānamaṇṭapam || 15.392
snānapīṭhe samāropya pūrvoditavidhānataḥ |
yathākramaṃ samabhyarcya yāvadātmanivedanam || 15.393
tatas tu devadevasya kuryāt kautukabandhanam |
kumbhānāṃ vihitaṃ karma na kṛtaṃ yadi vai purā || 15.394
kayā tv anupapattyā tu tadā tat sarvam ācaret |
snānāsanoditair bhogair mukhalepāntimaiḥ kramāt || 15.395
pūjayitvā tataḥ kumbhaiḥ snāpayed uktavartmanā |
sarveṣām api kumbhānāṃ snānaśeṣaṃ tu pūrayet || 15.396
ghaṭāntaraṃ tu dravyāṇām antarāntarayogataḥ |
śuddhāmbhasā snāpayitvā vastreṇārghyādibhir yajet || 15.397
evaṃ saṃsnāpya vidhivadrajanīcūrṇapūritaiḥ |
alaṅkṛte <alaṃkṛte> dhānyapīṭhe purastādadhivāsitaiḥ || 15.398
pañcaviṃśatibhiḥ kumbhair navabhiḥ pañcabhis tu vā |
etena vāpi taccūrṇaṃ śrīsūktena dvijottamāḥ || 15.399
pradadyān mūrdhni devasya bhūyaś cārghyādibhir yajet |
sarvāṅgaṃ parimṛjyātha bhaktānāṃ mūrdhni dāpayet || 15.400
viṣvaksenasya datvā tu tanmantreṇa tato dvijāḥ |
sahasradhārāsnapanam ācarec chuddhavāribhiḥ || 15.401
sacandanādikaṃ datvā tataḥ pīṭhantataḥ prabhum |
alaṅkārāsanaṃ <alaṃkārāsanaṃ> nītvā āsanādikramād yajet || 15.402
bhogaiḥ sāṃsparśikaiḥ prāgvadvividhair aupacārikaiḥ |
hṛdayaṅgam <hṛdayaṃgam> asaṃjñaiś ca vicitraiś ca manoharaiḥ || 15.403
evaṃ dvijapradānāntaṃ homāntaṃ vā prapūjya ca |
śibikādau samāropya pūrvavat sampraveśayet <saṃpraveśayet> || 15.404
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva prāsādābhyantaraṃ tataḥ |
tatrāvaropya tadbimbaṃ svasthāne sanniveśya <saṃniveśya> ca || 15.405
iṣṭvā cārdhyādibhir bhogair mūlabimbaṃ tathaiva ca |
samarpya ca kṛtaṃ karma kuryāc caiva visarjanam || 15.406
mṛṇmayādau mūlabimbe vidhir evaṃ prakīrtitaḥ |
śilāmayādike mūle snapanārhe munīśvarāḥ || 15.407
tam eva snāpya pūrvoktavidhinā kautukād imam |
havirantaiḥ samabhyarcya homāntaṃ sarvam ācaret || 15.408
tatas tu cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ vicitrair vasanais tathā |
anekair bhūṣaṇai ramyair mālyaiś ca susugandhibhiḥ || 15.409
alaṃkṛtya <alaṅkṛtya> samāropya śibikāṃ sampraveśayet <saṃpraveśayet> |
āsthānamaṇṭapaṃ samyagutsavoditavartmanā || 15.410
tatrāvaropya yānāc ca sauvarṇe vitate śubhe |
bhadrāsane 'tha vā viprā vicitrāstaraṇānvite || 15.411
yathākramoditenaiva vartmanā samprapūjayet <saṃprapūjayet> |
sāṃsparśikādikair bhogair vividhais tu viśeṣataḥ || 15.412
mahāhavir nivedyātha kṛtvā sarvaṃ krameṇa tu |
dvijapradānaparyantamagnau santarpayet <saṃtarpayet> kramāt || 15.413
samarpaṇādikaṃ sarvaṃ kṛtvā devaṃ jagatpatim |
samāropya ca yānādau sarvam aṅgalasaṃyutam || 15.414
praveśayet tu prāsādaṃ yānāder avaropya ca |
svasthāne sanniveśyātha <saṃniveśyātha> arghyagandhādibhir yajet || 15.415
mūlabimbaṃ tathābhyarcya kṛtaṃ karma samarpayet |
snānaśeṣeṇa toyena kumbhasthena krameṇa tu || 15.416
dvārasthān sakalān devān tathā cāvaraṇasthitān |
balidānakrameṇaiva samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> paripūjya ca || 15.417
baliṃ ca datvā śeṣeṇa gaṇeśam abhiṣicya ca |
pūjayed arghyagandhādyair atha vā hy anukalpake || 15.418
pūjāvasāne devasya snapanavyaktigasya ca |
prokṣaṇaṃ devatānāṃ ca gaṇeśasyābhiṣecanam || 15.419
ācaret kramayogena yajamānas tato dvijāḥ |
ācāryān sādhakāṃś caiva toṣayed vividhair dhanaiḥ || 15.420
anyāṃś ca vaiṣṇavān sarvān yathāśakti ca toṣayet |
anivāritamannādyaṃ sārvajanyaṃ tu kārayet || 15.421
evam eva hi sarveṣu snapaneṣu kriyākramaḥ |
prokṣaṇaṃ parivārāṇāṃ balidānaṃ ca varjayet || 15.422
mahāhavirvidhānaṃ ca vibhave sati kalpayet |
pradhānādikrameṇaiva snapanānāṃ tu pañcakam || 15.423
kuryān nitye vidhau viprāḥ tathā naimittikeṣu ca |
tatas tu sūkṣmasūkṣmādisthūlasthūlāntapañcakam || 15.424
cāturātmyādidevānāṃ kāryaṃ snāpanakarmaṇi |
ayane viṣuve caiva grahaṇe candrasūryayoḥ || 15.425
snapanaṃ mukhyakalpe tu hy ācared uttamottamam |
anukalpe tu tanmadhyaṃ tannyūnādicatuṣṭayam || 15.426
ayanadvayamadhyasthasaṅkrāntidvicatuṣṭaye
<ayanadvayamadhyasthasaṃkrāntidvicatuṣṭaye> |
āvṛtikramayogena kalpayen munipuṅgavāḥ <munipuṃgavāḥ> || 15.427
utsavārambhadivase tadante ca samārabhet |
athamottamasaṃjñaṃ tu tanmadhyaṃ vānukalpake || 15.428
mahāhavirvidhāne tu tannyūnaṃ tu samācaret |
prāyaścitteṣu kāryeṣu sarvāṇy etāni kalpayet || 15.429
teṣāṃ snapanabhedaṃ tu vakṣyāmy upari vistṛtam |
snapanānāṃ vidhānaṃ tu divyaśāstroktavartmanā || 15.430
yathāvatkathitaṃ samyak kim anyac chrotum icchatha |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
snapanavidhir nāma
pañcadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ


atha ṣoḍaśo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
bhagavan muniśārdūla sarvajña vadatāṃ vara |
pratiṣṭhā mantrabimbasya kathaṃ kāryā narottamaiḥ || 16.1
prāsādasya ca bimbasya pīṭhāder lakṣaṇaṃ katham |
tat sarvaṃ vistareṇaiva vadasva kṛpayādhunā || 16.2

nāradaḥ
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayaḥ sarve sāvadhānena cetasā |
mantrabimbapratiṣṭhāyā vidhānaṃ lakṣaṇādikam || 16.3
tat sarvaṃ devadevena sātvatādiṣu kīrtitam |
teṣāṃ sāraṃ samuddhṛtya pravakṣyāmi samāsataḥ || 16.4
brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyo vaiśyaḥ śūdro vā bhagavanmayaḥ |
śraddhābhaktisamāyuktaḥ sampannaḥ <saṃpannaḥ> śāntamānasaḥ || 16.5
āstikaḥ satyasandhaś <satyasaṃdhaś> ca sadācārasamanvitaḥ |
ācāryaṃ varayet pūrvaṃ bhagavacchāstrakovidam || 16.6
tattvajñaṃ bhagavadbhaktaṃ bhagavadvaṃśasambhavam 
<bhagavadvaṃśasaṃbhavam> |
ācāryo yajamānaś ca saha sammantrya <saṃmantrya> śilpibhiḥ || 16.7
puṇye deśe 'nukūle ca manojñe sādhusevite |
mṛdvāriphalapuṣpāḍhye kuśendhanasamanvite || 16.8
gosasyaśālisubhage kṣudraprāṇivivarjite |
parvatāgre ca tanmadhye sānudeśe dvijocite || 16.9
bhūgate tu vane ramye pādapauṣadhisaṅkule <pādapauṣadhisaṃkule> |
bhadre copavane hy adhya praśaste kamalānvite || 16.10
kūleṣu nimnagānāṃ ca tāsām api ca saṅgame <saṃgame> |
samīpe puṇyatīrthānāṃ susthire sārasaṅkule <sārasaṃkule> || 16.11
duṣṭaprāṇivinirmukte corātaṅkabhayojjhite |
sarvadoṣavinirmukte deśe divye manohare || 16.12
bhuvaṃ parīkṣya tatrādau śāstradṛṣṭena vartmanā |
tataḥ paraṃ dvijaśreṣṭhāḥ kṣmāparigraham ācaret || 16.13
kṣmāparigrahapūrāṇām ārambhe sarvakarmaṇām |
dvādaśākṣarapūrvais tu mantraiḥ sarveśvaraḥ purā || 16.14
ārādhyo bhagavān bhaktyā vedyāṃ vā kalaśe sthale |
santarpyājyādikair <saṃtarpyājyādikair> bhaktyā mantraiḥ śrutimayais tataḥ || 16.15
bhagavān viśvakarmātmā sagaṇeśaṃ tu yājayet |
vividhair upacārais tu puṣpadhūpānulepanaiḥ || 16.16
visarjane kṛte viṣṇoḥ sānale kamalodbhava |
śilpino yatra ye dakṣā mānyās te tadanantaram || 16.17
yathā prasannabuddhyā tu śaśvannirvartayanti ca |
tair api prayataiḥ snātais tarpaṇīyaḥ svakaḥ patiḥ || 16.18
tataḥ parigṛhītavyaṃ kṣetraṃ tv abhimataṃ dvijāḥ |
abhuktam athavā bhuktaṃ vasudhāguṇalakṣitam || 16.19
niśśalyam anukūlaṃ ca sthapatīnāṃ ca sammatam <saṃmatam> |
samādāya pratiṣṭhārthaṃ yathābhimatavistṛtam || 16.20
mahendro 'pāṃpatir <'pāmpatir> vāyur vittapeśānadikṣu ca |
padam āsādya vai kuryād divyādyāyatanāśritam || 16.21
pañcāyatanapūrvaṃ tu śubhaṃ devagṛhaṃ mahat |
siddhaye tatsvamārgāt tu vimārgāt tadasiddhaye || 16.22
etāvadarthanān muktam ato'nyeṣāṃ tu doṣakṛt |
svamārgaṃ paramārgaṃ vā yeṣāṃ sarvagato hariḥ || 16.23
sphuraty avirataṃ buddhau guruṃ taṃ śāstrataḥ svayam |
śubhe 'nukūle nakṣatre namaskṛtyācyutaṃ vibhum || 16.24
nirvatya nityaṃ vighneśapūrvam arcāpnayed dvijāḥ |
saha caikāyanaiś cānyair ṛgyajussāmapāṭhakaiḥ || 16.25
sālaṅkāraiś <sālaṃkāraiś> ca soṣṇīṣaiḥ sitāmbaradharais tathā |
samālabhanamālyaiś ca bhūṣitaiḥ sāṅgulīyakaiḥ || 16.26
śaṅkhavāditranirghoṣair gītibhir māṅgalīyakaiḥ |
phalapuṣpākṣatakaro lājasiddhārthakādikam || 16.27
samādāya śuciḥ kartā deśikena saha dvijāḥ |
sthānam āsādya sarveṣāṃ vāsudevaṃ hṛdi smaran || 16.28
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu pūrvoktavidhinā tataḥ |
japann aṣṭākṣaraṃ tiṣṭhan kartrāste deśikas tataḥ || 16.29
bahiḥ kṣetrasya caiśānyāṃ prācyāṃ vā munipuṅgavāḥ |
tatāṃ parṇakuṭīṃ kṛtvā vātavṛṣṭikṣamāṃ śubhām || 16.30
tatra puṣpārghyadhūpādyaṃ kṛtvā vai bhadrapīṭhagam |
pañcagavyaṃ samāpādya sārdhaṃ mantrair vilakṣaṇaiḥ || 16.31
nārāyaṇamapāṃ mūrtiṃ hemādye kutape śubhe |
sannidhīkṛtya <saṃnidhīkṛtya> sampūjya <saṃpūjya> sarittīrthāmbupūrite || 16.32
hemasarvauṣadhīratnadarbhavargasraganvite |
mantrāstrakalaśābhyāṃ tu sampādya <saṃpādya> racanāṃ tataḥ || 16.33
sādhāramāsanaṃ tābhyāṃ dhyātvā kuryāt tadarcanam |
hṛdi mantreśvaraṃ sāstraṃ pūjayitvā yathāvidhi || 16.34
nyastavyam āsane kaumbhe praṇavaṃ namasā saha |
saumyanāḍīpathā caiva tato hy astraṃ samantrarāṭ || 16.35
dakṣiṇena tu mārgeṇa tv apasavyaghaṭe vibhoḥ |
avatārya jvaladrūpaṃ dahantaṃ vighnasañcayān <vighnasaṃcayān> || 16.36
mantratrayaṃ tu sāmānyaṃ sarvatra vihitaṃ dvijāḥ |
ṣaḍaṣṭākṣaramantraṃ yat tathā vai dvādaśākṣaram || 16.37
hetīśaṃ yatsahasrāraṃ parijñeyaṃ tathāyudham |
kṛtadīkṣeṇa yallabdhaṃ suprasannāc ca vai guroḥ || 16.38
astraṃ tadaṅgam āpādyaṃ saviśeṣam idaṃ śubham |
sāṅgaṃ samarcayitvā tu bhogair mātrāvasānakaiḥ || 16.39
satsūktair yajubhiḥ sāmair yathāvasaralakṣaṇaiḥ |
vyañjakair atha sarveśam atha homaṃ samācaret || 16.40
sahasraśatasaṅkhyaṃ <sahasraśatasaṃkhyaṃ> yatpūrṇāntaṃ sākṣatais talaiḥ |
kuṇḍe mantrāstradikpūte evaṃ kuryāt tu deśikaḥ || 16.41
sthaleṣu vālukādyeṣu prāgādau viniveśya ca |
catvāraś cāturātmīyā mantrajñāḥ kṛtamaṇḍanāḥ || 16.42
ṛgvedādyāś catasro ye īśād vāyupathāvadhi |
bhaktyānayā parā yojyā homārthaṃ kṣetrasaṅgrahe <kṣetrasaṃgrahe> || 16.43
hotavyaṃ bhūmiliṅgais tair mantrair ājyādikaṃ bahu |
caturbhiś cāturātmīyair dviṣaṭkārṇapurassaraiḥ || 16.44
hotavyam aparair vipraiḥ smaran sarveśvaraṃ harim |
upadraṣṭā catuṣkoṇe ekaikaṃ viniyojya ca || 16.45
homārthaṃ sarvakuṇḍeṣu mantravinyastavigraham |
śucayaḥ saṃyatā dakṣā vāstuśāstrakṛtaśramān || 16.46
viśvakarmakulodbhūtānāhūyāgre niveśya ca |
pañcagavyādinābhyukṣya sitāmbaradharāṃs tu vai || 16.47
mālyacandanasūṣṇīṣair bhūṣitān 'ṅgulīyakaiḥ |
saṃvīkṣya pāvanīkṛtya hy ādāya ghaṭikānvitam || 16.48
kārpāsaṃ sudṛḍhaṃ sūtraṃ sahasrārābhimantritam |
sthapatīnāṃ kare dadyāt saha caikaśalākayā || 16.49
prokṣitān pañcagavyena sahasrārābhimantritān |
vikīrya lājasammiśrān <lājasaṃmiśrān> bījān siddhārthakānvitān || 16.50
japann astraṃ sacakraṃ ca tridhā kuryāt pradakṣiṇam |
prākpadāt tatpadaṃ yāvat saha ghaṇṭāravaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 16.51
kṣetramānamathādāya karair abhimatais tataḥ |
śiṣyadeśikakartṛsthair viśvakarmāṃśajais tu vā || 16.52
īśakoṇādi tatsūtraṃ caturdikṣu prasārya ca |
śaṅkubhir yajñadārūtthair mudrayec ca diśāṣṭakam || 16.53
tato bhūtabaliṃ dadyāt prādakṣiṇyena buddhimān |
tilapiṣṭaṃ niśācūrṇaṃ salājaṃ dadhisaktukam || 16.54
bhūtakrūram iti proktaṃ tena bhūtabaliṃ haret |
bhūtāni rākṣasā vāpi yatra tiṣṭhanti ke cana || 16.55
te sarvedyāpagacchantu sthānaṃ kuryām imaṃ hareḥ |
śalavetralatācarmapuñjādyair gradhitān drumān || 16.56
mṛdaṃgorvāsam <mṛdaṅgorvāsam> ākārān pāṇḍumṛdgrahaṇakṣamān |
na cāṅgahomāḥ syus tīkṣṇān kuddālākhyān khanitrakān || 16.57
sudṛḍhān yajñakāṣṭhotthān hastipādāṃś ca pūjayet |
kṣetrabrahmapade sthitvā yathābhimatadiṅmukhaḥ || 16.58
saṃsmṛtya dvādaśārṇena bhagavān bhūtabhāvanaḥ |
adhibhūtādhidaivākhyaṃ smared adhyātmalakṣaṇam || 16.59
saptadvīpavatīṃ tatra samudrādisamanvitām |
saptapātālasahitāṃ bhūtair yuktāṃ narādikaiḥ || 16.60
śaktibhiḥ śabdaniṣṭhābhiḥ sarvagābhiḥ samāvṛtām |
brahmabījasametena lakāreṇa sabindunā || 16.61
svayaṃ jñānaniyuktena mānayitvā purā tataḥ |
bhāvayitvādhibhūtatvam adhidaivamataḥ smaret || 16.62
sāmarthyaṃ yadbhagavato viṣṇoḥ sarveśvarasya ca |
paramadhyātmarūpaṃ ca vārāhaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ mahat || 16.63
etāvaduktaṃ sāmānyaṃ dhyānaṃ kṣitiparigrahe |
devālayavaśād anyadviśeṣaṃ cātra saṃsmaret || 16.64
caturaśre caturmūrtivyaktivyūhaṃ vicintya ca |
caturaśrāyate dhyāyed divyaṃ vidyāgamābhidham || 16.65
vṛtte śāntoditaṃ cakraṃ saṃvṛtāvayavaṃ smaret |
anantaśayanaṃ devaṃ dhyāyed vṛttāyate gṛhe || 16.66
puryaṣṭakaṃ yadamalaṃ kālapuṣkaradehabhṛt |
nābhirandhrodbhavaṃ viṣṇoḥ sthitam aṣṭadigātmanām || 16.67
devālaye tathāṣṭāśre smartavyaṃ vasudhāgṛham |
dhyātvaivaṃ dvādaśārṇena mantreṇaiva punaḥ punaḥ || 16.68
ṣaḍakṣareṇa saṃrodhya mudrāṃ badhvā tathācyutam |
abhidhyānasamādhānādyāvatkalaśasannidhim 
<abhidhyānasamādhānādyāvatkalaśasaṃnidhim> || 16.69
prāgvadvilakṣaṇair bhogair athāṣṭārṇena pūjayet |
saha vipraiḥ svayaṃ dadyād agnau pūrṇāhutiṃ punaḥ || 16.70
sarvakarmasamāptyarthaṃ kṣetre kṣetrīkṛte sati |
kuryāt pādapratiṣṭhāṃ vai suśubhe divase 'pare || 16.71
atha karmakarā dakṣā niyoktavyāḥ krameṇa tu |
santoṣya <saṃtoṣya> cānnapānādyais toṣamāyānti vai yathā || 16.72
evaṃ parigṛhīte tu kṣmāṃśe śalyojjhite sati |
āghṛṣṭe sopalā bālā vasudhā vasubhūmidā || 16.73
śuddhiṃ sāpekṣate kiñcitkṛtrimām udapāsara? |
yāvannopavanastāṃ tu cirarūḍhair mahādrumaiḥ || 16.74
saṅkīrṇā <saṃkīrṇā> tatprasūtaiś ca mūlair vyāptā nirantaraiḥ |
jñātaṃ tasyāpi bālatvaṃ śuddhir vai bhāvinī smṛtā || 16.75
tyaktā saritpravāhair na nagaragrāmadeśikā |
mahāntaṃ prekṣate śuddhiṃ bhuktā sā bahuśo yataḥ || 16.76
khātvā vaibhavam uddhṛtya dāyād abhyeti mṛcchubhām |
sitām aśarkarāṃ snigdhāṃ jalāntaṃ nikhaneta vā || 16.77
dṛṣṭvā jalaṃ samabhyarcya tarpayed yādasāṃ patim |
nāganāśrasamopetaṃ surasaṅgham <surasaṃgham> ataḥ sthitam || 16.78
sthityartham upalaiḥ sarvaiḥ saha sampūryate <saṃpūryate> mṛdā |
mṛdopalaiś ca sampūrya <saṃpūrya> jātiṣu snigdhayā tayā || 16.79
ākoṭya paunaḥpunyena bālādvai vārisecanāt |
samīkṛtyopalipyātha gogaṇāṃs tatra vāsayet || 16.80
bālavatsasametaṃ ca vṛkṣendragaṇasaṃyutam |
satoyāḥ śālayaś caiva prabhūtatṛṇasañcayam <prabhūtatṛṇasaṃcayam> || 16.81
vikīrya salilaṃ tatra santyakte <saṃtyakte> gomayādike |
apāsya gogaṇaṃ tatra tridinānte punarmahīm || 16.82
śodhayitvā catruthe 'hni lāṅgalaiḥ parivartitam |
pradīpteneṣṭakenātha sparśanīyā ca sarvaśaḥ || 16.83
tataḥ kāñcanajaṃ reṇuṃ tāmratāramayaṃ tv api |
ratnajaṃ gandhamālyāḍhyaṃ sasyaśāliphalānvitam || 16.84
sapuṣpākṣatalājāḍhyaṃ siddhārthaiś ca tilair yutam |
śrīkaraṃ pañcagavyena bhūmau sarvatra secayet || 16.85
akṛte vā kṛte khāte śuddhim eti ca tatkṣaṇāt |
yasmāt tasmād idaṃ samyagyatrakutra samācaret || 16.86
tato bhuvaṃ samīkṛtya gomayenopalipya ca |
samarcayitvā vidhivat tato diksiddhim ācaret || 16.87
śāstradṛṣṭena mārgeṇa śaṅkusaṃsthāpanādikam |
kṛtvā yathoktavidhinā prāsādaṃ kartum ārabhet || 16.88
ārabhyamāṇe prāsāde ye vai pratyūhakāriṇaḥ |
bhūtadānavayakṣāś ca rākṣasās tatpraśāntaye || 16.89
bālālaye devadevaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi |
arcayed vividhair bhogair yāvad vai mūlamandire || 16.90
sthāpanaṃ devadevasya tadante bālabimbagām |
śaktiṃ kumbhe samāvāhya mūlabimbe samarpayet || 16.91
evaṃ bālagṛhe viṣṇau pūjite munipuṅgavāḥ |
pratyūhakāriṇaḥ sarve praṇaśyanti tato guruḥ || 16.92
śubhe dinenūkūle ca nakṣatre pūjitagrahe |
lagne sthire sthirāṃśe ca dṛkśuddhe cottarāyaṇe || 16.93
divyādyutpātasaṃśuddhe sitapakṣe 'male 'mbare |
ājalāntaṃ kṛte khāte pūrvavatsamprapūrite <pūrvavatsaṃprapūrite> || 16.94
vimuktadoṣe bhūbhāge sarvalakṣaṇalakṣite |
pūraṇād aṃśaśeṣe tu sūpalipte dharātale || 16.95
catuṣṣaṣṭipade bhūte prāgvatsūtreṇa sarvadik |
snātaḥ śuklāmbaraḥ sragvī kṛtanyāsaḥ suśāntadhīḥ || 16.96
sarvasādhanasaṃyuktaś cārghyapātrasamanvitaḥ |
maṅgalyakumbham ādāya dhyāyamāno 'cyutaṃ hṛdi || 16.97
saha caikāyanairvipraiḥ sadāgamaparāyaṇaiḥ |
tathā ṛṅmayapūrvais tv āmūlād bhagavanmayaiḥ || 16.98
viśet prāsādabhūbhāgaṃ madhye kumbhaṃ nidhāya tam |
kuryān nirīkṣaṇaṃ bhūmes tāḍanaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ tathā || 16.99
secanaṃ pañcagavyena saha cāstrodakena tu |
oṅkārādyaṃ <oṃkārādyaṃ> pavitrāntaṃ mantrāṇāṃ prākcatuṣṭayam || 16.100
pāṭhayec ca sapuṇyāhaṃ brāhmaṇān kṛtamaṅgalān |
bahvṛcān śākunaṃ sūktaṃ tato bhadraṃ yajurmayān || 16.101
iḍāmayeti sāmajñān śāntādyair ityadharvaṇān |
īśakoṇāt samārabhya prāgādau pratipaṅktiṣu || 16.102
dvādaśākṣaramantreṇa svanāmnā tu pade pade |
natipraṇavagarbheṇa daivataṃ dehalakṣaṇam || 16.103
yaṣṭavyo vāstupuruṣo dadhisrakcandanādinā |
sātvikenopahāreṇa agnau santarpayet <saṃtarpayet> tataḥ || 16.104
yadvā vidhyantaraṃ bhūyaḥ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
sarvadikṣu samair bhāgair navadhā saṃvibhajya ca || 16.105
sūtraiḥ sudhāvaliptaiś ca yāgāgāravasundharām |
ekāśītipadopetāṃ kṛtvaitāṃ samprayatnataḥ <saṃprayatnataḥ> || 16.106
pratyekasmin pade kuryāt tatturyāṃśena cāmbujam |
dalāṣṭakayutaṃ caiva karṇikākesarānvitam || 16.107
agnīśarakṣovāyavyabahiḥkoṇapadeṣu ca |
catuṣṭayaṃ yatpadmānāṃ kevalaṃ taccaturdulam || 16.108
īśānapadapadmāt tu samārabhya prapūjayet |
bāhyapaṅktiṣu padmeṣu kramād devāsurān ṛṣīn || 16.109
vṛṣāṅkapadapadme tu brahmāṇaṃ karṇikāntare |
īśvaraṃ tapanaṃ caiva ditiṃ caiva tathāditim || 16.110
pūrvapatraṃ samārabhya vinyased yāvaduttaram |
evaṃ tasmin padābje tu pūjayitvā tu pañcakam || 16.111
yaṣṭavyaṃ ca tataḥ samyagvibudhānāṃ ca saptakam |
kramāt saptapadasthānāṃ padmānāṃ karṇikopāri || 16.112
vāyvākhyaṃ cāpavatsaṃ ca jayendraḥ samarīyakaḥ |
raviḥ satyātmadevau ca tato vahnipadāmbuje || 16.113
bhūyaḥ pitāmahaṃ madhye pūrvapatre nyased bhṛgum |
gaganaṃ hi vibhuṃ pūṣā dakṣiṇe paścimottare || 16.114
iṣṭvaivaṃ koṇapadmeṣu patrasthaṃ ca catuṣṭayam |
yajed rākṣasakoṇāntam ambujeṣv atha saptakam || 16.115
savitrākhyaś ca sāvitraḥ sasainyaś ca gṛhakṣamaḥ |
vivasvān dharmadevas tu gandharvādhipatiḥ smṛtaḥ || 16.116
padme nairṛtakoṇasthe bhūyo brahmāṇam antare |
bhṛṅgākhyo bhṛṅgarāṭ caiva tataḥ pitṛgaṇādhipaḥ || 16.117
devadauvārikākhyaś ca prākpatrādau catuṣṭayam |
tato 'ṣṭapatrapadmeṣu devatāsaptakaṃ kramāt || 16.118
karṇikāntargataṃ nyasya yāvadvāyupadāvadhi |
indraś cendrapadākhyaś ca sugrīvaḥ kusumadvijaḥ || 16.119
mitrākhyo varuṇaś caiva tv asurādhipatiḥ punaḥ |
vāyavyapadapadme tu madhye caiva prajāpatim || 16.120
prākpūrveṣu ca patreṣu śeṣaś cādharma eva ca |
yanmayādhipatiś caiva nāgendras tadanantaram || 16.121
saptakaṃ devatānāṃ ca pūrvavat pūjayet tataḥ |
pūrvākhyo rudradāsaś ca mukho bhallakasomakau || 16.122
dhārādharaś ca matsaṃjña ity etaddevatāgaṇam |
pūjayitvā tataḥ paścād ekaikasmiṃs tu paṅkaje || 16.123
svanāmnā vāstunāthaṃ tu patramadhye sthitaṃ yajet |
koṇabhāgasthapadmānāṃ kesarādho yajec ca tam || 16.124
praṇavaṃ vāstunādhāya namaś cānte prapūjayet |
pūjayitvā vidhānena puṣpadhūpādikena ca || 16.125
dadhikṣīrodakenaiva bhakṣyaiḥ saphalamūlakaiḥ |
iṣṭvaivaṃ vibudhavrātaṃ bāhye tvāvaraṇe purā || 16.126
tadantarapadābjānām īśakoṇāditaḥ punaḥ |
yāvanmadhyapadābjaṃ tu pūrya varṇāṣṭakena tu || 16.127
mātṛkāvarṇabhedenākārādikrameṇa tu |
yāvaddhakāravarṇaṃ tu tato 'bje 'bjadaleṣu ca || 16.128
tenaiva kramayogena pūjayed devatāgaṇam |
dvitīyāvaraṇe caivāntarīye nibodhata || 16.129
dhātā yātā dhruvaḥ kālaḥ kāmaḥ kartā jayantakaḥ |
jīvaḥ prāṇas taro yajño raviṃś ca mṛgayāmyakau || 16.130
lokanātho vidhātā vai bhṛguḥ sraṣṭā niyāmakaḥ |
manojavaś ca kalyāṇaḥ parjanyo draviṇas tataḥ || 16.131
sraṣṭāro viśvakarmā cety etā munipuṅgavaḥ |
devatāś cāntare pūjyāś caturviṃśatisaṃkhyayā || 16.132
eteṣām antare bhūyas tṛtīyāvaraṇe tathā |
ṣoḍaśānāṃ tataḥ samyagdevatānāṃ gaṇaṃ kramāt || 16.133
samudrā mātaro dvīpā māsā nadyaś ca tārakāḥ |
viśve devāś cāpsaraso manavo ṛṣayas tathā || 16.134
vasavo marutaḥ siddhā nāgāḥ sādhyā grahāḥ kramāt |
indrādilokapālāṃs tu caturthāvaraṇe nyaset || 16.135
tatpādādau tu ceśāntaṃ padmānāṃ patramadhyataḥ |
madhyapadme tu padmasthaṃ viśvarūpaṃ yajet prabhum || 16.136
yasyaivaṃ devatācakraṃ vāhanāstrānuyāyibhiḥ |
saṃyuktaṃ tiṣṭhate dehe sakalasya mahātmanaḥ || 16.137
praṇavena svanāmnā ca namaskārayutena tu |
ekaikaṃ pūjayed devaṃ tathaikaikam ihākṣaram || 16.138
iṣṭvaivaṃ devatāḥ prāgvadagnau santarpayet <saṃtarpayet> tataḥ |
kuryāt kumbhapratiṣṭhānaṃ yathā tadavadhāryatām || 16.139
pūrvavattoraṇādyais tu bhūbhāgam upaśobhayet |
nirṇiktālayavaktrasyāgratas tatkṣiter bahiḥ || 16.140
pūrvopakaraṇopetaṃ kuryān maṇḍalam uttamam |
kuṇḍāṣṭakāntarasthaṃ ca sthalaṃ tatrāṣṭahastakam || 16.141
sapiṇḍikā dvihastās tu kuṇḍāḥ pūrvoktalakṣaṇāḥ |
trihastaparitā vīdhī syād evaṃ dvinavaḥ śamaḥ || 16.142
pūrvavatpratikuṇḍe tu viniveśya ca sādhanam |
ātmanaś cottare kuryāt kuṇḍaṃ cātha samasthale || 16.143
dakṣiṇe pūrvavad devam avatārya yajet kramāt |
sthalāyāṃ sthaṇḍilasyordhve unnatāyāṃ ca pūrvavat || 16.144
tarpayitvā yathākāmam uddhṛtyāgnigaṇaṃ tataḥ |
dikkuṇḍeṣu vinikṣipya saṃskṛteṣu ca pūrvavat || 16.145
tathaiva ca vidikstheṣūddhṛtyābhyarcya vai kramāt |
tataḥ prabhavayogena caturdikṣu niveśayet || 16.146
caturo vāsudevādīn nāmnā ekāyanān dvijān |
svābhiḥ svābhir asaṃkhyaṃ tu taiḥ kāryam abhidhāya ca || 16.147
karmāvasānaṃ havanaṃ sājyais tu tilataṇḍulaiḥ |
evamapyayayogena vāyvādīśānagocaram || 16.148
ṛgvedādyāṃs tu caturaḥ saṃskṛtyādau tathā nyaset |
tair apy acyutaliṅgais tu svaśākhoktaiś ca pāvanaiḥ || 16.149
havanaṃ vidhivatkāryaṃ bhaktiyuktena cetasā |
atheśakoṇam āsādya brāhmaṇair aparaiḥ saha || 16.150
prāṅnirdiṣṭaṃ nyaset tatra snānopakaraṇaṃ tu yat |
daśārdhagavyapūrvaṃ tu kalaśeṣu pṛthak pṛthak || 16. 151
tān arcyārghyādinā paścāddviṣaṭkenābhimantrya ca |
samānīya śilopetān kalaśān pūrvasambhṛtān <pūrvasaṃbhṛtān> || 16.152
utkṛṣṭadhātusambhūtān <utkṛṣṭadhātusaṃbhūtān> nava śailamayāṃs tu vā |
samān supakvān sughanān mṛṇmayāṃs tadabhāvataḥ || 16.153
dvādaśāṅgulavistīrṇān tanmānena tu connatān |
dviguṇān sati sāmarthye nṛpāṇāṃ hemajān hitān || 16.154
tatsaṃkhyaṃ caturaśraṃ tu dvādaśāṅgulavistṛtam |
tattryaṃśatulyaṃ bāhulyāc chilābṛndaṃ samāharet || 16.155
saṃsthāpya vidhivatkumbhān pūrvoktena krameṇa tu |
kanbutulyam athaikaṃ vā tatkaṇṭhaṃ tyaṅgulonnatam || 16.156
tadguṇair api vistīrṇaṃ tatkhāto 'ṣṭāṅgulaḥ smṛtaḥ |
paritaḥ karṇavarjaṃ tu śaṅkho vā susito mahān || 16.157
vihito hata nāsas tv antaḥ śuddhas tu sākṣataḥ |
evaṃ hi sāntarād bāhyāt samālabhyādhivāsya ca || 16.158
phalair hemādikai ratnaiḥ sarvauṣadhimayais tataḥ |
gandhair bījais tathā dhānyair vidrumādyais tu mauktikaiḥ || 16.159
netravastrair alaṅkārair <alaṃkārair> bhūṣayet sragvaraiḥ śubhaiḥ |
dvādaśākṣaramantreṇa ekaikasya samācaret || 16.160
mūrtisaṃsiddhaye nyāsaṃ praṇavais taccidātmanām |
tataś cārghyādikair bhogair balyantair vividhair yajet || 16.161
śilāsv evaṃ kṛteḥ paścān ninayet kuṇḍasannidhim <kuṇḍasaṃnidhim> |
saśilaṃ kumbhabṛndaṃ tv ādhāreṣūparinyaset || 16.162
tadādhāraśilāṃ paścāt tatra vā maṇṭapād bahiḥ |
evam eva ca saṃskṛtya bhāvayet praṇavena tu || 16.163
jvalantīṃ gosahasreṇa khacitāṃ sūryabimbavat |
tataś cārādhya mantraṃ tu santarpya <saṃtarpya> śatasaṅkhyayā 
<śatasaṃkhyayā> || 16.164
madhye tatkalaśaṃ nyasya sāṅgaṃ saparivārakam |
niśśeṣaśaktigarbhaṃ tu vyāpakaṃ brahmatattvavit || 16.165
ata urdhve tiryagābhir vāgādyābhiś ca śaktibhiḥ |
vratamūrtisametābhirabhinnābhis tu tattvataḥ || 16.166
pāṭhayed brāhmanān tatrātmavyūhaṃ tu mantrarāṭ |
tathaivātmānuvādaṃ ca praṇavādyantagantu vai || 16.167
tam arcayitvā vidhivat tarpayitvā tv anantaram |
diksthitānāṃ ca kumbhānāṃ vāsudevādikān nyaset || 16.168
pūrvavac cāniruddhādyān vidiksaṃsthāpiteṣu ca |
pāṭhayec cāturātmīyaṃ saṃjñāmantracatuṣṭayam || 16.169
prabhavāpyayayogena tataḥ sūktaṃ tu pauruṣam |
ṛgvedān pāṭhayed bhaktyā yuñjatety aparān yajuḥ || 16.170
rathantarākhyaṃ yatsāma sāmajñān bhagavanmayān |
sahasraśirasaṃ ceti mantraṃ cādharvaṇaṃ tataḥ || 16.171
ekasmin vā muniśreṣṭhāḥ sarvoktaṃ kalaśe hitam |
tathaiva havanaṃ kuṇḍe madhyame vihitaṃ svayam || 16.172
kiṃ tu krameṇa vai mantrān pāṭhayec ca yathāsthitān |
evaṃ sampātahomaṃ <saṃpātahomaṃ> tu kṛtvā pūrṇāntikaṃ tataḥ || 16.173
mahāśaktisamūhas tu paraḥ sāmarthyalakṣaṇaḥ |
abhedena ca mantrādimūrtīnāṃ yaḥ sthitaḥ sphuṭam || 16.174
sasandheyaḥ <sasaṃdheyaḥ> śilānāṃ ca svanāmnā praṇavena tu |
jñānabhāsā nivasati tathā nandabalā prabhā || 16.175
sarvagā brahmavadanā dyotakī satyavikramā |
sampūrṇā <saṃpūrṇā> ceti kathitāḥ śaktayo viśvadhārikāḥ || 16.176
yā śilā kalaśāghārasaṃjñā tāṃ viddhi sarvagām |
sāmarthyaśaktisāmānyāṃ niṣkalāṃ pārameśvarīm || 16.177
santarpya <saṃtarpya> mūlamantrāc ca śikhāmantreṇa lāṅgalin |
ajasyanābhāvadhyekamantreṇaikāyanais tataḥ || 16.178
tādarthyena tu hotavyaṃ mṛṇmayais tu tathaiva hi |
hotavyam asya vāgmīyaṃ gāyatrībhir atoparaiḥ || 16.179
hotavyaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥ samyaktadvyāpter upalakṣakaiḥ |
datvā pūrṇāṃ svayaṃ kṛtvā sthalasthasyārcanaṃ punaḥ || 16.180
balidānaṃ ca bhūtānāṃ samācamya tato vrajet |
prāsādabrahmabhūbhāgaṃ nyaset tatra mahāśilām || 16.181
saṃsmaraṃś cakramantraṃ tu sānantaṃ praṇavena vai |
bījair bhūtaṃ tadantaḥsthamadhvaṣaṭkaṃ smaran yajet || 16.182
niśśeṣamantrabṛndena tāmarghyāder anantaram |
dvāradigvīkṣamāṇaṃ tu madhye mantraghaṭaṃ nyaset || 16.183
svadikṣv anyānyathāvasthān svaiḥ svair mantrair niveśayet |
tataḥ svaśaktipāṣāṇair ekaikaṃ sthagayed ghaṭam || 16.184
pūrayed astramantreṇa ghaṭānām antaraṃ tataḥ |
mṛdumṛdvālukābhis tu sudhayācalasiddhaye || 16.185
saṃveṣṭya netravastrais tu ṛgvedān pāṭhayet tataḥ |
ātvā hārṣeti sūktaṃ tu pratiṣṭhāsāma sāmagān || 16.186
dvādaśākṣarasaṃyuktaṃ balamantraṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
vaktavyaṃ brahmaniṣṭhais tu praṇavāntaṃ subhāvitaiḥ || 16.187
tadekatanutāṃ yātaṃ saṃsmaret praṇavena tu |
mūrtyādiśaktiniṣṭhaṃ yannāmarūpakriyātmakam || 16.188
dvādaśākṣaramantreṇa bhūyaḥ sahṛdayaṅgamaiḥ |
mantrārādhyaṃ khamūrtiṃ tu saṃsmaret tejasāṃ nidhim || 16.189
tatas tv ombhagavanbhogaiḥ pāṭhayet pāñcarātrikān |
arcāmiteti ṛgvedān arcāsāma ca tadvidaḥ || 16.190
tataḥ parigṛhīte tu kṣetre devagṛhīyake |
dvādaśāṅgulamānaṃ tu digvidikṣvaṣṭakaṃ nyaset || 16.191
snāpitaṃ pūjitaṃ samyak śiṣyāṇāṃ śubhalakṣaṇam |
tadantaḥ sanniroddhavyo <saṃniroddhavyo> buddhidharmaguṇaḥ kramāt || 16.192
dharmādyāś cāgnikoṇāt tu yāvadīśapadaṃ punaḥ |
prāgādāv uttarāntaṃ cādharmādyaṃ catuṣṭayam || 16.193
śilānām antare bhūmau ṣaṭkaṃ ṣaṭkaṃ krameṇa tu |
nyastavyaṃ pūrvavarṇāc ca varṇānāṃ sāvasānakam || 16.194
śabdabrahmānuviddhāṃ ca kṛtvaivaṃ buddhivāgurām |
sūtrabhūtāṃ nyaset samyak prāsādatalasaṃsthitām || 16.195
nyaset prāṅgaṇabhittyarthaṃ tathaiva hi śilāṣṭakam |
tāsu saṃrodhayet samyak prāguktāṃs tu digīśvarān || 16.196
cakraṃ tadantabhūmīnāṃ bhramadvahnisphuliṅgavat |
kṣārṇena cintayed vyāptaṃ bhūbhāgaṃ cāṅkaṇīyakam || 16.197
ābhogaṃ tadadhaḥ śeṣaṃ tadūrdhve gaganeśvaram |
bahiḥ prāṅgaṇabhittīnāṃ sāstraṃ saparivārakam || 16.198
prāgādāvīśakoṇāntam indrādyaṃ cāṣṭakaṃ nyaset |
tathāvidheṣūpaleṣv antarbhūmigateṣu ca || 16.199
tatsvanāmnārcayitvā tu ṛgvedān pāṭhayet tataḥ |
klībo na vidvān iti vai ye devās tu yajurmayān || 16.200
devavrataṃ ca sāmajñān praviśyābhyantaraṃ tataḥ |
sthitvāgrato mantramūrter adhvavyāptim anusmaret || 16.201
bījataś cāṅkurībhūtā purastādvyaktim eti sā |
prāsādapīṭhaparyantaṃ kumbhādhāropalāt tu vai || 16.202
bhuvanādhvā yathāvastho bhāvanīyas tu sarvadā |
garbhocchrayāvadhir yāvatpadādhvānaṃ vilokayet || 16.203
mantrādhvā śukanāsāntaṃ tattvādhvā vedikāvadhi |
kālādhvā tu galāntaṃ ca varṇādhvā tu tadūrdhvataḥ || 16.204
samīkṛya purā sarvaṃ prāsādaṃ prārabhet tataḥ |
prāsādasthairyasidhyarthaṃ devasānnidhyasiddhaye || 16.205
sarvadoṣapraśāntyarthaṃ sarvasampattisiddhaye <sarvasaṃpattisiddhaye> |
garbhanyāsaṃ purā kuryād garbhagehe yathāvidhi || 16.206
ratnair lohais tathā bījaiḥ kandair mudgaiś ca pūritām |
sauvarṇīṃ rājatīṃ vātha tāmrajāṃ vā svaśaktitaḥ || 16.207
navagartasamāyuktāṃ mañjūṣāṃ sāpidhānakām |
samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> cāstratoyena vastrayugmena veṣṭayet || 16.208
dhānyarāśau tu vinyasya mūlamantreṇa deśikaḥ |
arghyagandhādinābhyarcya kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile 'pi vā || 16.209
devam abhyarcya vidhivatsamidbhiḥ saptabhiḥ kramāt |
hutvā pūrṇāhutiṃ paścādācāryaḥ samupoṣitaḥ || 16.210
śubhravastrottarīyaś ca bhūṣaṇair api bhūṣitaḥ |
gandhamālyālaṅkṛtāṅgo rātrau lagne suśobhane || 16.211
bhājanaṃ tatsamādāya vedaghoṣaiś ca maṅgalaiḥ |
vādyaghoṣaiś ca sahitaḥ kṛtvā gehaṃ pradakṣiṇam || 16.212
praviśya garbhabhūbhāgaṃ tatra dvārasya dakṣiṇe |
kṛtaṃ śvabhraṃ pañcagavyaiḥ secayitvā samantataḥ || 16.213
tatra bhūmiṃ tu cārghyādyaiḥ samabhyarcya tatas tu tām |
paricintya ṛtusnātāmātmānaṃ ca hariṃ smaran || 16.214
sarvabhūtadhare kānte parvatastanamaṇḍite |
samudraparidhānīye devi garbhaṃ samāśraya || 16.215
ityuktvā bhājanaṃ śvabhre nidhāya sudhayā tataḥ |
dṛḍhīkṛtya tataḥ śvabhraṃ mṛdāpūryaṃ samantataḥ || 16.216
tricatuḥ pañcarātraṃ vā rakṣāṃ kuryān munīśvarāḥ |
garbhanyāsastvayaṃ viprā devadhāmnoś ca vṛddhidaḥ || 16.217
akṛte garbhavinyāse pratyavāyo mahān smṛtaḥ |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena garbhanyāsaṃ samācaret || 16.218
prāsādasyātha vakṣyāmi lakṣaṇaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
talādūnādhikāc caiva sāṅgulair ucitaiḥ karaiḥ || 16.219
dvidvādaśakaraṃ yāvattalenonādhikena tu |
śubhāya siddhaye viddhigarbhaṃ devagṛhasya ca || 16.220
kṛtvā kṣetrāṃgulānāṃ <kṣetrāṅgulānāṃ> ca karāṇāṃ vā ghanaṃ purā |
tyajet tadaṣṭabhiḥ samyagyaccheṣaṃ tadvicārya ca || 16.221
ekādyaṣṭamaparyantā dhvajadhūmamṛgeśvarāḥ |
śvā ca gokharamātaṅgavāyasās tu tataḥ śubhāḥ || 16.222
ekatripañcasaptākhyāḥ sarvatraiva vidhīyate |
evamantarbhrameṇaiva saha bhittigaṇena tu || 16.223
garbhadviguṇavistīrṇaṃ kṣetraṃ devagṛhasya ca |
mandire tv ekabhittīye kṣetramānaṃ vidhīyate || 16.224
garbhoktaṃ tattribhāgena yuktaṃ yuktena vartmanā |
tatrāpi hrāsavṛddhyā tv āyaśuddhiṃ vicārayet || 16.225
evaṃ nirjagatīkaṃ ca bhāgapīṭhaṃ vivarjitam |
prāsādakṣetramānaṃ ca tadyuktam avadhāryatām || 16.226
ṣaḍbhāgenātha pādena tribhāgenobhayātmikā |
adhikārdhaṃ caturdikṣu tatpañcāṃśais tu vai tribhiḥ || 16.227
tṛtīyāṃśena vai madhye nirgamas tu vidhīyate |
koṇāt koṇāt tu vai śeṣaṃ bhāgaṃ bhāgaṃ praveśayet || 16.228
uccaṃ garbhasamaṃ pīṭhaṃ tatpīṭhena dalena vā |
pīṭhoktālayapīṭhasya lakṣmasthityaṃśakalpanā || 16.229
caturdikṣu vidheyā vai bahudhānantapūrvikā |
athocchrāyaṃ tu vai kṣetrāt trikoṇaṃ mandirasya ca || 16.230
kuryād vyardhaguṇaṃ caiva dviguṇaṃ vā yathecchayā |
dvirekādaśadhā kuryāt taṃ ca bhāgaiḥ samaṃ purā || 16.231
vidheyaṃ pīṭhavatpaścādekāṃśena masūrakam |
tadūrdhve vihitā jaṅghā garbhamānena connatā || 16.232
bhavopakaraṇīyābhir devatābhir alaṅkṛtā <alaṃkṛtā> |
jaṅghāyām aṃśayugmena upayūnādhikena vai || 16.233
kāryaṃ śikharapīṭhaṃ tu pūrvalakṣaṇalakṣitam |
kiṃ tu praveśaniryāsau tatra cārdhāṃśasammitau <cārdhāṃśasaṃmitau> || 16.234
śikharaṃ cātra vihitaṃ bhūmikānavakānvitam |
saṅkocya <saṃkocya> tatpurā sūtram ādāyonnatisammitam <ādāyonnatisaṃmitam> 
|| 16.235
etasmād ekavarṇāt tu jaṅghirdhvīyāt prasārya ca |
saṃspṛśec chikharaṃ pīṭhamañjasā tannirodhya ca || 16.236
prāsādād bahirādyatra bhūbhāge tv amalekṣaṇa |
karṇād ūrdhvaṃ nayet sūtraṃ lāñcchyamānaṃ krameṇa tu || 16.237
śikharonnatiparyantaṃ caturdikṣv evam eva hi |
paryaṭel lāñchyamānaṃ tu karṇāt karṇaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 16.238
yāvatkumudapatrābhā sā syāc chikharamañjarī |
evamālekhyadṛṣṭyā tu sampādyātantupātataḥ <saṃpādyātantupātataḥ> || 16.239
bhūmikāṇḍaprasidhyarthaṃ kāryā sā daśadhā punaḥ |
upariṣṭāt tu bhāgena bhaved āmalasārakam || 16.240
bhūmayo bhāgamānās tu tatas tāsāṃ samācaret |
kṣayavṛddhyā vidhānaṃ tu taddviraṣṭāṃśasammitam 
<taddviraṣṭāṃśasaṃmitam> || 16.241
vibhinnā pīṭharacanā tāsu kāryā yathāsthitā |
sacakrair vividhaiḥ padmaiḥ prādurbhāvais tu cākhilaiḥ || 16.242
sarvair vā lāñchanair mūrtair nṛttagītarasasthitaiḥ |
navāṃśenordhvabhāgāt tu svapādena vinirgatam || 16.243
uṣṇīṣam ūrdhvabhūmes tu kāryaṃ yai racanojjhitam |
śiṣṭaṃ kṛtvā tridhā pīṭhaṃ maṇḍalasthena pūrvavat || 16.244
dvitīyena tataḥ kaṇṭhaṃ tṛtīyenordhvagena tu |
susamaṃ śrīyutaṃ kuryād aṇḍaṃ dhātrīphalāṇḍavat || 16.245
navadhoṣṇīṣakaṃ kṛtvā caturbhir vedikābhramam |
tribhāgapṛthubhāgena sastambhā hy atha kevalā || 16.246
unnatā śikharārdhena sāpy utpaladalopamā |
kāryā śikharapīṭhordhve divyakarmavibhūṣitā || 16.247
tataḥ śubhataraṃ kuryān maṇṭapaṃ stambhasaṃyutam |
bhūṣitaṃ vahigendreṇa balimaṇḍalagena tu || 16.248
caturdvāre tathā dikṣu vidheyaṃ maṇṭapatrayam |
praveśatritayopetaṃ maṇṭape maṇṭapaṃ bhavet || 16.249
kuryān maṇṭapamuktaṃ vā yathābhimatanirgamam |
rathoparathakādyaṃ tu teṣāṃ garbhād vidhīyate || 16.250
niryāso daśamāṃśena dvādaśāṃśena lāṅgalin |
atha vā ṣoḍaśāṃśena te kāryā nemivat punaḥ || 16.251
caturdikpakṣasaṃliptāḥ pīṭhakarmavibhūṣitāḥ |
śikharasya caturdikṣu pīṭhopari samāpayet || 16.252
samaṃ rathakayukatyā tu nāsikāmañjarīgaṇam |
madhyadeśacaturdikṣu kuryād dvāragaṇaṃ samam || 16.253
tricatuḥpañcaṣaḍbhāge tato garbhād vidhīyate |
dviguṇaṃ connatatvena tripañcanavaśākhikam || 16.254
yuktaṃ dvārsthadvayenaiva kumbhebhadaśanais tu vā |
vidhivat sthāpanaṃ tasya mantrapūrvaṃ samācaret || 16.255
saṃsnāpya mūlamantreṇa sampūjyārghyādinā <saṃpūjyārghyādinā> hṛdā |
śākhāmūlagatāṃ kuryād dhāturatnamayīṃ sthitim || 16.256
sarvādhāramayaṃ mantraṃ sannirodhya <saṃnirodhya> hi tatra ca |
jñānakriyātmakaṃ dhyātvā śikhāmantreṇa śāśvatam || 16.257
dakṣiṇottarabhāgābhyāṃ śākhāyugmaṃ tu vinyaset |
hṛnmantreṇa tadūrdhve tu rudhvādyaṃ parameśvaram || 16.258
sannidhīkṛtya <saṃnidhīkṛtya> sampūjya <saṃpūjya> gaganasthe hy udumbare |
dvividhaṃ dhātujālaṃ tu ratnaṃ siddhārthakān tilān || 16.259
candanādyā hi gandhā ye kṣīraṃ dadhi ghṛtaṃ madhu |
śālayaḥ sarvabījāni sarvauṣadhyaḥ savidrumāḥ || 16.260
kṛtvā netreṇa netrasthān dvārordhve viniveśya tān |
dṛśyaṃ bhogāptaye caiva tvadṛśyaṃ mokṣasiddhaye || 16.261
catuṣpātsakalo dharmas tadūrdhve sannirodhya <saṃnirodhya> ca |
catvāri śṛṅgā iti yat pāṭhayed ṛṅmayāṃs tataḥ || 16.262
karmahomacayaṃ kṛtvā pūrṇāṃ mūlena pātayet |
etadbimbapratiṣṭhānāt prāgvatpaścātsasācaret || 16.263
sthityapekṣāvaśenaiva hy ālayasya tu vai vibhoḥ |
anantabhuvanaṃ nāma sarmakāmāpavargadam || 16.264
catuṣprakāram evaṃ hi prāsādaṃ viddhi pīṭhavat |
racanāsanniveśotthabhedenānekadhā <racanāsaṃniveśotthabhedenānekadhā> tathā 
|| 16.265
patatrīśamṛgendrais tu nidhibhūtopamair ghaṭaiḥ |
śaṅkhapadmāṅkitābhis tu sopānapadapaṅktibhiḥ || 16.266
yuktaṃ dvāravaśenaiva tathā pīṭhavaśāt tu vai |
vistāraḥ pratidiksaṃsthas tv aruṇasya vidhīyate || 16.267
garbhortthakṣetrasaṃjñā ca jagatīkasya lāṅgalin |
jñeyaḥ sajagatīkasya tanmānenāpi sarvadik || 16.268
ebhyaḥ pādādikaṃ kuryāt pādādyaṃśojjhitaṃ tu vai |
budhvā cāyatanānāṃ ca saṃsthitaś cāṅgaṇe purā || 16.269
caturāyatanaṃ hy etatprāsādair diktrayasthitaiḥ |
ādyena saha koṇasthais tatpañcāyatanaṃ smṛtam || 16.270
vijñeyam aṣṭāyatanaṃ tribhir anyais tu diggataiḥ |
vinā madhyasthitenaiva diggatais tu dvibhir dvibhiḥ || 16.271
taddaśāyatanaṃ tena yuktam ekādhikaṃ bhavet |
pratolīpakṣagenaiva prāsādadvitayena tu || 16.272
dvādaśāyatanaṃ hy etat saha madhyāsthitena tu |
tadevādhikasaṃjñaṃ tv ato'nye ānantasaṃjñikaḥ || 16.273
parasparamukhau kuryāt prāsādau dvāradeśagau |
prāsādābhimukhāc caiva diktraye 'vasthitās tu ye || 16.274
koṇasthābhyāṃ ca sāmmukhyaṃ <sāṃmukhyaṃ> dvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ 
vidhīyate |
dvābhyāṃ cābhimatābhyāṃ tu kuryād ucitadiṅmukham || 16.275
dvau parasparavaktrau tu koṇadeśasamaśritau |
dvārāṇyanantāyatane prāsādānāṃ nunīśvarāḥ || 16.276
yathābhimatadiksthāni kartavyānyaviśaṅkayā |
na tatra teṣāṃ bhavati vedhadoṣaḥ parasparam || 16.277
aṅgabhāvagatatvāc ca pradhānāyatanasya vai |
ardhena ca tribhāgena hitaḥ pādena cāṅgaṇāt || 16.278
paraṇḍakasya cocchrāyas tadvistāras tathocchriteḥ |
tac ca pīṭhopamaṃ kuryāc ślakṣṇaṃ soṣṇīṣam eva vā || 16.279
yuktaṃ koṭigaṇenātha nānādevāntagena tu |
yadekāyatanaṃ caiva tv aṅgaṇaṃ tanmunīśvarāḥ || 16.280
yuktaṃ laghuparaṇḍena kevalaṃ vā paraṇḍakam |
yadā dvyāyatanādyaṃ ca dvādaśāyatanāntimam || 16.281
ekadigvīkṣamāṇaṃ ca caturaśrāyate 'ṅgaṇe |
vṛttāyate vā vitate prāsāde coktalakṣaṇe || 16.282
yasmād devālayānāṃ cāṅgaṇānāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
caturaśrādipīṭhānāṃ nityam eva munīśvarāḥ || 16.283
anyonyānugatatvaṃ tu hitaṃ vāpekṣikaṃ tu vai |
bhūmibhāgavaśenaiva tathaivārcāvaśena tu || 16.284
nānāphalavaśenāpi tathā śobhāvaśena ca |
bhūlābhaś caturaśrāt tu caturaśrāyatād ghanam || 16.285
vartulāt sarvakāmāptir nirvṛtis tu tadāyatāt |
dṛṣṭādṛṣṭaphalepsūnāṃ lokās tu mahadādayaḥ || 16.286
yacchānti vaiṣṇavaṃ sthānam ārogyaṃ bhūtim uttamām |
vaiṣṇavānām akāmānāṃ cyuter ante paraṃ padam || 16.287

munayaḥ
prāsādalakṣaṇam idaṃ śrutaṃ tvatto munīśvaraḥ |
tasya saṃsthāpanavidhiṃ vistareṇa prakāśaya || 16.288

nāradaḥ
prāsādādipratiṣṭhānāṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ vidhim uttamam |
prāsādasyāgrataḥ kṛtvā pūrvavadvyāgamaṇṭapam || 16.289
sarvopakaraṇair yuktaṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam |
prasādasyāpi paritaḥ kuryāt kuṇḍāṣṭakaṃ guruḥ || 16.290
sāmagryāder abhāve tu prāsādāgraprakalpite |
yāgamaṇṭapabhūbhāge kuṇḍam ekaṃ prakalpayet || 16.291
samastamūrtipīyaṃ ca homaṃ tatraiva kalpayet |
prāsādasthāpanārambhāt tṛtīye pañcame 'pi vā || 16.292
divase tv aṅkurāropaṃ yathāvidhi samācaret |
śailotthaṃ pūrvavatkumbhaṃ kṛtvā dhātumayaṃ tu vā || 16.293
tadvigolakamānena mantrabimbena vai saha |
śubhe 'nyasmin dine yāgamaṇṭape hy uktalakṣaṇe || 16.294
adhivāsya yathānyāyaṃ sarvopakaraṇānvitam |
snānādyam akhilaṃ tābhyām āpādya ca yathāvidhi || 16.295
tasmin ratnādi<<hṛdādi>>saṃyukte bimbaṃ kumbhe niveśya ca |
vastrair ābharaṇaiḥ puṣpaiś channaṃ kṛtvārghyapuṣpavat || 16.296
śanaiḥ prāsādaparyaṅkam āruhen mūrtipaiḥ saha |
tatra prāktāḍanādīṃs <<prāgāsantimān>> tu kuryāt saṅkṣālanādikān 
<saṃkṣālanādikān> || 16.297
ācared ratna<<bīja>>vinyāsaṃ sarvaṃ vāvāhanoditam |
niveśanīyam ity eva bimbaṃ kumbhasamanvitam || 16.298
hṛdādyantaniruddhena mūlamantreṇa lāṅgalin |
tatrādyam anusandhānam <anusaṃdhānam> ekaṃ kṛtvā parānvitam || 16.299
sāmānyalakṣaṇaṃ paścāt pūrvoktaṃ vai kalātmakam |
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> vāsasacchādya sudhayā vyaktatāṃ nayet || 16.300
tataḥ piṇḍaṃ tadūrdhve tu sāṇḍaṃ kuryād yathoditam |
prāsādaṃ snāpayet paścāt ṣaḍbhiḥ siddhārthakādibhiḥ || 16.301
sudhāmayaṃ cet prāsādaṃ darpaṇe snānam ācaret |
samālabhyārcayitvā ca sragādyair maṇḍayet tataḥ || 16.302
prāsādapaṭṭikāyāṃ tu pañcaviṃśatitantubhiḥ |
badhvā tu kautukaṃ paścāt kuryāc chāyādhivāsanam || 16.303
snapanaṃ darpaṇe kuryāt prāgvaddeśikasattamaḥ |
prāsādasya caturdikṣu mūrtayaḥ kalpitā yadi || 16.304
teṣāṃ netrāṇi conmīlya yathāvidhi munīśvarāḥ |
sarvamanyadyathāyogaṃ vakṣyamāṇena vartmanā || 16.305
prāsādasyāpi kurvīta kūrcadvārādhivāsanam |
prāsādasyāgraparyantaṃ kumbhādhāropalāt tu vai || 16.306
lokādhvatattvadevānāṃ nyāsaṃ prāgvat samācaret |
diṅmūrtināṃ tathāṅgeṣu mūlamantrādikān nyaset || 16.307
kalaśe maṇḍale caiva prāsādasthān samarcayet |
prāsādaparitaḥ kḷptakuṇḍeṣv agniṃ yathāvidhi || 16.308
saṃskṛtya vāsudevādīn prabhavāpyayayogataḥ |
santarpayed <saṃtarpayed> yathāśāstraṃ yadvā tatpurataḥ sthite || 16.309
kuṇḍe tu sakalaṃ homam ācāryaḥ svayam ācaret |
mantrāś ca pāṭhayed viprāṃs tatpratiṣṭhāṃ nayet tu vai || 16.310
saṃrodhya varmamantraṃ tu tatra dhyānadhiyā svayam |
pūrṇāntam akhilaṃ kṛtvā vidhinānena vai punaḥ || 16.311
kṣurohareti vai sāma pāṭhayet sāmagāṃs tu vai |
cakramāmalasārasya madhyataḥ sanniveśayet <saṃniveśayet> || 16.312
yathābhimatarūpaṃ tu digvaktraṃ vāmbarānanam |
svaśaktivarṇadaṇḍasthaṃ caṇḍamārtāṇḍabhāsvaram || 16.313
cakramantraṃ nyaset tasmin varṇādhvānaṃ puroditam |
gatyāgatiprayogeṇa prākprameyajñalakṣaṇam || 16.314
nānyadhāvatpurā jñātvā dravyamūrtigate vibhum |
kuryāt tato 'dhvasandhānaṃ <'dhvasaṃdhānaṃ> nānyathā tu munīśvarāḥ || 16.315
amalaṃ śāntasaṃjñaṃ vai tathā śāntoditoditam |
ekam eva hi tanmūrti yaścakraṃvetti tattvataḥ || 16.316
so 'smin saṃsāracakre tu sarvāśramanivāsinām |
sarvadharmaratānāṃ ca cakravartitvam āpnuyāt || 16.317
yacchaktir brahmamūrtyaiva siddhā sākṣān nirāśrayā |
antarbahisthaṃ sarveṣāṃ mokṣadaṃ cāmalaṃ smṛtam || 16.318
kṣīrodārṇavatulyaṃ yatsahasrādityasannibham <yatsahasrādityasaṃnibham> |
niraṅgaṃ tīkṣṇadhāraṃ vai tacchāntākhyaṃ hi yogataḥ || 16.319
yat tu nānāṅgabhāvena svātantryāt svayam eva hi |
sarvadikprasṛtāṃ kṛtvā svātmavṛttiṃ hi vartate || 16.320
īṣadvalayavannābherarāṇām antare khavat |
śāntoditaṃ ca tadviddhi cakram icchāphalapradam || 16.321
yacchāntamūrtau sambandhaṃ <saṃbandhaṃ> sarvaṃ kṛtvāvatiṣṭhate |
pravṛttaṃ nābhipūrvaṃ tūditākhyaṃ tu cakrarāṭ || 16.322
tasmin nārādhito mantras tad vai sampūjitaṃ <saṃpūjitaṃ> smṛtam |
japtaṃ santarpitaṃ <saṃtarpitaṃ> bhaktyā sarveṣāṃ sarvam ṛcchati || 16.323
evaṃ cābhimataṃ cakraṃ sarvavighnakṣayaṅkaram <sarvavighnakṣayaṃkaram> |
pratiṣṭhāpya samabhyarcya tasyaivaṃ samanantaram || 16.324
vyaṃśena śikharād uccaṃ khagarāṭ paribhūṣitam |
saṃskṛtya dhvajadaṇḍaṃ ca śikhāmantreṇa vinyaset || 16.325
tato vividhavarṇaṃ ca kiṅkiṇīgaṇabhūṣitam |
dhvajāgraśikharāgraṃ tu yattaddīrgham akṛttrimam || 16.326
dairghyād dvādaśamāṃśena dvinavāṃśena vā tatam |
kṛtvāstrasannidhiṃ <kṛtvāstrasaṃnidhiṃ> tasmin lāñchanākhye purā paṭe || 16.327
niveśya dhvajadaṇḍāgre gandhādyair arcayet tataḥ |
sudhāmayādibimbānāṃ sthāpane munipuṅgavāḥ || 16.328
bimbaprāsādayor viprā yugapat sthāpapanaṃ bhavet |
prāsādasya pratiṣṭhetthaṃ samāsātkīrtitā mayā || 16.329
maṇḍapādi pratiṣṭhāṃ ca śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
prathamaṃ paṇṭapaṃ cāgryaṃ tathaivāsthānamaṇṭapam || 16.330
prākāraṃ pacanāvāsaṃ kośāgārāmbarāspade |
puṣpapānīyaśāle ca tathā vai yāgamaṇṭapam || 16.331
dhānyāgārādikaṃ sarvaṃ saṅkṣālya <saṃkṣālya> bahubhir jalaiḥ |
paryagnikaraṇaṃ caiva mārjanollekhanādikam || 16.332
kārayitvā dvijavarair gavyaiḥ samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> pañcabhiḥ |
vitānādyair alaṃkṛtya maṇṭapādīn viśeṣataḥ || 16.333
pradhūpayitvāgarubhir dīpān āropya sarvataḥ |
sudhācūrṇair alaṃkṛtyākṣatānvikired bhuvi || 16.334
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu vāstupūruṣam arcayet |
dhānyapīṭhaṃ prakalpyātha kumbhaṃ tatra salakṣaṇam || 16.335
sopakumbhaṃ sakarakaṃ nyasya prāgvatsalakṣaṇam |
tatra devaṃ samabhyarcya sāṅgaṃ saparivārakam || 16.336
kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile vāpi pratiṣṭhāpyānalaṃ tataḥ |
tatra devaṃ tu santarpya <saṃtarpya> pūrṇāntaṃ deśikottamaḥ || 16.337
sumuhūrte tu samprāpte <saṃprāpte> prokṣayet kumbhatoyataḥ |
sarvatra mūlamantreṇa deśilo mantravittamaḥ || 16.338
ityevaṃ paṇṭapādīnāṃ pratiṣṭhāvidhir īritaḥ |
maṇṭapādipratiṣṭhāyāṃ gopurasthāpane tathā || 16.339
kṣmāparigrahapūrvaṃ tu garbhanyāsaṃ samācaret |
garbhaṃ tu maṇṭapādīnām agnikoṇe tu vinyaset || 16.340
gopurasya bhaved yāmye garbhanyāso munīśvarāḥ |
gopurasya pratiṣṭhāṃ tu kuryāt prāsādavadbudhaḥ || 1.341
tatra vai devatānyāse viśeṣaḥ kathyate 'dhunā |
śākhāmūlādiṣu yajec cakrādyān dharmapaścimān || 16.342
kavāṭadvitaye pūjyau kālāgnir varuṇas tathā |
nyasej jaṅghāsamūhe tu bhavopakaraṇaṃ mahat || 16.343
mūrtayaḥ keśavādyās tu jaṅghāgropari saṃsthitāḥ |
vinyaset prastaroddeśe cakrādyāyudhasañcayam <cakrādyāyudhasaṃcayam> || 16.344
pūrvavadvedikāgrīvāśikharoddeśabhūmiṣu |
nyasyā vibhavadevāś ca padmanābhāntimaṃ dvijāḥ || 16.345
tale tale gopurasya diṅmūrtīś ca yathāpuram |
prāsādoktavidhānena kalpayen munipuṅgavāḥ || 16.346
tatas tu kalaśādhāravedikāyās tale dvijāḥ |
sudarśanaṃ tu ṣaḍaraṃ yajet kumbhacatuṣṭaye || 16.347
vāsudevādikāḥ pūjyāḥ kumbhaṣaṭke kṛte sati |
sampūjyaṃ <saṃpūjyaṃ> keśavādīnāṃ ṣaṭkaṃ kumbhāṣṭake kṛte || 16.348
keśavādyaṣṭakaṃ pūjyaṃ dviṣaṭke dvādaśārcayet |
yugmayogena kumbhānāṃ sthāpanaṃ mokṣakāṅkṣiṇaḥ || 16.349
itarasyāyugmayuktyā kumbhasthāpanam ācaret |
ekasmin sthāpite kumbhe vāsudevaṃ samarcayet || 16.350
trayādau keśavādīṃś ca pūjayed dvijasattamāḥ |
ityevaṃ devatābṛndaṃ gopure nyasya pūjayet || 16.351
prāsādādipratiṣṭhāyā vidhir evaṃ munīśvarāḥ |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
prāsādādipratiṣṭhāvidhir nāma 
ṣoḍaśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha saptadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ
nāradaḥ
atha bimbasya pīṭhāder lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣyate dvijāḥ |
citramṛtkāṣṭhaśailotthaṃ sallohamayam eva vā || 17.1
bhedabhinnaṃ dvijātīnāṃ hitaṃ bimbaṃ phalārthinām |
tadabhinnam akāmānāṃ prāptaṃ cāpy avirodhakṛt || 17.2
atra citramayaṃ viddhi bhittikāṣṭhāmbarāśritam |
punarvarṇakrameṇaiva caturdhā cāmbarotthitam || 17.3
tac ca kārpāsakauśeyakṣaumaśāṇamayaṃ tu vai |
mṛjjam evaṃ sitādyutthaṃ vārkṣaṃ vividham eva ca || 17.4
āśvatthaṃ brahmavṛkṣotthaṃ śrīparṇīsuradārujam |
sālatālamayaṃ caiva śāśavaṃtī<<śaiṃśupaṃ ve�>>ndusārajam || 17.5
evaṃ dvayaṃ dvayaṃ viddhi dvijātīnāṃ yathākramam |
ato'nye dṛḍhamūlāś ca sāravanto hi yājñikāḥ || 17.6
sādhāraṇāś caturṇāṃ tu pratimādye ca karmaṇi |
sāmānyaṃ bhuktimuktyarthamaśma mṛṇmayavatsmṛtam || 17.7
tārahāṭakatāmrotthamārakūṭamayam tathā |
evaṃ hi bhūmayo vastrapāṣāṇā dhātavo drumāḥ || 17.8
vajrādayo 'khilā ratnāḥ sitaraktādilakṣaṇāḥ |
asāmānyāḥ phalepsūnāṃ lābhālābhavaśāt punaḥ || 17.9
samyak svamūrtimantrais tu japahomārcanādinā |
nayet sāmānyabhāsitvaṃ yathā tatkāraṇārcanāt || 17.10
yajet sendrāṃ dharāṃ śailamṛdāpādanakarmaṇi |
evaṃ paṭadrumārthaṃ tu varuṇaṃ savanaspatim || 17.11
saratnānāṃ ca dhātūnāṃ sambandher <saṃbandher> kendupāvakān |
ratnāśrayeṇa dhātvarthe nārcyādeśena vai vinā || 17.12
tathārcanāsanenaiva cakrapadmamayādinā |
na ratnī pratimā śastā dhyāyināṃ dhyānasiddhaye || 17.13
kevalā laghumānā ca pramāṇāvayavojjhitā |
varṇāśramagurutvāc ca svāmitvād akhilasya ca || 17.14
bhūtādidevarūpatvād uttamādyeṣu vastuṣu |
nṛpaścārhati vai nityaṃ saviśeṣapade sthitaḥ || 17.15
kiṃ punar yo 'phalākāṅkṣī bhaktiśraddhāparaḥ sadā |
budhvaivaṃ citrabimbārthī yatnenedaṃ samācaret || 17.16
guhyakān gṛhadevāṃs tu hṛdārcyārghyādinā purā |
malabhasmatuṣāṅgārakeśakīṭanakhāstṛṇam || 17.17
mūlakaṇṭakacarmāsthisāmānye 'śmāhni bhittikā |
bhavatyanarthadāvaśyamataḥ prāgcaturaṅgulam || 17.18
vihāya mṛddalaṃ bhitter īṣadbimbāt tu vādhikam |
uktadoṣavimuktātha pañcagavyena sāmbhasā || 17.19
marditayā mṛdā bhūyas tadbhittyaṃśaṃ prapūrya ca |
śastreṇa kāṣṭhaphalakāṃ mṛgacarmasamāṃ purā || 17.20
chaviṃ vihāya śuddhyarthaṃ turīmuktaṃ tu vai ghaṭam |
prakṣālya salilenaiva tvāstrajaptena saptadhā || 17.21
hṛnmaṃtreṇa <hṛnmantreṇa> tu sāstreṇa mūrtimantrānvitena ca |
tīrthadeśān nadītīrāt puṇyakṣetrāc ca parvatāt || 17.22
apāsya doṣasaṅkīrṇām <doṣasaṃkīrṇām> ūrdhvādādāya mṛttikām |
sāvacūrṇyātha saṃśoṣyā sūpalipte dharātale || 17.23
śāṇamūrṇaṃ ca kārpāsaṃ sasūtraṃ cāvijaṃ tathā |
kṛtvā pāṣāṇabhinnaṃ prāgyojyaṃ tatra savālukam || 17.24
īṣadgomayayuktena bhūrikṣīraghṛtādinā |
bhāvayet pañcagavyena khādireṇa kaṣeṇa ca || 17.25
siddhārthakāta(la)sīsnehatilotthena tu vai saha |
kledayec ca trisaptāhaṃ bhāṇḍe kṛtvāyasādike || 17.26
mārutānalasūryendudarśanena vinaiva hi |
tayā samāpya tadbimbaṃ śubhakāṣṭhāntarīkṛtam || 17.27
vastravac caiva lohānāṃ kṛtvā prakṣālanaṃ tataḥ |
mārjanaṃ bhūtinā bhūyas tathā tanmantritena ca || 17.28
bhaktyā pravartamāvastu bimbasādhanakarmaṇi |
sarvatra cāstramantrasya kuryān nirvighnaśāntaye || 17.29
pūjanaṃ havanaṃ bhūtabalidānaṃ sadakṣiṇam |
samyag<<sanmṛd>>grahaṇakāle tv etatsāmānyam eva hi || 17.30
sacchailadārugrahaṇe viśeṣas tv adhunocyate |
sarvatrārambhakāle tu nimittam upalakṣya ca || 17.31
viśeṣārcana<<dvana>>yātrāyāṃ tacchubhena śubhodayaḥ |
aśubhena nimittena yātrā vighnavatī bhavet || 17.32
virāmeṇa tu japyena śāntisvastyayanādinā |
nivartanena tadvanyād dahate śubhakṛ(dya)tyataḥ || 17.33
mantram abhyarcya yātrāyām abhyarthyājñāṃ vinandya ca |
naivedyaśeṣabhugvāmacārasthaḥ saṃyatendriyaḥ || 17.34
prāṅmukhaḥ saṃsmaren mantraṃ samutthāyāmṛtodaye |
parijñāya parāṃ mūrtiṃ tanmūrtyantaram eva vā || 17.35
yāyāt tadīyaṃ digbhāgaṃ tadabhāvāt tu cānyadik |
sahāyair apramattais tu śilpibhiḥ saha saṃvṛtaḥ || 17.36
lājadadhyakṣataiḥ kumbhair yāyāt puṣpapurassaraiḥ |
saumanasyaṃ mahotsāhas tv aṃgaspandas <aṅgaspandas> tu dākṣiṇaḥ || 17.37
śubhā vāṇī dhvajaḥ śaṅkhas tantrīvādyaphalādayaḥ |
gogajāśvadvijāḥ kanyā navabhāṇḍaṃ ca mṛddadhi || 17.38
