tadvattadanugā yā ca triparvās tās tu pūrvavat || 17.155
saṃyuktā nakhajālena kūrmapṛṣṭhopamena ca |
dvikalaṃ tu yavārdhonaṃ pādatarjaniveṣṭanam || 17.156
catuścaturyavonaṃ ca taccheṣāṇāṃ prakīrtitam |
tryaṃśena veṣṭanād jñeyaṃ sarvāsāṃ caiva vistṛtam || 17.157
sarve samāṃsalāḥ saumyāḥ samās tv avayavāḥ śubhāḥ |
daśanāvalibāhyasthe daṃṣṭre saptayavonnate || 17.158
yavadvayonnataṃ mānaṃ madhyadantacatuṣṭaye |
tatpakṣagānāṃ sarveṣāṃ mānaṃ vittaṃ caturyavam || 17.159
triyavaṃ dvijavistāram agrān mūlādyavadvayam |
tatsārdhaṃ madhyadeśāc ca sarve dantā nirantarāḥ || 17.160
lomapradhakṣiṇāvartamayugjanmotthitaṃ śubham |
suniścitaṃ hitaṃ caitanmānam avyabhicāri yat || 17.161
manohāritvam ekatra rūpalāvaṇyabhūṣitam |
sarvadā cānayor vitta anyonyatvena saṃsthitim || 17.162
sasaundaryaṃ tu mānasya kvacid ākramya vartate |
lāvaṇyasya kvacinmānaṃ samācchādyāvatiṣṭhate || 17.163
yathābhirūpavān loke daridro 'py eti mānyatām |
virūpopyativittāḍhyo ?cārūpo naiva nirdhanaḥ || 17.164
evaṃ dvayojjhitaṃ bimbam anādeyatvam eti ca |
ādeyam ekayuktaṃ ca nityaṃ yasmān munīśvarāḥ || 17.165
samyaṅmāne ca saundarye bhaktānugrahakāmyayā |
mantrasannidhiśaktir <mantrasaṃnidhiśaktir> vai saphalā hy avatiṣṭhate || 17.166
sā samyakpratipannasya bimbe dṛggocarasthite |
āmūrty āhlādayaty āśu jñātvaivaṃ yatnam ācaret || 17.167
mānonmānapramāṇānām atha saundaryasiddhaye |
ṛjoḥ susamapādasya tryaṃgulaṃ <tryaṅgulaṃ> caraṇāntaram || 17.168
tadvai viṣamapādasyāgrāt tālasamaṃ smṛtam |
tatpārṣṇidvayamadhyāt tu parijñeyaṃ dvigolakam || 17.169
sthityarthaṃ brahmanāḍyā vai tathā mārgadvayasya ca |
sūtreṇa susame kuryād dehotthe dakṣiṇottare || 17.170
samapādasya bimbasya lalāṭān meḍhramastakam |
prasārya sūtramācchādya tena nābhihṛdantaram || 17.171
ghrāṇāgramalakānāṃ ca siddhir yastilakordhvagaḥ |
evaṃ viṣamapādasya dakṣāṃguṣṭhāgragaṃ <dakṣāṅguṣṭhāgragaṃ> nayet || 
17.172
gātrasāmyaṃ samāpādyaṃ kṣetrāt kṣetragatena ca |
sūtreṇa sarvabimbānāṃ vaiṣamyavinivṛttaye || 17.173
catustridvyaśriparitaḥ pariśuddhā yataḥ śubhā |
aśubhā pariśuddhā tu bimbotthāvayavī sthitiḥ || 17.174
lalāṭam aśvavaktrasya vistārād dvādaśāṃgulam <dvādaśāṅgulam> |
aṣṭalocanamāyāmād agrataś caturaṃgulam <caturaṅgulam> || 17.175
kalārdhasuṣire ghrāṇarandhre bhāgāntarīkṛte |
aṣṭāṃgule <aṣṭāṅgule> tu hanuke sṛkviṇyau dve 'tha tatsame || 17.176
madhyataś śrotraśuktī dve dvyaṃgule <dvyaṅgule> dvikalonnate |
dvyaṃgulaṃ <dvyaṅgulaṃ> ghrāṇavaṃśaṃ tu tadūrdhvaṃ dvikalaṃ smṛtam || 
17.177
vitta vaktravikāsaṃ ca dviyavaṃ cāgrataḥ kramāt |
tam eva hi yavāṃśena hanvantaṃ tanutāṃ nayet || 17.178
ghrāṇavaṃśasya pakṣau dvau madhyanimnau ca saṃhatau |
yavadvayena sārdhena dṛgghrāṇābhyāṃ tu cāntare || 17.179
atho dalaṃ tu dṛgdroṇer yavamānena sañcitam <saṃcitam> |
lalāṭaṃ sālakaṃ prāgvaddṛṅmadhyaṃ sāṃgulā <sāṅgulā> kalā || 17.180
nṛsiṃhasya mukhe vitta paritaś cāṣṭalocanam |
tatoṣṭhakhaṇḍadeśāc ca kuryāt karṇadvayotthitam || 17.181
tatkarṇadvayamānena lalāṭāntaṃ nayet punaḥ |
pramāṇāt prākpraṇītāc ca saṃraṃbhāghrāṇalakṣaṇaḥ 
<saṃrambhāghrāṇalakṣaṇaḥ> || 17.182
praphullavikasacchidraṃ ghrāṇavaṃśānvitaṃ bhavet |
tacchidre pūrvamānāc cāpyasya vai triyavādhikam || 17.183
sagolam uttarāṅgeṣu sakalāṃśaṃ ca locanam |
adharoṣṭhaṃ parijñeyaṃ sacaturyavam aṃgulam <aṅgulam> || 17.184
sārdhaṃ catuṣkalaṃ vaktraṃ śeṣāyāmo hanoḥ smṛtaḥ |
tadvikāsaḥ parijñeyo netramānaṃ yavādhikam || 17.185
agrato hrāsam āyāti sṛkviṇyantaṃ hi cāṃgulam <cāṅgulam> |
sarvavṛttaṃ tadardhena netrayugmaṃ savismayam || 17.186
pūrvavadvistṛtaṃ śrotraṃ kalārdhena tadunnateḥ |
tulyā cendrakalāyugmayogasya bhrūstrigolakā || 17.187
tanmadhyaṃ tu kalāmānaṃ śaṅkhāvartopamaṃ mahat |
bhāgamānaṃ samāvṛttaṃ kāryaṃ tacchirasi sphuṭam || 17.188
dairghyeṇa sārdhatālaṃ ca kṣmādharasyānanaṃ smṛtam |
vistāreṇa lalāṭāc ca tanmānaṃ dvyaṃgulojjhitam <dvyaṅgulojjhitam> || 17.189
saumyarūpasya ca vibhoḥ prodyatasya kalojjhitam |
taccaturdhāṃśamānena potradeśasya vistṛtiḥ || 17.190
tasyopariṣṭād bāhulyaṃ tatsamaṃ cāṃgulaṃ <cāṅgulaṃ> tv adhaḥ |
hanudvayasya vai mānaṃ sārdhaṃ saptāṃgulaṃ <saptāṅgulaṃ> smṛtam || 17.191
śeṣamānanarandhraṃ tu sṛkviṇībhyāṃ yadantaram |
tadvikāsaś ca sārdhena kalārdhenāgradeśataḥ || 17.192
sa evāṃgulamānena <evāṅgulamānena> vijñeyaḥ sṛkviṇīdvayāt |
vāṇarandhraś ca vakrokte daṃṣṭre tv ardhakalonnate || 17.193
nāsāvaṃśaṃ yathāpūrvaṃ kadalīnāḍipṛṣṭhavat |
śrotre vājimukhokte tu ko(ki)ṭeḥ saptakalāntare || 17.194
tattulye locane kiṃ tu prāntatīkṣṇe yavojjhite |
eteṣāṃ vihitā grīvā hy aṅguladvitayena tu || 17.195
pratyekadeśāt saṃyuktā saumyamūrtyuditā ca yā |
vinocchrāyeṇa nṛharer yasya gātrasya yā pramā || 17.196
sā sā saṃveṣṭanād vyāsāt kalārdhenādhikā bhavet |
vakṣaḥkaṭyudarāṃsasphikkalāmānādhikāni ca || 17.197
tathaiva nakhapatrāṇi dehaś cāsya samāṃsalaḥ |
sampūrṇo <saṃpūrṇo> dakṣiṇāvartair lomabhiś cātikuñcitaiḥ || 17.198
tricatuḥpañcavaktrasya vinaivordhvamukhena tu |
dakṣiṇottaravaktrābhyāṃ hrāsaṃ kuryād dvigolakam || 17.199
vikāsaḥsiṃhavaktrokta udagvaktrasya tatra ca |
samo dṛksanniveśas <dṛksaṃniveśas> tu caturṇāṃ mokṣasiddhaye || 17.200
ārogyabhogakaivalyaprāptaye 'rdhāgulena ca |
kuryāt savyāpasavyābhyām atho dṛksanniveśanam <dṛksaṃniveśanam> || 17.201
sahapūrvānanenaiva samyakpratyaṅmukhasya ca |
niṣkā(ṣṭhā)sāyāmavistāraghrāṇadṛgbhūśrutiṣv atha || 17.202
īṣattir yakkṣitinyastadṛṅmukhaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ śubham |
tadvac ca proktadṛgvaktram uttaraṃ sarvasiddhikṛt || 17.203
svakāryasūcanān nūnaṃ tanmantrasya ca sannidhiḥ <saṃnidhiḥ> |
ato'nyathā samāśritya śāntimaste ca mantrarāṭ || 17.204
nityaṃ tatsannidhānāc <tatsaṃnidhānāc> ca bhūtavetālarākṣasāḥ |
ādarśanāt palāyante āviśānti ca darśanam || 17.205
ādāya śirasā mantrisamājñāṃ samprayānti <saṃprayānti> te |
ataḥ samācared yat tad yena syād bimbasannidhiḥ <bimbasaṃnidhiḥ> || 17.206
na hi tatsannidhānād <tatsaṃnidhānād> vai kaś cid ārabhate śubham |
varāhadaṃṣṭraṃ siṃhākṣaṃ tathā cipiṭanāsikam || 17.207
vidheyaṃ paścimaṃ vaktraṃ pañcavaktrasya vai vibhoḥ |
asyādharottarābhyām apy oṣṭhābhyāṃ samatā bhavet || 17.208
vibhinnatāṃgulārdhena <vibhinnatāṅgulārdhena> tābhyāṃ tanmadhyagā sphuṭā |
kāryā daśanapālī vai mūlamadhyāgrataḥ samā || 17.209
kalārdhenolbaṇaṃ vṛttaṃ tadgaṇḍadvitayaṃ tataḥ |
dvikalaṃ cāgrataḥ śmaśru kalā cārdhakalā kramāt || 17.210
sambandhaveṇiḥ <saṃbandhaveṇiḥ> pūrvoktamānena śubhakṛd bhavet |
siṃhasūkaravanmukhyavaktrāṇāṃ saumyatāṃ nayet || 17.211
pramāṇaṃ dṛggatāl lakṣād vyavahāramayāt tu vai |
vikāsaś cāśvavaktroktaḥ saumyarūpasya bhūbhṛtaḥ || 17.212
tadādyoktas tu nṛhareḥprāgukto yaḥ samācaret |
tathā vaktrāṅgabhāvitve vibhoḥ śaktīśvarasya ca || 17.213
hāranūpuravastrasrakkaṭakāṅgadabhūṣitā |
mālyopavītakeyūramakuṭādyupaśobhitā || 17.214
pratimā mantramūrtīnāṃ kṛtā bhavati siddhidā |
yatpurā pañcadhā proktaṃ vāhanaṃ prāṇadaivatam || 17.215
tasya bimbasamutthena tālena mukhamaṇḍalam |
dvyaṅgulaṃ tu lalāṭoktaṃ jaṭābandho dvilocanaḥ || 17.216
dvyaṅgulenonnataḥ karṇa uraḥ pañcakalaṃ smṛtam |
aṣṭāṃgulaṃ <aṣṭāṅgulaṃ> tadudaraṃ kaṭiḥ pañcāṃgulonnatā 
<pañcāṅgulonnatā> || 17.217
navāṃgulonnatāvūrū <navāṅgulonnatāvūrū> jānunī dvyaṅgule smṛte |
aṣṭāṅgulocchrite jaṅghe dvyaṅgule padapiṇḍake || 17.218
ṣamam <śamam> ekaṃ kalāhīnaṃ tadgrīvāyāś ca veṣṭanam |
bimbatulyā parijñeyā sarvadā sāṅgavistṛtiḥ || 17.219
tadvibhāgādhikaṃ vitta veṣṭanaṃ hy udarasya ca |
paridhiḥ kaṭideśasya caturnetrādhikas tu vai || 17.220
bimbokasadṛśaṃ vitta tadūrvor mūlaveṣṭanam |
tad eva jaṅghāmadhyasya jaṅghāntasya tad eva hi || 17.221
pādaṃ pañcakalāyāmaṃ caturaṃgulavistṛtam <caturaṅgulavistṛtam> |
tryaṅgulaṃ pārṣṇideśāc cāṅguṣṭhordhakalāsamaḥ || 17.222
vijñeyā aṅghrideśāc ca yavenāṃgulayaḥ <yavenāṅgulayaḥ> kramāt |
nābhirandhraṃ suvistīrṇaṃ dvyardhalocanavistṛtam || 17.223
madhyamāṃguliparyantaṃ <madhyamāṅguliparyantaṃ> maṇibandhān navāṃgulam 
<navāṅgulam> |
trikalaḥ pāṇivistāras tannakhā niśitonnatāḥ || 17.224
tadbāhumastakaṃ vitta ucchrāyeṇa dvilocanam |
bhujopabhujayugmaṃ yat tad dvitālasamaṃ smṛtam || 17.225
kalārdhenādhikaṃ bimbabāhvos tadbāhuveṣṭanam |
bimboṣṭhāṃ sadvidhīr hy evaṃ stanabhūrlocanolbaṇā || 17.226
vṛttavaipulyamānena locane padmapatravat |
bhrūyugmaṃ narasiṃhotthaṃ ghrāṇāgraṃ śukacañcuvat || 17.227
kalārghamānaṃ dīrghaṃ ca tadvaṃśaṃ gajapṛṣṭhavat |
svāyāmadīrghaṃ tatpakṣayugalaṃ kukṣideśagam || 17.228
tad eva dairghyād ardhena vistṛtaṃ haṃsapakṣavat |
svapakṣamānād dviguṇaṃ tatpucchaṃ śataśākhakam || 17.229
sapakṣamimamāyāmaṃ satyaṃ tvavayavānvitam |
sarveṣāṃ vitta sāmānyaṃ viśeṣākhyam athocyate || 17.230
ūrudvayān nayed dhrāsam aṅgulānāṃ trayaṃ tathā |
jaṅghākāṇḍocchriteḥ kuryāj jāṅghābhyāṃ cātra veṣṭanam || 17.231
bimbākhyaṃ maṇibandhasya samamūlān mahāmate |
jāladeśāt tadardhena saha cārdhāṃgulena <cārdhāṅgulena> tu || 17.232
pāde jālaṃ parijñeyaṃ vistāreṇa ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ <ṣaḍaṅgulaṃ> |
śeṣaṃ satyoditaṃ sarvaṃ sarveṣāṃ vitta sarvadā || 17.233
kiṃ tu pādojjhitau pakṣau dairghyāt taddalavistṛtau |
eṣā coḍḍīyamānānāṃ svāyāmā pakṣavistṛtiḥ || 17.234
pañcānāṃ ca parijñeyā sthitānām ardhalakṣaṇā |
etad ādāya mānaṃ tu pucchabhrūpakṣavarjitam || 17.235
viddhi vāmanarūpasya lakṣaṇaṃ kiṃ tu lāṅgalin |
lalāṭanāsāvaktrebhyaḥ samādāyāṃgulatrayam <samādāyāṅgulatrayam> || 17.236
mastakasyopariṣṭāt tu jaṭābandhaṃ prakalpayet |
jaṭāvasānamāyāmaṃ yathā syāt pañcatālakam || 17.237
tatas tu karmabimbeṣu viśeṣaḥ kathyate 'dhunā |
karmārcā cotsavārcā ca balyarcā tīrthakautukam || 17.238
nimittasnapanārcā ca śayanārceti ṣaḍvidhāḥ |
arcāḥ kāryās tv imā viprā bahuberavidhānake || 17.239
ekabere tu karmārcāṃ vinā pañca prakalpayet |
etaiḥ sarvair aṅgabimbair yuktaṃ cenmūlakautukam || 17.240
uttamaṃ syāt tribhir yuktaṃ madhyamaṃ parikīrtitam |
ekena yuktam adhamaṃ tattanmānam ihocyate || 17.241
mūlabimbasamucchrāyaṃ dvidhā vāpi tridhāpi vā |
caturthā vā saṃvibhajya ekabhāgena kalpayet || 17.242
utsavārcāṃ taducchrāyaṃ dvidhā vāpi tridhāpi vā |
caturdhā vā vibhajyaikabhāgena parikalpayet || 17.243
karmārcādīni bimbāni pañcāpi dvijapuṅgavāḥ |
bimbaṣaṭkaṃ ca devībhyāṃ sahitaṃ parikalpayet || 17.244
atha vā cautsavaṃ bimbaṃ tathā śayanakautukam |
śrīpuṣṭisahitaṃ kāryaṃ mūlabimbe dvijottamāḥ || 17.245
sthite vā vāhanārūḍhe samāsīne 'pi vā dvijāḥ |
karmabimbādiṣaṭkaṃ ca tathaiva syāt sthitaṃ tu vā || 17.246
mūlabimbe śayāne tu karmabimbādayo dvijāḥ |
sthitāv api samāsīnā vidhātavyā munīśvarāḥ || 17.247
nityotsavārthabimbaṃ tu sarvatraiva sthitaṃ bhavet |

munayaḥ
kair liṅgair muniśārdūla beraikatvabahutvakam || 17.248
jñātavyaṃ tadaśeṣeṇa vadasva vadatāṃ vara |

nāradaḥ
śilayā maṇinā vāpi lohair vāpi kṛtā tu yā || 17.249
nityādisakalasnānaviṣayā rahitā sadā |
karmārcayāpi devībhiḥ sthitāpy āsīnatāṃ gatā || 17.250
sthāpyate kevalā mūrtir ekaberaṃ tu vitta tat |
mṛddārujaṃ tu yadbimbaṃ karmārcādisamanvitam || 17.251
nityādisarvasnānārthaṃ śaktibhiḥ sahitaṃ na vā |
maṇivajrādiśailotthaṃ nimittasnapanakṣamam || 17.252
sadā tu nityasnānārthaṃ karmārcāsahitaṃ tu yat |
bṛhadbimbaṃ tu lakṣmyādisahitaṃ rahitaṃ tu vā || 17.253
nityanaimittikādyuktasakalasnapanakṣamam |
lakṣmyādibhiḥ samopetaṃ yadbimbaṃ śaktibhiḥ sadā || 17.254
tadetattrividhaṃ vitta bahuberaṃ munīśvarāḥ |
yat tu citramayaṃ bimbaṃ bhittikāṣṭhāmbarāśrayam || 17.255
karmabimbasamopetaṃ nityādisnānakarmaṇi |
yac cāpi mṛṇmayaṃ bimbaṃ trividhaṃ cāpi citrajam || 17.256
nityanaimittikasnāne darpaṇādisamanvitam |
karmabimbānvaye yogyaṃ vibhavec chānusārataḥ || 17.257
etaccaturvidhaṃ vitta bahubetaṃ viśeṣakam |
bahuberaṃ yathāyogaṃ sthitam āsīnam eva vā || 17.258
śayānaṃ yānagaṃ vāpi bhaved icchānurūpataḥ |
bahuberādibhedās tu pañcadhā parikīrtitāḥ || 17.259
anyāni karmabimbāni yātrābimbapurassaram |
tattatkarmaviśeṣārthaṃ bahuberaikaberayoḥ || 17.260
dvayoś ca kalpanīyāni vibhavasyānurūpataḥ |
ityuktaṃ leśato bimbalakṣma pīṭham athocyate || 17.261
bimbānām upaviṣṭānāṃ caturaśraṃ tu tad bhavet |
caturaśrāyataṃ caiva protthitānāṃ sadaiva hi || 17.262
vṛttavṛttāyatatvena hy anayo rūpam anyathā |
yāṃgulaiḥ <yāṅgulaiḥ> paramāṇūtthair ārādhakamayais tu vā || 17.263
dhattercā tu samāyāmadvārād vā mandirotthitāt |
tanmānena tu pīṭhasya dairghyamardhena vistṛtiḥ || 17.264
dvārordhvāc ca trirantāni ekapūrvāṇi vai purā |
santyajya <saṃtyajya> dvādaśāṃśād vai athaḥ pīṭhonnatistribhiḥ || 17.265
śeṣeṇātrāṃśasaṃghena pratimā cotthitā bhavet |
atha vā vāhanārūḍhā nyūnā vā madhyamottamā || 17.266
caturbhir dvādaśāṃśais tadupaviṣṭasya connatiḥ |
vihitā cāsya sarvatra pratimārdhena vistṛtiḥ || 17.267
tryaṃśakaviluptā vā caturthāṃśojjhitātha vā |
parivāravaśenaiva cāturātmyasya vai punaḥ || 17.268
aluptāṃśaṃ ca vihitapīṭhāyāmaṃ ca sarvadik |
caturdigdṛggatasyaiva ekadigdṛggatasya ca || 17.269
tad eva dairghyaṃ dviguṇaṃ lāñchanair āvṛtasya ca |
sārdhaṃ cānāvṛtasyaiva tadbāhulyaṃ puroditam || 17.270
catuṣkam ekapīṭhānāṃ kevalaṃ lakṣmavarjitam |
ekaikaṃ lakṣmabhedena tatsaṅkhyaṃ <tatsaṃkhyaṃ> vitta vai punaḥ || 17.271
anantāsanām ādyaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ pakṣamandiram |
kamalāṅkaṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ cakrabhūṣitam || 17.272
evaṃ hi sarvasāmānyaṃ pīṭhānāṃ hi dviraṣṭakam |
bhedabhinnaṃ samāsena punar eva nibodhata || 17.273
dikṣu lakṣmāṇi pīṭhānāṃ vitta kaṇṭhagatāni ca |
anyonyasanniveśāc <anyonyasaṃniveśāc> ca teṣāṃ bahvātmanā punaḥ || 17.274
cakrāmbujābhyāṃ tatsthābhyāṃ luptābhyām atha tatsthiteḥ |
tābhyām anyonyayogāc ca dikṣvanantakhagāśrayāt || 17.275
dvidvyātmanā dvyātmanā vā bahutvam avadhāryatām |
padmenordhvagatenaiva dvayaṃ cakreṇa tadbahiḥ || 17.276
evaṃ hy adhogatenaiva parijñeyaṃ dvayaṃ dvayam |
upariṣṭāt tu padmābhyām adhaścakraṃ dvayaṃ dvayam || 17.277
dvitayavyatyayāc cānyatparijñeyaṃ munīśvarāḥ |
antarbahiḥsthitivaśāc cakrapadmadvayasya ca || 17.278
vyatyayād anayor vitta ūrdhvabhāgāc catuṣṭayam |
adhobhāgād evam eva catuṣkam aparaṃ tu vai || 17.279
pīṭhānām aṣṭakam idam adhastād ūrdhvatas tu vā |
yuktam ekena vai kuryāc cakreṇa kamalena vā || 17.280
cakrākārās tu vihitā hy ekabhramasamāśritāḥ |
bahavo 'pi talās tadvadīṣad vai karṇikānvitāḥ || 17.281
iti lāñchanasañcāro <lāñchanasaṃcāro> bahudhā tanmayoditam |
yasmin prakṛtibhūte tu pīṭhe tadadhunocyate || 17.282
kṛtvā dvirdaśadhā pīṭhaṃ purāyāmāt samaiḥ padaiḥ |
ekena caraṇaṃ jaṃghākalaśau <jaṅghākalaśau> ca tribhis tribhiḥ || 17.283
kaṇṭhavīdhīm athaikena ṣaḍbhiḥ kaṇṭhaṃ tadūrdhvataḥ |
bhāgena kaṇṭhasūtraṃ tu śuktikāṃśatrayeṇa tu || 17.284
uṣṇīṣaṃ ca tadūrdhve tu kuryād aṃśadvayena vai |
nirgamaḥ svadalenaiva vihitaś caraṇasya tu || 17.285
caturdikṣu mahātmānaḥ kṣetrato hy adhikaḥ smṛtaḥ |
sarvavṛttaṃ ghaṭaṃ kuryāt pallavair vārakair yutam || 17.286
parito'ṃśadvayenaiva karṇapīṭhaṃ praveśayet |
antaḥ praveśam ekena vīthyaṃśena galasya ca || 17.287
kuryād galapraveśasya samāṃ sūtrasya niḥsṛtim |
śukter adhaḥ kaṇṭhasūtrabhāgāt pādena nirmitam || 17.288
vadanāntaṃ samāsena śakteḥ saṅkocam <saṃkocam> ācaret |
uṣṇīṣaghaṭajaṃghānāmaśrisāmyaṃ <uṣṇīṣaghaṭajaṅghānāmaśrisāmyaṃ> 
yathāsthitam || 17.289
ghaṭavad bhūṣayec chuktimarakair vābjapallavaiḥ |
tatropariṣṭāt paridhiṃ caturaṃśakasaṃmitam || 17.290
santyajya <saṃtyajya> nikhaned droṇīm aṃśanimnāṃ samantataḥ |
vistṛter madhyabhāge 'tha svatryaṃśena ca nirgamam || 17.291
tanmānaṃ caturaśraṃ tu pīṭhakṣetrād vinirgatam |
tac cāgratas tridhā kṛtvā pakṣabhāgau kṣayaṃ nayet || 17.292
anupādena cāmūlāt samyag lāṅgalavaktravat |
agrato mūladeśāc ca kṛtvādau vai tridhā tridhā || 17.293
bhūyas tan nikhanen madhyāj jalaṃ yāti yathā drutam |
sūkarānanatulyaṃ tu bhavaty evaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 17.294
kuryād vai śaṅkhasadṛśaṃ makarāsyopamaṃ tu vā |
jalanirgamam etad vai pīṭheṣūditalakṣaṇam || 17.295
na kuryāt karmabimbānām āśamādimitātmanām |
citramṛtkāṣṭhajānāṃ tu calānāṃ tu viśeṣataḥ || 17.296
tathaiva caturaśrasya caturmūrtigatasya ca |
praṇālam agragaṃ mūrter yataḥ saṃsiddhihānikṛt || 17.297
prayojanaṃ vinā kā cin na kṣatis tasya tadvinā |
sāmānyasya tu vai yasmād ādhārasya viśeṣataḥ || 17.298
sapraṇālaṃ bhavet pīṭhamāsanaṃ ca praṇālakam |
bhūri nīrādinā snānaṃ yatra yacchati sādhakaḥ || 17.299
pratyahaṃ tadvinā tatra pratyavāyo bhavet sphuṭam |
evam eva bṛhadbimbaṃ bhūṣitānāṃ vidhīyate || 17.300
dhātuśailotthitānāṃ ca nimittasnapanārthataḥ |
bhadrāsanagate karmabimbe tasya samācaret || 17.301
satataṃ ca yathālābhaṃ dadhikṣītaghṛtādinā |
toyena tan nayed yatnād bhūbhāgaṃ vā pratigraham || 17.302
yathā nākramyate pādair jantubhis tanmahardhidam |
ataḥ praṇālaṃ vihitaṃ niṣiddham ata eva hi || 17.303
janmāntaṃ vā jagatyantaṃ kairavāntaṃ galāntakam |
paṭṭimadyantalaṃ pañcabhedaṃ sarveṣu dhāmasu || 17.304
tatsaṃsthāpanakāle tu devānāṃ digdvaye hitam |
prākpratyagānanānāṃ ca tadudagdiggataṃ śubham || 17.305
udagdakṣiṇavaktrāṇāṃ prāgbhāge vihitaṃ sadā |
tatpunarbhadrapīṭhīyadevādvāmerthasiddhikṛt || 17.306
sadaivārādhakānāṃ tu vilomād viparītadam |
ityevaṃ pīṭhalakṣmāpi samāsāt kathitaṃ mayā || 17.307
iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
pratimādilakṣaṇaṃ nāma
saptadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ



athāṣṭādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ

ataḥparaṃ pravakṣyāmi mantrabimbaniveśanam |
bhogepsūnāṃ ca varṇānāṃ sāmprataṃ <sāṃprataṃ> yadabhīṣṭadam || 18.1
kaivalyadaṃ śamāc caiva cāturāśramyasevinām |
yajñakarmaratānāṃ ca sahāyaṃ ca phalais tu tat || 18.2
prāgvaddevagṛhasyāgre digbhāge sati maṇṭapam |
caturaśraṃ caturdvāraṃ darbhamālāntarīkṛtam || 18.3
anyatra tadalābhe tu yathābhimatadiṅmukham |
caturdaśakarāc caiva yāvattriṃśatkarāvadhi || 18.4
ṣaṭkarāntaṃ puras tasmād bimbamānavyapekṣayā |
kāryā madhye sthalī teṣāṃ dvisaptāṃśais tato 'ṣṭabhiḥ || 18.5
samantabhadrā suślakṣṇā citā pakveṣṭakādibhiḥ |
tālonnateḥ samārabhya sāmānye 'smin hi karmaṇi || 18.6
unnatāṃgulavṛddhyātu <unnatāṅgulavṛddhyātu> nītā taddhrāsatāṃ kramāt |
dvitriraṣṭāṃśakair madhye sarvāsāṃ maṇḍalaṃ bhavet || 18.7
caturaśraṃ caturdvāraṃ cakrāṃburuhabhūṣitam <cakrāmburuhabhūṣitam> |
dakṣiṇe śayanaṃ saumye kuṇḍam agnes tu pūrvavat || 18.8
samekhalaṃ dvihastaṃ tu cakrapadmāṅkitaṃ śubham |
tadadhaś caturaśraṃ prāgdāmamekhalikānvitam || 18.9
atha dakṣiṇadigbhāge kuryād vai cakracihnitam |
vartulaṃ paścime saumye kamalāṅkaṃ manoharam || 18.10
śaṅkhāṅkaṃ sarvakoṇeṣu mānam eṣāṃ yathordhvage |
sarve daśāntahastānāṃ caturṇām ekamekhalam || 18.11
maṇṭapānāṃ tu kiṃ tv atrordhvagaṃ sarvamekhalam |
ato'dhassaṃsthitāḥ sarve ekakuṇḍās tu maṇṭapāḥ || 18.12
teṣāṃ samekhalaṃ cādyaṃ dvāviṃśatyaṃgulair <dvāviṃśatyaṅgulair> bhavet |
hrāsād aṃgulayugmasya <aṅgulayugmasya> yāvad vai ṣoḍaśāṃgulam 
<ṣoḍaśāṅgulam> || 18.13
syāt ṣaṭkare gṛhe kuṇḍaṃ kāryā vā mekhalādhikā |
aṣṭahastocchritaṃ pūrvam athordhvakaravardhitāḥ || 18.14
na hrāsaṣṣaṭkārāṃtānāṃ <hrāsaṣṣaṭkārāntānāṃ> nyūnānām ucchriter 
bhavet |
trayodaśakarādīnāṃ caturṇāṃ pātayet tataḥ || 18.15
aṣṭakaṃ cāṃgulānāṃ <cāṅgulānāṃ> tu saptapañcacatuḥkramāt |
evaṃ snānagṛhāṇāṃ tu vistāraś connataiḥ saha || 18.16
kiṃ tu vai vālukāpīṭhair madhyataś copaśobhitāḥ |
dvicaturbhir dvihastāṃśair vistṛtāḥ prāgvadunnatāḥ || 18.17
snānīyā agragehād vai diktraye 'bhimate śubhe |
arghamānasamaṃ mukhyāt supīṭhaśayanānvitam || 18.18
dṛgdānabhavanaṃ kuryān māṅgalyakalaśaiḥ saha |
sarveṣām api bhūbhāge koṇastambhair vibhūṣitam || 18.19
sunetrair veṣṭitaṃ kuryāc cakrādyaiḥ pūrvavadyutam |
susthitaṃ dṛḍhapādaṃ ca snānām bhograhaṇakṣamam || 18.20
ardhena vālukāpīṭhaṃ dīrghamādyakrameṇa tu |
vardhitaṃ cārdhahastena hrāsitaṃ cataraṅgulaiḥ || 18.21
svadairghyād ardhavistīrṇaṃ kṛtvaivaṃ sapraṇālakam |
tena tadvālukāpīṭhaṃ bhūṣayen madhyagena tu || 18.22
yāgāgārasya vai dikṣu dvārārthaṃ tatra cāntare |
śāmārdhavṛddhiyogena hrāso'nyatra kalādikaḥ || 18.23
toraṇāni bahiḥ kuryād dṛḍhaiḥ kāṣṭhaiḥ supūjitaiḥ |
pañcahastāni cārdhena vardhitāni kareṇa tu || 18.24
na hrāsam ācarat teṣām anyatra karaṇe sati |
na samāt pañcahastānāmṛte bhūmau praveśayet || 18.25
śamārthaṃ vardhitānāṃ ca dve dve saṃvardhayet kale |
dairghyāt praveśaśiṣṭāt tu tribhāgena tadantaram || 18.26
sarve cakradhvajāḥ kāryā vastrasraṅmañjarīyutāḥ |
sudhādyair varṇakaiḥ pītaiś candanādyais tu lepitāḥ || 18.27
bhinnāṅgam etadakhilaṃ yathaikasmin hi yujyate |
karma yāgagṛhe śaśvadvibhūter vāvaner vinā || 18.28
pañcatriṃśatkaṃ kṣetraṃ svaturyāṃśena vistṛtam |
tanmadhye tu caturhastaṃ tvāpādyaṃ sthalasaptakam || 18.29
sthalānāṃ vyavadhānaṃ tu kuryād vai tālasaṃmitam |
ekāpāyena vai kuryād dvihastāntaṃ sthalāṅgaṇam || 18.30
krameṇāṣṭāṃgulān <krameṇāṣṭāṅgulān> mānād dvyaṃgulaṃ 
<dvyaṅgulaṃ> dvyaṃgulaṃ vinā |
sthalānāṃ saṅkaṭānāṃ <saṃkaṭānāṃ> ca vyavadhānaṃ dvigolakam || 18.31
evam eva samucchrāyaḥ sarveṣāṃ parikīrtitaḥ |
parito vihitaṃ vīdher mānam atra svapīṭhajam || 18.32
evaṃ vā saṅkaṭe <saṃkaṭe> kuryāṃ dādyoktān maṇṭapadvayāt |
madhyamaṇḍalapīṭhaṃ tu tasya dakṣiṇadig bhavet || 18.33
samīpe śayanasthānaṃ kumbhānāṃ sthāpanāyanam |
evaṃ hi ?vāmanikaṭe bhogānāṃ mantratarpaṇam || 18.34
ṛgyajussāmapūrvāṇāṃ śrutīnāṃ havanaṃ pare |
dṛgdānaṃ śayanasthānaṃ hy anyasmin śayane hitam || 18.35
prāsādasyāṣṭadiṅmūrtipānām eva yathoditam |
sthaṇḍileṣv atha kuṇḍeṣu tādarthyenātha vā svayam || 18.36
svakuṇḍe havanaṃ kuryāc caturvedamaye pare |
samastamūrtipīyaṃ vā svayam eva samācaret || 18.37
sāmagrīvirahād yogyamūrtipānām abhāvataḥ |
evaṃ tv abhinavaṃ kṛtvā yāgārthaṃ maṇṭapaṃ dvijāḥ || 18.38
pūrvoditair alaṅkārair <alaṃkārair> alaṃkṛtya pṛthagvidhaiḥ |
sitaraktādibhedena prāgādau tu dhvajāṣṭakam || 18.39
niveśya madhyavedyāṃ tu punarapyayavat tathā |
tadarthān sarvasambhārān <sarvasaṃbhārān> sambhṛtya <saṃbhṛtya> susamāhitaḥ 
|| 18.40
dine karmadināt pūrve saptame pañcame 'pi vā |
aṅkurānarpayitvā tu tataḥ karma samārabhet || 18.41
pradhānadivasāt pūrvaṃ dine deśikasattamaḥ |
snātaḥ śuklāṃbaraḥ <śuklāmbaraḥ> sragvī kṛtyanyāsaḥ suśāntadhīḥ || 18.42
kṛtāhnikodhivāsārthaṃ sarvālaṅkārabhūṣitaḥ <sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ> |
sarvasādhanasaṃyuktas tv arghyapātrasamanvitaḥ || 18.43
māṅgalyakumbham ādāya dhyāyamānocyutaṃ hṛdi |
saha caikāyanair vipraiḥ sadāgamaparāyaṇaiḥ || 18.44
tathā ṛṅmayapūrvais tv āmūlād bhagavanmayaiḥ |
bherīpaṭahavāditraśaṅkhaśabdādikaiḥ saha || 18.45
ṛgyajussāmapūrvais tu praśastāḥ sampaṭhan <saṃpaṭhan> śrutīḥ |
dvārapālārcanaṃ kṛtvā yāgāgāraṃ praviśya ca || 18.46
saṃsmṛtya svāsane vyāptim arcayitvopaviśya ca |
madhyapīṭhasamīpe tu prāṅmukhaḥ paścime pade || 18.47
agre māṃgalyakalaśam <māṅgalyakalaśam> ādhārasyopari nyaset |
viprān ṛṅmayapūrvāṃś copaveśya ca pūrvavat || 18.48
pūrvoktas tv adhikair yukto dravyair dravyagaṇaḥ śubhaḥ |
yaś ca yatropayojyas tu tatra taṃ saṃpraveśayet || 18.49
maṃtrāṇām <mantrāṇām> upadeṣṭā cānukūlo mahāmatiḥ |
yoktavyaḥ karmadakṣas tu sarveṣv avasareṣu ca || 18.50
dakṣiṇe hy ātmano viprā ekacittaḥ samāhitaḥ |
svayaṃ vastvanusaṃdhāya havanārcanakarmaṇām || 18.51
āste hy utpattipūrvāṇāṃ nyāsāntānām ananyadhīḥ |
karaśudhyādi sarvaṃ tu cakrādinyāsapaścimam || 18.52
sarvaṃ krameṇa kṛtvā tu puṇyāhaṃ vācayet tataḥ |
pūrvoktavidhinā kuryāt sahomaṃ kalaśārcanam || 18.53
kuryāt satoraṇānāṃ ca dhvajānāṃ sthāpanaṃ tataḥ |
satyādikaṃ catuṣkaṃ tu madhyavedyā dhvajāṣṭake || 18.54
prabhavāpyayayogena yajet prāgādiyogataḥ |
uta devā avahitā ṛṅmayān pāṭhayet tataḥ || 18.55
prāgādidikcatuṣkeṣu toraṇānāṃ catuṣṭaye |
suśobhanaṃ subhadraṃ ca sugaṃdhaṃ <sugandhaṃ> ca yajet kramāt || 18.56
sugotraṃ ca tataś cakraṃ vihageśvarasaṃyutam |
upariṣṭān muniśreṣṭhāḥ pūjayet pratitoraṇam || 18.57
eteṣām atha vā pūrvaṃ bhaved dvārsthaiḥ sahārcanam |
pāṭhayed dvārapālīyaṃ sāma sāmavidas tataḥ || 18.58
athārghyapuṣpabhṛnmūrtidharairyāyāt samāvṛtaḥ |
yatra tiṣṭhati viśveśaḥ pīṭhabrahmaśilānvitaḥ || 18.59
tatrāvalokanaṃ teṣāṃ kuryāt santāḍanādikam <saṃtāḍanādikam> |
cakrāstramantritaiḥ snānakalaśaiḥ snāpayet tataḥ || 18.60
siddhārthakais tathā pañcagavyamṛdbhūtivāriṇā |
valmīkamṛjjalenātha cakrāṅkauṣadhivāriṇā || 18.61
saṃkṣālyābhyarcya codvartya kṣālayed astravāriṇā |
tam arghyeṇārcayitvā ca tatas tanmāntritān kare || 18.62
siddhārthakān dakṣiṇe tu badhvāgre pāṭhayed ṛcam |
prarohaṇaṃ tathā sarvān nayet pratisare maṇīn || 18.63
sarvatra veṣṭitaṃ kṛtvā samāropya rathottame |
karmārambhaṃ ca paṭhatas tasya dakṣiṇadiṅ nyaset || 18.64
ṛksāmapūrvān vāme tu brāhmaṇāṃś ca catuś catuḥ |
purato 'straṃ smaranyāyāt svayaṃ vighnāṃs tu sūdayan || 18.65
sanṛttagītavāditrastutimaṅgalapāṭhakaiḥ |
idaṃ viṣṇur vicakrama ity ṛṅmayaiḥ sahapāṭhakaiḥ || 18.66
ekāyanāṃs tadante tv onnamobrahmaṇe tu yat |
tathaiva śākunaṃ sūktaṃ śrīsūktena samanvitam || 18.67
svarṇādinārthinaḥ śaktyā tarpayaṃs tān niveśayet |
yāgabhūmiṃ tato bimbam avaropya rathādikāt || 18.68
niṣaṇṇaṃ dṛḍhakāṣṭhotthatoraṇe sanniveśya <saṃniveśya> ca |
snānabhūmau tataḥ kuryād astreṇājyatilāhutīḥ || 18.69
yadvā pūrvaṃ samānīya pīṭhaṃ brahmaśilānvitam |
bhūmiṣṭhe bhadrapīṭhe tu vedikāyāṃ niveśya ca || 18.70
tato bimbaṃ samānīya sthāpayet piṇḍikopari |
sthāpyamāne bṛhadbimbe viśeṣaḥ kathyate dvijaḥ || 18.71
pūrvavatkarmaśālāyāṃ saṃsthāpyākāraśuddhaye |
saṃsnāpya vidhinā kṛttvā nayanonmīlanaṃ tataḥ || 18.72
snapanaṃ bṛhad āpādya kevalaṃ vā bahūdakaiḥ |
snānakarma śilādīnām īṣatkṛtvā tu sārcanam || 18.73
utthāpya mūrtipādyais tu bahubhis tu rathasthitam |
samānīya tato yatnāt prāsādābhyantaraṃ tu vai || 18.74
yathāvadratnavinyāsapūrvaṃ pīṭhe niveśya ca |
bṛhadbiṃbaṃ <bṛhadbimbaṃ> tataḥ kuryāt karmabiṃbe <karmabimbe> 'khilaṃ tu vai 
|| 18.75
sannirodhas <saṃnirodhas> tu mantrāṇāṃ tatra lagnodaye smṛtaḥ |
ābṛhatsnapanāt pūrvaṃ yat kiṃ cid api tatra tat || 18.76
nirvartanīyaṃ pūrṇāntaṃ budhvaivaṃ prāṅmunīśvarāḥ |
tathā kāryaṃ śubho yena muhūrto nāvasīdati || 18.77
evaṃ hi citrapūrvāṇām anyeṣāṃ munisattamāḥ |
saratnabrahmapāṣāṇavarjitānāṃ samāpayet || 18.78
snānādyaṃ karma biṃbe <bimbe> tu tatsamīpe 'tha darpaṇe |
karmabiṃbaṃ <karmabimbaṃ> vinānyeṣāṃ prasvāpādyaṃ hi viṣṭare || 18.79
kuryāt praveśapūrvaṃ tu sarvam utsavapaścimam |
śaktibhiḥ karmabiṃbaiś <karmabimbaiś> ca garuḍādyair yadā saha || 18.80
samācaret pratiṣṭhānaṃ mūlabiṃbasya <mūlabimbasya> vai saha |
tadānīṃ tāni biṃbāni <bimbāni> yāgabhūmau praveśayet || 18.81
evaṃ praveśya tadbiṃbaṃ <tadbimbaṃ> snānārthaṃ sthāpayed ghaṭān |
atha vā karmadivasāt tṛtīye vāsare purā || 18.82
prāguktavidhinā kṛtvā sahomaṃ kalaśārcanam |
ācāryo mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ karmaśālāṃ praviśya ca || 18.83
prāpte 'parāhṇasamaye biṃbamākāraśuddhaye <bimbamākāraśuddhaye> |
sasnāpya vidhinā paścād biṃban <bimban> toye 'dhivāsya ca || 18.84
aparasmin dine prāpte deśikas tu kṛtāhnikaḥ |
jalād utthāpya tadbiṃbaṃ <tadbimbaṃ> yāgabhūmau praveśayet || 18.85

munayaḥ
toyādhivāsanavidhiḥ kathaṃ kāryo munīśvara |
tadvidhānaṃ vistareṇa vadasva vadatāṃ vara || 18.86

nāradaḥ
jalādhivāsanavidhiṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
prāsādasya viśuddhyarthaṃ bimbaśuddhyartham eva ca || 18.87
mānonmānapramāṇānāmūnādhikyopaśāntaye |
jagadāpyāyanārthaṃ ca sarvasampūrṇasiddhaye <sarvasaṃpūrṇasiddhaye> || 18.88
pratiṣṭhārthakriyārambhāt pūrvam eva śubhe dine |
pañcagavyādinā snānaṃ pūjāhomau tathā japam || 18.89
samācaret svamantrasya yatraivaṃ ca kṛtaṃ purā |
hetunā kena cit tatra jalavāsaṃ samācaret || 18.90
nadīṣu dīrghikāyāṃ vā taṭāke nirjhare hrade |
sambhave <saṃbhave> sati kurvīta jalavāsaṃ yathāvidhi || 18.91
asambhave <asaṃbhave> jaladroṇyāṃ kaṭāhe dhātunirmite |
yathāsambhavam <yathāsaṃbhavam> anyasmin pātre vā mṛṇmayādike || 18.92
alpatoye śmaśānānte lavaṇodapariplute |
kaṭuke ca kaṣāye ca tikte phenaiś ca dūṣite || 18.93
caityavṛkṣasamīpe ca nīcāvāsasamīpake |
varṇāntarayute svalpe ūṣare śaivalānvite || 18.94
evamādiṣu duṣṭeṣu jalavāsaṃ na kārayet |
ekatripañcarātraṃ vā jalamadhye 'dhivāsayet || 18.95
deśakālānusāreṇa sadyo vā jalavāsanam |
pratiṣṭhādivasāt pūrvaṃ tṛtīye paṃcasaptame <pañcasaptame> || 18.96
dineparāhṇasamaye karmaśālāṃ praviśya ca |
astramantreṇa samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> bimbaṃ santāḍayet <saṃtāḍayet> tataḥ || 
18.97
siddhārthakais tilair dīrghair astramantrābhimantritaiḥ |
saṃsnāpyākāraśuddhyarthaṃ ṣaḍbhiḥ siddhārthakādibhiḥ || 18.98
vastrābharaṇapuṣpādyair alaṃkṛtya ca bhūṣaṇaiḥ |
pūrvavatkautukaṃ badhvā samāropya rathādike || 18.99
pūrvavacchrutighoṣaiś ca śaṅkhabheryādikaiḥ saha |
vividhair nṛttageyaiś ca tathānyair maṅgalaiḥ saha || 18.100
grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ vāpi prāsādaṃ ca pradakṣiṇam |
bhrāmayitvā jaloddeśam ānayen mūrtipaiḥ saha || 18.101
prapāyāṃ tu jalābhyarṇe avaropya rathādikāt |
viṣṭare viniveśyātha prāṅmukhaṃ vāpyudaṅmukham || 18.102
maṇṭapaṃ jalamadhye tu vātavṛṣṭikṣamaṃ śubham |
catusstambhasamāyuktaṃ catustoraṇabhūṣitam || 18.103
vitānadhvajasaṃyuktaṃ veṣṭitaṃ darbhamālayā |
vicitraiś ca phalair yuktaṃ drumāṃgaiḥ <drumāṅgaiḥ> pāvanais tathā || 18.104
muktādāmasamāyuktaṃ sragdāmabhir alaṃkṛtam |
koṇe pradīpasaṃyuktaṃ cāmarair upaśobhitam || 18.105
puraiva kārayitvā tu kuryāt puṇyāhaghoṣaṇam |
prāgvacchuddhimapāṃ kṛtvā tanmadhye vinyaset tataḥ || 18.106
pratimānuguṇaṃ bhadrapīṭhamāstaraṇānvitam |
sopadhānaṃ tadūrdhve tu kalpayen māntram āsanam || 18.107
anantaṃ kalpayitvordhve 'rghyagandhādinārcayet |
mūlamantreṇa biṃbasyārghyaṃ <bimbasyārghyaṃ> pādyaṃ tathaiva ca || 18.108
ācāmaṃ vāsitaṃ gandham upavītottarīyake |
bhūṣaṇāni ca mālyāni dīpaṃ dhūpaṃ yathākramam || 18.109
datvā kṛtvā ghṛtāropaṃ saṃsmaret saṃhṛtikramam |
saṃhārasya kramaṃ vakṣye samākarṇayata dvijāḥ || 18.110
ātmānaṃ sarvagandhyātvā sarvajñaṃ viṣṇum avyayam |
kuryād bhāvānvito mantrī tadviṣṇor adhivāsanam || 18.111
praṇavena samāropya jīvam arcābhimāninam |
utkramyātmaikatāṃ kṛtvā svasmin sarveśvare harau || 18.112
saṃśodhya malināṃ pṛthvīṃ dagdhvā bījānvitāgninā |
adbhiḥ saṃplāpya tāṃ vāyuśuṣkāṃ vahnau vilāpya ca || 18.113
saṃhṛtya vāyunā vahniṃ vāyum ākāśatāṃ nayet |
ādhyātmikādhidevais tu karaṇair viṣayaiḥ saha || 18.114
tanmātrāsaṃsthitāny eva kramāt saṃhṛtya deśikaḥ |
nabho manasi saṃhṛtya mano 'haṃkṛti tat punaḥ || 18.115
mahaty ātmani taṃ cāpi nayed avyākṛtaikatām |
śāntānante pare vyomni niṣkale jñānavigrahe || 18.116
taṃ dhyāyet paramānande saṃsthitaṃ śāntavigraham |
yasminn avyākṛtaṃ līnaṃ sāvasthaṃ yatsvarūpakam || 18.117
vāsudevo 'pi vijñeyaḥ sarvātmā sarvakṛtprabhuḥ |
tasminn eva tu saṃhṛtya pṛthivyādīni deśikaḥ || 18.118
evaṃ dhyātvā yathānyāyaṃ biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> vastreṇa veṣṭayet |
sthagayitvāṃśukair divyair darbhaiḥ sarvaiḥ sragādibhiḥ || 18.119
ācāryo mūrtipair mantrān vyāpakāṃś caturo 'pi vā |
paṭhadbhiḥ śākunaṃ sūktaṃ tathā cānyais trayīmayaiḥ || 18.120
āmnāyodghoṣaṇaparaiḥ sārdham ādāya tīrataḥ |
tadbiṃbaṃ <tadbimbaṃ> jalamadhye tu pīṭhordhve śāyayes tv ayam || 18.121
ambhasyeti ca mantreṇa prāṅmūrdhānamudaṅmukham |
dundubhīr vividhākārā nādayitvā diśo daśa || 18.122
jayaśabdaiś ca gītādyaiḥ sapuṇyāhapurassaram |
ātmanyāsaṃ kramāt kṛtvā diśo 'streṇāvabadhniyāt || 18.123
avalokya ca netreṇa kavacenāvakuṇṭhayet |
lokapālān bahirdhyātvā sthānād asmāt samantataḥ || 18.124
tīradeśam anuprāpya kumbhaṃ sūtreṇa veṣṭitam |
veṣṭitaṃ navavastrābhyāṃ sāpidhānaṃ sapallavam || 18.125
saṃsthāpya taddakṣiṇataḥ karakaṃ ca tathaiva hi |
indrādīśānaparyantaṃ kalaśān parito nyaset || 18.126
savastrān sāpidhānāṃś ca sahiraṇyān sakūrcakān |
kumbhe viśākhayūpaṃ tu karake ca sudarśanam || 18.127
āvāhyārghyādinābhyarcya indrādīn kalaśāṣṭake |
bimbasya śiraso deśe kumbhaṃ ca karakaṃ nyaset || 18.128
arcitaṃ paritaś cāṣṭau kalaśān vinyaset kramāt |
koṇeṣu pālikā nyasyānirvāṇaiś ca dīpakaiḥ || 18.129
darśayec cakramudrāṃ ca rakṣāmudrāṃ tathaiva ca |
ata ūrdhvaṃ ca vai kuryād grāmyadharmaṃ tu tajjale || 18.130
dārulohaśilotthānāṃ bimbānāṃ jalavāsanam |
sākṣādbhavet tadanyatra bhavec chāyādhivāsanam || 18.131
vidhānaṃ tatra vakṣyāmi yathāvanmunipuṅgavāḥ |
snānam ākāraśuddhyarthaṃ darpaṇe tu samācaret || 18.132
anyac ca sakalaṃ viprāḥ prāgvadbimbe samācaret |
agrato devabimbasya chāyādhivasanārthataḥ || 18.133
jaladroṇīṃ kaṭāhaṃ vā sthāpayel lohanirmitam |
mṛṇmayaṃ dārujaṃ vāpi bhājanaṃ dhānyasaṃcaye || 18.134
pūrayed gandhatoyena śuddhasphaṭikavarcasā |
pūrvavadviṣṭaraṃ kṛtvā darbham aṃjarijaṃ <añjarijaṃ> śubham || 18.135
aṣṭāviṃśatidarbhotthaṃ kūrcaṃ kṛtvā dvijottamāḥ |
deśikendro vidhānena tatrāvāhya jagadgurum || 18.136
arghyagandhādinābhyarcya smṛtvā vai saṃhṛtikramam |
viṣṭaraṃ jalamadhye tu prāṅmūrdhānaṃ tu śāyayet || 18.137
cakramudrāṃ pradarśyātha kumbhādīn pūrvavan nyaset |
śaktīnām api viprendrāḥ pūrvavadviṣṭaraṃ bhavet || 18.138
atha vā tu tribhir darbhaiḥ kūrcaṃ kuryād vidhānataḥ |
chāyādhivāsamātraṃ tu tāsām api pṛthak pṛthak || 18.139
sarvāṅgaṃ navavastreṇa pratimāyāḥ samantataḥ |
chādayitvā samantāc ca siddhārthān vikiret kṣitau || 18.140
rakṣohaṇeti mantreṇa rakṣāṃ kuryāt samantataḥ |
anuktam atra yat kiṃ cit prāgvat sarvaṃ samācaret || 18.141
mṛṇmaye bhittisaṃsthe ca biṃbe <bimbe> chāyādhivāsanam |
antaḥ praviśya prāsāde deśikendraḥ samācaret || 18.142
anyeṣāṃ yāgagehasya prāgvat kṛtvā tu maṇṭapam |
kuṭīṃ vā tatra kurvīta chāyādhivasanaṃ guruḥ || 18.143
dārulohaśilotthānāṃ biṃbānāṃ <bimbānāṃ> vibhave tadā |
jaladroṇyādike pātre toyādhivasanaṃ caret || 18.144
tadāpi jalavāsan tv ācaren maṇṭapāntare |
yadvā snānārthataḥ kḷptamaṇṭape vā samācaret || 18.145
atha vā yāgasadane snānabhūmau tu tadbhavet |
evaṃ jalādhivāsan tu kṛtvā vai deśikottamaḥ || 18.146
upayojyaṃ pratiṣṭhāyāṃ yadyaddravyam upārjitam |
tat sarvaṃ samupāhṛtya prāsādādīṃś ca śodhayet || 18.147
paryagnikaraṇaṃ cāpi kārayed brāhmaṇena tu |
mārjanairgomayālepaiḥ śodhayitvā tu mandiram || 18.148
sudhācūrṇair akṣatādyair bhūṣayitvā samantataḥ |
pañcagavyais tataḥ prokṣya dīpānāropya sarvataḥ || 18.149
vitānādyair alaṃkṛtya gandhadravyaiś ca dhūpayet |
nāstikān bhinnamaryādān devabrāhmaṇanindakān || 18.150
pāpayogayutān anyān ninditān piśunāṃs tathā |
pāṣaṇḍino hīnavṛttīn pratilomān samatsarān || 18.151
lubdhān mūrkhān aviduṣo bahir nirvāsayet tataḥ |
karmāhād vāsare viprā aparāhṇe guruḥ svayam || 18.152
jalādhivāsadeśaṃ tu saṃprāpya saha mūrtipaiḥ |
utthāpya bimbam udakād mumbhaṃ ca kalaśān api || 18.153
udvāsya devatās tatsthās tadbimbaṃ tīraviṣṭare |
prāṅmukhaṃ samavasthāpya vāribhiḥ kṣālayet tataḥ || 18.154
lohajāś ced viśuddhyanti tintriṇīphalavāribhiḥ |
prāgvatsṛṣṭikramaṃ kṛtvā vidhānena munīśvarāḥ || 18.155
vastrābharaṇapuṣpādyair alaṃkṛtya manoharaiḥ |
yānam āropya tadbimbaṃ śaṅkhabheryādisaṃyutam || 18.156
grāmaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya hy ālayaṃ vā samānayet |
yāgagehaṃ tu yānāder avaropya niveśayet || 18.157
sthāne pūrvodite paścād ārabhet snapanaṃ guruḥ |
lekhyādau saṃpraviśyātha prāsādaṃ mūrtipaiḥ saha || 18.158
prākcādhivāsitaṃ kūrcaṃ jalāt tasmāt samuddharet |
bimbāc ca vastrābharaṇamālyāny apanayet tataḥ || 18.159
pīṭhe tu snānakumbhānāṃ sthāpanārthaṃ prakalpite |
pūrvoditaṃ sthūlaparaṃ snapanaṃ sthāpayed dvijāḥ || 18.160
pūrvādipaścimāśāntaṃ pṛthaksnapanamaṇṭapam |
vihitaṃ yatra tatraiva devadevasya vāmataḥ || 18.161
yātudhānapadaṃ yāvadagnikoṇādito nyaset |
snapanaṃ sthūlaparākhyaṃ sthūlasūkṣmaṃ tu pṛṣṭhataḥ || 18.162
īśakoṇāt samārabhya yāvadāgneyagocaram |
devasya dakṣiṇe pārśve īśānād vāyupaścimam || 18.163
sthūlasthūlābhidhaṃ snānaṃ sthāpayet kramayogataḥ |
adhivāsadine kuryāt snānaṃ sthūlaparābhidham || 18.164
pratiṣṭhādivaset kuryāt snapanaṃ sthulasūkṣmakam |
caturthe divase snānaṃ sthūlasthūlābhidhaṃ bhavet || 18.165
tadā tattaddine tattatsnapanaṃ sthāpayed guruḥ |
evaṃ hi snānakalaśān kramāt saṃsthāpya pūrvavat || 18.166
tadarpaṇāvasāne 'tha śayanaṃ kalpayed dvidhā |
nayanonmīlanārthaṃ tu śayanaṃ kalpayet purā || 18.167
dvādaśākṣaramantreṇa pīṭhaṃ saṃprokṣayet tataḥ |
prāgagrān udagagrān vā darbhānās tīrya puṣkalān || 18.168
pañcabhāramitān śālīnatha vā cārdhasaṃmitān |
vṛttaṃ vā caturaśraṃ vā kaṃbalānupari <kambalānupari> nyaset || 18.169
upadhānāni citrāṇi śayanāṃgāni <śayanāṅgāni> kalpayet |
māṃgalyakumbhān <māṅgalyakumbhān> saṃsthāpya digaṣṭakasamāśritān || 
18.170
tato biṃbādhivāsārthaṃ <bimbādhivāsārthaṃ> śayanaṃ parikalpayet |
tadarthaṃ vedikordhve tu kuryāt svastikamaṇḍalam || 18.171
rajasā kusumair vātha caturvarṇair mahojvalaiḥ |
prāgagrān udagagrāṃś ca darbhānās tīrya tatparam || 18.172
pañcabhārapramāṇena śālīṃs tatra vinikṣipet |
tadardhaṃ taṇḍulaṃ śuddhaṃ tadardhaṃ tu tilaṃ tathā || 18.173
uparyupari nikṣipya lājānūrdhve tu vinyaset |
kāṣṭhajaṃ sudṛḍhaṃ snigdhaṃ caturgātrasamanvitam || 18.174
catuṣpādasamāyuktaṃ caturaśrāyataṃ tatam |
khaṭvāsaṃjñitaparyaṃkaṃ <khaṭvāsaṃjñitaparyaṅkaṃ> tadūrdhve sthāpayet 
tataḥ || 18.175
dukūlaṃ mṛdutalpaṃ ca vinyaset soparicchadam |
kevalaṃ talpamātraṃ vā vinyased atha vā dvijāḥ || 18.176
khaṭvātūle visṛjyātha lājordhve ratnakambalam |
nyased abhinavaṃ paścādvastraṃ kārpāsajaṃ navam || 18.177
kṣaumavastraṃ nyasen madhye citravastraṃ tatopari |
śiropadhānasaṃyuktaṃ pādagaṇḍūkasaṃyutam || 18.178
sarvān abhinavān śubhrān sakapolopadhānakān |
sugandhadhūpitān vastrān kusumāmodasammitān <kusumāmodasaṃmitān> || 18.179
indrādīśānaparyaṃtaṃ <indrādīśānaparyantaṃ> kalaśān sūtraveṣṭitān |
toyapūrṇān samān snigdhān sāpidhānān savastrakān || 18.180
saratnapallavair yuktān dhānyarāśiṣu nikṣipet |
śaṃkhacakragadāpadmair <śaṅkhacakragadāpadmair> dhvajaiś cendrādiṣu kramāt || 
18.181
śrīvatsaṃ garuḍaṃ kūrmaṃ sauvarṇaṃ teṣu nikṣipet |
madhye madhye ca kumbhānāṃ dhānyordhve maṅgalān nyaset || 18.182
śaṃkhaṃ <śaṅkhaṃ> cakraṃ tathā lakṣmīṃ kumbhaṃ śrīvatsam eva ca |
darpaṇaṃ svastikaṃ matsyayugmaṃ vai maṅgalāṣṭakam || 18.183
vastrair ācchāditās tadvad nyaset koṇeṣu pālikāḥ |
evaṃ śayanayugmaṃ tu prakalpya tadadho yajet || 18.184
sarvādhāram anantaṃ tu tadūrdhve sarvagaṃ prabhum |
prabhavāpyayayogena yajet prāgādiyogataḥ || 18.185
pāṭhayet sarpasāmādi saṃjñāṃ jñānabalātmikām |
hutvā śatāṣṭasaṃkhyaṃ tu mūlaṃ tadanu kalpayet || 18.186
maṇḍalaṃ pāvanai rāgaiḥ sitādyair māṃgalīyakaiḥ <māṅgalīyakaiḥ> |
tadūnādhikaśāntyarthaṃ hutvā kuṇḍagaṇaṃ tataḥ || 18.187
saṃskuryāt pratikuṇḍasya nikaṭe kumbhamadhyagam |
prabhavāpyayayogena cāturātmyaṃ tu saṃyajet || 18.188
hṛdādi yadvā dikstheṣu vidikstheṣu tadastrapam |
datvā tadarthaṃ pūrṇāṃ tu pūrṇāt pūrṇaṃ ca pāṭhayet || 18.189
ekāyanān yajurmayān āśrāvitam anantaram |
evaṃ sarvaṃ samāpādya prayāyād biṃbasannidhim <bimbasaṃnidhim> || 18.190
biṃbam <bimbam> arghyādinābhyarcya guruḥ snapanam ārabhet |
athāstramantreṇa purā māṃgalyakalaśāṃbhasā <māṅgalyakalaśāmbhasā> || 
18.191
saṃsecya biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> tadanu snāpayet tanmṛdāṃbhasā <tanmṛdāmbhasā> |
pāṭhayet tatra kūśmāṇḍān balamantrād anantaram || 18.192
tato gomayakumbhena iha gāvaḥ prapāṭhayet |
bhūtis tvam iti mantreṇa pāṭhyamāne vibhūtinā || 18.193
pañcagavyena tadanu pāṭhayec chākvaran tataḥ |
pūrvavac ca tato 'bhyarcya vidhivaccamasāṃbunā <vidhivaccamasāmbunā> || 18.194
kṣālayitvā jalaiḥ śuddhair abhiṣijya tato 'rcayet |
śilpidoṣavināśārthaṃ snānam etadudāhṛtam || 18.195
paridhāya tato viprā vāsasī adharottare |
nayanonmīlanārthaṃ tu śayanaṃ yatprakalpitam || 18.196
tatra pūrvaśiraskaṃ ca biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> prasvāpayed dvijāḥ |
tataḥ samantād biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> tu chādayet kambalādibhiḥ || 18.197
sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ caiva pātram āḍhakapūraṇam |
dhānyarāśau nidhāyāgre pūrayeta yathākramam || 18.198
madhunā sarpiṣā caiva tatas tu madhupātrake |
arkamaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃ mārtāṇḍāyutasannibham <mārtāṇḍāyutasaṃnibham> || 
18.199
dhyātvā mantreśam abhyarcya tadanyasmin munīśvarāḥ |
candramaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃ dhenumudrāsamanvitam || 18.200
mantraṃ vai saurabhīyaṃ ca sphuradinduśataprabham |
tadantarasthaṃ mantreśaṃ himācalanibhaṃ smaret || 18.201
tatsrutair amṛtaudhaiś ca śaśijair dhenujair api |
subhāvitaṃ smared biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> madhuvāteti mantrataḥ || 18.202
ghṛtādi mantrayet paścādvastreṇāc chādayet tu tat |
aṣṭāṃgulā <aṣṭāṅgulā> ca sauvarṇī śalākā rājatī tathā || 18.203
kevalā vāpi sauvarṇī śalākā syād dvijottamāḥ |
aṣṭa dhānyāni paritaḥ pātreṣu viniveśayet || 18.204

