dhyānayukto dhiyā samyakpaṭhed ārādhakas tataḥ || 18.230
āvāhayānyamarabṛndanatāṃghriyugmaṃ 
<āvāhayānyamarabṛndanatāṅghriyugmaṃ> lakṣmīpatiṃ bhuvanakāraṇam 
aprameyam |
ādyaṃ sanātanatantuṃ praṇavāsanasthaṃ pūrṇendubhāskarahutāśasahasradīptim || 
