gūḍho yathaiva dahano mathanād upaiti āvāhito 'pi hi tathā tvam upaiṣi cārcām || 
18.233
mālādharācyuta vibho paramārthamūrte sarvajña nātha parameśvara sarvaśakte |
āgaccha me kuru dayāṃ pratimāṃ bhajasva pūjāṃ gṛhāṇa 
madanugrahakāmyayādya || 18.234
tato vimṛjya vastreṇa bhogaiḥ pūrvoditair yajet |
arghyādyair dekṣiṇāntais tu pāṭhayed ṛṅmayāṃs tataḥ || 18.235
arcāmi teti mantraṃ vai sāmagāṃś cārcitas tv iti |
oṃ bhagavān iti tadjñāṃs tv agnau santarpayet <saṃtarpayet> tataḥ || 18.236
svakuṇḍe deśikendras tu samidhāṃ saptakaṃ hunet |
paścāc chatāṣṭasaṃkhyaṃ ca sājyaiś ca tilataṇḍulaiḥ || 18.237
tarpayitvā tu pūrṇāntam uddhṛtyāgnikaṇaṃ tataḥ |
dikkuṇḍeṣu vinikṣipya saṃskṛteṣu puraiva tu || 18.238
tathaiva ca vidikstheṣūddhṛtyābhyarcya vai kramāt |
tataḥ prabhavayogena caturdikṣu niveśayet || 18.239
caturo vāsudevādināmnā ekāyanān dvijān |
svābhis svābhir asaṃkhyaṃ ca taiḥ kāryam abhidhādibhiḥ || 18.240
samitsaptakapūrvais tu sājyais tu tilataṇḍulaiḥ |
evamapyayayogena vāyvādīśāvasānakam || 18.241
ṛgvedādyāṃs tu caturaḥ saṃskṛtyādyau tathā nyaset |
tair apy acyutaliṅgais tu svaśākhoktaiś ca pāvanaiḥ || 18.242
havanaṃ vidhivatkāryaṃ bhaktiyuktena cetasā |
evaṃ krameṇa kuṇḍāṃs tu sarvān hutvā tato guruḥ || 18.243
dvārsthādīnāṃ puroktānāṃ dikpatīnāṃ samācaret |
havanaṃ vidhivatkuṇḍe sthaṇḍile vā munīśvarāḥ || 18.244
prāsādasyeśadigbhābhe tadarthaṃ pūrvanirmite |
stutvā jitantemantreṇa sāmajñān pāṭhayet punaḥ || 18.245
saha gāyatrasāmnā tu yadrathantarasaṃjñitam |
prajapya dvādaśārṇaṃ tu mudrāṃ badhvā praṇamya ca || 18.246
aṣṭāṅgenātha vijñāpyo bhagavān bhūtabhāvanaḥ |
mūrtibhedena rūpeṇānenaiva hi sāṃpratam || 18.247
lokānajñātatattvāṃs tu samāhvādaya nāgarān |
yenāntas sampraviṣṭeneṣatkālavaśāt <saṃpraviṣṭeneṣatkālavaśāt> tu vai || 18.248
janmāntarasahasrotthān mokṣam āyānti kilbiṣāt |
evamarthyo hi bhagavān lokānugrahakṛtprabhuḥ || 18.249
datvārghyagandhasragdhūpadīpān naivedyam eva ca |
nivedyācamanaṃ cārghyaṃ kuryān nīrājanaṃ tataḥ || 18.250
puṇyāhajayaghoṣeṇa vedadhvaniyutena ca |
śaṅkhavāditranirghoṣapaṭahair gītibhḥ saha || 18.251
karāv aṃghrigatau <aṅghrigatau> kṛtvā devadevasya deśikaḥ |
pāṭhayed ṛṅmayaṃ mantram uttiṣṭheti tatas saha || 18.252
yātropakaraṇair mantraṃ kṛtvā brahmarathe sthire |
suyantrite ca kṣīrājyadadhyodanasamanvite || 18.253
subhikṣakṣemaśāntyarthaṃ paramānnaphalair yute |
pāṭhayedasyavāmīyamṛṅmayaṃ tadanantaram || 18.254
tanmayān balamantraṃ tu daśārdheti munīśvarāḥ |
svayamādyantasaṃruddhaṃ hṛdā tu kavacaṃ japet || 18.255
bhrāmayed balidānaṃ ca kriyamāṇaṃ tu sarvadik |
ratnakāṃcanavajrāṇāṃ <ratnakāñcanavajrāṇāṃ> pūrvavat kṣepam ācaret || 
18.256
divyādyāyatanānāṃ ca kāryā pūjā yathocitā |
pacarātravidāṃ caiva yatīnāṃ brahmacāriṇām || 18.257
ṣaṭkarmaniratānāṃ ca dānaṃ dīnajaneṣv api |
rathasthe mantrabimbe tu yāvatpadaśataṃ vrajet || 18.258
tadrathaṃ tūryaghoṣeṇa tāvatkratuśataṃ phalam |
āpnoty ārādhakaḥ śaśvatsakāmo niyatavrataḥ || 18.259
tatas toraṇadeśasthaṃ rathaṃ kṛtvārcayet prabhum |
pādyārghyapuṣpadhūpaiś ca namaskṛtya ca pāṭhayet || 18.260
uttiṣṭheti dviṣaṭkārṇaṃ sajitantaṃ tu cākhilam |
sampaṭhan <saṃpaṭhan> pauruṣaṃ sūktaṃ yāgaveśma praveśayet || 18.261
śayyāyāṃ prākśiro bimbaṃ śāyayed dhṛdayena tu |
deśiko mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ yātrāhomaṃ samāpayet || 18.262
tatas tacchiraso deśe cakrādhārasthite ghaṭe |
pūrvoktalakṣaṇe netramantrasampuṭitaṃ <netramantrasaṃpuṭitaṃ> yajet || 18.263
pūjayen maṅgalāny aṣṭau prāgādau tu svanāmabhiḥ |
aṣṭāsu tatra kumbheṣu puraiva sthāpiteṣu ca || 18.264
vāsudevādayaḥ pūjyāḥ prabhavāpyayayogataḥ |
hṛdādi yadvā dikstheṣu vidikstheṣu tadastrapam || 18.265
yadvā prācyāṃ tu vārāho nārasiṃhas tu dakṣiṇe |
pratīcyāṃ śrīdharo devo hayavaktras tathottare || 18.266
āgneyyāṃ bhārgavo rāmo nairṛte rāma eva ca |
vāyavye vāmanaś cāpi viṣṇur īśānagocare || 18.267
svanāmnā pūjayitvaitān arghyagandhādibhis tataḥ |
pūjayitvārghyagandhādyaiḥ śayanasthaṃ vibhuṃ tataḥ || 18.268
varmaṇāc chādanapaṭaṃ datvā dhūpādhivāsitam |
mūlena śayanasthasya kuryād āpyāyanaṃ tataḥ || 18.269
devāṃghrinikaṭoddeśe <devāṅghrinikaṭoddeśe> upaviṣṭas tu deśikaḥ |
mantraviddevabimbasya mantranyāsaṃ samācaret || 18.270
lekhyādau mantrabimbe tu prāsādasthe dvijottamāḥ |
utsavaṃ karmabimbe tu viṣṭare vā prakalpya ca || 18.271
prasvāpya śayane prāgvatprāsādaṃ sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> ca |
mantranyāsādikaṃ kuryād vakṣyamāṇavighānataḥ || 18.272
suvistṛtaṃ tadvidhānaṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
pīṭhe puṣpāṃjaliṃ <puṣpāñjaliṃ> kṛtvā gandhayuktaṃ ca sākṣatam || 18.273
nyased aṣṭākṣaraṃ prāgvadāmūrdhnaś caraṇāntimam |
nyased dhṛdādiṣaṇmantrān sthāneṣu hṛdayādiṣu || 18.274
kirīṭaṃ śiraso deśe śrīvatsaṃ tu galādadhaḥ |
vakṣaso vāmabhāge tu vinyaset tadanantaram || 18.275
kaustubhaṃ hṛdaye nyasya vanamālāṃ ca kaṇṭhataḥ |
devasya dakṣiṇe haste cakraṃ śaṃkhaṃ <śaṅkhaṃ> tu vāmataḥ || 18.276
vāmahaste gadākhaḍgau hy atha vā dakṣavāmayoḥ |
kramāl lāṃchanamantrāṃs <lāñchanamantrāṃs> tu cakrādīn lāṃchanān 
<lāñchanān> nyaset || 18.277
śriyaṃ dakṣiṇabhāge tu puṣṭim uttarato nyaset |
ūrumūle vainateyam athedānīṃ nibodhata || 18.278
caturbhujasya devasya cakrāder viniveśanam |
mukhyadakṣiṇahaste 'bjaṃ gadāṃ vāmakare nyaset || 18.279
apare dakṣiṇe cakraṃ śaṃkhaṃ <śaṅkhaṃ> vāmakare pare |
anyān lāṃchanamantrāṃs <lāñchanamantrāṃs> tu yathāyogaṃ ca vinyaset || 
18.280
anyeṣu ṣaḍbhujādyeṣu mukhyadakṣāditaḥ kramāt |
sarvān lāṃchanamantrāṃs <lāñchanamantrāṃs> tu yathāsthānagatān nyaset || 
18.281
saṃsthāpyā bhagavanmūrtidhatte cakrādilāṃchanam <cakrādilāñchanam> |
haste yena krameṇaiva lāṃchanāni <lāñchanāni> nyaset tathā || 18.282
mantrān kirīṭapūrvāṃś ca prāgvat sarvatra vinyaset |
pādādidvādaśāṃgeṣu <pādādidvādaśāṅgeṣu> tato dāmodarādikān || 18.283
tacchaktikāṃs tathā mantrān tadvadvyāpakalakṣaṇān |
aiśvareṇātha bījena yathāvasthena bhāvayet || 18.284
pādādi tanmayenaiva tadvanmantravareṇa tu |
prāgvadapyayayuktyā tu hy antarjyotirmayātmanā || 18.285
vibhunā vāksvarūpeṇa tad evātha paraṃ padam |
suśāṃtaṃ <suśāntaṃ> sarvagaṃ budhvā nistaraṅgam ivodadhim || 18.286
vidyāṃ gadām ityādyaṃ yatpāṭhayet pāñcarātrikān |
dehasānyāsikaṃ mantraṃ dhāraṇākhyam anantaram || 18.287
jīmūtasyeti ṛgvedān nāsadāsīt tu pāṭhayet |
krameṇānena hutvā tu padārthaśatasaṃkhyayā || 18.288
tilānāṃ ca tathājyasya mantrair ebhir munīśvarāḥ |
datvā pūrṇāhutiṃ prāgvadupasaṃhāralakṣaṇām || 18.289
tatas tatparamaṃ brahma hy uditaṃ pūrvavat smaret |
sarvaśaktimayenaiva svabhāvena svakena tu || 18.290
ojo balātmanā yadvadgandho dravyātmanā tu vai |
bījaṃ tarusvarūpeṇa samudro budbudātmanā || 18.291
evamavyapadeśyā yā śaktiḥ sve śaktidarpaṇe |
sthitam ādāya viśveśaṃ svātantryāc ca munīśvarāḥ || 18.292
mantrarūpāṃ tanuṃ dhatte samyagārādhanāya ca |
nānātvam upayātasya prasaraṃ tasya ca svayam || 18.293
niṣprabhatvaṃ prayātasya cidbījaniyamasya ca |
āviṣkṛtasya bhede vāpyamūrtena balīyasā || 18.294
ajñānagahanenaiva nityānityāmalātmanā |
smṛtvaivaṃ mūlamantraṃ tu biṃbahṛtpadmagaṃ <bimbahṛtpadmagaṃ> smaret || 
18.295
ṣaṭchaktikaraṇopetaṃ tais taddravyamayīṃ tanum |
saṃsmaret saṃharantaṃ ca prāguktenaiva vartmanā || 18.296
svarūpam amalaṃ bhūyaḥ smaren mūrtyātmanā tu tat |
nayantaṃ pūrvavidhināpy evaṃ sa parameśvaraḥ || 18.297
mantrātmanā svatantratvam upayāto yadā tadā |
sahasraśirasaṃ devam iti sarvāṃs tu pāṭhayet || 18.298
pāṭhayed brāhmaṇān dhātaryaddhakṣeti ca mantrapam |
yo 'viśvataś cakṣur iti dhyātavyo bhavatīti ca || 18.299
dvāsuparṇeti tadanv atodeveti vai tataḥ |
ṛṅmayaṃ pauruṣaṃ sūktaṃ tataḥ paratamān iti || 18.300
śāśvatācatataḥ kālakaleti samudāharet |
eṣābuddhiḥ saptadhety atredānīṃ ca pāṭhayet || 18.301
tato 'rcayityā mantreśaṃ śayane biṃbavṛttikam <bimbavṛttikam> |
sāṃsparśikair āsanādyair vividhair aupacārikaiḥ || 18.302
hṛdayaṅgam asaṃjñaiś ca madhuparkādibhir dvijāḥ |
paramānnādibhiś cānnaiḥ pavitraiḥ pāvanais tathā || 18.303
anyaiś ca vividhair bhogair yathā cānukrameṇa tu |
sarvaṃ tu sampradānāntaṃ <saṃpradānāntaṃ> kṛtvā paścāt tu maṇḍale || 18.304
sannidhīkṛtya <saṃnidhīkṛtya> sampūjya <saṃpūjya> mahatā vibhavena tu |
agnau santarpayet <saṃtarpayet> sāṅgaṃ samitsaptakapūrvakam || 18.305
juhuyur mūrtipāś cāpi sve sve kuṇḍe yathākramam |
prāgādi dikṣu kuṇḍeṣu krameṇa samidhaḥ smṛtāḥ || 18.306
palāśavṛkṣakhadirabilvodumbarabhūruhām |
āgneyādividikṣu syuḥ pippalaplakṣasambhavāḥ <pippalaplakṣasaṃbhavāḥ> || 18.307
nyagrodhaprabhavāś caiva kaśmaryaprabhavās tathā |
palāśasamidho 'nyatra bhūyasāṃ parikalpane || 18.308
uktābhāve tu sarvatra pālāśyaḥ samidho matāḥ |
catasro dhenavaḥ sthāpyā dakṣiṇasyāmudaṅmukhāḥ || 18.309
gaṅgā sarasvatī godā yamunā rūpadhāriṇī |
dugdhais tadīyaiś śrapaṇaṃ carūṇām āhutis tathā || 18.310
śrapayet payasā pūrve śālitaṇḍulam āḍhakam |
kṛsarair dakṣiṇāgnau tu pāścād ye guḍam iśritam || 18.311
udīcyāgnau haridrānnaṃ śuddhānnam itarāgniṣu |
pratyekaṃ śatam aṣṭau ca homāḥ syuḥ samidādibhiḥ || 18.312
tadardhaṃ vāpi pādaṃ vā deśakālānurūpataḥ |
tilaśāliyavair veṇuhomabījāny anukramāt || 18.313
tilair itarakuṇḍeṣu tair vā sarvatra kalpayet |
svamūrtikumbhān mantreṇa jalam uddhṛtya bhājane || 18.314
biṃbamūrdhni <bimbamūrdhni> kramād deyaṃ sarvair ekāyanādikaiḥ |
caturdarbhakṛtenaiva kūrcena tadanantaram || 18.315
palāśakhadirāśvatthabilvaśākhābhirambhubhiḥ |
siñceyur mūrtipāḥ samyag vedikākalaśasthitaiḥ || 18.316
ācāryaḥ koṇadeśasthair mantrair ?vetasaśākhayā |
saṃtarpayitvā tadanu mantraṃ saparivārakam || 18.317
ājyādinā prabhūtena datvā pūrṇāhutiṃ tataḥ |
biṃbātmanā <bimbātmanā> prayātānāṃ kṣmādīnām aṅgarūpiṇām || 18.318
āpādane 'pi prāṇārthaṃ piṇḍībhūtārtham eva ca |
ārambhād eva jātānāṃ chidrāṇāṃ śamane tu vai || 18.319
āpyāyanārthaṃ mantrāṇāṃ dravyair homaṃ samācaret |
dviṣaṭkeṇāhutīnāṃ ca ekaikena caturhṛdā || 18.320
ācāṅghrer jānuparyantaṃ spṛṣṭvājyaṃ homayet purā |
ānābhi jānudeśāc ca tathaiva juhuyād dhadhi <dadhi> || 18.321
nābherākaṇṭhataḥkṣīramāmūrdhnaḥ kaṇṭhato madhu |
saṃmiśraṃ juhuyāt sarvaṃ spṛṣṭvā dehan tu cākhilam || 18.322
datvā ghṛtena vai paścāt pūrṇāṃ mūlena tatparam |
saṃskṛtya bimbavatpīṭhaṃ bhinnaṃ brahmaśilāṃ tathā || 18.323
prāṇābhimānadevaṃ vā yasya yo vihitas tu vai |
veṣṭayitvāmbaraiś citraiś cakramantreṇa vai tataḥ || 18.324
kāryo brahmaśilāhomaḥ śatāṣṭādhikasaṅkhyayā <śatāṣṭādhikasaṃkhyayā> |
gāyatrībhis tadardhaṃ ca bahvṛcādyaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak || 18.325
ajasyanābhāvityādi mantrair ekāyanais tataḥ |
adhvādibhūtamūrtaṃ tu bhogyaṃ vāpi pṛthak sthitam || 18.326
devatānāṃ tv adhiṣṭhānaṃ pīṭhaṃ kṛtvā tu buddhigam |
hotavyaṃ praṇavenaiva svayaṃ vyāhṛtibhis tataḥ || 18.327
aparair balamantreṇa praṇavāntena hāvayet |
tato havanamantreṇa tarpaṇīyaṃ tathaiva hi || 18.328
svanāmnā praṇavenaiva svāhāntenāparais tathā |
saṃrodhas tarpitānāṃ ca kāryaḥ pūrṇāntam eva hi || 18.329
sāmbhasā viṣṭareṇaiva bhāvena sajapena ca |
sarveśvarasya devasya svakīyāsu ca mūrtiṣu || 18.330
śabdātmikāsu mūrtāsu tadvacchrutimayasya ca |
kṛtvaivaṃ ca tadā dikṣu mūrtipān viniveśya ca || 18.331
pārśvadeśe tu kuṇḍānāṃ tarpayet pāyasena tu |
dakṣiṇāṃ ca yathāśakti dadyād dhemādikāṃ tataḥ || 18.332
gṛhītvā dakṣiṇāṃ mantraḥ prīṇanīyas tu tais tataḥ |
atha nidrāyamāṇaṃ tu devaṃ stutvāvakuṇṭhya ca || 18.333
arcayitvā manaskṛtya tatra sarvān praveśayet |
viprānekāyanāṃś cāpi tathā vai bahvṛcādikān || 18.334
svasvaśākhoditān mantrān pāṭhayet kamayogataḥ |
stutipāṭhakapūrvāṃś ca nṛttagītaparāyaṇān || 18.335
vīṇāveṇumṛdaṅgādīn itarāṃś ca praveśayet |
vidiksthān praṇave jāpe mūrtipān viniveśayet || 18.336
diksthitān mūrtipān viprān dvādaśārṇe niyojayet |
rakṣāmudrāṃ tataḥ kṛtvā darśayet sarvadikṣv atha || 18.337
śāyayed darbhaśayyāyāṃ yajamānam upoṣitam |
sthaṇḍile svapnasiddhyarthaṃ prākśiraskan tato dvijāḥ || 18.338
evaṃ kṛtvādhivāsaṃ tu jāgareṇa nayenniśām |
prabhātāyāṃ tu śarvaryāṃ kṛtvā snānādikāḥ kriyāḥ || 18.339
pratiṣṭhām ārabhet paścāddeśikaḥ śāstravittamaḥ |
prabuddhaṃ yajamānaṃ tu svapnaṃ pṛcchec chubhāśubham || 18.340
tatrāśubhopaśāntyarthaṃ tadānīṃ juhuyād guruḥ |
śataṃ sahasraṃ sāṣṭaṃ vā yathāśakty atha vā dvijāḥ || 18.341
madhvājyakṣīrasaṃmiśrān saphalāṃś ca tilān api |
asrasampuṭitenaiva <asrasaṃpuṭitenaiva> nāmnā svāhānvitena tu || 18.342
doṣaṃ jahi jahīty evaṃ padaṃ nāmāvasānakam |
kevalenātha vākyena siṃhamantreṇa homayet || 18.343
evaṃ dussvapnaśāntiṃ tu kṛtvā sthāpanam ācaret |
prāsādaṃ darbhaśākhābhir bahirantaś ca mārjayet || 18.344
vikīrya sākṣataṃ puṣpaṃ gugguluṃ dhūpayet punaḥ |
sahamūrtidharair viprāḥ śilpibhiś cātha deśikaḥ || 18.345
sārghyapuṣpākṣatakaraḥ prāsādāntaṃ vrajet tataḥ |
hanyāt siddhārthakais tatsthān vighnān astrābhimantritaiḥ || 18.346
prāṅmadhye vidhinānena śvabhraṃ vā sāṃprataṃ khanet |
tadarthaṃ garbhagehaṃ tu sūtrapātair vibhājayet || 18.347
prāsāda ekadvāre tu garbhamānaṃ viniścitam |
dvārāt paścimabhittyantaṃ dakṣiṇottaram āyatam || 18.348
saptadhā vibhajet samyak paiśācaḥ prathamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
dvitīyo mānuṣo bhāgas tṛtīyo daivasaṃjñitaḥ || 18.349
brāhmaś caturtho vijñeyaḥ kramād anye trayas tathā |
daivamānuṣapaiśācā vijñeyā dvijasattamāḥ || 18.350
prāsāde tu caturdvāre caturdikṣu samaiḥ padaiḥ |
vibhajet saptadhā madhyo bhāgaḥ syād brāhmasaṃjñitaḥ || 18.351
divyamānuṣapaiśācāḥ kramāt paṅktikrameṇa tu |
caturdvāretrabhavane brāhmākhye madhyame pade || 18.352
caturdigvīkṣamāṇasya sthāpanaṃ caturātmanaḥ |
prāsāda ekadvāre tu devaṃ saṃsthāpayed dvijāḥ || 18.353
brāhmadaivikabhāgābhyāṃ daivamānuṣayos tu vā |
brāhme vā daivike vātha tasmin divyāśrite tu vā || 18.354
mānuṣāśritadaivena phalabhedavaśāt tu vai |
brāhmabhāge tu mokṣaḥ syād divyaṃ sthānābhivṛddhikṛt || 18.355
bhogamokṣaphalāvāptir brāhme divyasamāśrite |
divyabhāgaphalāvāptir mānuṣāśritadaivake || 18.56
daivamānuṣabhāgāc ca tv aihikāmuṣmikaṃ phalam |
vibudhabrahmabhāgāc ca saihikaṃ tu guṇāṣṭakam || 18.357
agradeśe 'tha bimbasya vedirbhāgadvayopari |
ārādhanārthato viprāḥ sthāpanīyā śilānvitāḥ || 18.358
pīṭhopary atha vā devaṃ yantvārādhayate sadā |
madhye ratnopalaṃ pīṭhe nyastvordhve sthāpayet tu tam || 18.359
devīsamanvitaṃ yatra sthāpanaṃ bhavati dvijāḥ |
mūlabimbasya pārśve tu pīṭhadeśaṃ visṛjya ca || 18.360
sapīṭhānāṃ tu devīnāṃ sthāpanaṃ tu samācaret |
ekā savye dakṣiṇe vā sthāpyā dve dakṣavāmayoḥ || 18.361
catasras tu krameṇaiva sthāpyā dakṣiṇavāmayoḥ |
pramādād buddhipūrvād vā tattatsthānaviparyayam || 18.362
na kuryād rājarāṣṭrāder hitaiṣī deśikottamaḥ |
bhinnaprekṣāvaśān madhye sati bhūyaḥ samācaret || 18.363
kṣālite 'strāmbunā lipte hṛdā vai candanādinā |
śvabhredho ghaṭaruddhānāṃ mantrāṇāṃ ca nirodhanam || 18.364
pūrvoktena vidhānena dhiyā sve sve yane tathā |
kṛtvārcanaṃ yathoddiṣṭaṃ pūrṇāntaṃ tatra vinyaset || 18.365
bāhulyena tu ṣaṭ paṃca <pañca> caturgolakasaṃmitām |
pīṭhād vinirgatāṃ kiñcidbhūtaye susthirāṃ śilām || 18.366
grastāṃ pīṭhena muktyarthaṃ navarandhrakṛtāṃ purā |
svamantreṇa tu tatrāpi pratiṣṭhāsīti pāṭhayet || 18.367
prāgādau prabhavenātha paṃcakaṃ <pañcakaṃ> paṃcakaṃ nyaset |
śilāvaṭeṣu dravyāṇāṃ tatra vajraṃ ca hāṭakam || 18.368
haritālamuśīraṃ ca vrīhayo dakṣiṇe tv atha |
indranīlamayaś caiva kāsīsaṃ candanaṃ tilam || 18.369
muktāphalaṃ ca rajataṃ pāradañ cāpyadik tathā |
sahośīrāś ca vai mudgāḥ padmarāgamathottare || 18.370
kāṃsyaṃ sarājapāṣāṇaṃ rājendraṃ caṇakaiḥ saha |
viṃśakaṃ vinyasen madhye pūrvam eva tato bahiḥ || 18.371
vidikṣvapyayayogena tv evam anyat pṛthak pṛthak |
evaṃ vaiḍūryapūrvan tu cakrāṃkaṃ <cakrāṅkaṃ> cābhrakaṃ tathā || 18.372
ṣāṣṭikāṃ tv īśadigvāyoḥ puṣyarāgo harītikā |
gairikaṃ śārikātraiva masūrāṇyatha yātu dik || 18.373
mahānīlañ ca vaṅgañ ca tathā pāṣāṇam ākṣikam |
yavān sāgarukāṃś caiva āgneyyāṃ sphaṭikaṃ tathā || 18.374
tāmraṃ manaśśilā caiva godhūmāś śaṅkhapuṣpikāḥ |
madhye sarvāṇi tadanu tato gartagaṇaṃ tu tat || 18.375
lepair ācchāditaṃ kṛtvā sāṅgaṃ mantraṃ pade pade |
pūjayitvā yajur vedāṃś camaṣaṭkāṃś ca pāṭhayet || 18.376
tadūrdhve vinyaset pīṭhaṃ tacchvabhre viniveśya ca |
aṣṭalohamayaṃ cakraṃ tadūrdhve tu mahāmate || 18.377
dvādaśākhyā dviśeṣotthādādhāro yasya yaḥ svakaḥ |
haimantadūrdhve kamalaṃ tajjaṃ vā tāmram eva vā || 18.378
yathākramasthitaṃ hy etatpañcakaṃ caturātmani |
nyased anantaṃ cakrasya mīnakūrmau tu tasya vai || 18.379
kūrmānantau tu mīnasya mīnānantau tu tasya ca |
sarvasya vihitaṃ padmaṃ tasyānantaṃ tu vinyaset || 18.380
lakṣmyādīnāṃ ca śaktīnāṃ cakrasthāpanakarmaṇi |
nyasya pūrṇāntikaṃ kṛtvā karmāṇy atra ca tarpaṇam || 18.381
maṇṭape tu khageśasya evam eva samācaret |
saha mūrtidharaḥ prāgvatkāryā darbhodakakriyā || 18.382
caturguṇitasūtreṇa veṣṭayed devamandiram |
chādayen navavastreṇa tathā vai darbhamālayā || 18.383
tatas tu mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ praviśed yāgamaṇṭapam |
pratīkṣel lagnakālaṃ tu yāvatkālaṃ na yāti ca || 18.384
tāvadvinodair homaiś ca hāsyaiḥ pāṭhaiś ca saṃkṣipet |
prāpte lagnodaye viprāḥ śayanasthaṃ prabodhayet || 18.385
arghyālabhanamālyādyair arcayitvā tv imaṃ paṭhet |
mantrātman rūpam ātmīyam āgneyam upasaṃhara || 18.386
samāśrayasva saumyatvaṃ sthityarthaṃ parameśvara |
namaste 'stu hṛṣīkeśa uttiṣṭha parameśvara || 18.387
madanugrahahetvarthaṃ pīṭhabhūmiṃ samāśraya |
uddhṛtya hṛdayenātha tyaktanidraṃ ca mantrapam || 18.388
utthāpya mūrtimantreṇa saha mūrtidharair balāt |
tathā tacchiraso deśe cakrādhārasthitaṃ ghaṭam || 18.389
tadaṣṭadiksthitāṃś cāpi kumbhāṃs tanmaṅgalaiḥ saha |
utthāpya mūrtipādyais tu vāhayan deśiko 'grataḥ || 18.390
yāyāt prakṣipamāṇas tu ratnāṃś ca vividhān bahūn |
nānāvidhais tu kusumair lājādyān miśritān bahūn || 18.391
pratimām udvahanto ye mūrtidhārās tv anantaram |
anye yathā na gaccheyur antarācāryabimbayoḥ || 18.392
aṣṭakumbhadharāś cānye ye ca maṅgalapāṭhakāḥ |
paritas te 'pi gaccheyuḥ paṭhantaḥ śākunaṃ tathā || 18.393
vāgyato yajamānas tu kuśapāṇiḥ praṇāmavān |
teṣāṃ vai pṛṣṭhatas tv anye gaccheyuḥ parivārakāḥ || 18.394
toraṇena ca niṣkramya pradakṣiṇacatuṣṭayam |
kuryāt prāsādapīṭhasya dvārāgre sannirodhya <saṃnirodhya> ca || 18.395
pādyārghyācamanaṃ datvā hṛnmantreṇa praveśayet |
śākhādyam aspṛśan taṃ ca pāṭhayet tadvidas tataḥ || 18.396
catuścakreti tadanu puram ekādaśeti ca |
varmābhimantritenātha dukūlena sitena ca || 18.397
pādāmburuhanālaṃ prāk śikhāmantreṇa veṣṭayet |
agnīṣomau samīkṛtya praṇavādyantakena tu || 18.398
mūlamantreṇa pīṭhordhve biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> saṃsthāpayet sthiram |
dvāramadhyaṃ na santyājyaṃ <saṃtyājyaṃ> devasthāpanakarmaṇi || 18.399
na tataś cāgrataḥ sthāpyaṃ na pārśve na ca pṛṣṭhataḥ |
nāmato mārutaṃ paścāt santyajed <saṃtyajed> deśikottamaḥ || 18.400
pratiṣṭhāliṅgaśabdau ca dvau mantrau pāṭhayet kramāt |
śāntaṃ brahmamayaṃ rūpaṃ svakaṃ samavalambya ca || 18.401
yatrāpi kevale brāhme sthāpanaṃ samudīritam |
tatrāpi vāmataḥ kiṃ cid divyabhāgaṃ samāśrayet || 18.402
yato hitārthaṃ sarveṣāṃ nirgataṣṣaḍguṇātmanā |
ato brahmapadādīṣaddevabhāge samānayet || 18.403
mokṣādiphalasiddhīnāṃ prāptaye hy avicārataḥ |
karastham atha moktavyaṃ kautukaṃ hṛdayena tu || 18.404
sarvāṅgam arghyamantreṇa datvā mūlam anusmaret |
hṛdāstraparijaptena vajralepena vai tataḥ || 18.405
biṃbapīṭhaśilānāṃ <bimbapīṭhaśilānāṃ> cāpy ekatvenācaret sthitam |
tatas tu netrakumbhasthais tathā kumbhāṣṭakasthitaiḥ || 18.406
toyaiḥ kūrcāgrasaṃlagnair biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> saṃprokṣya mantrataḥ |
tattatkumbhagatān mantrān biṃbena <bimbena> saha yojayet || 18.407
bālabiṃbagatāṃ <bālabimbagatāṃ> cāpi śaktiṃ mūle nyaset tadā |
mūlabiṃbe <mūlabimbe> muniśreṣṭhā mṛdādidravyanirmite || 18.408
karmārcāyāṃ viṣṭare vā darbhamañjarije dvijāḥ |
prabodhanaṃ ca vai karma tathā prādakṣiṇakriyām || 18.409
prāsāde saṃpraveśaṃ ca kṛtvānyatsarvam ācaret |
mūlabiṃbe <mūlabimbe> krameṇaiva deśikendraḥ samāhitaḥ || 18.410
mūlamantraṃ tato dhyātvā saṃśāṃtabrahmalakṣaṇam 
<saṃśāntabrahmalakṣaṇam> |
ādhārādidhvajāgrāntaṃ vyāptaṃ tenākhilaṃ smaret || 18.411
iti sāmānyasandhānaṃ <sāmānyasaṃdhānaṃ> prākkṛtvā tadviśiṣyate |
sthūlsūkṣmaparatvena sthūlaṃ ṣoḍhā śilāṃtagam <śilāntagam> || 18.412
piṇḍikāyāṃ tathā sūkṣmaṃ tatparaṃ bimbanigrahe |
vinyāsaṃ pīṭhamūletha devatānāṃ samācaret || 18.413
bhavopakaraṇīyānām etāsāṃ munipaṅgavāḥ |
vinyāsaṃ mantrabimbe tu na kadācit samācaret || 18.414
pīṭhordhve tu muniśreṣṭhāḥ pratiṣṭhaivaṃ vinaiva tu |
nyased vibhavadevāṃs tu hy uparyupari pūrvavat || 18.415
ghaṭoddeśāt samārabhya paramarcāgataṃ tataḥ |
evaṃ hi sarvadevānāṃ viniveśavaśāt tu vai || 18.416
cintāmaṇīmayo nyāsaḥ kṛto bhavati siddhidaḥ |
mantranyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryād bimbāṅgeṣu yathāvidhi || 18.417
sṛṣṭisaṃsthitisaṃhāranyāsaṃ kuryāt trayaṃ vibhoḥ |
sthite 'pi ca tathāsīne śayāne yānage 'pi ca || 18.418
eteṣv api ca sarveṣu kuryān nyāsatrayaṃ dvijāḥ |
yadvā sthite sthitinyāsamāsīne sṛṣṭisaṃjñitam || 18.419
śayāne saṃhṛtinyāsam ācared dvijasattamāḥ |
aṅgamantrasthitiṃ kuryāt sthāneṣu hṛdayādiṣu || 18.420
anyāni bhūṣaṇāḍīni vinyasya garuḍāntimam |
tataḥ sampūjayet <saṃpūjayet> tatra layayāgena cākhilam || 18.421
pīṭhasthaṃ bhogayāgena mantracakraṃ yajet punaḥ |
svanāmni svāmiśabdaṃ tu samāropya paraṃ tu vā || 18.422
harikeśavapūrvaṃ tu tatas tārasamanvitam |
prabrūyur mūrtipādyā vai supratiṣṭhitam astv iti || 18.423
puṣpākṣatāñjaliṃ pūrṇaṃ kṣipamāṇāś ca sarvataḥ |
sarve vadeyus tatrasthāḥ supratiṣṭhitam astv iti || 18.424
ātvāhārṣeti saha vai pratiṣṭhāsīti pāṭhayet |
viśvasya mitram ityādi mantram ekāyanā dvijāḥ || 18.425
oṃ namo 'stu namaś cānto ṛgvedādyais tu taiḥ saha |
oṃ nāmo brahmaṇebhīkṣṇaṃ jitantety evam eva hi || 18.426
jayaśabdasamopetaṃ stotraṃ śrotṛmanoharam |
deśikaiḥ saha sarvais tu vāgbhir uccābhir uccaret || 18.427
jīvabhūtena caitena vibhunā mantramūrtinā |
pratiṣṭhitena vipreṃdrā <viprendrā> vitta sarvaṃ pratiṣṭhitam || 18.428
evaṃ kṛtvādhivāsādi mūlabiṃbena <mūlabimbena> vai saha |
sthāpayet karmabiṃbādīn <karmabimbādīn> mūlabiṃbāgrato <mūlabimbāgrato> 
dvijāḥ || 18.429
lakṣmyādīṃś ca yathāśakti sthāpayet tu vidhānataḥ |
atha maṇṭapamadhye tu devadevasya sammukham <saṃmukham> || 18.430
sthite 'pi tanmuhūrtāṃśe sthāpanīyaś ca pakṣirāṭ |
snāto 'nulipto mantreṇa svena yaḥ saṃskṛtaḥ purā || 18.431
jñaśaktyā saha biṃbena <bimbena> yasmād bhinneṣu vastuṣu |
biṃbasannikaṭastheṣv <bimbasannikaṭastheṣv> athavānyatra sattamāḥ || 18.432
tatkālamaṅgabhāvatvaṃ vrajamāneṣu sarvadā |
havanāntaṃ ca niśśeṣaṃ dhyānārcanapurassaram || 18.433
svayam evānurūpeṇa karma sāmānyatāṃ vrajet |
tasmāt tadyāgabhavanād utthāpyādāya biṃbavat <bimbavat> || 18.434
devaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya prāgvatsaṃsthāpanāpade |
ekasmin madhyarandhre tu vajrādyaṃ pañcakaṃ nyaset || 18.435
eka eva tadūrdhveta ādhāro ya udīritaḥ |
prāgvanniveśanīyaś ca tatpīṭhordhve 'tha bhāvanam || 18.436
bhāvanīyaṃ śarīre ca śeṣaṃ vijñaptilakṣaṇam |
pāṭhayed brāhmaṇāṃs tadvatsuparṇosīti mantrarāṭ || 18.437
tam evāstrārcitaṃ kṛtvā tv athaprāk śāṅkare <śāṃkare> tataḥ |
someśānāntare vāpy aṅkaṇe vāpi tatpade || 18.438
atha vā mūrtipīṭhasthaṃ bhavanābhyantare 'pi ca |
khagoktena vidhānena viṣvaksenaṃ niveśya ca || 18.439
dvārasthānakhilān devān tathā cāvaraṇasthitān |
pūrvoditān krameṇaiva sthāpayed deśikottamaḥ || 18.440
samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> kumbhatoyena yāyāt pākagṛhaṃ tataḥ |
cullīṣv agniṃ pratiṣṭhāpyāgnim īle 'tipāṭhayet || 18.441
tatra vai pāyasādīni havīṃṣi vividhāni ca |
pācayec ca tato viprā yāyād devaniketanam || 18.442
kalaśaiḥ pṛṣṭhabhāgasthaiḥ snāpanīyas tato vibhuḥ |
saha mūrtidharaiḥ sarvair yathā cānukrameṇa tu || 18.443
sahāghamarṣaṇenaiva gāyatryāvartitena tu |
prāgṛṅmayas tu tadanu caturdhāvartitaiḥ svayam || 18.444
hṛdādyāvartitaiḥ ṣaḍbhir yajur jñas tena secayet |
bhūyaḥ svayaṃ tathā kumbhaiḥ sāmavit snāpayet tataḥ || 18.445
ṣaḍbhir anyaiḥ svayaṃ paścāt tenaivātharvaṇas tataḥ |
pavitrāvartitair evaṃ kalaśair antarāntarā || 18.446
saha caikāyanīyais tu snapanīyam anantaram |
caturmūrtimayair mantrair bahuśaḥ paribhāvitaiḥ || 18.447
snāpayet kalaśenātha śeṣam ādāya vai ghaṭam |
tacchatāvartitaṃ kṛtvā samūlenādyamūrtinā || 18.448
sārdhyaṃ vai devadevasya mūrdhni cotkīrya pāṭhayet |
jitanta iti vai sarvāṃs tataś cāstrodakena tu || 18.449
prāsādaṃ śodhayitvā tu gatvā vai kumbhasannidhim <kumbhasaṃnidhim> |
tatra sampūjya <saṃpūjya> deveśaṃ pūrvoktena krameṇa tu || 18.450
maṇḍale pūjayitvātha prayāyād bimbasannidhim <bimbasaṃnidhim> |
tatra sampūjayed <saṃpūjayed> devaṃ snānavarjaṃ viśeṣataḥ || 18.451
sāṃsparśikair āsanādyair vividhair aupacārikaiḥ |
hṛdayaṅgam asaṃjñaiś ca pāyasādyaiś caturvidhaiḥ || 18.452
annaiḥ prabhūtair anyais tu bhakṣyabhojyādibhis tathā |
sampradānāvasānāntaṃ <saṃpradānāvasānāntaṃ> kramāt kṛtvā dvijottamāḥ || 
18.453
sadakṣiṇaṃ viśeṣeṇa guraur <guror?> mūrtidhareṣu ca |
samitsaptakapūrvaṃ tu vahnau santarpya <saṃtarpya> vai kramāt || 18.454
mahānase 'pi nityāgniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi |
hutvā nityoktamārgeṇa kṛtvā homasamarpaṇam || 18.455
devaṃ praṇamya vijñāpya karmaṇā manasā girā |
svamarcāntargato deva mayā yaccānalādiṣu || 18.456
nīto 'si cābhimukhyaṃ tu kṣantavyaṃ tanmamācyuta |
evaṃ praṇamya vijñāpya krāntvā niṣkramya saṃmukham || 18.457
āmūlād dhvajaparyantaṃ prāsādo yaḥ purākṛtaḥ |
devaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtyāṣṭāṅgena praṇamya ca || 18.458
gṛhītvā cārghyapātraṃ tu yāyād devagṛhād bahiḥ |
snānādinā samabhyarcya vāhanaṃ bhagavanmayam || 18.459
pūrvoditānāṃ dvārsthānāṃ dikpatīnāṃ tathaiva ca |
pūrvavat tu baliṃ dadyāt krameṇa ca tataḥ param || 18.460
prabhūtānāṃ ca bhūtānāṃ balidānaṃ samācaret |
gṛhṇantu bhagavadbhaktā bhūtāḥ prāsādabāhyagāḥ || 18.461
balamantrapavitrāś ca teṣām anucarāś ca ye |
evaṃ kramād baliṃ datvā sarveṣāṃ pāṭhayet tataḥ || 18.462
ṛgvigdhiraṇyagarbheti yā devās tv iti vai kramāt |
sāmajñāṃś cānnasāmāni sahadhenumayāni ca || 18.463
sarveṣv āvaraṇeṣv evaṃ balyarthaṃ tu pradakṣiṇam |
kṛtvā tu deśikaḥ paścād ācamya bhavanaṃ viśet || 18.464
nyūnātirekaśāntyarthaṃ pūrṇāntaṃ juhuyāc chatam |
hṛnmantreṇa tu sāstreṇa dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ tataḥ || 18.465
evaṃ taddinam ārabhya kuryād dinacatuṣṭayam |
pūjanaṃ devadevasya catuḥsthāneṣu ca kramāt || 18.466
prāpte 'hani caturthe tv apanīya sragādikam |
kalaśān maṇḍalād biṃbāt <bimbāt> tato yāgagṛhe 'rcanam || 18.467
homāvasānaṃ mantrasya kṛtvā pūrvaṃ yathā purā |
ācamya ca baliṃ datvā yāyād devagṛhaṃ tataḥ || 18.468
tatrāsanādikair iṣṭvā snānāntaiḥ pūrvavatprabhum |
apanītāmbaraiḥ kumbhair dhānyapīṭhopari sthitaiḥ || 18.469
hṛnmantrapūjitair bhūyaḥ salilena supūritaiḥ |
saha mūrtidharaiḥ prāgvadantarāntarayogataḥ || 18.470
kāryaṃ vai snānakarmātha vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
nirodakethaprāsāde punarārādhya pūrvavat || 18.471
bhogair āsanapūrvais tu sampradānāntam <saṃpradānāntam> acyutam |
mudrāṃ badhvā japen mantraṃ stutvā kṣāntvā bahirvrajet || 18.472
śataṃ sahasraṃ sāṣṭaṃ vā juhuyān mantrarāṭ svayam |
sāṅgaṃ saparivāraṃ ca saṃhitoccārayuktitaḥ || 18.473
mūrtipaiḥ praṇavādyābhir gāyatrībhiḥ śataṃ śatam |
ekāyanair abhijñābhis svakīyābhis tu tatsamam || 18.474
pradāpayet tataḥ pūrṇām ṛgvedādyāṃs tu mūrtipān |
ekāyanāṃs tadante tu kramāt tān pāṭhayet tataḥ || 18.475
pūrṇāt pūrṇeti vai mantramādyāt pūrṇamasīti yat |
sanamaskena mantreṇa svayaṃ sāṅgena nikṣipet || 18.476
balibhis tu tataḥ sarvān bhūtapūrvāṃs tu tarpayet |
praviśyācamya tadanu kṣāntvā devan tu kumbhagam || 18.477
pūrvavanmaṇḍalasthaṃ tu kuṇḍasthaṃ tadanantaram |
viṣvaksenaṃ yajet prāgvadiṣṭaśiṣṭais tu vai kramāt || 18.478
bhūṣayed gurupūrvāṃs tu mūrtipān kaṭakādikaiḥ |
guror vā guruputrasya yāgadravyaṃ nivedayet || 18.479
siddhimūrtyor abhīpsārthaṃ snāyād avabhṛdhena ca |
ity etatsādhakasyoktaṃ mantrārādhanakāṃkṣiṇaḥ <mantrārādhanakāṅkṣiṇaḥ> || 
18.480
mantramūrtipratiṣṭhānaṃ yatrasthas siddhim āpnuyāt |
sthāpane yajamānasya phalaṃ vakṣye samāsataḥ || 18.481
ā devālayabhūbhāgād dhvajāntād vāpi maṇṭapāt |
sarvopakaraṇopetāt sarveṣv āvaraṇeṣu ca || 18.482
samantāt paramāṇūnāṃ sarveṣāṃ dvijasattamāḥ |
yāvatī jāyate saṃkhyā tāvatkartā samāvaset || 18.483
bhogabhugviṣṇuloke ca yātyante paramaṃ padam |
kartā vai brāhmaṇo vipraḥ sarvavidyādhipo bhavet || 18.484
kṣatriyo yajamānas tu sarvadeśādhipo bhavet |
vaiśyas tu yajamānaḥ syād dhanadhānyasamṛddhimān || 18.485
śūdras tu yajamānaḥ syān modate bandhubhiḥ saha |
sajjanmanā ca jñānena evam eva bhavet tu saḥ <<striyo 'pi ca>> || 18.486
putrārthī putram āpnoti rājyārthī rājyam āpnuyāt |
akāmānāṃ tu bhaktānāṃ bhaktir avyabhicāriṇī || 18.487
yac cāpi śāśvataṃ jñānaṃ bhavet taddharmaṇā saha |
svayaṃ kṛtānāṃ biṃbānāṃ <bimbānāṃ> sthāpanaṃ saṃprakīrtitam || 18.488
evaṃ biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> pratiṣṭhāpya prāsāde svagṛhe tu vā |
tataḥ prabhṛti kālāc ca pūjayet prativāsaram || 18.489
jīrṇoddhāravidhir yāvat tāvat kālaṃ vidhānataḥ |
pramādād buddhipūrvād vā pūjālopaṃ na kārayet || 18.490
evaṃ śriyādidevīnāṃ cakrādīnāṃ tathaiva ca |
sarveṣāṃ viṣṇubhaktānāṃ pratiṣṭhāṃ ca samācaret || 18.491
prathamāvaraṇādau vā maṇṭape vāṃkaṇādike <vāṅkaṇādike> |
lakṣmīpratiṣṭhayā sarvā samṛddhir jāyate nṛṇām || 18.492
cakrasaṃsthāpanāt sthānasaṃrakṣā bhavati dhruvam |
viṣṇubhaktapratiṣṭhānād aihikāmuṣmikaṃ phalam || 18.493
tasmāt kāryaṃ śriyādīnāṃ sthāpanaṃ devamandire |
devapratiṣṭhākāle vā hy anyakāle 'pi vā pṛthak || 18.494
saha saṃsthāpane tv eṣāṃ na pṛthak tv aṅkurādikam |
na yāgagehanirmāṇaṃ parivāroktavad bhavet || 18.495
sarvaṃ tatrāpi kartavyaṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ munisattamāḥ |
siddhārthakādibhiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ snānaṃ kautukabandhanam || 18.496
jalādhivasanaṃ caiva sūkṣmasūkṣmādipañcasu |
snāneṣv anyatamasnānaṃ nayanonmīlanaṃ tathā || 18.497
śayyāyām adhivāsaṃ ca tattanmantrādhikasya ca |
tattallāñchanajālasya nyasanañ ca yathāvidhi || 18.498
tattanmantrais tathā homaṃ kuryāt kuṇḍe pṛthakkṛte |
tattatpīṭhādisaṃskāraṃ pīṭhasaṃsthāpanaṃ tathā || 18.499
vajrādipañcakanyāsaṃ prāgvatsaṃsthāpanaṃ pade |
tadādhāraniveśaṃ ca yasya yaḥ samudīritaḥ || 18.500
biṃbasaṃsthāpanaṃ <bimbasaṃsthāpanaṃ> caiva pīṭhordhve tu yathāvidhi |
tattatsthāpanakāle tu tattanmantraprapāṭhanam || 18.501
etat sarvaṃ samabhyūhya kuryād deśikasattamaḥ |
pṛthaksaṃsthāpane kuryāt sarvaṃ karma yathāvidhi || 18.502
tattanmantrais tathā tattatparivārcanaiḥ saha |
cakrasaṃsthāpane kaś cid viśeṣaḥ śrūyatāṃ dvijāḥ || 18.503
amūrtaṃ dvādaśāran tv aṣṭāraṃ ṣaḍaran tu vā |
cakraṃ saṃsthāpayet tatra prāsādaśikharopari || 18.504
mūrtam aṅkaṇadeśe tu ṣoḍaśāṣṭabhujaṃ tu vā |
tasya sthāpanakāle tu tasya saṃjñām anuṃ japet || 18.505
vidyāṃ gadām ityādyaṃ yatpāṭhayet tadvido janān |
camūṣacchyeneti ca prateviṣṇo iti tv ṛcau || 18.506
pāṭhayed bahvṛcān paścāc chākunaṃ sūktam eva ca |
dhṛtordhvapuṇḍraḥ kṛtacakreti mantraṃ tataḥ param || 18.507
pavitrante vitatam iti mantrān yajurmayān |
āroheti <<kṣurihareti>> ca sāmajñān pavitranto 'gnir ity api || 18.508
ebhir vayam urukramasyety ādharvaṇikān dvijān |
evaṃ saṃsthāpya vidhivannavabhiḥ kalaśais tataḥ || 18.509
snāpayed brahmasūktasthair mantrair aṣṭabhir eva ca |
viśvasya vaśinaṃ devam iti prāgsthāpitena tu || 18.510
bahirāvaraṇenāstīty agnidiksaṃsthitena tu |
yannābhipadmādabhavad iti yāmyasthitena tu || 18.511
dhṛtordhvapuṇḍra iti ca yātudhānagatena tu |
dakṣiṇe tu bhuje vipra iti paścimagena vai || 18.512
viṣṇunāttamaśnantīti vāyudiksaṃsthitena ca |
puṃpradhāneśvaro viṣṇur iti somagatena vai || 18.513
imāṃ mahopaniṣadam itīśānagatena tu |
mantrair etaiḥ samastais tu madhyakumbhena secayet || 18.514
prāsādāgrasthite cakre prokṣaṇaṃ tu samācaret |
mahopaniṣadantasthānaṣṭau mantrān puroditān || 18.515
yadvā puruṣasūktaṃ tu sarvaśāntyai tato japet |
atrānuktaṃ tu sakalaṃ pūrvoktaṃ tu samācaret || 18.516
itthaṃ hi vīralakṣmyādi pratiṣṭhā ca prakīrtitā |
bhūṣopakaraṇānāṃ tu pratiṣṭhā tūcyate 'dhunā || 18.517
tadartham iha sarveṣāṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ devatākramam |
kirīṭe kaustubhe caiva śrīvatsavanamālayoḥ || 18.518
tā eva devatās tāsāṃ rūpaṃ prāg eva kīrtitam |
prabhāyāṃ tu prabhā devī pīṭhenantādayas tathā || 18.519
pādukāyāṃ vainateyo ghaṇṭāyāṃ tu sarasvatī |
śibikāyāṃ tathā yāne haṃsakesariṇos tathā || 18.520
gajāśvayo rathecaiva garutmān eva devatā |
śeṣapakṣīśayoś caiva tathā candrārkabimbayoḥ || 18.521
vāyusūnau dhvajāḥ sākṣāc cheṣādyā eva devatāḥ |
evaṃ jñātvā purā tattaddevatāḥ kramaśo dvijāḥ || 18.522
tattatsaṃsthāpanaṃ kuryāt tattanmantreṇa deśikaḥ |
aṅkurāropaṇaṃ kṛtvā sadyo 'ṅkuram athāpi vā || 18.523
siddhārthakādibhiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ snāpya kautukabandhanam |
kṛtvā chāyādhivasanaṃ jalādhivasanaṃ tu vā || 18.524
kṛtvā mūrtasya nayane samunmīlya yathāvidhi |
kumbhaiḥ saṃsnāpya vidhivat kṛtvā śayyādhivāsanam || 18.525
kumbhaṃ saṃsthāpya tatreṣṭvā tattaddevāṃs tadaṅgake |
tattanmantrādikān nyasya tattanmantraiḥ samarcayet || 18.526
kuṇḍeṣu vā sthaṇḍileṣu huned ekatra vā dvijāḥ |
tataḥ śubhamuhūrte tu prokṣayet kumbhayoyataḥ || 18.527
ācāryadakṣiṇādīni yaśāśakti pradāpayet |
evaṃ sāmānyataḥ proktaḥ sarveṣāṃ sthāpanakramaḥ || 18.528
rathasya sthāpane jñeyo viśeṣo mandiroktavat |
anyatsarvoṣakaraṇaṃ chatracāmarapūrvakam || 18.529
bhūṣaṇāni ca divyāni dhūpapātrādikāni ca |
arghyādisarvapātrāṇi vādyāni vividhāni ca || 18.530
kṣālanārhāṇi prakṣālya kṛtvā puṇyāhavācanam |
samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> pañcagavyena dahanāpyāyanādikaiḥ || 18.531
saṃskṛtya devadevasya pūjanāhau niyojayet |
nānāratnaprabhāḍhyāni lāṃchanāny <lāñchanāny> aṅgadāni ca || 18.532
nirmitāni suvarṇādyaiḥ prabhoḥ saṃyojayanti ye |
te dhūtakalmaṣāḥ sarve deham āsādya niṣkalam || 18.533
samyag jñānena yujyante bhāvaṃ nāyānti yecana |
ātmanaś copakārāya sarvaduḥkhanivṛttaye || 18.534
aṅgaṣṭhāgrāc ca gulphāntamājānvaṃsāvadhīhavā |
maṇimuktāpravālāḍhyaṃ kavacaṃ kāṃcanādikam <kāñcanādikam> || 18.535
yaḥ kṣipaty atibhaktyā vai svaśaktyā cāgate 'cyute |
sa yāti paramaṃ sthānaṃ sarvatra paśubāndhavāḥ || 18.536
lagnaṃ yadbhagavan mūrtāv aṅgadaṃ nūpurādikam |
viyojayati yo mohāt tasya vīcau sthitā sthitiḥ || 18.537
yaḥ paṃcakālasaktānāṃ <pañcakālasaktānāṃ> viprāṇām adhikāriṇām |
paṃcakālavidāṃ <pañcakālavidāṃ> caiva bhaktānāṃ siddhikāṅkṣiṇām || 
18.538
atha yocchinnaśākhānāṃ nārāyaṇaratātmanām |
tapasvināṃ vratīnāṃ vā snātakabrahmacāriṇām || 18.539
bhaktānām athavānyeṣām arcanāniratātmanām |
prītaye parameśāya kṛtvā samyakprayacchati || 18.540
śālādyāyatanopetam aśmapakveṣṭakānvitam |
grāmyair dhānyais tathāraṇyaiḥ pūrṇaṃ sadvṛttisaṅkulam <sadvṛttisaṃkulam> || 
18.541
vaṇikkuḍumbabhṛtakarakṣāpālaiḥ samanvitam |
sonantaṃ phalam āpnoti kālam ācandratārakam || 18.542
saṃsthitiṃ śāśvate loke prāpnuyād akṣayaṃ yaśaḥ |
bhogopayoginīṃ bhadrāṃ ramyāṃ pūrvoktalakṣaṇām || 18.543
yāganiṣpattaye kuryād yo 'grataḥ pīṭhasannidheḥ <pīṭhasaṃnidheḥ> |
bahirāvaraṇārthaṃ vā karmiṇāṃ brahmayojinām || 18.544
ṛṣidevapitṛbhyaś ca mucyate sa ṛṇatrayāt |
madhyato garuḍākrāntaṃ sacakrāmburuhāṅgitam || 18.545
turyāśram athavā vṛttaṃ kuṇḍavatpadavīyutam |
balipīṭhaṃ bahiḥ kuryād dātā yas tv acyutālaye || 18.546
sa yāti cācyutaṃ sthānaṃ vimānaiḥ sūryavarcasaiḥ |
yas tu prāggrāmam ārāmaṃ samprayacchati <saṃprayacchati> vai vibhoḥ || 18.547
nānāpuṣpaphalopetaṃ vāpīdrumasamākulam |
sābjatoyāśayopetaṃ mārakhaḍgasamanvitam || 18.548
sa nandanavane bhogān bhuktvā yāty acyutālayam |
kṣoṇiṃ yaḥ sasyasampūrṇāṃ <sasyasaṃpūrṇāṃ> yuktāṃ sadgandhaśālinā || 
18.549
kedāraṃ jalapātais tu paricchannaṃ samantataḥ |
sa gacchati jagadyoneḥ kālam āsādya śāśvatam || 18.550
sa yāyāt susitadvīpaṃ tatrāste bhagavān iva |
snānopabhogamantrārthasavṛṣendran tu gogaṇam || 18.551
samarcayitvā yo 'rcāṃ vai vaiṣṇavīṃ pratipādayet |
so 'cirān muktadoṣas tu viṣṇulokaṃ prayāti ca || 18.552
gajaṃ rathaṃ varāśvaṃ ca dīpasthālīṃ sulakṣaṇām |
vyajanaṃ cāmaraṃ chatraṃ vāditraṃ gaṇikāgaṇam || 18.553
śubhavastrāṇi netrāṇi divyānyābharaṇāni ca |
vitānaṃ vaijayantīṃ ca citrapatralatāgaṇam || 18.554
susvarām upaghaṇṭāṃ ca dhūpasthālīṃ sulakṣaṇām |
bhṛṅgāraṃ darpaṇaṃ toyakumbhaṃ gandhopalaṃ mahat || 18.555
pūrvoddiṣṭāni cānyāni dhānyāni vividhāni ca |
yo dadāti harer bhaktyā sa tallokam avāpnuyāt || 18.556
īkṣamāṇaṃ vibhor vaktraṃ vahantaṃ dīpabhājanam |
mahāntaṃ cāthavā dīpaṃ yantraṃ kūrmādirūpadhṛk || 18.557
śarayajñāsanasthaṃ ca cittasampuṭabhūṣitam <cittasaṃpuṭabhūṣitam> |
sacchāstrapīṭhaṃ vividhaṃ śraddhayā yo munīśvarāḥ || 18.558
dadāti devadevasya paraṃ sthānaṃ prayāti saḥ |
puraskṛtya jagadyoniṃ yadyadbhaktyā pradīyate || 18.559
tadārādhanasaktānāṃ tattadakṣayyatāmiyāt |
ity evaṃ biṃbapūrvāṇāṃ <bimbapūrvāṇāṃ> pratiṣṭhāvidhir īritaḥ || 18.560
ito 'nyacchrotum icchā cet kathyatāṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
pratiṣṭhāvidhānaṃ nāma
aṣṭādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha ekānaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
bhagavan nāradamune jīrṇoddhāravidhiṃ tathā |
biṃbasyāspṛśyasaṃsparśe <bimbasyāspṛśyasaṃsparśe> mahotpātādisambhave 
<mahotpātādisaṃbhave> || 19.1
nityapūjādilope ca prāyaścittaṃ tu kṛtsnaśaḥ |
śrotum icchāmahe yogin tatsarvaṃ samprakāśaya <saṃprakāśaya> || 19.2

nāradaḥ
śṛṇuteha pravakṣyāmi jīrṇoddhārādikaṃ dvijāḥ |
yat kṛtvā deśikādīnāṃ caturṇāṃ sukham edhate || 19.3
manuṣyanirmite sthāne vakṣye jīrṇavidhiṃ purā |
dhātumṛcchailadārūttho vastrādiṣv avatāritaḥ || 19.4
yo yo bhagavadākāras tasya tasya munīśvarāḥ |
upāṅgabhaṅge sandhānaṃ <saṃdhānaṃ> kuryād bhagne mahāṅgake || 19.5
tadbiṃban <tadbimban> tu parityajya sṛjed biṃbāntaraṃ <bimbāntaraṃ> punaḥ |
tatra tāvat pravakṣyāmi mahāṅgopāṅgakakramam || 19.6
śiro vaktraṃ tathā karṇau pāṇī vakṣas tathodaram |
nābhimeḍrapadaṃ caiva mahāṅgāni dvijottamāḥ || 19.7
cakṣuḥ śrotraṃ tathā nāsā tālur hastapadāṃguliḥ <hastapadāṅguliḥ> |
keśaśmaśru ca romāṇi nakhadantās tathaiva hi || 19.8
cakrādyāyudhasaṃghaś ca vanamālādibhūṣaṇam |
upāṅgāni muniśreṣṭhā mṛdbiṃbe <mṛdbimbe> śṛṇutādhinā || 19.9
pradhānaśūlaṃ yat tatra mahāṅgam iti kathyate |
vakṣodaṇḍaḥ kaṭīdaṇḍo bāhukūrparakoṣṭhakam || 19.10
jaṃghorujānu <jaṅghorujānu> cānyāni upāṅgāni munīśvarāḥ |
mahāṃgabhaṅge <mahāṅgabhaṅge> jāte 'pi bimbasya munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.11
sati sandhānayogyatve <saṃdhānayogyatve> na kadācit parityajet |
tasya tyāgo vināśaś ca hy uparyupari bādhakṛt || 19.12
bimbādīnāṃ tu bṛhatāṃ parityāgo na yujyate |
vaktrabhaṅge tu bimbasya sarvadhā tyāgam ācaret || 19.13
parityaktāni bimbāni dhātudravyodbhavaṃ vinā |
jalāśaye hy agādhe vā samudre vidhinā kṣipet || 19.14
bhūmau vā nikhaned viprā deśakālānusārataḥ |
utkṛṣṭānāṃ hematāratāmrajānāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 19.15
nocitaḥ syāt parityāgas tasmāt sandhānam <saṃdhānam> ācaret |
prayantenāpyayogyatve parityāgaṃ samācaret || 19.16
parityaktaṃ tu vā dravyaṃ dravīkṛtya yathā vidhi |
taddravyeṇa yathāpūrvaṃ biṃbaṃ <bimbaṃ> karma samāpayet || 19.17
athavā hīnatāmrotthamārakūṭamayaṃ tu yat |
sandhānakaraṇāyogyaṃ <saṃdhānakaraṇāyogyaṃ> taddvayaṃ tu parityajet || 19.18
parityaktaṃ tu tadbimbaṃ kṣipet pūrvoktavartmanā |
tato biṃbāntaraṃ <bimbāntaraṃ> kuryād rājataṃ vā suvarṇajam || 19.19
utkṛṣṭatattajjātīyadravyajaṃ vā munīśvarāḥ |
karmabiṃbeṣu <karmabimbeṣu> sarveṣu hy evam eva samācaret || 19.20
bhagnāṃgasya <bhagnāṅgasya> tu sandhānaprakāraṃ <saṃdhānaprakāraṃ> 
śṛṇuta dvijāḥ |
lohāśmadārubimbānāṃ bhagnāṃgaṃ <bhagnāṅgaṃ> lohapaṭṭakaiḥ || 19.21
bandhayed atha vā lohabiṃbāṃgaṃ <lohabimbāṅgaṃ> bhagnam eva tu |
svarṇādinā drāvitena yojyaṃ yatnād dvijottamāḥ || 19.22
citramṛṇmayabiṃbānāṃ <citramṛṇmayabimbānāṃ> bhagnāṃgaṃ 
<bhagnāṅgaṃ> munisattamāḥ |
tattatsajātidravyeṇa sandheyaṃ <saṃdheyaṃ> yatnagauravāt || 19.23
sarveṣāṃ bhagnam aṅgaṃ tu naṣṭaṃ cet tat tathā punaḥ |
tattatsajātidravyeṇa kṛtvā yojyaṃ prayatnataḥ || 19.24
mahāṅge ratnabiṃbasya <ratnabimbasya> bhagne 'pi munisattamāḥ |
sandheyam <saṃdheyam> eva na tyājyaṃ svayaṃvyaktāśmabiṃbavat 
<svayaṃvyaktāśmabimbavat> || 19.25
sarvatrāṅgasamādhāne punaḥ sṛṣṭau tu vā dvijāḥ |
jīrṇabimbagatāṃ śaktiṃ kumbhe tv āvāhya deśikaḥ || 19.26
kurvann abhyarcanaṃ tatra bimbasandhānam <bimbasaṃdhānam> ācaret |
māsādarvāksamādhāne kumbhe śaktiṃ samarcayet || 19.27
tadūrdhvaṃ dvādaśābhāntaṃ samādhānavilambane |
kṛtvā bālagṛhaṃ tatra bālabiṃbaṃ <bālabimbaṃ> yathāvidhi || 19.28
saṃsthāpya tatra tacchaktiṃ samāvāhya samarcayet |
aṅgamātrasamādhāne kuryāt saṃprokṣaṇaṃ dvijāḥ || 19.29
biṃbāntarasya <bimbāntarasya> karaṇe pratiṣṭhāṃ punarācaret |
mūlabiṃbāṃgasandhāne <mūlabimbāṅgasaṃdhāne> kuryād bālagṛhādikam || 
19.30
karmabiṃbāṃgabhaṅge <karmabimbāṅgabhaṅge> tu tattadbimbagataṃ vibhum |
mūlabimbe samudvāsya sandhānādi <saṃdhānādi> samācaret || 19.31
bālālaye tu prathame jīrṇoddhārābhidhe 'ntime |
prāyaścittaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.32
atīte prārthite kāle kartrā prāsādaberayoḥ |
nirmāṇe snapanaṃ kuryād uttamaṃ śāstracoditam || 19.33
paścād abhyarthayet kālaṃ vāñchitaṃ tatsamāpane |
akṛtvaivaṃ gate paścātkāle dvādaśavārṣike || 19.34
punaḥ pratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta mūle bālālaye tu vā |
bimbe corādibhir naṣṭe bālagehe pramādataḥ || 19.35
tad evāpādya tām arcāṃ pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi |
uttamasnapanaṃ kṛtvā śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.36
corair apahṛtaṃ bimbaṃ punaḥprāptaṃ yadi dvijāḥ |
punaḥ pratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta nayanonmīlanaṃ vinā || 19.37
svasthānāc calite tasmin hetunā yena kena cit |
yathāpūrvaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sthāpayet puruṣottamam || 19.38
sarvaṃ bālagṛhe kāryaṃ nityanaimittikādikam |
pūrvaṃ saṃsthāpitaṃ bimbaṃ lakṣaṇair ujjhitaṃ yadi || 19.39
jīrṇoddhārasya kāle tu kuryāl lakṣaṇasaṃyutam |
jīrṇākhyasya vidheḥ pūrvaṃ na kadācit samācaret || 19.40
rītije tāmraje vāpy ārakūṭamaye 'pi vā |
praṇīte pūjyamāne tu karmabimbādike sati || 19.41
kālāntareṇa jīrṇe 'smin utkṛṣṭasamupasthite |
nikṛṣṭaṃ santyajed <saṃtyajed> vidvān na doṣas tatra vidyate || 19.42
lohapāṣāṇamṛtkāṣṭaiḥ sthāpite mūlakautuke |
na sampādyam <saṃpādyam> ato'nyena kadācinmukhyavastunā || 19.43
purāvajjīrṇatāṃ yātaṃ kartavyaṃ mūlakautukam |
prāksthitaṃ bahuberaṃ vā ekaberam athāpi vā || 19.44
jīrṇoddhāre 'pi kartavyaṃ pūrvavanmunupaṅgavāḥ |
vyatyāsaṃ naiva kurvīta bahuberaikaberayoḥ || 19.45
lakṣmyādikāntarāhite bahuberapurasthite |
jīrṇoddhāre tu devībhyāṃ kalpayet sahasā vinā || 19.46
sarvadā bahuberatvahānir na syād viparyayāt |
śayanaṃ vāsanaṃ yānaṃ sthānaṃ vā prāgyathāsthitam || 19.47
tathaiva syāt punassṛṣṭāv anyathā vecchayābhavet |
jīrṇe deve punassṛṣṭe devyo yadi yathā sthitāḥ || 19.48
devībhis tābhir evāyaṃ yojyo devo na cānyathā |
evaṃ mānuṣabiṃbasya <mānuṣabimbasya> jīrṇoddhāraḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 19.49
svayaṃ vyakte tathā divye saiddhe cārṣādyamānuṣe |
jīrṇoddhāravidhiṃ vakṣye śṛṇudhvaṃ munisattamāḥ || 19.50
svayaṃvyaktādibimbānāṃ mahāṅge vāhyupāṅgake |
bhagne sandhānam <saṃdhānam> eva syāt tyāgas tu na kadācana || 19.51
sandhānāyogyam <saṃdhānāyogyam> api tan na tyājyaṃ munisattamāḥ |
sāligrāmaśalābiṃbaṃ <sāligrāmaśalābimbaṃ> bhinnaṃ bhagnaṃ bṛhat kṣatam 
|| 19.52
alpakṣataṃ ca sauvarṇaiḥ paṭṭair dṛḍhataraṃ yathā |
bandhayec ca tathaivaiṣu svayaṃvyaktādikeṣv api || 19.53
śilāmayeṣu bimbeṣu bhinnaṃ bhagnaṃ ca yojayet |
suvarṇanirmitaiḥ paṭṭair yathā dṛḍhataraṃ bhavet || 19.54
yadvā tadaṅgaṃ haimena kṛtvā samyaṅniyojayet |
dāruje lohajeṣv evaṃ svayaṃvyaktādikeṣv api || 19.55
bhede 'py aṅge samādhiḥ syāt svayaṃvyaktāśmabiṃbavat 
<svayaṃvyaktāśmabimbavat> |
ratnaje 'pi samādhānam evam eva samācaret || 19.56
mṛṇmaye mūlabiṃbe <mūlabimbe> tu jīrṇe vātha jalādibhiḥ |
hīnāṅge vā tathā kuryāt sandhānan <saṃdhānan> tu prayatnataḥ || 19.57
evaṃ varṇavihīne 'pi sandhānan <saṃdhānan> tu samācaret |
mṛttikāśūlarajvādīn na kadācit parityajet || 19.58
tathaiva citrabiṃbāṃgaṃ <citrabimbāṅgaṃ> galitaṃ gandhabhāvitaiḥ |
sitaraktādikai rāgaiḥ pāvanair asramantritaiḥ || 19.59
citrayet tu yathāpūrvaṃ śilpibhiḥ śāstrakovidaiḥ |
atrāyaṃ hi viśeṣaḥ syāt svayaṃvyaktādiṣu dvijāḥ || 19.60
na bālagehabimbādyaṃ kuryāt tatraiva pūrvavat |
pūjāyāṃ vartamānāyāṃ samādhānādikaṃ caret || 19.61
sandhānāṃ <saṃdhānāṃ> te tu vidhivat kuryāt saṃprokṣaṇādikam |
devādipūjite vāpi svayaṃvvyakte tu kautuke || 19.62
mṛddāruje tu sañjīrṇe <saṃjīrṇe> krimivahnijalādibhiḥ |
tattadbālagṛhaṃ kṛtvā pūjyamāne tu pūrvavat || 19.63
kramād arcāntaraṃ kṛtvā sthāpayec ca yathāvidhi |
bālabimbe tu jīrṇe 'tra kuryād evaṃ punaḥpunaḥ || 19.64
svayaṃvyaktādibimbāni yādṛśāni bhavanti hi |
lakṣaṇaiś ca pramāṇaiś ca yuktāni rahitāni vā || 19.65
utkṛṣṭalohajātāny apakṛṣṭotthitāni vā |
tādṛśāni bhavanty eva na kuryād anyathā punaḥ || 19.66
na lakṣaṇāntaraṃ kuryān na pramāṇāntaraṃ tathā |
na tu dravyāntaraṃ caiva na tu kuryāt kriyāntaram || 19.67
mantrāntaraṃ na kurvīta sarvaṃ kuryād yathāpuram |
kuryāc cel lakṣaṇādīnāṃ viparyāsaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 19.68
rājño rāṣṭrasya sarveṣāṃ pratyavāyo mahān bhavet |
tasmāt paurāṇikasthāne na viparyāsam ācaret || 19.69
lakṣaṇādiṣv api tathā na kuryād anyathā punaḥ |
yeṣu vyakteṣu cihnāni nābhivyaktāni vai dvijāḥ || 19.70
tāny api svāni cihnāni lalāṭe vāṃsapaṭṭake |
pṛṣṭhe vāpy aṅgapaṭṭe vā pāṇipādataleṣu vā || 19.71
mūrdhni vā dadhate tasmāt tatra tatra nirīkṣayet |
tasmād alakṣaṇā vyaktir vidyate na kadācana || 19.72
svayaṃvyaktādike caiva mānuṣe ca munīśvarāḥ |
śilāmayādibimbānāṃ nāsādyavayaveṣu ca || 19.73
ekadvittriyavā mātraṃ nyūnatā sambhaved <saṃbhaved> yadi |
pūrvavat kārayet tattattīkṣṇaśastreṇa yatnataḥ || 19.74
tataḥ saṃprokṣaṇaṃ kuryād devasya munipuṅgavāḥ |
evaṃ pīṭhādibhaṅge 'pi sandhānaṃ <saṃdhānaṃ> samyagācaret || 19.75
pratimā caiva tatpīṭhaṃ prāsāde garbhamandiram |
vigrahaṃ devadevasya catuṣṭayam idaṃ samam || 19.76
samādhiś ca tathā śāntiḥ kāryā tatra sadā samā |
prabhābhaṅgo yadi bhaved bandhayel lohapaṭṭakaiḥ || 19.77
pīṭhabhaṅge tu taṃ pīṭhaṃ sarvadā santyajed <saṃtyajed> budhaḥ |
kiñcinyūnaṃ tu taṃ pīṭhaṃ bandhayel lohapaṭṭakaiḥ|| 19.78
prāktanārcāṅgabhaṅgādidoṣair yā cātidūṣitā |
nirdoṣād āsanāt tasmāt tām utthāpya visṛjya ca || 19.79
pūrvavannirmitāṃ pīṭhe sthāpayet tu yathāvidhi |
pīṭhabhaṅge tathānyasmin kalpite yojayed dṛḍham || 19.80
pratimāpīṭhayor aṣṭabandhaviśleṣaṇe 'pi ca |
aṣṭabandhaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā samprokṣaṇam <saṃprokṣaṇam> athācaret || 19.81
svayaṃvyaktādike vāpi mānuṣe vā munīśvarāḥ |
bimbe corādyapahṛte tattadravyeṇa pūrvavat || 19.82
nirmāya lakṣaṇopetaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya tadaiva tu |
pūrvavat pūjayen mantrī bimbaṃ sarvatra sarvadā || 19.83
dravyāntareṇa vā kuryād deśiko yāgasiddhaye |
corair apahṛtaṃ bimbaṃ punaḥ prāptaṃ yadi dvijāḥ || 19.84
kṛtvā samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> pūjyaṃ mānuṣe tu dvijottamāḥ |
punaḥ pratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta nayanonmīlanaṃ vinā || 19.85
mūlabimbe 'gninā dagdhe mānuṣe vāpy amānuṣe |
sahasrakalaśasnānam ācartavyaṃ vidhānataḥ || 19.86
vahninā karmabimbādau vaivarṇyaṃ samupāgate |
tattadbimbeṣu kurvīta snapanaṃ cottamaṃ kramāt || 19.87
vahnidāhādinā mūlabimbe vā karmakautuke |
bhinnāṅge sati sandheyaṃ <saṃdheyaṃ> prāgvattacchilpisattamaiḥ || 19.88
sandhānāntaṃ <saṃdhānāntaṃ> tu sarvatra kuryāt samprokṣaṇaṃ 
<saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> vibhoḥ |
prāsādādes tato viprā jīrṇoddhāraś ca vakṣyate || 19.89
tatra pūrvaṃ mānuṣasya vidhānaṃ śṛṇuta dvijāḥ |
bhagne vimānaikadeśe śikhākumbhādike 'pi vā || 19.90
vimānasaṃsthitān devān mūlaverasya pīṭhake |
samāvāhyārcayan bhagnaṃ prāsādāvayavaṃ dṛḍham || 19.91
sandhāya <saṃdhāya> paścāddevasya saprāsādasya sattamāḥ |
samprokṣaṇādikaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇādikaṃ> kuryāc chāstradṛṣṭena vartmanā || 19.92
vimāne sarvato bhagne bālasthānaṃ prakalpya ca |
prāsādāntargatā yās tu devatāstā munīśvarāḥ || 19.93
bālabimbasya pīṭhasthāḥ kṛtvā pūjyās tu pūrvavat |
tathaiva bālabimbe tu nityanaimittikādikam || 19.94
pavitrārohaṇāṃtaṃ <pavitrārohaṇāntaṃ> ca sarvaṃ karma samācaret |
prāsādaṃ tu punaḥ kṛtvā pratiṣṭhāpya yathā vidhi || 19.95
samprokṣaṇādikaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇādikaṃ> kuryād devasya munipuṅgavāḥ |
evaṃ hi maṇṭape sāle gopure mālikādike || 19.96
jīrṇe tatrasthitāḥ sarvā nītvānyatra tu devatāḥ |
yathāpūrvaṃ navaṃ kṛtvā pratiṣṭhāpya vidhānataḥ || 19.97
uttamasnapanaṃ kuryāt tasya doṣasya śāntaye |
prāsādādi purākḷptaṃ lakṣaṇair ujjhitaṃ yadi || 19.98
jīrṇoddhāraprakaraṇe kuryāt tallakṣaṇānvitam |
prāsādādau purākḷpte mṛṇmaye caiṣṭake 'pivā || 19.99
jīrṇe punaḥ samuddhāre śilābhir vā prakalpayet |
svayaṃvyaktādike dhāmni jīrṇoddhāras tu vakṣyate || 19.100
prāsādāder ekadeśabhaṅgaś cet tatra saṃsthitāḥ |
devās tv anyatra nodvāhyāḥ pūjayann eva tatra tāḥ || 19.101
bhagnaikadeśaṃ sandhāya <saṃdhāya> kuryāt samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> 
dvijāḥ |
prāsāde sarvato bhagne prāsādasthās tu devatāḥ || 19.102
mūlabimbasya pīṭhe tu samāvāhya samarcayan |
prāktanair eveṣṭakādyais tatsajātīyavastubhiḥ || 19.103
nūtanaiś cāpi gilitaiḥ prāsādaṃ kalpayet punaḥ |
pūrvaṃ vimānaṃ yaddravyaṃ yādṛglakṣaṇasaṃyutam || 19.104
tādṛg eva punaḥ kuryān na kuryād anyathā punaḥ |
punaḥ kṛtaṃ vimānādyaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi || 19.105
saṃprokṣaṇādikaṃ kuryād devasya munipuṅgavāḥ |
svayaṃvyaktādike vāpi devasiddhādikalpite || 19.106
bimbe vimāne prākāre gopure dvāri maṇṭape |
pīṭhe vā pacanāvāse kośāgārādike 'pi vā || 19.107
lakṣaṇair anvite vāpi lakṣaṇair ujjhite 'pi vā |
jīrṇe punas tathā kuryāt pūrvarūpānusārataḥ || 19.108
anyathā karaṇe viprāḥ pratyavāyo mahān bhavet |
svayaṃvyaktādike dhāmni tathā devādikalpite || 19.109
cirakālavaśāt kiṃ cic chaithilyaṃ samupāgate |
nirvāhakāṇāṃ bhaktānāṃ śāstrajñānām anujñayā || 19.110
bāhye vābhyantare dhāmno rakṣaṇārthaṃ śilādibhiḥ |
nipuṇaiḥ śilpibhiḥ kāryo bhittibandhaḥ samantataḥ || 19.111
vimāne vahnidagdhe tu mānuṣe vāpyamānuṣe |
taddoṣaśāntaye kuryād adham asnapanaṃ vibhoḥ || 19.112
vahnidāhādinābhagne prāsāde pūrvavat tu tat |
sandhāya <saṃdhāya> śilpanipuṇaiḥ kuryāt saṃprokṣaṇādikam || 19.113
kṣmābhedajalavegādyaiḥ patitaṃ bhagavadgṛham |
prāgbimbasahitaṃ tasmād deśād anyatra kalpayet || 19.114
naṣṭe sabimbe sadane divyādau prāgvad ācaret |
coranadyādivegādyair atinaṣṭe tu mānuṣe || 19.115
bimbe paścāt prakurvīta pūrvavad vānyathā tu vā |
na śūnyamūlabimbatvād vālārcāvāhanādikam || 19.116
na kuryād deśikendras tu pūrvavat sthāpya pūjayet |
evaṃ hi sarvadevānāṃ paravyūhādirūpiṇām || 19.117
viṣvaksenagaṇeśādi parivāragaṇasya ca |
kḷptānāṃ gopurādyeṣu vibhavavyūharūpiṇām || 19.118
sānnidhyātiśayāt teṣu pūjitānāṃ dinaṃ prati |
jīrṇoddhāravidhiḥ proktaḥ sarveṣāṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.119
tattatsānnidhyānuguṇaṃ pratiṣṭhādikam ācaret |
prāyaścittaṃ samyabhyūhya sādhakas tu samācaret || 19.120
bimbādīnāṃ ca dhāmāder aṅgabhaṅgādike sati |
ācāryās tv anutāpārtaḥ svamantram ayutaṃ japet || 19.121
tadārabhya brahmacaryavratasthaḥ sādhakaiḥ saha |
yāvadbimbasamāpatti japen mantram atandritaḥ || 19.122
catussthānārcanaṃ kuryāt sarvadoṣapraśāntaye |
trirātraṃ vā saptarātraṃ pātrebhyo dānam ācaret || 19.123
gobhūhemādikānāṃ tu yathāśakti munīśvarāḥ |
brāhmaṇān bhojayen nityaṃ śataṃ vāpi sahasrakam || 19.124
yāvadbimbasya sandhānaṃ <saṃdhānaṃ> viśeṣeṇārcayed vibhum |
sandhānānte <saṃdhānānte> tu devasya kṛtvā saṃprokṣaṇādikam || 19.125
śāntihomaṃ tathā dānaṃ brāhmaṇānāṃ ca bhojanam |
kārayed yajamānas tv ācāryaṃ dakṣiṇādibhiḥ || 19.126
toṣayec chaktyanuguṇaṃ tena tuṣyati keśavaḥ |
apūrvakalpanāj jīrṇasamuddhāre 'dhikaṃ phalam || 19.127
labhate yajamānas tu nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
ity evaṃ muniśārḍhūlā jīrṇoddhāro mayoditaḥ || 19.128
tatas tu bimbasyāspṛśyasparśādo munipuṅgavāḥ |
prāyaścittaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvam avadhānataḥ || 19.129
asnāto deśikaś caivaṃ caṇḍālādyupaghātitaḥ |
keśāsthyādyaśucispṛṣṭastriyaṃ gatvā hy anāplutaḥ || 19.130
spṛśec ced bhagavadbiṃbaṃ <bhagavadbimbaṃ> snāpayen navabhir ghaṭaiḥ |
ācarec chāntihomaṃ ca śatavāraṃ japen manum || 19.131
eteṣāṃ garbhagehāntaḥ praveśaś cet tadā vibhum |
saṃsnāpya pañcabhir gavyaiḥ śāntihomādikaṃ caret || 19.132
adīkṣitair anyatantradīkṣitair arcaketaraiḥ |
spṛṣṭe bimbe tadā kuryāt snapanaṃ tv adhamādhagam || 19.133
śāntihomaṃ japaṃ cāpi taddoṣasya praśāntaye |
eteṣāṃ garbhagehāntaḥ praveśe navabhir ghaṭaiḥ || 19.134
saṃsnāpya devadeveśaṃ śāntihomādikaṃ caret |
strībhir vānupanītair vā tathā vaikhānasair dvijaiḥ || 19.135
avaiṣṇavair vā saṃspṛṣṭe bimbe tv adhamamadhyamam |
snapanaṃ vidhivat kṛtvā śāntihomādikaṃ caret || 19.136
etaiḥ praviṣṭe gehāntaradhamādhamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya vidhivaddevaṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.137
patitaḥ pātakī vāpi kuṣṭhyapasmārarogavān |
kāṇo bāndhaś ca mūko vā badhiro vāṅgahīnakaḥ || 19.138
parastrīgamanāsaktaḥ kuṇḍo vā golako 'pi vā |
rajasvalāntyajādyaiś ca saṃspṛṣṭo gardabhādibhiḥ || 19.139
spṛśec ced bhagavadbimbamadhamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsrāpya devaṃ vidhivacchāntihomaṃ tathācaret || 19.140
etaiḥ praviṣṭe dhāmāntaḥ kuryād adhamamadhyamam |
snapanaṃ devadevasya śāntihomaṃ tathācaret || 19.141
kṣatrair viśyais tathā śūdrais tattatstrībhis tu vā dvijāḥ |
bimbe spṛṣṭe kramāt kuryāt snapanaṃ tv adhamottamam || 19.142
madhyamādhamasaṃjñaṃ ca tathā madhyamamadhyamam |
etair garbhagṛhābhyantaḥ praveśe munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.143
adhamādhamasaṃjñaṃ ca tathā hy adhamamadhyamam |
adhamottamasaṃjñaṃ ca kramāt snapanam ācaret || 19.144
sarvatra śāntihomaṃ ca sahasraṃ japam ācaret |
anulomajasaṃsparśe bimbasya snapanam bhavet || 19.145
madhyamottamasaṃjñaṃ tu praviṣṭe tair gṛhāntare |
vimāne vāpi saṃspṛṣṭe snapanaṃ madhyamādhamam || 19.146
pratilomajasaṃspṛṣṭe bimbe tūttamamadhyamam |
snapanaṃ tv ācaret teṣāṃ praveśe garbhamandire || 19.147
prāsāde vāpi taiḥ spṛṣṭe snapanaṃ tūttamādhamam |
kuryāt sarvatra homaṃ ca japaṃ prāgvanmunīśvarāḥ || 19.148
corabhūto brāhmaṇo vā kṣatriyo vaiśya eva vā |
śūdro 'nulomajo vāpi pratilomaja eva vā || 19.149
spṛśec ced devabimbaṃ tu krameṇa snapanam bhavet |
madhyamādhamasaṃjñaṃ ca tathā madhyamamadhyamam || 19.150
madhyamottamasaṃjñaṃ ca hy uttamādhamasaṃjñakam |
tanmadhyamaṃ ca snapanaṃ tathāsyād uttamottamam || 19.151
etais tu garbhagehāntaḥ praveśe hy adhamottamam |
madhyamādhamapūrvaṃ ca tritayaṃ cottamādhamam || 19.152
tanmadhyamaṃ ca snapanaṃ hy ācaret kramaśo dvijāḥ |
ajñātajātibhiś corair bimbasaṃsparśane kṛte || 19.153
sahasrakalaśair devaṃ snāpayed vidhipūrvakam |
tais tu garbhagṛhābhyantaḥpraveśe tūttamottamam || 19.154
snapanaṃ syāt tu sarvatra śāntihomo japas tathā |
āśaucavadbhir manujair mahāpātakibhir naraiḥ || 19.155
caṇḍālaiḥ sūtikodakyāmlecchair vā pulkasādibhiḥ |
saṃspṛṣṭe bhagavadbimbe goghṛtenābhiṣicya tam || 19.156
saṃprokṣaṇaṃ ca vidhivat kṛtvā śāntiṃ samācaret |
godānādīṃs tathā kuryād brāhmaṇāṃś cāpi bhojayet || 19.157
citramṛṇmayabimbaṃ tu navīkṛtya yathāvidhi |
punaḥ pratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta svayaṃvyaktādikeṣu ca || 19.158
citrabimbādikaṃ cāpi na navīkṛtya pūrvavat |
saṃprokṣaṇādikaṃ kuryāt tat tu tenaiva śudhyati || 19.159
etair āśaucavatpūrvaiḥ praveśe garbhamandire |
vimānasparśane cāpi hy ālayasthāni sarvataḥ || 19.160
mṛtpātrāṇi parityajya lohapātrāṇi śodhayet |
ālayaṃ cāpi saṃśodhya mārjanollepanādibhiḥ || 19.161
pañcagavyena saṃprokṣya sarvatra munipuṅgavāḥ |
uttamottamamārgeṇa snāpayed vidhivatprabhum || 19.162
tair agramaṇṭapābhyantaḥ prathamāvaraṇe 'pi vā |
praveśe dhāmasaṃśuddhiṃ prāgvat kṛtvā munīśvarāḥ || 19.163
athamottamamārgeṇa snāpayet puruṣottamam |
dvitīyāvṛtim ārabhya rathyāvaraṇapaścimam || 19.164
tair antassaṃpraviṣṭe tu kṛtvālayaviśodhanam |
adhamādhamamārgeṇa devaṃ saṃsnāpayed dvijāḥ || 19.165
sarvatra śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam |
caṇḍālaiś śvapacair vāpi pramādād viṣṇumandire || 19.166
nirantaraṃ kṛte vāse māsam ekaṃ munīśvarāḥ |
mṛtpātrāṇi parityajya sammārjya <saṃmārjya> bhagavadgṛham || 19.167
gomayenopalipyātha paryagnikaraṇaṃ caret |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvātha prokṣayet pañcagavyakaiḥ || 19.168
gogaṇaṃ vāsayet tatra sarvadoṣapraśāntaye |
vācayitvā mahāśāntiṃ brāhmaṇair vedapāragaiḥ || 19.169
bhojayitvā dvijāṃs tatra tebhyogadyāt tu dakṣiṇām |
evaṃ māsaṃ tu māsārddhaṃ saptapañcatryahan tu vā || 19.170
kṛtvā śuddhiṃ mandirasya bimbānāṃ goghṛtaiḥ purā |
kṛtvābhiṣecanaṃ prāgvatsaṃprokṣaṇam athācaret || 19.171
mānuṣaṃ mṛṇmayaṃ bimbaṃ tathā citramayaṃ dvijāḥ |
navīkṛtya yathāpūrvaṃ pratiṣṭhāṃ punarārabhet || 19.172
caṇḍālaśvapacādyās tu pramādād bhagavadgṛhe |
karmaṇy adhikṛtāś cet taiḥ sahavāse 'pi ca dvijāḥ || 19.173
snātvā sarve kuśāmbhaś ca pītvā cāndrāyaṇādikam |
kṛtvā cālayasaṃśuddhiṃ dvijabhojanapaścimam || 19.174
saṃprokṣaṇādikaṃ sarvaṃ prāgvad eva samācaret |
ante mahotsavaṃ kuryāt sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.175
tathaiva pratilomādyāḥ karmaṇy adhikṛtā yadi |
prāgvadālayaśudhyantaṃ sarvaṃ kṛtvā yathāvidhi || 19.176
sahasrakalaśaiḥ snānam utsavaṃ ca samācaret |
brahmakṣatriyaviṭchūdraśavaiś caivānulomajaiḥ || 19.177
śavaiḥ spṛṣṭaṃ kautuke tu goghṛtenābhiṣicya tam |
saṃprokṣaṇaṃ prakurvīta sahasrakalaśāplavam || 19.178
śāntihomaṃ ca kurvīta japaṃ cāyutasaṃkhyayā |
mānuṣaṃ citrabimbādyaṃ navīkṛtya yathāvidhi || 19.179
punaḥpratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta sahasrakalaśāplavam |
taiś śavair garbhagehāntarvimāne vāpi dūṣite || 19.180
kuryāt saṃprokṣaṇaṃ cāpi snapanaṃ cottamottamam |
pratilomajacaṇḍālasūtikāśavadūṣite || 19.181
bimbe pratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta nayanonmīlanaṃ vinā |
sahasrakalaśaiś cāpi snāpayet puruṣottamam || 19.182
prāsāde dūṣite tais tu śavaiḥ saṃprokṣaṇaṃ caret |
sahasrakalaśaiś cāpi snāpayed vidhipūrvakam || 19.183
prathamāvṛtim ārabhya rathyāvaraṇapaścime |
brāhmaṇādiśavair vāpi pratilomaśavādikaiḥ || 19.184
dūṣite prāṅkaṇakṣetre caturhastamitāṃ kṣitim |
khātvā mṛdaṃ samuddhṛtya bahiḥ prakṣipya śuddhayā || 19.185
sampūrya <saṃpūrya> ca samīkṛtya kārayen mārjanādikam |
śilātalaṃ cet tāṃ bhūmiṃ dāhayet khananaṃ vinā || 19.186
gomayenopalipyātha puṇyāhoddhoṣaṇādikam |
pañcagavyena cābhyukṣya gogaṇaṃ tatra vāsayet || 19.187
vācayitvā mahāśāntiṃ bhojayet tatra vai dvijān |
kṛtvaivaṃ sthūlasaṃśuddhiṃ śāntiṃ kuryād ataḥparam || 19.188
mukhyottamāt tu snapanād nīcāntimam anukramāt |
snāpayitvā viśeṣeṇa śāntihomādikaṃ caret || 19.189
ālaye janane vāpi pramādān munipuṅgavāḥ |
prāyaścittaṃ bhaved eva tattadāvaraṇakramāt || 19.190
sālamaṇṭapapīṭheṣu gopure mandireṣu vā |
vimānād bāhyato vāpi parivārālayādiṣu || 19.191
varṇānāṃ brāhmaṇādīnām anulomādikasya ca |
maraṇe janane vāpi tattadāvaraṇoktavat || 19.192
prāyaścittaṃ prakurvīta bimbasparśādike 'pi ca |
tattatsānnidhyānuguṇaṃ prāyaścittaṃ samācaret || 19.193
evaṃ mahānase vāpi yāgamaṇṭapa eva vā |
caṇḍālādipraveśe vā śavādyair vāpi dūṣite || 19.194
mṛtpātrāṇi parityajya khananādyair mahītalam |
saṃśodhya kuṇḍacullīstham agniṃ tyaktvā yathā vidhi || 19.195
punaragniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya śāntihomādikaṃ caret |
svayaṃvyaktādyālayānām aṅgatvena prakalpite || 19.196
grāmādau brahmavarṇasya maraṇaṃ sambhaved <saṃbhaved> yadi |
grāmamadhye gato yāvacchavas tiṣṭhati vai dvijāḥ || 19.197
grāmasya tāvadāśaucaṃ tadā devasya pūjanam |
na kuryāt tacchave grāmād bahirnīte munīśvarāḥ || 19.198
saṃprokṣya sarvato grāmaṃ puṇyāhodghoṣapūrvakam |
tatas tu devadevasya prakuryāt pūjanādikam || 19.199
ārabdhe pūjane viprā grāmaś cec chavadūṣitaḥ |
ārabdhapūjanaṃ śīghraṃ kuryāt tantreṇa deśikaḥ || 19.200
prāgvadgrāmaprokṣaṇānte punaḥpūjanam ācaret |
grāme śūdrādimaraṇaṃ sambhaved <saṃbhaved> yadi vai tadā || 19.201
āśaucaṃ gṛhamātrasya grāmāśaucaṃ na vidyate |
tatrāpi bhagavadgehasamīpe dvijasattamāḥ || 19.202
ekādaśadhanurbhyo 'ntaḥ śūdrādiśavadūṣite |
niṣkāsya tacchavaṃ paścāt kuryād devasya pūjanam || 19.203
puragrāmādyaṅgatayā kḷpte 'pi bhagavadgṛhe |
antaśśavaṃ ced grāmādyaṃ na kuryād devapūjanam || 19.204
catuśśatabrāhmaṇais tu yukte grāmapurādike |
antaśśave 'pi naivāsti grāmāśaucaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 19.205
tatrāpi bhagavadgehasamīpe caikavīdhiṣu |
śavas tiṣṭhati ced devaṃ nārcayet prokṣaṇāt purā || 19.206
utsavāṅgatayā kḷptagrāmādau rāṣṭrasaṃkulāt |
caṇḍālapatitodakyāsūtikāśabarādibhiḥ || 19.207
adhiṣṭhite ca śvānādyair madhyamāṃsādibhis tathā |
śavāsthibhiś ca saṃduṣṭe sarvatraikatra vā kṣitim || 19.208
khātvā mṛdaṃ samuddhṛtya bahiḥ prakṣipya śuddhayā |
samāpūrya samīkṛtya pañcagavyokṣaṇādibhiḥ || 19.209
śuddhiṃ kṛtvā grāmaśāntiṃ kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye |
retomūtrapurīṣādyai rudhirāpeyavāntibhiḥ || 19.210
niṣṭhīvanāsthimāṃsādyair bimbe spṛṣṭe munīśvarāḥ |
uttamottamamārgeṇa snāpayec chāntim ācaret || 19.211
etaiḥ prāsādasaṃsparśe madhyamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya devadeveśaṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.212
prathamāvaraṇe tais tu saṃspṛṣṭe munipuṅgavāḥ |
adhamottamamārgeṇa snāpayet puruṣottamam || 19.213
dvitīyāvaraṇādau tu śakṛnmūtrādidūṣite |
tatkṣaṇāt tadbahir nītvā mārjanollepanādibhiḥ || 19.214
śodhayitvā bhuvaṃ paścāt pañcagavyais tu secayet |
śāntihomaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.215
tathaiva bhagavadgehe prathamāvaraṇādiṣu |
rajasā dūṣite strīṇāṃ tadbhuvaṃ jānumātrakam || 19.216
khātvā tu mṛdbhir navyābhir āpūrya dharaṇītalam |
gomayāmbhobhir ālipya paryagnikaraṇaṃ tathā || 19.217
puṇyāhavācanaṃ pañcagavyair abhyukṣaṇaṃ tathā |
kṛtvā rajasvalābhis tu spṛṣṭaṃ dvārakavāṭakam || 19.218
saṅkṣālya <saṃkṣālya> vāriṇā bhūyas tāsāṃ mārgaṃ ca mārjanaiḥ |
gomayālepanaiś caiva śodhayitvālayasthitān || 19.219
mṛdbhāṇḍāṃś ca parityajya prāsādāntaḥsthitaṃ vibhum |
adhamottamamārgeṇa snāpayitvā tathaiva hi || 19.220
rajasvalāsannikṛṣṭaṃ <rajasvalāsaṃnikṛṣṭaṃ> bimbaṃ ca snāpya śāstrataḥ |
śāntihomaṃ japaṃ cāpi kuryād deśikasattamaḥ || 19.221
mārjālamūṣikāsarpamaṇḍūkasaraṭādibhiḥ |
gaulībhiś cāpi khadyotair bimbasaṃsparśane sati || 19.222
snāpayen navabhiḥ kumbhair devadevaṃ munīśvarāḥ |
pipīlikādyair bimbasya sparśe doṣo na vidyate || 19.223
bimbe gomukhasaṃspṛṣṭe tathā vai varṣabindubhiḥ |
adhamādhamamārgeṇa snāpya śāntiṃ samācaret || 19.224
śvānaiś ca gardabhair uṣṭrair varāhaiś ca śivāśaśaiḥ |
bimbe spṛṣṭe snāpayet tam uttamottamamārgataḥ || 19.225
sahasrasaṃkhyayā śāntihomaṃ ca japam ācaret |
etair garbhagṛhābhyantaḥpraveśe sparśane 'pi vā || 19.226
madhyamottamamārgeṇa snāpayet puruṣottamam |
prathamāvaraṇābhyantaḥpraveśe tv adhamottamam || 19.227
snapanaṃ kārayet teṣāṃ dvitīyāvaraṇādiṣu |
praveśaś ced devadevam adhamādhamamārgataḥ || 19.228
saṃsnāpya śāntihomaṃ ca sahasraṃ japam ācaret |
mārjālādiśavair bimbasparśane tv adhamottamam || 19.229
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād deśikasattamaḥ |
tais tu garbhagṛhābhyantar dūṣite navabhir ghaṭaiḥ || 19.230
snāpayed devadevaṃ tu śāntihomaṃ tathā caret |
prathamāvaraṇādau tair dūṣite tadbahir nayet || 19.231
mārjanair gomayālepaiḥ pañcagavyaiś ca śodhayet |
gomahiṣyavyajādyais tu vānarādiśavais tathā || 19.232
bimbasparśe snāpayet tam uttamottamamārgataḥ |
etais tu garbhagehāntardūṣite madhyamottamam || 19.233
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād deśikasattamaḥ |
pūrvoktānāṃ gavādīnāṃ prathamāvaraṇādiṣu || 19.234
janane maraṇe caiva tadbhuvaṃ khananādibhiḥ |
saṃśodhya snāpayed devam adhamottamamārgataḥ || 19.235
śvagardabhavarāhādiśavaiḥ spṛṣṭe tu kautuke |
saṃprokṣaṇaṃ tathā śāntihomādīṃś ca samācaret || 19.236
etaiḥ prāsādasaṃsparśe uttamottamamārgataḥ |
snāpayed devadevaṃ tu prathamāvaraṇādiṣu || 19.237
tair dūṣite devadevaṃ madhyamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya śāntihomādīn kuryād deśikasattamaḥ || 19.238
tathā mahānase yāgagehe śvādipraveśane |
tacchavair dūṣite vāpi mṛtpātrāṇi parityajet || 19.239
lohapātrāṇi saṃśodhya kṛtvā sammārjanādikam <saṃmārjanādikam> |
pañcagavyaiś ca saṃprokṣya śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.240
tais tu kuṇḍādisaṃsparśe cullīsparśe tathā dvijāḥ |
tyaktvā tam agnim anyan tu sthāpayed vidhivad dvijāḥ || 19.241
kākair gṛdhrais tathā ghūkaiḥ kukkuṭaiś ca kapotakaiḥ |
śyenādibhiś ca godhābhir bimbasparśe munīśvarāḥ || 19.242
madhyamottamamārgeṇa snāpayec chāntim ācaret |
eteṣāṃ garbhagehāntaḥpraveśe munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.243
adhamottamamārgeṇa snāpya śāntiṃ samācaret |
prathamāvaraṇādyeṣu hy apraveśyasthale dvijāḥ || 19.244
eṣāṃ praveśe tatsthānaṃ prokṣayet pañcagavyakaiḥ |
śāntihomādikaṃ kuryāt sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.245
kākādīnāṃ śavaiḥ spṛṣṭe bimbe caivottamottamam |
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye || 19.246
tais tu prāsādasaṃsparśe madhyamottamamārgataḥ |
snāpayed devadevaṃ tu prathamāvaraṇādiṣu || 19.247
tair dūṣite sthale yat tu mārjanollepanādibhiḥ |
saṃśodhya pañcagavyaiś ca prokṣaṇaṃ śāntim ācaret || 19.248
mahānasādau tair duṣṭe prāgvat sarvaṃ samācaret |
śithilīsaraghātumbhīvalmīkādau tu vā dvijāḥ || 19.249
bimbopari samutsanne tatsamuddhṛtya tatkṣaṇāt |
bimbābhiṣecanaṃ kṛtvā pañcagavyair yathāvidhi || 19.250
kṛtvā samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> paścācchāntihomaṃ samācaret |
gobhūtilādikaṃ dadyāt taddoṣasya praśāntaye || 19.251
sahasraṃ brāhmaṇāṃś caiva bhojayen munipuṅgavāḥ |
prāsāde garbhagehe vā śithilyādisamudbhave || 19.252
uttamottamamārgeṇa snāpayet puruṣottamam |
śāntihomādikaṃ sarpaṃ prāgvad eva samācaret || 19.253
prākāre maṇṭape vāpi gopure vāhanādike |
śithilīsaraghādīnāṃ valmīkādes samudbhave || 19.254
chatrākāṇāṃ samutpattau brahmadaṇḍasamutthitau |
tatkṣaṇāt tatsamuddhṛtya prokṣayet pañcagavyakaiḥ || 19.255
adhamottamamārgeṇa saṃsnāpya puruṣottamam |
śāntihomādikaṃ sarvaṃ prāgvad eva samācaret || 19.256
bhagavanmandire viptāḥ kṛtaṃ cet pūjaketaraiḥ |
āsaneṣv āsanaṃ caiva śayanaṃ bhojanādikam || 19.257
tat sthānaṃ pañcagavyena prokṣya śāntiṃ samācaret |
bimboparyaśaneḥ pāte bhagnam aṅgaṃ yathāvidhi || 19.258
sandhāya <saṃdhāya> prokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā sahasrakalaśais tathā |
saṃsnāpya devaṃ śāntyarthaṃ hutvā brāhmaṇabhojanam || 19.259
sahasrasaṃkhyayā kṛtvā kuryād ante mahotsavam |
prāsāde tv aśaneḥ pāte bhagnaṃ sandhāya <saṃdhāya> pūrvavat || 19.260
saṃprokṣaṇādikaṃ kṛtvottamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya devaṃ tadanu śāntihomādikaṃ caret || 19.261
prathamāvaraṇādyeṣu gopure maṇṭape tu vā |
bhaved aśanipātaś ced adhamottamamārgataḥ || 19.262
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca brāhmaṇānāṃ ca bhojanam |
athotpātasya śāntiṃ tu vakṣyāmi śṛṇuta dvijāḥ || 19.263
ulkāśanyādipāte ca nakṣatre patite ca khāt |
sadhūme ca diśāṃ dāhe bhūtādyāveśite nṛpe || 19.264
durbhikṣe vyādhite rāṣṭre tathā vai śatrusaṅkaṭe <śatrusaṃkaṭe> |
sūryodayasya vyatyāse bhūkampe tadvidāraṇe || 19.265
ativṛṣṭāvanāvṛṣṭau divyadundubhinisvane |
rātrāvindradhanurdarśe jale 'gnijanane tathā || 19.266
candrodaye 'ndhakāre ca vināgniṃ dhūmadarśane |
pratisūryapradarśe ca divā nakṣatradarśane || 19.267
darśane vālamīnasya rātrau sūryapradarśane |
svapne tu candrapatane bhūmau jvalanadarśane || 19.268
bhūtādidarśane caiva vyomni nemisvane tathā |
ākāśe grahayuddhe ca nimittaṃ tu vinā dvijāḥ || 19.269
ārdravṛkṣasya patane tathaiva patite girau |
vṛkṣe tv anyaphale dṛṣṭe śilāyām aṅkure tathā || 19.270
śilāvarṣe taṭākādau raktaśaivāladarśane |
dviśīrṣajaṃtuprasave <dviśīrṣajantuprasave> drume śoṇitasambhave 
<śoṇitasaṃbhave> || 19.271
vibhinnajaṃtuprasave <vibhinnajantuprasave> manuṣyapaśupakṣiṣu |
evam anyeṣv adbhuteṣu mahotpāteṣu satsv api || 19.272
taddoṣaśāntiṃ viprendrāḥ kārayed acirān nṛpaḥ |
sthāpanoktavidhānena kalpite maṇṭape śubhe || 19.273
cakrāmburuhapūrveṣu yathāvatkalpiteṣu ca |
kuṇḍeṣu daśasaṃkhyeṣu brahmavṛkṣādisambhavaiḥ <brahmavṛkṣādisaṃbhavaiḥ> 
|| 19.274
sabhidgaṇais tilair ājyaiḥ secitaiḥ prāgudīritaiḥ |
pañcabhir madhurādyaiś ca miśrībhūtaiḥ krameṇa tu || 19.275
mahattarāṇāṃ doṣāṇāṃ śāntaye mantravittamaiḥ |
ayutaṃ niyutaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ koṭiniṣṭhaṃ yathābalam || 19.276
hotavyaṃ pūrṇayā sārdhaṃ daśabhir mantravittamaiḥ |
kuṇḍeṣu madhyapūrveṣu mantrāṇāṃ niyatiḥ kramāt || 19.277
cakrābje dvādaśārṇena vasvaśre 'ṣṭākṣareṇa tu |
ṣaḍarṇena ṣaḍaśre tu śaṅkhābhe <śaṃkhābhe> praṇavena tu || 19.278
jitantayā caturaśre viśvatrātrā trikoṇake |
dvātriṃśaddalapadmākhye nṛsiṃhānuṣṭubhena tu || 19.279
sudarśananṛsiṃhena cakrakuṇḍākṣarārake |
vārāheṇārdhacandrākhye vṛtte saudarśanena tu || 19.280
dhiṣṇyadvayaṃ madhyavedyāṃ prāguktaṃ dakṣiṇottare |
śeṣāṇi paritaḥ kuryād dikṣu caiva vidikṣu ca || 19.281
siddhamantrā niyoktavyā hotāraḥ śāntikarmaṇi |
sarvakuṇḍāni sarveṣāṃ mantrāṇām icchayā guroḥ || 19.282
kalpanīyāni vā mantrā yataḥ sarvaphalapradāḥ |
nyastamantrair yathānyāyaṃ japyas te saṃkhyayā tathā || 19.283
gobhūhematilānnānāṃ dānair yogyajanasya ca |
tṛptiḥ kāryā viśeṣeṇa divyādyāyatanasya ca || 19.284
prajāpālanaśīlena bhūpenātmahitecchunā |
śāntir evaṃvidhā kāryā śāstrāṅgair bahubhir dhanaiḥ || 19.285
mukhyakalpe vidhir ayam anukalpe dvijottamāḥ |
pūrvavadyāgagehe tu pañcakuṇḍeṣv anukramāt || 19.286
vyāpakaiḥ pañcabhir mantrair aṣṭākṣarapurassaraiḥ |
madhukṣīrādibhir dravyaiḥ paṃcabhir <pañcabhir> niyutākhyayā || 19.287
saṃkhyayā juhuyān mantrī lakṣasaṃkhyā yathā bhavet |
gobhūtilādikaṃ dadyāt prāgvad eva munīśvarāḥ || 19.288
sarvatrānte dhvajārohapūrvakaṃ tūtsavaṃ caret |
tathā bimbasya hasane calane rodane tathā || 19.289
patane bhramaṇe svedasambhave <svedasaṃbhave> raktasambhave <raktasaṃbhave> |
samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> tu kṛtvātha pūrvoktāṃ śāntim ācaret || 19.290
mahotsavāntaṃ devasya sarvadoṣapraśāntaye |
prāsādāntaḥsthite bimbe akasmād uṣṇasambhave || 19.291
payomadhughṛtaiś caiva nālikerajalais tathā |
pṛthakprasthasahasrais tu snāpayet sapta vāsarān || 19.292
tataḥ pūrvoditāṃ śāntim utsavāntaṃ samācaret |
raktavarṣe tu saṃjāte prāsādādīn munīśvarāḥ || 19.293
śuddhodakaiḥ kṣālayitvā gomayālepanaṃ tathā |
paryagnikaraṇaṃ paṃcagavyaiḥ <pañcagavyaiḥ> samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> 
tathā || 19.294
kṛtvā devasya vidhivatsamprokṣaṇam <vidhivatsaṃprokṣaṇam> athācaret |
saṃsnāpya madhusarpirbhyāṃ devaṃ prasthasahasrakaiḥ || 19.295
kuryāt pūrvoditāṃ śāntim utsavāntaṃ yathāvidhi |
madhuvarṣe kṣīravarṣe tattatprasthasahasrakaiḥ || 19.296
saṃsnāpya devaṃ saptāhaṃ prāgvacchāntiṃ samācaret |
akasmād dhāmapatane tadūrdhve patite drume || 19.297
sandhāya <saṃdhāya> pūrvavacchīghraṃ kṛtvā samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> 
vibhoḥ |
kuryāt pūrvoditāṃ śāntimante kuryān mahotsavam || 19.298
evaṃ mahotpātadoṣaśāntir viprāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
atha nitthārcanādīnāṃ prāyaścittaṃ tu vakṣyate || 19.299
asnāto 'nūrdhvapuṇḍraś cāpavitro 'nupavītakaḥ|
nagno vā hy ekavastro vā jīrṇavastradharas tu vā || 19.300
tathā paryuṣitaṃ vāso dadhāno nīlavastraghṛk |
dagdhavastradharo vāpi hy ārdravastradharas tu vā || 19.301
anācānto dhyānahīno muktakeśas tathā dvijāḥ |
svinnāṅgaś ca hasan kupyan śvasaṃś ca pralapan dvijāḥ || 19.302
niṣṭhīvādiyutaś cāpi devaṃ sampūjayed <saṃpūjayed> yadi |
taddoṣaśāntaye viprā aṣṭākṣaram anuttamam || 19.303
japet sahasravāraṃ tu śatavāraṃ tu vā dvijāḥ |
punaḥ sampūjanaṃ <saṃpūjanaṃ> kuryād devasya vidhipūrvakam || 19.304
keśāsthiloṣṭacīrāsṛgaspṛśyasparśadūṣitaḥ |
tathā mūtrapurīṣādīn samākramya hy anāplutaḥ || 19.305
āśaucavadbhiḥ saṃpṛṣṭaś caṇḍālādyupadhātakaḥ |
rudhirādyanvitāṅgaś ca pūjayed yadi keśavam || 19.306
pañcagavyaiḥ snāpayitvā punaḥ pūjanam ācaret |
kākagṛddhrādibhiḥ spṛṣṭaḥ śvānair vā gardabhādibhiḥ || 19.307
pāṣaṇḍapratilomādyaiḥ patitair hīnavṛttibhiḥ |
caityavṛkṣādibhiś cāpi saṃspṛṣṭaḥ pūjayed yadi || 19.308
adhamādhamamārgeṇa snāpayet puruṣottamam |
caṇḍālair vā tathā mlecchair udakyāsūtikādibhiḥ || 19.309
mahāpātakibhiḥ spṛṣṭaḥ striyaṃ gatvā hy anāplutaḥ |
pūjayed yadi deveśaṃ nīcamadhyamamārgataḥ || 19.310
saṃsnāpya devaṃ tadanu punaḥ pūjanam ācaret |
parastrīgamanāsaktaḥ kuṣṭhī vāpy aṅgahīnakaḥ || 19.311
kāṇo vāndho'pi mūko vā badhiraḥ paṃgur <paṅgur> eva vā |
apasmārī tathonmatto devaṃ sampūjayed <saṃpūjayed> yadi || 19.312
adhamottamamārgeṇa devaṃ saṃsnāpayed dvijāḥ |
āśaucavān vā patito guṇḍo vā golako 'pi vā || 19.313
mahāpātakavāṃś cāpi devaṃ sampūjayed <saṃpūjayed> yadi |
uttamottamamārgeṇa saṃsnāpya puruṣottamam || 19.314
śāntihomaṃ mūlamantrajapaṃ cāpi samācaret |
krimikīṭādibhir duṣṭadhānyapuṣpaphalādibhiḥ || 19.315
prāṇyaṅgatuṣabhasmāsthikeśadantanakhādibhiḥ |
spṛṣṭair dravyais tathāspṛśyapāṇispṛṣṭaiḥ phalādibhiḥ || 19.316
tathā paryuṣitair vānyaiḥ patrapuṣpaphalādibhiḥ |
pūjane sati devasya mūlamantraṃ śataṃ japet || 19.317
caṇḍālapatitodakyāsūtikāpratilomajaiḥ |
śabarādyaiś ca saṃspṛṣṭair dravyaiś śāstravininditaiḥ || 19.318
patrapuṣpādibhiś caiva spṛṣṭair vā gomukhādibhiḥ |
manuṣyair laṅghitadravyais tathāspṛśyamṛgādibhiḥ || 19.319
krimikīṭapataṅgāsthidantakeśanakhādibhiḥ |
tuṣaiś ca bhasmaloṣṭādyair yuktair dravyais tathā dvijāḥ || 19.320
pūrvaṃ samarpitair dravyais tathā paryuṣitodakaiḥ |
pūjane sati devasya puṃsūktena kuśodakaiḥ || 19.321
snāpayitvā mūlamantram aṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
śāntihomaṃ tu vā kuryāt sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.322
jantubhakṣitapuṣpādyair nīcāvāsasamīpagaiḥ |
anyārāmodbhavaiḥ puṣpair grathitair dīkṣitetaraiḥ || 19.323
śūdrānītaiḥ puṣpagehād bahirbaddhaiś ca rogibhiḥ |
bhūgataiḥ patrapuṣpādyaiḥ phalādyair vārcane hareḥ || 19.324
kṣīreṇa snāpya deveśam aṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
mūlamantraṃ punaḥ śuddhapatrapuṣpādibhir yajet || 19.325
jīrṇavastrair adhautaiś ca jīrṇaiś chatrādibhis tathā |
aśodhitārghyapātrādyaiḥ kṛte devasya pūjane || 19.326
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā punaḥ pūjanam ācaret |
keśāsthyādyaśucispṛṣṭaiḥ spṛṣṭaiś śūdrādibhis tathā || 19.327
śvānādibhir vā saṃspṛṣṭaiś caṇḍālādyupaghātakaiḥ |
vastrais saṃpūjite deve 'dhamottamamārgataḥ || 19.328
saṃsnāpya devadevaṃ tu śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
caṇḍālasūtikodakyāspṛṣṭair vastraiḥ prapūjane || 19.329
uttamottamamārgeṇa snāpya śāntiṃ samācaret |
keśāsthiśvādibhiś śūdraiḥ spṛṣṭaṃ kārpāsavastrakam || 19.330
punassaṃśodhya devāya dadyāc caṇḍālapūrvakaiḥ |
spṛṣṭaṃ kārpāsavastraṃ tu santyajen <saṃtyajen> munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.331
paṭṭavastraṃ tu śūdrādyaiḥ spṛṣṭaṃ saṃprokṣayed dvijāḥ |
caṇḍālapūrvaiḥ spṛṣṭaṃ tu jalaiḥ saṃkṣālayed guruḥ || 19.332
ajāvimahiṣoṣṭrājyais tailair eraṇḍajais tathā |
prāṇyaṅgasambhavais <prāṇyaṅgasaṃbhavais> tailaiḥ phalajair vāpi dīpane || 19.333
ajādikṣīradadhyājyahome vā munipuṅgavāḥ |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta taddoṣasya praśāntaye || 19.334
pūrvoktājyādibhir devasnapane vā nivedane |
adhamottamamārgeṇa snapanaṃ śāntim ācaret || 19.335
narabhuktair vastrakhaṇḍair dīpavartyādike kṛte |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta sahasraṃ japam ācaret || 19.336
dhūpaiḥ prāṇyaṅgasaṃmiśrais tailajaiḥ snuhijair api |
anyair durgandhajaiś caiva pūjayed yadi mohataḥ || 19.337
kapilāgoghṛtenaiva hutvāhutisahasrakam |
jātipuṣpasahasreṇa devam abhyarcya deśikaḥ || 19.338
punaḥ śuddhaṃ muniśreṣṭhāḥ karpūrāgaru dhūpayet |
devatāntaranirmālyaduṣṭadravyaiḥ prapūjane || 19.339
adhamādhamamārgeṇa snāpya śāntiṃ samācaret |
caṇḍālasūtikodakyāspṛṣṭād vā śavadūṣitān || 19.340
kūpāt samuddhṛtais toyaiḥ kṛte devasya pūjane |
uttamottamamārgeṇa snāpayet puruṣottamam || 19.341
antastiryakchavāt kūpāt spṛṣṭād vā pratilomajaiḥ |
samuddhṛtair jalair devam arcayed yadi mohataḥ || 19.342
taddoṣaśāntaye kuryāt snānam uttamamadhyamam |
antarjantuśavāt kūpād dviṇmūtrāpeyadūṣitāt || 19.343
devatāntaranirmālyaduṣṭād voddhṛtavāribhiḥ |
pūjane devadevasya snānaṃ syād uttamādhamam || 19.344
antaśśavoṣitād vāpi spṛṣṭāc caṇḍālapūrvakaiḥ |
sarasaḥ proddhṛtais toyaiḥ pūjane madhyamottamam || 19.345
snānaṃ kuryāt tu devasyāntastiryakchavoṣitāt |
spṛṣṭād vā pratilomādyaiḥ sarasaḥ proddhṛtair jalaiḥ || 19.346
pūjane sati devasya snānaṃ madhyamamadhyamam |
spṛṣṭāc caṇḍālapūrvair vā manuṣyaśavadūṣitāt || 19.347
taṭākāduṭghṛtais toyaiḥ pūjane tv adhamottamam |
snapanaṃ devadevasya kuryād deśikasattamaḥ || 19.348
antaśśavoṣite kūpe spṛṣṭe caṇḍālapūrvakaiḥ |
sarvam uddhṛtya tattoyaṃ tadardhaṃ vā munīśvarāḥ || 19.349
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvātha prokṣayet pañcagavyakaiḥ |
tiryakchavādibhir duṣṭe jalasyārdhaṃ samuddharet || 19.350
pādaṃ vāpi samuddhṛtya prokṣayet pañcagavyakaiḥ |
cucundaryādijantūnāṃ śavair mūtrapurīṣakaiḥ || 19.351
duṣṭe vā śivanirmālyaiḥ kūpe tajjalam uddharet |
pādaṃ vāpi tadardhaṃ vā secayet pañcagavyataḥ || 19.352
caṇḍālādyaśucisparśamanuṣyaśavadūṣite |
pratilomajasaṃsparśatiryakchavavidūṣite || 19.353
kuryāt sarasi kūpoktaprāyaścittārdham eva ca |
taṭāke śavacaṇḍālasparśanādyair vidūṣite || 19.354
ācaret sarasi proktaprāyaścittārdham eva ca |
yadvā sarasi vistīrṇe taṭāke ca mahattare || 19.355
kumbhānāṃ tu sahasraṃ vā śataṃ vā jalam uddharet |
divā samuddharet toyaṃ rātrau ced agnisannidhau <agnisaṃnidhau> || 19.356
caṇḍālasūtikodakyāśabarair madyapādibhiḥ |
śvasṛgālavarāhādyaiḥ kākagṛdhrādibhis tathā || 19.357
spṛṣṭānnapānabhakṣyāder devāya vinivedane |
tathā rudhiramāṃsāsthispṛṣṭānnavinivedane || 19.358
śavādidūṣite gehe pakvānnasya nivedane |
mṛtpātrāṇi parityajya lohapātrāṇi śodhayet || 19.359
kṛtvā cālayasaṃśuddhiṃ sarve snātvā yathāvidhi |
kuryuḥ kuśodapānaṃ ca snapanaṃ cottamottamam || 19.360
kṛtvā devasya vidhivacchāntihomaṃ samācaret |
parastrīgamanāsaktair bhakṣyābhakṣyāvivekibhiḥ || 19.361
avaiṣṇavaiś ca saṃspṛṣṭahaviṣo vinivedane |
tyaktaṃ paryuṣitaṃ vāpi dṛṣṭaṃ vāyogyamānuṣaiḥ || 19.362
maṇḍūkamūṣikāsarpair biḍālaiḥ spṛṣṭam eva vā |
krimikīṭapataṅgādyaiḥ spṛṣṭaṃ keśādidūṣitam || 19.363
śvāsāhataṃ tathāghrātaṃ tathā pūrvaṃ niveditam |
nivedayec ced annādyaṃ kumbhair dvādaśabhiḥ kramāt || 19.364
saṃsnāpya devadeveśaṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
śvagṛdhrādispṛṣṭacullayāṃ pakvānnavinivedane || 19.365
prāgvaddvādaśabhiḥ kumbhaiḥ snāpayet puruṣottamam |
caṇḍālādyaiḥ spṛṣṭacullayāṃ pakvānnavinivedane || 19.366
pañcaviṃśatibhiḥ kumbhaiḥ snāpayet puruṣottamam |
atyuṣṇaṃ cātiśītaṃ ca rajastuṣakaṇānvitam || 19.367
mṛtpāṣāṇair dūṣitaṃ vā haviś ced vinivedayet |
japet sahasravāraṃ tu mūlamantraṃ dvijottamāḥ || 19.368
ayājñīyaiḥ kodravādyaiḥ kṛtasya haviṣo 'rpaṇe |
niṣiddhaśākamūlānāṃ phalānāṃ vā nivedane || 19.369
goghṛtena snāpya devaṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
mahāhavirvidhāne tu viśeṣaḥ śrūyatāṃ dvijāḥ || 19.370
pacanālayato 'nyatra sādhitaṃ dīkṣitetaraiḥ |
amantrasaṃskṛtaṃ cānnam avibhaktam alakṣaṇam || 19.371
nirīkṣitam ayogyaiś ca saṃspṛṣṭaṃ makṣikādibhiḥ |
samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> cāstratoyena nivedyaṃ yatnagauravāt || 19.372
anyatraivaṃ duṣṭahaviḥkalpane śāntim ācaret |
makṣikāghuṇabhṛṅgādyair daṣṭaṃ duṣṭaṃ purīṣakaiḥ || 19.373
patrapuṣpaphalādyannaṃ tyaktavyaṃ tadadhiṣṭhitam |
astrodakena samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> dadyād devāya bhaktitaḥ || 19.374
akṛtvā bhūtasaṃśuddhiṃ mantranyāsādikaṃ tu vā |
hṛdi devam anabhyarcya nirmālyodvāsanādikam || 19.375
bimbasaṃśodhanaṃ vāpi sthānasaṃśodhanaṃ tathā |
akṛtvā devayajanaṃ kuryāc cen mohato dvijāḥ || 19.376
taddoṣaśāntaye mūlamantraṃ japtvā sahasrakam |
luptaṃ karma tataḥ kṛtvā punaḥ pūjanam ācaret || 19.377
arghyādīnāṃ dravyalope dahanāpyāyanādike |
lupte vā viṣṇugāyatrīṃ śataṃ japtvā yathāvidhi || 19.378
dravyanyāsādisaṃskāraṃ kṛtvārghyādīn samarcayet |
prāsādadvāradevānāṃ tathāvaraṇavāsinām || 19.379
lupte 'rcane tatpuratas tattanmantrānyathākramam |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā punararcanam ācaret || 19.380
prāsādadvāradevānāṃ parivāragaṇasya vā |
viparyāse mūlamantraṃ śataṃ japtvā kramād yajet || 19.381
pīṭhārcanam akṛtvaiva devasampūjane <devasaṃpūjane> kṛte |
pīṭhādidevatāmantraṃ śataṃ japtvā yathoditam || 19.382
punaḥ pīṭhārcanaṃ kṛtvā devam abhyarcayed guruḥ |
karmārcādyaṅgabimbeṣu vināvāhanam arcane || 19.383
layayāgaṃ bhogayāgaṃ vinā vābhyarcane kṛte |
sahasravāraṃ saṃjaptvā mūlamantraṃ yajet punaḥ || 19.384
mantrahānau kriyāhānau mudrāhānau tathaiva ca |
bhogamantrakriyādīnāṃ viparyāse 'pi ca dvijāḥ || 19.385
taddoṣaśāntaye mantram aṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
pūjākāle tu ghaṇṭāyāś cālane tu vivarjite || 19.386
vedaghoṣavihīne vā śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
pūrvakḷptopacāre tu nyūne dviguṇavastubhiḥ || 19.387
punarabhyarcanaṃ kṛtvāṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
aupacārikasāṃsparśahṛdayaṅgam arūpiṇām || 19.388
paricyutau ca bhogānāṃ trayāṇāṃ kramaśo dvijāḥ |
pūjane sarvabījāni mātrāvittaṃ ghṛtodanam || 19.389
nivedanīyaṃ devasya viśeṣejyāpurassaram |
mātrādānādihānau tu devaṃ maṅgalavāribhiḥ || 19.390
saṃsnāpya śāntihomaṃ ca kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye |
akasmād dīpanirvāṇe pūjāmadhye munīśvarāḥ || 19.391
punaruddīpya śāntyarthaṃ hutvā netram anuṃ japet |
anirvāṇasya dīpasya nāśe tu munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.392
kṣīreṇa snāpya deveśaṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
punarāropya taddīpaṃ japen mūlasahasrakam || 19.393
pākasthānādāhvateṣu devanīrājanārthataḥ |
dīpeṣv ekatamo dīpo yāyād uparatiṃ yadi || 19.394
pramādādvātavegādyaiḥ purastādvinivedanāt |
śrībhaṅgo jāyate paścād yadi vyādhyādipīḍanam || 19.395
tasmāt pradīpya sahasā mūlam aṣṭottaraṃ japet |
tathā nīrājane naṣṭe prākpaścād vā samarpaṇāt || 19.396
punaḥ pradīpya sahasā japen mantraṃ sahasradhā |
ayogyajanasaṃspṛṣṭe tatkumbhe taṃ vihāya tu || 19.397
kumbhāntaraṃ samāpādya tena tat tu samācaret |
pūjākāle dhūpapātre dīpapātre tu vā dvijāḥ || 19.398
nīrājanārthakumbhe vā pramādāt patite sati |
ghaṇṭāyāś cārghyapātrādeś chatradīnāṃ tu vā dvijāḥ || 19.399
patane prajapen mantram aṣṭottarasahasrakam |
dhūpapātrādike bhagne punaḥ sandhāya <saṃdhāya> pūrvavat || 19.400
pañcagavyais tu samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> pūjanādau niyojayet |
kḷpteṣu pūjākāleṣu lupte kasmiṃścid arcane || 19.401
tadanantarakāle tu devaṃ dviguṇavastubhiḥ |
pūjayed dvitrikāleṣu lupteṣu munisattamāḥ || 19.402
tricaturguṇitair dravyaiḥ pūjayet puruṣottamam |
ekāham arcanāhīne tv adhamādhamamārgataḥ || 19.403
devaṃ saṃsnāpya vidhivacchāntihomaṃ samācaret |
yajed dviguṇitair dravyair brāhmaṇān bhojayet tathā || 19.404
dvidinādau ca pakṣānte pūjahīne munīśvarāḥ |
adhamottamamārgeṇa snāpya śāntiṃ samācaret || 19.405
tāvaddviguṇitair dravyair dinasaṃkhyāvaśena tu |
devam ārādhya vidhivadbrāhmaṇān bhojayed bahūn || 19.406
ekamāse 'rcanāhīne tūttamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya devaṃ vidhivatprāgvacchāntyādikaṃ caret || 19.407
saṃvatsaratrayādarvāṅmāsād ūrdhvaṃ dvijottamāḥ |
pūjālope tu devasya kuryāt saṃprokṣaṇaṃ tathā || 19.408
tāvaddviguṇitair dravyair māsasaṃkhyāvaśena tu |
devam abhyarcya vidhivatsahasraṃ bhojayed dvijān || 19.409
saṃvatsaratrayād ūrdhvaṃ pūjālope tu mānuṣe |
punaḥ pratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta svayaṃvyaktādikeṣu tu || 19.410
kuryāt saṃprokṣaṇaṃ cāpi sahasrakalaśāplavam |
manuṣyanirmite sthāne pūjālopādike dvijāḥ || 19.411
prāyaścittaṃ tu kṛtvaiva nityapūjādikaṃ caret |
svayaṃvyaktādike sthāne pūjālopādike sati || 19.412
pūjāyāṃ vartamānāyāṃ prāyaścittaṃ samācaret |
samitparidhidarbhāṇāṃ kūrcānāṃ haviṣām api || 19.413
ājyasthālyādipātrāṇām agneḥ sthaṇḍilakuṇḍayoḥ |
sruksruvasya praṇītāyā abhāve lakṣaṇojjhite || 19.414
śāntyarthaṃ juhuyān mantrī prāgvadvyāpakapañcakaiḥ |
eteṣāṃ bhedane chede vahnidāhādike sati || 19.415
punaranyaṃ samāpādya śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
abhāve kāṣṭhasamidhāmājyena caruṇā hunet || 19.416
samidbhr ājyābhāve tu tilair vā homam ācaret |
alābhe haviṣānyeṣām ājyena juhuyāt sudhīḥ || 19.417
sarvathā homakarmārthaṃ tilam ājyaṃ na lopayet |
tilājyayor abhāve tu havanaṃ syān nirarthakam || 19.418
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta taddoṣasyāpanuttaye |
vahnau kuṇḍe sthale culyāṃ saṃskṛte 'nugatiṃ gate || 19.419
punarādhāya saṃskṛtya śāntihomādikaṃ hunet |
agnipratiṣṭhākarmādau mohād avidhivatkṛte || 19.420
punarvidhivad āpādya śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
vahnau spṛṣṭe tathāspṛśyaiḥ keśāsthinakharair api || 19.421
yathāvanmūlamantreṇa juhuyāt sarpiṣā śatam |
udakyāsūtikādyaiś ca sannikṛṣṭe <saṃnikṛṣṭe> 'yutaṃ hunet || 19.422
saṃspṛṣṭe 'nyaṃ samādhāya juhuyāc cāyutaṃ japet |
asamiddhe hute 'gnau tu punarhomaṃ samācaret || 19.423
naimittikeṣu kāmyeṣu cotsaveṣu viśeṣataḥ |
tadaṅgahutabhugyāgaṃ kuṇḍe 'nyasmin samācaret || 19.424
viparyāse kṛte mohāc chāntihomaṃ samācaret |
hutaśeṣahaviśśeṣe bhukte yogyajanair vinā || 19.425
japen mūlāyutaṃ mantrī dātā kilbiṣaśāntaye |
ekadvitricatuḥpañcaṣaṭkāleṣu yathākramam || 19.426
saṅkalpya <saṃkalpya> yāgaṃ homāntaṃ havanaṃ ca kṛtaṃ yadi |
dviguṇaṃ havanaṃ kuryāt pūrṇāntaṃ mantravittamaḥ || 19.427
ekaṃ dinaṃ samārabhya māsāntaṃ homalopane |
adhamottamamārgeṇa saṃsnāpya puruṣottamam || 19.428
tattadviguṇitair dravyair homakarma samācaret |
māsordhvaṃ vatsarādarvāg homalope 'dhamottamam || 19.429
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca sahasrāhutibhiś caret |
varṣordhvaṃ homalope tu snapanaṃ madhyamottamam || 19.430
śāntihomaṃ ca godānaṃ kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam |
patane balivastūnāṃ tattyaktvānyena deśikaḥ || 19.431
baliṃ datvātha tacchāntyai śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
tathaiva balivastūnām aspṛśyasparśane dvijāḥ || 19.432
tathaiva pātre 'bhimate keśaloṣṭādidūṣite |
tattyaktvānyena nirvartya mūlam aṣṭottaraṃ japet || 19.433
baliṃ duṣṭena dadyāc chec chāntihomapurassaram |
baliṃ datvā viśeṣeṇa parivāram anuṃ japet || 19.434
mudrāmantrakriyādhyānadravyāṇāṃ bhogarūpiṇām |
tattadgānasvarāṇāṃ ca tālanṛttādikasya ca || 19.435
viśeṣād balikāle tu hānir utpadyate yadi |
japen mūlasahasraṃ tu mantrī dhyānasamanvitaḥ || 19.436
yānasthe balibimbe tu vyūḍhe 'yogyajanaiḥ sati |
kuśodakena saṃprokṣya śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.437
aspṛśyair yadi saṃspṛṣṭā balibimbasya vāhakāḥ |
pañcagavyena saṃprokṣya śucinānyena vāhayet || 19.438
balikāle dīpanāśe punarāropya dīpakam |
kṛtvā cotsavaśeṣaṃ tu śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.439
balibimbe nipatite śibikādau munīśvarāḥ |
sthāpayitvā yathāpūrvaṃ baliśeṣaṃ nayet tataḥ || 19.440
taddoṣaśāntaye kumbhair navabhis snāpayed vibhum |
sabimbayānapatane 'py evaṃ śāntiṃ samācaret || 19.441
nityotsavārthabimbe tu yānān nipatite bhuvi |
tadaivoddhṛtya tadbimbam akṣataṃ snāpya mantravit || 19.442
adhamādhamamārgeṇa śāntyarthaṃ juhuyād anu |
tathaiva ca kṣataṃ bimbaṃ samādhāya yathāpuram || 19.443
kṛtvā prātiṣṭhikaṃ karma svasthāne sthāpayed anu |
yāvat samādhikālaṃ tu tāvadbibmāntareṇa vā || 19.444
kūrcena vānyabimbena kuryān nityotsavaṃ hareḥ |
balibimbasya mūrddhasthapuṣpādipatane tu vā || 19.445
kirīṭapatane cāpi taddoṣasya praśāntaye |
snapanaṃ navabhiḥ kumbhaiś śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.446
balikāle tu nṛtyantyāḥ patane vārayoṣitaḥ |
taddoṣaśāntaye kuryāc chantihomaṃ dvijottamāḥ || 19.447
balidānavihīne tv ekakālārcanādike |
baliṃ dviguṇitaṃ dadyāt tathā tv ekadine dvijāḥ || 19.448
balipradānahīne tu hutvā mūlaśataṃ tataḥ |
tattadāvaraṇadvāradevānāṃ svasvasaṃjñayā || 19.449
juhuyāt tilamiśreṇa ghṛtenaiva śataṃ śatam |
dvidinādau ca māsāntaṃ tadūrdhvaṃ vatsarāntimam || 19.450
varṣād ūrdhvaṃ ca rahite balidāne 'dhamādhamam |
taduttamaṃ ca snapanaṃ kramād vai madhyamottamam || 19.451
śāntihomaṃ ca kurvīta dravyair dviguṇitair balim |
sūtakaṃ vā mṛtāśaucaṃ pūjākāle śrutaṃ yadi || 19.452
āśaucam ācared viprāḥ pūjānte deśikottamaḥ |
devasya nityapūjādau mohāt siddhāntasaṅkare <siddhāntasaṃkare> || 19.453
saṃhitāsaṅkare <saṃhitāsaṃkare> vāpi jāte taddoṣaśāntaye |
saṃprokṣaṇaṃ purā kṛtvā sahasrakalaśāplavam || 19.454
mahotsavaṃ ca kurvīta nānyathā śāntir iṣyate |
ekatra dīkṣitas tantre siddhānte vā munīśvarāḥ || 19.455
na kuryād deśiko 'nyatra pūjanādīn api dvijāḥ |
tantrabhede ca siddhāntabhede vāpy utsavādiṣu || 19.456
ācāryatvaṃ tathārtvijyaṃ na kāryaṃ mohataḥ kṛte |
doṣāya kalpate rājarāṣṭradhāmakṣayātmane || 19.457
pañcarātroktamārgeṇa pūjyamāne pratiṣṭhite |
vaikhānasaiḥ pūjite tu pratiṣṭhāṃ punar ācaret || 19.458
tathaiva karmabimbānāṃ sāṅkaryam <sāṃkaryam> api nācaret |
karmaṇāṃ snapanādīnāṃ yatkarma vihitaṃ dvijāḥ || 19.459
yasmin vai karmabimbe tu tatraiva ca samācaret |
tattatkarmārthabimbe tu tatra sannihite <saṃnihite> sati || 19.460
tattatkarmaviśeṣāṇāṃ vyatyayaṃ na samācaret |
asannidhāne <asaṃnidhāne> teṣāṃ tu rāṣṭrabhaṅgādidoṣataḥ || 19.461
taddeśakālānuguṇaṃ tatra sannihitaṃ <saṃnihitaṃ> bhavet |
yadyatkarmārthabimbaṃ tu tatra sarvaṃ samācaret || 19.462
snapanadvitayañ caiva nityanaimittikātmakam |
nityotsavavidhānaṃ ca tathā naimittikotsavam || 19.463
tīrthayātrāvidhānaṃ cety evaṃ karmāṇi pañca vai |
śayanotthāpanaṃ karma tadā kūrce samācaret || 19.464
yadvā śobhārthabimbe tu pūjyamāne pratiṣṭhite |
evaṃ kathitam ekasmin bimbe sannihite <saṃnihite> sati || 19.465
bimbadvaye sannihite <saṃnihite> tattatkarmavibhedataḥ |
kṛtvā tadanyatsakalaṃ yathāyogaṃ samācaret || 19.466
evam abhyūhya kartavyaṃ tattadbimbe prakāśite |
sarveṣu karmabimbeṣu tatra sannihiteṣu <saṃnihiteṣu> vai || 19.467
tadā teṣāṃ tu bimbānāṃ vyatyayaṃ na samācaret |
pramādād vyatyaye jāte kuryāt snapanam uttamam || 19.468
ataḥparaṃ pravakṣyāmi prāyaścittaṃ tu cotsave |
purastātsarvakarmārtham arpiteṣv aṅkureṣv anu || 19.469
rakteṣu śyāmavarṇeṣu tathā tiryaggateṣu ca |
vakreṣu cāprarūḍheṣu dakṣiṇābhimukheṣu ca || 19.470
vidhihīneṣu cāspṛśyaspṛṣṭeṣv adhikṛtair vinā |
pālikādiṣu bhinneṣu naṣṭeṣu patiteṣu ca || 19.471
mūṣikādyaiś ca daṣṭeṣu mūlamantrāyutaṃ japet |
punaḥ kṛtvāṅkurāropaṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.472
sakṛnniyuktapātreṣu mṛṇmayeṣu punardvijāḥ |
bījāvāpe kṛte viprā māhān doṣaḥ prajāyate || 19.473
tacchāntyai śāntihomaṃ tu kṛtvā bhūyo 'ṅkurārpaṇam |
samācaret pālikādau valmīkādisamudbhave || 19.474
tān tyaktvānyeṣu prātreṣu bījāvāpaṃ samācaret |
śāntihomaṃ tathā kṛtvā bhojayed brahmaṇān śatam || 19.475
karmārtham aṅkuraṃ kṛtvā tatkarmākaraṇe dvijāḥ |
aṅkurān api tān tyaktvā śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.476
anarpya tv aṅguraṃ mohād ārabdhe tu mahotsave |
sadyaḥ kṛtvā tadanyedyur bījāvāpaṃ yathāvidhi || 19.477
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta taddoṣasyāpanuttaye |
devatāvyatyaye jāte pālikādau munīśvarāḥ || 19.478
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
tathaiva pālikādīnāṃ sthānavyatyayasambhave <sthānavyatyayasaṃbhave> || 19.479
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā krameṇa sthāpayet punaḥ |
pātrāṇāṃ pālikādīnāṃ vihīne lakṣaṇādike || 19.480
japed aṣṭākṣaram anum aṣṭottarasahasrakam |
karasthe deśikādīnāṃ devadevasya vā dvijāḥ || 19.481
naṣṭe kautukasūtre tu chinne vā munipuṅgavāḥ |
sūtrāntaraṃ punarbadhvā śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.482
rakṣābandhaṃ vinā karmaprārambhe munisattamāḥ |
sadyo badhvā pratisaraṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.483
mahotsavādyutsaveṣu pratiṣṭhāprokṣaṇādike |
karmaṇi snapanādau vā baddhapratisaro guruḥ || 19.484
ṛtvijaś ca tathābhūtā madhye 'py āśaucasambhave <āśaucasaṃbhave> |
bhavanti naivāśucayas tattatkarmāvasānakam || 19.485
śāvaṃ vā sūtakāśaucaṃ karmānantaram ācaret |
karmamadhye snānamātraṃ kāryaṃ śāvasya sambhave <saṃbhave> || 19.486
karmamadhye 'pi vāśaucaṃ bhaved ātmānvite mṛte |
pitā mātā jyeṣṭhaputro bhāryā cātmānvitā smṛtāḥ || 19.487
tadā guror abhyanujñāṃ labdhvānyo deśikottamaḥ |
taddoṣasya praśāntyartham uttamottamamārgataḥ || 19.488
devaṃ saṃsnāpya śāntyarthaṃ hutvāhutisahasrakam |
gobhūtilādikaṃ datvā brāhmaṇān bhojayed bahūn || 19.489
tataḥ samāpayet karmaśeṣaṃ bhaktasamanvitaḥ |
evaṃ gurau vyādhite vā mṛte vānyaḥ samācaret || 19.490
karmaśeṣaṃ dvijaśreṣṭhāḥ prāyaścittapurassaram |
pramāṇarahite vaṃśe paṭe bāladhvaje 'pi ca || 19.491
varṇabhūṣaṇanāmādye daṇḍayaṣṭau tu vaiṇave |
pheṇake cāvaṭe pīṭhe prapāyāṃ dhvajarajjuṣu || 19.492
ācarec chāntihomaṃ cāṣṭottaraśataṃ japam |
chinne bhinne 'gninā dagdhe naṣṭe mūṣakadaṃśite || 19.493
viṇmūtrarudhirāpeyaretoniṣṭhīvanādibhiḥ |
dūṣite dhvajam utsṛjya prāgvadanyaṃ samācaret || 19.494
pratiṣṭhāpyātha daṇḍāgramānayitvādhamena tu |
saṃsnāpya doṣaśāntyarthaṃ juhuyāt sarpiṣā śatam || 19.495
stambhāgre dhvajavastrasya rakṣā kāryātha dīkṣitaiḥ |
ārohaṇe na doṣo 'tra rakṣāhetor dvijātibhiḥ || 19.496
dhvajasya rajjuvicchede kiṃcicchinne tu vā dhvaje |
yaṣṭighaṇṭāvihīne vā śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.497
sujīrṇān pheṇadaṇḍādīn parityajya tato 'parān |
saṃskṛtya yojayet tatra badhvā tu dhvajamañjasā || 19.498
madhyamasnapanānte tu śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
varṣavātātapasparśair luptavarṇe khagadhvaje || 19.499
na kiṃ cid apy aniṣṭaṃ syāt stambhāgre yāvadutsavam |
baddhadhvajapaṭe stambhe vātavegādihetubhiḥ || 19.500
mūladeśe tu vicchinne sadhvaje patite sati |
akṛtvā dhvajaviśleṣaṃ sthāpayec cheṣamañjasā || 19.501
snapanaṃ cottamaṃ kuryāc catuḥsthānārcanādikam |
gobhūhematilādīnāṃ dānaṃ śaktyā samācaret || 19.502
utsavadhvajabhaṅgena rājyād bhraṣṭo bhaven nṛpaḥ |
tasmāt tatparihārārthaṃ tvarayā śāntim ācaret || 19.503
hetubhir vātavegādyair dhvaje nipatite bhuvi |
kṣipram uddhṛtya tad badhvā snapanaṃ cādhamena tu || 19.504
śāntyarthaṃ juhuyād ājyaṃ tilena śatasaṃkhyayā |
dhvaje nipatite chinne kuryāt snapanam uttamam || 19.505
punaranyaṃ samutpādya badhnīyāt saṃskṛtaṃ tathā |
anyathā yadi doṣaḥ syād rājño rāṣṭrasya mantriṇaḥ || 19.506
grāmapradakṣiṇe kāle dhvaje vātādinā bhuvi |
patite tatpunaryāne sthāpya nītvālayaṃ tataḥ || 19.507
snāpyādhamādhamenātha śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
sakṛnniyuktastambhādau punaś cāpi niyojite || 19.508
adhamottamamārgeṇa snapanaṃ śāntim ācaret |
viparītadhvajapaṭaṃ bandhayed yadi mohataḥ || 19.509
taṃ mocayitvā badhvānyamadhamādhamamārgataḥ |
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād doṣāpanuttaye || 19.510
pakṣīśādhiṣṭhite kumbhe naṣṭe vā patite bhuvi |
spṛṣṭe 'spṛśyais tathā keśaloṣṭāsthiśakṛdādibhiḥ || 19.511
kumbhe 'nyasmin samāropya tāṃ śaktiṃ kumbhamadhyagām |
hutvā mūlāyutaṃ japtvā śeṣaṃ karma samācaret || 19.512
dhvajārohaṇakāle tv atikrānte dvijottamāḥ |
śāntihomaṃ tu vā kuryāt sahasraṃ japam eva vā || 19.513
dhvajastambhe 'gninā kiñciddagdhe sandhāya <saṃdhāya> pūrvavat |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta taddoṣasyāpanuttaye || 19.514
stambhasya tu mahaddāhe chede bhede tu vā dvijāḥ |
stambhāntaraṃ pratiṣṭhāpya devasyottamamārgataḥ || 19.515
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād deśikasattamaḥ |
dhvajastambhe tu caṇḍālodakyādisparśadūṣite || 19.516
taṃ tyaktvānyaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya prāgvacchāntiṃ samācaret |
sūtakapretakaspṛṣṭe spṛṣṭe vā pratilomajaiḥ || 19.517
pañcagavyais tu saṃprokṣya śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
dhvajastambhe khageśasya pūjālope munīśvarāḥ || 19.518
pūjālopoditaṃ prāgvatprāyaścittaṃ samācaret |
devatāvāhanārthaṃ tu bherītāḍanakarmaṇi || 19.519
vādyajāleṣu sarveṣu mṛdaṅgapaṇavādiṣu |
na sthāpiteṣu svasthāne tattatpūjāvilopane || 19.520
puṇyāhapāṭharāhitye japtvā manusahasrakam |
tattatkuryād yathāśāstraṃ bherītāḍanalopane || 19.521
adhamādhamamārgeṇa devaṃ snāpya yathāvidhi |
punastattāḍanaṃ kuryāc chāntihomapurassaram || 19.522
bherītāḍanakāle tu koṇacchede dvijottamāḥ |
carmavicchedane caiva śāntihomapurassaram || 19.523
japtvā gārutmataṃ mantraṃ punaranyaṃ samācaret |
tāḍayed vidhivadbherīṃ tathāvāhanagādhayā || 19.524
sagaṇeṣu ca bhūteṣu sagṛheṣūtkaṭādiṣu |
svāsu dikṣu yathānyāyamanāhūteṣu satsu ca || 19.525
dvārāvaraṇarathyāsu grāmavāstuṣv anukramāt |
balipradānahīne tu tathā tālasvarādiṣu || 19.526
geyanṛtteṣu hīneṣu śāntihomapurassaram |
pratyekaṃ devatāmantram aṣṭadhāvartayed badhaḥ || 19.527
punarāpādayet sarvaṃ devatāvāhanādikam |
ārambhasnapane hīne śāntihomapurassaram || 19.528
devaṃ saṃsnāpayel lupte mahāhaviṣi sattamāḥ |
śāntihomapuraskaṃ tu dviguṇaṃ havir ācaret || 19.529
dvāḥsthānāṃ yāgagehasya pūjālope pramādataḥ |
tattanmantrān aṣṭavāraṃ japtvā bhūyaḥ samarcayet || 19.530
catuḥsthānārcanāhīne tv ekakālaṃ dvijottamāḥ |
śāntihomapuraskaṃ tu yajed dviguṇavastubhiḥ || 19.531
ekāham arcanāhīne catuḥsthānasthitasya tu |
adhamādhamamārgeṇa devaṃ snāpya yathāvidhi || 19.532
śāntihomapuraskan tu yajed dviguṇavastubhiḥ |
bhede cchede tu vā jāte mahākumbhasya sattamāḥ || 19.533
tathā cāspṛśyasaṃsparśe tacchaktiṃ maṇḍalāvanau |
samāvāhya tu tatkumbhaṃ tyaktvānyasmin salakṣaṇe || 19.534
kumbhe prāgvatsamābāhya yajec chāntiṃ samācaret |
maṇḍale 'py evamādīnāṃ doṣāṇāṃ sambhave <saṃbhave> dvijāḥ || 19.535
kumbhe devaṃ samāvāhya prāgvatsarvaṃ samācaret |
valmīkaśithilīduṣṭe maṇḍale tatsthadevatāḥ || 19.536
kumbhe visṛjya tadvedīṃ khātvāpūrya ca saikataiḥ |
punarmaṇḍalam ālikhya prāgvat tatra samarcayet || 19.537
taddoṣaśāntaye devam adhamādhamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād deśikasattamaḥ || 19.538
dhvajatoraṇakumbhānāṃ kūrcapallavavāsasām |
pratimādhānyapīṭhāder lope śāntiṃ samācaret || 19.539
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā yathāśāstraṃ prakalpayet |
dhvajatoraṇapūrvāṇāṃ pīṭhānām aṅgarūpiṇām || 19.540
prapāmaṇṭapapātrāṇām anyeṣāṃ vā munīśvarāḥ |
agnidāhe samutpanne punarutpādya tān api || 19.541
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta mūlamantrajapaṃ tathā |
pramādād utsavāgnes tu nāśe jāte munīśvarāḥ || 19.542
punaragniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya devam āvāhya pūrvavat |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta śatabrāhmaṇabhojanam || 19.543
yāgaśālākumbhadīpanirvāṇe munipuṅgavāḥ |
śāntihomapuraskan tu dīpam uddīpya pūrvavat || 19.544
japed aṣṭottaraśataṃ netramantraṃ dvijottamāḥ |
caṇḍālasūtikodakyāgardabhaśvānasūkaraiḥ || 19.545
ūṣṭrādibhiḥ sūtakibhis tathaiva pratilomajaiḥ |
praviṣṭe yāgagehāntaḥ kumbhamaṇḍalavahniṣu || 19.546
sthitān devān svahṛdaye samāvāhya yathāvidhi |
kumbhamaṇḍalavahnyādīn tyaktvā lohamayāni cet || 19.547
pātrāṇi tāni saṃśodhya mārjanollekhanādibhiḥ |
yāgagehaṃ śodhayitvā secayet pañcagavyakaiḥ || 19.548
punaḥkumbhādikān sthāpya hṛdayasthās tu devatāḥ |
yathāpūrvaṃ samāvāhya śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.549
mūlamantrāyutaṃ japtvā bhojayed brāhmaṇān śatam |
pratirātraṃ balidravyavyatyāse sarpiṣāṃ śatam || 19.550
hutvāgnau mūlamantreṇa japed aṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
kāle tasmin baliṃ dadyāt tatkāle prāptamañjasā || 19.551
vyatyāse balidevānāṃ japo homaś ca tādṛśaḥ |
asvatantrālaye grāmabalidāne 'kṛte dvijāḥ || 19.552
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta taddoṣasya praśāntaye |
sāyaṃ prātas tu kartavyam utsaveṣu balidvayam || 19.553
tannyūnādhikyadoṣe tv adhamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya devaṃ vidhivac śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.554
bimbādhiṣṭhitayānasya patane bhuvi sattamāḥ |
ud?dhṛtyotsavaśeṣaṃ tu kṛtvā navaghaṭair vibhum || 19.555
saṃsnāpya śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād deśikasattamaḥ |
adhiṣṭhiteṣu bimbena yāneṣu patanādinā || 19.556
bhinneṣv api ca vāheṣu pramādād yatra kutra cit |
yānāntare samāropya vāhane vātha kautukam || 19.557
śāntihomaṃ purā kṛtvā japen mūlasahasrakam |
gobhūhemādikaṃ dadyād vaiṣṇavebhyo guror api || 19.558
yānād vā vāhanād vāpi bimbe tu patite sati |
uttamaṃ sanpanaṃ kṛtvā śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.559
yānam āropya tadbimbaṃ punarutsavam ācaret |
tathaiva ca kṣataṃ bimbaṃ samādhāya yathāpuram || 19.560
kṛtvā samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> paścād utsavaṃ śeṣam ācaret |
samādhau dīrghakālīne kuryāc chobhārthakautuke || 19.561
śeṣakarma mahārcāyāṃ nirvṛtte sandhikarmaṇi <saṃdhikarmaṇi> |
pūrvavattāṃ pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvacchāntim ācaret || 19.562
bimbenādhiṣṭhite yāne vyūḍhe 'spṛśyajanais tadā |
yānādīn kṣālayed devam adhamādhamamārgataḥ || 19.563
snāpayet kevalaṃ yāne vyūḍhe taiḥ śuddhavāriṇā |
saṅkṣālya <saṃkṣālya> yānaṃ vidhivat prokṣayet pañcagavyakaiḥ || 19.564
devasyotsavakāle tu jātāyāṃ dīpanirvṛtau |
patane vāpi dīpasya mūlamantreṇa mantravit || 19.565
aṣṭottarasahasraṃ tu hutvā tatsaṃkhyayā japet |
chatracāmarapūrvāṇāṃ patane tu śataṃ japet || 19.566
vahnidāhe samutpanne punar utpādya tān api |
sajapaṃ śāntihomaṃ tu kuryād aṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 19.567
devasyotsavakāle tu grāme maraṇasambhave <maraṇasaṃbhave> |
paścādgrāmaṃ tu samprokṣyādhamādhamamārgataḥ 
<saṃprokṣyādhamādhamamārgataḥ> || 19.568
devaṃ saṃsnāpayet paścācchāntihomaṃ samācaret |
devasyotsavakāle tu grāmādau vahnidāhataḥ || 19.569
dūṣite pañcagavyais tu prokṣya grāmādikaṃ budhaḥ |
śāntihomaṃ ca kṛtvātha punarutsavam ācaret || 19.570
grāmādāv agninā digdhe vātyāsārādidūṣite |
śāntihomaṃ purā kṛtvā paścādutsavam ācaret || 19.571
anyathā cotsave kḷpte tv adhamottamamārgataḥ |
devaṃ saṃsnāpya vidhivacchāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.572
śūnyeṣu grāmanagarapattanādiṣu cotsavam |
balidānaṃ na kurvīta kṛte tatrāpi niṣphalam || 19.573
dhāmany evotsavaṃ kuryād balidānaṃ ca deśikaḥ |
anyathā karaṇe devam uttamottamamārgataḥ || 19.574
saṃsnāpya śāntihomaṃ ca kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye |
samāhite tu grāmādau grāmaśāntipurassaram || 19.575
punar apy utsavaṃ kuryād brāhmaṇānām anujñayā |
ripucorāgnivṛṣṭyādibhayāt kasmiṃścid utsave || 19.576
vighnite muniśārdūlāḥ kevalaṃ balim ācaret |
atikrāntotsavaṃ kuryād anyedyuḥ śāntipūrvakam || 19.577
vighnite balidāne 'pi hy anyedyur adhamottamam |
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kṛtvātikrāntam utsavam || 19.578
balidānaṃ ca kurvīta dvidinaṃ tridinaṃ tu vā |
catuṣpañcadinaṃ vāpy utsave vighnite sati || 19.579
tattaddoṣānurūpeṇa prāyaścittaṃ vidhāya ca |
atikrāntotsavān kuryād balidānāni ca kramāt || 19.580
devasyotsavakāle tu mahāvātais tathātapaiḥ |
pāṃsubhir varṣanīhāraiḥ spṛṣṭe bimbe 'dhamottamam || 19.581
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye |
bimbe corādibhir naṣṭe vartamāne mahotsave || 19.582
bimbāntaraṃ samāpādya pratiṣṭhāpya yathāpuram |
mahābhiṣekaṃ havanaṃ japaṃ caiva yathāvidhi || 19.583
kuryād utsavaśeṣaṃ tu karmārcādiṣu nācaret |
rathasya yātrākāle tu cakracchede 'kṣabhedane || 19.584
rajjucchede 'pi vā hy anyaṃ saṃyojya ca yathāpuram |
yātrānte śāntihomaṃ tu kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye || 19.585
śikhākumbhasya patane sāratheḥ patane tu vā |
punar yathāpuraṃ sthāpya kṛtvā puṇyāhavācanam || 19.586
rathaṃ samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> yātrānte śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
rathopari tv ayogyānām ārohe paṃcagavyakaiḥ <pañcagavyakaiḥ> || 19.587
rathaṃ samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> yātrānte tvadhamādhamamārgataḥ |
snāpayed devadeveśaṃ rathe vai kiṃcidagninā || 19.588
dagdhe punarnavīkṛtya secayet paṃcagavyakaiḥ <pañcagavyakaiḥ> |
yātrānte snapanaṃ kuryād adhamottamasaṃjñakam || 19.589
rathasya tu mahaddāhe rathād devaṃ khagopari |
samāropyālayaṃ nītvottamottamamārgataḥ || 19.590
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam |
rathād bimbasya patane rathopari khage tu vā || 19.591
punardevaṃ samāropya nītvā vai mandiraṃ tataḥ |
uttamottamamārgeṇa snapanaṃ havanaṃ tathā || 19.592
mūlamantrāyutajapaṃ kṛtvā gobhūtilādikam |
datvā taddoṣaśāntyarthaṃ sahasraṃ bhojayed dvijān || 19.593
sabimbasya rathasyaiva patane prāgvad ācaret |
prāyaścitaṃ dvijaśreṣṭhā rathabhaṅge tu taṃ punaḥ || 19.594
sandhāyotsavaśeṣaṃ <saṃdhāyotsavaśeṣaṃ> tu kṛtvā śāntyai huned guruḥ |
asandheye <asaṃdheye> rathe devam āropya ca khagopari || 19.595
nītvālayaṃ tatra devam adhamottamamārgataḥ |
saṃsnāpya śāntihomādi kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye || 19.596
rathacakrādighātais tu manuṣyamaraṇe sati |
śavaṃ bahirviniṣkāsya taddeśakhananādikām || 19.597
pañcaśuddhiṃ kramāt kṛtvā yātrānte tv adhamottamam |
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam || 19.598
cakraghātādinā tiryaṅmaraṇe prāgvad ācaret |
bhūmiśudhyādikaṃ sarvaṃ snapanaṃ tv adhamādhamam || 19.599
yātrākāle tathānyonyavirodhādāyudhādinā |
rathāntike janamṛtau prāgvanniṣkṛtir īritā || 19.600
tadraktādyai rathe spṛṣṭe rathaṃ saṃkṣālya vāribhiḥ |
pañcagavyena saṃprokṣya yātrānte tv adhamādhamam || 19.601
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kuryād deśikasattamaḥ |
rathotsavasya kāle tu tadgrāme yatra kutra vā || 19.602
maraṇe brāhmaṇādīnāṃ tacchavaṃ grāmato bahiḥ |
niṣkāsya grāmavīdhīs tu mārjanollekhanādibhiḥ || 19.603
saṃśodhya pañcagavyena prokṣya yātrāṃ samācaret |
tato 'dhamādhamaṃ snānaṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.604
ekadvitridinānte tu rathe svasthānasaṃsthite |
adhamottamamārgeṇa snapanaṃ havanaṃ tathā || 19.605
kṛtvā tatas tv atikrāntam utsavaṃ balim ācaret |
tathā tīrthadine vāpi hy apraviṣṭe rathe sthalam || 19.606
avaropya rathād devaṃ samāropya khageśvare |
grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ nītvottamottamamārgataḥ || 19.607
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kṛtvātikrāntam utsavam |
balidānaṃ ca kurvīta tatas tīrthādikaṃ caret || 19.608
ekadvitridināntaṃ tu rathārohe tu vighnite |
adhamottamamārgeṇa snapanaṃ havanaṃ tathā || 19.609
dvijānāṃ bhojanaṃ kṛtvā sadyaḥ kuryād rathotsavam |
ekadvitricaturvarṣaṃ vighnite tu rathotsave || 19.610
uttamasnapanaṃ homaṃ sahasradvijabhojanam |
gobhūdānādikaṃ kṛtvā rathaprokṣaṇam ācaret || 19.611
rathasthā devatāḥ pūjya khageśamanunā tataḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā tilair ājyaiś ca taṇḍulaiḥ || 19.612
rathasthadevatāmantraiḥ pṛthagaṣṭāhutīr hunet |
evaṃ kṛtvātha devasya rathayātrāṃ samācaret || 19.613
mahotsavāṅgabhūte tu vasantotsavakarmaṇi |
ḍolotsave ca mṛgayādyutsave ca munīśvarāḥ || 19.614
yuddhārambhe ca devībhyāṃ tathā cūrṇābhiṣecane |
lupte kuryāc śāntihomaṃ tattaddoṣopaśāntaye || 19.615
muhūrtātikrame 'py evam utsave sarvakarmaṇām |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvītāṣṭottarajapaṃ tathā || 19.616
divārātryutsavaṃ kuryād āsūryāstamayodayāt |
kālayor viparītaś ced adhamasnapanaṃ caret || 19.617
tīrthayātrā prakartavyā sūryasyāstamayāt purā |
pūrvabhāge rajanyāṃ vā kuryāt svavyaktadivyayoḥ || 19.618
uttamasnapanaṃ kuryāt tīrthakālaviparyaye |
bhraṣṭāyāṃ tīrthayātrāyām avaropya khagadhvajam || 19.619
pūrvavaddhvajam utthāpya kuryāt tīrthārtham utsavam |
kumbhaprokṣaṇalope tu snapanaṃ madhyamottamam || 19.620
mahotsavāntasnapane nakṛte snāpayet tataḥ |
uttamottamamārgeṇa śāntyarthaṃ juhuyāt tataḥ || 19.621
niśāyāṃ sarvaśāntyarthī puṣṭyarthī madhyame dine |
āpyāyanārthī pūrvāhṇe dharmārthī madhyato niśi || 19.622
tathā ripukṣayārthī ca puṣpayāgaṃ samācaret |
na tu paryuṣitaiḥ puṣpaiḥ parimlānais tathārcayet || 19.623
taddoṣaśāntaye kuryāt snapanaṃ tvadhamādhamam |
nakṛte puṣpayāge 'smin kuryāt snapanam uttamam || 19.624
tadrātrau dhvajadaṇḍāgrād avaropya khagadhvajam |
grāmādivāstuniṣṭhānāṃ baliṃ datvā visarjayet || 19.625
utsavānte dhvaje naṣṭe purastādavarohaṇāt |
prāgvad dhvajaṃ samutthāpya punar evāvarohayet || 19.626
tīrthānte paṃcadivasād <pañcadivasād> ūrdhvaṃ cāpy avarohaṇe |
dhvajasya nakṛte kuryāt snapanaṃ madhyamottamam || 19.627
avaropya dhvajaṃ paścād devatās tu visarjayet |
udvāsanabaler lope śāntihomapurassaram || 19.628
dviguṇaṃ tu baliṃ datvā devatodvāsanaṃ caret |
ācāryādakṣiṇāhīne niṣphalaḥ syāt sa utsavaḥ || 19.629
ācāryadakṣiṇāhīnaṃ ṛtvijāṃ ca tathaiva ca |
yatkarma kriyate sarvam abhicārāya kalpate || 19.630
tacchāntyai śāntihomaṃ tu kārayed guruṇā tataḥ |
praṇamya daṇḍavadbhūmau yajamānaḥ svayaṃ guroḥ || 19.631
santoṣaṃ <saṃtoṣaṃ> kārayed dhīmān vastrahemāṅgulīyakaiḥ |
dakṣiṇāṃ dviguṇāṃ dadyāt tena śāntir bhaviṣyati || 19.632
dvijabhojanalope 'pi hy evaṃ śāntiṃ samācaret |
atuṣṭeṣu brāhmaṇeṣu na prīṇāti hariḥ sadā || 19.633
yatra viprās tu santuṣṭās <saṃtuṣṭās> tatra devaḥ prasīdati |
tatas taddoṣaśāntyarthaṃ dviguṇaṃ bhojayed dvijān || 19.634
daivād vā mānuṣād dheto rāṣṭrakṣobhādināpi vā |
ekadvitridinaṃ viprā anārabdhe mahotsave || 19.635
brāhmaṇān samanujñāpya deveśasyādhamottamam |
snapanaṃ śāntihomaṃ ca kṛtvā brāhmaṇabhojanam || 19.636
aṅkurārpaṇapūrvaṃ tu dravyair dviguṇitais tataḥ |
atikrāntotsavān kṛtvā kramaprāptam athācaret || 19.637
catuḥpaṃcadinaṃ <catuḥpañcadinaṃ> vighne snapanaṃ madhyamottamam |
kuryāt taddoṣaśāntyarthaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavad ācaret || 19.638
ṣaṭsaptadinaparyantam anārabdhe tu cotsave |
uttamottamamārgeṇa snānam anyat tu pūrvavat || 19.639
tathāṣṭadinaparyantam anārabdhe mahotsave |
sahasrakalaśair devaṃ snāpya prāgvat samācaret || 19.640
yadvā tīrthadine viprā ārabhyaḥ punarutsavaḥ |
tathā tīrthadine cāpi hy atikrānte dvijottamāḥ || 19.641
tadanantaramāsasthatīrthaṛkṣavaśena tu |
punar apy utsavaṃ kuryāt sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.642
tasmin māse 'py atikrānte māsi syāt tadanantare |
evaṃ saṃvatsarāntaṃ syād atikrānte 'pi vatsare || 19.643
sahasrakalaśasnānaṃ śāntihomo .autaṃ japaḥ |
sahasrabrāhmaṇānāṃ ca bhojanaṃ kārayed dvijāḥ || 19.644
tenaiva śāntir bhavati na gatotsavam ācaret |
navāhotsavapūrveṣu pūrvaṃ yāvaddinotsavam || 19.645
saṅkalpitaṃ <saṃkalpitaṃ> tathaiva syāt pratisaṃvatsaraṃ dvijāḥ |
tāvannyūnādhikadinaṃ notsavaṃ parikalpayet || 19.646
amatyā yadi kurvīta punarutsavam ācaret |
vaiśeṣikeṣu prāpteṣu vartamāne mahotsave || 19.647
dvādaśyādiṣu tatsarvaṃ yathānyāyaṃ samācaret |
na lopayet prayatnena prāptaṃ vaiśeṣikaṃ sudhīḥ || 19.648
japed astrāyutaṃ mantrī tv akṛteṣu ca śāntaye |
evamādiṣu cānyeṣu doṣeṣu munisattamāḥ || 19.649
utsavāgnau yathāśāstraṃ śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
parvotsaveṣu lupteṣu snapanaṃ tv adhamādhamam || 19.650
havirnivedanaṃ cāpi viśeṣeṇa samācaret |
śravaṇādyutsave lupte snapanaṃ tv adhamottamam || 19.651
lupte tu kṛttikādīpe tadanantaramāsi vā |
kurvīta vahninakṣatre snapanaṃ tv adhamottamam || 19.652
dīpotsavaṃ prakurvīta śāntihomapurassaram |
anyeṣv apy utsaveṣv evaṃ lupteṣu munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.653
tadanantaramāse vā tattadutsavavāsare |
ācared utsavaṃ prāgvatsnānahomapurassaram || 19.654
prāyaścittam atho vakṣye pavitrāropaṇe dvijāḥ |
apramāṇe pavitre tv astramantrāyutaṃ japet || 19.655
atīta uktakāle tu cāturmāsyasya madhyataḥ |
madhyamaṃ snāpanaṃ kṛtvā kāle 'nyasmiṃs tadācaret || 19.656
pavitre keśapāṣāṇacarmāṅgāranakhādibhiḥ |
dūṣite vāgninā dagdhe chinne daṣṭe 'tibhakṣite || 19.657
mūṣikādyaiś ca kākādyais spṛṣṭe tyaktvā tu tatpunaḥ |
sūtrais tathāvidhaṃ kṛtvā vidhivac cādhivāsayet || 19.658
evaṃ duṣṭapavitrāṇāṃ mohādāropaṇe kṛte |
tatparityajya deveśam adhamottamamārgataḥ || 19.659
saṃsnāpya hutvā śāntyarthaṃ dadyāc chuddhapavitrakam |
akrameṇa tu devasya pavitrāropaṇe kṛte || 19.660
śāntihomaṃ tadā kṛtvā sahasraṃ japam ācaret |
muhūrte samatikrānte śuddhe yajanavistarāt || 19.661
tadanyasmin vibhor dadyāt pavitraṃ śāntipūrvakam |
pāvitrikī tīrthayātrā na kṛtā cen munīśvarāḥ || 19.662
uttamaṃ snapanaṃ kṛtvā punarutsavam ācaret |
pavitre devadevasyāyogyānāṃ niyojite || 19.663
śāntihomaṃ tadā kṛtvā sahasraṃ japam ācaret |
cāturmāsye tu devasya kurvīta śayanotsavam || 19.664
tadvyatyaye vilope ca catuḥsthānārcanādikam |
japtvā mūlāyutaṃ mantrī śāntyarthaṃ juhuyāt tathā || 19.665
kalaśasthāpanārthaṃ cen na kuryād aṅkurārpaṇam |
tathā pratisaraṃ bandhaṃ mūlamantrāyutaṃ japet || 19.666
punastādaṅkurānarpya badhvā bimbe tu kautukam |
amatyāvā samatyā vā snapanaṃ nācared yadi || 19.667
śāntihomaṃ purā kṛtvā japed aṣṭākṣarāyutam |
kautukāṃkurapūrvaṃ <kautukāṅkurapūrvaṃ> tu punar evābhiṣecayet || 19.668
akṛtvāṃkurayāgaṃ <akṛtvāṅkurayāgaṃ> tu tathā kautukabandhanam |
snāpito yadi deveśaḥ snapanaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 19.669
vidhivac cāṅkurāvāpaṃ kṛtvā kautukabandhanam |
snāpayed dvidhivanmantrī śāntihomapurassaram || 19.670
saṅkalpite <saṃkalpite> tu snapane tv akṛte dviguṇaṃ caret |
nāsāditair dravyahīnaiḥ snāpite 'py evam ācaret || 19.671
sthāpiteṣv atha kumbheṣu hīneṣu sthāpya pūrvavat |
japet kalaśadaivatyaṃ mantram aṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 19.672
samuddhṛteṣu kumbheṣu rikteṣu suṣirādinā |
prāgvadanyaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya japed aṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 19.673
mārjālamūṣikādyais tu spṛṣṭe vā laṃghite <laṅghite> ghaṭe |
keśāsthiloṣṭasaṃspṛṣṭe bhedacchedādikūṣite || 19.674
pipīlikāder gavyādau patane sūtravastrayoḥ |
agnidāhe tathā kumbhe kālamaṇḍaladūṣite || 19.675
taṃ taṃ kumbhaṃ parityajya sthāpya kumbhāntaraṃ punaḥ |
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> kumbhadaivatyaṃ mantram aṣṭottaraṃ japet || 19.676
sthāpite snānakalaśe śvānakukkuṭavāyasaiḥ |
aspṛśyaiś cāpi saṃspṛṣṭe udakyāsūtikādibhiḥ || 19.677
caṇḍālair vā sannikṛṣṭe <saṃnikṛṣṭe> spṛṣṭe sūtakibhir naraiḥ |
sarvān kumbhān parityajya śuddhān saṃsthāpya pūrvavat || 19.678
puṇyāhapūrvakaṃ ceṣṭvā japtvā mūlasahasrakam |
mantraṃ kalaśadaivatyam aṣṭavāraṃ japet pṛthak || 19.679
duṣṭais saṃsnāpite deve punar apy abhiṣecayet |
māhiṣājoṣṭrasambhūtadadhikṣīraghṛtādibhiḥ 
<māhiṣājoṣṭrasaṃbhūtadadhikṣīraghṛtādibhiḥ> || 19.680
māsātītadhṛtair vāpi payobhir dadhisaṃyutaiḥ |
kṣīrayuktaiś ca dadhibhir guḍamiśraiś ca mākṣikaiḥ || 19.681
anyaiś ca saṅkaradravyais <saṃkaradravyais> tathā paryuṣitodakaiḥ |
agālitaiś ca salilais tathā vai palvalodakaiḥ || 19.682
saṃsnāpite tu deveśe punar apy abhiṣecayet |
śāntihomaṃ ca kurvīta tattaddoṣapraśāntaye || 19.683
adhivāsitakumbhasthatoyānāṃ pūrvam eva tu |
na paryuṣitadoṣo 'sty adhivāsais tathārcanaiḥ || 19.684
anarcane ca kumbhānām akrameṇa samarcane |
akrameṇa samuddhāre sthāpane dravyayojane || 19.685
dravye nyūne 'dhikevāpi śarāve kalaśe tathā |
kūrce vastre tathā koṣṭhe pīṭhādau toraṇādike || 19.686
pramāṇarahite dhānyapīṭhābhāve munīśvarāḥ |
sūtravastrādyabhāve ca śatavāraṃ japen manum || 19.687
geyamaṅgalavāditrastotranṛttādibhir vinā |
vīṇāveṇuninādaiś ca tathā puṇyāhavācanaiḥ || 19.688
vinābhiṣecane mūlam aṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
mokṣārthī snāpayed devaṃ sarvakālaṃ yathāvidhi || 19.689
ripūṇāṃ nigrahārthī tu divā kuryāt tu sarvadā |
svargakāmas tu pūrvāhṇe dharmārthī dinamadhyame || 19.690
dinānte sarvabhogārthī prāyaścitteṣu sarvadā |
candrasūryoparāge ca tatkāle snāpayet prabhum || 19.691
saṃkrāntiṣu ca sūryasya prāgvatpaścāt tathaiva ca |
saṃkrāntikālā vijñeyā nāḍyaḥ ṣoḍaśa ṣoḍaśa || 19.692
tadānīṃ snāpayed devam atikrānte hunen manum |
sahasrakṛtvas tadanu tatsamañjasam ācaret || 19.693
baddhapratisare bimbe snapanārthaṃ tu mantriṇā |
samprāpte <saṃprāpte> snapane 'nyasmin prāyaścittanimittataḥ || 19.694
tadarthaṃ kautukaṃ badhvā snānakarma samāpya ca |
pūrvārabdhaṃ prakurvīta prāyaścittādanantaram || 19.695
anyatra kramaśaḥ kuryāt pūrvārabdhaṃ samāpya ca |
anyathā ced idaṃ karma niṣphalaṃ bhavati dvijāḥ || 19.696
taddoṣaparihārārthaṃ śāntihomo japas tathā |
sahasrasaṃkhyayā yukto mūlamantreṇa mantravit || 19.697
vināvabhṛthakālaṃ tu devamālayato bahiḥ |
snāpayed yadi saṃmohāc chāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.698
bahubere 'bhiṣekārcāṃ tāṃ gṛhītvāgramaṇṭapāt |
na gacched bāhyato mantrī snapanārthaṃ bahirgate || 19.699
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta tasya doṣasya śāntaye |
bimbe 'bhiṣicyamāne tu patite snānaviṣṭarāt || 19.700
pratiṣṭhāsnapanaṃ kṛtvā śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
snānakāle viśeṣeṇa bimbasya calane dvijāḥ || 19.701
calane snānavedyāś ca śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
prabhāpīṭhāstravastrāṅgabhedabhaṅgadidūṣite || 19.702
tattadbimbagatāṃ śaktiṃ niyojya dhṛtakautuke |
sandhānaṃ <saṃdhānaṃ> śilpibhiḥ kṛtvā susaṃskṛtya tadaiva tu || 19.703
śeṣakarmaṇi nivṛtte snāpayed uttamakramāt |
tilena caruṇājyena pratyekañ ca sahasraśaḥ || 19.704
juhuyān mūlamantreṇa tena śāntir bhaviṣyati |
tadā na ghaṭituṃ śaktir yadi syād yatnagauravāt || 19.705
śobhārthabimbe purataḥ sthāpite śeṣam ācaret |
evam utsavatīrthārthaśayanādiṣu mūrtiṣu || 19.706
tattadaṅgādisandhānaṃ <tattadaṅgādisaṃdhānaṃ> sthāpanaṃ yojanaṃ punaḥ |
kṣmāparigrahakāle tu durnimittodaye dvijāḥ || 19.707
śāntihomaṃ purā kṛtvā sahasraṃ japam ācaret |
tathaiva kṣetramānārthaṃ sūtraṃ yat saṃprasāritam || 19.708
vicchede tasya sūtrasya śaṅkūnāṃ vā vidāraṇe |
bhūtānāṃ balikāle tu patite balipātrake || 19.709
bhūtale khanyamāne tu bhasmāṅgāratuṣādike |
krimikīṭādike vāpi dṛṣṭe tacchāntaye dvijāḥ || 19.710
nārasiṃhena mantreṇa tilairājyaiḥ sahasraśaḥ |
huned ācāryavaraṇam akṛtvā kṣmāparigraham || 19.711
mandire nirmite viprā brāhmaṇānām anujñayā |
śāntihomapuraskan tu kṣmāparigraham ācaret || 19.712
bālasthānam akṛtvaiva mandire nirmite dvijāḥ |
mūlārcāsthāpanāt pūrvaṃ yajamānānvito guruḥ || 19.713
ravimaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃ devaṃ sampūjya <saṃpūjya> bhaktitaḥ |
onnamaḥ puṇḍarīkākṣa bhaktānugrahakāraka || 19.714
kṣantum arhasi deveśa yanmayāpy akṛtaṃ kṛtam |
iti praṇamya deveśaṃ vāsasthānaṃ yathāvidhi || 19.715
nirmāya tatra devaṃ tu pratiṣṭhāpya samarcayet |
khātapradeśe prāsādabhūmadhye munisattamāḥ || 19.716
vinā prāsādanirmāṇe kumbhasaṃsthāpanādikam |
brāhmaṇān samanujñāpya khātvā prāsādamadhyataḥ || 19.717
tatra kumbhasthāpanādi yathāsambhavam <yathāsaṃbhavam> ācaret |
śāntihomaṃ ca kurvīta sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.718
garbhanyāse 'pi na kṛte tathā garbhaṃ ca vinyaset |
āyaśuddhyādihīne vā prāsāde lakṣaṇojjhite || 19.719
yathāśāstraṃ punaḥ kṛtvā śānihomaṃ samācaret |
na sthāpite śikhākumbhe prāsāde cāpratiṣṭhite || 19.720
tattatkarma punaḥ kuryāc chāntihomapurassaram |
prākāramaṇṭapādīnāṃ gopurādes tathā dvijāḥ || 19.721
akṛte sthāpane śāntipūrvaṃ tattatsamācaret |
dārulohaśilādīnāṃ saṃgrahāvasare <saṅgrahāvasare> dvijāḥ || 19.722
durnimittodaye caiva tathā dusvapnadarśane |
nārasiṃhena mantreṇa tilājyais tu sahasraśaḥ || 19.723
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta sarvadoṣapraśāntaye |
dārulohaśilāmṛtsnāvastrādīnāṃ parigrahe || 19.724
tattadaṅgatayodīrṇadravyamantrakriyādiṣu |
paricyuteṣu tatkuryāc chāntihomajapādikam || 19.725
akṛte parvatādau tu dārvādīnāṃ parigrahe |
ānītasyālayakṣetre śilpibhiḥ satkriyāṃ vinā || 19.726
yathāvad ācared vidvānarcādravyasya saṅgraham |
vinaiva saṃgrahaṃ <saṅgrahaṃ> karmabimbādau nirmite sati || 19.727
paścād api ca tat kuryāc chāntihomapurassaram |
bimbapīṭhaśilādīnāṃ mānonmānādilakṣaṇe || 19.728
rahite śāntihomaṃ tu kuryāt taddoṣaśāntaye |
bimbapīṭhaśilānāṃ tu vyatyaste puṃśilādike || 19.729
tattattyaktvā punaḥ kuryād yathoktaśilayā dvijāḥ |
nirmitā pratimā śīghraṃ svagṛhe na niveśitā || 19.730
rājño rāṣṭrasya tatkartur aniṣṭam upapādayet |
ekaviṃśaddinād ūrdhvam āsurī sā bhaved dhruvam || 19.731
kṛtvā mahābhiṣekādyaṃ sthāpayed anyathā tyajet |
jalādhivāse snapane tathā nayanamokṣaṇe || 19.732
śayane vedikāyāṃ ca mantranyāsādikarmasu |
kumbhamaṇḍalapūjāyāṃ dvāratoraṇakumbhayoḥ || 19.733
home pīṭhādisaṃskāre 'kṛte vānyathā kṛte |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta sahasrāhutisaṃkhyayā || 19.734
mūlamantrāyutajapaṃ śatabrāhmaṇabhojanam |
asthāne sthāpite bimbe pādādhāraśilānvitam || 19.735
tadānīm eva coddhṛtya sthāpayet taṃ svake pade |
uttamasnapanaṃ kṛtvā śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.736
na sthāpite muhūrte 'smin na tadā bimbam uddharet |
pūrvavatsnapane home kṛte śāntir bhaviṣyati || 19.737
sthāpane 'dhikṛte mukhye deśike vyādhite sati |
nyastadehe 'thavā madhye vartamāne kriyākrame || 19.738
kriyāmantropadeṣṭā ca pratiṣṭhākarmaṇi sthitaḥ |
putro vā deśikendrasya sthāpane śeṣam ācaret || 19.739
ante sahasrakalaśair abhiṣicya sureśvaram |
cakrāṃburuhakuṇḍe <cakrāmburuhakuṇḍe> tu madhukṣīrādibhiḥ kramāt || 19.740
śāntyarthaṃ madhunā hutvā tatsaṃkhyaṃ japam ācaret |
pratiṣṭhākarmakālādāv ācāryayajamānayoḥ || 19.741
ṛtvigācāryayor vāpi saṃjāte kalahe dvijāḥ |
karma niṣphalatāṃ yāti śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 19.742
namaskṛtyābhyarcya guruṃ kṣamyatām iti coccaret |
doṣāṇām evamādīnāṃ sambhave <saṃbhave> 'pi munīśvarāḥ || 19.743
tattacchāntiṃ prakurvīta śāntihomajapādibhiḥ |

munayaḥ
prāyaścittāny aśeṣāṇi śrutāni munipuṅgava || 19.744
tatra tatra tvayā proktaṃ karma saṃprokṣaṇābhidham |
grāmaśāntividhiś cāpi śāntihomaś ca bhūyaśaḥ || 19.745
tadvidhānādikaṃ sarvaṃ jñātum icchāmahe mune |

nāradaḥ
samprokṣaṇavidhānādīn <saṃprokṣaṇavidhānādīn> vakṣyāmi munisattamāḥ || 
19.746
śṛṇudhvam adhunā sarve sāvadhānena cetasā |
bimbapīṭhavimānānāṃ bhagnāṅge tu samāhite || 19.747
pratimāpīṭhayor aṣṭabandhane tu punaḥ kṛte |
āśaucavadbhir manujair mahāpātakabhir naraiḥ || 19.748
caṇḍālodakyādibhiś ca mlecchair vā phulkasādibhiḥ |
devabimbe tu saṃspṛṣṭe caṇḍālaśvapacādibhiḥ || 19.749
nirantaraṃ tv ekamāsamālaye samadhiṣṭhite |
caṇḍālaśvapacādīnāṃ pramādād bhagavadgṛhe || 19.750
karmaṇy adhikṛtau tais tu sahavāse 'pi ca dvijāḥ |
bimbe prāsādabhāge vā śavaiḥ spṛṣṭe dvijottamāḥ || 19.751
bimbe valmīkaśithilīsaraghāṇāṃ samudbhave |
bimbe tv aśanisaṃspṛṣṭe prāsāde vā munīśvarāḥ || 19.752
bimbasya hasane caiva calane rodane tathā |
patane bhramaṇe caiva svedaraktādisambhave <svedaraktādisaṃbhave> || 19.753
kampane ca tathā viprā raktavarṣādisambhave <raktavarṣādisaṃbhave> |
ārādhane ca vicchinne māsād ūrdhvaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 19.754
saṃhitāsaṅkare <saṃhitāsaṃkare> caiva tathā siddhāntasaṅkare 
<siddhāntasaṃkare> |
bhūgupte coddhṛte bimbe māsād ūrdhvaṃ dvijottamāḥ || 19.755
samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> prakurvīta tattaddoṣapraśāntaye |
doṣair upahataṃ jñātvā prāsādapratimādikam || 19.756
asamprokṣyārcanaṃ <asaṃprokṣyārcanaṃ> kurvan rājānaṃ rāṣṭramañjasā |
devatāyatanaṃ grāmaṃ nāśayen nātra saṃśayaḥ || 19.757
tasmāt samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> kāryaṃ prāsādapratimādiṣu |
purā samprokṣaṇadinaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇadinaṃ> rājarāṣṭrābhivṛddhidam || 19.758
niścayīkṛtya kālajñaiḥ purastāduktavāsare |
aṅkurān arpya vidhivatpaścātsaṃśodhite gṛhe || 19.759
sarvatra gomayāmbhobhiḥ puṇyāhoktipurassaram |
samprokṣya <saṃprokṣya> pañcabhir gavyaiḥ kuśodakasamanvitaiḥ || 19.760
mūlaberādibimbānāṃ ṣaḍbhis siddhārthakādibhiḥ |
pavitrārtitair adbhir bahuśaḥ kṣālane kṛte || 19.761
pradhānadinapūrvasyāṃ rātrau yāgādimaṇṭape |
toraṇadvārakalaśe vitānadhvajaśobhite || 19.762
dīkṣādhivāsavat kṛtvā kumbhe vai maṇṭapasthale |
pūjanaṃ vibhavenaiva japāntaṃ mūlamandire || 19.763
kṣīrādyaiḥ pañcaviṃśadbhiḥ snāpayed dhruvakautukam |
lepabhittipaṭasthasya purastād bhadraviṣṭare || 19.764
karmārcām athavā kūrcadarpaṇe pratibimbitam |
saṃsnāpya vidhivatkumbhaiḥ sthāpitair agramaṇṭape || 19.765
utsavārcādibimbānām aṅgānām āśrayātmanām |
pūjanaṃ snapanaṃ kāryaṃ pāścātye yāgamaṇṭape || 19.766
tatrasthe havanaṃ kuṇḍe śaṅkhacakrādilakṣaṇe |
madhukṣīrādibhiḥ kāryaṃ sahasraśatasaṃkhyayā || 19.767
karmabimbaṃ vinānyeṣāṃ bimbānām aṅgarūpiṇām |
dakṣiṇe maṇṭapasyātha śayane kalpayen mahat || 19.768
tilataṇḍulaśālīnāṃ bhārair vastrādibhiḥ saha |
tadūrdhve śāyayed arcāṃ vidhivadbaddhakautukām || 19.769
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> kaṃbalādyaiś <kambalādyaiś> ca chādayet tāṃ sitādibhiḥ 
|
varṇakair maṇḍalaṃ kuryāc cakrāṃburuhabhūṣitam <cakrāmburuhabhūṣitam> || 
19.770
yāvatprabhātasamayaṃ bimbasthasya samīpataḥ |
deśiko mūlamantrasya japenaiva nayen niśām || 19.771
prabhātāyāṃ tu śarvaryāṃ kṛtasandhyāvidhir <kṛtasaṃdhyāvidhir> guruḥ |
catuḥsthānārcanaṃ kṛtvā pūrvavatsnapanānvitam || 19.772
pūrṇāhutyādikaṃ sarvaṃ vidhāya tu yathāvidhi |
kuṇḍasthaṃ maṇḍalasthañ ca devaṃ hṛdi visṛjya ca || 19.773
udvāsya dvāradevāṃś ca balidānapurassaram |
muhūrte śobhane prāpte navavastrapariṣkṛtam || 19.774
sottarīyopavītaṃ ca kṛtakautukabandhanam |
samastatattvavinyastam abhyarcyārghyādibhiḥ kramāt || 19.775
tāsu svahṛdayāmbhojāt puṣpāñ jalipurassaram |
agrāhyam aparicchedyam amūrtam amalaṃ mahat || 19.776
nityaśuddhamanaupamyaṃ susūkṣmam acalaṃ sphuṭam |
saccidrūpaṃ tv asāmānyaṃ bhāsvaraṃ sudṛḍhaṃ mahat || 19.777
tejas tu saṃkramayyātha daṇḍavatpraṇipatya tu |
vinivedya vibhoḥ sarvaṃ kṛtaṃ karma dvijottamāḥ || 19.778
utthāpyotsavabimbādīn pūrvavanmaṅgalaiḥ saha |
mahākumbhaṃ ca purato vāhayan mūrtipādibhiḥ || 19.779
karakāstraṃ samādāya tv ācāryaḥ purato vrajet |
śalākāmātrayācchinnadhārayā secayan bhuvam || 19.780
prādakṣiṇyena dhāmāntaḥ praveśya munipuṅgavāḥ |
mahotsavoktamārgeṇa kumbhaprokṣaṇam ācaret || 19.781
dvārāvaraṇadevāṃś cālayāśrayavartinaḥ |
khageśaviṣvaksenādīn parivārāṃś ca sarvaśaḥ || 19.782
kumbhāvaśiṣṭatoyena prokṣayet sarvataḥ kramāt |
avaśiṣṭaṃ kumbhatoyaṃ balipīṭhe 'bhiṣecayet || 19.783
evaṃ saṃprokṣya vidhivatprāsādāntaḥ praviśya ca |
karasthaṃ kautukaṃ cātha hṛdayena visṛjya tu || 19.784
gobhūhemādikaṃ datvā sarvadoṣapraśāntaye |
devam arghyādinābhyarcya havirantaṃ viśeṣataḥ || 19.785
brāhmaṇān bhojayet paścātsahasraṃ śatam eva vā |
sadyo vā sakalaṃ tv evaṃ kuryāt samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> vibhoḥ || 19.786
puṣpāṅkurapuraskan tu tattaddoṣapraśāntaye |
na tithir na ca nakṣatraṃ kālavelā na vidyate || 19.787
sadyaḥ samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> viprā niśi vā divase 'pi vā |
prāyaścittavilambe tu kuryāt kālanirīkṣaṇam || 19.788
iti samprokṣaṇaṃ <saṃprokṣaṇaṃ> proktaṃ sarvaṃ cāpi dvijottamāḥ |
prāyaścittaṃ tu vai kuryāt sañjāte <saṃjāte> tannimittake || 19.789
tattadaivātha karmānte tridinābhyantare 'pi vā |
tadgurutvānuguṇyena pañcasaptadināntare || 19.790
tadārambhasamāptir vā hy anyathā dviguṇaṃ caret |
prāyaścittaṃ tu sarvatra svayaṃvyaktādike sthale || 19.791
athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi grāmaśāntividhiṃ dvijāḥ |
rājyakṣobhāvasāne ca śūnye grāme ca hetunā || 19.792
grāme ca vahninā dagdhe vātyāsārādidūṣite |
punaḥ samāhite raktamadhuvarṣādisambhave <raktamadhuvarṣādisaṃbhave> || 19.793
grāme bahubrahmavadhe tathā govadhasambhave <govadhasaṃbhave> |
caṇḍālaśabarādyais tu grāme bahudinoṣite || 19.794
mahāmāryādirogeṇa saṃghātamarādike |
grāmaśāntiṃ prakurvīta sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.795
tadgrāme muniśārdūlāḥ sarvatraikatra vā kṣitim |
khātvā mṛdaṃ samuddhṛtya bahiḥ prakṣipya śuddhayā || 19.796
sampūrya <saṃpūrya> ca samīkṛtya kuśādbhiḥ parimṛjya ca |
paryagnikaraṇaṃ vipraiḥ kārayitvā samantataḥ || 19.797
saṃsicya gomayāmbhobhiḥ puṇyāhodghoṣapūrvakam |
pañcagavyena cābhyukṣya gogaṇaṃ tatra vāsayet || 19.798
vācayitvā mahāśāntiṃ brāhmaṇair vedapāragaiḥ |
bhojayitvā dvijāṃs tatra tebhyo dadyāt tu dakṣiṇām || 19.799
kṛtvaivaṃ sthalasaṃśuddhiṃ śāntiṃ kuryād anukramāt |
devagehapurobhāge bahirdvārasya sannidhau <saṃnidhau> || 19.800
maṇṭapaṃ kārayet pūrvaṃ caturdvārādisaṃyutam |
tanmadhye vedikāṃ kuryād ūrdhvakuṇḍasamanvitām || 19.801
paritaḥ kalpayet kuṇḍān aṣṭau vā caturo 'pi vā |
madhyakuṇḍe 'pi vā sarvaṃ homaṃ kuryād dvijottamāḥ || 19.802
sarvāṃś ca yāgasambhārān <yāgasaṃbhārān> sambhṛtya <saṃbhṛtya> 
susamāhitaḥ |
niśāmukhe pravṛtte tu kṛtasnānaḥ kṛtāhnikaḥ || 19.803
devagehaṃ samāsādya ṛtvigbhiḥ saha deśikaḥ |
devadevaṃ samabhyarcya tadanujñāpurassaram || 19.804
sarvaiḥ parijanaiḥ sārthaṃ yāgagehaṃ praviśya tu |
dvārakumbhādikāṃs tatra parikalpya yathāvidhi || 19.805
vedikordhve tu kuṇḍasya dakṣiṇe karakānvitam |
mahākumbhaṃ ca vinyasya vāme śāntighaṭaṃ nyaset || 19.806
karaśuddhyādikaṃ sarvaṃ kṛtvā hṛdyāgapaścimam |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu sambhārān <saṃbhārān> prokṣya kṛtsnaśaḥ || 19.807
dvārārcanapuraskan tu mahākumbhe yathāvidhi |
abhyarcya devam arghyādyair havirantais tathāstrapam || 19.808
parito vāsudevādīn tataḥ śāntighaṭe dvijāḥ |
śāntiṃ puṣṭiṃ ca tuṣṭiṃ ca samabhyarcya yathāvidhi || 19.809
vāstudevagaṇāṃś cāpi tatraiva paripūjayet |
tadaṣṭadikṣu kumbheṣu kumudādīn samarcayet || 19.810
athordhvakuṇḍe vidhivatpratiṣṭhāpya hutāśanam |
tatra devaṃ tu santarpya <saṃtarpya> samidbhiḥ saptabhiḥ kramāt || 19.811
aṣṭottarasahasrākhyasaṃkhyayā saghṛtais tilaiḥ |
tarpayitvā tu śāntyartham uddhṛtyāgnigaṇaṃ tataḥ || 19.812
dikkuṇḍeṣu vinikṣipya vidikkuṇḍeṣu ca kramāt |
prāgādidikṣu caturo ṛtvijaḥ sanniveśya <saṃniveśya> tu || 19.813
vāsudevādibhir mantraiḥ samitsaptakapūrvakam |
sahasrasaṃkhyayā devān tarpayet saghṛtais tilaiḥ || 19.814
evam apy ayogena vāyvādīśāvasānakam |
ṛgvedādyāṃś ca caturaḥ sanniveśya <saṃniveśya> yathākramam || 19.815
taiś cāpi vaiṣṇavaiḥ sūktaiḥ śāntisūktaiś ca pāvanaiḥ |
sahasrasaṃkhyayā sājyatilahomaṃ tu kārayet || 19.816
śāntiṃ puṣṭiṃ ca tuṣṭiṃ ca vāstudevagaṇāṃs tathā |
kumudādigaṇāṃś cāpi madhyakuṇḍe yathākramam || 19.817
pratyekam aṣṭāhutibhis tarpayed ghṛtadhārayā |
brahmā marīciratriś ca vivasvān pṛthivīśvaraḥ || 19.818
citraś caivāpavatsaś ca sandhitā <saṃdhitā> ca savitrakaḥ |
rudro rudrajayaś caiva indra indrajayas tathā || 19.819
īśaś caivātha parjanyo jayantaś ca mahendrakaḥ |
bhānuḥ satyo bhṛguś caivāntarikṣaś ca pūrvakaḥ || 19.820
agniḥ pūṣā kṛśo bhānur guhaḥ kṣetrādhipas tathā |
gandharvo bhṛṅgarājaś ca mṛtyuś caiva tathāntakaḥ || 19.821
pitṛdauvārikaś caiva sugrīvaḥ puṣpadantakaḥ |
varuṇaś ca bhṛśaś cāpo yakṣamāsamanoja?vaḥ || 19.822
yogo nāgaś ca mṛtyanto bhallāṭaḥ soma eva ca |
aditir vāstunāthaś ca grāmavāstugaṇāḥ smṛtāḥ || 19.823
etāṃs tu svasvanāmnaiva svāhāntena hunet kramāt |
grāmāśritāṃs tathādevān nagarāśritadevatāḥ || 19.824
bhūpālāśritadevāṃś ca caityaprāsādadevatāḥ |
udyānopavanasthāṃś ca parvatadrumasaṃsthitān || 19.825
sarvān adhyāgatān devān tarpayed ghṛtadhārayā |
sampātājyaṃ <saṃpātājyaṃ> tu saṃgṛhya śāntikumbhe tu secayet || 19.826
kumbhasthaṃ devadevaṃ tu punarabhyarcya deśikaḥ |
gehādigrāmamadhyāntaṃ balidānaṃ samācaret || 19.827
rātriśeṣaṃ samāpyātha prabhāte deśikottamaḥ |
nityakarmāṇi nirvartya gatvā vai yāgamandiram || 19.828
dvārārcanapuraskan tu mahākumbhādiṣu sthitān |
devānarghyādibhir bhogair havirantaṃ yajet kramāt || 19.829
tatas tu mūrtipaiḥ sārdhaṃ madhyakuṇḍādiṣu kramāt |
devaṃ santarpya <saṃtarpya> vidhinā pūrvoktena munīśvarāḥ || 19.830
pūrṇāhutyādikaṃ sarvaṃ vidhāya ca yathāvidhi |
agnimadhyasthitaṃ devaṃ visṛjya svahṛdi kramāt || 19.831
dvāradevān visṛjyātha balidānapurassaram |
mahākumbhādikān sarvān vāhayan mūrtipādibhiḥ || 19.832
paṭhadbhiḥ śāntisūktāni brāhmaṇaiḥ saha deśikaḥ |
śaṃkhādimaṅgalaravair <śaṅkhādimaṅgalaravair> ghaṇṭāravasamanvitaiḥ || 
19.833
devagehaṃ samāsādya devam arghyādibhir yajet |
puṃsūktena prokṣayet taṃ mahākumbhasthatoyataḥ || 19.834
prāsādadvāram ārabhya balipīṭhāntimaṃ kramāt |
kumbhāvaśiṣṭatoyena prokṣayet pūrvavaddvijāḥ || 19.835
śāntikumbhajalenātha śāntisūktaiḥ samantataḥ |
grāmaṃ saṃprokṣayed viprāḥ sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.836
tato gehaṃ samāsādya sampūjya <saṃpūjya> puruṣottamam |
mahāhavir nivedyātha homāntaṃ sarvam ācaret || 19.837
tatas tu balibimbaṃ tu yānam āropya deśikaḥ |
nityotsavavidhānena yātropakaraṇaiḥ saha || 19.838
dvārāvaraṇadevānāṃ baliṃ datvā viśeṣataḥ |
kumudādibaliṃ dadyād grāme 'pi ca yathāvidhi || 19.839
balibimbaṃ tato 'bhyarcya svasthāne sanniveśya <saṃniveśya> tu |
mūlabimbaṃ samabhyarcya praṇipatya kṣamāpayet || 19.840
gobhūhemādikaṃ dadyāt tatkāle sarvaśāntaye |
ācāryaṛtvigādīṃś ca dakṣiṇābhiḥ pratoṣayet || 19.841
brāhmaṇān bhojayet paścātsahasraṃ śatam eva vā |
tebhyaś ca dakṣiṇāṃ dadyād rājarāṣṭrasukhāvahaḥ || 19.842
grāmaśāntividhis tv eṣa kathito munipuṅgavāḥ |
athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi śāntihomavidhikramam || 19.843
sarvadoṣapraśamanaṃ sarvacchidraprapūraṇam |
sarvaiśvaryapradaṃ n�ṇāṃ sarvāriṣṭavināśanam || 19.844
kartuḥ kārayituś caiva prajānāṃ vāṃchitapradam <vāñchitapradam> |
ativṛṣṭāvanāvṛṣṭau durbhikṣe rogasambhave <rogasaṃbhave> || 19.845
dussvapnādau durnimitte mahotpāteṣu satsu ca |
ārādhanāṅgavakalye galite cotsavāṅgake || 19.846
pratiṣṭhāsnapanādīnām aṅgavaikalyasambhave <aṅgavaikalyasaṃbhave> |
bimbopakaraṇādīnām aspṛśyasparśanādike || 19.847
pūrvokteṣu nimitteṣu sarveṣu munipuṅgavāḥ |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta tattaddoṣapraśāntaye || 19.848
prāsādasyāgrato vāpi prathamāvaraṇādike |
tadarthaṃ maṇṭapaṃ kuryāc caturdvārasamanvitam || 19.849
yadvā pūrvaṃ kṛte viprāḥ kutra cinmaṇṭapādike |
yāgārthamandire vāpi pacanālaya eva vā || 19.850
goṣṭhāgārādike vāpy udyānopavanādiṣu |
dvihastam ekahastaṃ vā vṛttaṃ vā caturaśrakam || 19.851
kuṇḍaṃ prakalpayed yadvā sthaṇḍile homam ācaret |
kuṇḍasya dakṣiṇe pārśve dhānyapīṭhe salakṣaṇam || 19.852
sopakumbhaṃ sakarakaṃ mahākumbhaṃ tu vinyaset |
śāntikumbhaṃ ca tatpārśve vinyasya tu salakṣaṇam || 19.853
kṛtvā mānasayāgāntaṃ karaśudhyādikaṃ dvijāḥ |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvātha sambhārān <saṃbhārān> prokṣya kṛtsnaśaḥ || 19.854
arghyādīn parikalpyātha dvārārcanapurassaram |
mahākumbhe yogapīṭhaṃ parikalpya yathāvidhi || 19.855
tatrāvāhya nṛsiṃhaṃ tu sarvadoṣapraśāntidam |
sakalīkṛtya vidhivallayabhogādikaṃ kramāt || 19.856
kṛtvāsanādibhir bhogair havirantaṃ samarcayet |
sudarśanaṃ ca karake prāgādikalaśeṣu ca || 19.857
vāsudevādikāṃ ceṣṭvā prabhavāpyayayogataḥ |
śāntiṃ puṣṭiṃ ca tuṣṭiṃ ca śāntikumbhe samarcayet || 19.858
kuṇḍaṃ saṃskṛtya tatrāgniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya yathāvidhi |
tatrāpi nṛhariṃ devaṃ samāvāhya yathāvidhi || 19.859
samidbhiḥ saptabhiś cāpi santarpyātha <saṃtarpyātha> svamantrataḥ |
viśeṣeṇa huned doṣaśāntyarthaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 19.860
oṃ kṣrauṃ namaś cetimantrasaṃyuktenādito dvijāḥ |
oṃnamobhagavate nārasaṃhāyety anena tu || 19.861
etaddoṣaṃ jahijahi svāhetyantena deśikaḥ |
madhvājyakṣīrasaṃmiśrān saphalāṃs tu tilān dvijā || 19.862
śataṃ sahasraṃ sāṣṭaṃ vā yathāśakty athavā hunet |
pālāśaṃ khādiraṃ caiva bilbam audumbaraṃ tathā || 19.863
aśvatthaplakṣanthagrodhamapāmārgam iti dvijāḥ |
samidhām aṣṭakaṃ kḷptaṃ madhukṣīrānvitair ghṛtaiḥ || 19.864
aṣṭākṣareṇa juhuyāt pṛthagaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
dvādaśākṣaramantreṇa kevalājyaṃ hunet tathā || 19.865
ṣaḍakṣareṇa mantreṇa tilaṃ sājyaṃ hunec chatam |
bījāni viṣṇugāyatryā hutvā cāṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 19.866
caruṃ puruṣasūktena juhuyād deśikottamaḥ |
kṛtvātha sviṣṭakṛddhomaṃ prāyaścittāhutīs tathā || 19.867
nārasiṃhena mantreṇa dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ tataḥ |
sampātājyaṃ <saṃpātājyaṃ> samādāya secayet kumbhamadhyataḥ || 19.868
punaḥ kumbhe sthitaṃ devaṃ samabhyarcya yathāvidhi |
śāntikumbhaṃ tu saṃspṛṣṭvā brāhmaṇaiḥ saha deśikaḥ || 19.869
nārasiṃhena mantreṇa śāntisūktaiś ca mantrayet |
tataś ca dvāradevebhyo baliṃ dadyād yathāvidhi || 19.870
evaṃ pūrvadine rātrau kṛtvā deśikasattamaḥ |
paredyuḥ prātar utthāya kṛtasnānaḥ kṛtāhnikaḥ || 19.871
iṣṭvā kumbhasthitaṃ devaṃ santarpyāgnau <saṃtarpyāgnau> yathāvidhi |
dravyaiḥ pūrvoditaiś cāpy aṣṭāviṃśatisaṃkhyayā || 19.872
pūrṇāhutiṃ ca kṛtvātha visṛjyāgnisthitaṃ vibhum |
visṛjya dvāradvāṃś ca balidānapurassaram || 19.873
mahākumbhaṃ śāntukumbhaṃ bāhayan brāhmaṇaiḥ saha |
vedaghoṣair vādyaghoṣair ghaṇṭāravasamanvitaiḥ || 19.874
āsādya devasadanaṃ samabhyarcya jagatprabhum |
puṃsūktena mahākumbhatoyena prokṣayed vibhum || 19.875
śāntikumbhajalenātha devaṃ vā mandirādikam |
sarvopakaraṇaṃ vāpi dūṣitaṃ doṣaśāntaye || 19.876
prokṣayec chāntisūktena doṣaśāntir bhaviṣyati |
yajamāno guruṃ paścāt toṣayed dakṣiṇādibhiḥ || 19.877
sadyaḥkāle 'pi vā hy evaṃ tattaddoṣānusārataḥ |
śāntihomaṃ prakurvīta sarvadoṣapraśāntaye || 19.878
kumbhārcanaṃ vinā vāpi kevakaṃ homam ācaret |
mahotsavādyutsaveṣu pratiṣṭhāsnapanādike || 19.879
tattatkarmāṅgabhūte 'gnau śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
iti sarvaṃ samākhyātaṃ kim anyac chrotum icchatha || 19.880

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
prāyaścittavidhir nāma
ekonaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha viṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
bhagavanmuniśārdūla sarvaśāstraviśārada |
bhavatā tatra tatreha svayaṃvyaktādibhedataḥ || 20.1
viśeṣaḥ kīrtitaḥ pūrvaṃ jīrṇoddhārādikarmasu |
kiṃ kiṃ bhuvi svayaṃvyaktaṃ mahattvaṃ tasya kīdṛśam || 20.2
tatsarvaṃ vistareṇaiva prakāśaya dayānidhe |

nāradaḥ
svayaṃvyaktādibhedaṃ ca tanmāhātmyaṃ ca kṛtsnaśaḥ |
pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ tatsāvadhānena cetasā || 20.3
kṣetreṣu puṣkarādyeṣu vāsudevo jagatpatiḥ |
svayaṃ vyaktiṃ samabhyetya bhaktānāṃ hitakāmyayā || 20.4
sthitaḥ sannihito <saṃnihito> devaḥ svayaṃvyakto munīśvarāḥ |
kṣetreṣu keṣucid devaḥ sthāpito devattottamaiḥ || 20.5
tathaiva keṣucit siddhaiḥ keṣucid ṛṣipuṅgavaiḥ |
gandharvaiś cāpi yakṣaiś ca tathāvidyādharottamaiḥ || 20.6
asurai rākṣasaiś caiva manujendraiś ca keṣu cit |
sthāpito vidhivaddevaḥ sannidhatte <saṃnidhatte> jagatprabhuḥ || 20.7
evaṃ bhagavadākārair nānāsaṃsthānalakṣaṇaiḥ |
nānāviśeṣarūpaiś ca nānākāryavaśena tu || 20.8
viśvam āpūritaṃ sarvaṃ sarvānugrahakāmyayā |
bhagavadbhaktiniratair manujendraiḥ pratiṣṭhitāt || 20.9
māhātmyaṃ syād daśaguṇaṃ rākṣasendrapratiṣṭhite |
tataḥ śataguṇaṃ proktam asuraiḥ sthāpite vibhau || 20.10
sahasraguṇitaṃ proktaṃ vidyādharakṛte dvijāḥ |
tato daśaguṇaṃ viprā māhātmyaṃ yakṣakalpite || 20.11
tato daśaguṇaṃ proktaṃ gandharvaiś ca pratiṣṭhite |
ārṣe koṭiguṇaṃ proktaṃ saiddhe daśaguṇaṃ tataḥ || 20.12
koṭikoṭiguṇaṃ divye svayaṃvyakte munīśvarāḥ |
māhātmyaṃ syād asaṃkhyātam iti śāstreṣu niścitam || 20.13
tat syād dvedhā svayaṃvyaktabimbaṃ bhagavato vibhoḥ |
sālagrāmaśilārūpair itarais tu śilādibhiḥ || 20.14
ubhayatra samānaṃ syād dhareḥ sānnidhyam uttamam |
sālagrāmaśilābimbe tattanmūrtivinirṇayam? || 20.15
tattadvyavasthitaiś cihnair jñātvā kāryaṃ samarcanam? |
kṣetreṣu puṣkarādyeṣu svayam eva jagatpatiḥ || 20.16
arcārūpeṇāvatīrya vyaktaiś cakrādilāṃchanaiḥ <cakrādilāñchanaiḥ> |
samanvitaḥ sannidhatte <saṃnidhatte> bhaktānāṃ hitakāmyayā || 20.17
tattatkṣetrasthitān devān pravakṣyāmi munīśvarāḥ |
yaj jñātvā manujo loke sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate? || 20.18
puṣkaraṃ kṣetram āśritya puṇḍarīkākṣasaṃjñayā |
vāsudevas tu bhagavān nityaṃ sannihitaḥ <saṃnihitaḥ> sthitaḥ? || 20.19
evaṃ kṣetravare divye śrīraṅge naimiśāhvaye |
kṣetreṣv anyeṣu ca tathā vāsudevādisaṃjñayā || 20.20
caturmūrtisthito devo lokarakṣaṇahetunā |
keśavaḥ keśihā loke kurukṣetrādiṣu sthitaḥ || 20.21
nārāyaṇo muniśreṣṭhāḥ sthito nārāyaṇācale |
mādhavo veṅkaṭagirau govindaḥ puruṣottamaḥ || 20.22
bhūbhāgapadam āśritya saṃsthito nābhasāhvaye |
sthāne bṛndāvanākhye 'pi? dvidhaiva kamalodbhava || 20.23
viṣṇur lobhāpahe viprāḥ sthito viṣṇupade 'pi ca |
mandarākhyaṃ giriṃ caivāsādya madhusūdanaḥ || 20.24
bhūtānām anukampārtham avatīrya ca saṃsthitaḥ |
yāmunaṃ jalam āśritya devadevastrivikramaḥ || 20.25
sthitaḥ kamalasambhūta <kamalasaṃbhūta> taraṇaṃ sugatipradam |
mūrtyantaraṃ vāmanākhyaṃ siṃhādrau kamalodbhava || 20.26
svasatvād etya viśrāntaṃ bhavinā śokaśāntaye |
narmadākhyaṃ hi cākramya jalaṃ vāpakṣayaṃkaram || 20.27
śrīdharaḥ saṃsthito devaḥ kauṇḍale 'pi śriyā saha |
hṛṣīkeśas tu bhagavān saṃsthito 'py ātmanā bhuvi || 20.28
dharādhare dhvajākhye tu kṣetre kubjāmrake 'bjaja |
padmanābhas tu deveśas tv avatīrya ca saṃsthitaḥ || 20.29
dakṣiṇāṃ diśam āśritya samīpe jaladhikṣiteḥ |
girau raivatake vipra svasatvād etya vartate || 20.30
dāmodaras tu bhagavān hitārthaṃ bhāvitātmanām |
ebhir mūrtyantaraiḥ sārdhaṃ mūrtibhir viśvamandiram || 20.31
samākrāntaṃ dvijaśreṣṭha ato'nyeṣāṃ ca saṃsthitim |
nibodhatu mahābuddhe sāvadhānena cetasā || 20.32
siddhāmarāścitaṃ viddhi śvetadvīpe tu haṃsarāṭ |
matsyātmā bhagavān apsv aśvātmā baḍabāmukhe || 20.33
rasātale tu kūrmātmā vindhyāraṇye tu pauṣkara |
vijñātavyo mṛgendrātmā pāpahā sarvadehinām || 20.34
saukarīyeṇa rūpeṇa kṣetre tatsaṃjñake tu vai |
gāṅge śubhajale kūle surasiddhaniṣevite || 20.35
hemottamāṃgadhṛgdevo <hemottamāṅgadhṛgdevo> hemaśailamahāntare |
naubandhanagirāv evaṃ mīnavaktraḥ sthitaḥ prabhuḥ || 20.36
kṛṣṇāśve 'śvaśirā devaḥ kṣitikṣetre ca mārcite |
lavaṇodadhiparyante bhūbhāge siddhasevite || 20.37
kūrmavaktraś ca bhagavān saṃsthitaḥ śaṃkhacakradṛk <śaṅkhacakradṛk> |
nṛhariḥ kṛtaśauce tūjjayinyām api dvijāḥ || 20.38
viśākhamūlasaṃjñe tu sthāne tv evaṃ sthitas tridhā |
kokāmukhe varāhan tu vārāhe tu nagottame || 20.39
mandamāle vivaitas te kulakukṣau himācale |
vāmanaḥ kharvamūrtiś ca vaiśvarūpyeṇa saṃsthitaḥ || 20.40
madhyadeśe tu gaṅgāyāḥ kurukṣetre tu pauṣkara |
yāmunaṃ kūlam āśritya prādurbhāvāntaraṃ mahat || 20.41
sthitaṃ trivikramākhyaṃ yat trailokyākrāntavigraham |
nagottame mahendrākhye paraśvathakaraṃ dvija || 20.42
rāmasaṃjñaś ca bhagavān saṃsthitaḥ kṣatriyāntakaḥ |
dharādhare citrakūṭe rakṣaḥkṣayakaro mahān || 20.43
saṃsthitaś cāparo rāmaḥ padmapatrāyatekṣaṇaḥ |
rāmo 'nyaḥ sīrapāṇir vai yāmuno bhrāmayan jalam || 20.44
saṃsthito mānuṣīyeṣu bhūbhāgeṣu śubheṣu ca |
sāmudre 'pi tato dvīpe dvārakākhye 'marārcite || 20.45
vartate bhagavān kṛṣṇaḥ sarvātmā parameśvaraḥ |
kalkī viṣṇuś ca bhagavān stūyamāno dvijaiḥ sthitaḥ || 20.46
samāsādya vipāśāṃ ca nadīṃ niyatamānasaḥ |
dharmamūrtir mahātmā vai dharmāraṇye surārcite || 20.47
anugrahaparastvāste lokānāṃ lokapūjitaḥ |
narasaṃjño jagannāthaḥ siddhaiḥ sampūjiteṣu <saṃpūjiteṣu> ca || 20.48
bhūbhāgeṣu ca ramyeṣu nityaṃ sannihitasthitiḥ <saṃnihitasthitiḥ> |
girau govardhanākhye tu devaḥ sarveśvaro hariḥ || 20.49
saṃsthitaḥ pūjite sthāne gavāṃ niṣkramaṇeṣu ca |
sālagrāme ca bhagavān rājendrākhye vane dvijāḥ || 20.50
tathaiva vasudhāṃśe ca sthito devavratābhidhe |
kṛṣṇoparaś catumūrtir avatīrya dharātale || 20.51
sthitaḥ piṇḍārake vipra mocayan duṣkṛtāj janān |
śvetadvīpe kurukṣetre himavantācale 'bjaja || 20.52
vedikāyām api taṭe viśvarūpaḥ sthitaḥ prabhuḥ |
kṣīrodadhau padmanābhaḥ śeṣāhiśayano hariḥ || 20.53
sthito nanv abjasambhūta <abjasaṃbhūta> yasmāc cedaṃ pitāmaha |
caturthā rūpam āśritya viśve 'smin saiva vartate || 20.54
hitāya sarvalokānāṃ yathāvadavadhāraya |
āsādya śayanaṃ brahman pātālatalasaṃsthitaḥ || 20.55
vaṭam ādāya cāgneyaṃ yo 'nte saṃharate jagat |
vaṭamūlaṃ samāśritya prayāge surapūjite || 20.56
jagadekārṇavaṃ kṛtvā divyam āsādya pādapam |
santiṣṭhate <saṃtiṣṭhate> sa bhagavān tasmin tīre kṣitau dvijāḥ || 20.57
nyagrodhaśāyinaṃ caiva dhyāyed divyagatipradam |
himācalaikadeśe tu tuṅge vai bhṛgusaṃjñake || 20.58
madhukaiṭabhamāthī ca saṃsthitaḥ so 'vanītale |
kṣīrodakakṣitikṣetre surāsuraniṣevite || 20.59
mandarādrikaro devo vartate devapūjitaḥ |
tatraivāmṛtaciddevaḥ saṃsthitaḥ siddhasevitaḥ || 20.60
kāntārūpadharaś caiva sudhākalaśadhṛkprabhuḥ |
siddhānāṃ ca munīnāṃ ca devānāṃ mṛtyujit sthitaḥ || 20.61
dvidhā kartā gaṇopeto devo garuḍavāhanaḥ |
sālavṛkṣabhujoddeśe sālagrāme sthito vibhuḥ || 20.62
trikūṭagiripṛṣṭhe tu gamye gaganacāriṇām |
gajoddhṛticchalenaivāprameyākhyayā sthitaḥ || 20.63
śvetadvīpapatir deva avatīrya ca saṃsthitaḥ |
gaṅgāsamudrasaṃyoge kṣityuddeśe manorame || 20.64
yajñabhugbhagavān devo naimiśe siddhapūjite |
saindhavāraṇyam āśrityānanto bhagavān sthitaḥ || 20.65
śārṅgapāṇis tu deveśo daṇḍakāraṇyasaṃjñake |
utpalāvartake deśe śaurisaṃjño 'cyutaḥ sthitaḥ || 20.66
kṣitau samudrabandhe 'bdheḥ saṅgame <saṃgame> siddhasevite |
jñānopadeṣṭā bhagavān saṃsthito duḥkhaśāntaye || 20.67
āsādya sūkarakṣetraṃ devo garuḍavāhanaḥ |
saṃsthito garuḍārūḍhaḥ pārijātakarāṅgitaḥ || 20.68
siddhaiḥ suragaṇaiḥ sārdhaṃ gagane cāpi pauṣkara |
devadeva jagannātha hastiparvatamastake || 20.69
ekadeśaṃ samāsādya sarvasya varadaḥ sthitaḥ |
mālyodapāṇir vaikuṇṭho māgadhāyāṃ mahāmate || 20.70
uḍḍīya puṇyabhūbāge saṃsthitaḥ puruṣottamaḥ |
acintyātmātha bhagavān parvate gandhamādane || 20.71
śipiviṣṭākhyayā deśe śipiviṣṭāvṛttaḥ sthitaḥ |
prāksamudrāpayāne tu bhūbhāge śubhalakṣaṇe || 20.72
kāpilīṃ mūrtim āsādya vāsudevaḥ sthitaḥ prabhuḥ |
avatīrya svasatvāc ca brahmasaṃjñaḥ prajāpatiḥ || 20.73
maṇibandhaṃ samāsādya nityaṃ sannihitaḥ <saṃnihitaḥ> sthitaḥ |
magadhāmaṇḍale vipra mahābodhatharāśrayaḥ || 20.74
saṃsthito lokanāthātmā devadevo janārdanaḥ |
devadakṣiṇagākṣṇo vai yo 'bhimānatanur dvija || 20.75
sūryasaṃjñas tu bhagavān hemaśailopari sthitaḥ |
ācyute vāmanetre tu yo 'bhimānatanurvibhuḥ || 20.76
bhagavān somasaṃjñas tu somatīrthāśrame 'pi ca |
agnisvarūpam ajitaṃ saṃsthitaṃ bāḍabānale || 20.77
vasvātmā bhagavān vipra bhāsate tv asurāntakṛt |
viṣṇunāmnā punardevas tv anekāyudhamaṇḍitaḥ || 20.78
jayākhyayojjayinyāṃ vai sthitaḥ pāpajayo nṛṇām |
kāśmīramaṇḍale puṇye kṣetre cakradharābhidhe || 20.79
cakrapāṇis tu bhagavān bhakrānāṃ mokṣadaḥ sthitaḥ |
surottamābhidhānaṃ ca gadāpāṇiṃ tu pauṣkara || 20.80
sadāsannihitaṃ <sadāsaṃnihitaṃ> viddhi gaṅgādvāre suraiḥ saha |
caturbhujaś caturmūrtiś caturvaktraś caturgatiḥ || 20.81
sthitaḥ piṇḍārake devo viṣvaksenaḥ sanātanaḥ |
śubham āsādya bhūbhāgaṃ prākjyotiṣapure tathā || 20.82
devaṃ viśveśvarākhyaṃ ca sthitim etya svagocarāt |
sātatranābhidhakṣetre siddhavidyādharānvite || 20.83
svāmisaṃjño jagannāthaḥ sthito mandākinītaṭe |
bhadrātake mahāyoge dhyāyinām apavargadaḥ || 20.84
dharātale nṛsiṃhākhye devikāyāntaṭāśrite |
ripukṣayākhyayā vipra devaḥ sarveśvaraḥ sthitaḥ || 20.85
śaṅkarākhye <śaṃkarākhye> tu bhūbhāge sarvadevaniṣevite |
jñānamūrtir jagannāthaḥ saṃsthitaḥ śubhakṛnnṛṇām || 20.86
pṛthivyāṃ tu pitṛkṣetre mocayantamṛṇatrayāt |
janārdanākhyayā brahman viśvātmā bhagavān sthitaḥ || 20.87
ete 'vatārāḥ kathitā leśataḥ kamalodbhava |
ebhiḥ kṣititalaṃ vyāptaṃ paunaḥpunyena ca svayam || 20.88
saṃsāriṇāṃ janānāṃ tv anugrahadhiyābjaja |
saṅkīrtanamagamyānāṃ <saṃkīrtanamagamyānāṃ> trisandhyaṃ <trisaṃdhyaṃ> 
nityam ācaret || 20.89
matiṃ cakre ca gamyānāṃ sevane darśane 'pi ca |
mlecchānāṃ teṣu deśeṣu kṣitau kṣetrādayo hi ye || 20.90
sāṅkaryaparihāreṇa <sāṃkaryaparihāreṇa> draṣṭavyās te sadaiva hi |
ṛṣibhiḥ sāmaraiḥ siddhaiḥ svāśrameṣu mahatsu ca || 20.91
jalāśayeṣu puṇyeṣu pṛthivyāṃ vividheṣu ca |
sarve bhagavadākārā vibhavavyūhalakṣaṇāḥ || 20.92
uktā gatāś ca ye cānye samutprekṣya dhiyā svayam |
pratiṣṭhitāś ca vidhivatsamantrāḥ satyavikramāḥ || 20.93
sthityā nānāprakārā ye bhūtabhavyādikākhyayā |
saumyāgneyobhayākhyena sanniveśavaśena <saṃniveśavaśena> vai || 20.94
līlārucimayenaiva cittasaukhyapradena ca |
bhujādyāyudhasandhānaketubhedena <bhujādyāyudhasaṃdhānaketubhedena> vai 
saha || 20.95
alaṃkṛtaṃ ca bhūbhāgaṃ manujais tv evam eva hi |
bhaktair anugṛhītaiś ca siddhādyaiś ca yathoditam || 20.96
ādidevādayaś caite tatveśāḥ samudīritāḥ |
parasmin bhagavattattve tv abhedena vyavasthitāḥ || 20.97
sūryasya raśmayo yadvadvahner arcirgaṇā yathā |
jaladherūr mayoyadvattadvad evābjasambhava <evābjasaṃbhava> || 20.98
citsāmānyā nityaśuddhā vyāpakāḥ parameśvarāḥ |
tattvasattāṃ samāśritya jñānādyaiḥ samalaṃkṛtāḥ || 20.99
aṇimādyaṣṭakopetāḥ saṃsthitā svātmanā tu vai |
adhvāvaniṣu sarvāsunityaṃ kurvanti sannidhim <saṃnidhim> || 20.100
muktaye sarvabhūtānāṃ viśeṣeṇa tu vai bhuvi |
āviśvaprabhavāt kālād ārabhya pralayāvadhi || 20.101
kṣetreṣu tīrthatīreṣu śabdabrahmamayātmanā |
sāmānyenāpi mantreṇa tadvivartena bhātmanā || 20.102
tato vyaktetaraṃ rūpam āśrayanti ca pārthivam |
hitārthaṃ sarvalokānām avatīrṇamanaśvaram || 20.103
jagatyāyatanākhyāyām atra sidhyanti yoginaḥ |
kālāntareṇa vyaktīnāṃ majjanaṃ jāyate yadi || 20.104
sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> śaktibhāvena nityaṃ kurvanti tatra ca |
yogeśvarāmarāḥ siddhāḥ smṛtvākāraṃ tadātmakam || 20.105
śailamṛddārudhātūtthāṃ vyaktiṃ saṃsthāpayanti ca |
yatrānuvedaṃ kurute mantraśaktidharās tu ye || 20.106
yenācyutīyanāmnau vai yadyat sthānāntaraṃ smṛtam |
sannidhis <saṃnidhis> tatra vairūpāḥ śabdamūrtidharasya ca || 20.107
bhinnātmanāṃ svayaṃvyaktarūpeṣv avyakeṣu? ca |
sanniruddheṣu <saṃniruddheṣu> mantreṣv icchāśaktigateṣu ca || 20.108
ākārāḥ sanniveśāś <saṃniveśāś> ca pārameśvaram anyathā |
anyathā vai jagaty asmin khyātākhyātaṃ ca śāśvatam || 20.109
evam āyatanānāṃ ca nityatvaṃ saṃprakāśitam |
anāditvam asaṃkhyaṃ ca mahatvam api pauṣkara || 20.110
evaṃ kṣetrasthitā mūrtibhedāḥ samyakprakīrtitāḥ |
kṣetreṣv eteṣu yohīndrās sārabhūtaṃ catuṣṭayam || 20.111
śrīraṅgaṃ veṅkaṭādriś ca hastiśailas tv anantaram |
tato nārāyaṇādriś ca mama dhāmacatuṣṭayam || 20.112
evamuktaṃ bhagavatā sākṣānnārāyaṇena hi |
asmin kṣetracatuṣke tu saṃsthitaṃ puruṣottamam || 20.113
mahābhaktisamāyuktāḥ sevante ye narottamāḥ |
sarvakṣetrasthitā devās sevitās tair na saṃśayaḥ || 20.114

munayaḥ
bhagavanmuniśārdūla sarvañ ca vadatāṃ vara |
nārāyaṇādrimahātmyaṃ śrotum icchāmahe vayam || 20.115
iha nārāyaṇasyaiva dhyānamārādhanādikam |
kathitaṃ hi tvayā pūrvaṃ na tu nārāyaṇo hariḥ || 20.116
kathaṃ prāpto girivaraṃ mahattā tasya kīdṛśī |
tatsarvaṃ vistareṇaiva vadasva vadatāṃ vara || 20.117

nāradaḥ
sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ mahābhāgā bhavadbhir munipuṅgavāḥ |
nārāyaṇācalasthasya harer māhātmyam uttamam || 20.118
saṅkṣepeṇa <saṃkṣepeṇa> pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvam avadhānataḥ |
ādau nārāyaṇaḥ śrīmān svasya nābhīsaroruhāt || 20.119
caturmukhaṃ samutpādya sarvasaṃskārasaṃskṛtam |
vedaśāstrārthatattvajñaṃ kṛtvā taṃ puruṣottamaḥ || 20.120
sṛṣṭau niyojya brahmāṇaṃ tatas tv antarhito 'bhavat |
tasminn antarhite deve viparyastamatir vidhiḥ || 20.121
itikartavyatāmugdho babhūvodvignamānasaḥ |
tadāsau tapa ātiṣṭhaddraṣṭukāmo jagatpatim || 20.122
bahukāleṣv atīteṣu tapyamāne pitāmahe |
āvirāsa jagannātho brahmaṇaḥ purato dvijāḥ || 20.123
taṃ dṛṣṭvā kamalākāntaṃ paramāścaryasaṃyutaḥ |
tuṣṭāva vividhaiḥ stotraiḥ śrutisiddhaiś caturmukhaḥ || 20.124
tena stuto jagaddhātā karuṇāpūrṇamānasaḥ |
brahmāṇaṃ samuvācedaṃ meghagambhīrayā girā || 20.125
tvayā vatsa kutas tv evaṃ tapas taptaṃ sudustaram |
tuṣṭo 'haṃ tapasā te 'dya kiṃ tavābhīpsitaṃ vada || 20.126

brahmā
nānyad asti phalaṃ deva bhavato darśanādṛte |
tvayā niyojito 'haṃ hi jagatsṛṣṭau purā vibhoḥ || 20.127
sraṣṭuṃ jagad idaṃ sarvaṃ kā śaktir mama mādhava |
atropāyaṃ samācakṣva karuṇāmṛtavāridhe || 20.128
ityukto brahmaṇā devo mantram aṣṭākṣaraṃ param |
tasyopadiśya bhagavān tadarthāṃś ca viśeṣataḥ || 20.129
aṣṭākṣaram imaṃ mantraṃ santataṃ <saṃtataṃ> hṛdi cintayan |
mantrasyāsya prabhāveṇa jagatsraṣṭuṃ tvam arhasi || 20.130
sargakarmaṇi saṃvṛtte etan mantraprabhāvataḥ |
āvirbhaviṣyati puraḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 20.131
tam abhyarcaya deveśaṃ mantreṇānena padmaja |
tatas tvadadhikārānte matpadaṃ prāpsyāsi dhruvam || 20.132
ityuktvāntardadhe devas tatas tuṣṭaś caturmukhaḥ |
japamāno mūlamantraṃ cetanācetanātmakam || 20.133
sṛṣṭvā jagad idaṃ sarvaṃ virañcir munipuṅgavāḥ |
nārāyanaṃ draṣṭukāmas tapastepe sudustaram || 20.134
āvirāsīt tato divyaṃ vimānaṃ śubhalakṣaṇam |
śrīvaikuṇṭhāc caturvaktra tapaḥphalam ivādbhutam || 20.135
anekakoṭimārtāṇḍavilasattejasāvṛtam |
anantavihageśānaviṣvaksenapurogamam || 20.136
śriyā sudarśanenāpi pārśvayoḥ samanudrutam |
kumudādyaiḥ parivṛtaṃ sarvāvayavaśobhitam || 20.137
vṛttākāraṃ śubhakaraṃ sarvālaṅkāraśobhitam <sarvālaṃkāraśobhitam> |
taṃ dṛṣṭvā sahasotthāya santuṣṭaḥ <saṃtuṣṭaḥ> kamalāsanaḥ || 20.138
pulakāñcitasarvāṅgaḥ santoṣodbhrāntalocanaḥ <saṃtoṣodbhrāntalocanaḥ> |
praṇamya prāñjaliḥ sthitvā vimānam avalokayat || 20.139
pīṭhādyeṣu śikhānteṣu vimānāvayaveṣu ca |
bhūrādyaṃ satyaparyantaṃ lokānāṃ saptakaṃ kramāt || 20.140
adhvanāṃ bhuvanādhvādiṣaṭkaṃ varṇādhvapaścimam |
dharādipuruṣāntaṃ ca tattvabṛndaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 20.141
sattārūpam avasthāya saṃsthitaṃ sandadarśa <saṃdadarśa> ha |
tatas tu devatābṛndaṃ krameṇa samalokayat || 20.142
ghaṭādhāraśilādhastādanantamamitadyutim |
cakraṃ tadūrdhve sāmarthyaśaktiṃ cāpi śilāntare || 20.143
mantranādhaṃ madhyakumbhe prāgādikalaśāṣṭake |
vāsudevādikāṃś caiva prabhavāpyayayogataḥ || 20.144
saṃsthitān tatpidhāneṣu madhyādīśadigantimam |
jñānabhāsādikānāṃ ca śaktīnāṃ navakaṃ kramāt || 20.145
dharmādīnām aṣṭakaṃ ca tathā pādaśilāṣṭake |
akārādikṣakārāntaṃ varṇacakraṃ tadantare || 20.146
sarvādhāramayaṃ cakraṃ śākhāmūlaṃ samāśritam |
jñānakriyātmake tattve śākhayoḥ parameśvaram || 20.147
ādyaṃ hy udumbarasyordhve tatpṛṣṭhe dharmam eva ca |
kavāṭayos tu kālāgniṃ varuṇaṃ ca munīśvarāḥ || 20.148
śaṅkhapadmanidhī caiva tadagradvārapārśvayoḥ |
tato jaṃghāsamūhe <jaṅghāsamūhe> tu tathaivāntarabhūmiṣu || 20.149
kālādivasudhāṃtāṃś <kālādivasudhāntāṃś> ca bhāvopakaraṇāmarān |
jaṃghāgre <jaṅghāgre> keśavādīnāṃ dviṣaṭkaṃ prastarasthale || 20.150
cakrādyāyudhasaṃghaṃ ca sattārūpeṇa saṃsthitam |
nāsācatuṣkasthāneṣu varāhādi catuṣṭayam || 20.151
saśaktikaṃ tu patrādyair bhūṣite vedikātale |
sudarśanaṃ śikhākumbhe vāsudevaṃ parāt param || 20.152
tadagradeśe hetīśaṃ sūryakoṭisamaprabham |
sarvalokamayaṃ viprāḥ sakalādhvamayaṃ tathā || 20.153
sarvatattvamayaṃ caiva sarvadevamayaṃ tathā |
ānandamayasaṃjñaṃ tadvimānaṃ kamalāsanaḥ || 20.154
evaṃ krameṇāvalokya praṇipatya punaḥpunaḥ |
tathā pradakṣiṇīkṛtya viṣvaksenābhyanujñayā || 20.155
vimānāntaḥ sampraviśya <saṃpraviśya> japannaṣṭākṣaraṃ manum |
abhyantare vimānasya garbhabhūmau tu madhyataḥ || 20.156
sarasīruhamāsthāya saṃsthitaṃ puruṣottamam |
prāvṛḍjaladasandohavilasaddivyavigraham 
<prāvṛḍjaladasaṃdohavilasaddivyavigraham> || 20.157
sarvadevamayaṃ devaṃ sarveṣāṃ tejasān nidhim |
sarvalakṣaṇasampūrṇaṃ <sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇaṃ> sārvajñyādiguṇair yutam || 
20.158
vapuṣā sundareṇaiva divyenāviṣkṛtena ca |
muñcantam aniśaṃ dehād ālokaṃ jñānalakṣaṇam || 20.159
prayatnena vinā jñānanāśakṛddhyāyināṃ mahat |
ghanakuñcitanīlālidalitāṃjanasannibhaiḥ 
<ghanakuñcitanīlālidalitāñjanasaṃnibhaiḥ> || 20.160
karpūradhūsarair divyaiḥ puṣpasaṃvalitāntaraiḥ |
kirīṭamakuṭākrāntaiḥ śobhitaṃ svaśiroruhaiḥ || 20.161
bālacandrapratīkāśaphālodyattilakojvalam |
subhruvaṃ sunasaṃ śāntaṃ savilāsasmitādharam || 20.162
kiṃ cid āraktagokṣīraśuddhanīlābjalocanam |
śītalair dṛṣṭipātais tu jagadāpyāyakāriṇam || 20.163
vilasadgaṇḍaphalakaṃ śravaṇojvalakuṇḍalam |
mukhasaundaryaniṣyandacubukasthalaśobhitam || 20.164
vikalaṅkaśaraccandravilasanmukhamaṇḍalam |
kambugrīvaṃ pīvarāṃsaṃ dīrghabāhuṃ mahorasam || 20.165
caturbhujam udārāṅgaṃ vilasatpāṇipaṅkajam |
pītakauśeyavasanaṃ nimnanābhiṃ tanūdaram || 20.166
cārūruyugalaṃ cārujaṃghād <cārujaṅghād> vitayam ujvalaiḥ |
maṇinūpurabhūṣādyair vilasatpadapaṅkajam || 20.167
divyagandhānuliptāṅgaṃ divyāmbaradharaṃ tathā |
divyasragveṣṭanopetaṃ divyālaṅkāramaṇḍitam <divyālaṃkāramaṇḍitam> || 20.168
anekaratnakhacitakirīṭamakuṭojvalam |
kaustubhenor asisthena śrīvatsenāpy alaṃkṛtam || 20.169
raktakāñcanasanmuktāyuktayā vanamālayā |
sabrahmasūtrayā caiva śobhitaṃ parameśvaram || 20.170
mukhyadakṣiṇahastena bhītānām abhayapradam |
śroṇītaṭaniviṣṭena vāmahastena līlayā || 20.171
ghriyamāṇaṃ gadāṃ gurvīṃ niṣaṇṇāṃ dharaṇītale |
paścād dakṣiṇahastena cakraṃ kālānaladyuti || 20.172
praṇavadhvanigarbhaṃ tu himādriśataśodhikam |
śaṅkhaṃ vāmakareṇāpi dadhānamatulaprabham || 20.173
svadehatejassambhūtajvālāmaṇḍalamadhyagam 
<svadehatejassaṃbhūtajvālāmaṇḍalamadhyagam> |
karuṇāpūrṇahṛdayaṃ jagaduddharaṇodyatam || 20.174
abhinnapūrṇaṣāḍguṇyavibhavenopabṛhmitam |
yogidhyeyam ajannityaṃ jagajjanmādikāraṇam || 20.175
sākṣāllakṣmīpatiṃ devaṃ nārāyaṇamanāmayam |
dṛṣṭā prahṛṣṭahṛdayaḥ praṇipatya muhurmuhuḥ || 20.176
tuṣṭāva kamalākāntaṃ stotrair nānāvidhair vidhiḥ |
tatas tatstotrasantuṣṭo <tatstotrasaṃtuṣṭo> nārāyaṇa udāradhīḥ || 20.177
pitāmaham uvācedaṃ medhagambhīrayā girā |
santuṣṭas <saṃtuṣṭas> tapasā te 'ham aṣṭākṣaraparāyaṇa || 20.178
samabhyarcaya mām atra yugānām ayutaṃ vidhe |
tato bhuvaṃ gamiṣyāmi kena cit kāraṇena tu || 20.179
ityuktaḥ sa caturvaktro harṣeṇa mahatānvitaḥ |
vimānaṃ tatsamādāya sthāpayitvā nije gṛhe || 20.180
sātvatoktavidhānena manunāṣṭākṣareṇa tu |
pūjayāmāsa vidhivadbhogair nānāvidhair vibhum || 20.181
evaṃ bahuṣu kāleṣu vyatīteṣu munīśvarāḥ |
sanatkumāro yogīndraḥ kadācitkṣīrasāgarāt || 20.182
satyalokaṃ samāsādya tatra nārāyaṇaṃ prabhum |
dṛṣṭvā śriyā samopetaṃ sarvacittāpahāriṇam || 20.183
praṇamya prāñjalis tiṣṭhann uvācedaṃ caturmukham |
bhavān guruḥ pitā cāpi mama vātsalyavāridhe || 20.184
tvattinyo nāsti me loke gatiḥ sarvārthadāyaka |
iyantaṃ kālam īśo 'yaṃ śrīmān nārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 20.185
bhavatārādhitaḥ samyagbhogair nānāvidhair api |
adyāhaṃ yaṣṭum icchāmi bhavadārādhitaṃ vibhum || 20.186
nārāyaṇaṃ jagannāthaṃ dātum arhasi me pitaḥ |
iti saṃprārthito brahmā putravātsalyavān api || 20.187
viprayogabhiyā viṣṇoś cintāparavaśo 'bhavat |
tadā nārāyaṇaḥ śrīmān cintāvyākulamānasam || 20.188
dṛṣṭvābjasambhavaṃ <dṛṣṭvābjasaṃbhavaṃ> prītyā vākyam etad uvāca ha |
cintāṃ jahi mahābuddhe viśleṣān mama padmaja || 20.189
arcāntaram idaṃ me 'pi dadāmi tava saṃprati |
māmādāya munīndro 'yaṃ saṃprāpya dharaṇītalam || 20.190
saṃsthāpya pūjayen nityaṃ padmakūṭābhidhe girau |
yatra māṃ draṣṭum aniśaṃ tapasyanti munīśvarāḥ || 20.191
ityuktvā bhagavān devo rūpaṃ svaṃ hṛdayodbhavam |
śriyā puṣṭyā ca sahitaṃ prāyacchadbrahmaṇe tadā || 20.192
pitāmahas tadādāya rūpaṃ śrīpuṣṭisaṃyutam |
abhyārcayadviśeṣeṇa bhogair vismitamānasaḥ || 20.193
tataḥ sanatkumāraṃ tam āhūya kamalodbhavaḥ |
santoṣotphullanayanaḥ <saṃtoṣotphullanayanaḥ> provācetthaṃ munīśvarāḥ || 20.194
sanatkumāra he vatsa satputro 'si bhavān mama |
sākṣānnārāyaṇo devo yataḥ sānugrahas tvayi || 20.195
ityuktvātha munīndrāya divyam aṣṭākṣaraṃ manum |
upadiśya tadarthāṃś ca tathā sātvatasaṃjñakam || 20.196
mahopaniṣadaṃ tantraṃ grāhayāmāsa yoginam |
yo mūlavedo vikhyātastādṛktasmāt parisrutam || 20.197
siddhimokṣapradaṃ viprāḥ sarvaśāstrārthagarbhitam |
yatra śāntataraṃ vyūhaṃ śāntoditam anantaram || 20.198
suṣuptisaṃjñaṃ svapnākhyaṃ jāgradvyūhaṃ yathoditam |
mūrtyantaraṃ keśavādyaṃ prādurbhāvāntaraṃ tathā || 20.199
hṛtpadmapadmapīṭhādau lakṣmīpuṣṭyādiśaktibhiḥ |
lāṃchanaiḥ <lāñchanaiḥ> śaṅkhacakrādyair garuḍapramukhair api || 20.200
bhūtasiddhādibhiḥ śāstraparyantaiḥ pūjanaṃ hitam |
viśvatrātṛnṛsiṃhasya dīkṣāpūrvaṃ tathā param || 20.201
vibhavavyūhasūkṣmākhyam adhikāraṃ yathākramam |
samayīputrakādīnāṃ caturṇām abhiṣecanam || 20.202
tathaiva samayācāraṃ mūrtīnāṃ sthāpanakramaḥ |
mantramaṇḍalamudrāṇāṃ kuṇḍādīnāṃ ca lakṣaṇam || 20.203
yatra proktaṃ bhagavatā lokojjīvanahetunā |
tadarthāṃś copadiśyātha tatprāptiṃ ca vyavarṇayat || 20.204
idaṃ hi sātvataṃ tantraṃ vāsudevāj jagatprabhoḥ |
saṅkarṣaṇena <saṃkarṣaṇena> samprāptaṃ <saṃprāptaṃ> tasmāt 
saṅkarṣaṇātmanaḥ <saṃkarṣaṇātmanaḥ> || 20.205
pradyumnākhyena samprāptam <saṃprāptam> aniruddhena vai tataḥ |
aniruddhān mayā prāptaṃ matto rudrādibhis tathā || 20.206
sarveṣu divyaśāstreṣu nāsty asmādadhikaṃ mune |
yathā sarveṣu mantreṣu nāsti cāṣṭakṣarāt param || 20.207
etaduktavidhānena nārāyaṇam amuṃ mune |
samabhyacaya lokeśaṃ bhogaiḥ sāṃsparśikādibhiḥ || 20.208
vaikuṇṭhavardhanaṃ nāma kṣetram asti mahītale |
tatrāsti padmakūṭākhyaḥ kaś cid girivaro mahān || 20.209
kāver yā uttare bhāge mune yojanamātrataḥ |
aprākṛtaṃ hi tatsthānaṃ bhūvaikuṇṭham iti śrutam || 20.210
purā bhagavadājñaptaḥ sākṣāccheṣo hi śailatām |
samprāpyāgamanaṃ <saṃprāpyāgamanaṃ> viṣṇoḥ pratīkṣan vatrate dhunā || 
20.211
virajāpy aṃśabhāgena tadgirer uttare taṭe |
pravahaty amalā nityaṃ sarvadoṣapraṇāśinī || 20.212
tathaivānekatīrthāni kṣetrāṇi vividhāni ca |
santi tatra giriśreṣṭhe sevyāni vibudhottamaiḥ || 20.213
kalau yuge 'pi tatratyā na dūṣyanti kadā cana |
tasya pralayakāle 'pi nāśo nāsti girer mune || 20.214
tatas tatsadṛśaṃ sthānaṃ brahmāṇḍāntar na kiñ cana |
tasmin girau munivarā bahavaḥ saṃśitavrattāḥ || 20.215
nārāyaṇam amuṃ draṣṭhuṃ tapasyanty amalāśayāḥ |
teṣv apy anugraho jāto devasyāsya kṛpānidheḥ || 20.216
tasmād vimānam etat tvaṃ samādāya samāhitaḥ |
tasmin girivare sthāpya yaja nārāyaṇaṃ prabhum || 20.217
evamukto munivaraḥ santuṣṭahṛdayas <saṃtuṣṭahṛdayas> tataḥ |
pitāmahād devadevaṃ labdhvā nārāyaṇaṃ prabhum || 20.218
phālgunyāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ hi hastarkṣe munisattamāḥ |
tamānīya giriśreṣṭhaṃ tanmūrdhniṃ munisevite || 20.219
tīre tīrthavarasyaitad dvimānam amitaprabham |
saṃsthāpayāmāsa tadā tatratyā munipuṅgavāḥ || 20.220
dṛṣṭvā nārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ harṣeṇa mahatānvitāḥ |
asmākam iha kalyāṇaṃ kalyāṇam iti cocire || 20.221
tataḥ kalyāṇatīrthaṃ tatpravadanti manīṣiṇaḥ |
tataḥ sanatkumāras tu sātvatoktavidhānataḥ || 20.222
samarcayan jagannāthaṃ santuṣṭahṛdayo <saṃtuṣṭahṛdayo> 'bhavat |
yato nārāyaṇas tatra girau vasati santatam <saṃtatam> || 20.223
nārāyaṇācala iti tataḥprabhṛti kathyate |
tatra nārāyaṇasyaivam avatāraḥ samīritaḥ || 20.224
arcāntaran tu yat proktaṃ nārāyaṇahṛdudbhavam |
taccāpi taṃ giriṃ prāpa kutaścitkāraṇāt purā || 20.225
tadvṛttam iha vakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
purā nārāyaṇaḥ śrīmān lokarakṣaṇahetunā || 20.226
avatīrya raghorvaṃśe rāmo rakṣaḥkulāntakaḥ |
pitṛvākyāpadeśena daṇḍakāraṇyavāsinām || 20.227
munīnāṃ rakṣaṇārthāya tatra tatrāśrame vasan |
lakṣmaṇena ca lāvaṇyapūrṇayā sītayānvitaḥ || 20.228
nārāyaṇagiriṃ prāpya kadācinmunisevitam |
kṛtātithyo munigaṇaiḥ kautūhalasamanvitaiḥ || 20.229
adhityakāyāṃ tasyādres tuṅgaśṛṅge 'timañjule |
sītāvārivihārārthaṃ sumitrāsūnunā kṣaṇāt || 20.230
dhanuṣkoṭyā kṛte khāte sadyas sañjātavāriṇi <saṃjātavāriṇi> |
vihṛtya sītayāsārthaṃ nimajyāntarjale japan || 20.231
ṛco 'ghamarṣaṇīs tatra dadarśa paramādbhūtam |
rūpaṃ bhagavataḥ paścādunmajyālocya rāghavaḥ || 20.232
paryaṭan paritaś śailaṃ vismayāviṣṭamānasaḥ |
pāre kalyāṇatīrthasya padmapatrāyatekṣaṇam || 20.233
paśyan nārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ praṇamya śirasāsakṛt |
pūjayan katicinmāsānuvāsa tadanantaram || 20.234
uvāca bhagavān rāmaṃ parituṣṭo 'smi pūjayā |
dattābhayo munīnāṃ tvaṃ jitvā rākṣasapuṅgavān || 20.235
sarvaiḥ parijanaiḥ sārdhaṃ sāketapuramāviśa |
tatrāṃśenāgamiṣyāmi tadā māṃ yaṣṭum arhasi || 20.236
ityukto raghuśārdūla indirāramaṇājñayā |
kṛtvā niṣkaṇṭakāṃ pṛthvīṃ sāketanagare vare || 20.237
abhiṣiktaḥ svabhaktāya rākṣasendrāya dhīmate |
svavaṃśārādhitaṃ devaṃ datvā raṅgeśvaraṃ vibhum || 20.238
nīte raṅgādhipe tena cintāviṣṭobhavat tadā |
tadviditvā caturvaktraḥ śrībhūmisahitaṃ vibhum || 20.239
nārāyaṇāṃśam ādāya sāketanagarīṃ javāt |
samabhyetya ca rāmāya dadau svārādhitaṃ harim || 20.240
tato rāmaḥ saṃprahṛṣṭaḥ śrībhūmisahitaṃ vibhum |
arcayāmāsa vidhivacciraṃ nijagṛhe dvijāḥ || 20.241
ato rāmapriya iti tasya nāmābhavadvijāḥ |
tataḥ kuśo rāmaputraḥ svapitrārādhitaṃ vibhum || 20.242
pūjayan svasutāṃ kāṃ cid yaduvaṃśyāya bhūbhṛte |
datvā tathā prārthitaḥ san prādāttasyai tam acyutam || 20.243
labdhvā kanyāṃ ca taṃ devaṃ yaduśekharasaṃjñakaḥ |
madhurānagarīm etya tatraiva nijamandire || 20.244
saṃsthāpya kamalākāntaṃ samabhyārcayadādarāt |
tatas tu tatkramāl labdhvā yaduvaṃśasamudbhavaḥ || 20.245
kṛṣṇaḥ śriyaḥpatiṃ devaṃ pūjayan vinatāsutāt |
prāptaṃ kirīṭamatulaṃ kalaśārṇavaśāyinaḥ || 20.246
samarṣya tasmai devāya vividhotsavam ātanot |
tataḥ kadācinmusalī tīrthayātrānimittataḥ || 20.247
gatvā nārāyaṇagiriṃ tatra kalyāṇanāmake |
tīrthe tathāṣṭatīrtheṣu snātvā tacchailamūrdhani || 20.248
yogāsanasamāsīnaṃ yogānandaṃ jagatprabhum |
sarvadevamayaṃ devaṃ sarveṣāṃ tejasāṃ nidhim || 20.249
sarvalakṣaṇasampūrṇaṃ <sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇaṃ> sārvajyādiguṇair yutam |
niṣṭaptakanakābhaṃ ca sampūrṇāṅgaṃ <saṃpūrṇāṅgaṃ> mahātanum || 20.250
ghoraśārdūlavadanaṃ caṇḍamārtāṇḍalocanam |
saudāminīcayaprakhyair lomabhiḥ paripūritam || 20.251
aruṇām bhojapatrābhavajrādhikakarer uham |
calatphaṇīśvarasaṭaṃ candrakoṭitaṭiddyutim || 20.252
pralayāṃbudhinirghoṣam udgirantaṃ svavācakam |
yugāntahutabhugjvālāmaṇḍalāntarvyavasthitam || 20.253
jānvāsaktabhujadvandvaṃ yogapaṭṭavibhūṣitam |
rathāṅgaśaṃkhadhartāraṃ <rathāṅgaśaṅkhadhartāraṃ> paścādbāhudvayena ca 
|| 20.254
mārtāṇḍakoṭisadṛśakirīṭamakuṭojvalam |
kaustubhenorasisthena śrīvatsenāpy alaṃkṛtam || 20.255
ratnakāñcanasanmuktāyuktayā vanamālayā |
sabrahmasūtrayā caiva śobhitaṃ parameśvaram || 20.256
divyagandhānuliptāṅgaṃ divyāmbaradharaṃ tathā |
divyasragveṣṭanopetaṃ divyālaṅkāramaṇḍitam <divyālaṃkāramaṇḍitam> || 20.257
subhīṣaṇaṃ saumyarūpaṃ svāśritābhīṣṭasiddhidam |
devaṃ narahariṃ dṛṣṭvā natvā tatpādapaṅkaje || 20.258
stotrair nānāvidhaiḥ stutvā santuṣṭahṛdayo <saṃtuṣṭahṛdayo> halī |
tasmin girivare viprās tatra tatra ca saṃcaran || 20.259
ānandamayamadhyasthaṃ saundaryāmṛtavāridhim |
dṛṣṭvā nārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ nimagno vismayāmbudhau || 20.260
natvā tatpādakamale tuṣṭāvetthaṃ jagatpatim |
jitante puṇḍarīkākṣa jitante bhaktavatsala || 20.261
jitante kamalākāṃta <kamalākānta> jitante puruṣottama |
nārāyaṇa namaste 'stu vāsudeva namo 'stu te || 20.262
namo 'stu viṣṇave tubhyaṃ namaste sarvaśeṣiṇe |
namaste pararūpāya namaste vyūharūpiṇe || 20.263
namo vibhavarūpāya namaste tv antarātmane |
namaste 'rcāvatārāya nānākārāya te namaḥ || 20.264
bhavān hi lokarakṣārthaṃ lakṣmyā kāruṇyarūpayā |
sudarśanenāpi yukto viharasy atra bhūdhare || 20.265
adya me saphalā dṛṣṭiḥ saundaryāmṛtavāridhiḥ |
yadbhavān sarvalokeśo mama dṛṣṭipathaṃ gataḥ || 20.266
puṇyakṣetreṣu sarveṣu sarveṣv āyataneṣu ca |
na paśyāmi jagannātha bhagavantaṃ bhavādṛśam || 20.267
śaraṇaṃ tvāṃ prapanno 'smi śaraṇāgatavatsala |
kaṭākṣaiḥ karuṇāpūrṇaiḥ samālokaya māṃ vibho || 20.268
evaṃ nānāvidhaiḥ stotraiḥ stuto nārāyaṇo hariḥ |
uvāca valabhadraṃ taṃ karuṇāpūrṇamānasaḥ || 20.269
balabhadra bhavānbhaktaḥ śeṣo 'si mama kiṅkaraḥ <kiṃkaraḥ> |
abhīpsitaṃ kiṃ bhavato brūhi tatpradadāmi te || 20.270
ityukto balabhadro 'yaṃ pratyuvāca jagatprabhum |
nārāyaṇa dayāmbodhe tava kaiṅkaryato <kaiṃkaryato> vinā || 20.271
kim asty abhīpsitaṃ nātha tvām ihārcayituṃ vibho |
abhīpsāmi ramākānta pūrayāsya manoratham || 20.272
iti samprārthito <saṃprārthito> devaḥ pratyuvāca balaṃ tadā |

śrīnārāyaṇaḥ
asti te vimalābhaktir mayi yādavanandana || 20.273
prathamaṃ śeṣarūpo me kaiṅkaryam <kaiṃkaryam> akarodbhavān |
tatas tu lakṣmaṇo bhūtvā māmārādhitavān iha || 20.274
idānīm api māṃ yaṣṭuṃ balabhadra tvam arhasi |
kalāv api yuge 'bhūyaḥ kaś cid bhūtvā dvijottamaḥ || 20.275
nānāvidhair bhogajālair arcanaṃ me kariṣyasi |
ityukto devadevena balabhadraḥ prahṛṣṭadhīḥ || 20.276
pūjayāmāsa vidhivadbhogair nānāvidhair harim |
tadarcanenātituṣṭaḥ śrīmān nārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 20.277
utsavādīn kartukāmaṃ balam evam uvācaha |
śriyā bhūmyā ca sahitaṃ rūpaṃ mama hṛdudbhavam || 20.278
madhurāyāṃ bhavadgehe pūjyate kila yādava |
tadānīyotsavārcāṃ me kṛtvā nānāvidhotsavān || 20.279
kartum arhasi bhaktyā tvaṃ tena tuṣyāmy ahaṃ halin |
evamukto rauhiṇeyas tvarayā madhurāṃ purīm || 20.280
etya kṛṣṇāya tadvṛttaṃ vistareṇa nyavedayat |
tacch�tvā bhagavān kṛṣṇo babhūvātīva vismitaḥ || 20.281
tato yadūdvahau kṛṣṇabalarāmau śriyaḥpatim |
śibikāyāṃ samāropya sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 20.282
yātropakaraṇaiḥ sarvaiś caturaṅgabalaiḥ saha |
māghamāse tu citrarkṣe sumuhūrte manohare || 20.283
nitvā girivaraṃ tatra nārāyaṇapurobhuvi |
saṃsthāpya ca mahānandāt pūjayāmāsaturharim || 20.284
tatas tu devadevasya kartukāmau mahotsavam |
balyarcāṃ snapanārcāṃ ca pratiṣṭhāpyājñayā hareḥ || 20.285
mahotsavaṃ tu vidhivatkṛtvā devasya śārṅgiṇaḥ |
phālgune māsi hastarkṣe sarvatīrthasamāśrite || 20.286
tasmin kalyāṇasarasi cakrāte 'vabhṛghotsavam |
yatas tatrārcito devo yādavābhyāṃ ramāsakhaḥ || 20.287
tadāprabhṛtitacchailo yādavādrir itīryate |
iti nārāyaṇasyāsya mahātmyaṃ kīrtitaṃ mayā || 20.288
itaḥparaṃ yacchrotavyaṃ kathyatāṃ tanmunīśvarāḥ |

munayaḥ
sarvajña muniśārdūla tatra yādavabhūdhare || 20.289
asti kalyāṇatīrthaṃ yat tad utpattiṃ tathaiva hi |
tacchailāgre saṃsthitasya nṛharer vaibhavaṃ vayam || 20.290
ākarṇayitum icchāmas tad api tvaṃ prakāśaya |

nāradaḥ
sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ mahābhāgā bhavadbhiḥ sāravedibhiḥ || 20.291
kalyāṇatīrthamahātmyaṃ vakṣyāmi śṛṇutādhunā |
purā varāho bhagavān magnāmabdhau vasundharām || 20.292
samuddhṛtya yathāpūrvaṃ saṃsthāpyātha mahīdhare |
tasmin śeṣātmake devyā bhūmyā saha samāsthitaḥ || 20.293
tadā devāṅgasaṃlagnāḥ samudrajalabindavaḥ |
galitās tatra tattīrthaṃ kalyāṇam abhavad dvijāḥ || 20.294
tadā devāḥ puṣpavarṣaiḥ samākīrya jagatpatim |
tuṣṭuvurvividhaiḥ stotrair nanṛtuś cāpsarogaṇāḥ || 20.295
divyadundubhayo nedur babhūva muditaṃ jagat |
tato brahmādayo devāḥ sarve devarṣipuṅgavāḥ || 20.296
tatrāgatya varāhantaṃ prārthayāmāsuracyutam |

devāḥ
devadeva jagannātha sarvalokaikarakṣaka || 20.297
tvayā hato mahādaityo vasudhāpi samuddhṛtā |
vayaṃ ca rakṣitā deva karuṇāmṛtavāridhe || 20.298
ihānenaiva rūpeṇa bhavān bhūmyā samanvitaḥ |
sthātum arhasi lokeśa bhaktānugrahakāmyayā || 20.299
iti devaiḥ prārthito 'yaṃ varāho bhagavān hariḥ |
svāṅke vasundharāṃ nyasya tasyā upadiśan manum || 20.300
prāgbhāge tasya tīrthasya hy adyāpyāste munīśvarāḥ |
tatra tena varāheṇa svājñaptaḥ patageśvaraḥ || 20.301
śvetadvīpāc chuddhamṛdaṃ samāhṛtya sarastaṭe |
purā nikṣiptavān sā hi mṛttikā lokapūjitā || 20.302
phālgune māsi kalyāṇasaṃjñe tasmin sarovare |
gaṅgādyāḥ sakalā nadyo bhajante sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> dvijāḥ || 20.303
tanmāsi paurṇamāsyām hi brahmādyā devatottamāḥ |
snātuṃ kalyāṇasarasi samāgacchanti bhaktitaḥ || 20.304
divyaṃ kalyāṇatīrthaṃ tad ye paśyanti smaranti vā |
pradakṣiṇaṃ vā kurvanti praṇamanti bhajanti vā || 20.305
ye vā tattīrthamāhātmyaṃ bhaktyā śṛṇvanti mānavāḥ |
snānaṃ vā tatra kurvanti tattīrthan tu pibanti vā || 20.306
ye vārcayanti puṣpādyais te janā lokapāvanāḥ |
āyurārogyam aiśvaryaṃ vidyāṃ tejo jayaṃ yaśaḥ || 20.307
satsutāṃś cāpi santoṣaṃ <saṃtoṣaṃ> yadyadiṣṭam iha dvijāḥ |
tat sarvam acirād eva labhante nātra saṃśayaḥ || 20.308
tasya tīrthasya māhātmyaṃ brahmādyair api daivataiḥ |
samyaṅ na śakyate jñātuṃ hiṃ punaḥ khalu mādṛśaiḥ || 20.309
ityuktaṃ leśatas tīrthamāhātmyaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
atha śrīnarasiṃhasya māhātmyaṃ vakṣyate dvijāḥ || 20.310
prahlādo nṛharer bhaktaḥ purā vaiṣṇavasattamaḥ |
tapasārādhituṃ devaṃ nṛsiṃhaṃ bhaktisaṃyutaḥ || 20.311
anveṣamāṇo vimalaṃ tapaḥsthānaṃ dharātale |
nārāyaṇācalaṃ prāpya dṛṣṭvā tadrāmaṇīyakam || 20.312
nāsty asmādadhikaṃ sthānaṃ bhuvīti kṛtaniścayaḥ |
tatra kalyāṇasarasi snātvā tattīragāṃ śubhām || 20.313
śvetamṛtsnāṃ samādāya ghṛtvā caivordhvapuṇḍrakān |
tacchailaśikharaṃ prāpya viviktamatinirmalam || 20.314
yamādiniyamair yukto nṛsiṃhaikākṣaraṃ śubham |
tathaivānuṣṭubhaṃ mantraṃ japamānas tadekadhīḥ || 20.315
draṣṭuṃ narahariṃ bhūyas tapas teṣe sudustapam |
tatas tattapasā tuṣṭo nṛharir bhaktavatsalaḥ || 20.316
prādur āsīj jagannāthas tasya śailasya mūrdhani |
prahlādas svatapaḥphalaṃ narahariṃ vātsalyavārānidhiṃ
śrīvatsāṅkitavakṣasaṃ śubhaguṇaṃ cakrābjabhāsvatkaram |
tacchailāgraśilātale śubhatare yogāsanasthaṃ paraṃ
dṛṣṭvā hṛṣṭatanūruho munivarā valgaṃ nanartādarāt || 20.317
tuṣṭāva cetthaṃ nṛhariṃ vismayāviṣṭamānasaḥ |
namaste śrīnṛsiṃhāja namaste daityasūdana || 20.318
namaste jagatāṃ nātha namaste bhaktavatsala |
rakṣakas tvaṃ hi lokasya tvadātmakam idaṃ jagat || 20.319
brahmādyāḥ sakalā devā bhavatpādābjasevakāḥ |
nāsti tvatto 'dhikā loke devatā puruṣottama || 20.320
vedānteṣu vicinvanti tvāṃ munīndrāḥ sanātanam |
sa bhavān karuṇāmbhodhe mama dṛṣṭipathaṃ gataḥ || 20.321
śaraṇaṃ tvāṃ prapanno 'smy ātmasātkuru māṃ vibho |
iti nānāvidhaiḥ stotraiḥ sa stuto narakesarī || 20.322
uvācāmṛtavarṣiṇyā girā prahlādasaṃjñakam |
prahlāda tedya tapasā tuṣṭo 'haṃ varam īpsitam || 20.323
vṛṇīṣva tatpradāsyāmītyuktaḥ prahlādanāmakaḥ |
baddhāṃjalipuṭo <baddhāñjalipuṭo> bhūtvā pratyuvāca mahāmatiḥ || 20.324
bhavān guruḥ pitā mātā suhṛdbandhuś ca me vibho |
vidyā dhanaṃ ca sakalaṃ nāsti tvattoparaṃ yataḥ || 20.325
tvāṃ vināhaṃ kṣaṇam api vastuṃ necche bhuvīśvara |
tasmān nirantaraṃ deva bhavatpādābjasevanām || 20.326
dātum arhasi deveśa tv iti saṃprārthito vibhuḥ |
prahlādānugrahārthāya tasminn eva mahīdhare || 20.327
kṛtāvāso naraharis tena sampūjito <saṃpūjito> bhṛśam |
adyāpi rājate tatra svāśritābhīṣṭasiddhikṛt || 20.328
evaṃ nārāyaṇagirer māhātmyaṃ leśato mayā |
saṅkīrtitaṃ <saṃkīrtitaṃ> munivarāḥ kim anyac chrotum icchatha || 20.329

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
yādavācalamāhātmyaṃ nāma
viṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha ekaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
bhagavanmuniśārdūla sarvajña vadatāṃ vara |
adīkṣitānāṃ pūjādau prāguktānadhikāritā || 21.1
tasmād dīkṣāvidhiṃ samyagvadasva munipuṅgava |

nāradaḥ
śṛṇudhvaṃ munayaḥ sarve bhavanti bhagavanmayāḥ || 21.2
brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyo vaiśyaḥ śūdro vā munipuṅgavāḥ |
pūrvoktalakṣaṇo jñātā kaś cid dṛḍhataraḥ pumān || 21.3
saṃsārabhayabhītas tu nirvāṇam abhivāñchati |
vairāgyadhīracapalaś cirakālaṃ guror gṛhe || 21.4
saṃsthito dāsabhāvena khedodvegavivajritaḥ |
jñātvā tasyārthitaṃ nūnam āhūyāgre niveśya ca || 21.5
kṛtākṛtaṃ ca praṣṭavya ājanes tatkṣaṇāvadhi |
jñātvā doṣabalaṃ samyakprāyaścittair yathoditaiḥ || 21.6
kṛcchrātikṛcchrapūrvais tu chedanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
bahūnāṃ paripīḍānām asāmarthyāt tu lāṅgalin || 21.7
manaḥprasādaparyantaṃ kālaṃ vā dvādaśāhnikam |
niyoktavyo mite pūte 'yācite naktabhojane || 21.8
stutisammārjanasnānapuṣpādyāharaṇodyame 
<stutisaṃmārjanasnānapuṣpādyāharaṇodyame> |
āśrame vaiṣṇavānāṃ tu divyādyāyatane vibhoḥ || 21.9
aniśaṃ bhagavadbimbasyāpīṭhād avalokane |
abhijātatanur yaḥ prāgduṣkṛtair malinīkṛtaḥ || 21.10
sāṃprataṃ bhagavadbhaktyā pavitrīkṛtamānasaḥ |
ahorātroṣito bhūtvā nakhakeśādiluṇṭhitaḥ || 21.11
pañcagavyamathāpādya hṛdādyaiḥ sakuśodakam |
mantrais tadvāsudevādyaiḥ samāvartya catuśśatam || 21.12
evaṃ dinacatuṣkaṃ tu snāpayet tena taṃ sudhīḥ |
pratyahaṃ caturo vārānāprabhātān niśāgamam || 21.13
brahmatīrthacatuṣkaṃ tv āpūryāpūrya samaṃ pibet |
kramāt sañcoditair <saṃcoditair> mantraiḥ samācamyāntarāntarā || 21.14
atṛptam aśanaṃ kuryād ante kṣīrājyabhāvitam |
sevayet phalamūlair vāhorātracatuṣṭayam || 21.15
iti bhaktyā prapannānām ājīvam api duṣkṛtāt |
kathitaṃ viratānāṃ ca dehaśuddhikaraṃ param || 21.16
brahmakūrcasametaṃ tu prāyaścitaṃ mayādya te |
jñātvā mahattvaṃ doṣāṇāṃ trividhānāṃ tu vai purā || 21.17
sambhave <saṃbhave> sati hemādidānaṃ satatam ācaret |
pūrvoktād dvihitāt kālāl laghuduṣkṛtināṃ kramāt || 21.18
caturthāṃśena hrāsas tu brahmakūrcaṃ pibet tataḥ |
kālena varṇotkarṣeṇa saha sāmānyam ucyate || 21.19
prāyaścittaṃ hi sarveṣāṃ sarvakalmaṣanāśanam |
uttarottaratāṃ budhvā prathamaṃ duṣkṛtasya ca || 21.20
kṣapayet tadvijendras tu māsair dvitricaturguṇaiḥ |
nṛpaviṭchūdrajātīya ekaikaṃ vardhayet kramāt || 21.21
māsam ekādikān kālān samārabhya yathākramāt |
durācāro 'pi sarvāśī kṛtaghno nāstikaḥ purā || 21.22
samāśrayed ādidevaṃ śraddhayā śaraṇaṃ yadi |
nirdoṣaṃ viddhi taṃ jantuṃ prabhāvāt paramātmanaḥ || 21.23
kiṃ punar yo 'nutāpārtaḥ śāsane 'smin hi saṃsthitaḥ |
virataḥ kukṛtāc caiva bhakticchāyāṃ samāśritaḥ || 21.24
evaṃ saṃśuddhadoṣāṇāṃ bahujanmārjitasya ca |
kalmaṣasya vighātārthaṃ nārasiṃhīṃ mahāmate || 21.25
kṛtvā vai sāṃprataṃ dīkṣāṃ dadyād vai mantrapūrvakam |
arādhanaṃ hi tasyaiva vaibhavīyasya vai vibhoḥ || 21.26
sabāhyābhyantaraṃ caiva samyaṅmāsacatuṣṭayam |
māsāṣṭakaṃ vatsaraṃ vā budhyā bhāvabalaṃ purā || 21.27
jñātvā bhavyāśayānāṃ ca prasādaṃ pārameśvaram |
vibhavavyūhasūkṣmākhyāṃ dīkṣāṃ kuryāt tadantaram || 21.28
atha dīkṣāvidhiṃ vakṣye śṛṇudhvaṃ munisattamāḥ |
samprāptapratyayānāṃ <saṃprāptapratyayānāṃ> ca dvijādīnāṃ ca sāṃpratam || 
21.29
samyakprakṣīṇapāpānām ārūḍhānām iha krame |
śubhe 'nukūle nakṣatre tithau lagne śubhe kṣaṇe || 21.30
bhaktānām adhivāsārthaṃ kṣāparigraham ācaret |
puṇyadeśe 'nukūle ca manojñe sādhusevite || 21.31
mṛdvāriphalapuṣpāḍhyekaśabdenasamanvite |
gosasyaśālisubhage kṣudraprāṇivivarjite || 21.32
tatra varṇānurūpāṃ kṣmāṃ bhajet pūrvoktalakṣaṇām |
sarvadoṣavinirmuktāṃ satpakṣimṛgasevitām || 21.33
yā śubhāyatanoddeśe maṭhagoṣṭhāpaṇair gṛhaiḥ |
toyāśayāśramakṣetraiḥ sadvṛtair antarīkṛtā || 21.34
jalād bhayavinirmuktā balād bhuktā ca sajjanaiḥ |
vanair upavanair grāmair nagarāṅgaiḥ samāvṛtā || 21.35
alābhe sati lābhe vā svabhūmer brāhmaṇādiṣu |
svamantreṇārcanāt svatvaṃ kuryād varṇavyapekṣayā || 21.36
uddhṛtāṃ kṛtakhātāṃ ca jñātvā doṣānvitāṃ purā |
śubhamṛtpūritāṃ kṛtvā laghvaśmabhir athāntarāt || 21.37
tataś ca kuṭṭayet paścāt pañcagavyena secayet |
yuktāṃ hemādisadratnaiḥ samīkṛtyopalipya ca || 21.38
tatrārcanaṃ vibhoḥ kuryād dhavanāntaṃ ca pūrvavat |
bhūtānāṃ balidānaṃ ca surabhīṇāṃ ca tarpaṇam || 21.39
dvijānāṃ dakṣiṇāntaṃ vai tatas tatra samāpayet |
prāgdikṣu siddhipūrvaṃ tu maṇṭapaṃ maṇḍanānvitam || 21.40
stambhadvidvitayenaiva koṇakenopaśobhitam |
pārthivena ca pīṭhena madhyagena virājitam || 21.41
vistārāt tu dvijādīnāṃ śūdrāntānāṃ samaṃ smṛtam |
aṣṭāśram atha vā vṛttaṃ turyāśraṃ sopapīṭhakam || 21.42
aṣṭāṅgulād samutsedhād ekāpāyena lakṣitam |
svonnatyarthenopapīṭhaṃ sarveṣāṃ parikalpayet || 21.43
vistāram upapīṭhānām ucchrāyād dviguṇaṃ samam |
upapīṭhasya saṃlagnāt tanmānena tu connatā || 21.44
āpyadiksthāgṛhasthā ca sampādyāsanapiṇḍikā <saṃpādyāsanapiṇḍikā> |
naivedyam upapīṭhe tu viniveśya nidhāya ca || 21.45
tasya dakṣiṇadigbhāge tv antargamanasaṃyutam |
vivikte locanopetaṃ piṇḍikākuṇḍabhūṣitam || 21.46
sakavāṭārgalopetaṃ kuryād dhavanamaṇṭapam |
upalipyāstrajaptena vāriṇā gomayena tu || 21.47
vidhivacchobhanaṃ kuryād ity evaṃ maṇṭapadvayam |
vihito vittavirahād adhivāso dvijālaye || 21.48
śaiṣye vācāryabhavane tatra kuryāt parigraham |
prāgvadarcanapūrvaṃ tu bhūtatarpaṇapaścimam || 21.49
odanaṃ dadhilājājyamadhutoyapariplutam |
bhūtatarpaṇam ityuktaṃ tadvinā tatra te 'niśam || 21.50
santiṣṭhante <saṃtiṣṭhante> bahiḥ kruddhāḥ kāṅkṣamāṇāḥ paraṃ padam |
athaś ca vihitaṃ yatnāt sthāne kṣetrīkṛte sati || 21.51
nirvidhnasiddhaye dadyād baliṃ sarvatra sarvadā |
kṛtvaivaṃ maṅgalārthaṃ tu dīrghaghaṇṭāravopamam || 21.52
svapadāt prāgvad utthāpya proccārya praṇavaṃ mahat |
praveśayet tatas tasmāl lājan siddhārthakān śubhān || 21.53
phalāni śrīphalādīni candanādīni rocanām |
śvetapūrvāḥ sumanasas tanmahīruhamañjarīm || 21.54
sāgrān haritadarbhāṃś ca sarvaratnāni kāñcanam |
sarvauṣadhītvagelādyaṃ sugandhanicayaṃ śubham || 21.55
padmakaṃ śaṅkhapuṣpaṃ ca viṣṇukrāntāṃ ca kundakam |
sapta sapta ca dhānyāni bījāni ca samāni ṣaṭ || 21.56
śāliśyāmākanīvārataṇḍulaṃ bhūri sambhṛtam <saṃbhṛtam> |
gosambhavāni <gosaṃbhavāni> vai pañca patreṣv audumbareṣu ca || 21.57
tatsrāvavarjitānyāni tāny eva subahūny api |
pratikṣaṇopayogārthaṃ bhāṇḍeṣv abhinaveṣu ca || 21.58
pādyācamanam arghyārthaṃ dadhyantaṃ vinivedane |
hemādyutthāni pātrāṇi mṛduparṇapuṭāni vā || 21.59
pāṇḍurāṇi dukūlāni vastrayugmadvayaṃ navam |
upavītaṃ sottarīyaṃ susite dhautavāsasī || 21.60
kauśeyāni pavitrāṇi kaṅkaṇaṃ sāṅgulīyakam |
sphāṭikaṃ cākṣasūtraṃ tu padmākṣan tu gaṇitrakam || 21.61
pañcalohamayaṃ cakraṃ saśaṅkhaṃ dvādaśārakam |
kutapaṃ yogapaṭṭaṃ ca netravastraṃ mṛgājinam || 21.62
brusikāṃ śāṭakaṃ paṭṭaṃ pāduke copānahau |
daṇḍaṃ pratigrahacchatraṃ cūrṇe godhūmamāṣaje || 21.63
caturvarṇāni mālyāni sundaraṃ pāvanaṃ laghu |
nīlaśāḍvalasammiśraṃ <nīlaśāḍvalasaṃmiśraṃ> haritaṃ patrasañcayam 
<patrasaṃcayam> || 21.64
gugguluṃ mṛṣṭadhūpaṃ ca dīpatailaṃ ca vartayaḥ |
darpaṇaṃ dhūpapātraṃ ca ghaṇṭāṃ kūrcaṃ ca darbhajam || 21.65
rajāṃsi karaṇīyugmaṃ pālikāṃ ghaṭikāṃ sitām |
paṃcāṅgulaṃ <pañcāṅgulaṃ> tu sudṛḍhaṃ hemādyaṃ kuśapaṃcakam 
<kuśapañcakam> || 21.66
alaktaraṃjitaṃ <alaktarañjitaṃ> sūtraṃ susitaṃ kartarīkṣuram |
kāṇḍāny aṣṭau tu sāgrāṇi barhipakṣānvitāni ca || 21.67
pronnatāni sthirāsthīni lohamṛtkāṣṭhajāni vā |
raṃjitāni <rañjitāni> sudhādyais tu tadādhārāṇi yāni ca || 21.68
mallakāny ambukumbhāni bhṛṅgārakaravīṃ śubhām |
akāmamūlaṃ nirdāhaṃ sādhāraṃ kalaśaṃ tathā || 21.69
sthālīkamaṇḍaluṃ darvīṃ tatpidhānaṃ tu cullikām |
bhadrapīṭhaṃ catuṣpādaṃ caturaśrāyataṃ navam || 21.70
mātrāvittaṃ satāmbūlaṃ dantadhāvanasañcayam |
śuṣkagomayasaṃyuktāmaraṇīṃ cāgnidaṃ maṇim || 21.71
pālāśapūrvāḥ samidhaḥ sāgrāḥ paridhayas tu vai |
prabhūtam indhanaṃ śuṣkam ājyāktaṃ tilataṇḍulam || 21.72
prāguktaṃ sruksruvādyaṃ ca homopakaraṇaṃ ca yat |
sarvaṃ pakṣmakaparyantaṃ bṛhatpātradvayānvitam || 21.73
pūrvoktānāṃ ca bhogānāṃ madhyādyasthaṇḍilārcane |
saṃyāti cāṅgabhāvaṃ taj jñātvā sarvaṃ praveśayet || 21.74
adhivāsadināt pūrvadine kṛtvāṅkurārpaṇam |
adhivāsadine pūrvaṃ kṛtvā vai kautukaṃ śiśoḥ || 21.75
anugrahadhiyacāryo bhaktānāṃ bhāvināṃ vibhoḥ |
divyabhogaphalepsūnāṃ niśreyasapadārthinām || 21.76
pratyekaikaṃ hi yāgāṅgaṃ vardhayed divyamūrtinā |
nityenāvyaktatattvena sanmantrabrahmaṇā saha || 21.77
svātmakarmadruyadravyaṃ mantravyūhaṃ yathāgamam |
phaladaṃ syāt sakāmānām akāmānāṃ hi mokṣadam || 21.78
sahasā yas tatas tatra prāgvat snātvā kṛtāhnikaḥ |
sampraviśyāpyadiksaṃsthaḥ <saṃpraviśyāpyadiksaṃsthaḥ> prāṅmukhaḥ praviśet 
tataḥ || 21.79
padmāsanādinā mārge carmaṇyāsyāt prapūrvakam |
kuryād yadadhikāreṇa mantreṇānugrahaṃ śiśoḥ || 21.80
tenāṅgasahitenaiva sarvakarma samācaret |
samastavaibhavair mantraiḥ kāryo vānugraho yadi || 21.81
sarvārādhanadānārthaṃ dviṣaṭkāvāptaye tadā |
viśākhayūpamantreṇa kuryāt taddāraṇadvayam || 21.82
tadbījena tanuṃ vyāpya prāgvattadabhimantritaiḥ |
purāhṛtair yathāśakti maṇḍalaṃ ca samācaret || 21.83
prāksamālabhanair vastraiḥ kaṭakādyaṅgulīyakaiḥ |
sitoṣṇīṣeṇa mahatā sitamālyena vai saha || 21.84
mukhavāsais satāmbūlair lalāṭatilakena ca |
kṛtvā śubhena śārīraṃ yogapaṭṭena saṃsthitam || 21.85
hṛtpuṇḍarīkamadhye tu sannyased <saṃnyased> bījam aiśvaram |
karayoḥ padmanābhīyaṃ dhruvākhyam atha vigrahe || 21.86
śeṣair ālabhya pādāntam āmūrdhnaś cāpi pūrvavat |
hastayor vigrahe sāṅgaṃ vinyased bījam aiśvaram || 21.87
mudrāvasānaṃ kṛtvaivaṃ samyak tadanu cāharet |
pāṇibhyāṃ śaṅkhacakre dve svamantreṇābhimantrite || 21.88
bhūtvā tadātmanā paścāt tau nidhāya dharātale |
avalokyākhilaṃ tatsthaṃ pravartetātha karmaṇi || 21.89
astrābhimantritaṃ kṛtvā karmāgārāntare sthitaḥ |
tenopalipya samārjya yāgasthānaṃ nighṛṣya ca || 21.90
tadbrahmākhyavayobhayas tejaso 'bhivṛddhaye |
hemapūrvāṇi ratnāni bījāni viniveśya ca || 21.91
prāgvadarghyādipātrāṇi parikalpya yathāvidhi |
mukhyārghyavāriṇā prokṣya pṛthagbhāṇḍasthitaṃ purā || 21.92
pañcagavyaṃ tataḥ prāgvatkalpanīyaṃ hṛdādikaiḥ |
kuśodakaṃ tadastreṇa datvādyenābhimantrya ca || 21.93
atha pāṇidvayenaivāgnīṣomātmakena ca |
yogyatāpadavīṃ nītvā prokṣayed yatpurāhṛtam || 21.94
sāmbhasā tena vai sarvaṃ viṣṭarāgragataiḥ kuśaiḥ |
sarvabījāni dhānyāni siddhārthakayutāni ca || 21.95
kṛtvāstraparijaptāni dhyātvā cāstrasamāni ca |
vighnopaśāntaye yogād daśadikṣu vinikṣipet || 21.96
saṃhṛtya barhikūrcena prācyāṃ diśi nidhāya vai |
tadgarbhīkṛtya saṃlikhya hetirāṭ candanādinā || 21.97
karakaṃ kumbhasaṃyuktam alaṃkṛtya yathāpurā |
bhogaiḥ prāvaraṇāntaiś ca mūrtibhūtau vicintya ca || 21.98
astramantraṃ tu tanmadhye dhyātvābhyarcya yathāvidhi |
dhvaṃsayatnaṃ ca vighnānāṃ kālaṃ karmāvasānakam || 21.99
idam abhyarthya bhagavān sāstro baddhāñjaliḥ sthitaḥ |
yāgālayaṃ hi viśveśa gṛhāṇa racitaṃ mayā || 21.100
āsamāpter bhaja vibho kriyāṅgānāṃ ca sannidhim <saṃnidhim> |
tadastrodakadhārāṃ cāpy acchinnāṃ bhittigāṃ nayet || 21.101
prādakṣiṇyena prāgbhāgāt tatpadāntaṃ ca saṃsmaret |
tannidhāyātha kumbhena saha kuryāt pradakṣiṇam || 21.102
arghyadānaṃ tayoḥ kṛtvā prāgbhāge vikirordhvagam |
pūjitaṃ vāsasā cchannaṃ cakramantrābhimantritam || 21.103
nidadhyād bhadrapīṭhaṃ tu tatrādhāragataṃ nyaset |
sāstraṃ hi mantrakalaśam arcayitvā praṇamya ca || 21.104
digīśvaragaṇaṃ dikṣu pūrvoktaṃ vinyaset tataḥ |
nirodhaṃ sārcanaṃ teṣāṃ kṛtvāstreṇa hṛdā saha || 21.105
praṇavena svanāmnā ca namaskārānugena vai |
toraṇadhvajapūrvāṇāṃ kāryam arghyādinārcanam || 21.106
tato havanabhūmadhye dhyātvā pīṭhaṃ puroditam |
tatrārcanaṃ vibhoḥ kuryāt pūrvoktena krameṇa tu || 21.107
pūrṇāntaṃ tarpaṇaṃ kuryāt prāgvatkuṇḍe tu pūjite |
tatas tu bhagavadbhūtān kṣetranāthasamanvitān || 21.108
arghyapuṣpādinābhyarcya balim ādāya pātragam |
idam uktvā ca tadanu kṣiped yāgagṛhād bahiḥ || 21.109
ye viṣṇubhāvino bhūtā ye ca teṣv anuyāyinaḥ |
āharaṃtu <āharantu> baliṃ tuṣṭāḥ prayacchaṃtu <prayacchantu> śubhaṃ mama || 
21.110
prakṣālitāṃghris <prakṣālitāṅghris> tv ācāntas saṃviśed yāgamandiram |
agnigehetha saṃskṛtya cullīṃ prāgdiśy avasthitām || 21.111
pacanālayam utsṛjya svadeśāt kuṇḍamadhyagām |
sthālīṃ cāstreṇa saṃkṣālya bāhyato gomayādinā || 21.112
vilipyāntas sugandhais tu pratāpya jvalitaiḥ kuśaiḥ |
santāḍya <saṃtāḍya> kusumāstreṇa sitasūtreṇa kaṇṭhataḥ || 21.113
caturdhā varmajaptena saṃveṣṭyārghyādinārcya ca |
culyāṃ kṛtvā samāropya tasyāṃ madhu ghṛtaṃ payaḥ || 21.114
pariśuddhe śṛte kṣīre tv astreṇāropya taṇḍulān |
pācayen mūlamantreṇa dṛṣṭvā netreṇa saṃskṛtam || 21.115
hṛdāvatāryābhighārya śikhāmantreṇa ghaṭṭayet |
śirasālipya saṃkṣālya suprasannena vāriṇā || 21.116
bhūtinā candanāḍhyena bhūṣayed ūrdhvapuṇḍrakaiḥ |
viṣṭaropari cānyatra nidadhyān maṇḍalāntare || 21.117
homaṃ ca siddhaye kṛtvā pūrṇāntam atha vai carau |
āghāradānam ājyena kuryāt tejomṛtātmakam || 21.118
īśābjanābharuddhena haṃsārṇena sabindunā |
tadvadvauṣaḍvaṣaṭkārapraṇavadvitayena ca || 21.119
yato vinā bhāvito 'tra sthitir dvābhyāṃ ca sāmpratam <sāṃpratam> |
ataḥ puroditenaiva tadannaṃ sampuṭena <saṃpuṭena> ca || 21.120
ata ūrdhve ca saṃchannaṃ smared ādāya vai hṛdi |
dravyasampātahome <dravyasaṃpātahome> 'tha pūrṇānte tu kṛte sati || 21.121
uddhṛtyāhutiyogena pātratrayagataṃ tu yat |
sthaṇḍile kalaśe 'gnau ca viniyujya yathāvidhi || 21.122
tadājyabhāvitaṃ śeṣaṃ kuśākrāntaṃ vighaṭya ca |
kramān mūlāstranetreṇa juhuyāc ca śatatrayam || 21.123
nītvā sampūrṇabhāvaṃ <saṃpūrṇabhāvaṃ> ca pūrṇayā punar eva hi |
tataś cottaradikkuryān maṇḍalaṃ gomayādinā || 21.124
prāksāntaṃ viṣṭaraṃ tatra dadyād dārbhaṃ hṛdantare |
tanmadhye vinyasec chiṣyaṃ samāṃghriṃ <samāṅghriṃ> stabdhavigraham || 21.125
prāṅmukhaṃ yatavākcittavṛttirūpaṃ dhṛtāñjalim |
astreṇa pūrvavat kuryāt prokṣaṇaṃ tasya cāmbhasā || 21.126
tenaiva tāḍayen mūrdhni dīptaiḥ siddhārthakais tilaiḥ |
anādivāsanotthānāṃ bandhānāṃ cālanāya ca || 21.127
phaḍantenātha cāstreṇa kuśāgreṇāṃghrigocarāt <kuśāgreṇāṅghrigocarāt> |
samullikhya śikhāntaṃ ca ṛjvarthaṃ mārgasantateḥ <mārgasaṃtateḥ> || 21.128
jālavanmantrajālena vyāptaṃ smṛtvā ca sāṃpratam |
badhnīyān netramantreṇa tasya netre ca vāsasā || 21.129
vasvarghyakusumair gandhaiḥ kṛtvā pūrṇāṃjaliṃ <pūrṇāñjaliṃ> purā |
pāṇinādāya cāmneti nidhāyāgre sthitaṃ vaṭum || 21.130
prakṣepayed devadhāmni natamūrdhnāṃjaliñcatam <natamūrdhnāñjaliñcatam> |
tasyodghāṭitanetrasya tvadṛṣṭasyetarair janaiḥ || 21.131
kuśalādhvaniviṣṭasya dṛṣṭvā vai bhaktilakṣaṇam |
romāñcautsukyaharṣāḍhyamānandāśrusamanvitam || 21.132
sapraṇāmajayālāpadikpradakṣiṇasaṃyutam |
pūtāntaḥkaraṇaṃ budhvā yogyo 'yam iti bhāvayet || 21.133
yadā tadācyutākhyā yānugṛhīto dhiyā tayā |
smared dakṣiṇapāṇau tu cakrāmburuhamadhyagam || 21.134
pradhānadevatābṛndaṃ sve sve dhāmni pare sthitam |
svamarīcigaṇenaiṣa dyotayantaṃ tu cākhilam || 21.135
tenācyutakareṇaiva sodakenālabheta tam |
puṣpapūrṇāñjalau pṛṣṭhe tasya tattritayāśritam || 21.136
kṛtvā mantragaṇāntaṃ vai mokṣavighnopaśāntaye |
punar apy arcayen nītvā mantreṇa parameśvaram || 21.137
ādhārādheyabhāvena budhvāntassaṃsthitaṃ purā |
kṣmādīnāṃ buddhiniṣṭhānāṃ vāsanānāṃ tathātmanām || 21.138
tataḥ kuryāc ca viśleṣaṃ teṣāṃ dhyānārcanādinā |
ātmasatyaṃ samāśritya karmacakraṃ hi vartate || 21.139
taccakram avalambyāste buddhiniṣṭhaṃ hi saptakam |
ajñānavyāpakatvaṃ ca sukhaduḥkhanivedanam || 21.140
sarvajñasyātmatattvasya karmacakrāvalambanāt |
capalaṃ karmacakraṃ tadvardhamānaṃ sadaiva hi || 21.141
kṣmādyamādhāram āśritya tāvad evāvatiṣṭhate |
yāvat sa sarvaṃ śaktyā vai karmātmanā na prabodhitaḥ || 21.142
prabuddhas tasya saṃrodhaṃ kartuṃ śaknoti sarvadā |
mantrārādhanarūpeṇa jñānaniṣṭhena karmaṇā || 21.143
ato ya āśrayaḥ kṣmādyastvasādhāro hi pauruṣam |
nīrasaṃcoriṇiṃ bhūtaṃ kuryāt saṃsthāpya sāṃpratam || 21.144
nirmuktācitphalo yena karmavṛkṣo vinaśyati |
śudhyartham ātmanas tasmāt sarvajñasyāgrataḥ sthale || 21.145
bhūtādidevamantrāṇāṃ kuryād vai pūjanaṃ kramāt |
cittanuṃ viddhi sāmānyaṃ mantranāthair adhiṣṭhitam || 21.146
kṣmādyadhvānaṃ tu budhyantaṃ dhyātvā ṣaṭpatravat purā |
tatra madhye 'bjanābhaṃ ca prāgbhāge kesarordhvagam || 21.147
ṣaṭkaṃ tu viśvarūpādyaṃ kṣmāharāntaṃ tu vinyaset |
nītvā svanāmna ādyarṇaṃ kṣmāntānāṃ bījatāṃ gatam || 21.148
tena teṣāṃ dalāntaṃ prāgvinyāsaṃ saṃsmaret kramāt |
kṣmābījaṃ ca dalāgreṣu mūlaniṣṭheṣu satsu ca || 21.149
sarvaṃ sarvendriyādhāram ity abhinnaṃ purā tataḥ |
cinvānaḥ skandabṛndena svabhūtenāntarīkṛtam || 21.150
uparyupari yogena budhyantaṃ samupasthitam |
bhedadṛṣṭyā yajet samyagbhūyaḥ saṃhāravartmanā || 21.151
savajraṃ svena bījena pītaṃ turyāśralakṣaṇam |
hemābjabhūṣitaṃ dhyātvā kṣmātattvaṃ tatra madhyataḥ || 21.152
vārāhaṃ samyajen mantraṃ sāṅgaṃ sāvaraṇaṃ kramāt |
tatkāraṇāśritaṃ kṛtvā parivārasamanvitam || 21.153
adhastān maṇḍalordhvastham artheṃdusadṛśaṃ <arthendusadṛśaṃ> sitam |
puraṃ padmāṅkitaṃ smṛtvā sitapadmodaraṃ mahat || 21.154
saraśśayaṃ tadantastham abhisandhāya <abhisaṃdhāya> saṃyajet |
tejomayaṃ tadūrdhve tu trikoṇaṃ bhāvayet puram || 21.155
raktajvālāgaṇākīrṇaṃ svastikair upalāñchitam |
nṛsiṃhaṃ pūjayet tatra madhye raktacchaviṃ vibhum || 21.156
tasyoparyasitaṃ vṛttaṃ puraṃ tāṛāgaṇāṅkitam |
smṛtvā nīlāṃbujākrāṃtaṃ <nīlāmbujākrāntaṃ> smaret tatra khagāsanam || 
21.157
nīrūpaṃ khaṃ tadūrdhve tu smarec chabdaikalakṣaṇam |
dhyāyet tadantaḥ sūryābhaṃ prāgvadvarṇaṃ tu paṅkajam || 21.158
tatra vāgīśvaraṃ devam abhyarcya vidhivat tataḥ |
tatkarṇikodarākāśe nānāratnaruciṃ tataḥ || 21.159
saṃsmaret kamalākāraṃ cittavṛttimayaṃ tu yat |
yajet tanmadhyagaṃ viśvarūpaṃ tu manaspatim || 21.160
tadūrdhve 'mṛtagarbhaṃ tu śītāṃśukarakoṭivat |
padmaṃ svenātmanātmānaṃ dhārayantaṃ vibhāvya ca || 21.161
samabhyarcyas tadantastho hy abjanābho dhiyāṃ patiḥ |
evaṃ gandharasarūpasparśaśabdamanodhiyām || 21.162
krameṇādhīśasaṃghaṃ tv avatārya parād yajet |
arcayitvārcayitvā ca nyaset tatraiva taṃ punaḥ || 21.163
ye varṇā bhūtayonīnāṃ raśmayaḥ kamalopamāḥ |
saṃsthitiṃ saṃsmaret teṣām asmin śaktau tathāgatam || 21.164
anādivāsanārūpāṃ tv abhedenātmani sthitām |
niśśeṣabījair abhyutthāṃ padmanābhavidhāriṇīm || 21.165
nirgatāṃ vaiṣayāt sarvād viyuktāṃ svāminā kṛtām |
sphuradrūpāṃ paribhraṣṭāṃ nirādhārāṃ ca saṃsmaret || 21.166
praṇavena samabhyarcya dīkṣākāle hy upasthite |
sādhibhūtādhidaivaṃ ca iṣṭvaivaṃ bhūtasaptakam || 21.167
svayam abhyarcayet paścāc chiṣyamañjalinā ca tam |
tato 'gneḥ sannidhiṃ <saṃnidhiṃ> gatvā dhyātvā dhāmatrayopari || 21.168
dakṣiṇenātmano dārbhaviṣṭare cakramaṃtrite <cakramantrite> |
sakuśena svahastena dakṣiṇaṃ caraṇaṃ guroḥ || 21.169
avalambya samāste vai sparśanādyekatātmanā |
bījenāṃghreś <bījenāṅghreś> śikhāntaṃ ca smaret tejomayaṃ vibhum || 21.170
viśleṣayantaṃ sahasā hy anādyuttham avigraham |
saṃsāracakraṃ vividhaṃ prerakaṃ duḥkhavartmani || 21.171
nāḍyaikyam abhisandhānam <abhisaṃdhānam> abhisandhāya <abhisaṃdhāya> 
cetasā |
viśleṣaṃ karmaṇāṃ tadvadvarmaṇāstreṇa homayet || 21.172
krameṇa saghṛtānāṃ ca tilānāṃ dvādaśāhutim |
anusandhāya <anusaṃdhāya> sampādyo <saṃpādyo> mayāthaṃ vai parātmani || 
21.173
dadyād āhutikāś cāṣṭau mūlena saghṛtāḥ purā |
taduttamāṅgaṃ saṃspṛṣṭvā sruveṇājyānvitena ca || 21.174
hutvā jñānāya tenaiva bhūyas sarvaguṇātmanā |
prāksaṃkhyam ācared dhomamantarāntarayogataḥ || 21.175
agner upādadyāt sarvaṃ netrāntaṃ hy evam eva hi |
iti sampātahome <saṃpātahome> vai sampanne <saṃpanne> sati jāyate || 21.176
kartavyo mantramāhātmyāt saṃskātair nikhilair yutaḥ |
sāmprataṃ <sāṃprataṃ> śaktir ādīnāṃ guṇānām uttaratra tu || 21.177
vibhor ārādhanāt samyagyogyābhyāsāc ca bhājanam |
kṛte sampātahavane <saṃpātahavane> ājyenātha sakṛtsakṛt || 21.178
mantrāṇāṃ tarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā sārcanaṃ śrāvayed vibhum |
asya karmākhyatatvasya karmabandhaṃ savāsanam || 21.179
tadanekaprakāraṃ tu tvacchaktyā stambhitaṃ mayā |
prāyaścittanimittaṃ tu juhuvāt tadanantaram || 21.180
bījenāntarniruddhena svāṅgenāhutikāṣṭakam |
etāvatā mahābuddher jantor janmāśritasya ca || 21.181
yāti vyāmiśrarūpasya heyarūpasya saṅkṣayaḥ <saṃkṣayaḥ> |
mokṣaikaphalado dharma upādeyas tv anantaram || 21.182
yo 'sau sāṃmukhyam āyāti vividhas tasya cācyutaḥ |
yenāntarlīnam abhyeti hy ajñānaṃ sahasā kṣayam || 21.183
athādāyāruṇaṃ sūtraṃ kṛtvā naikaguṇaṃ purā |
nirīkṣya taṃ dṛśā cāstravāriṇā pariśodhitam || 21.184
tadaṅguṣṭhābadhiṃ yāvacchikhāyāḥ samprasārya <saṃprasārya> ca |
saṃsmaret sarvaduḥkhānāṃ sabandhānāṃ tadāspadam || 21.185
saṃviśya devayānena śiśucaitanyasannidhim <śiśucaitanyasaṃnidhim> |
huṃphaḍantaṃ <humphaḍantaṃ> ca śiṣyasya nāma ca praṇavādikam || 21.186
hṛnmantrasampuṭasthaṃ <hṛnmantrasaṃpuṭasthaṃ> ca kṛtvā vai putṛvartmanā |
ānīya saha sūtreṇa nayen netreṇa sāmyatām || 21.187
abhyarcyārghyādināveṣṭya kavacena mahātmanā |
oṃ hum adanyaihuṃsvāhety anenāhutisaptakam || 21.188
hutvāstramantrajaptena sitena rajasā tataḥ |
santāḍya <saṃtāḍya> śaiśavaṃ kāyaṃ viśet pādāvadhiṃ tathā || 21.189
viśleṣayāmukaṃ brūyāt padaṃ vīryapadānugam |
taṃ jñānavācakenātha tvādyantena vikṛṣya ca || 21.190
svabudhyānugataṃ kṛtvā dhyātvā nakṣatragolavat |
sandhāyābhyantare <saṃdhāyābhyantare> sūtre haṃsārṇena sabindunā || 21.191
natipraṇavagarbheṇa ruddhaśaktiṃ ca vigrahe |
vāsanāmayam ity evam ātivāhikasaṃjñakam || 21.192
sūtrātmakaṃ vapuḥ smṛtvātmaśaktyā vibhāvitam |
valamantreṇa saṃruddhaṃ tadarthaṃ juhuyāt tataḥ || 21.193
uktvā omātmane svāhā dviṣaṭkaparisaṃkhyayā |
ādāya bhāvino bandhān vyāpakān śuddhabhogadān || 21.194
jñānādayaḥ samāśritya ye 'tra tiṣṭhaṃti <tiṣṭhanti> sarvadā |
svasthāneṣu svamantrebhyas tāṃs tu tatraiva yojayet || 21.195
yathākrameṇocitānāṃ kṛtvā teṣāṃ ca tarpaṇam |
atha saṃskāracakrasya tattvabṛndāśritasya ca || 21.196
sarvagasyāpi vai viddhi sthitiṃ niyatalakṣaṇām |
tattvavyāptiś ca tenaiva śarīre pāñcabhautike || 21.197
gulphajānukaṭīvakṣaḥkaṇṭhabhrūkāvaṭāvadhi |
budhyantānāṃ dharādīnāṃ kramād avanisaptakam || 21.198
ahaṅkāras <ahaṃkāras> tadutthās tu ye bhedā vividhā api |
cittajā api ye cānye tiṣṭhanti manasā saha || 21.199
sakālotthās tathābodhās tatpūrvās tv apare ca ye |
anekabhedabhinnās tu sthitā āśrityate dhiyam || 21.200
dvisaptabhuvanaṃ viśvam anekaracanānvitam |
śatakoṭipravistīrṇam aṣṭayo 'nyārthasevitam || 21.201
sthitaṃ dharāśritaṃ bhūyo boddhavyaṃ sarvadaiva hi |
catuṣkaṃ jāgrad ādyaṃ yatpadānām apsu vartate || 21.202
mantrakoṭisahasrāṇāṃ vividhānāṃ mahāmate |
yogaṃ siddhisametānāṃ saṃsthitis taijase pade || 21.203
cāturātmīyatattvānāṃ jñeyaṃ kaivalyadehinām |
śāntoditasvarūpāṇāṃ sanniveśo <saṃniveśo> marutpade || 21.204
anekaśaktibhūtānāṃ jñānādīnāṃ ca lāṅgalin |
kālānām āśrayo vyoma yā sā mūrtir na lakṣyate || 21.205
saṃsthitāś cādhayo varṇāḥ pade ṣaṣṭhe tu mānase |
asmin mātrādyamuktāni kīrtite 'smin ṣaḍadhvani || 21.206
kṣipaṃs tu cāharaṃs tv evaṃ śuddhyarthaṃ līlayaiva hi |
sthitaḥ karmātmatattvāni buddhiśaktipade prabhuḥ || 21.207
nirastadoṣaṃ kṛtvā prāk samāviśya tadaiva hi |
svāṃ śaktim upasaṃhṛtya śāntim abhyeti śāśvatīm || 21.208
madhusūdanaparyantaṃ pātālaśayanād atha |
saptaka saptakaṃ ṣaṭkaṃ saṃpaśyet kṣmādipañcake || 21.209
manasy avasthitaṃ hy evaṃ śaktīśāt tritayaṃ hi yat |
buddhau kamalanābhātmā devaḥ sarveśvaraḥ prabhuḥ || 21.210
punaḥ svasiddhair yuktānāṃ sarveṣāṃ pārthive pade |
dvisaptabhedabhinne tu boddhavyā saṃsthitiḥ śubhā || 21.211
tīvramandādikaṃ budhvā bhāvaṃ bhaktisamanvitam |
ālambhanavaśāt kuryāt sarveṣāṃ svapade sthitam || 21.212
eṣa vaibhavadīkṣāyām adhivāsanakarmaṇi |
krama uktas tv athedānīm aparāyāṃ nibodha tu || 21.213
āpādān nābhideśāntaṃ mahābhūtair dharādikaiḥ |
vyāptaṃ caturthā vāyvaṃtais <vāyvantais> tadūrdhvaṃ nabhasā punaḥ || 21.214
pūritaṃ hṛdayāṃtaṃ <hṛdayāntaṃ> ca taduddeśāc chikhāvadhi |
vibhāvya manasā vyāptam anenaiva krameṇa tu || 21.215
sthitās saṅkarṣaṇāntāś <saṃkarṣaṇāntāś> cāpy aniruddhādayas tu vai |
samākramyādhvaṣaṭkan tv adhvātītas tu buddhigaḥ || 21.216
samanā ātmatattvaṃ ca prāgvad abhyetya mūrtatām |
vyāpikā mūrtayas tv etāḥ pṛthaṅmuktaparāyaṇaiḥ || 21.217
tadākārair asaṅkhyais <asaṃkhyais> tu saṃvṛtāḥ kṣmāvanīṣu ca |
prāksaṃkhyāsu ca tiṣṭhanti sarvās sarvāsu sarvadā || 21.218
smṛtvā hy abhedabhāvena ṣaṭkaṃ modakavatpurā |
śikhāntaṃ kṣmādinā tena sarvaṃ vyāptaṃ vicintayet || 21.219
caturātmānam avyaktaṃ śabdamūrtiṃ nirākṛtim |
guṇamātrair vibhinnaṃ ca khaṃ ca tatraiva bhāvayet || 21.220
...?
saṃkrāṃtena <saṃkrāntena> tu vai buddhau sarvaṃ samuditena tu || 21.221
svaśaktyā vai hy anicchāto jīvam ādāyasordhvagam |
svasāmarthyaṃ svaśaktyā tacchāntatmāste? vilāpya ca || 21.222
śuddhāśayānāṃ bhaktānāṃ tatpadaikābhilāṣiṇām |
tatsāmarthyānuviddhānāṃ sarvatra vyaktim eti ca || 21.223
atas tu yadyatsaṃvedyaṃ heyaṃ parimitan tv api |
tattadāthatmanābhyeti sarvadā bhāvitātmanām || 21.224
ityādau sarvasāmānyo nityo vidyākhya āśrayaḥ |
boddhavyaḥ so 'pi tadanu hy asāmāntyatayā gataḥ || 21.225
āmokṣād aṅgabhāvaṃ ca jīvānāṃ svayam eva hi |
vajravatsūkṣmarūpeṇa saṃpūjyena mahāmate || 21.226
dīkṣākāle tu śiṣyāṇāṃ parijñeyaṃ yathoditam |
evam eva vijānīyād bhūyaḥ sautre tu vigrahe || 21.227
saptadhā tu vibhajyādau sandhīn <saṃdhīn> vai kuṅkumādinā |
citrīkṛtya taduddeśāt praṇavādyantagais tataḥ || 21.228
svanāmapadasaṃyuktaṃ grathanīyaṃ svakāraṇaiḥ |
evaṃ vyāptimayair bhogair hṛdā pūrṇāntime kṛte || 21.229
nītvā vai maṇḍalasthasya vibhos taṃ sannivedayet <saṃnivedayet> |
varmaṇā cchāditaṃ kṛtvā nidhāya kalaśāgrataḥ || 21.230
saśiṣyo 'thārcanaṃ kuryāt punarviśvātmano vibhoḥ |
pradakṣiṇaiḥ praṇāmais tu nānāstutipadaiḥ saha || 21.231
tatropalipte bhūbhāge maṇḍalāntaṃ ca taṃ bahiḥ |
sthānabhedasthitaṃ kṛtvā netrahṛnmaṃtramantritaiḥ <netrahṛnmantramantritaiḥ> || 
21.232
pañcagavye carau dantadhāvane viniyojya tam |
bhaktojjhite dantakāṣṭhe kuryāt siddhivicāraṇam || 21.233
saumyavāruṇa īśāne yadi pūrvadigānanam |
tatsiddhisūcakaṃ viddhi viparītam ato'nyathā || 21.234
tad dhvaṃsanāya juhuyād vīryamantreṇa vai śatam |
dhūpānulepanādīni rajāṃsi ghaṭikādayaḥ || 21.235
sājyāni ca tilādīni yogyāny anyāni lāṅgalin |
uddhṛtyottarataḥ kṛtvā varmajaptena vāsasā || 21.236
abhuktenāhatenaiva tvācchādya susitena ca |
samabhyarcyāstramantreṇa puṣpadhūpānulepanaiḥ || 21.237
kṣāntvā sthalasthitaṃ devamagnau vā kalaśe nyaset |
atha śuddhe tu bhūbhāge hṛnmatritakuśāstare || 21.238
kṛtvā prāṅmastakaṃ śiṣyaṃ balajaptāṃśukena tu |
hṛdāvakuṇṭhitatanuṃ mukhyamantram anusmaran || 21.239
svāpayet svapnalābhāya tato hṛnmantritais tilaiḥ |
siddhārthakayutais tasya nidadhyāt parito bahiḥ || 21.240
sabarhipakṣaṃ mantreṇa prāgvadiṣv aṣṭakaṃ nyaset |
pradakṣiṇena tac cāpi sitasūtreṇa varmaṇā || 21.241
caturdhā veṣṭayitvā tu maṇṭapān niṣkramed bahiḥ |
dantakāṣṭhādikaṃ karma viniṣpādya svayaṃ svapet || 21.242
kutape darbhaśayyāyāṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇataś śiraḥ |
saṃspṛśet svāṃghriyugmena <svāṅghriyugmena> śiśuṃ śayanasaṃsthitam || 
21.243
bhagavantaṃ hi manasā prārthayann apavargadam |
omādīśa jagannātha sarvajña hṛdayeśaya || 21.244
tatrāhaṃ yojayāmy enaṃ satkarma tvatparāyaṇam |
prāptānujñas tu śiṣyāṇāṃ kuryād vai tatra yojanam || 21.245
yatra yatra ca tat teṣām avaśyaṃ śāśvataṃ bhavet |
itthaṃ dīkṣādhivāsasya vidhānaṃ samprakīrtitam <saṃprakīrtitam> || 21.246
ekānekasvarūpā tu dīkṣedānīṃ prakīrtyate |
āsādya yāṃ samāyānti dehānte 'bhimataṃ padam || 21.247
kaivalyaphaladā hy ekā bhogakaivalyadā parā |
bhogadaiva tṛtīyā ca prabuddhānāṃ sadaiva hi || 21.248
ācāryānumatāḥ sarvāḥ kāryāḥ samyak phalāptaye |
bhaktibhāvānuviddhānāṃ śiṣyāṇāṃ bhavināṃ tu vai || 21.249
vṛddhānām aṅganānāṃ ca bālānāṃ bhāvitātmanām |
vinācārasamūhena duḥśakena ca tā hitāḥ || 21.250
purā dhiyā vicāryaivam upasannena vai saha |
tadīyam āśayaṃ jñātvā sampādyaikā <saṃpādyaikā> mahāmate || 21.251
athātīter dharātre tūtthāya śayanād guruḥ |
kamaṇḍaluṃ samādāya bahirācamya saṃviśet || 21.252
saṃsmared agrataś cāstraṃ hutabhugrāśisannibham <hutabhugrāśisaṃnibham> |
tadantas saṃviśed evaṃ snānaṃ māṃtraṃ <māntraṃ> kṛtaṃ bhavet || 21.253
nidrāmohamalaṃ yena śaśvadāyāti saṅkṣayam <saṃkṣayam> |
śaṅkūn vai ghaṭikāsūtraṃ rajāṃsy astravareṇa tu || 21.254
samādāya ca saṃskṛtya niṣpiṣyāghyair mahītale |
śuṣkagomayasaṃspṛṣṭe maṇḍalaṃ yatpuroditam || 21.255
bhadratvaparirakṣārthaṃ nyasyāḥ koṇeṣu śaṅkavaḥ |
kamalaṃ bhramasiddhyartham ekaṃ madhye niveśya ca || 21.256
īṣannāyāti vaiṣamyaṃ tadrātrisamaye yathā |
mahānyūnāthike doṣaḥ saśiṣyasya yato guroḥ || 21.257
atas tadrakṣaṇīyaṃ ca yatnena mahatā sadā |
nirvartya nityaṃ pratyūṣe purā vai snānapūrvakam || 21.258
śiṣyam ādāya sañcodya <saṃcodya> svapnaprāptiṃ śubhāśubhām |
caturmūrtisamūhaṃ tu yathādiksaṃsthitaṃ tu vai || 21.259
paśyet paṅktiniviṣṭaṃ copaviṣṭaṃ tu cotthitam |
tanmadhyād bhagavattattvam ekaṃ vā bhinnalakṣaṇam || 21.260
prādurbhāvasamūhaṃ ca tallāñchanagaṇaś ca yaḥ |
devīyaṃ banitābṛndaṃ sarvam ekatamādha vā || 21.261
bhavopakaraṇavrātam aśeṣaṃ vā pṛthaksthitam |
rudrendracandrasūryāmbuhutabhugvātalakṣaṇam || 21.262
pañcarātravido viprā ārādhanaparāyaṇāḥ |
trayīm udghoṣayantaś ca nigadantaś ca vā dvijāḥ || 21.263
yatayaḥ śuddhasatvāś ca sadbrahmapadasaṃssthitāḥ |
nagasrakcandanādyāni sugandhāni tarūttamaḥ || 21.264
udyānavanitārāmavāpīharmya mahālayāḥ |
phalabījoṣadhīsāmbukumbho vā pākanirgataḥ || 21.265
gogajāśvanadīyānaṃ kanyā sālaṃkṛtā śiśuḥ |
maṅgalyagītimadhurā bherī vaṃśaś ca vallarī || 21.266
sasārasaṃ saraḥ padmaiḥ pūrṇaṃ chatraṃ sitaṃ tatam |
hemādidhātavo ratnajālaṃ gosambhavāni <gosaṃbhavāni> ca || 21.267
navo netracayaś śuklaṃ vastrabṛndamanāhatam |
rājāpurodhāḥ sāmanto rājapatnī ca darpaṇam || 21.268
tuṣārapātasadvṛṣṭimahāmedhodayo divi |
śoṇitaṃ cārdramāṃsāni khaplutir madirādayaḥ || 21.269
satpakṣimṛgasaṃghātasurārcā cāmaraṃ sitam |
evamādīni cānyāni viddhi siddhipradāni ca || 21.270
svapnāni yāny aniṣṭāni tāni me leśataś śṛṇu |
mlānatā kṣitikampaś coparāgo 'tibhīṣaṇaḥ || 21.271
nīhāra ulkāpātaś ca nirghātaś cittabhaṅgakṛt |
gartapraveśo dadhyannaṃ svinnamāṃsasya bhakṣaṇam || 21.272
nartanaṃ rathavidhvasa ājyaṃ svāṅgād vijacyutiḥ |
kharoṣṭraṃ cotkaṭaṃ hāsyaṃ kapiṛkṣākulaṃ vanam || 21.273
sthānaṃ dhūmākulaṃ dagdham asitāṃbaraveṣṭitam <asitāmbaraveṣṭitam> |
śuṣkatvaṃ saridādīnāṃ pratisrotas tvam eva ca || 21.274
potayānaṃ dhvajacchatratarubhaṅgo 'py asiddhikṛt |
avatāro nagād vṛkṣānn agnatvaṃ pretadarśanam || 21.275
vacākajjalatailājyaleposatkardame sthitiḥ |
mahiṣohirnara kṛṣṇo dakṣiṇāśāgamaḥ kṣudhā || 21.276
luṇṭhanaṃ nakhakeśānām asthibhaṅgādhikādratam |
evamādīni cānyāny aśubhāni mahāmate || 21.277
prāpte śubhāśubhe svapne 'py abhisandhāya <abhisaṃdhāya> vai hṛdi |
autsukyādaśivadhvaṃsi pūjāhomaṃ samācaret || 21.278
yathoktavidhinā devam avatārya kramād yajet |
tarpayitvā yathānyāyaṃ pūrṇāṃtaṃ <pūrṇāntaṃ> cārcayet punaḥ || 21.279
īśakoṇe 'thavā saumye pade yāgagṛhasya ca |
maṇḍale pūrvanirdiṣṭe vṛtte vā caturaśrake || 21.280
snātaṃ sragvastrabhṛcchiṣyaṃ kṛtanyāsaṃ niveśayet |
nirīkṣya tāḍya saṃprokṣya darbhair ālabhya pūrvavat || 21.281
saṃskṛtya mūrtivat kiṃ tv anugṛhya dharāgatam |
āpādān mantrahastena parāmṛśyātha mūrdhani || 21.282
mantrahastam jvaladrūpaṃ dadyād yo duḥkhabījajit |
ataḥ śiṣyasya vai kuryāt saṃskārān pañca ca kramāt || 21.283
tāpaḥ puṇḍras tathā nāma mantro yāgaś ca paṃcamaḥ <pañcamaḥ> |
tatra tāpavidhānaṃ tu śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 21.284
ācāryo vaiṣṇavān sabhyān pūjya teṣām anujñayā |
gatvā kuṇḍasamīpaṃ tu śiṣyeṇa sahito guruḥ || 21.285
cakraśaṅkhau samabhyarcya tattanmantraiḥ pratiṣṭhitau |
pūrvaṃ svaguruṇā dattau svadīkṣāvasare dvijāḥ || 21.286
mūlamantreṇa juhuyāc chatam aṣṭottaraṃ ghṛtaiḥ |
vaiṣṇavyā cāpi gāyatryā tadviṣṇor iti vai ṛcā || 21.287
tataḥ kuṇḍānale cakraśaṃkhau <cakraśaṅkhau> nikṣipya pūjayet |
tatas tu cakramantreṇa śaṃkhamantreṇa <śaṅkhamantreṇa> ca dvijāḥ || 21.288
hutvā cāṣṭottaraśatam aṣṭaviṃśatim eva vā |
pavitranteti mantreṇa prate viṣṇo iti tv ṛcā || 21.289
hutvā tatas tu deveśaṃ dhyātvā guruparamparām <guruparaṃparām> |
śiṣyasya dakṣiṇaṃ bāhumūlaṃ cakreṇa cāṅkayet || 21.290
śaṅkhena pratapet savyabāhumūlaṃ munīśvarāḥ |
tataś cakraṃ ca śaṃkhaṃ <śaṅkhaṃ> cābhiṣicya svamantrataḥ || 21.291
saṃpūjya mūlamantreṇa hunet pūrṇāhutiṃ dvijāḥ |
tatas tu cordhvapuṇḍrāṇi dhārayen munipuṅgavāḥ || 21.292
tadvidhānaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ sāvadhānataḥ |
gṛhītvā vaiṣṇavakṣetrād vimalāṃ śvetamṛttikām || 21.293
hatsau prakṣālya cācamya prāṅmukhaṃ vāpy udaṅmukham |
upaviśyāsane śuddhe vāmahastatalaṃ dvijāḥ || 21.294
saṃkṣālya cāstramantreṇa tatra vai śvetamṛttikām |
praṇavena tu vinyasya gandhadvāreti tāṃ mṛdam || 21.295
jalena secayitvātha kṛtvā digbandhanaṃ dvijāḥ |
mūlamantreṇābhigantrya vāgahastasthitāṃ mṛdam || 21.296
tanmadhye nārasiṃhasya bījam ālikhya mantravit |
aṅgulyā mṛdam ādāya lalāṭādiṣu dhārayet || 21.297
puṣṭipradenāṅguṣṭhena tarjinyā muktisiddhaye |
vāṃchitārthapradāthinyāṃ <vāñchitārthapradāthinyāṃ> tathā nāgikayātha vā 
|| 21.298
āyuṣkāgī madhyamayā cāṃgulyā <cāṅgulyā> ca munīśvarā |
etābhir aṃgulībhis <aṅgulībhis> tu dhārayen na nakhaiḥ spṛśet || 21.299
ūrdhvapuṣḍramṛjuṃ ramyaṃ viṣṇoḥ pādadvayākṛtim |
sāntarālaṃ supārśvaṃ ca dvyaṅgulaṃ tryaṅgulaṃ vā || 21.300
vistīrṇam atha cāyāme caturaṅgulasammitam <caturaṅgulasaṃmitam> |
lalāṭedhārayet kukṣau caturaṅgulavistṛtam || 21.301
aṣṭāṅgulāyataṃ yadvā prādeśaparisammitam <prādeśaparisaṃmitam> |
dhārayed ūrdhvapuṇḍraṃ tu tāvanmānasam anvitam || 21.302
ūrdhvapuṇḍraṃ tu hṛdaye dhārayel lakṣāṇvitam |
tatas tryaṃgulavistīrṇaṃ <tryaṅgulavistīrṇaṃ> caturaṃgulam <caturaṅgulam> 
āyatam || 21.303
ūrdhvapuṣṇraṃ kaṇṭhadeśe tato vai dakṣiṇodare |
ūrdhvapuṇḍaraṃ tu pūrvoktakukṣipuṇḍrasamaṃ dvijāḥ || 21.304
tatas tu dakṣiṇe bāhumadhye tv aṣṭāṃgulāyatam <aṣṭāṅgulāyatam> |
caturaṃgulavistīrṇam <caturaṅgulavistīrṇam> ūrdhvapuṇḍraṃ tu dhārayet || 21.305
tatas tu dakṣiṇāṃse tu kaṇṭhapuṇḍrasamaṃ bhavet |
vāmakukṣau tūrdhvapuṇḍraṃ kukṣipuṇḍrasamaṃ bhavet || 21.306
vāmabāhau bhavet puṇḍraṃ dakṣabāhūktalakṣaṇam |
vāmāṃse tu tataḥ puṇḍraṃ kaṇṭhapuṇḍrasamaṃ bhavet || 21.307
pṛṣṭhe tv aṣṭāṃgulāyāgaṃ <aṣṭāṅgulāyāgaṃ> caturaṃgulavistṛtam 
<caturaṅgulavistṛtam> |
ūrdhvapuṇḍraṃ kakuddeśe caturaṃgulam <caturaṅgulam> āyatam || 21.308
tathā tryaṃgulavistāraṃ <tryaṅgulavistāraṃ> dhārayen munipuṅgavāḥ |
evaṃ dvādaśa puṇḍrāṇi dhṛtvā caiva yathākramam || 21.309
hastakṣālanatoyaṃ tu mūrdhni saṃprokṣayed dvijāḥ |
tatas tu cordhvapuṇḍrāṇāṃ madhye viṣṇusamarṣitam || 21.310
dhārayed rajanīcūrṇaṃ lakṣmīsān nidhyasiddhaye |
vartidīpākṛtiṃ caiva veṇupatrākṛtiṃ tu vā || 21.311
evaṃ dhṛte hy ūrdhvapuṇḍre lakṣmyā sārthaṃ jagatpatiḥ |
krīḍate satataṃ tatra tato baddhāñjalir dvijāḥ || 21.312
nāmabhiḥ keśavādīnāṃ tadarthadhyānapūrvakam |
tattacchaktisametāṃs tu keśavādīn smared budhaḥ || 21.313
lalāṭe keśavaṃ dhyāyen nārāyaṇam athodare |
mādhavaṃ hṛdaye caiva govindaṃ kaṇṭhakūbare || 21.314
udare dakṣiṇe pārśve viṣṇuṃ dhyāyen munīśvarāḥ |
tatpārśve bāhumadhye tu cintayen madhusūdanam || 21.315
trivikraman tu tatskandhe vāmakukṣau tu vāmanam |
śrīdharaṃ vāmabāhau tu hṛṣīkeśaṃ tadaṃsake || 21.316
apare padmanābhaṃ tu trike dāmodaraṃ smaret |
ity evam ūrdhvapuṇḍrasya vidhānaṃ suprakīrtitam || 21.317
evaṃ śiṣyasyordhvapuṇḍraṃ dhārayitvā yathā vidhi |
nāma kuryāc ca śiṣyasya tadvidhānam ihocyate || 21.318
tam ādāya karād devadhāmasannikaṭaṃ vrajet |
kṛtvātmano vāmabhāge bhūyaḥ saṃchādya locane || 21.319
prakṣepayet tathā sārghyamañjaliṃ muktalocanaḥ |
sampaśyet <saṃpaśyet> paramaṃ dhāma māntram icchāphalapradam || 21.320
tasminn avasare kuryān nāma yasya yathocitam |
rahasyasaṃjñaṃ mukhyaṃ ca gauṇaṃ vāsya yathāsthitam || 21.321
sāmānyaṃ vāsudevādyaṃ nāma svāṅkāc caturṣv api |
sarveṣāṃ saviśeṣaṃ vā yathācānukrameṇa tu || 21.322
dviṣaṭkamūrtyaṅkitaṃ ca svāmyantaṃ brāhmaṇeṣu ca |
devāntaṃ kṣatriyāṇāṃ ca kuryād dvādaśadhā punaḥ || 21.323
pāṇyantaṃ dharaniṣṭhaṃ vā lāñchanāstrapurassaram |
dhvajalāñchanasaṃjñaṃ ca yathāvasthaṃ nṛpeṣu ca || 21.324
evaṃ vardhananiṣṭhaṃ ca mūrtilāñchanapūrvakam |
vihitaṃ cāpi vaiśyānāṃ dāsāntaṃ śūdrajanmanām || 21.325
athotthāya namaskṛtya maṇḍalaṃ kalaśaṃ gurum |
yāyāt kuṇḍasamīpaṃ tu śiśunā saha deśikaḥ || 21.326
kṛtasya karmaṇocchidrasiddhaye ca hute sati |
santāḍyāstrātmako <saṃtāḍyāstrātmako> bhūtvā prāgvattaddhṛdayaṃ viśet || 
21.327
prāṇaśaktiviyuktaṃ ca kṛtvānīya samāsataḥ |
sampraveśya <saṃpraveśya> svakaṃ sthānaṃ tatrāgnikaṇavac ca tam || 21.328
nītvā samyakpṛthagbhāvaṃ virecya saha vāyunā |
svabhūmau vāmamārgeṇa hṛdādyantaṃ nirodhitam || 21.329
janmagrahamanenaiva mantrayuktena karmaṇā |
bhāvadhyānānuviddheva pitṛmātṛmayaṃ tyajet || 21.330
tataḥ kavacamantreṇa dadyāt saptābhimantritam |
tasyopavītam aparam uditaṃ cāpi yasya tat || 21.331
sarvadhā dāsabhāvatvam āpannasya ca tattvataḥ |
amadyapānvayorthasya lokadharmojjhitasya ca || 21.332
āptavadbrahmaniṣṭhasya karmatantratasya ca |
godānaṃ śūdrajāter vai vihitaṃ caiva tānyathā || 21.333
vaiṣaṭsvāhāvaṣaṭkāraniṣṭhānāṃ tu pratikriyā |
namaskāreṇa mantrāṇāṃ kārye prāpte hy anugrahe || 21.334
tadīyam arghyapuṣpādyaṃ yat kiñcidyāgasādhanam |
susaṃskṛtam asiddhaṃ vā bhaktyā karmaṇyatāṃ vrajet || 21.335
ato'nyeṣāṃ tu bhaktānāṃ vihitā yāgasādhane |
samyaksatvanivṛttiḥ prāgdarśanaprokṣaṇānvitam || 21.336
mūrtau vā maṇḍalāgre tu puṣpakṣepaṃ mahāmate |
naktaṃ vā paripīḍaṃ ca bhūtārthaṃ caivam eva hi || 21.337
evaṃ saṃskārasaṃśuddhaṃ kṛtvā varṇagaṇaṃ purā |
sāṅgena vibhunā kuryāt tatprāyaścittatarpaṇam || 21.338
sadaśāṃśaṃ sahasraṃ tu yathā cānukrameṇa tu |
gatvā cābhyarthyakumbheśaṃ sūtram ādāya tat sthitam || 21.339
ṛjubhūtaṃ śiśuṃ kṛtvā tadvatsūtraṃ prasārya ca |
vyaktarūpaṃ ca mantreśaṃ saṃsmared agnimadhyagam || 21.340
paśyed vibhau śiśuṃ sūtre svātmanyadhvānamañjasā |
tatrādhyātmasvarūpaṃ ca saṃsmaren mantradehagam || 21.341
adhidaivasvabhāvaṃ ca tatsvātmanyavatārya ca |
adhibhūtamayaṃ sūtre trividhaṃ śiṣyavigrahe || 21.342
mūlamantrāvasāne tu sanamaskaṃ parātmane |
padaṃ kṛtvā tu juhuyād āhutīnāṃ catuṣṭayam || 21.343
tathā sūkṣmātmane coktvā tataḥ sthūlātmane tu vai |
sarvātmane ca tadanu tato 'dhvanicayaṃ hitam || 21.344
ā pādāgrāc chikhāntaṃ ca sarvaṃ dhyātvā svadehagam |
yathoddiṣṭakrameṇaiva vibhinnaṃ trividhaṃ tv api || 21.345
racanā sanniveśo <saṃniveśo> yaḥ kṣmādīnāṃ cādhibhūtatā |
boddhavyam adhidevatvaṃ sāmarthyaṃ yasya yatsvakam || 21.346
tadadhiṣṭhātṛmantrāṇām adhyātmatvaṃ vidhīyate |
atha mārgadvayaṃ tyaktvā dvādaśāntaṃ samāśrayet || 21.347
mūlamantramayo bhūtvā saṃvrajet svadhiyā tataḥ |
brahmadvārapadaṃ śaiṣyaṃ tatas tanmadhyavartmanā || 21.348
pārthivaṃ pādam ākramya kuryāt tacchaktim ātmasāt |
bījabhūtāṃ ca hṛnmantrasaṃruddhāṃ gandhavigrahām || 21.349
nānāṇḍabījasaṃruddhām anekaracanānvitām |
evam ādāya vai sarvā buddhiniṣṭhās tu śaktayaḥ || 21.350
pṛthak pṛthak krameṇaiva tasmin hṛnmantrasaṃpuṭe |
svenādhyātmagaṇenaiva pareṇa vyāpakātmanā || 21.351
taddehaṃ dhārayantaṃ ca smaret tadubhayātmakam |
kālaṃ bhogakṣayāntaṃ ca tatkālāc ca mahāmate || 21.352
kṛtvaivaṃ bhūtaśaktīnāṃ saṃhāraṃ śiśuvigrahāt |
sautraṃ deham athākramya saumyaṃ tenaiva vartmanā || 21.353
prollasaṃstadvajet tatra vyañjayet tu dhiyā tu yat |
ādāyādhyātmamantrāṃś ca bhūtabhūtānvitān atha || 21.354
nityañ ca lakṣaṇaiḥ śuddhaiḥ samantrais tatasthitān api |
atha sūtrād viniṣkramya prayāthādanalāśrayam || 21.355
tatrāvayabandhathān?ān mantrasāmyaṃ samācaret |
samāhṛtānāṃ mantrāṇāṃ pare sarvajñalakṣaṇe || 21.356
vyāpake sarvasāmānye kṛtvā sve sve pade sthitim |
svaśarīram athāsādya brahmadvāreṇa deśikaḥ || 21.357
sruvam ādāya santarpya <saṃtarpya> mantrabṛndaṃ yathoditam |
tattvabṛndasametaṃ ca svanāmnā praṇavādinā || 21.358
bhūyaḥ saṃsṛṣṭiyogena dviṣaṭkaparisaṃkhyayā |
pūrakena samākṛṣya śiṣyaṃ hṛtkamalād dhṛdi || 21.359
atha vyaktinirastaṃ ca kṣmābījaṃ paralakṣaṇam |
bhūśaktyā jñānasaṃruddhaṃ kṛtvādāyānalād dhṛdi || 21.360
praṇavāsanaviśrāntaṃ virecyābje tu śaiśave |
smṛtvātha śiṣyacaitanyam ekam eva dvirūpaghṛt || 21.361
śaktimacchaktibhāvena śaktitvena tu saṃsmaret |
kṣmātattvāntargataṃ kuṇḍe śaktimatvena tat punaḥ || 21.362
recayitvā svasāmnā ca vigrahe madhyavarmanā |
niyojya tatsamādhau tu japadhyānaikalakṣaṇe || 21.363
tad evaṃ pārthivaṃ bījaṃ hṛdā vai homakarmaṇā |
samyak tasyopakārārthaṃ netavyaṃ sūkṣmadehatām || 21.364
svāhāntaṃ bhogasidhyarthaṃ namo'ntaṃ mokṣasiddhaye |
bhogamokṣāptaye vāpi tad evobhayalakṣaṇam || 21.365
karmaṇām avasāne tu saṃpādayapadaṃ nyaset |
evaṃ tadvigrahe sūkṣme taddhṛtpadmagatasya ca || 21.366
śirasā cādhikāraṃ tu tasyāpādya yathāsthitam |
śikhāmantreṇa tadbhogaṃ nirvartya śatasaṃkhyayā || 21.367
varmaṇā tatphalaprāptiṃ tallayatvam api smaret |
svatṛptimayanetreṇa kuryāt tenaiva tatsthitam || 21.368
tattyāgaś cāstramantreṇa viśleṣeṇa yato bhavet |
mūlenātha gṛhītvā tat kuryāc caivātmasāt punaḥ || 21.369
tadvacchaktiṃ tadīyāṃ ca kuṇḍād vyāpakalakṣaṇām |
kṣmātattvasyātha sādhyasya hy asādhārasya śāntaye || 21.370
pūrvasaṃkhyaṃ tu cāstreṇa kṛtvā homaṃ mahāmate |
sruvam ājyena sampūrya <saṃpūrya> skandasūtrāt tu parthivam || 21.371
vikarttya pūrṇayā sārthaṃ vilāpyāgnau svake pade 
mūlamantreṇa sahasā hṛtpadme preritena tu || 21.372
svadehād recakenātha prerya śaktiṃ ca śaiśavīm |
tayākrāntamadhasthaṃ ca saṃsmared vyatiriktayā || 21.373
kabinduno vābjapatramādyādhvānaṃ ca bhauvanam |
śiṣyadehe niruddhasya vyaktikroḍīkṛtasya ca || 21.374
svaśaktiparipūrṇasya kṣmābījasya tv athopari |
virecyaśaktimantaṃ ca vyastadharmeṇa pūrvavat || 21.375
tatkṣaṇebījasaṃsthaṃ tv adhvānaṃ tu yathāsthitam |
prakāśayantaṃ kṛpayā tannāthantasya siddhaye || 21.376
viraktaṃ bhāvayec chiṣyaṃ cinmayantam idaṃ dhiyā |
idaṃ tatpārthivaṃ tattvaṃ mudhā vai duḥkhapañjaram || 21.377
bhāvavatvagataṃ cāsya susahatvaṃ ca sāmpratam <sāṃpratam> |
katham atra tv ahaṃ cāsaṃ yasya me na tatā imāḥ || 21.378
vimuktaḥ paṃjarād <pañjarād> yadvatsukhamāste vihaṅgamaḥ <vihaṃgamaḥ> |
ūrdhvapātī tadārūḍhas tv evaṃ mantrabalāc chiśuḥ || 21.379
samūham atha vijñāpya tatprabhutvena yatsthitaḥ |
sanniruddho <saṃniruddho> bhavet tvasya sarvataḥ sarvadaiva hi || 21.380
yuṣmatprasādasāmarthyād yathāvatpārthivo guṇaḥ |
dehāntaṃ gandhatanmātraṃ bhaved āsīnam asya vai || 21.381
samyaksampratipannasya <samyaksaṃpratipannasya> śāsane pārameśvare |
he dharādhipate nātha asyādyaprabhṛti tvayā || 21.382
dhvaṃsāya mokṣavighnānāṃ bhavitavyañ ca karmaṇaḥ |
iti vijñāpya cājñāpya āpādyāhutayaḥ kramāt || 21.383
saha śaktyā samākṛṣya bhūyas tatpūrakeṇa tu |
taddehe cāmmayaṃ bījaṃ sādhāraṃ pūrvavan nyaset || 21.384
kuṇḍamadhye tu sandhāya <saṃdhāya> jīvaśaktiṃ ca pūrvavat |
virecya śaktimāṃs tatra niyojya tadanantaram || 21.385
tatsamādhau yathāpūrvaṃ kumbhakena mahāmate |
athāpyaṃ deham āsādya homadhyānādinā param || 21.386
tatrādhikārapūrvaṃ tu sarvaṃ nṛvartya tasya vai |
āpyena sūtraskandhena saha pūrṇāṃ nipātya ca || 21.387
aptatvaṃ padasaṃyuktaṃ tenākrāntaṃ smaret tathā |
tatsthaṃ mantrasamūhaṃ tu saha tatpatinā tu vai || 21.388
pūrvavac chrāvayitvā ca rasam ajñāpya gandhavat |
manovasānaṃ nītvaivaṃ taṃ varṇādhvordhvagocaram || 21.389
niṣṭhāṅgena mahābuddhe tejasāstreṇa cecchayā |
samuddhṛtyātha vai prāgvadyoktavyaṃ buddhigocare || 21.390
ṣaḍadhvamuktaṃ mūlena prāptasaṃjñaṃ ca taṃ śiśum |
tattvakañcukanirmuktaṃ śāntātmany ekatāṃ gatam || 21.391
smṛtvā śaktyātmanāgnau tu labdhalakṣaṇaṃ pare pade |
aiśvareṇa tu bījena proktasatvānvitena ca || 21.392
tataḥ saṃvedya nirbhukte samādhau viniyojya ca |
na vetti yatra saṃlīnaḥ svānandaṃ dvaitamātrakam || 21.393
āhutīnāṃ śataṃ hutvā tadāpādanakarmaṇi |
nītvā samānatāṃ sarvaṃ tenaiva svadhiyākhilam || 21.394
saha saṃvedyajālena vākprabandhaṃ yathāsthitam |
nistaraṅgamayo bhūtvā dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ parām || 21.395
athāsmitāṃ prāpya guruḥ pradadyād āhutiṃ punaḥ |
bījanāthena śiṣyasya tv apamokṣanivṛttaye || 21.396
padair oṅkārasaṃruddhaiḥ <oṃkārasaṃruddhaiḥ> padāvasthitamānasaḥ |
sarvajño bhava coktvaivaṃ juhuyād dvādaśāhutim || 21.397
bhavaivam evabhagavān niravadyo nirāśrayaḥ |
sarveśvaraḥ sarvaśaktiḥ susampūrṇo <susaṃpūrṇo> 'cyuto hariḥ || 21.398
vyāpī niruddhaṣāḍguṇyo nirvikāro niraṃjanaḥ <nirañjanaḥ> |
nityo nityoditonūno nityānandaḥ suniṣkalaḥ || 21.399
anādyanto hy anidhano vāsudevo vibhūtimān |
hutvaivaṃ ca tataḥ kuryāt pūrṇayā punar eva hi || 21.400
sthitaṃ vaibhavadīkṣāyāṃ mumukṣor aiśvare pade |
yatrastho dhāma cābhyeti hy acirāt parameśvaram || 21.401
īśvarecchāvaśenaiva dehapātān mahāmate |
bhogecchoḥ padmanābhīya ubhayepsoḥ padadvaye || 21.402
śaktimacchaktiyogena tv atha buddhimaye 'dhvani |
niveśyo dehapātantaṃ kālam uddhṛtya tatpadāt || 21.403
antargūḍho yathā kāṣṭhāt pāvakaś ca pṛthakkṛtaḥ |
na bhūyaḥ saha kāṣṭhena sāmyam eti tathā pumān || 21.404
yojitodhvāntare bhūyo naiti tanmayatāṃ tataḥ |
samādhipracyutiṃ kṛtvā viniveśyātmano 'grataḥ || 21.405
yathāvadupadeṣṭavyas tasyādhvā ca sitāsitaḥ |
saṃsthito yaṃs tv abhedena bhinnarūpaḥ parātmani || 21.406
vedyavedakanirmuktam acyutaṃ brahma yatparam |
tacchabdabrahmabhāvena svaśaktyā svayam eva hi || 21.407
muktaye 'khilajīvānām udeti parameśvaraḥ |
tadavyaktākṣaraṃ viddhis tantraśabdo yathā kalaḥ || 21.408
pṛthagvarṇātmanā yāti sthitaye na tathā svayam |
no yānti niścayaṃ yatra cāturātmyād anugrahāt || 21.409
ṛte vedavido viprās tv etasmin prathamekṣare |
sa śabdamūrtir bhagavān abhyeti ca kalātmanā || 21.410
tadgṛho yujyate yena tanniṣṭhānāṃ hi karmaṇā |
na ṣāḍguṇyakalotthā ca yāvanmūrtir niraṃjanā <nirañjanā> || 21.411
vada jenānyathā mūrtaṃ tadgṛhītuṃ niyujyate |
tattvāḥ kalāmayāḥ sarve prabhavāpyayalakṣaṇāḥ || 21.412
pūrvoktā vāsudevādyā adhyakṣāntā yathoditāḥ |
tattvebhyo nirgatā mantrās tv aṇimādiguṇair yutāḥ || 21.413
ṣaṭkalāṃgalavair <ṣaṭkalāṅgalavair> yuktā yeṣu saṃkhyā na vidyate |
vyañjitā taisvanirmāṇaṃ turyādyaṃ padasaṃjñakam || 21.414
karmaṇām ātmalābhārthaṃ mohārthaṃ tatkṣayāya ca |
dvisaptabhuvanaṃ viśvaṃ guṇatrayamayaṃ hi yat || 21.415
tadaśuddhaṃ jaḍaṃ nityaṃ bhogye vyāpyaṃ pṛthaksthitam |
ityadhvaṣaṭkam uddiṣṭaṃ heyopādeyalakṣaṇam || 21.416
bhuvanādhvā padādhvā ca vinā turyapadena tu |
heyaśeṣam upādeyaṃ karmaṇāṃ tadapekṣayā || 21.417
vyapekṣayāpy upeyaś ca heyapakṣe prayāti ca |
kiṃ tu tatprāptyupāyaṃ vai nistaraṅge pare pade || 21.418
vivekapadasaṃsthasya dīkṣayā saṃskṛtasya ca |
vicāryamāṇa evaṃ hi viśramo yatra vai sphuṭam || 21.419
jāyate tatparaṃ brahma vāsudevākhyam avyayam |
ambaraṃ paramāṇūnāṃ juhūnām āspadaṃ yathā || 21.420
tathā cādyaḥ prabuddhānāṃ jīvānāṃ hi niketanam |
vijñeyaṃ bhuvanānāṃ ca padānām antaraṃ hi yat || 21.421
yeneścarecchayā teṣāṃ mantrā vai krīḍayanti ca |
māyīyedhvadvaye tasmin sukhaduḥkhamayaiḥ phalaiḥ || 21.422
īśvarecchānuviddhānāṃ bhaktānāṃ parameśvare |
gurūṇāṃ dīkṣitānāṃ cāpyārādhanaratātmanām || 21.423
bhavaty adhvadvayordhvasthā mantrāś cājñāpratīkṣakāḥ |
nayanti karmiṇaḥ samyaṅmāyāyīdhvadvayād balāt || 21.424
svasthānamaṇim ādīnāṃ bhogānāṃ prāptaye tu vai |
viraktasya ca tadbhogāt svaśaktyā prerayanti ca || 21.425
svavyāpāravaśenāpi tattvādhvany amṛtopame |
yatrāṇimādir manyeta tṛṇānīva ca saṃsthitaḥ || 21.426
anugrahaparās tasya tattvādhyakṣādayomalāḥ |
nayanty apy ayatāṃ samyaksakalādhvani śāśvate || 21.427
sa ṣāḍguṇyamayo brahma vāsudevo 'dhvamūrtibhṛt |
nitye svātmani sambandhe <saṃbandhe> śabdabrahmābhidhe 'dhvani || 21.428
karoti yojanāntasya yatrasthaḥ svayam eva hi |
prāpnoti tatparijñānāt suśāntaṃ bhagavatpadam || 21.429

saṅkarṣaṇaḥ <saṃkarṣaṇaḥ>
deva varṇādhvavijñānaṃ vada kiṃlakṣaṇaṃ mama |
prāpnoti yatparijñānādadhvī sadvāsudevatām || 21.430

śrībhagavān
pañcādhvakośamuktasya labdhasatvasya cātmanaḥ |
yo 'nubhūtipadaṃ yāti dhārāsantānarūpadhṛk <dhārāsaṃtānarūpadhṛk> || 
21.431
bhinnavarṇamayaḥ śabdaḥ pūrvalakṣaṇalakṣitaḥ |
sa cāturātmyanicaye vijñeyo hi tadātmanā || 21.432
prabhavāpyayayogena śabdabhāsvaralakṣaṇaḥ |
sakārāntastvakārāc ca hakārādānta eva hi || 21.433
prabhavedvādaśāntas tu hakārāś caturatmanām |
akāras tv apyaye caiva tulyatātonayoḥ smṛtā || 21.434
varṇavyūhasamūhe 'smin jñeyaṃ jñānasamādhinā |
viśvāma udayo vyāptir vyaktirāḍvāsudevatā || 21.435
atraikaikā parijñeyā mūrtir vai tv evam eva hi |
yuktā viśramapūrveṇa catuṣkeṇa samāsataḥ || 21.436
daṇḍavatsanniveśena <daṇḍavatsaṃniveśena> saṃsthitā hy evam eva hi |
dviṣaṭkaṃ dhāraṇānāṃ ca dvādaśādyātmalakṣaṇam || 21.437
sopānabhūtaṃ yatkrāntā dvādaśāntaṃ viśet param |
nītvaivaṃ vyaktibhāvena hṛtpadmodarasaṃsthitam || 21.438
varṇādhvānaṃ dīkṣitasya śabdabrahmeti yaḥ sthitaḥ |
saṃsevya hutabhugbhūmiṃ praṇītenodakena tu || 21.439
saha śiṣyeṇa cātmānaṃ tenaivācchidrasiddhaye |
pūrvavadbhūtinā kṛtvā lakṣma cāgniṃ praṇamya ca || 21.440
samutthāya tato yāyāt taṃ gṛhītvācyutālayam |
pūjayitvā jagannāthaṃ nivedya niyamāc chiśoḥ || 21.441
saviśeṣāt samāsena sāntarān yogyatāvaśāt |
yathāvadupadeṣṭavyaṃ tatas tasyārcanaṃ hṛdi || 21.442
mudrāsamanvito mantro nyāsadhyānapurassaraḥ |
itikartavyatā śāstrasaṅkṣiptā ca savistarā || 21.443
tatsamaṃ santatas <saṃtatas> tena sarvaṃ kāryaṃ yathā sthitam |
gurvarcanaṃ tataḥ kuryād ātmanā ca dhanādinā || 21.444
pūrayitvāṃbhasā <pūrayitvāmbhasā> pāṇim arghyapātrā tu dakṣiṇam |
ṣaḍaṅgamantrasaṃjaptaṃ kṣeptavyaṃ tasya mastake || 21.445
maṇḍalaṃ praṇavenātha pāṇau sūryaprabhaṃ smaret |
tatrābhinnaṃ nyaset prāgvadvaibhavaṃ devatāgaṇam || 21.446
kṛtvā dhiyārjitaṃ dadyāt sāśivaṃ tasya mūrdhani |
yathoktā ca yathābhīṣṭā tv acirād eva putraka || 21.447
tavāstu vaibhavī siddhir mokṣalakṣmīsamanvitā |
iti vaibhavadīkṣāyā lakṣaṇaṃ samudāhṛtam || 21.448
tatprayuktasya sāmānyaṃ sarvamantragaṇasya ca |
yena yena hi mantreṇa dīkṣā kāryātha kasyacit || 21.449
tasya tasya tadīyānāṃ pūrvoddiṣṭena vartmanā |
kāryotrāvayavānāṃ tu viniyogo yathoditaḥ || 21.450
samūhavaddhṛdādīnāṃ mūlāntānāṃ samācaret |
saha tattvagaṇenaiva sarvadādhyātmarūpatām || 21.451
samyaggṛhya tataḥ kuryāt prāgvadabhyarcanaṃ tu vai |
netrakarmāṇi hṛdbījaṃ pañcāṅgānāṃ vidhīyate || 21.452
niraṅgānāṃ tu mantrāṇām aṅgamantroktakarmaṇām |
praṇavo viniyoktavyaḥ saha karmapadena || 21.453
sampādyā <saṃpādyā> vidhinānena vyūhadīkṣārthināṃ tu sā |
kiṃ tu vai tatra yoktavyaṃ pratyekasmin hi karmaṇi || 21.454
catuṣkaṃ vāsudevādyaṃ bījānāṃ tatpuroditam |
evam evādyamantras tu niśśeṣaḥ karmasaṃgrahe <karmasaṅgrahe> || 21.455
yoktavyo brahmadīkṣāyāṃ ṣoḍhā bhaṃktvā <bhaṅktvā> ca pūrvavat |
svarūpeṇa yathāvasthamukteṣv avasareṣu ca || 21.456
kiṃ tv ekavacanenātra devānāṃ prārthanā matā |
yojanā tv adhivāsoktā vijñātavyā samāsataḥ || 21.457
nityadīkṣādvayasyāsya nānyan mokṣād ṛte phalam |
tatrāpi cāturātmīyā dīkṣā prākkamalekṣaṇa || 21.458
balād dadāti ṣāḍguṇyabhogāptiṃ bhāvitātmanām |
phalaṃ srakcandanādīnāṃ homadravyasya cāpi yat || 21.459
prakṛtyā sahasābhyeti vilayaṃ brahmadīkṣayā |
evaṃ dīkṣātrayaṃ cāpi dadyād ekasya vā kramāt || 21.460
sarvārādhanayogyatvasiddhaye munipuṅgavāḥ |
yadvāṣṭākṣaramantrādau vyāpakatritaye dvijāḥ || 21.461
ekena sarvasāmānyaṃ dīkṣāṃ kuryād yathāvidhi |
tenāṅgasahitenaiva sarvakarma samācaret || 21.462
tadāpi vibhavavyūha paramantrās tathā dvijāḥ |
śaktibhūṣaṇavāhāstramantrāṃś copadiśed guruḥ || 21.463
itthaṃ dīkṣāvidhiḥ samyakkīrtito munipuṅgavāḥ |
atha maṇḍaladṛṣṭasya śāstrajñasya yathārthataḥ || 21.464
samārādhanasaktasya putrakatvaṃ gatasya ca |
siddhyarthaṃ sarvamantrāṇām adhikārāptaye tu vā || 21.465
tatkālaṃ guruṇā kāryaṃ yacchiṣyasyābhiṣecanam |
bhagavattattvavett�ṇāṃ pañcakālaratātmanām || 21.466
saṃhitāpāragāṇāṃ cācāryāṇāṃ ca sannidhau <saṃnidhau> |
yatīnāṃ baddhalakṣāṇāṃ bodhakānāṃ mahātmanām || 21.467
devasya purataḥ kuryāc caturaśraṃ ca maṇṭapam |
sarvopakaraṇopetaṃ madhye bhadrāsanānvitam || 21.468
tasmin kuryād anantādyaṃ sandhānañ <saṃdhānañ> cāsanokṣitam |
pūjayitvārghyapuṣpādyais tato devasya saṃmukham || 21.469
baddhapadmāsanaṃ śiṣyaṃ tatrāropya kṛtāñjalim |
kāntābhir gīyamānaṃ tu stūyamānaṃ ca bandibhiḥ || 21.470
śaṅkhādyair dhmāyamānaṃ tu paṭhyamānaṃ tu maṅgalaiḥ |
japamānaṃ paraṃ mantraṃ dhyāyamānam ivācyutam || 21.471
aṣṭāṅgenārcayitvā tu kumbham ādāya vaiṣṇavam |
sa tatrasthena mantreṇa samyaksiddhivyapekṣayā || 21.472
sahasrāvartitaṃ kṛtvā śatāvartitam eva vā |
siddhaye drutahemābhaṃ smṛtvā tam abhiṣicya ca || 21.473
svāhāntaṃ mantram uccārya plutaṃ hṛtkamalodarāt |
evamuktvā namo'ntas tu dhyātvā taṃ sphaṭikāmalam || 21.474
samutkīrya kharandhreṇa tasya hṛtpadmagaṃ smaret |
aśaktivigrahaṃ brahma tvāhlādānandalakṣaṇam || 21.475
samāropya dhiyā samyak svādhikāraṃ tu cākhilam |
samāsādyārcitaṃśuddhaṃ divyam āgamasañcayam || 21.476
śubham ārādhanādhāram akṣasūtraṃ ca kiṅkiṇīm |
sruksruvau yogapaṭṭaṃ ca śaṅkhacakraṃ kamaṇḍalum || 21.477
camasaṃ kusumañ cārghyapātraṃ kṛṣṇājinaṃ tataḥ |
pāduke pādapīṭhaṃ ca chatramāsanadarpaṇam || 21.478
mayūravyajanaṃ śuklaṃ cāmaraṃ bhagavaddhvajam |
yathārhadaṇḍasahitaṃ kāṣāye kṣaumavāsasī || 21.479
samutthāpyāsanāt sarvam āhṛtya snānajaṃ jalam |
vinikṣipya śucau sthāne devam abhyarcya vai tataḥ || 21.480
tādarthyena tu santarpya <saṃtarpya> pūrṇāntaṃ cāgnimadhyagam |
kṣāntvā pūrvoktavidhinā sakuṇḍān maṇḍalāntarāt || 21.481
arghyapātrasamūhāc ca balidānaṃ samācaret |
sodakena ca bhūtānām odanenāstram uccaran || 21.482
valimaṇḍalakaṃ kṛtvā yāgāgārāc ca bāhyataḥ |
kṛtvāntarbalidānaṃ tu prādakṣiṇyena vai purā || 21.483
atha ūrdhva idaṃ coktvā śeṣaṃ tanmaṇḍale bahiḥ |
namos tv acyutabhūtebhyaḥ sarvebhyaḥ sarvadaiva hi || 21.484
sadikparibhyaḥ sāstrebhyaḥ śāntaye svasya vai śiśoḥ |
pūjādyam upasaṃhṛtya dattaśiṣṭeṇa pūrvavat || 21.485
vṛttamaṇḍalamadhye tu sitapadmodare tataḥ |
dattaśiṣṭair yajed devaṃ sarvadevaguruṃ prabhum || 21.486
tarpayitvāgnimadhye tu kuryāt tasya visarjanam |
tadīyam atha nikṣipya kṣmāpaṭe nāva jalāntare || 21.487
yāgāvanauca taccakraṃ dvādaśāraṃ vicintya ca |
nyasyātmany arghyapuṣpādyaiḥ samabhyarcya tadantare || 21.488
karakaṃ vārisampūrṇam <vārisaṃpūrṇam> ādāya viniveśya ca |
tatreṣṭvā vīryamantreṇa madhye mantrāmlam uttamam || 21.489
madhvambupayasā pūrṇam aparaṃ śubhalakṣaṇam |
tadagrato 'rghya 'kalaśaṃ tanmadhye 'straṃ ca cakragam || 21.490
tad abhyarcya yathānyāyaṃ kṛtvāṣṭaśatamantritam |
vaṣaṭpadaniruddhena mūlamantreṇa taṃ punaḥ || 21.491
dadyāt tadantaḥ sāstreṇa prāgvatpīyūṣadhāraṇām |
nirvarjrīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt sarveṣāṃ mantravāriṇā || 21.492
tadambudhārādānena dhyānoccārayutena ca |
saṃvibhajyātha caiteṣāṃ mantrapānaṃ sudhāmayam || 21.493
sampādyāstraparaṃ <saṃpādyāstraparaṃ> paścātsamantāc cakragaṃ nyaset |
ādādya tattoyakumbham astramantram udīrayan || 21.494
dhārayet pūrvavaddhārām atha madhye nidhāya tam |
supūrṇam udakenaiva kṛtvā phalasamanvitam || 21.495
guruyāgam ataḥ kuryāc chiṣyaḥ prayatamānasaḥ |
bhagavadyāgavadbhaktyā karmaṇā manasā girā || 21.496
yāgopayuktasambhāraṃ <yāgopayuktasaṃbhāraṃ> tasmai sarvaṃ nivedya ca |
saśiraḥ pāṇiyugmaṃ tu kṛtvā caiva tadaṃghrigam <tadaṅghrigam> || 21.497
kṣantavyaḥ suprasannena śraddhāpūtena cetasā |
pañcarātravidas tadvadyatīṃś ca snātakādayaḥ || 21.498
sampūjya <saṃpūjya> vidhivad dadyāt teṣāṃ śaktyā ca dakṣiṇām |
saṃvāhanaparāt kālāl labdhvānujñāṃ tu gauravīm || 21.499
bhrātṛbhiḥ saha cāśnīyād bahubhiḥ pūrvadīkṣitaiḥ |
tathānyair bhagavadbhaktaiḥ suhṛtsambandhibāndhavaiḥ 
<suhṛtsaṃbandhibāndhavaiḥ> || 21.500
vrajantaṃ saha śiṣyais tu kāle hy anyatra tatra vā |
tadicchayāpy anuvrajya nivartetātha vai yadā || 21.501
kṛtvā tu pādapatanaṃ bahudhā sapradakṣiṇam |
āmokṣāt sarvasiddhīnāṃ bhaktānāṃ bhāvitātmanām || 21.502
parā gatir gurur yasmāt prasādyas tata eva saḥ |
ityevam abhiṣekas tu bhaven mukhyādhikāriṇām || 21.503
svārthe parārthayajane ubhayatrādhikāriṇām |
anye tu dīkṣāmātreṇa saṃskāryā munipuṅgavāḥ || 21.504

munayaḥ
kiṃ svārthaṃ ca parārthaṃ kiṃ ke ca tatrādhikāriṇaḥ |
tad etan muniśārdūla vadasva vadatāṃ vara || 21.505

nāradaḥ
svagṛhe sthāpito devaḥ svārtha ityabhidhīyate |
parvatāgre nadītīre sindhutīre vanādike || 21.506
grāme vā nagare vāpi svayavyaktodibhedataḥ |
saṃsthito bhagavān viprāḥ parārtha iti kathyate || 21.507
parārthas sūryasadṛśaḥ svārthas tu gṛhadīpavat |
utkṛṣṭaḥ paraśabdo 'yam artho mokṣādilakṣaṇaḥ || 21.508
yasmāt salabhyate so 'yaṃ parārthaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
sa eva sarvaphaladaḥ sarveṣām api yad dvijāḥ || 21.509
tasmāt sarvajanaiḥ sevyaḥ parārthaḥ puruṣottamaḥ |
svārthaḥ svasvagṛhe pūjyaḥ svasvābhīṣṭaphalapradaḥ || 21.510
svārthasyāpi parārthasya pūjāyām adhikāriṇaḥ |
śāṇḍilyādyanvaye jātā guror labdhābhiṣecanāḥ || 21.511
anye tu kevalaṃ svārthapūjane hy adhikāriṇaḥ |

munayaḥ
śāṇḍilyādyās tu ke yogin tadvaṃśyā eva kevalam |
kathaṃ parārthayajane bhavanti hy adhikāriṇaḥ || 21.512
tatsarvaṃ vistareṇaiva brūhi no munipuṅgava |

nāradaḥ
śāṇḍilyādimunīndrāṇāṃ śṛṇudhvaṃ vaibhavaṃ dvijāḥ |
purā kṛtayugasyādau vāsudevaḥ paraḥ pumān || 21.513
svārādhanārthaṃ bhūloke saddharmāṇāṃ pravṛttaye |
lokasaṃrakṣaṇārthaṃ ca svasya pañcāyudhādhipān || 21.514
samālokya bhavantodya hy avatīrya dharātale |
ādyam ekāyanaṃ vedaṃ mokṣaikaphalalakṣaṇam || 21.515
prakāśayadhvaṃ sarveṣāṃ saddharmāṃś ca viśeṣataḥ |
tatra tatrāvatīrṇaṃ māṃ svayaṃvyaktādibhedataḥ || 21.516
saṃpūjayadhvaṃ sarveṣāṃ mokṣalābhāya bhūtale |
ityādiśattataste vai viṣṇor ājñānuvartinaḥ || 21.517
sudarśanādyā hetīśāḥ pañca brahmarṣirūpataḥ |
samutpannāḥ kṣititale pauṇḍravardhnasthalādiṣu || 21.518
pañcāyudhāṃśāste pañca śāṇḍilyaś caupagāyanaḥ |
mauñjyāyanaḥ kauśikaś ca bhāradvājaś ca yoginaḥ || 21.519
te militvā samālocya viṣṇor ārādhanecchayā |
abhisaṃgamya totādrau tapaś cakrus sudustaram || 21.520
teṣāṃ tu tapasā tuṣṭo vāsudevo jagatpatiḥ |
lakṣmyā sārdhaṃ khageśānam adhiruhya kṛpānidhiḥ || 21.521
ājagāma giriśreṣṭhaṃ yatra santi munīśvarāḥ |
tatas te muniśārdūlā dṛṣṭvāyāntaṃ jagatpatim || 21.522
śaṅkhacakrāṅkitakaraṃ koṭisūryasamaprabham |
pulakāṅkitasarvāṃgā <pulakāṅkitasarvāṅgā> ānandāśrusamanvitāḥ || 21.523
praṇartantastuvantaś ca gāyantaś ca parasparam |
pradakṣiṇaṃ ca kurvantaḥ praṇemuḥ puruṣottamam || 21.524
ānandāmbudhisammagnānetānvīkṣya <ānandāmbudhisaṃmagnānetānvīkṣya> 
śriyaḥpatiḥ |
uvāca karuṇaṃ vākyaṃ meghagambhīrayāgirā || 21.525

śrībhagavān
ṛṣayas tapasāyuṣmatkṛtenānanyacetasrā |
santuṣṭo <saṃtuṣṭo> 'smi prasanno 'smi vṛṇīdhvam abhivāṃchitam 
<abhivāñchitam> || 21.526
iti tadvacanaṃ śrutvā ṛṣayo hṛṣṭamānasāḥ |
yaddhāñjalipuṭāḥ sarve pratyūcurvinayānvitāḥ || 21.527
adhītāḥ sakalā vedāḥ śāstrāṇi vividhāni ca |
mokṣopāyaṃ na jānīmas tatas tvāṃ śaraṇaṃ gatāḥ || 21.528
ihaivānugrahaṃ kartum arhasi tvaṃ dayānidhe |
iti saṃprārthito devaḥ karuṇāmṛtavārithiḥ || 21.529
tadānīm eva yogīndrān śāṇḍilyādīṃs tu dīkṣayā |
saṃskṛtya cābhiṣicyātha svayam eva jagatpatiḥ || 21.530
ādyam ekāyanaṃ vedaṃ rahasyāmnāyasaṃjñitam |
divyamantrakriyopetaṃ mokṣaikaphalalakṣaṇam || 21.531
pañcāpi pṛthagekaikadivārātraṃ jagatprabhuḥ |
adhyāpayāmāsa yatas tatas tanmunipuṅgavāḥ || 21.532
śāstraṃ sarvajanair loke pañcarātram itīryate |
tadarthāṃś copadiśyātha tān uvācedam acyutaḥ || 21.533
eṣa ekāyano veda upadiṣṭo mayā dvijāḥ |
mokṣāyanāya vai panthā etadanyo na vidyate || 21.534
tasmād ekāyanaṃ cainaṃ pravadanti manīṣiṇaḥ |
etaduktavidhānena divyakṣetrādiṣu sthitam || 21.535
svayaṃvyaktādirūpeṇa yajadhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
svārthe parārthayajane yūyaṃ mukhyādhikāriṇaḥ || 21.536
yaṣmadvaṃśyāś ca ye viprās tebhiṣecyā yathāvidhi |
te 'pi svārthe parārthe ca bhaveyur adhikāriṇaḥ || 21.537
eva kārtayugo dharmaḥ pratibuddhair niṣevitaḥ |
tretādau mandasañcāro bhaviṣyati munīśvarāḥ || 21.538
tretāyugādau sarve 'pi nānākāmasamanvitāḥ |
vyāmiśrayājino bhūtvā tyajanty ādyaṃ sanātanam || 21.539
antardadhāti sarvo 'yaṃ veda ekāyanābhidhaḥ |
tato yogyāya bhagavān prādurbhāvayati svayam || 21.540
ityuktvāntardadhe devo vāsudevaḥ sanātanaḥ |
takṣa prabhṛti te sarve śāṇḍilyādyā munīśvarāḥ || 21.541
ādyaṃ bhāgavataṃ dharmam ādibhūte kṛte yuge |
anutiṣṭhanti sarve 'pi mānavāś ca munīśvarāḥ || 21.542
tatas tretāyuge jāte nānākāmavaśāj janāḥ |
tyaktvā bhāgavataṃ dharmaṃ babhūvur miśrayājinaḥ || 21.543
tataś caikāyano vedo mandacāro babhūva ca |
tadā munīndraḥ śāṇḍilyo dṛṣṭvā kāmaratān janān || 21.544
lokasaṃrakṣaṇārthāya tapastepe sudustaram |
anekāni sahasrāṇi varṣāṇāṃ tapaso 'ntataḥ || 21.545
dvāparasya yugasyānte ādau kaliyugasya ca |
sākṣātsaṅkarṣaṇo <sākṣātsaṃkarṣaṇo> devaḥ prāpya pratyakṣatāṃ muneḥ || 
21.546
parityajya paraṃ dharmaṃ miśratharmam <miśradharmam> upeyuṣām |
bhūyas tatpadakāṅkṣāṇāṃ śraddhābhaktī upeyuṣām || 21.547
anugrahārthaṃ varṇānāṃ yogyatāpādanāya ca |
tathā janānāṃ sarveṣām abhīṣṭaphalasiddhaye || 21.548
mūlavedānusāreṇa sāraṃ saṃgṛhya sarvataḥ |
anuṣṭupchandobandhena proktāni hariṇā svayam || 21.549
sātvatādīni śāstrāṇi bhogamokṣapradāni ca |
upadiśyātha musalī tatraivāntaradhīyata || 21.550
labdhvaivaṃ sātvatādīni śāstrāṇi munipuṅgavāḥ |
śāṇḍilyo 'dhyāpayāmāsa muniñ caivaupagāyanam || 21.551
tathā mauñjyāyanādīṃś ca sanakādyāṃś ca yoginaḥ |
tataḥprabhṛti te sarve śāṇḍilyādyā munīśvarāḥ || 21.552
sātvatādyuktamārgeṇa harer ārādhanādikam |
kurvantaḥ svasvavaṃśyāṃś ca śiṣyāṃś cāpi sahasraśaḥ || 21.553
kāṇvīṃ śākhāmadhīyānān vedavedāntapāragān |
saṃskṛtya dīkṣayā samyaksātvatādyuktamārgataḥ || 21.554
abhiṣicya ca tān sarvān kṛtvā svārthaparārthayoḥ |
pūjādhikāriṇo viprā tair etatsātvatādikam || 21.555
śāstraṃ pravartayāmāsus te hi mukhyādhikāriṇaḥ |
ityuktvā muniśārdūlāḥ śāṇḍilyādimahātmanām || 21.556
māhātmyaṃ leśato hy atrādhikāraprasaṅgataḥ <atrādhikāraprasaṃgataḥ> |
evaṃ dīkṣā cābhiṣeko yatsiddhāntena pūrvataḥ || 21.557
prāptas tenaiva mārgeṇa kāryo nānyoktamāgataḥ |
siddhāntasaṅkaraṃ <siddhāntasaṃkaraṃ> naiva kuryāc chāstraviśāradaḥ || 21.558

munayaḥ
siddhāntaṃ nāma kiṃ ko vā bhedas tasya munīśvara |
tatsarvaṃ vistareṇaiva vadasva vadatāṃvara || 21.559

nāradaḥ
caturdhā bhedabhinno 'yaṃ pāñcarātrākhya āgamaḥ |
pūrvam āgamasiddhāntaṃ dvitīyaṃ mantrasaṃjñitam || 21.560
tṛtīyaṃ tantram ityuktam anyat tatrāntaraṃ <tantrāntaraṃ> bhavet |
ādyaṃ nityoditavyūhasthāpanādiprakāśakam || 21.561
apauruṣeyaṃ sadbrahmavāsudevākhyayājinām |
lakṣyabhūtaṃ dvijendrāṇāṃ hṛdistham adhikāriṇām || 21.562
brahmopaniṣadākhyaṃ ca divyamantrakriyānvitam |
vivekadaṃ paraṃ śāstram anicchātopavargadam || 21.563
evaṃ nityoditākhyasya nityākārasya ca prabhoḥ |
vāsudevābhidhānasya ṣāḍguṇyādiguṇodadheḥ || 21.564
prathamaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ viddhi hṛdayādyaṅgaśabdavat |
etadāgamasiddhāntaṃ śrutirūpaṃ tu viddhi tat || 21.565
eṣa kārtayugo dharmas sarvadharmottamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
tatas tretāyugasyādau bhogamokṣaprasiddhaye || 21.566
tasmād āgamasiddhāntān nissṛtaṃ bahubhedakam |
mantrasiddhāntasaṃjñaṃ tajjāgradvyūhādimūrtinā || 21.567
samutkīrṇaṃ dvitīyasya sātvatasya mahātmanaḥ |
tena pradyumnasaṃjñasya tena turyātmano vibhoḥ || 21.568
tena vāgīśvarākhyasya tasmād dvīpākhyavigrahe |
saṃkrāntaṃ ca tataḥ paścād rudrendrādityavahiṣu || 21.569
tathaiva nāradādyeṣu devatānāṃ gaṇeṣv api |
saṃkrāntaṃ mantrasiddhāntaṃ bhedabhinnam anekadhā || 21.570
yatra śāntataraṃ vyūhaṃ śāntoditam anantaram |
suṣuptisaṃjñaṃ svapnākhyaṃ jāgradvyūhaṃ yathoditam || 21.571
mūrtyantaraṃ keśavādyaṃ prādurbhāvaṃ tathāntaram |
hṛtpadmapadmapīṭhādau lakṣmīpuṣṭyādiśaktibhiḥ || 21.572
lāṃchanaiś <lāñchanaiś> śaṅkacakrādyair garuḍapramukhair api |
bhūtasiddhādibhiḥ śāstṛparyantair yajanaṃ hitam || 21.573
viśvatrātṛnṛsiṃhasya dīkṣā pūrvaṃ tathāparam |
vibhavavyūhasūkṣmākhyam adhikāraṃ yathākramam || 21.574
sāmayīputrikādīnāṃ caturṇām abhiṣecanam |
tathaiva samayācāraṃ mūrtīnāṃ sthāpanakramam || 21.575
mantramaṇḍalamudrāṇāṃ kṛṇḍādīnāṃ ca lakṣaṇam |
karmaṇām evamādīnāṃ vidhānaṃ yatra puṣkalam || 21.576
mantrasiddhāṃtasaṃjñaṃ <mantrasiddhāntasaṃjñaṃ> tadbahubhedasamanvitam |
paravyūhādibhedena vinaikaikena mūrtinā || 21.577
sāṅgena kevalenātha kāṃtāvyūhena <kāntāvyūhena> bhūṣaṇaiḥ |
tathāstrair vigrahopetair āvṛtaṃ tantrasaṃjñitam || 21.578
nṛsiṃhakapilakroḍahaṃsavāgīśvarādayaḥ |
mukhyānuvṛttibhedena kevalāpāṅgasaṃyutāḥ || 21.579
cakrādyastravaraiś cātha bhūṣaṇair makuṭādibhiḥ |
kāṃtāgaṇaiś <kāntāgaṇaiś> ca lakṣmyādyaiḥ parivāraiḥ khagādikaiḥ || 21.580
pūjitā vidhinā yatra tattantrāṃtaram <tattantrāntaram> īritam |
ye janmakoṭibhiḥ siddhās teṣām anto 'tra saṃsthitiḥ || 21.581
yasmāt tasmād vivedaiṣa siddhāntākhyo yathārthataḥ |
śāstramantrakriyādīnāṃ mūrtināṃ bhavanasya ca || 21.582
deśikasyābhijātasya yathāpūrvaṃ parigrahaḥ |
tathaiva yāvatkālaṃ tu nācartavyaṃ tadanyathā || 21.583
viparītakṛte cātra rājarāṣṭhādyanarthakṛt |
tatas siddhāṃtasāṅkaryaṃ <siddhāntasāṃkaryaṃ> nācartavyaṃ kṛtātmabhiḥ || 
21.584
yadyadiṣṭatamaṃ loke pūrvasiddhāvirodhi tat |
pratigrāhyam ato'nyonyaviruddhaṃ santyajed <saṃtyajed> budhaḥ || 21.585
vaikhānaseṣu tantreṣu śaivapāśupateṣu ca |
vihitānyatra jātāni viruddhānīti kiṃ punaḥ || 21.586
evaṃ siddhāṃtabhedaś <siddhāntabhedaś> ca kīrtito 'yaṃ yathāśrutam |
ito 'nyac chrotum icchā cet kathyatāṃ munipuṅgavāḥ || 21.587

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
dīkṣāvidhir nāma
ekaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha dvāviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
niyamā upadeṣṭavyāḥ śiṣyasyeti purā tvayā |
proktaṃ hi muniśārdūla niyamāṃs tān prakāśaya || 22.1

nāradaḥ
etad eva purā pṛṣṭo devaḥ saṅkarṣaṇena <saṃkarṣaṇena> hi |
provāca niyamāṃs tāṃs tu pravakṣyāmi munīśvarāḥ || 22.2

śrībhagavān
pratyekasmin hi niyame nirgate tu guror mukhāt |
brūyād vai bāḍham ity evaṃ śiṣyaḥ śokāgniśāntaye || 22.3
nākramyā gauravīcchāyā daivī yānagatā tv api |
guruvadguruvargaś ca draṣṭavyo nityam eva hi || 22.4
śayanāsanayānādyaṃ tadīyam abhivandayet |
atandritaḥ sadā kuryād vyāpāraṃ tadgṛhe 'khilam || 22.5
nāsane tatsamakṣaṃ ca yogābhyāsaś ca dhāraṇā |
suyantritaḥ saṃyatavāktadājñāsaṃpratīkṣakaḥ || 22.6
tatsannidhau <tatsaṃnidhau> tu nānyeṣāṃ pratyutthānaṃ samācaret |
kuryāt saṃśayavicchittiṃ na tadādeśato vinā || 22.7
vyākhyānam āgamānāṃ ca yogābhyāsaś ca dhāraṇā |
avaśyakāryāṅy etāni svagṛhe na guror gṛhe || 22.8
na śaṅkacakrapadmāṃke <śaṅkacakrapadmāṅke> bhoktavyaṃ bhājane tu vai |
tallakṣma copalaṃ kāṣṭhaṃ loṣṭaṃ vā phalakādikam || 22.9
kramaṇīyaṃ na pādena kalpyaṃ naivāsanārthataḥ |
bhagavacchāsanajñānām ārādhanaratātmanām || 22.10
yathocitā yathāśakti pūjā kāryā sadaiva hi |
prāsādaṃ devadevīyam ācāryaṃ pāñcarātrikam || 22.11
aśvatthaṃ ca vaṭaṃ betuṃ satsamūhaṃ guror gṛham |
dūrātpradakṣiṇīkuryān nikaṭe pratimāṃ vibhoḥ || 22.12
daṇḍavatpraṇipātais tu namaskuryāc caturdiśam |
na yānapādukārūḍho na sopānahapādabhṛt || 22.13
na vikṣiptamanā bhūtvā saṃviśed bhagavadgṛham |
na vyākhyāvasare kuryāpratyutthānābhivādane || 22.14
nābhaktānāṃ na mūrkhāṇāṃ nāstikānāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
dātavyaḥ saṃpradeyaś ca nopahāsaratātmanām || 22.15
nāpūjitaṃ samuddhāṭyaṃ śāsanaṃ pārameśvaram |
samakṣaṃ nānyabhaktānāṃ na tatsandehaśāntaye <tatsaṃdehaśāntaye> || 22.16
prakāśanīyaṃ tallobhān na cānyāyena nobhayāt |
sugandhaphalapuṣpādyam apūrvam ucitaṃ ca yat || 22.17
abhojyaṃ gurudevāgniviniveditavarjitam |
taskarāt paritāc caṇḍād dambhalobhamadānvitāt || 22.18
mātrāvittaṃ na gṛhṇīyād abhaktād upacārataḥ |
gṛhītvā bhagavadbimbaṃ vṛttyarthamaṭatīti yaḥ || 22.19
nagarāpaṇavīdhīnāṃ tasya devalakasya ca |
darśanaṃ sparśanaṃ naiva kuryāt saṃbhāṣaṇaṃ tathā || 22.20
gāyet tu bhagavadgādhāṃ yo grāme nagarāntare |
taṃ prabhustāvakaṃ caiva pūjayec caiva sarvadā || 22.21
viṣṇuvrataparaṃ caiva viṣṇvāyatanavāsinam |
viṣṇvālāpakathāsaktaṃ viṣṇvāyatanamārjakam || 22.22
śrāvakaṃ vaiṣṇavānāṃ ca viṣṇudharmaparāyaṇam |
paryeṣṭikṛdvaiṣṇavānāṃ mānyo vai viṣṇuvatsadā || 22.23
prātar utthāya cinvīyāt svārāmāt svayam eva hi |
pūjārtham astramantreṇa puṣpādīn prayataḥ sadā || 22.24
yāyād araṇyam atha vā nirbādhaṃ hi tadārjane |
akaṇṭakadrumotthāś ca kaṇṭakadrumajā api || 22.25
hṛdyāḥ sugandhāḥ karmaṇyā grāhyāḥ sarve sitādayaḥ |
ugragandhā hy akarmaṇyās tv aprasiddhās tathaiva ca || 22.26
catuṣpathaśivāvāsaśmaśānāvanimadhyagāḥ |
kṣatā aśanipātādyaiḥ kṛmikīṭasamāvṛtāḥ || 22.27
varjanīyāḥ prayatnena patrapuṣpaphalādayaḥ |
ambujāni sugandhīni sitaraktādikāni ca || 22.28
yoktavyāni pavitrāṇi nityam ārādhane tu vai |
sāṅkurāṇi ca patrāṇi bhūgatāny evam eva hi || 22.29
vihitāny arcane nityaṃ yathartuprabhavāni ca |
na gṛhe karavīrotthaiḥ kusumair arcanaṃ hitam || 22.30
viśeṣataḥ sakāmasya siddhibhūtiyutasya ca |
ato'nyathā na doṣo 'sti doṣa unmattakādibhiḥ || 22.31
sadyo hṛtānāṃ vihitaḥ svamlānānāṃ yathā krayaḥ |
pradānam ambusiktānāṃ teṣāṃ kuryān na cānyathā || 22.32
nirdoṣatāṃ prayānty āśu mantriṇām avalokanāt |
bhavanti bhaktipūtāni hṛnmantraniratātmanām || 22.33
na kāṃsyapātre bhoktavyaṃ na tatra vinivedayet |
devāya madhuparkādyaṃ tathā vai sati sambhave <saṃbhave> || 22.34
mṛṇmayāyasapātrāṇāṃ na dhūpam api nirdahet |
dhūpārthaṃ gugguluḥ sājyo deyaś cābhāvatoparaḥ || 22.35
saha ghaṇṭāraveṇaiva dīpārthaṃ parivarjayet |
medho majjātasītailaṃ ghṛtaṃ tailavimiśritam || 22.36
nāvikaṃ madhuparkārthe dadhikṣīrādikaṃ śubham |
kaulasthaḥ kodravaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ śālyuttho nodano hitaḥ || 22.37
nāpakvānnaṃ na māṃsaṃ cāranālavibhāvitam |
na cārādhanakāle tu samuttiṣṭhet tvarānvitaḥ || 22.38
āsamāptikriyāṃ caivoparodhena kena cit |
ādhārād bhagavadbimbād bhadrapīṭhān malacyutiḥ || 22.39
na kāryā kaṇṭakair lohair mṛdukūrcādinā vinā |
na snāyān na svapen namno na maunañ cācared gurau || 22.40
nocchiṣṭaṃ saṃspṛśet kiñcinnāśnīyād bhagavadgṛhe |
sannikarṣeṇa <saṃnikarṣeṇa> cāgnes tu na gṛhe madyasaṅkare <madyasaṃkare> || 
22.41
bhaktānāṃ kṛtadīkṣāṇāṃ vyaṅgyaḥ śāstrārtha eva hi |
anyeṣāṃ dharmaśāstraṃ ca lobhanirmuktayā dhiyā || 22.42
śiṣyāṇāṃ viṣṇubhaktānāṃ nityaṃ kuryāc ca saṃgraham <saṅgraham> |
mānamātsaryakārpaṇyalobhamohādayo guṇāḥ || 22.43
netavyāstānavaṃ sarve yāvajjīvāvadhiṃ kramāt |
akasmād upapannānāṃ deśāntaranivāsinām || 22.44
iṣṭopadeśaḥ kartavyo nārāyaṇaratātmanām |
yo na vettyācyutaṃ tattvaṃ pañcarātrārtham eva ca || 22.45
tathā sa vaiṣṇavīṃ dīkṣāṃ nānāśāstroktalakṣaṇām |
bhānena (?) saha sambandhaḥ <saṃbandhaḥ> kāryo bhinnakrameṇa tu || 22.46
na śāstrārthasya śāstrāṇāṃ buddhipūrva upaplavaḥ |
ācartavya ihājñānāt pāramparyakramaṃ <pāraṃparyakramaṃ> vinā || 22.47
praṣṭavyo bhagavadbhakta āpto lakṣaṇakovidaḥ |
prasiddha ārjave vṛddho naṣṭaṃ śāstrārthalakṣaṇam || 22.48
mudrāmaṇḍalamantrāṇāṃ nissandehapareṇa <nissaṃdehapareṇa> ca |
bhavitavyaṃ gurūṇāñ ca sakāśāt sarvadaiva hi || 22.49
na ca sarvajñamantrāṇāṃ vinā bhāvāṃśakena tu |
ānukūlyaṃ gaveṣṭavyaṃ muktvā maṇḍaladarśanāt || 22.50
nābhicakre tu hṛtpadme kandamūle galāvaṭe |
bhrūmadhye brahmarandhre ca sthāneṣv eteṣu mantrarāṭ || 22.51
smartavyasūryaḥ saṅkāśaḥ <saṃkāśaḥ> pravāse śayane 'dhvani |
mṛgasūkaramāṃsāni nādyānmīnotthitāni ca || 22.52
nāhaṃsakacchapīyāni na śṛṅgāṭaphalāni ca |
na tathā padmabījāni na vaṭāgraṃ samāruhet || 22.53
chedyamānaṃ na taṃ paśyet taddalaṃ vāṅghriṇā spṛśet |
puṇyakṣetre mahātīrthaṃ siddhāśramam anuttamam || 22.54
vaiṣṇavīṃ parṣadaṃ vāpi vyaktisthānaṃ tathācyutam |
āsādya maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā cakraṃ vā dvādaśārakam || 22.55
nirvahaṇīyaṃ vidhivaccāturmāsyaṃ mahāmate |
gṛhe saṃyamapūrvaṃ vā cakraṃ kṛtvā tu kuḍhyagam || 22.56
caturvidhena rajasā pratimāyā athāgrataḥ |
saṃyuktān api pūrvoktair etāṃś ca samayān sadā || 22.57
nirvāhakāṇāṃ bhaktānāṃ prayacchet satataṃ guruḥ |
jñātvā nirvāhakaṃ bhaktaṃ tasyādau deśikena tu || 22.58
samuddiśyāś ca te sarve nirvahaty atha yeṣu ca |
teṣu teṣu niyoktavyo yathā na cyavate punaḥ || 22.59
dhāvanti samayasthasya savighnāḥ savināśakāḥ |
vimukhāḥ siddhayo yānti hy āpado hi bhavanti ca || 22.60
jñātvaivaṃ sāvadhānena bhavitavyaṃ hi tāṃ prati |
sāram ādāya vai budhyā nirmathya niyamodadhim || 22.61
kṛpayā guruṇā deyam aśaṭhānāṃ ca pāvakam |
bhaktir agnau gurau mantre śāstre tadadhikāriṇi || 22.62
niyataṃ pañcakasyāsya yathāvatparipālanāt |
anuṣṭhānāt tu nānyeṣāṃ svatantreṇa yathecchayā || 22.63
bhaktānāṃ manaso 'bhīṣṭāḥ pravartante hi siddhayaḥ |
ye 'nirmalena manasoparodhāt tu kurvate || 22.64
pālanaṃ samayānāc ca te bhajjaty asite 'dhvani |
suprasannena manasā yathaitat paripālyate || 22.65
tathā prasādam abhyeti sva ātmā tu hitaiṣiṇām |
nūnaṃ kāluṣyamuktānāṃ sthitānām iha satpathe || 22.66
samayī sādhakācārya putrāṇāṃ ca bhavec chubham |
ityevamuktā niyamā itaḥ kiṃ śrotum icchatha || 22.67

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
niyamavidhānaṃ nāma
dvāviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha trayoviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

munayaḥ
bhagavan nāradamune sarvajña vadatāṃ vara |
svarūpaṃ divyaśāstrāder mantrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ tathā || 23.1
mudrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ mūrtidhyānaṃ kuṇḍādilakṣaṇam |
havirādividhānaṃ ca yadyad atropayujyate || 23.2
tatsarvaṃ vistareṇaiva vadasvānugrahādinā |

nāradaḥ
śāstraṃ divyaṃ ca munyuktaṃ pauruṣaṃ ceti vai tridhā |
proktaṃ tattatsvarūpaṃ tu pravakṣyāmi munīśvarāḥ || 23.3
yadarthādyam asaṃdigdhaṃ svaccham alpākṣaraṃ sthiram |
cāturātmyasvarūpeṇa saṃsthitasya vibhoḥ sadā || 23.4
svābhāvikaṃ paratvaṃ tu yatra yatra samīritam |
anyāsāṃ mantramūrtīnāṃ yatra caupādhikaṃ tu yat || 23.5
turyādijāgratparyantaḥ padabhedaḥ prakāśitaḥ |
bhaktānām anukampārthaṃ yatra vai caturātmanaḥ || 23.6
śaktīśasyavibhor yatra vibhavaḥ saṃprakāśitaḥ |
aṅgalāṃchanabhūṣāṇāṃ <aṅgalāñchanabhūṣāṇāṃ> śaktīnāṃ 
vihageśituḥ || 23.7
layādibhedabhinnaṃ tu svarūpaṃ yatra bhāṣitam |
bījapiṇḍhapadādyena cāturvidhyena sattamāḥ || 23.8
mantrāḥ pravartitā yatra yatra svāpanakarmaṇi |
anuvethakriyāproktā yatra vai nityapūjanam || 23.9
mūlamūrtau tu sampūrṇaṃ <saṃpūrṇaṃ> proktaṃ prāthānato dvijāḥ |
tatra kartum aśakyaṃ yatsnānādyaṃ tāvad eva tu || 23.10
bimbāntare tadarthaṃ tu karmabimbapurassare |
vihitaṃ darpaṇādyeṣu tadabhāvān mahāmate || 23.11
kṣmājalānalavāyvākhyanābhasīyena vai dvijāḥ |
dhāraṇāpañcakenaiva dhāraṇādvitayena ca || 23.12
dahanāpyāyanākhyena yatra śuddhiś ca bhautikī |
āgamaśrutimūlatvaṃ svasya yady upapādakam || 23.13
tatpārameśvaraṃ vākyam ājñāsiddhaṃ hi mokṣadam |
evamādeyavākyārtha āgamo yo mahāmate || 23.14
sanmārgadarśanaṃ kṛtsnaṃ vidhipādaṃ ca viddhi tam |
tatprāmāṇyāt tu yat kiñ cit samabhyūhya yathārthataḥ || 23.15
pūrvāparāvirodhena nirvāhyam avicārataḥ |
sarveṣāṃ rañjakaṃ gūḍhaṃ niścayīkaraṇakṣamam || 23.16
pārameśvaravākyoktam arthajālaṃ yathāsthitam |
pratyabhijñāpayad yadyatsātvikaṃ munibhāṣitam || 23.17
praśaṃsakaṃ yatsiddhīnāṃ sampravartakam <saṃpravartakam> apy atha |
mūlamūrtim anādṛtya karmārcāyāṃ tu puṣkalam || 23.18
nityasampūjanaṃ <nityasaṃpūjanaṃ> proktaṃ prādhānyena tu yatra vai |
brahmarudrādibimbānāṃ pramāṇaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ tathā || 23.19
sthāpanaṃ yatra nirdiṣṭaṃ yatra vai jagatāṃ pateḥ |
pūjanaṃ tu samuddhiṣṭaṃ prākṛtānāṃ jaḍātmanām || 23.20
tattvānām api viprendra diśāṃ kālasya vācakaiḥ |
parameṣṭhyādibhir mantraiḥ paṃcabhir <pañcabhir> yatra vai kramāt || 23.21
sthāpanādipratiṣṭhāntaṃ paṃcakaṃ <pañcakaṃ> samudīritam |
yāgapūrvā haristomaparyantāḥ sapta kīrtitāḥ || 23.22
yāgā yatra tathā sapta tatkramād adhikāriṇaḥ |
uktaṃ yatra pratiṣṭhāyāṃ ṣoḍaśanyāsakalpanam || 23.23
etajjānīhi tatsarvaṃ rājasaṃ munibhāṣitam |
bhagavantaṃ samuddiśya hy aṅgabhāvaṃ vinaiva tu || 23.24
brahmarudramukhānāṃ tu vibudhānāṃ tathaiva ca |
māt�ṇām api durgāyāḥ svātantryeṇa tu yatra vai || 23.25
mantradhyānaṃ pramāṇaṃ ca lakṣaṇaṃ sthāpana tathā |
nirdiṣṭaṃ tāmasaṃ nāma munivākyaṃ tu viddhi tat || 23.26
anarthakam asambaddham <asaṃbaddham> alpārthaṃ śabdaḍambaram |
anirvāhakam ādyokter vākyaṃ tatpauruṣaṃ smṛtam || 23.27
heyaṃ cānarthasiddhīnām ākaraṃ narakāvaham |
pārameśvaravākyārthair yadvirodhi na tad dvija || 23.28
saṃgrāhyaṃ sātvikādyeṣu munivākyeṣu yatnataḥ |
yad apy apekṣitaṃ vipra saṃgrāhyam avirodhi tat || 23.29
sātvikādikramāt teṣu samabhyūhyaṃ mahāmate |
prasiddhārtham upādāya saṅgatārthaṃ <saṃgatārthaṃ> vilakṣaṇam || 23.30
api cet pauruṣaṃ vākyaṃ grāhyaṃ tanmunivākyavat |
evaṃ divyādiśāstrāṇāṃ bhedaṃ jñātvā yajed dharim || 23.31
yo na jñātvā tu sāṅkaryaṃ <sāṃkaryaṃ> pūjādyam anutiṣṭhati |
sa hi sarvasya jagataḥ sāṅkaryaṃ kurute sadā || 23.32
viśeṣāt svasya vaṃśasya tasmād āpady api dvijāḥ |
na kuryāc chāstrasāṃkaryaṃ hitaiṣī śāstrakovidaḥ || 23.33
svayaṃvyaktaṃ tathā saiddhaṃ vibuddhaiś ca pratiṣṭhitam |
munimukhyais tu gandharvair yakṣair vidyādharair api || 23.34
rakṣobhir asurair mukhyaiḥ sthāpitaṃ mantravigraham |
divyaśāstroktavidhinā pūjayec chāstrakovidaḥ || 23.35
sthāpitaṃ manujair devaṃ munivākyoktamārgataḥ |
pūjayed dvija tatrāpi jñānibhis tattvadarśibhiḥ || 23.36
vāsudevaikaniṣṭhais tu devatāntaravarjitaiḥ |
vyāmiśrayāgamuktais tu tīvrabhaktisamanvitaiḥ || 23.37
sthāpitaṃ manujendrais tu hy anuvedhādikovidaiḥ |
arcayed devadeveśaṃ divyaśāstroktavartmanā || 23.38
munivākyoktamārgeṇa pūjanaṃ yatra vartate |
tatrāpi divyamārgāc cet pūjanaṃ kartum icchati || 23.39
munimārgaṃ parityajya divyamārgeṇa pūjayet |
bhavet sannidhimāhātmyaṃ <saṃnidhimāhātmyaṃ> kālaṃ kalpakṣayāvadhi || 
23.40
divyamārgeṇa pūjādyaṃ vatrate yatra nityaśaḥ |
tatra divyaṃ parityājyaṃ na kadācin mahāmate || 23.41
munivākyoktamārgeṇa na kuryāt pūjanādikam |
kuryād vā yadi sammohād <saṃmohād> dvijaḥ sammūḍhacetanaḥ 
<saṃmūḍhacetanaḥ> || 23.42
saṃprayāty acirāt tasya bhaktir bījena vai saha |
samantraṃ karmatantraṃ ca siddhayaś ca parāṅmukhāḥ || 23.43
ihaiva śīghraṃ viprenda dehānte gatasantatiḥ <gatasaṃtatiḥ> |
ghoraṃ prayāti narakaṃ rājā rāṣṭraṃ ca niśyati || 23.44
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena divyamārgaṃ tu na tyajet |
tāmasena tu mārgeṇa pūjanaṃ yatra vartate || 23.45
tatrāpi rājasenaiva pūjanaṃ siddhidaṃ bhavet |
rājasena tu pūjādyaṃ vartate yatra nityaśaḥ || 23.46
tatrāpi sātvikenaiva pūjanaṃ śubhadaṃ sadā |
sātvikena tu pūjādyaṃ vartate yatra cānvaham || 23.47
tatra rājasamārgeṇa na kuryāt pūjanādikam |
yatra rājasamārgeṇa pravṛttaṃ tv arcanādikam || 23.48
tatra tāmasamārgeṇa na kuryād arcanādikam |
vividhānāṃ rājasānām anyonyaṃ syān na saṅkaraḥ <saṃkaraḥ> || 23.49
sarvatra pauruṣe vākye tadgrāhyam avirodhi yat |
kevalaṃ tadvidhānena na kuryāt sthāpanādikam || 23.50
evaṃ divyādiśāstrasya svarūpaṃ kathitaṃ mayā |
mantrasvarūpam adhunā kathyate munipuṅgavāḥ || 23.51
sarveṣu viṣṇumantreṣu mantrāḥ syur vyāpakās trayaḥ |
ādyaṃ nārāyaṇāṣṭārṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ dvādaśākṣaram || 23.52
vāsudevasya yogīndrās tato viṣṇuṣaḍakṣaram |
sādhāraṇās tv ime mantrās trayaḥ sarvāsu mūrtiṣu || 23.53
anye tu manavas tattanmūrtimātraparā hy ataḥ |
vyāpakatritayenārcyāḥ sarvā api ca mūrtayaḥ || 23.54
mantrair anyais tu sampūjyās <saṃpūjyās> tattanmūrtaya eva hi |
tasmāt sarveṣu mantreṣu vyāpakatritayaṃ varam || 23.55
triṣv apy eṣu vyāpakeṣu mantro hy aṣṭākṣaro 'dhikaḥ |
aṣṭākṣarādimantrāṇām uddhāraṃ śṛṇutādarāt || 23.56
uddharet praṇavaṃ pūrvaṃ namaḥśabdam anantaram |
tato nārāyaṇāyeti hy etad aṣṭākṣaro manuḥ || 23.57
praṇavānte namaḥśabdaṃ turyāntaṃ bhagavatpadam |
vāsudevāya vai dadyāt padaṃ pañcākṣaraṃ tataḥ || 23.58
vāsudevasya devasya mantro 'yaṃ dvādaśākṣaraḥ |
caturthyantaṃ viṣṇupadaṃ tāreṇa namasānvitam || 23.59
ādāvante ca tanmantraḥ ṣaḍakṣara udīritaḥ |
jñānādiguṇasaṃyuktair akṣarair bindubhūṣitaiḥ || 23.60
hṛdayādyaṅgakḷptiḥ syāc chiṣṭavarṇāny api dvijāḥ |
netreṇa yojayed evam aṅgakḷptiḥ prakīrtitā || 23.61
tatas tu mūrtimantrāṇām uddhārakrama ucyate |
praśaste vijane gupte gandhalipte dharātale || 23.62
sudhūpite 'rghyapuṣpāḍhye varṇacakraṃ prasāryaṃ ca |
yasmin pratiṣṭhitaṃ viśvamābrahmabhuvanādikam || 23.63
yenoditena jagataḥ prabhavaḥ samanantaram |
svātmany uparate tasmin pralayaḥ samprajāyate <saṃprajāyate> || 23.64
prerakaṃ candrasūryābhyāṃ sabāhyābhyantaraṃ tu yat |
nityoditaṃ yathākṣasthaṃ varṇam īśvaravācakam || 23.65
yatra sthānavibhāgena varṇātmā bhagavān sthitaḥ |
akārādyo visargāntaḥ sauracāndrakalāgaṇaḥ || 23.66
hrasvadīrghavibhāgena nābhau yatra dviraṣṭakaḥ |
kādibhānto 'py arāṃśasthaḥ prākṛtas tattvasaṃcayaḥ || 23.67
pṛthivyādiprakṛtyanto yugmayogena lāṅgalin |
kalanādehabhṛtkālo nemigo navalakṣaṇaḥ || 23.68
makārādyo havargānto yatra prathigaṇe svayam |
kālavaiśvānaraḥ sākṣān mārtāṇḍāyutadīdhitiḥ || 23.69
jvālāyutasahasrāḍhyo varṇānto bhagavān sthitaḥ |
āmadhyāt prathiparyantān namo 'ntāṃ varṇasantatim <varṇasaṃtatim> || 23.70
uccāryārghyādinābhyarcya vidyābījaṃ hi cakrarāṭ |
tataḥ samuddharen mantraṃ paramātmani vācakam || 23.71
galantam amṛtaprakhyam acirānmokṣasiddhidam |
akṣastham uddharet pūrvaṃ nemiṣaṣṭham anantaram || 23.72
nābhidvitīyenākrāntaṃ dvitīyam idam akṣaram |
dvitīyaṃ daśasaṃkhyāc ca tadadhaś cāṣṭamāt param || 23.73
nābhes trayodaśopetaṃ tṛtīyam idam akṣaram |
atha dvitīyaṃ navam ānnābhituryādinānvitam || 23.74
dvitīyam aṣṭamād varṇaṃ kevalaṃ viddhi pañcamam |
vijñānapadam ādāya tryakṣaraṃ tadanantaram || 23.75
ādyam ekādaśād varṇaṃ bhinnaṃ nābhyapareṇa tu |
nemes tṛtīyavarṇasya tatas tadupari nyaset || 23.76
mantrārṇaṃ navamaṃ hy etaddaśamaṃ me nibodha tu |
nābhidvitīyenākrāntaṃ prāgvarṇaṃ cāṣṭam āragam || 23.77
nemer dvitīyaṃ tadanu nebher ādāya cāṣṭamam |
taduddeśāt tṛtīyaṃ ca sthitaṃ tatpañcamopari || 23.78
trayodaśam idaṃ viddhi navamād aparaṃ tataḥ |
ṣaṣṭhasya nemivarṇasyordhve tattritayaṃ nyaset || 23.79
yuktaṃ nābhitṛtīyenātha ṣoḍaśam ucyate |
dvitīyaṃ daśamād varṇānnābhyekādaśasaṃyutam || 23.80
caitanyāyapadaṃ dadyāt sanamaskam ataḥparam |
dvāviṃśārṇo hy ayaṃ mantraḥ padaiḥ ṣaḍbhir alaṃkṛtaḥ || 23.81
tatraikārṇaṃ padaṃ jñānaṃ caturvarṇaṃ padaṃ balam |
ṣaḍakṣaraiś cāpy aiśvaryaṃ vīryaṃ pañcākṣaraṃ param || 23.82
caturvarṇaṃ padaṃ tejaḥ śāktaṃ syād vyakṣaraṃ ca yat |
tejo vīryaṃ balaṃ śaktir aiśvaryaṃ jñānam eva ca || 23.83
dṛgastraṃ kavacaṃ śaikhaṃ śiro hṛtṣaḍyathākramam |
mantraḥ samādhiviṣaye nānābhūmijayeṣu ca || 23.84
nirākāro niraṅgaś ca smartavyo brahmalakṣaṇaḥ |
tatprāptyupāye prathame yāgahomādike tu vai || 23.85
sākāraṃ saṃsmaret sāṅgaṃ parivāreṇa cāvṛtam |
ānītā vyaktatāṃ yena svayaṃ jñānādayo guṇāḥ || 23.86
śaśvadyāgasamāptyartthaṃ karmaṇām anukampayā |
so 'naṅgaḥ saṃsmṛto mantro bhaktiśraddhāvaśena tu || 23.87
phalaṃ yacchati vai nūnaṃ nityaṃ tadbhāvitātmanām |
prādhānyena tv athaiśvaryaṃ mokṣo yatrānuṣaṅgataḥ || 23.88
tatra tadvighnaśāntyartham astrāntaṃ viddhi mantrapam |
viparyaye tu netrānto mantro yasmān mahāmate || 23.89
dṛgdṛṣṭiśuddhimārgāṇāṃ kva vighnāḥ śāntacetasām |
svakamantargataṃ tejaḥ svātantryāc ca bahiṣkṛtam || 23.90
yena yena hi mantreṇa sa ca netrānvitaḥ smṛtaḥ |
svaprakāśas tv anupamo yena yena hṛdantare || 23.91
sitāsitaḥ samākṛṣyaḥ sa sa tadvācakonvitaḥ |
atha mantracatuṣkaṃ tu bhinnaṣāḍguṇyavācakam || 23.92
karmaṇāṃ mokṣadaṃ śaśvatpūrvoddiṣṭaṃ nibodha tu |
ādāyākṣagataṃ bījaṃ nābhipūrvam ataḥparam || 23.93
arādekādaśāt pūrvaṃ tasyādho viniveśayet |
varṇaṃ nemes tṛtīyaṃ yattṛtīyam idam akṣaram || 23.94
dvitīyam aṣṭamād varṇaṃ nābhes turyādinānvitam |
tatas tu navamaṃ nemeḥ kevalaṃ viddhi pañcamam || 23.95
aṣṭamād aparaṃ varṇaṃ dvitīyasvarasaṃyutam |
ṣaṣṭham etadvijānīyāt saptamaṃ daśamāt param || 23.96
atha dvitīyaṃ daśamād ādāyordhve tu vinyaset |
aṣṭamāt tu dvitīyasya mantrārṇam idam aṣṭakam || 23.97
dvitīyāt prathamaṃ varṇam aṣṭamād aparaṃ tataḥ |
nābhyekādaśamopetaṃ dvitīyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt || 23.98
pūrvam ekādaśāc chuddhaṃ tādṛṅnemesmṛtīyakam |
nemipūrvaṃ ca tadanu nābher ekādaśāṅkitam || 23.99
neme ṣaṣṭham athādāya sthitaṃ tatpañcamopari |
tato nābhidvitīyena yuktaṃ nemesmṛtīyakam || 23.100
dvitīyaṃ kevalaṃ nemer ādāya ca mahāmate |
kartre namaḥpadaṃ paścād yojayec caturakṣaram || 23.101
ekaviṃśatibhir varṇair ayaṃ mantra udāhṛtaḥ |
abhinnaḥ padabhedena bhaved ekādhikas tu vai || 23.102
prāgvarṇena padaṃ pūrvaṃ pañcārṇaṃ dvitayaṃ bhavet |
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ tadvad eva tu || 23.103
dvyakṣaraṃ paṃcamaṃ <pañcamaṃ> viddhi tadvat ṣaṣṭhaṃ mahāmate |
athāparaṃ mahāmantraṃ dvitīyam avadhāraya || 23.104
yaj jñātvā na punarjanma bhavaty ārādhakasya ca |
ādāyākṣasya madhyasthaṃ nābhipūrvam ataḥparam || 23.105
pūrvaṃ nebhes tu tasyaiva yojyaṃ nābhitrayodaśam |
dvitīyād aparaṃ varṇaṃ sarvaśaktyātmanepadam || 23.106
dvitīyaṃ dvādaśād varṇaṃ dvitīyāt prathamaṃ tataḥ |
paṃcamaṃ <pañcamaṃ> ca bahiṣṭhebhyas trīn etān viddhi kevalān || 23.107
nābhyekādaśasaṃbhinnaṃ dvitīyaṃ cāṣṭamāt tataḥ |
namonamaḥ padayuto mantraś cāṣṭādaśākṣaraḥ || 23.108
asyaikārṇaṃ padaṃ pūrvaṃ tryakṣaraṃ tadanantaram |
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ caturakṣaram || 23.109
dvitīyaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ cānyatpadayoḥ saṃprakīrtitam |
tṛtīyam atha vakṣyāmi mantraṃ mantravidāṃ vara || 23.110
yaj jñātvā mānasaṃ śuddhiṃ paramāṃ yāti karmiṇām |
bījam ādāya madhyastham ādyam ekādaśāt tataḥ || 23.111
nemes tṛtīyaṃ tad athordhve nābhyaparaṃ tu vai |
athādyam aṣṭamād varṇaṃ dvitīyasvarasaṃyutam || 23.112
tadv? ekādaśād ādyaṃ varṇam anyaṃ samāharet |
daśamād aparaṃ varṇaṃ nemer aṣṭakam antataḥ || 23.113
yuktaṃ nābhidvitīyenatvādyaṃ nemyakṣaraṃ tu yat |
nābhitrayodaśopetam ādāya daśamāt param || 23.114
dvitīyaṃ navamād varṇaṃ yuktaṃ nābhyapareṇa tu |
tatsaṃkhyaṃ daśamāc chuddhaṃ tato bāhyāt tu pañcamam || 23.115
nemer dvitīyaṃ tadadho yuktam nābheḥ pareṇa tu |
dvitīyaṃ daśamād varṇaṃ prāṇāya tryakṣaraṃ padam || 23.116
tatas tv ekādaśād ādyaṃ kevalaṃ ca samāharet |
atha nābhidvitīyena yuktaṃ nemes tṛtīyakam || 23.117
nābhitrayodaśopetaṃ bahiṣṭheṣv aparaṃ tataḥ |
nemes tṛtīyasyor dve tu navamād aparaṃ nyaset || 23.118
tato nābhidvitīyena yuktaṃ prāṅnemimaṇḍalāt |
dvitīyam atha vai bāhyāt sanamaskaṃ hi kevalam || 23.119
trayoviṃśatibhir varṇair upeto 'py eṣa mantrarāṭ |
padaiḥ pūrvoktasaṃkhyais tu teṣāṃ bhedo 'py athocyate || 23.120
pūrvam ekākṣaraṃ viddhi dvitīyaṃ tu navākṣaram |
tṛtīyaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ caiva caturthaṃ tryakṣaraṃ smṛtam || 23.121
ṣaḍakṣaram athordhvasthaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ tadanantaram |
caturtham adhunā mantraṃ nibodha gadato mama || 23.122
yena vijñātamātreṇa saṃvid utpadyate varā |
ādāyādau yadakṣasthaṃ nābhipūrvam anantaram || 23.123
tatas tṛtīyād aparaṃ varṇam ādāya lāṅgalin |
nemidvitīyaṃ tasyādhastad adho nābhipaṃcamam <nābhipañcamam> || 23.124
dvitīyam aṣṭamād varṇaṃ tatsaṃkhyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt |
ādāyaitad dvayaṃ kuryād yuktaṃ nābhyapareṇa tu || 23.125
atha nābhitṛtīyena yuktaṃ bāhyāt tu paṃcamam <pañcamam> |
ādyāt pūrvam athādāya nābhisaptamasaṃyutam || 23.126
dvitīyam aṣṭamād varṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt |
ādāyābhyāṃ niyoktavyaṃ dvitīyaṃ nābhigocarāt || 23.127
atha dvitīyaṃ daśamāt kevalaṃ varṇam āharet |
dvitīyam aṣṭamād varṇaṃ tadūrdhve daśamāt param || 23.128
nābhidvitīyam ayaiva yojayet tadanantaram |
tato nemidvitīyaṃ tu kevalaṃ varṇam āharet || 23.129
atha nābher yadādisthaṃ prāgvarṇaṃ daśamādarāt |
tadadho dvitayaṃ bāhyāt prathivarṇam anantaram || 23.130
yuktaṃ nābhidvitīyena tvādāya tadanantaram |
nemidvitīyasaṃkhyaṃ yannamaskārapadaṃ tataḥ || 23.131
aṣṭādaśākṣaro hy eṣa dvyadhikaḥ padasaṃkhyayā |
ekārṇaṃ padam ādyaṃ tu dvitīyaṃ caturakṣaram || 23.132
paṃcākṣaraṃ <pañcākṣaraṃ> tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ caturakṣaram |
tathaiva paṃcamaṃ <pañcamaṃ> viddhi hy antasthaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ smṛtam || 23.133
yatra yatra padānāṃ ca varṇādhikyam udāhṛtam |
tatrādau nābhipūrvaṃ tu vyāhṛtyādyaṃ padaṃ nyaset || 23.134
athābhinnatanor mantraṃ devasyāsya mahātmanaḥ |
viśākhayūpasaṃjñasya vakṣye vidhyāvivekadam || 23.135
varṇam akṣastham ādāya tv ādyam ekādaśāt tataḥ |
bhinnaṃ nābhidvitīyena tṛtīyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt || 23.136
dvitīyaṃ kevalaṃ bāhyāt tejorūpāya vai padam |
tatas tv ekādaśāt pūrvaṃ kevalaṃ tu samāharet || 23.137
tṛtīyam akṣaraṃ bāhyādyuktaṃ nābhipareṇa tu |
daśamād aparaṃ varṇaṃ pūrvam ekādaśāt tataḥ || 23.138
ekādaśasvarākrāntam uddharet tadanantaram |
tato nābhidvitīyena yuktaṃ pradhyakṣaraṃ hi yat || 23.139
kevalaṃ dvitayaṃ bāhyād ādyam ekād ajñāt tathā |
nemes tṛtīyaṃ tadanu dvitīyasvarasaṃyutam || 23.140
daśamād aparaṃ śuddhaṃ pūrvam ekādaśāt tataḥ |
nābhyekādaśasaṃyuktaṃ tadante 'malalocana || 23.141
nābhes tṛtīyasaṃyuktaṃ prathivarṇaṃ samāharet |
atha nābhidvitīyena yuktaṃ yatparam aṣṭamāt || 23.142
nemer dvitīyaṃ tadanu namaskārasamanvitam |
caturviṃśatibhir varṇair yukto mantrohyayaṃ mahān || 23.143
praṇavena padaṃ cāsya pūrvam ekākṣaraṃ smṛtam |
dvitīyaṃ trakṣaraṃ proktaṃ paṃcārṇaṃ <pañcārṇaṃ> tadanantaram || 23.144
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ caturthaṃ tu saptārṇaṃ cātra paṃcamam <pañcamam> |
padaṃ tu dvyakṣaraṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ mantrasyāsya mahāmate || 23.145
nānāmantrasvarūpeṇa hy ādidevaḥ paraḥ prabhuḥ |
ādimadhyāvasāneṣu sthitaḥ sarvasya sarvadā || 23.146
caturvyūhacatuṣke sve śāntādivyaktalakṣaṇe |
prādhānyena trayāṇāṃ ca devānām avatiṣṭhate || 23.147
yathāmbarasthaḥ savitā tv eka eva mahāmate |
jalāśrayāṇi cāśritya bāhyātmyaṃ sampradarśayet <saṃpradarśayet> || 23.148
evam eko 'pi bhagavān nānāmantrāśrayeṣu ca |
turyādipadasaṃstheṣu bahutvam upayāti ca || 23.149
anugrahārthaṃ bhaktānāṃ nānāśraddhāvaśena tu |
catuṣkam atha mantrāṇāṃ nibodha gadato mama || 23.150
sitādivarṇavyaktīnāṃ vācakatvena vai kramāt |
akṣasthaṃ nābhipūrvaṃ ca varṇaṃ yaddaśamāt param || 23.151
nemipūrvam atho nābhes trayodaśasamanvitam |
dvitīyaṃ dvādaśād varṇaṃ dvitīyāt prathamaṃ tataḥ || 23.152
paṃcamaṃ <pañcamaṃ> ca bahiṣṭhebhyas trīn etān viddhi kevalān |
tato 'ṣṭamād dvitīyaṃ tu nābhyekādaśabheditam || 23.153
paṃcārṇaṃ <pañcārṇaṃ> vāsudevāya padaṃ ca tadanantaram |
trayodaśākṣaro hy eṣa prathamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 23.154
krameṇa vakṣyāmy anyeṣām uddhāraṃ tu yathāsthitam |
akṣastham akṣaraṃ nābher dvitīyaṃ tadanantaram || 23.155
pūrvamantrānusāreṇa tato dadyāt padatrayam |
athātra paṃcadaśamaṃ <pañcadaśamaṃ> nābher oṅkārapūrvakam 
<oṃkārapūrvakam> || 23.156
padatrayeṇa tenaiva saṃyuktaṃ viddhi mantrapam |
atha ṣoḍaśasaṃkhyaṃ yannābheḥ praṇavapūrvakam || 23.157
pūrvoktalakṣaṇānāṃ tu padānāṃ prāṅniveśayet |
asmān mantratrayād viddhi dvayaṃ prāṅmantrasaṃkhyayā || 23.158
eka ekārṇarahitaḥ padabhedam ataḥ śṛṇu |
padadvayaṃ tu sarveṣām ādyam ekākṣaraṃ smṛtam || 23.159
dvyakṣaraṃ ca tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ caturakṣaram |
paṃcākṣaraṃ <pañcākṣaraṃ> paṃcamaṃ <pañcamaṃ> vai trayāṇāṃ 
samudāhṛtam || 23.160
tadekasya caturvarṇaṃ pradyumnākhyasya lāṅgalin |
evaṃ svapnapadasthasya samāsāt parikīrtitam || 23.161
kramaśotha caturṇāṃ vai vakṣye mantragaṇaṃ śṛṇu |
akṣāntargatam ādāya nābheḥ pūrvam ataḥparam || 23.162
bhinnaṃ nābhidvitīyena nemipūrvam anantaram |
nābhipaṃcamasaṃyuktaṃ <nābhipañcamasaṃyuktaṃ> daśāmāt prathamaṃ tataḥ 
|| 23.163
tṛtīyaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ ca nebher ādāya cāṅkayet |
nābhidvitīyabījena navamād aparaṃ tataḥ || 23.164
tadadho viniyoktavyaṃ dvitīyaṃ dvādaśāt tu yat |
paṃcamenātha <pañcamenātha> vai nābher yuktaṃ kuryād anantaram || 23.165
aṣṭamād aparaṃ śuddhaṃ nemipūrvaṃ tathāvidham |
yuktaṃ nābhidvitīyena dvitīyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt || 23.166
bhūtas tatkevalaṃ dadyāt padaṃ yogeśvarāya vai |
tadante cakriṇe śabdam atha nemer yadaṣṭamam || 23.167
pañcamenānvitaṃ nābhes tadante viniveśya ca |
śuddham ekādaśāt pūrvam ādyaṃ tadanu cāṣṭamāt || 23.168
nemes tṛtīyenākrāntaṃ dhvajāyeti padaṃ nyaset |
bhinnam ekādaśāt pūrvaṃ nābhituryeṇa vai tataḥ || 23.169
aṣṭamād aparaṃ śuddhaṃ pañcamaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt |
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ sasetidvyakṣaraṃ padam || 23.170
vāsudevāya tadanu sanamaskaṃ padaṃ bhavet |
ṣaṭtriṃśadakṣaro mantro bhedas tasyādhunocyate || 23.171
padam ekādaśārṇaṃ tu prathamaṃ parikīrtitam |
pañcākṣaraṃ dvitīyaṃ tu tṛtīyaṃ tryakṣaraṃ smṛtam || 23.172
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ caturthaṃ tu pañcārṇaṃ pañcamaṃ tu vai |
ṣaṣṭhaṃ saptākṣaraṃ viddhi padaṃ padavidāṃ vara || 23.173
praṇavānte tv athādāya dvitīyaṃ nābhimaṇḍalāt |
caturdaśena vai nābher yuktaṃ nemyaṣṭakaṃ tataḥ || 23.174
dvitīyaṃ daśamāc chuddham atha bhūyaḥ samāharet |
tadadho navamād antyaṃ nābhes turyādinānvitam || 23.175
ekādaśasvarākrāntaṃ dvitīyaṃ daśamāt tataḥ |
bāhyād athāṣṭamaṃ nābher yuktaṃ pañcadaśena tu || 23.176
kevalaṃ pañcamaṃ nemer dvitīyaṃ cāṣṭamāt tataḥ |
nemes tṛtīyenākrāntaṃ varṇam etatsamāharet || 23.177
yuktaṃ nābhes tṛtīyena prāgarāt prathamaṃ tu vai |
dvitīyaṃ daśamād varṇaṃ nābher ekādaśāṅkitam || 23.178
pañcākṣaraṃ padaṃ dadyāt tadante tālaketave |
bhūyas tadavasāne tu pañcārṇaṃ nīlavāsase || 23.179
prathamāt prathamaṃ cātha dvitīyasvarasaṃyutam |
kevalaṃ nemipūrvaṃ tv ādyam ekādaśāt tataḥ || 23.180
bahiṣṭhebhyaś caturthaṃ tu dvābhyāṃ nābheḥ paraṃ nyaset |
kevalaṃ dvitīyaṃ bāhyāt saṅkarṣaṇāya <saṃkarṣaṇāya> vai padam || 23.181
tṛtīyaṃ prathamaṃ nemer ādāyākārasaṃyutam |
dvitīyam api vai bāhyāc chuddhaṃ tadanu vai namaḥ || 23.182
ṣaṭtriṃśākṣarasaṃyuktas tv ayaṃ mantro mahāmate |
ṣaḍvarṇaṃ padam asyādyaṃ pañcārṇaṃ tadanantaram || 23.183
daśākṣaraṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu trīṇi pañcākṣarāṇyataḥ |
athādāyākṣagaṃ bījaṃ nābheḥ pañcadaśaṃ tataḥ || 23.184
śārṅgadhṛte padaṃ dadyāc caturvarṇam ataḥparam |
nemipūrvam athādāya prāgarāt prathamaṃ tataḥ || 23.185
tṛtīyaṃ ca bahiṣṭhebhyaḥ padaṃ tryarṇaṃ dhvajāya vai |
atho tṛtīyaṃ bāhyāt tu prathamāt prathamaṃ tataḥ || 23.186
tadadho viniyoktavyaṃ dvitīyaṃ varṇam aṣṭamāt |
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktam atha bāhyāt tu paṃcamam <pañcamam> || 23.187
aṣṭamaṃ tu taduddeśāt kevalaṃ punar eva tat |
nābher ekādaśākrāntaṃ ṣaḍakṣaram anantaram || 23.188
padaṃ sanatkumārāya paṃcākṣaram <pañcākṣaram> anantaram |
padaṃ jagatpriyāyeti pradyumnāya namas tataḥ || 23.189
catus triṃśākṣaraḥ so 'yaṃ mantraḥ śṛṇu padāny api |
ādyaṃ ṣaḍakṣaraṃ jñeyaṃ dvitīyaṃ tadvad eva hi || 23.190
paṃcākṣaraṃ <pañcākṣaraṃ> tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ tu ṣaḍakṣaram |
paṃcārṇaṃ <pañcārṇaṃ> paṃcamaṃ <pañcamaṃ> viddhi ṣaḍvarṇaṃ ṣaṣṭham 
eva hi || 23.191
akṣasthaṃ ṣoḍaśaṃ nābher dvitīyaṃ daśamāt tu vai |
kevalaṃ hy atha tenaivākrāṃtaṃ <tenaivākrāntaṃ> navamāt param || 23.192
athādāya ca tasyānte prathamāt prathamaṃ parāt |
yuktaṃ nābhidvitīyena varṇam etan mahāmate || 23.193
varṇadvayaṃ padasyādau tad evāstesya vai punaḥ |
atha dvitīyaṃ navamāt prathamāt prathamaṃ tataḥ || 23.194
tṛtīyam atha vai nemer dvitīyasvarasaṃyutam |
dvitīyaṃ kevalaṃ bāhyāt saptamaṃ nābhimaṇḍalāt || 23.195
atha ṣaṣṭhena vai nemer ākrāntaṃ dvitayaṃ nyaset |
prāgvarṇaṃ daśamān nemeḥ pañcamasyordhvagaṃ tathā || 23.196
caturthād aparaṃ varṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt |
dvābhyāṃ nābhidvitīyaṃ tu yojayet tadanantaram || 23.197
daśamād aparaṃ varṇaṃ tṛtīyasvarasaṃyutam |
tṛtīyam atha vai nemer nābhipañcamasaṃyutam || 23.198
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ dvitīyaṃ navam ādarāt |
asyaivātho niyoktavyaṃ daśamāt prathamaṃ hi yat || 23.199
śuddhaṃ nemer dvitīyaṃ tu padaṃ tv asitavāsase |
viṣvaksenāya tadanu namaskārasamanvitam || 23.200
dvātriṃśārṇo hy ayaṃ mantraḥ padabhedena vai punaḥ |
ekādhikas tu bhavati padānyatha nibodha me || 23.201
dvyakṣaraṃ tu padaṃ pūrvaṃ dvitīyaṃ tv aṣṭavarṇakam |
trīṇi pañcākṣarāṇy anyatṣaṣṭhaṃ saptākṣaraṃ smṛtam || 23.202
apyayāvasare prāpte smaraṇe cārcaṇe vibhoḥ |
śṛṇu mantracatuṣkaṃ tu punaranyatsamāsataḥ || 23.203
ādyam ekādaśād varṇaṃ pañcamasvarasaṃyutam |
yuktaṃ svareṇa tenaiva tṛtīyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt || 23.204
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktam atha bāhyāt tu saptamam |
dvitīyaṃ kevalaṃ nemer ādyānte praṇavo namaḥ || 23.205
śuddhaṃ tv athāṣṭamaṃ bāhyād dvitīyam atha cāṣṭamāt |
atho nemer dvitīyena yuktaṃ nābhyapareṇa tu || 23.206
kevalaṃ dvitayaṃ bāhyān namaskāraṃ tataḥ param |
athākṣaraṃ nābhipūrvaṃ dvitīyaṃ tritayādarāt || 23.207
tadadho dvitayaṃ bāhyān nābhipaṃcamasaṃyutam <nābhipañcamasaṃyutam> |
atha nābhidvitīyena yuktaṃ yatparam aṣṭamāt || 23.208
kevalaṃ dvitayaṃ bāhyān namaskāram ataḥparam |
akṣasthabījaṃ tadanu dvitīyaṃ dvādaśādarāt || 23.209
dvitīyāt prathamaṃ cātha paṃcamaṃ <pañcamaṃ> nemimaṇḍalāt |
kevalaṃ tritayaṃ hy etaddvitīyaṃ ca tathāṣṭamāt || 23.210
ekādaśasvarākrāntaṃ vāsudevāya vai namaḥ |
saptākṣaras tu prāṅmantro dvitīyas tu ṣaḍakṣaraḥ || 23.211
pūrvatulyas tṛtīyas tu caturtho dvādaśākṣaraḥ |
padabhedavinirmuktam etanmantracatuṣṭayam || 23.212
gopanīyaṃ prayatnena vidhijñaiḥ siddhim īpsubhiḥ |
sāntaṃ ṣaṣṭhasvarārūḍham anusvāravibhūṣitam || 23.213
bījam ādyasya ca vibhor vāsudevasya kīrtitam |
tad eva bījaṃ bījasthaṃ ṣaṣṭhasvaravivarjitam || 23.214
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ saṅkarṣaṇasya <saṃkarṣaṇasya> bījarāṭ |
ubhayor antare repham ādyabījasya yojayet || 23.215
bījaṃ pradyumnanāthasya tṛtīyaṃ sarvakāmadam |
jīvārūḍhaṃ hakāraṃ tulāntasyopari vinyaset || 23.216
visargasahitaṃ bījam aniruddhasya vācakam |
hakāraṃ ca sakārasthaṃ kṛtvā ṣoḍhā niveśya ca || 23.217
dvitīyaturyaṣaṣṭhāṣṭadviṣaṭkadaśakaiḥ kramāt |
sarvaṃ niyojayed viddhi hṛdādyān netrapaścimān || 23.218
cāturātmīyamantrāṇāṃ sādhanatvena sarvadā |
tatas tu deśavādīnāṃ mantrāṃś ca śṛṇutādarāt || 23.219
tridhā hakāraṃ kṛtvādau jīvabījaṃ tathaiva ca |
kakāraṃ ca kṣakāraṃ ca likhet tadvat tridhā tridhā || 23.220
dviṣaṭkam evaṃ bījānāṃ krameṇādau niveśya ca |
tato vāridharāvārisaṃjñaṃ yac cākṣaratrayam || 23.221
paunaḥpunyena sarveṣām athobhāge niyojayet |
sarve ṣaṣṭhasvarārūḍhā anusvāravibhūṣitāḥ || 23.222
boddhavyāḥ keśavādīnāṃ bījās tv ete pṛthak pṛthak |
praṇavādyair namo'ntais tais turyāntair nāmabhiḥ saha || 23.223
keśavaḥ prathamo vācayas tato nārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ |
mādhavaś caiva govindo viṣṇuś ca madhusūdanaḥ || 23.224
trivikramo vāmanākhyaḥ śrīdharaḥ padmalocanaḥ |
hṛṣīkeśaḥ padmanābho dāmodara iti śrutaḥ || 23.225
bījaidīrghasvaropetaiḥ prāgvadaṅgāni kalpayet |
atha mantrān keśavādi devīnāṃ śṛṇuta dvijāḥ || 23.226
kṣahasattritayaṃ hy etaccaturthā vilikhet kramāt |
tato dviṣaṭkaṃ bījānāṃ tasyātho viniveśya ca || 23.227
krameṇa saptamād vargād dvitīyaṃ ca caturthakam |
punas tṛtīyaṃ turyaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ ca tṛtīyakam || 23.228
dvitīyaṃ ca caturthaṃ ca caturthaṃ tadanantaram |
tṛtīyam aṣṭamāc cātha tṛtīyaṃ saptamāt punaḥ || 23.229
navamadvādaśābhyāṃ tu viśeṣam imam ācaret |
atho niyojayed rephaṃ tattrayāṇāṃ tu mūrdhani || 23.230
ṣaṭsaptamāṣṭasaṃjñānāmīkāram upari nyaset |
sānusvāraṃ ca sarveṣām iti devīgaṇasya ca || 23.231
bījadvādaśakaṃ proktaṃ yathā cānukrameṇa tu |
tārabījanamoyuktair vācyās tattatsvanāmabhiḥ || 23.232
śrīś ca vāgīśvarī kāntiḥ kriyāśāntivibhūtayaḥ |
icchā prītī ratiś caiva māyā dhīr mahimeti ca || 23.233
svarajātyādiyuktāni bījāni hṛdayādayaḥ |
ityevaṃ keśavādīnāṃ devīmantrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 23.234
tatas tadāyudhānāṃ ca mantrān vakṣye munīśvarāḥ |
samudramūrtaye svāhā padmasya praṇavādikaḥ || 23.235
sarvāntaś cāriṇe kṛtvā tato gaganamūrtaye |
svāhāntaḥ praṇavādyaś ca mantraḥ śaṅkhasya kīrtitaḥ || 23.236
oṅkāro <oṃkāro> vedamītre 'tha vidye svāhāpadaṃ tu vai |
gadāmantras tv ayaṃ proktaś cakrasyātha nigadyate || 23.237
oṅkārānte <oṃkārānte> padaṃ dadyāt pañcārṇaṃ prabhaviṣṇave |
tadante kālaśabdaṃ tu mūrtaye huṃ tatas tu phaṭ || 23.238
padmādīnāṃ caturṇāṃ tu hy etanmantracatuṣṭayam |
tato vibhavamūrtīnāṃ mantrān vakṣyāmy ahaṃ dvijāḥ || 23.239
ārādhanārthaṃ vihito vācako hi caturvidhaḥ |
saṃjñānānāpadamayaḥ piṇḍākhyo bījalakṣaṇaḥ || 23.240
ebhyo madhyāt tv athaikena vācyam āmantrya bhaktitaḥ |
yatraikapiṇḍavākyotthamantreṇāthobhayātmanā || 23.241
tatra vai vidhinānena kuryāt tābhyāṃ hi kalpanām |
abhinnalakṣaṇo vācyam eka evopacaryate || 23.242
kṛtkadau nāmamantrasya bījaṃ piṇḍākṣaraṃ tu vā |
nayet tenābhimukhyaṃ ca vācyam ādyantagena vā || 23.243
sa tatra padamantraṃ tu vidhinānena vai tataḥ |
kuryāt praṇavapīṭhasthaṃ namaskāradhvajānvitam || 23.244
ābhyāṃ śāntasvarūpatvād ekatvamata eva hi |
saṃjñākhyaṃ padamantraṃ ca vidhisaṃsiddhilakṣaṇam || 23.245
svarotthaṃ vyañjanotthaṃ vā bījam ekākṣaraṃ smṛtam |
svaravyañjanasaṃyogād bahvarṇaḥ piṇḍamantrarāṭ || 23.246
dvābhyām ādyāt tathāntāc ca svasvargān mahāmate |
svarūpeṇa hi mantratvam anyeṣāṃ saha bindunā || 23.247
svareṇaikena yuktasya svarayugmānvitasya vā |
sānusvārasya bījatvaṃ vyañjanasyāpi lāṅgalin || 23.248
sakhaṃkārākhyaśabdasya vivarto dīdhitiprabhaḥ |
sallakṣaṇas tv anākāro viddhi tadvocakaṃ tridhā || 23.249
kvacitpiṇḍaṃ kvacidbījaṃ kvacicchabdam anāhatam |
tasya codgīyamānasya parimāṇaḥ sphuṭo hi yaḥ || 23.250
bahvakṣaro bahupadaḥ stutisaṃbodhalakṣaṇaḥ |
avināśī sakhaṃkāro bījādīnāṃ mahardhidaḥ || 23.251
prāgdadyāt praṇevenātha satyākhyenāsanaṃ mahat |
tasmād vai satyabhinnaṃ tu bījaṃ tadupari nyaset || 23.252
svavivartena bījasya mūrtyutthānaṃ prakalpayet |
prāptejyāvasare nityaṃ sampanne <saṃpanne> yajane sati || 23.253
taptopale jalaṃ yadvat tadvadvipralayaṃ smaret |
bhānuprasarasaṅkocatulyam <bhānuprasarasaṃkocatulyam> etan mahāmate || 23.254
kriyāvaśāt tu kiṃ tv atra bhedamātropalakṣaṇam |
na yatra bījaṃ piṇḍaṃ vā tatra vai praṇavād anu || 23.255
prāgvarṇaṃ padamantrasya yat tadālokavācakam |
tacchiṣṭaṃ vigrahaṃ varṇais tasmād utthāpya vṛkṣavat || 23.256
kevalaṃ yatra vai bījaṃ piṇḍaṃ vā padavarjitam |
tatrākārākhyavarṇasya kṣetrajñatvaṃ vidhīyate || 23.257
kṣetratvam avaśiṣṭānāṃ varṇānāṃ piṇḍarūpiṇām |
kevalasya hi bījasya svasthitir brahmavarṇatā || 23.258
svabhāvapracyutir bījaṃ bījoccāras tathā kṛtiḥ |
bījavatpiṇḍamantrāṇāṃ parijñeyaḥ sadodayaḥ || 23.259
yadbījalakṣaṇaṃ mantraṃ sāmarthyaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ mahat |
asaṃkhyeyam asaṃkhyānāṃ vācyānāṃ bhinnarūpiṇām || 23.260
tadyathāvatparijñānāj japadhyānāt samarcanāt |
havanāt tanmayatvāc ca nirbījaṃ padam ṛcchati || 23.261
sahābhimatasiddhasya sādhakānāṃ sadaiva hi |
piṇḍādibhagavan mantramūrtīnām evam eva hi || 23.262
parijñānād bhavet kiṃ tu piṇḍāt tatsthairyam uttamam |
nānātvaṃ nāmamantrāc ca nānālokāntarotthitam || 23.263
bhavet sarvapadaprāptiḥ parijñānāt padābhidhāt |
sabījaṃ vā sapiṇḍaṃ vā mantrāṇāṃ yatparaṃ dvayam || 23.264
vidadhāti phalaṃ svaṃ svaṃ kiṃ tv ādyaṃ bhāvayet padam |
mantrakṣetrajñarūpatvād yasmāt sarveśvaro 'cyutaḥ || 23.265
vyāpyavyāpakarūpeṇa vartate 'nugrahec chayā |
vyāpyarūpeṇa bhūlokād bhogād ārabhya cākhilāt || 23.266
ṣāḍguṇyamahimāntaṃ ca dadāti phalam uttamam |
svapadaṃ bhogakhinnasya divyadehasva karmiṇaḥ || 23.267
kṣetrajñabījapiṇḍātmā nirāvaraṇalakṣaṇaḥ |
jñānaṃ yadamalaṃ śuddhaṃ saṃyacchaty ātmalābhadam || 23.268
śaktivyaktimayatvaṃ ca jāgradvṛttopadātmanaḥ |
evaṃ saṃjñātmanaḥ svapnavṛtter ekatvam asti ca || 23.269
suṣuptivṛtteḥ piṇḍākhyamantrasyaiva mahāmate |
bījātmanas turyavṛtteḥ śaktivyaktitvam asti vai || 23.270
vyaktijñānaphalopetā niyatā yady api smṛtā |
bhagavanmantramūrtīnāṃ tathāpi paramātmanaḥ || 23.271
ādyasya cāturātmyasya kevalasyātha vā vibhoḥ |
catuṣprakāraṃ yanmantraṃ viddhi tanmokṣabhūtidam || 23.272
ato'nyathā yaduddiṣṭam amiśraṃ miśram eva hi |
phalaṃ bhāvavaśāc caiva tat tathā viddhi nānyatha || 23.273
śṛṇudhvam atha bījāni sāvadhānena cetasā |
śucau deśe manojñe ca sulipte puṣpabhūṣite || 23.274
candanakṣodasaṃyukte sudhūpenādhivāsite |
vilikhya mātṛkācakraṃ bhedenānena vai punaḥ || 23.275
yena sandṛṣṭamātreṇa <saṃdṛṣṭamātreṇa> śatathā yāti kalmaṣam |
prāgādau pañcavargāṃt?rān <pañcavargānt?rān> madhyāntaṃ madhyato likhet || 
23.276
.?ādayo nava nābhisthā ādayaḥ ṣoḍaśāragāḥ |
kādayo nemigāḥ sarve pūrvacakre yadakṣagam || 23.277
tad asmin prathibhūtaṃ tu pūjyed vidhinā tataḥ |
śabdabrahmamayaṃ cakramarghyapuṣpādikaiḥ kramāt || 23.278
tanmadhyād uddhared ādau sarveṣāṃ kāraṇaṃ hi yat |
udakstham akṣaraṃ cākṣādarāntādyenabhūṣitam || 23.279
viddhi sarveśvarasyedaṃ bījaṃ nirbījakāraṇam |
etad evābjanābhasya visargasahitaṃ smṛtam || 23.280
nemivargād dvitīyaṃ vai tatorāt ṣaṣṭham akṣaram |
aṣṭamaṃ nābhideśāc ca tatsaṃkhyaṃ nemimaṇḍalāt || 23.281
nemipūrvamato nābheḥ saptamaṃ pañcamāragam |
arāc caturdaśaṃ tv akṣāt paścimāśāgataṃ hi yat || 23.282
nemer ekādaśaṃ cātha ṣoḍaśaṃ ca trayodaśam |
pañcamaṃ nābhideśāc ca nemer ekonaviṃśakam || 23.283
tadantaṃ saptamaṃ caiva navamaṃ hi mahāmate |
nābhes tṛtīyaṃ tadanu nemes tatsaṃkhyam eva ca || 23.284
dvādaśaś ca bahiṣṭhebhyo daśamaṃ ṣoḍaśāt param |
nābhipūrvaṃ tato varṇaṃ nemeḥ pañcadaśaṃ hi yat || 23.285
turyasaṃkhyamarād bījaṃ tato nābhicaturthakam |
ṣaṣṭhaṃ nemeś caturthaṃ ca madhyamakṣāt tathā haret || 23.286
tatraiva pūrvadiksthaṃ yadbāhyād vai pañcamaṃ tataḥ |
akṣād dakṣiṇadiksaṃsthaṃ nemer aṣṭādaśaṃ tataḥ || 23.287
dvitīyaṃ nābhideśāc ca tadante saptamāragam |
caturdaśam ato nemeḥ ṣaṣṭhaṃ nābher athāharet || 23.288
sarve kāraṇavanmūrdhnā yojanīyāḥ samāsataḥ |
praṇavādyā namo'ntāś ca tejasātīya nirbhasaḥ || 23.289
padmanābhādayo devā vācyās teṣāṃ krameṇa tu |
padmanābho dhruvo 'nantaḥ śaktyātmā madhusūdanaḥ || 23.290
vidyādhidevaḥ kapilo viśvarūpo vihaṅgamaḥ <vihaṃgamaḥ> |
kroḍātmā baḍabāvaktro dharmo vāgīśvaras tathā || 23.291
deva ekārṇavaśayaḥ kūrmaḥ pātāladhārakaḥ |
varāho nārasiṃhaś cāpy amṛtāharaṇas tu vai || 23.292
śrīpatir divyadeho 'tha kāntātmāmṛtadhārakaḥ |
rāhujitkālanemighnaḥ pārijātaharo mahān || 23.293
lokānāthas tu śāntātmā dattātreyo mahāprabhuḥ |
nyagrodhaśāyī bhagavān ekaśṛṅgatanus tataḥ || 23.294
devo vāmanadehas tu sarvavyāpī trivikramaḥ |
naro nārāyaṇaś caiva hariḥ kṛṣṇas tathaiva ca || 23.295
jvalatparaśudhṛgrāmo rāmaś cānyo dhanurdharaḥ |
vedavidbhagavān kalkī pātālaśayanaḥ prabhuḥ || 23.296
prādurbhāvagaṇo mukhya ityuktas te samāsataḥ |
yathākramoditānāṃ ca devānāṃ vinibodha tu || 23.297
piṇḍamantragaṇaṃ mattaḥ sāvadhānena cetasā |
nābher aṣṭamabījaṃ yat sthitaṃ tatsaptamopari || 23.298
tadadhaś cottaraṃ cākṣād arānteva vibhūṣayet |
athottaraṃ cākṣadeśādādāya tad adho nyaset || 23.299
bījaṃ nemidvitīyaṃ yanmadhyān madhyaṃ tadāsane |
athāraṣaṣṭhasaṃruddhaṃ kuryād vai nābhi saptamam || 23.300
aṣṭamaṃ ca tadūrthve tv etadviddhi tṛtīyakam |
nābhyaṣṭamam athādāya arāt ṣaṣṭhāsanasthitam || 23.301
tato nābhidvitīyasya krameṇātho niveśya ca |
taduddeśāt tṛtīyaṃ ca saptamaṃ turyam eva ca || 23.302
athādāya ca nemeḥ prāk tad atho nābhisaptamam |
tasyāpy adhastaduddeśāt tṛtīyaṃ viniveśya ca || 23.303
tatas tu navamaṃ nābhes tasyordhvādhogataṃ nyaset |
tatraiva yaddvitīyaṃ tu tatpiṇḍaṃ viddhi saptamam || 23.304
arāt ṣaṣṭhasya cordhve tu nābhipūrvaṃ tu vinyaset |
saptamaṃ cāṣṭamaṃ cāpi hy uparyupari vai kramāt || 23.305
athāṣṭamaṃ nābhideśād ārūḍhaṃ saptamopari |
tad atho madhyagaṃ cākṣān navamaṃ parikīrtitam || 23.306
bhūyorāt pañcamasyordhve dadyān nābhitṛtīyakam |
bāhyāt tṛtīyaṃ tanmūrdhni piṇḍo 'yaṃ daśamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 23.307
dvitīyaṃ nābhideśāc ca tattṛtīyaṃ tadūrdhvagam |
nemer ādyantamūrdhve tu smṛtam ekādaśaṃ tv idam || 23.308
atho nābhicaturthasya saptamaṃ viniveśya ca |
tadatho nemipūrvaṃ tv etaddvādaśamaṃ smṛtam || 23.309
nemes tridaśam ādāya tadadho yojayet kramāt |
saptamaṃ ca caturthaṃ ca pūrvaṃ nābher mahāmate || 23.310
araṣaṣṭhāsanāḥ sarve piṇḍam etat trayodaśam |
nābheś caturtham ādāya tadūrdhve saptamaṃ nyaset || 23.311
navamaṃ cāpi tanmūrdhni etadviddhi caturdaśam |
nemeś caturthasaṃjñasyordhvādhobhyāṃ niveśya ca || 23.312
varṇaṃ nābhidvitīyaṃ yat tatpañcadaśamaṃ smṛtam |
yadviṃśasaṃkhyakaṃ bāhyādādāyārākhyamaṇḍalāt || 23.313
sāntimena ca ṣaṣṭhena yuktaṃ kuryād anantaram |
nemeḥ saptamavarṇasyordhvādhobhyāṃ niveśya ca || 23.314
nābhideśād dvitīyaṃ yadviddhi saptadaśaṃ tu tat |
navamaṃ nābhideśāc ca saptamasyopari nyaset || 23.315
athāṣṭamaṃ nābhideśāt kuryāt saptagamūrdhvagam |
dvitīyam api tasyādhas tasmād vai nābhimaṇḍalāt || 23.316
arāt trayodaśaṃ cordhve nyūnaviṃśatimaṃ hi tat |
nābheś caturthaṃ tasyordhve tattṛtīyaṃ tadūrdhvagam || 23.317
tatraiva saptamaṃ yad vai viddhi viṃśatimaṃ tv idam |
dvitīyasyāṣṭamaṃ nābher varṇasyordhve niyojya ca || 23.318
arāt ṣaṣṭhaṃ ca tasyādhaḥ kuryāt tadanu lāṅgalin |
navamaṃ nābhideśāc ca tṛtīyasyopari nyaset || 23.319
dvitīyaṃ tadadhaḥ kuryā trayoviṃśatimaṃ śṛṇu |
aṣṭamaṃ saptamaṃ nābher dvitīyaṃ prathamaṃ tataḥ || 23.320
krameṇa yojayec caivārāt ṣaṣṭhasya mūrdhani |
nemes saptamam ādāya tadadho nābhisaptamam || 23.321
tattṛtīyaṃ ca tasyādhaś caturviṃśatimaṃ smṛtam |
nābhes tṛtīyaṃ tasyordhve dvitīyaṃ tasya copari || 23.322
niveśya nemipūrvaṃ tu ṣaḍviṃśam adhunocyate |
arāt ṣaṣṭhāsanaṃ kuryād varṇaṃ nābhitṛtīyakam || 23.323
tadūrdhve saptamaṃ caivāto 'nyam avadhāraya |
nyūnaṃ viṃśatinemes tu tasyordhvādhogataṃ nyaset || 23.324
saptamaṃ nābhivarṇebhyas tvaravarṇāc ca pañcamam |
nemerādyaṃ dvitīyaṃ cādāya tadadho nyaset || 23.325
madhyamakṣān mahābuddhe aṣṭāviṃśatimaṃ smṛtam |
navamaṃ saptamaṃ nābhes tṛtīyaṃ ca dvitīyakam || 23.326
athottarasthamakṣāc cādāya tad adho nyaset |
tṛtīyaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ ca nābhideśād anantaram || 23.327
nābhidvitīyam ādāya saptamaṃ turyam eva ca |
tṛtīyasyātha vai nābher bāhyād ādyantam ūrdhvagam || 23.328
tatas tu navamaṃ nābher akṣamadhyastham ūrdhvagam |
aṣṭamasyātha vai nābher adha ūrdhve dvitīyakam || 23.329
dadyāt tadanvarāt ṣaṣṭhaṃ tasyaivādhogataṃ tu vai |
arāt ṣaṣṭhasya cordhve 'tha nābhipūrvaṃ tu tatparam || 23.330
viniveśyāṣṭamaṃ cāpi ṣaṭtriṃśam avadhāraya |
saptamaṃ ca tṛtīyaṃ ca caturthaṃ nābhimaṇḍalāt || 23.331
yojayitvā tadūrdhve tv apy arārṇaṃ tridaśaṃ nyaset |
atha yannavamaṃ nābhes tṛtīyaṃ ca dvitīyakam || 23.332
tatsaptatriṃśakaṃ viddhi nābhideśād athāharet |
arāt ṣaṣṭhāsanaṃ pūrvaṃ dvitīyaṃ ca tadūrdhvataḥ || 23.333
navamaṃ cāpi tasyordhve piṇḍāstvityādimaṃ vinā |
arān tādyena vai mūrdhnā sarve kāryā hy alaṃkṛtāḥ || 23.334
namontāḥ praṇavādyāś ca yuktās saṃjñāpadais svakaiḥ |
arān tādyaṃ vinā yasya yadūrdhve vartate svaraḥ || 23.335
adho vā nābhipūrveṇa saha vā kevalaṃ hitam |
apāsya ca tataḥ kuryāt sarveṣāṃ pūjanāya ca || 23.336
svena svena tu piṇḍena sihmavac cāṅgakalpanām |
namaḥpraṇavasaṃjñāḍhyā jātiḥ karmavaśāt punaḥ || 23.337
ātad uktānuyajanān mokṣaniṣṭhas samācaret |
bījapiṇḍapadotthānāṃ viniyogaṃ tu cākhilam || 23.338
kiṃ tv eṣāṃ vaibhavī mudrā deyārādhanakarmaṇi |
tadaṅgamudrāś cāṅgānāṃ yojyā mantrais svakais saha || 23.339
sarvaṃ sādhāram uddiṣṭaṃ saihamantroditaṃ mayā |
dīkṣāpūrvaṃ hi mantrāṇāṃ caturvargaṃ hi sādhanam || 23.340
lakṣaṇaṃ padamantrāṇām athedānīṃ nibodhatu |
yair vinā labdhasattānām arcanaṃ hi na jāyate || 23.341
viśvātītāya vimalapadaṃ vidyāvidhāyine |
padmanābhāya viśvavyāpine ca tadanantaram || 23.342
caturviṃśākṣaraṃ viddhi etatsaṃkhyaṃ paraṃśriṇu |
jyotīrūpāya pañcārṇaṃ padaṃ gaganamūrtaye | 23.343
dhruvāya dadyāt tadanu paramaṃ tryakṣaraṃ tataḥ |
padaprāpticaturvarṇaṃ hetave tryakṣaraṃ tv iti || 23.344
anantāyapadaṃ dadyāt tatoparimitāya ca |
sarvāśrayāya tadanu tadante dhūtaśaktaye || 23.345
etad viṃśatisaṃkhyaṃ ca dvāviṃśārṇam ataḥ śṛṇu |
namo bhagavate kṛtvā vāsudevāya vai tataḥ || 23.346
sarvaśaktyātmane 'nantamūrtaye tu padaṃ tv iti |
vīryātmano mahāśabdaṃ puruṣāya padaṃ tu tat || 23.347
mohamāyāpadaṃ caiva tato vidhvaṃsine tu vai |
sadoditāyaśabdaṃ tu sarvaśakte padaṃ tataḥ || 23.348
niyoktavyaś caturvarṇaḥ saptaviṃśākṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ |
padaṃ vedavide viśvarañjakāya tato bhavet || 23.349
tadante viśvapataye tato vai paramātmane |
eṣa viṃśatibhir varṇaiḥ śṛṇu saptadaśākṣaram || 23.350
jñānātmanepadaṃ kuryāt saṃvicchabdam ataḥparam |
padaṃ prakāśāśayāya śāntarūpāya vai tataḥ || 23.351
anantaśaktaye sarvavyāpine tadanantaram |
jaganmayāya tadanu viśvarūpāya vai padam || 23.352
ekaviṃśatibhir varṇair ayam uktoparaṃ śṛṇu |
satsatvapadam ādāya guhāśayapadaṃ tataḥ || 23.353
tataḥ paramahaṃsāya tato mānasacāriṇe |
nyūnaviṃśatyakṣaraś caiva tato yajñamūrtaye || 23.354
padam ādāya tadanu viśvāntarvartine tu vai |
tato bhuvanaśabdaṃ tu varāhāya padaṃ tv atha || 23.355
vibhūtisvāmine ceti caturviṃśākṣaras tv ayam |
namo bhagavate dadyāt tato vai vaḍabāgnaye || 23.356
jagajjalendhanapadaṃ pradīptaṃ padam eva tu |
vīryāyaphaṭ tadante tv etatsaṃkhyas tv ayaṃ smṛtaḥ || 23.357
sarvāntaś cāriṇe dadyāt prasannapadam eva ca |
mūrtaye 'tha padaṃ caiva dadyād dharmātmane padam || 23.358
ṣoḍaśākṣaram etad vai ato guhyamataś śṛṇu |
sarvavidyeśvarāyātha dadyād vākpataye tataḥ || 23.359
padaṃ padavad ādāya tato vāgvibhavaṃ tv iti |
nyūnaviṃśākṣaro hy eṣa tv aparaṃ kathayāmi te || 23.360
yogaiśvaryapradāyātha yoganidrārasāya vai |
nīradāya padaṃ dadyād bhagavan jalaśāyine || 23.361
triraṣṭavarṇasaṃkhyaś cāyam ekādhikas tu vai |
bhagavatpadam ādāyānantabalaśaktaye || 23.362
tejomayāya bhuvanadhṛte 'tha dvyakṣaraṃ padam |
tadante viniyoktavyaṃ padaṃ vai kacchapātmane || 23.363
ṣaḍviṃśārṇakramaṃ viddhi mantraṃ mantravidāṃ vara |
yajñāṅgadeham ādāya mahāpadam ataḥparam || 23.364
varāhāya tato dadyāt purāṇapuruṣāya vai |
dadyāt tataḥ prajāśabdaṃ tadante patayepadam || 23.365
caturviṃśākṣaraṃ mantram etanmantravidāṃ vara |
namo bhagavate kṛtvā nārasiṃhāya vai tataḥ || 23.366
tejonidhe padaṃ dadyāt padaṃ hana haneti ca |
tato vikarmajātyaṃ vai śadaṃ pañcākṣaraṃ bhavet || 23.367
duṣkṛtaṃ hi tadante vai saptaviṃśākṣaras tv ayam |
ādāyāmṛtamūrte vai tato jñānaparātmane || 23.368
sarveśvarāya bhagavannyūnaviṃśākṣaras tv ayam |
ādāyapuṇḍarīkākṣa padaṃ vai parameśvara || 23.369
tatas sakalaśabdaṃ tu sukhasaubhāgya vai padam |
nidhe vāṃchitaśabdaṃ <vāñchitaśabdaṃ> tu tatas siddhipradeti vai || 23.370
padaṃ cākhiladuḥkheti tatas tu śamanāgnaye |
ānandasundarapadaṃ tato lakṣmīpadaṃ nyaset || 23.371
pataye śabdam uccārya pañcāśārṇaṃ trirujjhitam |
sadasatpadam ādāya mūrtaye tadanantaram || 23.372
viścottamāya tadanu tato 'mṛtanidhe tu vai |
ṣoḍaśārṇas tv ayaṃ mantra uktaḥ kāntātmane vibhoḥ || 23.373
puruṣottamāya śabdaṃ tu tato 'pratihateti ca |
śaktaye 'tha padaṃ dadyāt sarveśvarapadaṃ tataḥ || 23.374
samagrograhayety atra nivāraṇa tataḥ param |
saptaviṃśākṣaro mantra uktaś cātaḥparaṃ śṛṇu || 23.375
niyantrepadam uddhṛtya tadante viśvahetave |
parabrahmasametaṃ ca setave omanantaram || 23.376
mantro dviraṣṭavarṇaś ca kathito 'yaṃ tataḥ param |
padam apratimetyādau prabhāvaṃ tadanantaram || 23.377
mahāvibhūte tadanu mahāmāyāpadaṃ tataḥ |
atha darśakaśabdaṃ tu tadante tālaketave || 23.378
caturviṃśākṣaro mantras tv ayam uktas samāsataḥ |
śāntātmane padaṃ dadyāt tadanteyam avinyaset || 23.379
niyamāśrayāya taddadyāt param apradayāya ca |
nārāyaṇāya śabdaṃ tu pūrvasaṃkhyāsamaṃ smṛtam || 23.380
bhavabhaṅgapadaṃ caiva kāriṇe tadanantaram |
tato bhagavate śabdaṃ dattātryeyāya vai tataḥ || 23.381
varṇāśramapadaṃ cātha dharmaśabdam ataḥparam |
parigrahāya praṇavam aṣṭāviṃśākṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ || 23.382
salokamāyāmāyeti sarvajñāya padaṃ tataḥ |
(śabdaṃ viśvātmane cātha vimaletipadaṃ tataḥ || 23.383
sarveśvarāya nyagrodhaśayanāya padaṃ tv atha |
trayoviṃśatyakṣaraś ca tv atha cānyaṃ nibodhatu || 23.384
bhūtaśabdam athādāya bhāvanāya padaṃ tataḥ |)
śabdaṃ viśvātmane cātha vimaletipadaṃ tataḥ || 23.385
niketanāya tadanu kandharāyapadaṃ tataḥ |
ayaṃ viṃśatibhir varṇair dvyadhikair mantrarāṭsmṛtaḥ || 23.386
viṣṇave padam ādāya nirastrāstrāya vai tataḥ |
padaṃ brahmanayāyātha jaṭine dīṇḍane tataḥ || 23.387
dadyād viditaśabdaṃ vai tadante vibhavāya ca |
ṣaḍviṃśārṇas tv ayaṃ mantraḥ paramasmān nibodhatu || 23.388
sarvaśabdam athādāya vyāpine tadanantaram |
padaṃ sahasrārciṣe ca dadyāt pañcākṣaraṃ śubham || 23.389
trivikramāyātha padaṃ tatoparimitāya vai |
prabhāvāyapadaṃ dadyāt trayoviṃśākṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ || 23.390
naranāthāya śabdaṃ tu puruṣapravarāya vai |
ātmadhyānaparāyeti ṇāya vai dvyakṣaraṃ tataḥ || 23.391
ekaviṃśākṣaro mantras tv ato'nyam avadhāraya |
nārāyaṇāya śabdaṃ tu dadyān nirati vai padam || 23.392
śayānandamayāyeti padaṃ nirabhimāna vai |
padasaktāya tadanu pañcaviṃśākṣaras tv ayam || 23.393
parāya padam ādāya tato vai paramātmane |
yogeśvarāya haraye mantro 'yaṃ ṣoḍaśākṣaraḥ || 23.394
saptārṇaṃ padam ādāya prāṅnamaḥ paramātmane |
kṛṣṇāya śabdaṃ tadanu kamalaṃ tryakṣaraṃ tataḥ || 23.395
dalaśabdaṃ tu vitataṃ netrāya tadanantaram |
bṛhmiṣṭhāya brahmaṇe vāy aṣṭāviṃśākṣaras tv ayam || 23.396
bhagavatpadam ādāya yugāntadahaneti ca |
dṛptaye 'tha padaṃ dadyāt saṃsārapadam eva hi || 23.397
bandhavicchedakartre vai dvāviṃśārṇas tv ayaṃ smṛtaḥ |
dadyād viśadaśabdaṃ vai paramārthapadaṃ tataḥ || 23.398
padaṃ caturmūrtaye vai caturgatimayāya ca |
śaraśārṅgabhṛte dadyāc charadindīvaratviṣe || 23.399
tato bhagavate dadyād abhirāmapadaṃ tataḥ |
śarīrāyapadaṃ caiva tv aṣṭatriṃśākṣaraṃ smṛtam || 23.400
dadyād dviśadaśabdaṃ vai paramārthapadaṃ tataḥ |
tato vedavide śabdaṃ viduṣe vyāpakāya ca || 23.401
svāmiṃs tadanu vai dadyād vyakṣaraṃ cāparaṃ padam |
ayaṃ viṃśatibhir varṇair uktas tv anyam ataś śṛṇu || 23.402
dadyād garuḍaśabdaṃ tu tadante vāhaneti ca |
sarvaśastrāstrodyateti śamayāśubham evaṃ ca || 23.403
tato 'dhunadhunādāya karmabandhāṃs tathoccaret |
dharmaṃ pāhi tatodadyāj jahyadharmaṃ tatoddharet || 23.404
catustriṃśākṣaro mantra eṣa vakṣyāmy ataḥparam |
saṃhāramūrtaye śabdaṃ kālavaiśvānarārciṣe || 23.405
pātālaśayanāyeti tv ajñānanigaleti vai |
nicayaṃ hana vīpsātaḥ praṇavaṃ tadanantaram || 23.406
pañcatriṃśākṣaro hy eṣa sarvasiddhikaraḥ smṛtaḥ |
praṇavālaṃkṛtās sarve namaskāravibhūṣitāḥ || 23.407
saṃskṛtāḥ pūjitāś caiva dhyānajaptā viśeṣataḥ |
tannāsti yac ca yacchanti bhaktyāsatkarmaṇāṃ bhuvi || 23.408
atha lāṃchanamantrāṇāṃ <lāñchanamantrāṇāṃ> śāstrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ 
śṛṇu |
sahasradīdhitipadaṃ dadyāc churita vai tataḥ || 23.409
vigrahāya daśārṇaṃ ca tryadhikaṃ makuṭasya ca |
ādāya vāṃchitapadaṃ <vāñchitapadaṃ> tadasidhyapradāya vai || 23.410
mahācintāpadaṃ dadyān maṇaye tadanantaram |
viddhi pañcadaśārṇaṃ ca daśārṇam aparaṃ śṛṇu || 23.411
sarvalakṣaṇaśabdaṃ tu tatas sampatpradāya <saṃpatpradāya> vai |
saubhāgyaśabdam ādāya janani tryakṣaraṃ tataḥ || 23.412
sarvaprade tu tadanv ayam eva daśākṣaram |
prāṇātmanetha satyāya viddhi saptākṣaraṃ tv idam || 23.413
kālakartre 'tha cakrāya phaḍaṣṭārṇaṃ prakīrtitam |
viśvātmane padaṃ dadyāt tato viśvapradāya ca || 23.414
navākṣaram idaṃ viddhi param aṣṭākṣaraṃ śṛṇu |
samādāya padaṃ vidye tato vidyeśvarārcite || 23.415
prākśabdamūrtaye kuryāc chaṅkhāyāṣṭākṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ |
padaṃ rasanidhe kuryād bhīmaśabdam ataḥparam || 23.416
bhīṣaṇāya tadante vai daśākṣaram idaṃ smṛtam |
prāgbhuvanādhipataye stambhabhūtāya vai padam || 23.417
trayodaśākṣaraṃ viddhi tato 'nyam avadhāraya |
padam indriyakośāya iṣvastrāya daśākṣaram || 23.418
kalpāntānilaghoṣāya vidyullasita vai padam |
prabhāya ṣoḍaśārṇaṃ tu navākṣaram ataś śṛṇu || 23.419
mahāmāyāpadaṃ dadyād bandhavarṇadvayaṃ tataḥ |
dhvaṃsine padam ādāya etatsaṃkhyaṃ paraṃ śṛṇu || 23.420
sarvāstragrasanādāya parāya tadanantaram |
santāpakāya <saṃtāpakāya> śabdaṃ tu darpavidhvaṃsine tataḥ || 23.421
ekādaśākṣaraṃviddhi navākṣaram athocyate |
ajñānakhaṇḍanapadaṃ parāya tadanantaram || 23.422
trailokyamohanapadaṃ mūrtaye tu navākṣaram |
sarvākarṣaṇakarapadaṃ mahāmāyāmayeti vai || 23.423
dvādaśākṣarasaṃkhyas tu navākṣaram athoddharet |
prāgakhaṇḍitaśabdaṃ tu tadante viniyojya ca || 23.424
parākramāya śabdaṃ tu saptākṣaram ataś śṛṇu |
darpapraśamakartre tu pañcārṇaṃ vinibodha vai || 23.425
tejomālini cety ete dvāviṃśatyanukīrtitāḥ |
prāgvadādyantasaṃruddhā svanāmapadabhūṣitāḥ || 23.426
saṃkhyāyniṣṭhākṣarasyānte dadyāt saṃjñāpadaṃ sadā |
cakravac cāstramantrāṇāṃ kuryān nāmāvasānakam || 23.427
kramāc caturdaśānān tu śaktyantānāṃ ca ṣaṭpadam |
atha vakṣye nṛsiṃhasya viśvatrātur manūttamam || 23.428
varṇacakraṃ tu pūrvoktaṃ sugupte vasudhātale |
upalipte tu saṃlikhya pūjayitvā yathāvidhi || 23.429
samuddharet tato mantram anekādbhutavikramam |
praṇavaṃ pūrvam ādāya tadante viniyojya ca || 23.430
navamaṃ nābhivarṇebhyas tadūrdhverāc caturdaśam |
tasyopari tadantasthavarṇaṃ golakavan nyaset || 23.431
namo 'ntaṃ varṇam etad vai vācakaṃ paramātmanaḥ |
jñānādayo guṇāṣ ṣaḍbhyaḥ prāguktā hṛdayādayaḥ || 23.432
tadartham eva varṇaṃ taṃ ṣoḍhā saṃlikhya kevalam |
dvitīyaturyaṣaṣṭhaiś ca dvādaśenāntimena ca || 23.433
caturdaśenārād vargāt kramād vai viniyojayet |
bījavacchirasā sarvān lāṃchayet <lāñchayet> pañcamaṃ vinā || 23.434
sarveṣāṃ praṇavaṃ pūrvaṃ svasaṃjñānte niyojya ca |
svakīyā jātayaś cānte vauṣaḍantāḥ krameṇa tu || 23.435
onnamo bhagavate nārasiṃhāyed yanena tu |
dvādaśākṣaramantreṇa smṛtvā vigrahavat purā || 23.436
sabāhyābhyantarasthena sāṅgenādyena pūjayet ||

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ
mantroddhāravidhir nāma
trayoviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha caturviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

nāradaḥ
atha mudrāvidhiṃ vakṣye śṛṇudhvaṃ munipuṅgavāḥ |
mudaṃ karmātmatattvānāṃ dadāty amalayājinām || 24.1
drāvayanti ca doṣāṇāṃ bāhyābhyantaracāriṇām |
tena mudrā samākhyātā kṛtasyāpi ca mudraṇāt || 24.2
tasmāt svābhāvikaṃ kṛtvā bandhaṃ vā mānasaṃ purā |
svena svena tu mantreṇa smared vyāptaṃ sadaiva hi || 24.3
caitanyenānuviddho yaś śākhāsaṃghaś ca yady api |
tatrāpi mantrotrādhyakṣas tatkāryaṃ samprayacchati <saṃprayacchati> || 24.4
gandhadigdhau karau kṛtvā mudrābandhaṃ samācaret |
madhyamānāmikābhyāṃ tu dvandvayuktaṃ karadvayāt || 24.5
parāṅmukhaṃ ca suspaṣṭaṃ kṛtvāyojyaṃ parasparam |
āmūlān nakhaparyantaṃ nairantaryeṇa yatnataḥ || 24.6
samuttāne karatale śeṣāś cāṃgulayas <cāṅgulayas> tathā |
agharottarayogena vāmadakṣiṇatas tathā || 24.7
tarjanyām ūrdhvato 'ṃguṣṭhe <'ṅguṣṭhe> sammukhe <saṃmukhe> samprasārya 
<saṃprasārya> ca |
niviṣṭā hṛdaye kāryā mudraiṣā munipuṅgavāḥ || 24.8
cāturātmyārcane yojyā sarvasiddhipradāyinī |
śiṣṭau vikasitau hastau yojyau ca maṇibandhanāt || 24.9
tadbāhukūrṣarau dvau ca nābhau saṃrodhya daṇḍavat |
īṣad vai ḍolayet paścād adha ūrdhve tu tau karau || 24.10
guptiṃ kṛtvā tu yojyaiṣā mudrārādhanakarmaṇi |
mūrtīnāṃ keśavādīnāṃ tato'nyāṃ śṛṇuta dvijāḥ || 24.11
śleṣya pāṇitale dve prāṅnamraṃ kuryāl latāgaṇam |
vimuktam antarīkṛtya sahāṃguṣṭhadvayena <sahāṅguṣṭhadvayena> tu || 24.12
maṇibandhadvayaṃ kuryāt sulagnam atiniścalam |
karayugmaṃ sagarbhaṃ tu sandhārya <saṃdhārya> svadhiyācalam || 24.13
ūrumadhye niṣaṇṇe tu kuryād vai bāhukūrpare |
guptāṃ kṛtvā prayantena bandhamasyāḥ samācaret || 24.14
eṣā vibhavadevānāṃ mudraikā vaibhavī dvijāḥ |
praṇavena prayojyeyaṃ sahasrāṃśusamaprabhā || 24.15
viśvatrātṛnṛsiṃhasya mudrādvayam athocyate |
dhyātvā tretāgnirūpaṃ tu dakṣiṇād aṃgulatrayam <aṅgulatrayam> || 24.16
spaṣṭam ūrdhvamukhaṃ saiva jyeṣṭhākrāntā kanīyasī |
athākhilādhvarūpā cāpy adhvātīto 'gnirūpadhṛk || 24.17
devo guṇatrayātītas tathā mārgatrayātigaḥ |
dharmais sthūlatarair mukto yo 'yaṃ vyakto dhiyārcitaḥ || 24.18
parasparamukhau śliṣṭau śākhākrāntau parasparam |
kin tu vai dakṣiṇaṃ hastam ūrdhvaṃ cāpy apareparam || 24.19
avidhyādalanīhyeṣyā mudrā pūrvam udāhṛtā |
tato hṛdādimantrāṇāṃ mudrāṣaṭkan tu kathyate || 24.20
sampuṭaṃ <saṃpuṭaṃ> hṛdayoddeśe badhvā hastadvayena tu |
nirantarābhyāṃ śākhābhyāṃ mudraiṣā hārdradhīsmṛtā || 24.21
aṅguṣṭhādi kaniṣṭhāntaṃ śākhāyugmaṃ pṛthak pṛthak |
sāntaraṃ sampuṭād <saṃpuṭād> asmāt kaniṣṭhādau tathā bhavet || 24.22
śiraśśikhātanutrāstranetramudrā yathā kramam |
hastau mukulitau kṛtvā nyasec chirasi mantrataḥ || 24.23
jñeyā kirīṭamudreyaṃ mārtāṇḍāyutasannibhā <mārtāṇḍāyutasaṃnibhā> |
tataḥ śrīvatsamudrā tu padmamudraiva kīrtitā || 24.24
madhyamānāmikānyūnā muṣṭivatpāṇimadhyagā |
ubhayor hastayor vipra paścānmuṣṭidvayaṃ tu yat || 24.25
śleṣayet samarandhreṇa tarjanyau dve prasārya ca |
tataḥ saṃśleṣayed agrād aṅguṣṭhāgre niyojayet || 24.26
madhyatas tarjanībhyāṃ tv anyonyena krameṇa tu |
mudraiṣā kaustubhasyoktā mālāmudrām atho śṛṇu || 24.27
śākhāṣṭakaṃ karābhyāṃ yadgrastam agrād apūrataḥ |
saṃślekṣṇaṃ lambamānaṃ ca upaviṣṭo 'tha vā sthitaḥ || 24.28
kuryād bāhudvayaṃ vipra ūrumadhyāvalambitam |
maṇibandhāvadhau samyaṅmālāmudrā prakīrtitā || 24.29
aṅguṣṭhau saṅgatau <saṃgatau> lagnāv aṅgulyo viralāsthitāḥ |
pādmī hy eṣā bhaven mudrā puṣṭisaubhāgyadāyikā || 24.30
muṣṭinā grāhayed vāmam aṃguṣṭhaṃ <aṅguṣṭhaṃ> dakṣiṇena tu |
aṃgulīr <aṅgulīr> vāmahastāt tu dakṣiṇasyopari nyaset || 24.31
vāmatarjanikāgraṃ tv aṃguṣṭhāgraṃ <aṅguṣṭhāgraṃ> ca dakṣiṇāt |
parasparaṃ sammukhaṃ <saṃmukhaṃ> tu suśliṣṭaṃ viniyojayet || 24.32
śaṅkhasyaiṣā bhaven mudrā uttānātu yathā sthitā |
spaṣṭau prasārito hastau parasparaniyojitau || 24.33
bhramaṇāc cakravattau tu cakramudreti kīrtitā |
nāśinī sarvaduḥkhānāṃ mudrāṇāṃ bhedinīparā || 24.34
badhvā muṣṭiṃ dakṣiṇena vāmāṃguṣṭhasya <vāmāṅguṣṭhasya> mūrdhani |
kṛtvaiva darśayed eṣā kaumodakyās suśobhanā || 24.35
gadāmudreti vikhyātā doṣasainyapramardinī |
prasāryā vāmam uttānā aṅgulyo viralasthitāḥ || 24.36
kāryās tvākuñcitā prāntād aṃguṣṭhaṃ <aṅguṣṭhaṃ> setuvad bhavet |
saṃmukhaṃ tāsu saṃlagnaṃ karaśākhāsu madhyataḥ || 24.37
hṛtsammukhāt <hṛtsaṃmukhāt> tu badhnīyāc chaktimudrāṃ sukhapradām |
prādiśinyādito viddhi kaniṣṭhāntaṃ śriyādiṣu || 24.38
prasārya saṃhitaṃ kṛtvā purā pāṇidvayaṃ dvija |
anāmāmūladeśābhyām aṃguṣṭhāgradvayaṃ <aṅguṣṭhāgradvayaṃ> nyaset || 
24.39
adhomukhaṃ tu patitaṃ maṇibandhasya sammukham <saṃmukham> |
suspaṣṭam ucchritaṃ lagnaṃ pucchavatkanyasāyugam || 24.40
pakṣirājasya mudraiṣā kevalasya mahātmanaḥ |
sāmānyā sarvamantrāṇām ekā mudrāṃjaliḥ <mudrāñjaliḥ> smṛtā || 24.41
svena svena tu mantreṇa saṃyuktāṃ tāṃ prayojayet |
dakṣe karatale raktapaṅkajaṃ bhāskaraṃ smaran || 24.42
dravyāṇi saṃspṛśet tena mudraiṣā dahanātmikā |
vāmahastatale śvetapaṅkaje śaśinaṃ smaran || 24.43
dravyāṇi saṃspṛśet tena mudraiṣāpyāyanātmikā |
grathitau dvau karau kṛtvā suśliṣṭau cāpy adhomukhau || 24.44
kannīyasau tadaṃguṣṭhau <tadaṅguṣṭhau> suśleṣeṇa niyojya ca |
madhyamāṃguliyugmaṃ <madhyamāṅguliyugmaṃ> tv anyonyakarapṛṣṭhagam || 
24.45
vikṣiptānāmikāyugmaṃ tarjanīyugalaṃ tathā |
mudraiṣā kāmadhenvākyā sarvecchā paripūriṇī || 24.46
atha cāsanamantrāṇāṃ mudrābandhas tu vakṣyate |
ādhemukhasya vāmasyānāmā tarjanī ubhe || 24.47
ākuñcya pṛṣṭhalagne tu madhyamāyāṃ tu saṃsthite |
tayor adhastān madhyābhyām ṛjvāṃ kuryād adhomukhām || 24.48
phaniṣṭhikā tu sāṃguṣṭhā <sāṅguṣṭhā> kāryā suprasṛtā mune |
anantāsanamudreyaṃ mantronāsyāyato dvija || 24.49
sarvaṃ jagad idaṃ hy eṣā kroḍīkṛtya ca vartate |
karadvayam asaṃlagne kṛtvā tadanu yojayet || 24.50
mukhe mukhaṃ tarjanībhyāṃ na muñced atha madhyayoḥ |
kuryāt tādṛgvidhaṃ bandhaṃ taṃ tyaktvānāmikādvaye || 24.51
upasaṃhṛtya taṃ cāpi dve kaniṣṭhe niyojayet |
pratyekabandhe saṃlagnam aṃguṣṭhayugalaṃ <aṅguṣṭhayugalaṃ> nyaset || 24.52
dharmādeś cāpy adharmāder idaṃ mudrācatuṣṭayam |
tadūrdhvasthasya padmasya prāguktā mantrayogataḥ || 24.53
dakṣiṇasya tu hastasya tarjany aṅguṣṭhamelanam |
kṛtvā tadanu tadbandhaṃ vikāsya ca śanaiś śanaiḥ || 24.54
samutthānaṃ pṛthakkuryāc chākhāsaṃghaṃ pṛthak sthitam |
dhāmatrayasya mudraiṣā gaṇeśādes tathocyate || 24.55
vāmahastakaniṣṭhādyās tisrassvatalamadhyagāḥ |
tāsām aṃguṣṭhataḥ <aṅguṣṭhataḥ> pṛṣṭhe tarjanī pronnatā bhavet || 24.56
nāsāvaṃśapradeśasthā tato dakṣiṇapāṇinā |
aṃgulī <aṅgulī> tritayenaiva muṣṭiṃ badhvā tu pūrvavat || 24.57
tarjanīṃ dviguṇī kṛtyāṃguṣṭhāgre <kṛtyāṅguṣṭhāgre> niyojayet |
prodyato dakṣiṇobāhuś cakrakṣepe yathodyataḥ || 24.58
viṣvaksenasya mudraiṣā viśvabandhanikartanī |
saṃmukhau sampuṭīkṛtya <saṃpuṭīkṛtya> dvau hastau samprasāritau 
<saṃprasāritau> || 24.59
viniyojyau lalāṭāgre śirasāvanatena tu |
gurvāditritayasyaiṣā mudrā cetaḥprasādinī || 24.60
karadvayaṃ samuttānaṃ nābhideśe niyojayet |
vāmasya dakṣiṇaṃ pṛṣṭhe mudraiṣā siddhasantateḥ <siddhasaṃtateḥ> || 24.61
tadanyeṣāṃ tu sarveṣāṃ mudrā syād añjalir dvijāḥ |
tathaiva parivārāṇāṃ dvārāvaraṇavāsinām || 24.62
svamantrayuktā cānyeṣām arcitānāṃ yathā kramam |
punaḥ punaḥ prayoktavyā hārdradhīś śirasā saha || 24.63
padmākārau karau kṛtvāṃguṣṭhe <kṛtvāṅguṣṭhe> ca kaniṣṭhake |
saṃmīlya cāgradeśāt tu karṇikeva yathā dvijāḥ || 24.64
tarjanyāditrayaṃ śeṣam ūrdhvagaṃ ca karadvayāt |
asaṃlagnaṃ tu nikṣipya mudrāgneḥ samprakīrtitā <saṃprakīrtitā> || 24.65
kiñcidākuñcayaddhas taṃ dakṣiṇaṃ hṛdayopagam |
aṃguṣṭhau <aṅguṣṭhau> viralau spaṣṭau mudrā hy āvāhane smṛtā || 24.66
urttānau saṃhatau pāṇī kṛtvāṃguṣṭhadvayena <kṛtvāṅguṣṭhadvayena> tu |
svāṃ svāṃ kaniṣṭhāṃ visṛjed eṣā sannidhimudrikā <saṃnidhimudrikā> || 24.67
anāmayor madhyamayoḥ kuryād unmārjanaṃ tataḥ |
saṃstambhasannirodhau <saṃstambhasaṃnirodhau> ca dvau kṛtau bhavatas tathā || 24.68
pāṇibhyām aṃjaliṃ <añjaliṃ> kuryād īṣadvikasitaṃ dvijāḥ |
eṣā sāṃmukhyamudrā hi sammukhīkurute <saṃmukhīkurute> vibhum || 24.69
khaḍgadhārāsamākārau viralāṃgulikāv <viralāṅgulikāv> ubhau |
aṃguṣṭhau <aṅguṣṭhau> daṇḍavat kṛtvā muṣṭibandhaṃ śanaiś śanaiḥ || 24.70
kuryāt kaniṣṭhikādibhyo mudraiṣā syād visarjane |
anena vidhinā mudrāṃ yo bandhāti vidhānavit || 24.71
tenedaṃ mudritaṃ viśvaṃ punarbhavati siddhidam |
atha prāguktamantrāṇāṃ dhyānaṃ vakṣye kramād dvijāḥ || 24.72
prathamaṃ tv ekamūrter vai śṛṇudhvaṃ dhyānam uttamam |
dhyeyaḥ paro jagannātho devonastasamanvitaḥ || 24.73
varadābhayadenaiva śaṃkhacakrāṅkitena <śaṅkhacakrāṅkitena> tu |
trailokyoddhṛtidakṣeṇa yuktaḥ pāṇidvayena tu || 24.74
śāntaḥ saṃvitsvarūpas tu bhaktānugrahakāmyayā |
anaupamyena vapuṣā hy amūrto mūrtatāṅgataḥ || 24.75
viśvam āpyāyayan kantyā pūrṇendvayutatulyayā |
raśmibhir bhāskaro yadvat samudra iva vīcibhiḥ || 24.76
svamūrtibhir amuktābhir acyutādibhir anvitaḥ |
dīptimadbhir amūrtais tu sudhākallolasaṃkulaḥ || 24.77
pūrṇa ābharaṇaiḥ sarvair nirvikārāṃghrivigrahaḥ <nirvikārāṅghrivigrahaḥ> |
tataḥ suṣuptivyūhasya vakṣye dhyānam anuttamam || 24.78
vedakatvena bhagavān brahmasaṃvalitākṛtiḥ |
stambhavatkarṇikāmadhye sthitvā vedyatvam eti ca || 24.79
svayam evopakārāya karmiṇāṃ brahmayājinām |
prāgbhāgād uttaraṃ yāvadguṇabhedena lāṅgalin || 24.80
vibhajatyātmanānmānaṃ vāsudevaḥ paraḥ prabhuḥ |
anujjhitasvarūpas tu prāgbhāge ṣaḍguṇātmanā || 24.81
balasaṃvalitenaiva jñānenāste 'tha dakṣiṇe |
aiśvaryeṇa ca vīryeṇa pratyagbhāge pratiṣṭhitaḥ || 24.82
tejaś śaktyātmanā saumye saṃsthitaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
yady apy arūpo bhagavān vyūhātmā guṇalakṣaṇaḥ || 24.83
atrāpi pūrvam evoktaṃ rūṣamasyopacaryate |
kiṃ tu dvitīyamūrter vai śubhe pāṇitaladvaye || 24.84
sphuṭo rekhāmayaḥ śaṃkhaḥ <śaṅkhaḥ> suvyaktaṃ lāṅgalaṃ mahat |
ramyeṣuṇā tṛtīyasya dakṣiṇaś cihnitaḥ karaḥ || 24.85
turyasyāsivareṇaiva śaṅkha ābhyāṃ karadvaye |
avāṅmukhaḥ karavaśād ūrdhvavaktraḥ svabhāvataḥ || 24.86
etāvatā lakṣaṇena vyaktibhāvaṃ gatena ca |
bhāvasthitiṃ nibadhnāti vyūhe 'smin sādhakasya tu || 24.87
sādṛśyāt ṣaḍguṇatvāc ca samatvāc ca viśeṣataḥ |
śāntatvān niṣkriyatvāc ca bhedo vidyate yataḥ || 24.88
guṇadvayadvayenaiva yady apy uktaḥ purā mayā |
ekaikaṃ bhagavadrūpaṃ mukhyavṛtyā tathāpi hi || 24.89
catuṣkam avaśiṣṭaṃ yadguṇānāṃ samavasthitam |
yadbhajetānuvṛttiṃ ca ekaikasya ca sarvadā || 24.90
svapnavyūhadhyānam atha śṛṇudhvaṃ munisattamāḥ |
yenātmā svapna evātmā karmiṇām anukampayā || 24.91
krameṇa vyaktatāṃ nīto vāgvarṇakamalopari |
abhinnapūrṇaṣāḍguṇyavibhavenopabṛṃhitaḥ || 24.92
bhābhiḥ sitādibhir dīptam abhinnābhir nirantaram |
avalokyāmalandevam uditatvena tejasā || 24.93
karṇikāgraṃ samāśritya divyaṃ mantratanuṃ punaḥ |
paśyet svayaṃ svaśaktyā vai kālenālakṣyamūrtinā || 24.94
saṃharantaṃ ca tadrūpaṃ vyaktaṃ pūrvoktalakṣaṇam |
evaṃ mantramayaṃ deham upasaṃhṛtya lāṅgalin || 24.95
āmūlāt karṇikāgraṃ ca sampūryās <saṃpūryās> te svatejasā |
brahmayūpasvarūpeṇa tv ākramya svaṃ mahāmate || 24.96
saumyamūrticatuṣkan tu sarvadikprasṛtaṃ ca yat |
prācyāṃ sitena vapuṣā sūryakāntyadhikena tu || 24.97
vyaktim abhyeti bhagavān vāsudaivātmanā svayam |
padmarāgasamānena tejasā tadanantaram || 24.98
udeti dakṣiṇasyāṃ vai prabhuḥ saṅkarṣaṇātmanā <saṃkarṣaṇātmanā> |
dharmāṃśuraśmisantaptaśatadhāmādhikena 
<dharmāṃśuraśmisaṃtaptaśatadhāmādhikena> tu || 24.99
rūpeṇa paścimasyāṃ ca vyaktaṃ pradyumnasaṃjñayā |
śaradgaganasaṅkāśavarṇena <śaradgaganasaṃkāśavarṇena> parameśvaraḥ || 
24.100
samāsta uttarasyāṃ cāpy aniruddhātmanā tataḥ |
saṃsthāna ādimūrtir vai sarveṣāṃ tu samaṃ smṛtam || 24.101
sūryakoṭiprabhāḥ sarve tejasā kamalekṣaṇa |
dantajyotsnāvitānais tu prakaṭīkṛtadiṅmukhāḥ || 24.102
pūrṇacandrāyutākārā muktāhārādyalaṃkṛtāḥ |
lasatpīyūṣasadṛśaiḥ svāmbaraiḥ sragvarair yutāḥ || 24.103
varāyudhodyatakarāḥ svakaiś cihnair anujjhitāḥ |
lekhotthitais tu kalhāraiḥ pādapatratalāṅkitāḥ || 24.104
nimagnajanasantāpaśamanavyapṛtānanāḥ 
<nimagnajanasaṃtāpaśamanavyapṛtānanāḥ> |
karuṇāpūrṇahṛdayā jagaduddharaṇodyatāḥ || 24.105
svadehatejas sambhūtajvālāmaṇḍalamadhyagāḥ 
<saṃbhūtajvālāmaṇḍalamadhyagāḥ> |
evam evaiṣa bhagavān santarpyaḥ <saṃtarpyaḥ> prākprayogataḥ || 24.106
ekaikena tu bhāgena prabhavena krameṇa tu |
punar evāniruddhādi prāṅmūrtyantaṃ mahāmate || 24.107
kramān nirantarair bhogair abhyarcyaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
praṇavadvitayenaiva budhyā tu suviśuddhayā || 24.108
apyayākhyena vidhinā hṛdyāganiratair budhaiḥ |
tatas tu jāgradvyūhasya vakṣye dhyānakramaṃ dvijāḥ || 24.109
anantasarasi kṣārṇe viśrāntaṃ yanmahāmate |
akārākṣaramūlaṃ tu nityaṃ sarvāśrayāmbujam || 24.110
akārākṣaranālaṃ tu śeṣasarvārṇapallavam |
digaṣṭakaṃ samāśritya yat tu tiṣṭhati cakravat || 24.111
tatpatramadhye bhagavān jāgratsaṃjñe pade tv atha |
yaṣṭavyo bhāvanīyaś ca yathā tadadhunocyate || 24.112
paro graṇavabījena sampūrṇaḥ <saṃpūrṇaḥ> svena tejasā |
sthitas tv ākarṇikordhvāc ca kesarāntarnirīkṣya ca || 24.113
tataḥ praṇavapūrvaṃ tu brahmabījacatuṣṭayāt |
kadambapuṣpasadṛśān marīciśatasaṅkulāt <marīciśatasaṃkulāt> || 24.114
dikkrameṇoditaṃ dhyāyed vibhor mūrticatuṣṭayam |
suvyaktalakṣaṇaṃ māntraṃ vibhavenāvṛtaṃ bahiḥ || 24.115
sphuliṅgakaṇatulyena samudbhūtena vai parāt |
vācakāntarniviṣṭena vyaktatāmāgatena ca || 24.116
tatrādyaṃ bhagavadrūpaṃ himakundendukāntimat |
caturbhujaṃ saumyavaktraṃ puṇḍarīkanibhekṣaṇam || 24.117
pītakauśeyavasanaṃ suvarṇadhvajaśobhitam |
mukhyadakṣiṇahastena bhītānām abhayapradam || 24.118
vidyākośas tu vāmena saṃgṛhītaś ca śaṅkharāṭ |
pṛṣṭhage hy aparasmiṃs tu prodyataṃ dakṣiṇo tvari || 24.119
tathāvidhe gadā vāme niṣaṇṇā vasudhātale |
sindūraśikharākāram ekavaktraṃ caturbhujam || 24.120
atasīpuṣpasaṅkāśavāsobhṛttālalāṃchitam 
<atasīpuṣpasaṃkāśavāsobhṛttālalāñchitam> |
mukhyena pāṇiyugmena tulyam ādyasya vai vibhoḥ || 24.121
sīraṃ tacakahastesya musalaṃ tu gadākare |
prāvṛṇṇiśāsamuditakhadyotacayadīdhiti || 24.122
raktakauśeyavasanaṃ makaradhvajaśobhitam |
ekavaktraṃ caturbāhuṃ tṛtīyaṃ parameśvaram || 24.123
mukhyahastadvayaṃ cāsya prāgvaddhyeyaṃ mahāmate |
vāme parasmin śārṅgaṃ ca dakṣiṇe bāṇapañcakam || 24.124
añjanādripratīkāśaṃ susitāmbaraveṣṭitam |
caturbhujaṃ viśālākṣaṃ mṛgalāṃchanabhūṣitam <mṛgalāñchanabhūṣitam> || 
24.125
ādivatpāṇiyugalam ādyam asyāpi kīrtitam |
dakṣiṇādikrameṇātha dvābhyāṃ vai khaḍgakheṭakau || 24.126
vanamālādharāḥ sarve śrīvatsakṛtalakṣaṇāḥ |
śobhitāḥ kaustubhenaiva ratnarājena vakṣasi || 24.127
kirīṭamakuṭai ramyair hārakeyūranūpuraiḥ |
lalāṭatilakaiś citraiḥ sphuran makarakuṇḍalaiḥ || 24.128
sragvarair vividhair mālyaiḥ karpūrādyair vilepanaiḥ |
ramyair alaṃkṛtāś caiva bhāvanīyāḥ sadaiva hi || 24.129
punarapyayayogena prāgudaṅmadhyame dale |
sitakṛṣṇena vapuṣā aniruddhaṃ smaret prabhum || 24.130
udakpaścimamadhyasthe pradyumnaṃ bhāvayec chade |
rūpeṇa kṛṣṇapītenāpyayāvasare tu vai || 24.131
pratyagdakṣiṇamadhyasthe pītaraktavapurdharam |
smaret saṅkarṣaṇaṃ <saṃkarṣaṇaṃ> devaṃ pratisrotaḥkriyāvidhau || 24.132
madhye prāgdakṣiṇasyāṃ ca sitarakteta tejasā |
vāsudevo jagannātho bhāvanīyo mahāmate || 24.133
atha śuddhāśayatvena sphaṭikopalavadvibhuḥ |
sthānabhedaṃ samāsādya sacakāntidvayāt tu vai || 24.134
gṛhṇāti śabalaṃ rūpam upasaṃhāralakṣaṇam |
abhedenādimūrter vai saṃsthitaṃ vaṭabījavat || 24.135
sarvakriyāvinirmuktam amūrtaṃ paramārthataḥ |
cāturātmyaṃ tadādyaṃ vai śuddhasaṃvinmayaṃ mahat || 24.136
vahnyarkendusahasrābhamānandaspandalakṣaṇam |
bījaṃ sarvakriyāṇāṃ yadvikalpānāṃ yadāspadam || 24.137
cāturātmyaṃ tu tadviddhi dvitīyam amalekṣaṇa |
nitya nityākṛtidharaṃ tejasā sūryavarcasam || 24.138
bhinnaṃ sitādibhedena ūrdhvādhaḥ saṃsthitena ca |
kaivalyabhogaphaladaṃ bhavabījajayaṅkaram <bhavabījajayaṃkaram> || 24.139
cāturātmyaṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu sudhāsandohasundaram <sudhāsaṃdohasundaram> |
sthityutpattipralayakṛtsarvopakaraṇānvitam || 24.140
prakṛtiṃ svām adhiṣṭhāya samudetyastam eti ca |
caturthaṃ viddhi tadyasya viśvaṃ tiṣṭhati śāsanāt || 24.141
yattatsitādikaṃ rūpaṃ caturthā yatkṛte yuge |
raktādyaṃ sitaniṣṭhaṃ ca traitāyāṃ hi mahāmate || 24.142
pītaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ sitaṃ raktaṃ samprāpte <saṃprāpte> dvāpare yuge |
kalau kṛṣṇaṃ sitaṃ raktaṃ pītaṃ cānukrameṇa tu || 24.143
yugasandhyācatuṣke <yugasaṃdhyācatuṣke> tu bibharti parameśvaraḥ |
vibhinnamūrtisāmānyaṃ rūpaṃ yat tan nibodha me || 24.144
pītaraktaṃ kṛtānte tu raktapītam ataḥparam |
pītakṛṣṇaṃ ca tadanu kṛṣṇaśuklam anantaram || 24.145
bhedaḥ prāguditair jñeya āyudhāmbaralāṃchanaiḥ <āyudhāmbaralāñchanaiḥ> |
samatvād anyathā kena vibhāgotrāvadhāryate || 24.146
tatas tu keśavādīnāṃ dhyānaṃ vakṣye munīśvarāḥ |
sarvagaṃ paramaṃ jyotir amūrtam amalaṃ hi yat || 24.147
sa eva vāsudeveti matvā samyag yajet tataḥ |
cetasāmṛtasaṅkāśaiḥ <cetasāmṛtasaṃkāśaiḥ> puṣpādyair akhilaiḥ prabhum || 
24.148
paścāttamamalandhāma dhyāyen mūrtam anaśvaram |
śroṇītaṭārpitakaraṃ sānukampam anūpamam || 24.149
dakṣiṇena tu hastena bhaktānām abhayapradam |
puṣpābharaṇavastrāḍhyaṃ śaṅkhacakradvayānvitam || 24.150
tatas tasmāt tu vai dhāmno yugapanniḥsṛtaṃ smaret |
mahat sphuliṅgasaṅkāśaṃ <sphuliṅgasaṃkāśaṃ> samūhaṃ satatoditam || 24.151
tena cākramarabṛndaṃ samākrāntaṃ ca bhāvayet |
atha pratyekatejo'ṃśād udbhūtaṃ bhāvayet kramāt || 24.152
trayaṃ tatraṃ sitādyaṃ ca keśavādyaṃ caturbhujam |
dakṣiṇottarapāṇibhyāṃ pṛṣṭhataḥ keśavādiṣu || 24.153
yugmaṃ yugmaṃ parijñeyaṃ krameṇordhvagataṃ tv idam |
śaṅkhacakre kajaṃ vidyā sā ca śaṅkho gadāmbujam || 24.154
tacchaṅkhaḥ sa kajaṃ vidyā cakraṃ cakraṃ gadāgadā |
śaṃkhaś <śaṅkhaś> cakraṃ kajaṃ padmaṃ cakraṃ śaṃkhas <śaṅkhas> tato 
gadā || 24.155
tadvadbhūyo 'grasaṃsthābhyām adharasthaṃ dvayaṃ dvayam |
jñeyaṃ dāmodarāntānāṃ dvādaśānām idaṃ śṛṇu || 24.156
padmaṃ gadā dhvaniś cakraṃ tatpadmo hetirāḍdhvanī |
gadācakraṃ ca tadvidyā padmaṃ śaṃkhaś <śaṅkhaś> ca so 'mbujam || 24.157
gadāpadma gadā śaṃkhaḥ <śaṅkhaḥ> sa vidyāmburuhaṃ tvari |
bhūyodhāmagaṇāt tasmāt saṃsmaren nissṛtaṃ mahat || 24.158
keśavādivibhāgena śriyādyaṃ ca trayaṃ trayam |
kamalāditrayeṇaiva tv anyonyatvena lāṃchitam <lāñchitam> || 24.159
baddhapadmāsanasthaṃ ca digvidikṣu ca saṃmukham |
saṃvījayat tu vinayāc cāmareṇa sitena ca || 24.160
devīdvādaśakaṃ caiva tāsāṃ rūpam athocyate |
pūrṇacandrānananāḥ sarvāḥ sarvartukusumānvitāḥ || 24.161
sarvalakṣaṇasampūrṇāḥ <sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇāḥ> sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ |
vidrumābhaṃ trayaṃ tv ādyam aparaṃ campakaprabham || 24.162
priyaṅgumañjarīśyāmaṃ tṛtīyaṃ devatātrayam |
caturthaṃ tritayaṃ dhyāyej jātipuṣpasamaprabham || 24.163
ādyāyāṃ kamalaṃ pāṇāvanyasyāṃ hetirāṭkare |
śaṃkhaṃ <śaṅkhaṃ> dhyāye tṛtīyasyām evaṃ dhyāyet triṣu triṣu || 24.164
tato vibhavadevānāṃ dhyānaṃ vakṣye dvijottamāḥ |
vaibhavīyo mahābuddhe devatānicayo mahān || 24.165
ya uktas te mayā pūrvam ekaikaṃ viddhi taṃ tridhā |
caturṇāṃ yugasandhīnāṃ <yugasaṃdhīnāṃ> yugānāṃ ca tathaiva hi || 24.166
viśvaviplavadoṣāṇāṃ vināśāya samudyatam |
sitaraktādirūpeṇa jvaladastrakarāṅkitam || 24.167
kāryārambhe tathā madhye hy avasāne tu sarvadā |
sandhatte <saṃdhatte> rūpam ātmīyam eka eva tv anekadhā || 24.168
śreyase sarvalokānāṃ sthūlaṃ tatkāmarūpadhṛk |
anudyatena vapuṣā kundendudhavalena ca || 24.169
vīrāsanādinā caiva sthitaṃ muditamānasam |
līlāvidhṛtasarvāstraṃ saumyavaktram anākulam || 24.170
dhiyā doṣagaṇaṃ sarvaṃ dhvaṃsayantaṃ ca mokṣiṇām |
tadvyaktaṃ śāntasaṃjñaṃ ca rūpaṃ rūpavatāṃ vara || 24.171
prakāśyati sanmārgaṃ samādhiniratātmanām |
tejomayaṃ yat tad rūpaṃ vaibhavaṃ śāntasaṃjñakam || 24.172
upāsakānāṃ bhaktānāṃ sarve sarvaphalapradāḥ |
viśākhayūpo bhagavān svayaṃ viśvasisṛkṣayā || 24.173
adhyakṣeṇa svarūpeṇa samudety eka eva hi |
mahimānaṃ tu niśśeṣaṃ śuddhaṃ saṃvitpurassaram || 24.174
ādāyādyapadasthasya cāturātmyasya vai vibhoḥ |
tathā cādhārabhūyiṣṭhaṃ devānāṃ ceṣṭitaṃ hi yat || 24.175
sitādayaḥ kāntayo yāḥ śryādikaṃ ca mahāmate |
salāñchanaṃ vaibhavīyaṃ sāyudhaṃ bījam eva tu || 24.176
jñānādyaṃ guṇaṣaṭkaṃ ca taduktāḥ śaktayo 'khilāḥ |
aṇimādyaṣṭakaṃ caiva sthityutpattilayodayāḥ || 24.177
śaktiḥ sā cāturātmīyā tv aiśvarīty abhidhīyate |
yathārkakiraṇavrātaṃ tyaktvā tejaḥkaṇo mahān || 24.178
svakāraṇaṃ vinā sarvam āpūrayati gocaram |
svātantryāt paripūrṇatvāt tadvat sa parameśvaraḥ || 24.179
vihāya vāsudevādyaṃ mūrtiśākhācatuṣṭayam |
vaibhavīyasya yūdhasya patitvenāvatiṣṭhate || 24.180
sambhūtisthitisaṃhārabhogakaivalyalakṣaṇam 
<saṃbhūtisthitisaṃhārabhogakaivalyalakṣaṇam> |
prerayan vai dhiyā cakraṃ pañcāram idam uttamam || 24.181
smartavyasvapadasthaḥ sa svabījenāmalātmanā |
āmūrdhato 'ṃghriparyantaṃ <'ṅghriparyantaṃ> tadīyaṃ gātramaṇḍalam || 24.182
ratnavadvaibhavīyais tu bījair bhāvyam alaṃkṛtam |
kramād uccāryamāṇais tair amṛtaughena pūrvavat || 24.183
pūjanāt parameśatvam acirād eva yacchati |
ityevamādiḥ sarveṣāṃ bhāvināṃ parameśvaraḥ || 24.184
sthito 'ntaryāmibhāvena rūpam āsādya niṣkalam |
āptakāmaḥ sa bhagavān svavyāpāravaśena tu || 24.185
svāṃ śaktim avalambyās te padmanābhātmanā punaḥ |
dharāmbuhutabhugvātamūlanāladalodare || 24.186
catustattvamaye padme gaganaikārṇavodare |
mānase 'nantaśayane divyabodhatanurvibhuḥ || 24.187
sahasrāṃśusahasrābha uttānastho hi līlayā |
tato vividharatnābhe māyīye nābhipuṣkare || 24.188
prodvahaṃs tu svavīryeṇa vidyāṃ sāmarthyavigrahām |
mūrtair dhvajādikaiḥ sarvair āvṛtas tatparāyaṇaiḥ || 24.189
anantaceṣṭasya vibhor ity evaṃ tv īśvarātmanaḥ |
bhogāpavargadaṃ rūpaṃ śāntaṃ vyaktaṃ ca vaibhavam || 24.190
prāgvatturyapadāvasthaṃ svared dhṛtkamalāmbare |
diśo daśa dyotayantaṃ nānāgātraruhaiś citam || 24.191
saumyaṃ dviraṣṭavarṣaṃ ca rājīvadalalocanam |
bhacakracakradhṛgdevaṃ gadādehaṃ tathaiva ca || 24.192
śaktim ādhārasaṃjñāṃ ca prodvahantaṃ smared dhruvam |
sthito yaḥ stambhabhūtas tv asmin vai viśvamandire || 24.193
nabho 'nilātmanācaiva bhūmikābhinnalakṣaṇe |
ityevaṃ mukhyapūrvāṇāṃ dhruvāntānāṃ prakīrtitam || 24.194
śeṣādīnāṃ ca śeṣāṇām idānīm avadhāraya |
dhyānaṃ pātālanilayaparyantāṇāṃ yathāsthitam || 24.195
eka eva jagannātha svarūpādyais tu śaktibhiḥ |
nānātvenāpy ananto yo bhaktānugrahakāmyayā || 24.196
tasyābhimānikaṃ rūpaṃ śṛṇu sarveśvarasya tu |
tuhinācalasaṅkāśaṃ <tuhinācalasaṃkāśaṃ> pūrṇacandrasamānanam || 24.197
svamaṇivyañjitenaiva yuktaṃ phaṇagaṇena tu |
prodvahantaṃ halaṃ cakram apasavyadvayena tu || 24.198
vāmahastadvayenaiva śaṅkhaṃ musalam eva ca |
nityasannihitaṃ <nityasaṃnihitaṃ> śeṣaśaktiṃ sarvajñam acyutam || 24.199
manasy antarmukhānāṃ yatkarmiṇāṃ pūrayec ca tat |
śaktīśo 'py atha sañcintyaḥ <saṃcintyaḥ> puṇḍarīkanibhekṣaṇaḥ || 24.200
icchārūpadharaiś caiva saumyaḥ prahasitānanaḥ |
vyaktaye ca phalādīnāṃ bhaktānām anukampayā || 24.201
piṇḍayan svāṃghriyugmena <svāṅghriyugmena> vasudhāṃ ca karadvayam |
yugānusārikāntiś ca caturvaktraś caturbhujaḥ || 24.202
mūrtacakragadāhastasvamūrtāc cāmbujāṅkitaḥ |
śamaṃ nayati santāpaṃ <saṃtāpaṃ> kamalenendukāntinā || 24.203
nānāmantramayīṃ vidyāṃ vyañjayaty amalātmanām |
samyagvākpatinā caiva kambunā śabdamūrtinā || 24.204
ājñāpratīkṣakenaiva gadācakradvayena tu |
preritena hinasty āśu sādhusantāpakāriṇam <sādhusaṃtāpakāriṇam> || 24.205
nārasiṃhena vaktreṇa bhavabhītivighātakṛt |
puṣṇāti sarvabhūtāni vārāheṇāmṛtātmanā || 24.206
kurute paścimasthena kāpilenopasaṃhṛtim |
bhaktiśraddhāparāṇāṃ ca smṛtamātre sadaiva hi || 24.207
hṛnmadhye gagane bhūmau vahnimadhye jalāntare |
caturṇāṃ brāhmaṇādīnāṃ svayam evānukampayā || 24.208
cāturātmyena rūpeṇa caturdhā vyaktam eti ca |
ātmatulyena dehena śaṅkhapadmāṅkitena tu || 24.209
mūrtimadbhir halādyais tu yuktena vadanair vinā |
varṇānurūpavarṇena samenāpy asamena tu || 24.210
anyonyānugatenaiva pūrvoddiṣṭena nānyathā |
pralayānalasūryābhaḥ smartavyo madhusūdanaḥ || 24.211
aṣṭabāhurviśālāṃ so 'py agniṣṭomakarāṅkitaḥ |
śaṃkhacakradharaś <śaṅkhacakradharaś> caiva bāṇakārmukadhṛk tathā || 24.212
rajastamobhyāṃ mūrtābhyāṃ sampravṛttinivṛttaye <saṃpravṛttinivṛttaye> |
karṇipīṭhaniviṣṭaṃ ca dhyeyaṃ pāṇiyugaṃ vibhoḥ || 24.213
vidyādhidevaṃ bhagavan caturvaktraṃ caturbhujam |
lambakūrcaṃ jaṭādaṇḍakamaṇḍalvakṣasūtriṇam || 24.214
phullaraktāmbujābhāsaṃ śvetapadmakarāṅkitam |
śrutī ṛgādyā vaktrebhyaḥ prodgirantamataḥ smaret || 24.215
nirdhūmāṅgāravarṇābhaṃ śaṃkhapadmākṣasūtriṇam 
<śaṅkhapadmākṣasūtriṇam> |
phullaraktāṃśuvibhavaṃ devatādhyātmasūtrakam || 24.216
dhyāyed abhayapāṇintaṃ kapilaṃ tejasāṃ nidhim |
yo 'ntaḥ sarveśvaro devaḥ sākṣībhūto vyavasthitaḥ || 24.217
spaṭikopalavadbhāvān svaśaktyārthān bibharti ca |
avidyāvikṛtānāṃ tu bhaktānāṃ satpadāptaye || 24.218
tamanādiṃ jagannāthaṃ bahiḥsthūlatarātmanā |
dyāvāpṛthivyor antassthaṃ viśvarūpam ataḥ smaret || 24.219
anekavaktrāṃghrinayanam <anekavaktrāṅghrinayanam> anekitakarāṅkitam |
yady apy anekavadanam anekabhujabhūṣitam || 24.220
tathāpi vai trayas triṃśadvadanair vividhair yutam |
caturabhyadhikair divyaiś catvāriṃśan mahābhujaiḥ || 24.221
brahmarudrendradakṣārkacandrasiddhās tathā śrutiḥ |
pauruṣasya tu vaktrasya cordhvavaktrasthitās tv amī || 24.222
piśācāgnimarucchailadvīpagandharvavāribhiḥ |
vaktrair ūrdhvasthitair dhyāyed dakṣiṇaṃ vadanaṃ vibhoḥ || 24.223
pātāladiṅmahāmeghalokarāśigṛhotthitaiḥ |
vaktrais tārasametais tu dhyāyed vaktraṃ tu paścimam || 24.224
yakṣāntakāmbunāgādyair vasunakṣatragogaṇaiḥ |
vaktrair vārāhavaktrordhvaṃ dhyāyec caivam ataś śubhaiḥ || 24.225
padmādyaṃ cāturātmīyamantrāṇāṃ daśakaṃ mahat |
procchritaṃ hi suvarṇādyaṃ tallāñchanacatuṣṭayam || 24.226
loke śāstrāṣṭakaṃ caiva pustakaṃ cākṣasūtrakam |
darvīkamaṇḍaluṃ haimam abhayaṃ hi varānvitam || 24.227
darbhājinaṃ tataś chatraṃ suśubhaṃ cāmaraṃ sitam |
sruvasruvau cāpi kalaśau vedir vahnisamanvitā || 24.228
candrārkamaṇḍale pūrṇe nāgendro maṇidarpaṇaḥ |
puṣpasragvyajanaṃ divyaṃ viśvapatralatā tathā || 24.229
smartavyās tu bhujeṣv asya vibhoḥ saṃsthānakaiḥ samaiḥ |
yathoditakrameṇaiva vyatyayo na bhaved yathā || 24.230
bhābhir nānāprakārābhir dehotthābhir idaṃ jagat |
bhāsayantaṃ jagannāthaṃ smared dhṛtkamalādiṣu || 24.231
haṃsamūrtim athātmānaṃ jñānayajñabhujaṃ smaret |
kundendusnigdhakāntiṃ ca hematuṇḍaṃ mahātanum || 24.232
rajastamodhriṃ satsattvaṃ vigrahaṃ parameśvaram |
dharmādharmekṣaṇe dhyāyed agnīṣomātmakena tu || 24.233
dakṣiṇottarasaṃsthena pakṣayugmena rājitam |
bahiḥstham evodakasthaṃ kāñcanācalasannibham <kāñcanācalasaṃnibham> || 
24.234
dhyātvārcayet tu vidhivaddhaṃsavigraham acyutam |
bahirdravyamayas tv ekaḥ sāmānyenaikalakṣaṇam || 24.235
samyaṅnirvarṇitaḥ svargaṃ pūrvam icchati cārthinām |
antarvedyāṃ caturdhā yas tv eka eva mahāmakham || 24.236
tapoyāgajapadhyānasvarūpaḥ śaśvad eva hi |
yājinām apavargaṃ tu vidadhāti samāpanāt || 24.237
taṃ yajñapuruṣaṃ brahma vāsudevam ajaṃ harim |
dhyāyed vai sūkarātmanamañjanādrisamaprabham || 24.238
yajñāṅgacihnitāṃghriṃ <yajñāṅgacihnitāṅghriṃ> ca mahāvyāhṛtidaṣṭriṇam |
bhūrbhuvas svaś śarīraṃ ca śabdabrahmaikamānasam || 24.239
nirṇudantaṃ prapannānām avidyāpaṅkamañjasā |
vaidyena potraprāntena tv akṣayenāmalena ca || 24.240
vāsanāvāsitānāṃ ca jīvānāṃ bhavaśāntaye |
mahāvibhūtir bhagavān pūrṇaṣāḍguṇyavigrahaḥ || 24.241
svakāc chāntatarād brahmatattvād ādāya cāñjalim |
karoti secanaṃ doṣadagdhānāṃ ca svatejasā || 24.242
sthūlarūpeṇa tamajaṃ bahirārādhanānvidhau |
ādhmātaṃ vāyunā yadvannirdhūmāṅgāraparvatam || 24.243
dhyāyet tadvanmahādīptaṃ vājivaktram alāñchanam |
baddhabrahmāñjalīkasthaṃ dravatkanakalocanam || 24.244
ghoṇāgreṇāharantaṃ ca trailokyotthaṃ jalendhanam |
kṛtvā tadbhasmasāt samyak phūtkurvantaṃ mukhena tu || 24.245
dharmaṃ sāmānyam amalam anādinidhanaṃ vibhum |
durlabhaṃ yatprabuddhānāṃ tatprasādadhiyā vinā || 24.246
tasya sthūlataraṃ rūpaṃ śṛṇu tatprāptaye param |
tuhinācalasaṅkāśaṃ <tuhinācalasaṃkāśaṃ> saumyavaktraṃ caturbhujam || 24.247
kāmārthāv udvahantaṃ ca śaṅkhapadmacchalena tu |
sādhumārge sthitānāṃ tu saṃyacchantaṃ dhiyā ca tau || 24.248
sitākṣamālāgarbhaṃ tu varapāṇim ataḥ smaret |
vāṅmayaṃ nikhilaṃ yasya vastujātam anaśvaram || 24.249
śaktitvena svabhāvasthacidrūpasyāmitadyuteḥ |
varavājimukhaṃ dhyāyed atha vāgīśvaraṃ prabhum || 24.250
sūryakā tādisaṅkāśam <tādisaṃkāśam> anekabhujabhūṣitam |
kamalaṃ cākṣasūtraṃ ca vediṃ tretāgni bhūṣitam || 24.251
sājyadhārau sruksruvau tu viṣṭaraṃ somasaṃyutam |
darbhājinaṃ mekhalāṃś cāpy apasavyeṣu ṣaṭsamī || 24.252
smared vāmakareṣv asya pustakaṃ śaṃkham <śaṅkham> eva ca |
daṇḍaṃ kamaṇḍaluṃ darvīm ekasmiṃs tritayaṃ kare || 24.253
pūrṇaṃ grāmyais tathāraṇyaiś carubījais tu pañcame |
sraṅmūlaphalapātrais tu yajñadravyaiḥ sadakṣiṇaiḥ || 24.254
sarvāśramopakaraṇair yuktaṃ ca samabhājanam |
dhyeyam asya bhuje ṣaṣṭhe vṛtaṃ mūrtai ṛgādibhiḥ || 24.255
vedāṅgair upavedais tu saṃskāraiḥ samakhais tathā |
vikāravasudhādhāre hy abhāve tu guṇodadhau || 24.256
svaśaktibhāvitaṃ kṛtvā manaḥpūrvaṃ catuṣṭayam |
prakṛtyantaḥ samāste yaḥ sarvajñaḥ puruṣātmanā || 24.257
niṣaṇṇaṃ bhogiśayyāyāṃ tapanīyaruciṃ smaret |
devam arṇavaśāyyākhyaṃ mūrtaiś cakrādikair vṛtam || 24.258
lakṣmyā saṃvāhyamānaṃ ca samākrāntaṃ ca nidrayā |
vījyamānaṃ hi vai prītyā gīyamānaṃ hi vidyayā || 24.259
kūrmātmā kūrmavaddevo dhyātavyas tv atha lāṅgalin |
dravatkanakavarṇābhasvasāmarthyajalāśrayaḥ || 24.260
śaktyādikakalādvandvadvitayāṃghriḥ <śaktyādikakalādvandvadvitayāṅghriḥ> 
sanātanaḥ |
śāntyādikakalāḍhyaś ca prodgiraṃs tu śrutitrayam || 24.261
atasīpuṣpasaṅkāśaḥ <atasīpuṣpasaṃkāśaḥ> śaṅkhacakragadādharaḥ |
makhopakaraṇāṅgaś ca nimagnoddhāraṇakṣamaḥ || 24.262
svaśaktivibhavādhāram icchājñānakriyārciṣam |
nānāviśeṣavijñānasphuliṅgormisadoditam || 24.263
dārayantaṃ sthitaṃ hārdamanūnaṃ moham ulbaṇam |
nadannādamanākhyeyaṃ tam ajaṃ parameśvaram || 24.264
santaptakanakābhaṃ <saṃtaptakanakābhaṃ> ca dhyāyed devaṃ nṛkesarim |
jvaladagnisphuliṅgābhiḥ svadehotthābhir āvṛtam || 24.265
rathāṅgaśaṅkhadhātāraṃ brahmamūrtasubhīṣaṇam |
satsatvakarajaśreṇīdīptenobhayapāṇinā || 24.266
saṃyacchantaṃ dhiyā samyagbhavināṃ sābhayamparam <sābhayaṃparam> |
amṛtādhmātameghābham amṛtāharaṇaṃ vibhum || 24.267
pītāmbaradharaṃ dhyāyed ekavaktraṃ caturbhujam |
śroṇītaṭārpitakaraṃ śaṅkhacakravibhūṣitam || 24.268
madhyato dakṣiṇenaiva vahantaṃ girirūpadhṛk |
śuddhajñānānuviddhaṃ ca karmasambhavabhītiham <karmasaṃbhavabhītiham> || 
24.269
diśantaṃ svadhiyā samyagbhaktānāṃ bhaktavatsalam |
māyāmathitadugdhābdhiṃ kṣobhayitvā prakāśitam || 24.270
amṛtaṃ kṣuttṛṣādīnāṃ pratipakṣamanāmayam |
evaṃ cānaśvaraṃ bhāvyaṃ māyākhyārṇavamadhyagam || 24.271
ātmāmṛtam anaupamyam aharadhvaṃsakarmaṇā |
dhyāyet kamalagarbhābhaṃ devadevaṃ śriyaḥpatim || 24.272
kamalālayahetīśavibhūṣitakaradvayam |
dvayaṃ devīpariṇaye līlayaiva samarpayan || 24.273
prakāśayann anāditvam ātmanā prakṛteḥ saha |
matkarair anuviddheyaṃ prakṛtiḥ prakṛter aham || 24.274
yato 'ham āśrayaś cāsya mūrter madhye tadātmikā |
yām ālambya sukhenaiva dustaraṃ hi guṇodadhim || 24.275
nistaranty acireṇaiva vyaktadhyānaparāyaṇāḥ |
madavihvalanetrañ ca devam udbhinnayauvanam || 24.276
phullaraktāmbujābhāsam atyajantaṃ nijāṃ smṛtim |
trailokyavismayakaraṃ kāntākṛtidharaṃ smaret || 24.277
ānandāmṛtasampūrṇavadanenendukāntinā 
<ānandāmṛtasaṃpūrṇavadanenendukāntinā> |
kalaśākṛtirūpeṇa karasthena virājitam || 24.278
līlākaṭākṣavāgbāṇais sūdayantaṃ suradviṣam |
dvirephapaṭalākrāntasahakāralatākaram || 24.279
kalāmūrtyabhidhānātmā rāhusaṃjño 'tibhīṣaṇaḥ |
mūrtāmūrtena rūpeṇa saṅgrasaty aniśaṃ <saṃgrasaty aniśaṃ> kila || 24.280
agnīṣomamayīṃ mūrtiṃ karmaṇām upakāriṇīm |
yo 'ntaḥ prāṇādirūpeṇa candrādityātmanā bahiḥ || 24.281
sthitas tadvijaye 'dhyakṣas satyadhyānaratātmanām |
niṣpandabodhabhāvena tantu vyaktaṃ smared bahiḥ || 24.282
nīlanīradavarṇābhaṃ padmapatranibhekṣaṇam |
madhyāhnabhāskarākāraṃ dvādaśārakarodyatam || 24.283
śroṇītaṭaniviṣṭena vāmahastena līlayā |
dhriyamāṇaṃ gadāṃ gurīṃ niṣaṇṇāṃ dharaṇītale || 24.284
avidyākhyā ca yā nemiḥ kālacakrasya durdharā |
sāmāyīyaṃ samāśritya vigrahaṃ vidhunoti ca || 24.285
japayajña kriyādīnāṃ tāmasena balena ca |
dhyāyet tatprasaraghnaṃ ca devaṃ rājopaladyutim || 24.286
vijñānaraśmibhir dīptaṃ satsattvagaruḍāsanam |
nānāstrarūpabhūtātmā sadvidyābhujabhūṣitam || 24.287
cakraṃ khaḍgaṃ gadāṃ bāṇam aṅkuśaṃ kuntam eva ca |
ṣaṭsu dakṣiṇahasteṣu śaktiṃ cāpaṃ ca kārmukam || 24.288
musalaṃ mudgaraṃ bhīmaṃ kheṭakaṃ vāmabāhuṣu |
deva āmradalābhaś ca saṃsmāryaḥ pārijātajit || 24.289
āklṣṭakarmā deveśas tv anekād bhūtavikramaḥ |
prabandhapratipannānāṃ bhaktānām api dehinām || 24.290
yo bodhabhūmau saṃrūḍho hy anityaś cānurañjakaḥ |
nyagrodhaviṭapākāro 'py avidyābandhalakṣaṇaḥ || 24.291
karmavṛkṣas suvitato mohamāyāphalāvṛtaḥ |
tadutpāṭanasiddhyartham anugrāhyaṃ janaṃ sadā || 24.292
āviśyāste 'śamātreṇa kṛpayā sa jagatprabhuḥ |
sa vivekātmanā bhūtvā jñānabāhuvitānadhṛk || 24.293
aiśvaryadharmavairāgyaśamasya sthitiśaktidhṛk |
ādāya saṃyamāstraughaṃ niyamāstragaṇaṃ tathā | 24.294
indriyārigaṇaṃ jitvā karmiṇāṃ doṣado hi yaḥ |
yad asya surajidrūpaṃ taddvādaśabhujaṃ smaret || 24.295
divyamālyāmbaradharaṃ divyābharaṇabhūṣitam |
caturvaktraṃ sunayanaṃ vāmotsaṅgārpitapriyam <vāmotsaṃgārpitapriyam> || 24.296
khaḍgaṃ cakragadābāṇaṃ musalaṃ ca tarūtamam |
ṣaṭsu dakṣiṇahasteṣu śaṅkham aṅkuśakārmukam || 24.297
chatraṃ ca phaṇabhṛtpāśaṃ vibhor vāmabhujeṣv amī |
ṣaṣṭhetāliṅgitā devī sāravindena bāhunā || 24.298
tadaṃsalapnakarayā devyā taccintayāniśam |
saṃbījyamānaṃ vinayāc cāmareṇa sitena tam || 24.299
lokanāthaṃ viśālākṣaṃ sarvadevanamaskṛtam |
varasiṃhāsanārūḍhaṃ dhyānonmīlitalocanam || 24.300
padmāsanenopaviṣṭaṃ padmagarbhopamadyutim |
karuṇāviṣṭabuddhiṃ ca śaṅkhapadmakarāṅkitam || 24.301
jñānavairāgyasaddharmamārgatrayanidarśakam |
saṃsmared atha dattākhyaṃ jñānamūrtim alepakam || 24.302
manasyamūni devānāṃ samādhiniratātmanām |
īṣallabdharasānāṃ ca brahmamārgānusāriṇām || 24.303
svaprabhānikareṇaiva bhāsayantaṃ ca satpatham |
manasā saha vāyūnā māgatipratiṣedhakṛt || 24.304
śrutīnām āgamānāṃ ca vyāpārāṇāṃ tathaiva ca |
varṇānām āśramāṇāṃ cāpy ācārāṇāṃ tathaiva ca || 24.305
varṇānām āśramāṇāṃ ca parirakṣaka eva hi |
mānasaikārṇavāntas sthe niṣkampe buddhipādape || 24.306
abhidhānalatāḍhye tv apy uparistham anusmaret |
prāvṛḍgirim iva śyāmaṃ tejasā jvalanopamam || 24.307
dhvaṃsakṛdvighnajālasya nidrālasyacayasya yaḥ |
utkṛṣṭadvijarūpeṇa vikasatpadmarūpiṇā || 24.308
sa eva dvibhujo dhyeyo daṇḍadarbhākṣasūtradhṛk |
dantajyotsnājitājñānaṃ nyagrodhaśayanaṃ vibhum || 24.309
niṣaṇṇamīṣaduttānaṃ dvibhujaṃ śiśurūpiṇam |
evam eva nirastāstraṃ śāntanidrārasasthitam || 24.310
anujjhitasvabhāvaṃ ca yogamāyābalena ca |
tyajantam āharantaṃ ca śvāsocchvāsadvayena tu || 24.311
ābrahmabhuvanaṃ sarvaṃ karmaprādhānikaṃ hi vā |
apauruṣeṇa rūpeṇa saṃvṛtāvayavātmanā || 24.312
svamāyājalamadhyastha madhyakṣam atha saṃsmaret |
jñānādiguṇabṛndena pakṣabhūtena bhūṣitam || 24.313
svotthasannissṛtaṃ <svotthasaṃnissṛtaṃ> brahma ekaṃ śṛṅgavirājitam |
kalpāvasānasamaye vahantaṃ caiva cintayet || 24.314
naurūpāṃ vitatāṃ kṣoṇīṃ prajāpatigaṇānvitām |
muktāphalanibhenaiva vapuṣā nirmalena ca || 24.315
animīlitanetras sanmīnātmā bhagavān atha |
yo nityaṃ bhavabhītānāṃ budhānāṃ kṛpayā svayam || 24.316
hṛtstho niyamadaṇḍena mārtāṇḍāyutasannibhaḥ <mārtāṇḍāyutasaṃnibhaḥ> |
jitvā jñānabalaṃ bhīmam indriyārigaṇānvitam || 24.317
saṃyacchaty acirād brahma nandanaṃ satsukhāya ca |
dhyāyet tam eva hrasvāṅgaṃ śām?aṃ padmadalekṣaṇam || 24.318
antarniviṣṭabhuvanaṃ jaṭāvalkalabhūṣitam |
chatraṃ tadvāmahaste 'sya daṇḍam anyatra vaiṇavam || 24.319
ākramya jāgradādityasūryenduhutabhuvaprabhān |
tiṣṭhaty ananto bhagavāṃs turyākhyaś cidvibhūtidhṛk || 24.320
saṃprerayann anicchātas svapadād amṛtaprabhām |
āhlādajananīṃ śaktiṃ karmiṇāṃ bhāvitātmanām || 24.321
trailokyapūrakaṃ dhyāyat tam eva haritadyutim |
nānāmudrāstrayuktena bhujabṛndena bhūṣitam || 24.322
khegatenāṃghridaṇḍena vahantam arisūdanam |
dyusindhuṃ sadvaijayantīṃ devānāṃ ca jayārthinām || 24.323
khaḍgacakragadādaṇḍabāṇāṅkuśasamudgarāḥ |
śaktiḥ paraśuśailendro daśa dakṣabhujeṣv amī || 24.324
śaṅkhatomaraśārṅgaṃ ca pāśaśūlamahīruhāḥ |
kuliśaṃ kṣurikā caiva lāṅgalaṃ musalaṃ mahat || 24.325
vāmahasteṣv amī dhyeyā anye mudrānvitā daśa |
bhayavismayahṛdveṇīkarṇagrahaṇalakṣaṇam || 24.326
dhyeyā mudrā vibhoḥ pañca sarve tu karapañcake |
varākhyāṃ bhūtisaṃjñāṃ ca yuktābhyāṃ sabhayāṃ tu vai || 24.327
gopanīṃ dakṣahasteṣu tatsaṃkhyeṣu ca saṃsmaret |
jagatsūtraṃ sahākṣais tu yenotamamitātmanā || 24.328
guṇaṣaṭkasvarūpeṇa pūrvoktākṛtibhir vinā |
smartavyas sa caturdhā vai lāñchanāstravivarjitaḥ || 24.329
sarvadā parirakṣaṃs tu japapūrvaṃ catuṣṭayam |
yogakriyātapo 'ntaṃ ca sadvibhūtyapavargadam || 24.330
narādyaḥ kṛṣṇaniṣṭhaś ca pṛthagekatra cecchayā |
naraṃ tatra pravālābhamardhonmīlitalocanam || 24.331
antarniviṣṭabhāvaṃ ca śabdabrahmaikamānasam |
yadomalakṣaṇaṃ mantraṃ lapamānam alakṣitam || 24.332
sphaṭikenākṣasūtreṇa karasthena ca śobhitam |
gaṇayannakṣasūtrīyānāvartān vāmapāṇinā || 24.333
atha nārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ dhyāyet kumudapāṇḍaram |
baddhabrahmāṃjaliṃ <baddhabrahmāñjaliṃ> śāntaṃ hṛtpadmārpitamānasam || 
24.334
yuñjānaṃ ca svam ātmānaṃ parasminn avyaye pade |
kamaṇḍalukaraṃ dhyāyet kāñcanābham ato harim || 24.335
viṣṭarāviṣṭapāṇiñ ca kriyākāṇḍapradarśakam |
