kṛṣṇam indīvaraśyāmam ūrdhvabāhuṃ jaṭādharam |
pādenaikena tiṣṭhāntam āharantañ ca mārutam || 24.337
ekatriṣaḍdviṣaḍrātrādyatikṛcchraparāyaṇam |
pakṣamāsopavāsāṃś ca diśantam anucintayet || 24.338
kṛṣṇājinottarīyāś ca sarve kāṣāyadhāriṇaḥ |
brahmaliṅgadharās sarve sarve brahmaparāyaṇāḥ || 24.339
mukhyakarmaparikrāntās sādhūnāṃ preraṇāya ca |
kālānukūlam āśritya sarve sarve parāyaṇāḥ || 24.340
asaṅgaśaktyā <asaṃgaśaktyā> bhagavān sakuṭhārābhidhānayā |
chinatti bandhamūlān yaḥ karmavṛkṣāṃs tu karmiṇām || 24.341
tam eva dvibhujaṃ dhyāyed udayādityavarcasam |
kṛṣṇaiṇacarmavasanaṃ satkuṭhārakarāṃkitam <satkuṭhārakarāṅkitam> || 24.342
daśendriyānanaṃ ghoraṃ yo manorajanīcaram |
vivekaśarajālena śamaṃ nayati yoginām || 24.343
dhveyas sa eva viśvātmā satoyajaladaprabhaḥ |
raktarājīvanayano dhanuśśarakarāṃkitaḥ <dhanuśśarakarāṅkitaḥ> || 24.344
vāgvedaṃ maṇḍalaṃ yo vai svarūpadyutilakṣaṇam |
svayaṃ svotthaṃ vibhajati tridhā paśyanti pūrvakam || 24.345
bodhamārutahṛtpūrvasthāneṣv abhyuditaṃ kramāt |
smartavyas so 'pi bhagavān atasīkusumadyutiḥ || 24.346
vahan vai vāmahastena sarvaśāstrārthapustakam |
dakṣiṇena tu śāstrārthamādiśaṃś ca yathāsthitam || 24.347
yugānusāribhedānām akhedajananāya ca |
vibhajaṃs tu caturdhā vai vedam ekaṃ trikālavit || 24.348
dānadharmaratānāñ ca yāgayajñānuyājinām |
tapassvādhyāyasaktānāṃ muktānām apunarbhavāt || 24.349
saṃrakṣaṇāya yogyatvavijñānavyaktaye 'pi ca |
samudeti jagannāthas teṣāṃ hṛtkamalāvaneḥ || 24.350
manovājinam ākramya tv ādāyātmaguṇāyudhān |
