vaiṣayaṃ vāsanājālaṃ śuddhavijñānasiddhaye |
dhyāyed varāśvagaṃ taṃ vai tanutrāvṛtavigraham || 24.352
sitoṣṇīṣalalāṭañ ca nātidīrghajaṭādharam |
dravatkanakavarṇābhamiṣudhidvayamadhyagam || 24.353
śaracāpakaravyagrakhaḍga kuntakuṭhāriṇam |
yajñādhyayanadānādi parirakṣantam eva hi || 24.354
śāntayantamavarṇānām adharmaniratātmanām |
sarvatattvāśrayaṃ tattvaṃ sarvaśaktimayaṃ vibhum || 24.355
sarvendriyaguṇābhāsaṃ sarvendriyavivarjitam |
niśśeṣabhuvanānāñ ca dhyātavyaṃ tadadhaḥ sthitam || 24.356
anantaśayanārūḍhaṃ kalpāntahutabhukprabham |
jvalajjvālāvalīyuktaṃ jvalanāṃśuvivoṣṭitam || 24.357
cakrādyāyudha bṛndena <<bandhena>> mūrtena parivāritam |
sthitāṃghrideśatolakṣmīś <sthitāṅghrideśatolakṣmīś> citā dakṣiṇato vibhoḥ || 
24.358
mūrdhadeśagatā nidrā puṣṭis tadvāmatas sthitā |
pradhānadevatādhyānam idam uktaṃ samāsataḥ || 24.359
yaj jñātvā vinirvartante janmamṛtyujarārujaḥ |
nāstrair vastrair dhvajair yeṣāṃ vyaktir vyaktā jagattraye || 24.360
te 'pi lāñchanabṛndantu dhārayanty aṃghrigocare <aṅghrigocare> |
