tanūruhadvaye mūrdhni karmiṇāṃ pratipattaye |
api saṃsāriṇo jantoḥ svabhāvād vaiṣṇavasya ca || 24.362
najahāty acyutaṃ liṅgaṃ kiṃ punarvibhavākṛteḥ |
sarveṣāṃ kāmacāritvaṃ yaduktaṃ vai mayā purā || 24.363
tadaṃghribhujavarṇāsyabṛhanmadhyānulakṣaṇaḥ 
<tadaṅghribhujavarṇāsyabṛhanmadhyānulakṣaṇaḥ> |
ekādyanekasaṃkhyañ ca dṛśyaṃ sarvatra sarvadā || 24.364
na tv anyarūpatā kāryā karaṇaṃ kāmarūpatā |
yasmād asmin pṛthagbhūto vyāpāro viśvamandire || 24.365
devānāṃ sthitisaṃhārasṛṣṭikāle svakaṃ svakam |
saty evaṃ niyame siddhe tathāpi bhagavadvaśāt || 24.366
cāturātmyasamūhāt tu yatpadmadala?bhūsthitam |
tathā vibhavadevānāṃ madhyāt padmadalekṣaṇam || 24.367
ekas tv anugrahārthaṃ tu śaktyātmā bhāvitātmanām |
bibharti bahubhedotthaṃ rūpaṃ sadvāhanasthitam || 24.368
yadanusmaraṇād dhyānād arcanād acirāt pumān |
prāpnoti manaso 'bhīṣṭaṃ tan me nigadataḥ śṛṇu || 24.369
satyas suparṇo garuḍas tārkṣyas tu vihageśvaraḥ |
pañcātmakasya prāṇasya vikārās tv ekapañcadhā <<eṣa pañcadhā >> || 24.370
ācāṃghrigocarāt <ācāṅghrigocarāt> sarve yasya dehas tu pauruṣaḥ |
dvibhujas tuhinābhaś ca sa satyaḥ prāṇadaivataḥ || 24.371
suparṇaḥ padmarāgābho nirmalas svarṇalocanaḥ? |
garuḍaḥ kāñcanābhas tu kuṭilabhrūruṇekṣaṇaḥ || 24.372
kekarākṣas tu tārkṣyo vai prāvṛḍjaladasannibhaḥ <prāvṛḍjaladasaṃnibhaḥ> |
dravatkanakanetras tu śabalābhas tu pañcama || 24.373
caturbhujās suparṇādyās saumyarūpās tv anākulāḥ? |
patatricaraṇās sarve pakṣamaṇḍalamaṇḍitāḥ || 24.374
lambodarās supīnāṅgāḥ kuṇḍalādyais tu bhūṣitāḥ |
kuṭilabhrūsuvṛttākṣā vakratuṇḍāḥ smitānanāḥ || 24.375
apānādisamīrāṇām ādhipatyena saṃsthitāḥ |
mahābalā mahākāyā raktatuṇḍo 'tra pañcamaḥ || 24.376
ādheyacaraṇādhas sthasavya ādyasya vai karaḥ |
dakṣiṇaś cākṣasūtreṇa susitena ca bhāsitaḥ || 24.377
evam eva suvarṇasya parijñeyaṃ bhujadvayam |
nābhyuddeśe paro vāma uttānas tu savismayaḥ || 24.378
puṣpastabakasampūrṇa <puṣpastabakasaṃpūrṇa> ūrdhvavaktras tu dakṣiṇaḥ |
garuḍasya dvayaṃ viddhi hṛddeśe 'ñjalirūpiṇam || 24.379
tatraiva sampuṭākāra <saṃpuṭākāra> caturthasya karadvayam |
dakṣiṇe 'mṛtakumbhas tu vāme tu viṣamaṃ phaṇī || 24.380
patram asya dvayaṃ śeṣaṃ trayāṇāṃ ca dvayos samam |
ādheyacaraṇākrānto yadi vai dakṣiṇaḥ karaḥ || 24.381
sañcāro <saṃcāro> vihito vāme tv akṣasūtrasya vai tadā |
ādheyacaraṇādhassthaṃ yasya pāṇitaladvayam || 24.382
nirastasūtraṃ taṃ viddhi vāhanaṃ bhagavanmayam |
anugrahaparas tv āste pakṣipakṣābjaviṣṭare || 24.383
svatejonijasāmarthyam asūrakavarānvite |
padmāsanādinā caiva kevalaṃ vā śriyānvitaḥ || 24.384
suvyaktāvayavasthityā viddhi taṃ garuḍāsanam |
bheḍrabhūssodarasyaiva gopitād vegagāminā || 24.385
vīryapātāt svaśirasā gacchataś cāṇḍajena tu |
lokāntarāṇāṃ kāryārthaṃ vātsalyādhyāyinām api || 24.386
pratyakṣadarśanārthaṃ tu smṛto garuḍavāhanaḥ |
tasmād bhagavato viṣṇor evaṃ rūpadharasya tu || 24.387
samāhṛtasya siddhyarthamāsīnaṃ saṃsmaret sthitam |
upasaṃhṛtavāmāṅghriḥ kañjastho vā khagasthitaḥ || 24.388
vāmam icchāphalānāṃ yad dhvaṃsayatyanyacintitam |
ājānor dakṣiṇasy evam avikṣipte smṛto 'cyuta || 24.389
āmokṣāt sarvasiddhīnāṃ dakṣiṇodhyāyināṃ bhavet |
sarvam eva ṛjusthityā saṃsthitaś cārthināṃ smṛtam || 24.390
svastikārdyair bhavaty eva kiṃ tu te vāhanaṃ vinā |
vihitāpīṭhakalhārasiṃhāsanagatasya ca || 24.391
vihagādhipatiś cātra yogaiśvaryād bibharti ca |
savaktraṃ bhujabṛndaṃ tu nāgendrāstravarānvitam || 24.392
vibhor ājñāvaśenaiva tuṣṭyarthaṃ vā svayaṃ vibhoḥ |
jagajjayodayārthaṃ tu śāntaye śaraṇaiṣiṇām || 24.393
vibhinnena ca rūpeṇa nānālokāntareṣu ca |
aniruddhagatir vīro vicaraty eka eva hi || 24.394
tadārūḍhasya yadrūpaṃ śaktīśasya ca sāmpratam <sāṃpratam> |
anekabhedabhinnaṃ tu nibodha gadato mama || 24.395
saṃyacchantaṃ sadā śāntaṃ bhavināṃ dakṣiṇena tu |
prodvahantaṃ ca vāmena śaṅkhaṃ pūrvoktalakṣaṇam || 24.396
dvibhujasya tv idaṃ rūpaṃ śaktīśasya tu kevalam |
rūpeṇānena ca punaṣṣoḍhā samupayāti ca || 24.397
saha kāntāgaṇenaiva tv ekādyena pṛthak pṛthak |
prāgvallakṣmyā sametaṃ yat tadekaṃ rūpam aiśvaram || 24.398
śrīpuṣṭyor atha madhyasthaṃ ditīyaṃ parikīrtitam |
śriyādimāyāniṣṭhena catuṣkeṇāvṛtaṃ param || 24.399
śuddhyādikena ṣaṭkeṇa caturthaṃ viddhi sāmpratam <sāṃpratam> |
puṣṭyantena śriyādyena tv aṣṭakena tu pañcamam || 24.400
lakṣmyādyena dviṣaṭkeṇa ṣaṣṭhaṃ viddhi samanvitam |
śriyādivimalā kīrtir jayā lakṣmīr halāyudhā || 24.401
caturthī bhagavanmāyā viśvasyāsya nibandhinī |
śuddhir nirañjanā nityā jñānaśaktyaparajite || 24.402
prakṛtis sundarī ṣaṭkam ityuktaṃ sarvasiddhidam |
lakṣmīśabdanidhis sarvakāmadā prītivardhinī || 24.403
yaśaskarī śāntidā ca tuṣṭidā puṣṭidāṣṭakam |
dviṣaṭkavaibhave yoge devīnāṃ kīrtitaṃ hi yat || 24.404
lakṣmyādyantaṃ ca boddhavyaṃ bhede 'smin pārameśvare |
punaścaturbhujasyaivaṃ vijñeyaṃ bhedasaptakam || 24.405
kiṃ tu vai śaṅkhacakre dve vāmahastadvayena tu |
jagaty asmin hi yacchantaṃ śāntimādyena śāśvatīm || 24.406
prodvahantaṃ dvitīyena tv apasavyena vai gadām |
bhūyaḥ karacatuṣkena pūrvoktena krameṇa tu || 24.407
caturṇām abjapūrvāṇām anyonyatvena dhāraṇāt |
yat te dvādaśathā rūpa niśśaktīkaṃ ca kevalam || 24.408
punardvādaśakaṃ tac ca saha śaktidvayena tu |
sthitam ekādhikenaiva ṣoḍhā kamalalocana || 24.409
evaṃ caturbhujenaiva vapuṣā bahudhā sthitam |
saptathā ṣaḍbhujādyena bhujādhikyena vā punaḥ || 24.410
sthitas tv anekathā devo yathā tadavadhāraya |
ṣaḍbāhur aṣṭabāhuś ca daśa dvādaśabāhudhṛk || 24.411
dvisaptaṣoḍaśakaraṃs tathāṣṭādaśabhūṣitaḥ |
kevalādiś ca sarveṣāṃ prāgvadbhedas tu saptathā || 24.412
tan me śṛṇu yathāvastham astravinyāsacihnitam |
ṣaḍbhujo dakṣiṇair dhatte nistriṃśaṃ kamalaṃ gadām || 24.413
saśaraṃ kārmukaṃ śaṅkhaṃ vāmair astrottamaṃ tribhiḥ |
gadāmusalacakrāsīn aṣṭabāhus tu dakṣiṇaiḥ || 24.414
śaṅkham aṅkuśapāśaś ca vāmais tu saśaraṃ dhanuḥ |
khaḍgavāṇagadāpadmaśaktiyuktās tu dakṣiṇāḥ || 24.415
daśa bāhor dhanuśśaṅkhacakrakhe?ṭāś ca ?ābhayāḥ |
ṣaṇṇāṃ dakṣiṇahastānāṃ dviṣaṭkabhujabhūṣita? || 24.416
sandhatte <saṃdhatte> kamalaṃ svaḍgacakrabāṇagadāṅkuśān |
śaṅkhapāśābhayaṃ śaktiṃ savyānāṃ musalaṃ dhanuḥ || 24.417
caturdaśabhujo dhatte vāme tu bhujasaptake |
śaṅkhaṃ gadāṅkuśaṃ pāśaṃ musalaṃ mudgaraṃ halam || 24.418
daṇḍābjakuliśaṃ cakraṃ khaḍgaśaktiparaśvadhān |
bibhṛyāt ṣoḍaśabhujo mukhyahastas samudgarān || 24.419
abhayaṃ kamalaṃ khaḍga śaktidaṇḍaśarāṅkuśān |
śaṅkhacakragadāvajra??śalāṅgalakārbhukān || 24.420
varaṃ karāṣṭakenaiva yat te savyena viśvajit |
padmakhaḍgagadāvajracakra.?āṇaparāṅkuśān || 24.421
daṇḍadakṣiṇahastais tu dhatte 'ṣṭādaśabāhudhṛk |
śaṅkhābhayaṃ halaṃ śaktiṃ mudgaraṃ musalaṃ dhanuḥ || 24.422
kuṭhāramatulaṃ pāśaṃ vibhur vāmabhujairamūn |
bibharti duṣṭaśāntyarthaṃ sādhūnāṃ pālanāya ca || 24.423
bhūyo viśeṣarūpāṇi etāny eva viśeṣataḥ |
sadvaktradvayamātreṇa nayaty amitavikramam || 24.424
saṃhatejosahiṣṇūnāṃ pitṛyānaratātmanām |
aṅganādikasaṃvārabhītānāṃ vai hitāya ca || 24.425
amṛte vai gṛhe bhāge tejase nityadakṣiṇe |
vāmadakṣiṇavaktrābhyāṃ kuryād vai vyatyayaṃ prabhuḥ || 24.426
vṛddhaye 'pi ca śāntyarthaṃ tejasaḥ padmalocanaḥ |
hetunā tena bhagavān bahirantargatena vai || 24.427
agnīṣomau samīkṛtya tv āste sādhāraṇātmanā |
vyaktiṃ vāgīśavaktraṃ tu nītvaiva śirasopari || 24.428
pañcavaktreṇa vapuṣā tv āmūlādyātvanekathā |
śabdabrahmaratānāṃ ca dhyāyinām ātmasiddhaye || 24.429
āpātālāc ca sarveṣāṃ lokānāṃ pūraṇāya ca |
nānāvapurdharo bhūyas tv ekaikenaiṣa yāti ca || 24.430
bhedena rūpam āśritya daśayā ca sitādikam |
vinā vaktrair nṛsiṃhādyais sarvajñamahimānvitam || 24.431
bibharti rūpāṇy etāny aniruddhas tu tārkṣyakaḥ |
evam ākramya garuḍaṃ pradyumno bibhṛyāt tanum || 24.432
nānātvam api cābhyeti saṅkarṣaṇas <saṃkarṣaṇas> suparṇagaḥ |
devas satyo marut sthitvā viśvātmā yāty anekathā || 24.433
surasiddhamanuṣyādibhūtānāṃ duḥkhaśāntaye |
caturṇāṃ ye nijā varṇās te tu mūrtyantareṣu ca || 24.434
caturbhujasyādimūrter viṣṇor mūrtyantarasya ca |
varalāñchanatulyatve bhedakṛtsadhvajadvayam || 24.435
apasavyasthitenaiva tattālākhyadhvajena tu |
svarūpabhedam āpnoti svamūrtyā saha sarvadā || 24.436
yasmāt kāryavaśenaiva mūrtīnām api pāṇigāḥ |
catuḥpadmādayaś śāntāmūrtāmūrtās tathodyatāḥ || 24.437
ity evaṃ bhagavaddhyānaṃ sarvamūrtaṃ munīśvarāḥ |
divyāyudhānāṃ keṣāṃ ciddhyānamuktaṃ puraiva tu || 24.438
śeṣāṇām āyudhānāṃ tu dhyānaṃ vakṣye 'dhunā dvijāḥ |
sandhyājaladasaṅkāśaṃ <saṃdhyājaladasaṃkāśaṃ> lāṅgalaṃ bhīmalocanam || 
24.439
kṣamāṅgam unnatāṃsaṃ ca vajrakāyaṃ balotkaṭam |
svaraśmikhacitaṃ dhyāyen nṛtyamānaṃ ca nandakam || 24.440
śaradākāśasaṅkāśaṃ <śaradākāśasaṃkāśaṃ> darśantaṃ daśanāvalim |
sūryamaṇḍalasaṅkāśaṃ <sūryamaṇḍalasaṃkāśaṃ> kheṭakaṃ 
saumyamūrtikam || 24.441
grasantam astrapūgāni svavaktreṇāniśaṃ balāt |
balamuṣṭiṃ smared daṇḍaṃ raktāṅgaṃ raktalocanam || 24.442
krodhamūrtiṃ svadaśanair daṃśantam adharaṃ svakam |
śakrakārmukavarṇaṃ ca paraśuṃ bhīmavigraham || 24.443
dravatkanakanetraṃ ca jvalajjvālājaṭādharam |
mudgaraṃ śatadhāmābhaṃ pīnāṃsaṃ pṛthuvigraham || 24.444
jaṭākalāpadhṛksaumyaṃ puṇḍarīkanibhekṣaṇam |
vajraṃ vajropalābhaṃ tu sthitaṃ dīrghanakhāṅkitam || 24.445
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ jvalatkanakalocanam |
saudāminīprabhāṃ śaktiṃ śāntāgnivadanekṣaṇām || 24.446
ghanaghargharanirghoṣam udgirantaṃ muhurmuhuḥ |
anyatsarvaṃ tu pūrvoktaṃ dhyānam eṣāṃ munīśvarāḥ || 24.447
adhiṣṭhātṛkramas tv eṣām oṣadhyo lāṅgalaṃ dvijāḥ |
nandakaṃ sarvaśāstrāṇi kheṭakaṃ vasudhā smṛtā || 24.448
jñeyo hi daṇḍo niyatir vairāgyaṃ paraśus smṛtaḥ |
mudgaras tu parijñeyo hy ahaṅkāro <ahaṃkāro> munīśvarāḥ || 24.449
vijñānamaṇḍalaṃ vajraṃ samādhiś śaktir ucyate |
bhinnarūpasya ca vibhor ya uktas sundarīgaṇaḥ || 24.450
sādhāraś cāpy asādhāras tāsāṃ dhyānaṃ kramāc chṛṇu |
cintākhaṇḍalacāpābhā lakṣmī raktāmbujaprabhā || 24.451
puṣṭiḥ kanakagaurā ca kīrtiḥ kumudapāṇḍarā |
jayārkakāntisadṛśī māyāñjananibhā smṛtā || 24.452
śuddhiḥ kiṃśukasaṅkāśā <kiṃśukasaṃkāśā> kundābhā tu nirañjanā |
bandhujīvojvalā nityā jñānaśaktis sitāruṇā || 24.453
phullendīvaravarṇā ca parijñeyā parājitā |
raktotpalābhā prakṛtis sitapītā sarasvatī || 24.454
sarvakāmapradā siddhis tv? indranīlasamaprabhā |
sindūrapuñjavarṇābhā vijñeyā prītivardhinī || 24.455
yaśaskārī ca dugdhābhā śāntidā vidrumojvalā |
tuṣṭistuhinasaṅkāśā <tuṣṭistuhinasaṃkāśā> dayā vaiḍūryasannibhā 
<vaiḍūryasaṃnibhā> || 24.456
nidrāyaskāntasadṛśī kṣamā pītāruṇaprabhā |
kāntir darpaṇasaṅkāśā dhṛtir gorocanojvalā || 24.457
maitrī bandhūkapuṣpābhā ratir gairikasannibhā <gairikasaṃnibhā> |
matir maratakābhā vai sarvāḥ pramuditā <<pramuditānanāḥ>> guṇāḥ || 24.458
divyamālyāmbaradharā nānālaṅkārabhūṣitāḥ <nānālaṃkārabhūṣitāḥ> |
divyasragveṣṭanopetā vīkṣamāṇās svakaṃ patim || 24.459
catasraś śaktayo yās tu vibhoś śayanagasya tu |
prāguktās tatra pūrvāśāvasthitā bījayanty ajam || 24.460
trayaṃ yaddiktrayasthaṃ tu tatsaṃvāhanatatparam |
yatraikā śrīr vibhos tatra sanniveśaḥ <saṃniveśaḥ> purodhitaḥ || 24.461
yatraikā śrīr vibhos tatra vāme vā dakṣiṇe 'pi vā |
śrīpuṣṭyākhyadvayaṃ yatra tatra taddakṣiṇottare || 24.462
padmāsanenopaviṣṭaṃ pakṣipakṣadvayena te |
nalinīnālahastādyāmṛtakumbhakarā parā || 24.463
agnīṣomamayo deha ādyo yas sarvagasya ca |
tasya śaktidvayaṃ tādṛgamiśraṃ bhinnalakṣaṇam || 24.464
bhoktṛśaktis smṛtā lakṣmī puṣṭir vai kartṛsaṃjñitā |
bhogārtham avatīrṇasya tasya lokānukampayā || 24.465
uditaṃ saha tenaiva śaktidvitayam avyayam |
nānātvena hi vai yasya pariṇāmaḥ prakāśita || 24.466
dikpatracaturantassthaṃ yad vai devīcatuṣṭayam |
śaktiḥ paraśupāśāstram aṅkuśaṃ tatkare kramāt || 24.467
ṣaṭkaṃ kesarajālasthaṃ tatra prākpaścime dvayam |
dvayaṃ dvayaṃ saumyayāmye tāsāṃ vāmakareṣu ca || 24.468
śaṅkhacakragadāsīramiṣv astraṃ nandakaṃ sitam |
patramadhyaniviṣṭaṃ tu yatkāntāṣṭakam uttamam || 24.469
tasya vāmakarāṇāṃ ca vijñeyaṃ tv ādito 'ṣṭakam |
śrīphalaṃ cākṣasūtraṃ sragdarpaṇaṃ puṣpamañjarīm || 24.470
viṣṭaraṃ kiṅkiṇīṃ śastrasañcayaḥ <śastrasaṃcayaḥ> kamalekṣaṇa |
vijñeyaś śaktidaḥ pāṇir dvādaśānāṃ tu sābhayaḥ || 24.471
antarāntarayogena sarvāś cāmaralāñchitāḥ |
svastikenopaviṣṭāś cāpy antarmuditamānasāḥ || 24.472
dvyādikasyāsya saṃghasya dvādaśāntasya lāṅgalin |
sitādikena varṇena lāñchanavyatyayena tu || 24.473
tulyalāñchanayogena tannirāse ca vai sati |
varābhayābhyām anyonyapāṇitvād atha kevalāt || 24.474
bahudhā bhedabṛndaṃ tu parijñeyaṃ tu pūrvavat |
śeṣaṃ bhavopakaraṇadevānāṃ nicayo hi yaḥ? || 24.475
suprasiddho mahābuddhe kiṃ tv abjādyais tu pūrvavat |
dhyātavyā lāñchanās sarve pāṇipādatalādiṣu || 24.476
bhaktiśraddhāvrataparas sarveṣāṃ yas sadaiva hi |
dhyātvaiva marcanaṃ kuryād bhogais sāṃsparśapūrvakaiḥ || 24.477
so 'cirān mokṣaniṣṭhaṃ tu phalam āpnoty abhīpsitam |
kirīṭādyastraniṣṭhena parivāreṇa cāvṛtam || 24.478
bhaktyā hy abhīpsitaṃ rūpam arcanīyam athāpi vā |
nirmuktaparivāraṃ vā svena dhyānena lakṣitam || 24.479
vidadhāty arcanāṃ nūnaṃ svaṃ padaṃ phalasaṃyutam |
jñātvaivaṃ sādhakaḥ kuryād yathābhimatam arcanam || 24.480
ātmaśaktisamair bhogair akhilaiś śuddhavigrahaḥ |
hṛdi vedyāṃ bahirmūrtau prāsāde svagṛhe tu vā || 24.481
bahuprakāranirmukte dhūmadāhādinojjhite |
śaraṇe ramaṇīye ca nissamparke <nissaṃparke> tu bhāvite || 24.482

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyām
mudrālakṣaṇabhagavaddhyānādiprakāro nāma
caturviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ



atha pañcaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

nāradaḥ
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi kuṇḍādīnāṃ ca lakṣaṇam |
śṛṇudhvam avadhānena cetasā munipuṅgavāḥ || 25.1
(purāmaṇḍalasiddhyarthaṃ yathākṣetraṃ vibhājitam |
tathaiva bhājitāt kṣetrāc caturaśrān mahāmate ||
pūrvoddiṣṭāni dhiṣṇyāni yathākāryāṇi tacchṛṇu ||)
pañcamaṃ brahmakarmādyaṃ marmaprāgdiśy avasthitam |
aṃśadīrgheṇa tatsthena kuryāt sūtreṇa lāñchanam || 25.2
ardhacandrasamākāraṃ bhāgayugmasya cāntare |
dakṣiṇottarabhāgābhyāṃ tadadhastatsamaṃ tathā || 25.3
lāñchanadvitayaṃ kuryātiryaksusthānasaṃsthitam |
bhāgadvādaśakasyaikyaṃ syāt paṅtidvitayād yathā || 25.4
brahmakarmacaturthaṃ yatsaṅkhyāmānaṃ <yatsaṃkhyāmānaṃ> ca pūrvavat |
marma tasya ca pakṣasthāv ekaṃ marmāntarīkṛtau || 25.5
tābhyām avasthitenaiva sūtreṇaitat prajāyate |
punarmadhyād dvitīyaṃ yatkarma cordhve pravartate || 25.6
tasmād vai tryantarībhūtaṃ caturthaṃ pakṣayor dvayeḥ |
marma tatsthena sūtreṇa vṛtārdhe pūrvavallikhet <<plavavallikhet>> || 25.7
brahmakarmaṇi ṣaṣṭhasya pratyagdiksaṃsthitasya ca |
marmaṇo 'py atha vai sūtraṃ kṛtvā tat samprasārya <saṃprasārya> ca || 25.8
yāvadvṛttārdhabudhnasthaṃ śṛṅgakoṭes tu sannidhim <saṃnidhim> |
evaṃ sūtradvaye datte dhiṣṇyaś śaṅkhākṛtir bhavet || 25.9
tasya bhāgasamā kāryā lāñchanair mekhalā bahiḥ |
pūrvoktamarmagais sūtrair yathāvadavadhāraya || 25.10
dvyaṃśadīrgheṇa sūtreṇa navacandrakalāsamam |
caturṇām antare 'ṃśānāṃ prāgdikkuryāc ca lāñchanam || 25.11
īśavahnipadābhyāṃ tu vṛttāt turyāṃśasaṃsthite |
dve lāñchane same kuryād ekabhāgādike tataḥ || 25.12
tatsame hy apare dve vai yat tadā lāñchyalāñchane |
dakṣiṇottarabhāgābhyāṃ pakṣāt sūtradvayaṃ kṣipet || 25.13
kṛtvā saptakamarmasthaṃ pūrvoddiṣṭakrameṇa tu |
jīvasūtrasya pāścātye bhāge pārśvadvaye sthitam || 25.14
bhāgadvayaṃ dvayaṃ lāñchayaṃ yo 'nyarthaṃ cārdhavṛttavat |
tacchṛṅgakoṭike sūtre kṛtvā te samprasārya <saṃprasārya> ca || 25.15
khātabhūbhāgaparyantaṃ tatpādādvaṭapatravat |
jāyate sarvakuṇḍānāṃ yonir evaṃvidhā śubhā || 25.16
bhāgārdhamānasūtreṇa yoner abhyantare punaḥ |
ardhavṛttadvayaṃ dadyāt tadvatsūtradvayānvitam || 25.17
khātasyāntargato varjyaś caturthāṃśas tu koṣṭhakāt |
oṣṭhārthaṃ nikhanec cheṣaṃ tatsamaṃ vā puroditam || 25.18
dairghyāt pādādikā kāryā yonir vai pṛṣṭhatonnatā |
gajoṣṭhasadṛśī cāgrāt spṛśanti daśanacchadam || 25.19
purobhāgacaturthāṃśaṃ yoner agrād visṛjya tu |
dadyāt prāksūtrasambandhaṃ <prāksūtrasaṃbandhaṃ> sūtrāṇāṃ dvitayaṃ 
param || 25.20
anupātena vai tābhyām agrāt saṅkocam <saṃkocam> ācaret |
bhāgapaṅtitrayeṇaiva mekhalātritayaṃ bahiḥ || 25.21
sampādya <saṃpādya> caturaśraṃ tu śaṅkhaṃ tattritayopari |
āśaṅkhān mekhalānāṃ tu pronnatatvaṃ savistṛteḥ || 25.22
mekhalānāṃ tu śaṅkhasya yanmadhye 'śracatuṣṭayam |
taccakracihnitaṃ kuryāt tallakṣaṇam athocyate || 25.23
brahmakarmaniruddhena caturbhāgasamena tu |
khātārthaṃ prāgbhramaṃ dadyāt kṣetramadhye mahāmate || 25.24
bahirbhāgasamānābhis tadbahirdvyaṃśavistṛtam |
arakṣetraṃ ca tasyāpi nemirbhāgasamā bahiḥ || 25.25
bhāgena tadbahis tv ekā caturaśrā ca mekhalā |
bhrāmyamadhyād arakṣetraṃ vṛttenaikena vai punaḥ || 25.26
tatra sūtrāṣṭakaṃ dadyād digvidiksaṃsthitaṃ purā |
tasya cāntargataṃ paścādaṣṭakaṃ pātayet param || 25.27
tatas teṣāṃ samāpādyamaratvam amalekṣaṇa |
antarvṛttaṃ niruddhena pratisūtrasya pakṣayoḥ || 25.28
sūtreṇa lāñchanaṃ kuryān nābhinemibhramāvadheḥ |
ekāṃśād ardhamānaṃ ca nemivṛttasya cāntare || 25.29
dvābhyāṃ dvābhyām arābhyāṃ tu madhye kuryāt pradhiṃ pradhim |
vistārapronnatā nābhiḥ kūrmapṛṣṭhopamākara || 25.30
nemir darpaṇavatkāryā tvīṣannimnāvasānataḥ |
śiṣṭaṃ puroditaṃ sarvam atha padmākṛtiṃ śṛṇu || 25.31
bhāgārthaṃ bhrāmayen nābher bahiḥ kesarasiddhaye |
bhrāmayed aparaṃ cārdham arakṣetrasya bāhyataḥ || 25.32
nītvā lopamanenaiva vidhinā nemimaṇḍalam |
arasūtrabhramaṃ kuryād antaḥ padmadalāṣṭakam || 25.33
kesarabhramaruddhena sūtreṇārdhendulakṣaṇam |
tacchṛṅgakoṭisaṃsthena paridher bāhyagena tu || 25.34
sūtradvayena patrāgraṃ kuryād bāhyabhramāvaneḥ |
nirantarāṇām āmūlāt kesarāṇāṃ mahāmate || 25.35
kirṇikocchrāyatulyānāṃ vibhāgaṃ janayet sphuṭam |
śaṅkhakoṇacatuṣke tu śeṣaṃ pūrvavad ācaret || 25.36
yonir ekena bhāgena caturbhir mekhalāgaṇam |
khātaṃ pūrvasamaṃ kiṃ tu vṛtte vṛttās tu mekhalāḥ || 25.37
caturaśre tadākārā ityuktaṃ kuṇḍapañcakam |
kālamāhutisaṅkhyāṃ <kālamāhutisaṃkhyāṃ> ca homadravyaprabhūtatām || 
25.38
jñātvaivam ekahastāt tu kuryād aṣṭakarāvadhi |
tatas sruksruvayor adya lakṣaṇaṃ cocyate dvijāḥ || 25.39
svabāhudaṇḍamānena mantrajñaḥ kalpayet purā |
daivīsruksiddhaye kāṣṭhavistārāc ca ṣaḍaṅgulam || 25.40
dairghyād bhāgadvayenātha daṇḍam aṣṭāśram ucyate |
sārdhadvyaṅgulamānaṃ tu kṛtvā śeṣaṃ tu śodhayet || 25.41
amalaṃ daṇḍamūle tu kuryāt padmānanaṃ śubham |
karṇikāstho yathā daṇḍo bhaved vai munisattama || 25.42
trivaliṃ tv atha vā śaṅkhaṃ yathādaṇḍas tadāsyagaḥ |
kṛtvāgrasthaṃ dvidhā bhāgaṃ samāṃśena prayatnataḥ || 25.43
dvyaṅgulaṃ cātha bhāgasya vaipulyaṃ cāgrataḥ kramāt |
daṇḍāvasthasya bhāgasya tryaṅgulaṃ paritassamam || 25.44
datvā bhramaṃ tataḥ kuryān nimnaṃ svātaṃ sulakṣaṇam |
tanmadhye paṅkajaṃ kuryāt praphullaṃ cordhvapallavam || 25.45
ājyakośaṃ tu taṃ viddhi saptapañcaphalopamam |
padmamadhye nimagnā ca karṇikā vai sakesarā || 25.46
dvādaśāraṃ bahiścakraṃ padmasyāṣṭadalasya ca |
padmabāhye tu kartavyaṃ śaṅkhaṃ koṇacatuṣṭaye || 25.47
tato 'grabhāgasya mune pārśvayor ubhayor api |
ekaikamaṅgalaṃ śodhyaṃ saṃvibhajya tridhā tataḥ || 25.48
karṇam ekena bhāgena madhye tvāsyau dvayena tu |
vicchinnaṃ vaktramaṃsābhyāṃ madhyam ekāṅgulena tu || 25.49
vistāraṃ karṇatulyaṃ tu varjayitvā tataḥ purā |
karṇadeśāt samārabhya śeṣaṃ tu pariśodhayet || 25.50
kramāgatena sūtreṇa syād vārāhānanaṃ yathā |
tataḥ puṣkaraparṇāt tu mukhāgraṃ yāvad eva hi || 25.51
kuryād ājyapraṇālaṃ tu samanyūnāṅgule mune |
īṣad vai kramasūkṣmaṃ ca nājyaṃ yāti yathādrutam || 25.52
hastamātraṃ tataḥ kuryāt sruvaṃ vipro manoramam |
vistāraṃ dvyaṃgulaṃ <dvyaṅgulaṃ> kāṣṭhaṃ vaipulyāc ca tadardhataḥ || 25.53
vistāramānād agre syād vṛttaṃ kuryād dviraṃgulam <dviraṅgulam> |
kramāt taṃ nimnakhātaṃ ca golakenaiva mudritam || 25.54
madhye mṛgapadākāracihnena tu virājitam |
vistārasya tribhāgena grīvā sāgrā triraṃgulā <triraṅgulā> || 25.55
mūle cobhayataḥ kuryāt svastikaṃ dvyaṃgulāyatam <dvyaṅgulāyatam> |
vicitraracanāyuktadaṇḍaṃ ślakṣṇaṃ tu vā bhavet || 25.56
sruvam evaṃvidhaṃ kuryād dhomakarmaṇi sādhakaḥ |
tatas tu prāpaṇādīnāṃ sādhanaṃ śrṇuta dvijāḥ || 25.57
śālim udgayavā māṣā godhūmāś ca priyaṅgavaḥ |
tilās sapta tv ime grāhyā grāmyā vai carukarmaṇi || 25.58
veṇuśyāmākanīvārā jartilāś ca gavīdhukāḥ |
karkaṭāḥ kanakās sapta vijñeyās tu vanodbhavāḥ || 25.59
śālayas teṣu mukhyās syus tadanyās tadabhāvataḥ |
raktaśālyo mahāśālyaḥ kalamā gandhaśālayaḥ || 25.60
śvetaśālyas saśūkāś ca hemābhā garbhaśālayaḥ |
sukumārāś ca sūkṣmāś ca daśaite śālayaḥ smṛtāḥ || 25.61
antarbhedāś ca bahavas sapta mudgā udāhṛtāḥ |
mudgāḥ kṛṣṇāś ca haimāś ca śvetāḥ pītā mahattarāḥ || 25.62
añjanābhāś ca saptaite antarbhedā udāhṛtāḥ |
śvetāḥ kṛṣṇāś ca pītāś ca v?enyāś caiva mahātilāḥ || 25.63
tilānāṃ pañca bhedās tu grāhyās syuḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
upāhṛtāni kedārād daivīyāc ca kṛṣīvalaiḥ || 25.64
ālimudgādibhedāni karmaṇyāny arcane hareḥ |
avapannādibhir doṣair aṣṭabhir varjitāni ca || 25.65
ānayed avaghātārtham avaghātagṛhe purā |
gomayena samālipte sudhādyaiḥ parimaṇḍite || 25.66
śodhite śatadhāreṇa pavitreṇa kuśāmbubhiḥ |
sthale pravaṇam uccārya praṅmukho vāpy udaṅmukhaḥ || 25.67
dīkṣitair niyatair viprair dhṛtacakrādilakṣaṇaiḥ |
susnātair lohadārvaśmamṛnmayāni samantataḥ || 25.68
sthāpayitvolūkhalāni kṣālitaiḥ khādirair dṛḍhaiḥ |
musalair avahanyās te dvādaśākṣaravidyayā || 25.69
nistuṣān niṣkaṇān kṛtvā taṇḍulān śūrpakoṭaraiḥ |
tais tāvad avahantavyā yāvanmuktāphalaprabhāḥ || 25.70
akhaṇḍitāś cānaṇavaḥ kṛṣṇabinduvivarjitāḥ |
mudgabhedās tathā kāryās sāravantaś ca nistuṣāḥ || 25.71
sādhvībhir brāhmaṇibhir vā dīkṣitānām abhāvataḥ |
śūdrair vā dīkṣitair devadāsībhir devasadmani || 25.72
haviḥ pākādikarmārthaṃ kāryāvahananakriyā |
vaiṣṇavānāṃ gṛhe śuddhe dīkṣitānāṃ gṛhe 'pi vā || 25.73
taṇḍulāṃs tu pragṛhṇīyād dvidhikṣuṇṇāṃs tu deśikaḥ |
akaṇān atuṣān eva krimihīnān api kramāt || 25.74
keśapāṣāṇahīnāṃs tu prāṇyaṅgarahitāṃs tathā |
bhasmāṅgāravihīnāṃs tv abhagnānalaghūn api || 25.75
kaṇais tu bhavati vyādhis tuṣair dāridryakaṃ bhavet |
krimibhiḥ putranāśaḥ syāt keśair dāravināśanam || 25.76
pāṣāṇair marṇaṃ viddhi aśanyā vahninā jalaiḥ |
prāṇyaṅgair vyādhayaḥ proktā bhasmanā kalaho dhruvaḥ || 25.77
aṅgārair vahninā bādho bhagnair bhaṅgas tu vigrahe |
pravāso laghubhiś caiva tasmāt tān parivarjayet || 25.78
sambhārān <saṃbhārān> akhilān evaṃ prāksaṅkalpitasammatān 
<prāksaṃkalpitasaṃmatān> |
sambhṛtya <saṃbhṛtya> deśikas sārdhaṃ sādhakaiḥ pācakair api || 25.79
avaghātagṛhaṃ prāpya tatrasthaṃ taṇḍulādikam |
brahmaśukram ivetyuktvā netreṇaivāvalokayet || 25.80
prāgvatsaṃśodhayet tāni dahanāpyāyanādibhiḥ |
vaidalādiṣv aśuddheṣu <<vaidalādiṣu śuddheṣu>> pātreṣu vitateṣv api || 25.81
pacanārthaṃ samuddhṛtya tatsarvaṃ taṇḍulādikam |
tattatpātrasamudvāre nipuṇaiḥ paricārakaiḥ || 25.82
susnātaiś ca suveṣaiś ca vastreṇācchāditānanaiḥ |
ānayet pacanāgāraṃ śaṅkhatūryādimaṅgalaiḥ || 25.83
dvārasyottarapārśve tu gomayenopalepite |
pradeśe nikṣipet tāni bhājanāni yathākramam || 25.84
gulopadaṃśapūrvāṇi lavaṇādirasāni ca |
vinyased dvāradigbhāge dadhikṣīraghṛtāni ca || 25.85
nidadhyān nairṛte bhāge homopakaraṇāny api |
caturbhir vyāpakair mantrair vastrapūtena vāriṇā || 25.86
kṣālayitvā caturdhā vai yathā syāt taṇḍulādiṣu |
śilāśakalanirmuktaṃ nistuṣaṃ niṣkaṇaṃ yathā || 25.87
apakvavrīhivihitataṇḍulenaiva sādhitam |
gavyadugdhājyasaṃsiktaṃ guḍakhaṇḍaphalānvitam || 25.88
akṣāralavaṇopetaṃ devānāṃ havir ucyate |
tad eva paramānnaṃ syāt kṣīrājyagulapācitam || 25.89
ghṛtasiktaṃ tu siddhānnam abhāve havir ucyate |
akṣāralavaṇaṃ siddhaṃ gulakṣīraphalānvitam || 25.90
śāntaye vratayajñe ca saṃsādhyaṃ haviruttamam |
pāyasānnaṃ guḍānnaṃ ca mudgānnaṃ kevalodanam || 25.91
dadhyannaṃ ca tilānnaṃ ca niśānnaṃ sarvamiśritam |
ityaṣṭadhā samuddhiṣṭaṃ havirdevasya sammatam <saṃmatam> || 25.92
prārabheta haviḥpākaṃ vakṣyamāṇena vartmanā |
āhṛtyodanapākāgniṃ kuṇḍādaupāsanānalāt || 25.93
cullyāṃ nidhāya tāreṇa saptate 'gna itīrayan |
indhanāni vinikṣipya yajñadārumayāni ca || 25.94
krimikīṭādihīnāni jyotīrātrīti mantrataḥ |
prajvālya vyajanenaiva tatas sthālīś ca tāmrajāḥ || 25.95
prakṣālya tintriṇītoyaiḥ kevalair mṛnmayāṃs tataḥ |
prakṣālya dvādaśārṇena vīryamantreṇa mantravit || 25.96
ghṛtenālāpayet tāsām antaraṃ vyūhavidyayā |
taṇḍulān prakṣipet tāsu gāyatryā viṣṇupūrvayā || 25.97
ambhasyapāra iti ca mantreṇa sahṛdā punaḥ |
jalena pūrayed ūrdhve taṇḍulān pratipātrakān || 25.98
taṇḍulādhikamānasya ṣaṭprastham udakaṃ bhavet |
karmārambheṇa tās sthālāś cullyām āropayet tataḥ || 25.99
cakramantreṇāpidhānais tās sañchādya <saṃchādya> yathākramam |
pākakāle samudghāṭya vīryamantreṇa taddhvanim || 25.100
nirīkṣya netramantreṇa darvyāmūlaṃ samuddharan |
caturghāvartayec caiva cakreṇāc chādayet punaḥ || 25.101
pakve jalam api srāvya dvādaśārṇaṃ samuccaran |
vidrāvitena gavyena haviṣā cābhighārya ca || 25.102
śucīṃ satkṛtayatetyādimantreṇādhārapṛṣṭhataḥ |
śodhite bhūtale nātha vrīhibhir vā prasā?rite || 25.103
evaṃ havīṃṣi siddhāni pāṇibhyām avaropya ca |
astrābhimantritenaiva bahiḥ prakṣālya vāriṇā || 25.104
tanmantritena śuddhena vastreṇāvartayet tataḥ |
bhasmanā mathitenābdhir vāsudevādivācakaiḥ || 25.105
tarjanyādyaṅgulībhiś ca kuryād dikṣūrdhvapuṇḍrakam |
samācchādya vidhānaiś ca vasanaiḥ kṣālitais tataḥ || 25.106
ityuktaṃ sādhanaṃ samyak śuddhānnasya viśeṣataḥ |
anyeṣāṃ sādhanaṃ vakṣye paramānnapurassaram || 25.107
taṇḍulasya tu turyāṃśaṃ pāyase mudgasārakam |
tanmānaṃ ghṛtam uddiṣṭaṃ taccaturguṇitaṃ payaḥ || 25.108
nālikerodbhavaṃ vāpi tatsamaṃ kathitaṃ payaḥ |
caturguṇaṃ taṇḍulāc ca khaṇḍacūrṇasamanvitam || 25.109
sādhayed uktamārgeṇa samantraṃ kevalodane |
haṃsaś śuciṣad ity a?nnaṃ gokṣīrasya niṣecanam || 25.110
tadabhāve niyoktavyaṃ nālikerodbhavaṃ payaḥ |
abjāgojeti tatkṣepaḥ syād gavyapratiyojane || 25.111
gulānnapācane kṣīram apahāyaikṣavaṃ rasam |
kathitaṃ gulakhaṇḍaṃ vā kṣīramānānusārataḥ || 25.112
kṣīraprakṣepa?mantreṇa gulādīni niyojayet |
mudgānne taṇḍulaṃ samyagmudgasāraṃ niyojayet || 25.113
śuddhānne tu purā proktaṃ viśeṣeṇa ghṛtāplutam |
dadhyodanaṃ dadhikṣepaṃ kṣīrārdhaparisammitam <kṣīrārdhaparisaṃmitam> || 
25.114
kadalīpanasāmrādigulakhaṇḍasamanvitam |
khaṇḍacūrṇasamopetaṃ kṛsarānne tu mudgakam || 25.115
āḍhakasya haridrānne niśāpiṣṭaṃ phalaṃ bhavet |
mudgasārasamopetaṃ śuddhakhaṇḍādisaṃyutam || 25.116
miśrānne yojayet kiñ cit kṣīrājyayutasaṃplutam |
śāntyarthe payasā miśraṃ puṣṭyarthe gulamiśritam || 25.117
vaśyārthe mudgasorotthamākṛṣṭau dadhimiśritam |
kṛsarānnaṃ tu prītyarthe māraṇoccāṭane 'pi ca || 25.118
stambhane ca haridrānnaṃ miśrānnaṃ mohanaṃ bhavet |
sādhāraṇaṃ tu śuddhānnaṃ yātrāsu mṛgayādike || 25.119
viśeṣeṇa tu dadhyannaṃ hemarājatapātragam |
marīciśuṇṭhilikucatintriṇīrasamiśritam || 25.120
jīrṇena jīrikotthena saṃskuryād dravavastubhiḥ |
rasabhedasamutthāni panasadvitayodbhavam || 25.121
cūtadeśasamutthāni nātipakvāni kālataḥ |
bṛhaty urvāruvārtākakūśmāṇḍaprabhavāni ca || 25.122
kāravallīlatotthāni kārkoṭaprabhavāni ca |
paṭoladvitayotthāni kośātak??udbhavāni ca || 25.123
alābukarkarīnimbabhadotthaṃ tintriṇīphalam |
kṣudrakandasametaṃ ca vallīkandadvayaṃ tathā || 25.124
sūraṇadvayakandaṃ ca tathā piṇḍārakadvayam |
padmotpalasamutthaṃ ca haviryogyaṃ viśeṣataḥ || 25.125
ucchiṣṭaṃ krimiduṣṭaṃ ca śivādyair daṃśitaṃ tathā |
ghṛtaṃ lālājalaspṛṣṭam amedhyasthalasambhavam <amedhyasthalasaṃbhavam> || 
25.126
pādaspṛṣṭam akālottham āhṛtaṃ cāśucisthale |
bhuktaśeṣaṃ? tathāspṛśya spṛṣṭaṃ dattāvaśeṣakam || 25.127
parīkṣya bahudhā mantrī varjayet pākakarmaṇi |
jīvantīṃ vāstukaṃ śākaṃ kāravallīdalaṃ tathā || 25.128
tumbīdalaṃ ca piṇḍīṃ ca cuccumudgadalāni ca |
śākinīṃ śataparvāṇaṃ tathaiva śvāsamarditam || 25.129
āgastyaṃ pācayec chākaṃ vihitaṃ brāhmaṇasya ca |
śākamūlāni cānyāni gṛhṇīyād aniṣedhane || 25.130
chedayitvā lavitreṇa vīryamantraṃ samuccaran |
nirīkṣya krimikīṭādīn prakṣālya bahudhā jalaiḥ || 25.131
prāgvat sthālīṣu nikṣipya pratyekaṃ vātha miśritam |
sendavais samarīcaiś ca sarṣapair jīrakair api || 25.132
śrīparṇidalasammiśraiḥ <śrīparṇidalasaṃmiśraiḥ> payobhir nārikelajaiḥ |
tatphalair api saṅghṛṣṭair <saṃghṛṣṭair> madhubhir ghṛtamiśritaiḥ || 25.133
masūramāṣanimbādimudgabhedasamanvitam |
sayūṣān mudgabhedādīn ayūṣān lavaṇādibhiḥ? || 25.134
rasabhedais sametāṃś ca sādhayet tadanantaram |
tvaco vyapohya? mudgotthais sāraiḥ kṣīreṇa pācitaiḥ || 25.135
marīcajīralavaṇair ghṛtayuktaiś ca marditaiḥ |
dadhyādibhiś ca saṃskuryād gulmāṣaṃ sarasaṃ yathā || 25.136
sthālīśarāvapūrṇeṣu pācitāni puraiva tu |
kadalīpanasādīni nālikeraphalāni ca || 25.137
kūśmāṇḍabṛhatīpūgakāravallīphalāni ca |
kṣudrakandasametāni vallīpiṇḍārakāni ca || 25.138
ambarīṣādipātreṣu vitateṣu samantataḥ |
ghṛtalipteṣu tapteṣu samāropya prasārya ca || 25.139
cūrṇībhūtair marīcaiś ca jīrakeṇa ghṛtena ca |
pratāpitāni snigdhāni darvyāloḍhya punaḥpunaḥ || 25.140
sthāpanīyāni bhāṇḍeṣu chāditāny ambarādibhiḥ |
āmrādīni ca śuṣkāṇy aśuṣkāṇi phalāni ca || 25.141
tintriṇīgulamiśrāṇi marīcair jīrakair api |
nālikerotthapayasā sarṣapaiḥ poṣitair api || 25.142
sthāpayed ātmasārotthaṃ lavaṇena samanvitam |
śṛṅgiberaṃ ca likucaṃ dalitaṃ haritaṃ ca vā || 25.143
vāsitaṃ lavaṇopetaṃ likucottharasena tu |
kadalīpanasāmrāṇāṃ kevalāni phalāni ca || 25.144
godhūmaśālijaiḥ piṣṭair gulapākena lolitaiḥ |
pācitair mudgasāraiś ca śakalair nārikelajaiḥ || 25.145
jīrakais samarīcaiś ca ghṛte 'pūpāni pācayet |
suvṛttāny āmratulyāni dhātraphilasamāni ca || 25.146
nyagrodhaphalatulyāni likucādyākṛtīni ca |
antarnikṣiptamudgāni rasavanti samantataḥ || 25.147
gulapiṣṭena baddhāni nālikerākṛtīni ca |
nānābhedasamutthāni ghṛte 'pūpāni sādhayet || 25.148
śālivrīhisamutthāṃś ca sthālīṣu sphuṭitāni ca |
laghūni vahnitaptāni gulapākāvitāni ca || 25.149
cūrṇitaiś ca marīcaiś ca jīrakaiḥ khaṇḍitair api |
nālikeraphalaiś śuṣkaiḥ pṛthukāni ca sādhayet || 25.150
bharjitaiś śālipiṣṭaiś ca miśritair jīrakādinā |
lolitair gulapākena piṇḍībhūtaiḥ pṛthakpṛthak || 25.151
saktu syāt sādhitaṃ tadvattilaiḥ piṇḍaṃ subharjitaiḥ |
tilapiṇḍa iti khyātas sadā devasya sammataḥ <saṃmataḥ> || 25.152
suśṛtaṃ ca ghanībhūtaṃ khaṇḍacūrṇasamanvitam |
kṣīraṃ ca madhusarpibhyāṃ saṃvṛttaṃ sughanaṃ dadhi || 25.153
taruṇaiś śakalībhūtair urvārusahakārayoḥ |
rūkṣasarvapasammiśraṃ <rūkṣasarvapasaṃmiśraṃ> samarīcaṃ tathā dadhi || 
25.154
pṛthakpātragataṃ śuddhaṃ gālitaṃ mākṣikaṃ madhu |
drākṣāpanasarambhāmrasamutthair marditair asaiḥ || 25.155
lolitaṃ gulakhaṇḍena jīrikādisamanvitam |
rasālam etadvijñeyaṃ dadhimiśraṃ tu pānakam || 25.156
kevalaṃ dadhisammiśraṃ <dadhisaṃmiśraṃ> vāriṇā tatsamena tu |
mathitaṃ samarīcaṃ ca lavaṇaiś cādhivāsitam || 25.157
khaṇḍacūrṇasamopetaṃ pānakaṃ śramaśāntikṛt |
annānām api saṃskāre purā mantrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 25.158
tadanyeṣāṃ tu saṃskāro dvādaśārṇena vā hṛdā |
sāṅgena mūlamantreṇa sarvaṃ saṃsādhayīta vā || 25.159
viṣṇugāyatriyā vātha pañcopaniṣadātha vā |
saṃsādhya paramannādyam upadaṃśānvitaṃ kramāt || 25.160
phalatādiṣu saṃsthāpya cordhvapuṇḍrādyalaṅkṛtam 
<cordhvapuṇḍrādyalaṃkṛtam> |
mahānasadvārabhūmer ālayadvārapaścimam || 25.161
gomayenānuliptena sudhācūrṇena śobhinā |
pa????mantrasañjaptavāridhārāpurassaram || 25.162
śaṅkhatūryādighoṣeṇa tathā maṅgalagītibhiḥ |
pradīpacchatrayuktaiś ca haviḥpālanatatparaiḥ || 25.163
vetrapāṇibhir anyaiś ca nāstikotsāraṇodyataiḥ |
?snātāś śuklāmbarā dakṣāḥ kṛtapādā vane janāḥ || 25.164
svācāntāḥ kuśahastāś ca mṛdā vā candanādinā |
dhṛtordhvapuṇḍrā niyatā manovākkāyakarmabhiḥ || 25.165
sitakañcukadhartārassthagitānananāsikāḥ |
balamantreṇa bhāṇḍāni vaheyuḥ paricārakāḥ || 25.166
mūlālayāgradeśasthe maṇṭape vitate 'tha vā |
prathamāvaraṇe dhāmno dakṣiṇe mālikāvanau || 25.167
sugupte suvitānāḍhye dīpamālādyalaṅkṛte <dīpamālādyalaṃkṛte> |
pradeśe vastrasañchanne <vastrasaṃchanne> sthāpyāni phalakādike || 25.168
haviḥpramāṇatulyāś ca hemarājatatāmrajāḥ |
sthālikāś ca yathāliptāḥ prakṣālyāstreṇa vāriṇā || 25.169
pāṇinā dakṣiṇenaiva parāmṛśyātha tena ca |
tāreṇa tāsu nikṣipyādhārājyasya samantataḥ || 25.170
sthālībhyas samupāhṛtya darvyāṃ? hemādikḷptayā |
tadūrdhve nikṣipen maunī pāyasādīny anukramāt || 25.171
ghṛtenāplāvya madhuravyañjanāni samantataḥ |
dadhikṣīrādipūrṇāni caṣakāṇy ūrdhvato nyaset || 25.172
siddhāny apūpabhedāni pṛthukādīni yāny api |
pānakāni vicitrāṇi pṛthakpātragatāni ca || 25.173
karpūracandanakṣodaprasūnaiś cādhivāsitam |
śītalaṃ vastrasañchannaṃ <vastrasaṃchannaṃ> pānīyaṃ karakādiṣu || 25.174
elālavaṅgatakkolajātīpūgaphalānvitam |
karpūratailasammiśraṃ <karpūratailasaṃmiśraṃ> khaṇḍitaṃ ca kṣurādibhiḥ || 
25.175
nāgavallīdalopetaṃ sacūrṇaṃ cendrasaṃyutam |
tāmbūlaṃ ca pratiṣṭhāpya pātreṣv abjākṛtīṣu ca || 25.176
candanādīni gandhāni tathā nānāvidhās srajaḥ |
sthāpayitvā yathāsthānamārādhakamukhena tu || 25.177
vijñāpayeyur devasya tattatkarmādhikāriṇaḥ |
bhojyāsanādhirūḍhasya devasyārādhakas svayam || 25.178
arghyādyaiḥ prāgvadabhyarcya sādhyabījāvasānakaiḥ |
dvārasyābhyantaragate devasya purataḥ sthale || 25.179
śodhite cāstratoyena candanādyaiś ca maṇḍite |
maṇḍale tu paristīrya taṇḍulāni yathāruci || 25.180
kṣālitaṃ vastrakhaṇḍaṃ tu tadūrdhve samprasārya <saṃprasārya> ca |
annādhāraṃ pratiṣṭhāpya tadūrdhve lohanirmitam || 25.181
ūrdhvato vasanārthaṃ tattadūrdhve srotasaṃplute |
vinyaset paramānnādipātrāṇy ekaikaśaḥ kramāt || 25.182
tarpaṇaṃ tu pratiṣṭhāpya hastaprakṣālanāmbhasā |
kuryād dakṣakare daive prāgupastaraṇārhaṇam || 25.183
tato devādimūrtīnāṃ havīṃṣi viniveśayet |
prathamaṃ pāyasaṃ paścād gulānnaṃ mudgabheditam || 25.184
śuddhānnaṃ tilasammiśraṃ <tilasaṃmiśraṃ> niśānnaṃ dadhimiśritam |
miśrānnaṃ ca kramād dadyād apūpāni tadantime || 25.185
pṛthukāni ca saktūni tilapiṇḍānvitāni ca |
kadalīpanasādīni phalāni vividhāni ca || 25.186
rasabhedasametāni pānakāni ca tarpaṇam |
nālikerarasaṃ caiva hastaprakṣālanaṃ tataḥ || 25.187
upasparśaṃ ca tāmbūlaṃ datvā prāguktām ācaret |
rājabhir haviṣo nityaṃ prācurye kalpite sati || 25.188
ādhāreṣu pratiṣṭhāpya vitate garbhamandire |
nivedyāni yathāyoga manyathā saṅkaṭe <saṃkaṭe> bhuvi || 25.189
tadekasmin dṛḍhādhāre vastracchanne yathākramam |
nidhāya vinivedyātha tathā tamapanīya ca || 25.190
protkṣite cāstramantreṇa nikṣepyaṃ havirantaram |
nivedayed yathāpūrvaṃ viśeṣo 'tra samīritaḥ || 25.191
mantrakriyāvihīnaṃ ca gandhaduṣṭaṃ vivarṇakam |
atipakvam apakvaṃ ca visrāvitajalaṃ tathā || 25.192
adīkṣitaiś ca patitair īkṣitaṃ pratilomajaiḥ |
atyuṣṇam atiśītaṃ ca pramāṇarahitaṃ tathā || 25.193
samuddhṛtaṃ ca niśśeṣaṃ mukhavātādidūṣitam |
vyañjanādivihīnaṃ cāpyapātrastham agopitam || 25.194
antastaṇḍulasaṃyuktaṃ bhinnabhāṇḍagataṃ tathā |
anādhāraṃ paraspṛṣṭaṃ śvasitāpahataṃ tathā || 25.195
aṅgāratuṣasaṃyuktaṃ keśapāṣāṇasaṃyutam |
krimiloṣṭādibhir juṣṭaṃ prāṇyaṅgādisamanvitam || 25.196
apūrṇapākamāghārarahitaṃ vyañjanājjhitam |
gavyājyadadhinirmuktaṃ kāṃkṣitaṃ <kāṅkṣitaṃ> cetarair janaiḥ || 25.197
apidhānavinirmuktaṃ devatāntarasammitam <devatāntarasaṃmitam> |
evaṃ duṣṭaṃ havirbudhvā prakṣipej jalamadhyataḥ || 25.198
mohāt tyakta havirviṣṇor yadi dadyāt tadarcanam |
nirarthakaṃ syāt kart�ṇāṃ vināśaṃ ca bhaved dhruvam || 25.199
tasmāt tadaiva mūlasya sahasraṃ japam ācaret |
tatas tatrāśrayāṇāṃ ca sthāpitānāṃ vidhānataḥ || 25.200
vibhavavyūhamūrtīnāṃ maṇṭape gopurādiṣu |
sthāpitānāṃ ca mūrtīnāṃ prādurbhāvātmanām api || 25.201
pūjitānāṃ yathānyāyaṃ satyādīnāṃ khagātmanām |
kumudādigaṇeśānāṃ dvārsthānām api sadmani || 25.202
pratiṣṭhitānāṃ bhaktānāṃ prāguktānāṃ vidhānataḥ |
tattanmantreṇa vidhivat siddhāni ca pṛthakpṛthak || 25.203
havīṃṣi pāyasādīni krameṇa viniveśayet |
gāruḍenaiva mantreṇa balyarthaṃ sādhayed dhaviḥ || 25.204
anyeṣāṃ praṇavenaiva siddham annaṃ nivedayet |
agnikāryahavissādhyaṃ yathāmūlālayākṛteḥ || 25.205
sarvāṇy apūpabhedāni nāgnikārye hitāni vai |
anyāni pāyasādīni nityaṃ naimittikādiṣu || 25.206
hotavyāni viśeṣeṇa phalāni vividhāni ca |
bhūtānāṃ balidāneṣu pāyasādīni nityaśaḥ || 25.207
apūpāni ca saktūni pṛthukāni phalāni ca |
tilapiṇḍasametāni miśritāny atha vā pṛthak || 25.208
dātavyāni yathānyāyaṃ teṣāṃ tṛptikaraṃ yataḥ |
tena krūrādibhir brahmann utsavādiṣu karmasu || 25.209
tatratatroktavidhinā balidravyāṇyupāharet |
abhāve sarvavastūnāṃ sodakaṃ kevalodanam || 25.210
taṇḍulaṃ vodakenaiva dātavyaṃ mantravittamaiḥ |
iti samyaksamākhyātaṃ haviṣāṃ sādhanādikam || 25.211
ity evaṃ muniśārdūlā bhavadbhir yadyadarthitam |
tat sarvaṃ vistareṇaiva yathāvatprakaṭīkṛtam || 25.212
sarvottamā saṃhitaiṣā sātvatārthaprakāśikā |
nākhyeyā duṣṭabuddhīnām abhaktānāṃ janārdane || 25.213
garvātsacchāstrasadvastunindakānāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
śāstrāpakartṛṇām anyadarśane bhāvitātmanām || 25.214
devasaṃsaktabuddhīnāṃ svadharmaniratātmanām |
saṃsārabhayabhīrūṇāṃ prapannānāṃ mahātmanām || 25.215
samākhyeyam idaṃ śāstraṃ dīkṣāṃ kṛtvā yathāvidhi |
śāstrārthaś cānuvaktavyo mantrārthaiś ca samanvitaḥ || 25.216
etacchāstroktavidhinā yo 'rcayaty acyutaṃ vibhum |
so 'cirāl labhate sveṣṭān sarvārthāṃś ca dvijottamaḥ || 25.217

iti śrīpāñcarātre īśvarasaṃhitāyāṃ kuṇḍasruksruva-
lakṣaṇahaviḥpākavidhānaṃ nāma
pañcaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ

īśvarasaṃhitā samāptā



 
